/*!40000 ALTER TABLE `base_review` DISABLE KEYS */;
INSERT INTO `base_review` VALUES ('Raveendar V',4,'Nice place to conduct Weddings or Receptions or other functions.  It\'s part of the Anantapadmanabha Swamy temple complex.  The hall is spacious to handle 300-400 people.  Airconditioned.  They have an AC Dining Hall also.  Parking isn\'t an issue.\n\nI attended two Thirukalyanams of Sreenivasa-Padmavathy & Siva-Parvathi in the last 3 days.  Great place.','2026-03-28 10:59:42.669997',1,1,1),('VENKATARAMANI RENGARAMANUJAM',5,'Very nice kalyana Mandapam at the  heart of Adayar adjescent to Anandha Padmanabha Swami Temple. well maintained easily accomodate 500 people at dining hall and space for car parking to a minimum.','2026-03-28 10:59:42.676285',2,1,1),('Sriram',4,'Quiet huge hall with elevated dais. However dining hall is too small. If there\'s no proper crowd management, guests are left on their own to wait standing behind people eating which is awkward.\nNot more than a dozen cars can be parked. Bike parking is outside only ,could get full easily and you\'re left to search for spots outside nearby houses.','2026-03-28 10:59:42.689337',3,1,1),('Chandrappa RC',3,'Medium size hall for social gathering attached to Sri Padmanabha temple in central Adyar. Very auspious location for religious functions.','2026-03-28 10:59:42.698949',4,1,1),('Venkat Narayan R',4,'Very close to Adyar main road, serene place and next to Padmanabha Swamy temple. Wish mahaswamigal images be decorated with little flowers and put hoarding not to wear Chappel / Shoes in places images are kept','2026-03-28 10:59:42.701092',5,1,1),('Karthik S',3,'A nice function hall with a capacity of upto 500 individuals, dining is in the 1st floor with a capacity of 300+ individuals. Very limited rooms. No escalator/ lift...limited parking provision in the front but valet parking can be opted. Road to the Hall is narrow and more like a 10ft lane, better to come by a rick. Can be better maintained but decent go!','2026-03-28 10:59:45.024907',6,2,3),('Gayathri shri Kashyap',4,'Next to the nidhi school is the nidhi kalyan mandapam. The hall can accomodate a floating crowd of 300 to 400 people. On the first floor is the dinning which has seating capacity of 150 people along with kitchen.There is parking in the nidhi school which is near  by nidhi school. There are total of 6 rooms provided for the bride and groom','2026-03-28 10:59:45.028835',7,2,3),('Gowtham N',3,'Close to railway station and bus stand. Spacious marriage hall. But the ambience is kind of average.','2026-03-28 10:59:45.033245',8,2,3),('Shiva Shiva',3,'It contains a superb Marraige hall and dinner hall and also many specification are included','2026-03-28 10:59:45.037374',9,2,3),('Kss Narayanan',5,'This marriage hall is situated in Alandur, one of the suburbs of Chennai, near Alandur Metro station.  About 250 persons can be seated inside the hall.  Spacious function conducting place.  Fully air-conditioned.  Ample space for car parking.  Suitable for marriages, discourses and other functions.  This hall is managed by a Trust.','2026-03-28 10:59:45.040922',10,2,3),('Rajan Kalambur',4,'In the busy city centre, this hall is located. Visited during peak Carnatic music concerts lined up. Very spacious hall, function and dining got individual halls. Parking is available well decorated interiors too.','2026-03-28 10:59:47.144802',11,3,5),('Shivani M',4,'Attended a concert at this venue. It has limited seating, and the ambience could be improved a bit. The sabha canteen (Mount Batten Mani Iyer Catering) was quite pricey, and the taste was average, we tried only dinner. However, I’ve heard there are mixed reviews, and that the lunch offerings are better.','2026-03-28 10:59:47.147940',12,3,5),('Saranya Rajagopal',4,'Ethiraju Kalyana Nilayam has a very big and spacious hall which is good for hosting weddings and large gatherings. The overall space inside the hall is quite comfortable for guests. However, the rooms provided are quite small and may feel a bit cramped if many people need to use them.\n\nCar parking is available, but the parking space is limited and may not be sufficient when there are many vehicles. Overall, the hall is good for functions because of the large main space, but improvements in room size and parking capacity would make it much better','2026-03-28 10:59:47.151139',13,3,5),('Murali Raghavan',4,'An old marriage hall at the arterial TTK road, this is now tastefully renovated. Relatively of medium size, this can hold upto 500 pax for weddings/ceremonies. The main venu & dining area are located at the ground floor with some rooms for guests at the mezzanine floor. There\'s a limited parking and AC facility besides other utilities. This is also a popular venue for margazhi kutcheries.','2026-03-28 10:59:47.154300',14,3,5),('Harihar Karthik',5,'The finest destination for experiencing the finest wedding ceremony 🎑. The facilities are of those that would serve a high profile wedding. From the outside lighting, entrance door, complete granite floorings and chandeliers, everything is just captivating. The altar, when decorated, will looks alluring for any event. This is a completely Air conditioned building and there are ducts to suck the fire smokes out from the altar. The first floor, accessible by both stairs and lift, has good looking and clean rooms. The parking space alone will need some extension as not everyone\'s vehicles can be parked. The toilets are downstairs, which is very helpful for the elderly people. Overall, a very fulfilling experience, highly recommended.','2026-03-28 10:59:47.157170',15,3,5),('Pradhikrishna Pradhikrishna',5,'Wonderful Experience❤️\n\nWe recently held an engagement function here for 220 guests, and it was a smooth and joyful event from start to finish.\n\nDrinking water and welcome drinks were provided throughout, and the welcome drink was refreshing and well-received by all.\n\nThe food arrangement was excellent. Even though around 250 guests attended, the full menu was served as promised, and everyone was satisfied with the quality and quantity.\n\nThe staff was polite and cooperative, making sure everything went as planned without any stress.\n\nWe are very happy with their service and would definitely recommend this place for any family function💯❤️','2026-03-28 10:59:51.356762',16,4,7),('Vishva V',5,'We had a wonderful experience at this mahal💥❤️The ambience was very spacious🥳, clean and well maintained. Parking facility was good 🚘🏍️and the management team was very supportive throughout the function. Decoration and lighting gave a grand look🧨🏮⚡. Overall, it was a perfect place for weddings and family functions. Highly recommended 🙌💝😊','2026-03-28 10:59:51.359778',17,4,7),('Selvi Palani',5,'We recently visited this mahal for a wedding function. The place was clean and well-maintained. The stage decoration was very nice and attractive. The AC worked well throughout the event. The management was friendly and\ntook care of all arrangements smoothly. Parking and dining areas were also neat and properly arranged.\n\nWe highly recommend this mahal for all kinds of functions.','2026-03-28 10:59:51.363258',18,4,7),('Ganesan Balraj',5,'Good location. Suitable for 150-200 people\'s function. Arrangements are good. Neat dinning and food arrangement.  Local to Ambattur residents can try here for gathering .','2026-03-28 10:59:51.367416',19,4,7),('Suriya Suriya',5,'We are very hpy with their service and would definitely recommend this place for any family function Good ambience ♥️👍','2026-03-28 10:59:51.370574',20,4,7),('Mandolin Saiganesh',5,'Excellent hall with spacious Car parking..Our Saiswarangal band carries lot of pleasant memories performing at this venue..','2026-03-28 10:59:53.449108',21,5,9),('Kss Narayanan',5,'This function hall is situated on the main road in Aminjikkarai, Chennai, on Poonamallee High Road.  A spacious hall for conducting marriages and lectures etc.  500 persons can be accommodated in the hall.  Fully air-conditioned.  Ample car parking space is available.  Dining hall accommodates 200 persons.','2026-03-28 10:59:53.451755',22,5,9),('Dr.Navin Puttum',4,'The place is pretty new to Chennai and has lot of space. The place is difficult to locate but the place is very good.\nThe place has all the amenities and attributes needed for any function.\nIt has ample and spacious parking inside the city which is most needed right now.\nIt has a well built infrastructure\nGood spacious hall but a max of 500 people capacity and decent rooms for the Bride and Groom.\n4 rooms are available\nMore than 50 cars can be parked easily\nDining for more than 200 persons\nNeat and tidy place','2026-03-28 10:59:53.454314',23,5,9),('geebumbaa',3,'The convention hall on the back, could accommodate approx 150-200 for sitting and dining. Dining capacity of 50 persons at a time, makes it tough to keep the function smooth. Access to the dining must me away from the main stage. Decent hall with ample parking but congested dining space.','2026-03-28 10:59:53.457345',24,5,9),('Prem Kumar',5,'Neatly maintained\nAmble parking for 4,2 wheelers\nAmidst in Poonamallee High road\nSemi circle view of seating to enjoy the stage\nSpacious, air, light abundant hall','2026-03-28 10:59:53.460085',25,5,9),('Sagayaraj Boss',2,'Small hall. Not more than 70 members.\n\nDining also very tiny needs to stand behind the person in the dining.','2026-03-28 13:23:47.610293',26,6,11),('செல்வம் சுப்பிரமணியம்',5,'Very spacious marriage hall.\nNeat and cleanly maintained.\nAround 300 people can sit in hall.\n250 people can sit for dining.\nCar and bike parking is there.','2026-03-28 13:23:47.613477',27,6,11),('Niyaz Ahamed',4,'A/C hall with big dining hall area.\n\nGround floor: Function hall 180 to 200 members can occupy\n\nFirst floor: Big Dining hall with 80 to 100 members can occupy at a time\n\nAdv:\nBig dining hall\nA/C  in both function hall and dining hall\nDid adv:\nSmall function hall\nSmall parking with max','2026-03-28 13:23:47.617088',28,6,11),('V S',2,'A marriage hall that\'s not big enough to hold a large no Of guests beyond 200-250 with no convenient car parking space. The Ac\'s in the hall as well as the dining is jus not sufficient and hardly had any effect.  The dining hall in the first floor was ok when compared to the marriage hall.  Two wheeler parking is also cramped.','2026-03-28 13:23:47.622101',29,6,11),('Sebin Kingston',5,'Likely to be suggested, i haven\'t experienced anything bad here.. compact and clean','2026-03-28 13:23:47.625527',30,6,11),('Vijayanarayanan saravanan',5,'The new hall is well-maintained and has ample parking space outside, with valet services available. We visited it for a birthday function and it comfortably accommodated over 200 people.\n\nThe dining area is spacious and adds to the overall good feel of the venue. There’s a lift inside, though it’s a bit slow but it serves its purpose.','2026-03-28 13:23:50.855929',31,7,13),('GOKUL NATHAN',5,'Good atmosphere and nice interior setup.\n\nDining hall with AC facility, comfortable for guests.\n\nSuitable for 100–150 members functions like birthday, engagement, and small gatherings.\n\nStaff service is good and event arrangements were neat.\n\nParking space is limited, so guests may need to park outside.\n\nLocation is easy to find and well-maintained surroundings.\n\nOverall a decent hall for small to medium events.','2026-03-28 13:23:50.858958',32,7,13),('Sathish Kumar .T',5,'Good Spacious hall. But parking space will be less. However, they are managing through vallet car parking.','2026-03-28 13:23:50.861802',33,7,13),('VIKRAM M',2,'(middleclass / EMI user\'s)\nGreen apple hall is most expensive one. So many of Restrictions is there in hall. But parking the vehicle very very less area. Total amount of money is not worth for(middleclass / EMI user\'s). Cleaning service team and rooms,toilet are excellent.','2026-03-28 13:23:50.864827',34,7,13),('Senthil Bagavathi',5,'Great experience at this hall and staff all friendly nature good lighting and aesthetic theme','2026-03-28 13:23:50.867451',35,7,13),('kumara swamy',5,'The hall is suited for mid-sized occasions, comfortably accommodating around 100–150 guests. The ambience is pleasant and modern space to conduct birthday parties, social events. Seating and space arrangements are adequate, ensuring the event feels compact.\n\nIn conclusion, it provides a balanced mix of seating capacity and atmosphere, making it a vice option for functions of mid scale.','2026-03-28 14:58:10.988318',36,8,15),('Gopinath P',5,'This Hall Was suitable for brithday parties get to gathering office seminar meetings. It is near to the Anna nagar main road','2026-03-28 14:58:10.990953',37,8,15),('Kripa Srinivasan',5,'The hall is well maintained and very good staff. The AC works very well and easy access with lift services. Very apt for small functions.','2026-03-28 14:58:10.993108',38,8,15),('Arun Paul',4,'The hall is well-suited for medium-sized gatherings, comfortably accommodating around 100–150 guests. The ambience is pleasant and welcoming, making it a good choice for family functions, receptions, or social events. Seating and space arrangements are adequate, ensuring the event feels neither too crowded nor too empty.\n\nOverall, it provides a balanced mix of capacity, comfort, and atmosphere, making it a reliable option for functions of this scale.','2026-03-28 14:58:10.995331',39,8,15),('I’m_A_ GiXxEr RiDeR VG_36',5,'We attended an event at Crystal Banquet Party Hall and the overall experience was okay. The hall is decent and spacious enough for small to medium gatherings. The ambiance was good and the staff were cooperative.\n\nHowever, one big drawback is the lack of parking facilities. Guests had a tough time finding a place to park, which was quite inconvenient, especially during a crowded event.\n\nWith better parking arrangements, the experience would have been much smoother. A decent option, but be prepared for parking issues.','2026-03-28 14:58:10.997431',40,8,15),('Praveen Kumar',5,'Less than 100m from Arumbakkam metro station, the property is easily accessible and in prime area near Koyambedu.\nThe hall has a full capacity of 500 seaters when cramped. With comfort it can safely be said as 300 seater. There are 12 rooms in Ayswarya mahal with reasonable space for parking. The hall is fully air conditioned, led display available.','2026-03-28 14:58:14.938683',41,9,17),('Jayashree Anand',5,'Aishwarya Marriage Hall is a fantastic venue for weddings and receptions, especially if you are expecting a large gathering. The function hall is impressively spacious, making it ideal for big events without feeling cramped. They also have a separate dining hall, which helps in managing the crowd smoothly during mealtime. The hall is located right in the centre of the city, making it very convenient for guests coming from different areas.\n\nThe only downside is the traffic congestion around the venue, especially during peak hours, which can make reaching the place a bit challenging. However, once you get there, the space and facilities definitely make up for it. Overall, a great choice for grand celebrations!','2026-03-28 14:58:14.943845',42,9,17),('Selvam Mohanraj',4,'Marriage hall located in main road, enough parking space, spacious hall and dining hall. Dining hall located in ground floor, marriage hall located in first floor. There has no lift. Large stage. Interior design were nice. Restroom were neat and clean.','2026-03-28 14:58:14.947821',43,9,17),('R.S. ANANTHAN',4,'Good air-conditioned Mahal. In  marriage hall the display T.V. is not functioning. No proper reply from Manager..... Situated on 100ft road. Always traffic congestion.','2026-03-28 14:58:14.953856',44,9,17),('Sridevi Sridharan',1,'If there\'s an option to give zero, I would give for the items put for sales on 02/14 & 02/15. None of the items worth for the hype n marketing done in the social media. Just added one pic for sample.','2026-03-28 14:58:14.956659',45,9,17),('Gabriel Devaraj',5,'Lakshmi Marriage Hall in Ashok Nagar is an excellent venue for weddings and other celebrations. The hall is spacious, well-maintained, and equipped with all the necessary facilities to host a grand event. The ambiance is elegant, with good lighting and comfortable seating arrangements.\n\nOne of the standout features is the cleanliness and hygiene maintained throughout the venue, including the dining area and restrooms. The air conditioning ensures a comfortable experience for guests, even during large gatherings. The parking space is also sufficient, which is a big plus in a busy area like Ashok Nagar.\n\nThe staff is courteous and cooperative, making sure that everything runs smoothly. The stage setup and decoration options available are impressive, allowing customization as per the event’s theme. The dining area is well-organized, and the food service is efficient, ensuring that guests are served promptly.\n\nOverall, Lakshmi Marriage Hall is a great choice for weddings and other functions, offering a blend of convenience, comfort, and elegance. Highly recommended for those looking for a hassle-free and memorable event experience!','2026-03-28 14:58:18.240157',46,10,19),('Shyam Iyer',5,'I attended an upanayan sanskar there. There was a delicious food they offered','2026-03-28 14:58:18.245049',47,10,19),('Ganesh Ayyanar',4,'It is Air conditioned party/wedding hall near to hot chips ashok nagar signal, parking is limited, you have to park your cars and bikes near the parallel roads of this hall. It\'s decent hall for 200-400 pax with a dining hall in basement.','2026-03-28 14:58:18.248335',48,10,19),('Madhan Kumar',5,'Good and Very nice compact marriage hall,at Ashok nagar,but no car parking.hall and dinning hall is very good location is on 100ft main road easy to have metro train,all ecr bus,local pillar bus stop is very near almost well','2026-03-28 14:58:18.251775',49,10,19),('Varghese Tony',3,'Decent hall. Can accommodate around 200 people in the hall at once. Have a basement for serving meals. The washrooms are ok. They also have rooms and dorm on the top floor.\n\nBiggest advantage is the ease of access. It\'s right next to the main road and also has a road entry/exit on its side. It\'s also walkable distance from the Ashok Nagar metro station.\n\nThe AC is just on one side of the hall and therefore the cooling is not even across the hall. One may freeze on one side whereas sweat on the other side.','2026-03-28 14:58:18.255029',50,10,19),('Sathish Sekar',5,'Manjula Mahal in Avadi is the epitome of elegance! With a spacious main hall accommodating 400 guests and a charming dining hall for 200, it\'s perfect for grand celebrations. Impeccable service and a stunning venue make it the ideal choice for memorable weddings!','2026-03-28 14:58:22.949948',51,11,21),('Rahul c',5,'My name is Rahul Chandrasekar. I visited Manjula Mahal with my friends Pravesh, Deenu, and Manish for Varsha and Rokesh\'s marriage on June 15th at 11:30 p.m., but we did not have an invitation. We waited at the entrance for 30 minutes, but no one told us to move the car. Such good staff! Thank you, Manjula Mahal.','2026-03-28 14:58:22.953638',52,11,21),('D S Narayanan',4,'Spacious Arangam for 600 + crowd, amenities are fine, rooms available.Dining hall near.','2026-03-28 14:58:22.957772',53,11,21),('Sundar_Appu',5,'Neatly maintained hall with 2 floors where one floor for function And one for dinning. Sufficient for small functions with decent parking facilities.','2026-03-28 14:58:22.961321',54,11,21),('Venugopal Durairajan',5,'Decent hall for marriages, functions. Can accomodate around 250 people at the same time. Has car parking both in ground floor and outside, staff help out in parking.','2026-03-28 14:58:22.964920',55,11,21),('Gokul Nivas',5,'We recently celebrated our engagement at GLS Mahal, and it was an unforgettable experience. From the moment we arrived, the staff made us feel truly special. The ambiance was warm, elegant, and perfect for such a meaningful occasion.\n\nThe food was absolutely exceptional — every dish was beautifully presented and bursting with flavor. Our guests couldn\'t stop raving about the menu! Special thanks to the team for accommodating our requests and making sure everything went smoothly.\n\nIf you\'re looking for a place to host a memorable event or even just enjoy a fantastic meal, I can\'t recommend Mahal enough. Thank you for being part of such an important milestone in our lives!','2026-03-28 14:58:26.458402',56,12,23),('Priya Andrews',5,'We recently celebrating our family function at GLS Mahal Ayanavaram. The ambience was very nice. We booked package system including all like Rent, Decorations, Naming board, catering service (veg or Non veg) , photo album etc .  Our guests told the food was delicious and the function were held very smooth. We\'re so happy  and\nWe don\'t have any tension about the celebration. I thank to Mr. Shankar Sir such a good Person being stand till last minute of the function.\nSo, I recommend the place for a small family functions around 150 People.','2026-03-28 14:58:26.461923',57,12,23),('vijay kdhas',5,'We had celebrated my son baptism function at this mahal. Really very nice experience. We have selected package from them. Package covers every things from Mahal Rent, Welcome drink, decoration, food, photography...etc included at reasonable budget. Food Quality and Quantity are excellent. Good place to celebrate any functions in ayanavaram.','2026-03-28 14:58:26.465068',58,12,23),('Arjith R',5,'Here\'s your altered review in a new format:\n\n\"We absolutely love this hall! This is the second event we\'ve held here from our family, and once again, it was a fantastic experience. The food was delicious, and everyone couldn\'t stop talking about it. The owners added a special touch with their singing and audio, making the atmosphere even more enjoyable. The arrangements were spot on, and everything went smoothly. We will definitely keep coming back for more events. Overall, it was an excellent celebration!\"','2026-03-28 14:58:26.468294',59,12,23),('Ajith Sathiyanathan',5,'Very clean organized And well Spaced Party hall that everybody can consider it, Shankar sir standing with us  Taking care of the function,They have a package also check with them, food, decoration, Welcome drink, , Photo Graphy Etc.. Every thing on your Budget. Go with out any second Thought. You wil be satisfied. Bluetooth speakers also there. Thank you Shankar sir 😊','2026-03-28 14:58:26.471927',60,12,23),('Vijay Natarajan',5,'Ceelam Grand Banquet is an excellent venue for special occasions! The hall is spacious, well-decorated, and perfect for weddings, receptions, and corporate events. The ambiance is elegant, with modern interiors that add a touch of sophistication.\n\nEnsuring smooth event management. The food was delicious, with a great variety of dishes to choose from. Overall, a fantastic experience—highly recommended for anyone looking for a premium banquet hall!','2026-03-28 14:58:29.937712',61,13,24),('Harini Kazipeta',2,'I celebrated my daughter\'s birthday at Ceelam Grand Hall. The hall, lift, food service area, and locality were good. The staff were supportive. The issue was the decoration.\n\nYou are required to use their in-house decorator. I booked the venue one month in advance. They shared the decor contact immediately. I reached out and he sent previous samples. I had my own ideas, so I explained everything on WhatsApp. He asked me to visit the venue for discussion. I arranged care for my one-year-old and went there. He arrived late, spent around 15 minutes with me, took notes, and said he would share the quote. He never did. He stopped responding.\n\nHe contacted me only a day before the event and asked all the same questions again. I explained everything again. The coordinator insisted on full payment before the event.\n\nHe promised to complete the decoration by 4 pm on the event day. The event was at 6 pm. At 5.30 pm, the decoration was incomplete and the cleaning started only after we reached.\n\nThe final output was disappointing. Several elements I requested were missing. The real flowers were not placed securely and kept falling. I had shared a birthday invitation template and asked for a 3-ft baby princess cutout, but he reused the template print instead. The entrance setup was added even though I did not agree to it.\n\nI never saw him on the event day. When I called, he said he added more work and had no profit. The result did not match the discussions or references. This part of the experience was stressful and frustrating.\n\nCeelam Grand Hall is a good venue, but the decoration service needs serious improvement.','2026-03-28 14:58:29.942177',62,13,24),('sushmitha',5,'Ceelam grand is an excellent venue for special occasions. I celebrate my baby shower at Ceelam grand. The hall, food service area and locality were good. The staff Jayanthi mam is very supportive and kindness. Overall I really enjoyed my day','2026-03-28 14:58:29.946741',63,13,24),('vignesh pandian',5,'We hosted our baby shower at CEELAM GRAND and had a fantastic experience. Big thanks to the owner for being so cooperative. The venue offers good car parking, nice AC, and delicious food. The affordable decor was exactly as promised, adding to the overall charm of the event. Highly recommend for anyone planning an event!\"','2026-03-28 14:58:29.952277',64,13,24),('vignesh surya',5,'CEELAM GRAND offers exceptional service! The car parking was hassle-free, and the staff made sure everything ran smoothly. The hall is clean, well-maintained, and the decorations by Nandha bro were elegant. The dining hall was spacious with great seating arrangements. The AC was good enough throughout the hall. In house Food was outstanding too!','2026-03-28 14:58:29.968594',65,13,24),('Dr. Ramya Priyadarshini',5,'Huge place with ample parking space .. well maintained hall ..\nRest rooms were clean..','2026-03-28 14:58:32.922320',66,14,26),('Jayashree Anand',5,'Dwaraka Palace is an excellent choice for hosting weddings and receptions, especially if you are planning a large gathering. The function hall is very spacious with a separate dining hall, ensuring a smooth flow of events. Located on East Coast Road, the venue offers a beautiful sea-facing view, adding a special charm to the celebrations.\n\nThey provide all facilities, including catering, with a delicious and well-curated sathvik menu and a truly sumptuous spread. The venue also boasts a huge car parking area, which is very convenient for guests. With plenty of beautiful spots for photos, it’s perfect for capturing all those special moments.\n\nHighly recommended for anyone looking for a grand, scenic, and hassle-free wedding venue!','2026-03-28 14:58:32.925897',67,14,26),('Kannammai Palaniappan',4,'It is a nice place with sea view all the time. The place is huge and they have dining and buffet area which greatly reduces the queue for eating. The mahal is fully equipped with centralized ac with clean toilet facilities. Being there with a sea view gives a calmer mind and peaceful time','2026-03-28 14:58:32.929791',68,14,26),('Meenakshi Pradeep',5,'Beautiful venue with the most organised team! Mamdapam, food, rooms and all other arrangements were exceptional. We had a great experience!','2026-03-28 14:58:32.933223',69,14,26),('Rajeswari Thangavelu',5,'We recently hosted my daughter’s wedding at Dwaraka Palace, Tiruvanmiyur, and it was a wonderful experience. The venue has a beautiful lawn that added elegance to the celebrations, and the arrangements were grand. The service was excellent, and the food received compliments from all our guests. Truly a perfect place for a memorable wedding!','2026-03-28 14:58:32.936613',70,14,26),('Vm Harish',5,'​I recently attended a wedding at Sri Sastha Mahal in Chrompet (located in the Hasthinapuram area), and it is a solid choice for anyone looking for a well-maintained, mid-to-large-scale.\n​The Venue Highlights\n​Hall Capacity: The main hall is impressively spacious. It can comfortably accommodate about 500 seated guests, and for a floating crowd, it easily handles more. The air conditioning was effective throughout the ceremony, which is a huge plus given the Chennai heat.\n​Dining Area: The dining hall is located on a separate floor and can seat roughly 200 people at a time. The flow from the main hall to the dining area was smooth, though it can get a bit crowded during the peak \"muhurtham\" lunch hour.\n​Parking: One of the standout features is the ample car parking. Unlike many mandapams in the narrow streets of Chrompet where you have to hunt for a spot, this venue has a dedicated space that takes the stress out of arriving by car.\n​Accessibility: It is situated on the main Dr. Rajendra Prasad Road, making it very easy to locate for guests coming from the GST Road or the Chrompet railway station.','2026-03-28 14:58:35.218304',71,15,28),('KAILASI Radhakrishnan Varadarajan',5,'Excellent kalyana Mandapam\nLift facility available\n3 floors available\n3 rd floors having good decent rooms\nRemaining 2 floors one Marriage hall second Dining Hall\nNeat and clean\nDon\'t know the per day rates','2026-03-28 14:58:35.221822',72,15,28),('Jordan Tech',5,'A very nice marriage hall with good ambience. Nice design decoration,The hall is spacious, clean, and well maintained. Parking facility is good , a perfect place for All functions. Nice atmosphere one of the best mahal in Chromepet Hasthinapuram,','2026-03-28 14:58:35.225266',73,15,28),('Swaminathan G',5,'Best mahal in RP road, Hasthinapuram. Good management, more ambience, vallet parking, Temple premises inside the mahal. Full Ac rooms, centralized Ac in dinning hall and marriage hall.. Very well maintained. Good neatness and cleanliness.. highly satisfied','2026-03-28 14:58:35.228686',74,15,28),('PUDHUSU RESTAURANT',5,'One of the good mahal in hasthinapuram and chromepet surroundings. All staffs and management side good services and neatly maintained. Good cooperation. Ac hall and dinning with centralized Ac. 14 suit rooms. Vallet parking, vinayagar temple inside the mahal. Highly satisfied.','2026-03-28 14:58:35.232332',75,15,28),('Aravind R',4,'Nice and big place, in the city centre just adjacent to the chetpet flyover from sterling road side . There is an access from Harrington road too . Centrally air conditioned hall and dining with ample car parking for around 200 cars. Rooms can be better. Easy access to this place makes it an ideal place for marriage and other functions.','2026-03-28 14:58:37.595869',76,16,30),('Kumaran Somasundaram',5,'Marriage hall is very neat and maintain well. Fully air-conditioned including dinning Hall. This hall can accommodate more than 500 people. Lot of parking space is available and outdoor dinning also available. Separate place for music entertainment.\n\nNearest metro station is kilpauk and chepet suburban train','2026-03-28 14:58:37.599417',77,16,30),('skanda kumar',5,'Very big Hall... Ample car parking.. right in the centre of city Chetpet... Can accommodate 1000 people . Fully air conditioned... Great Experience..','2026-03-28 14:58:37.603612',78,16,30),('Balasubramanian Govindaraju',5,'Very spacious marriage hall. Marriage hall have good seating and dining capacity. Lots of open space available to park 100+ cars.','2026-03-28 14:58:37.607681',79,16,30),('thrilokbabu darisa',4,'Kuchalambal Marriage Hall is a spacious venue that can handle large gatherings comfortably, making it ideal for weddings and big events. The hall facilities are well-maintained and suitable for large-scale functions. However, the entrance area tends to get a bit jammed during peak hours, especially when guests arrive at the same time. With better crowd management at the entry, the overall experience can be even smoother.','2026-03-28 14:58:37.613512',80,16,30),('Amreen Masthan',5,'Booked meenakshi narayana function hall for my reception on 17 june ....Your function hall provided ample space to our guests and relatives and friends..\nAnd the decoration was elegant and ambient..\nYour staffs provided excellent care right from entry to exit, disciplined in all the ways, co-operated with us and also permitted extra time..\nAll the rooms and restrooms were clean and hygienic.. special  thanks for Mr.mahesh and the manager Mr.vijay was kind n humble and understanding helped alot throughout....so eveyone can blindly book this function hall for all ur functions 😍😍😍...','2026-03-28 14:58:41.516041',81,17,32),('Agilan Sampath',5,'The wedding reception hall was absolutely stunning, with elegant interiors and excellent arrangements that made the celebration truly memorable.\nThe beautiful ambiance and excellent service made the event even more joyful and grand.\n\nI highly recommend this reception hall for anyone planning a wedding or special event.','2026-03-28 14:58:41.519582',82,17,32),('Mohanraj Devarajan',5,'Located few kms away from Nelson manikam road., Mandapam has three floored constructed. Party hall at floor one  with seating capacity around 300 odd and Dining hall at third floor with quite 250 seating capacity. Second floor may be stay rooms, if I\'m not wrong. Hall looks good and with interior decorations it so nice. Quite bit costly for rent considerably. Parking available with vallet.','2026-03-28 14:58:41.522654',83,17,32),('Dhandapani N',4,'The hall was good and it had balcony type seats as well which were not visible to many people on the 2nd floor.\nThat can be made more visible and accessible.\n\nThe dining area is on the 3rd floor and the main hall is on the 1st floor.\nIt has 1 lift and 2 staircase entries and they also provide valet parking .','2026-03-28 14:58:41.525459',84,17,32),('Saroj Kumar Sahoo',5,'It\'s little inside from market But they maintain very clean. Good For small function.','2026-03-28 14:58:41.529877',85,17,32),('RAMESH KUMAR',5,'RECENTLY WENT FOR COUSIN MARRIAGE WELL MAINTAINED SEATING CAPACITY OF 1000 AND DINING CAPACITY OF  300. PARKING FOR CAR AROUND 20 FOR TWO WHEELER ITS 50.','2026-03-28 14:58:45.692326',86,18,34),('Globetrotter Priya',4,'Nice place for conducting grand events. Well maintained, clean and hygienic hall with spacious rooms provided for relatives to stay along with bride and groom rooms. Parking facility is also spacious enough to park several cars and bikes indoor. Easy to locate and reach the venue too.','2026-03-28 14:58:45.695823',87,18,34),('Vijay M',4,'Ground floor, has car parking upto 20 cars or 25 cars max. Cannot park cars outside as its a main road\n\nFirst floor has air conditioned dinning. Upto 200 can dine at a time\n\nSecond floor is the hall which is also air conditioned. Can accommodate roughly 700 to 750.\nStage is medium size.\n\nLift facility is available','2026-03-28 14:58:45.698971',88,18,34),('Agoram Arenganathan',4,'Good hall to hold marriages and family functions, parking may be an issue','2026-03-28 14:58:45.702466',89,18,34),('HOMAN RAJ',5,'Spacious marriage hall fully air conditioned can accommodate 700 members in the hall','2026-03-28 14:58:45.705860',90,18,34),('Jagannath G',5,'Conducted salangai poojai of my daughter and her friend at this venue. Nice place for a small function with around 150 members occupancy. Excellent cooling with central a/c and wonderful lighting. Dining area is spacious too. Ample car parking on the adjacent roads.','2026-03-28 14:58:47.795397',91,19,36),('Deepak “DMKP” Muthukumar P.',4,'The place is good for a small gatherings like Baby Shower Function, Engagement, Birthday Parties etc.','2026-03-28 14:58:47.798642',92,19,36),('FRANCIS RAJA',4,'Clean and Neat.\n\nBut less space in dining\nMax of 60,\nbetter requested customers will plan for buffet dinners will dine up to 90.','2026-03-28 14:58:47.802338',93,19,36),('prashanthi P',5,'Excellent modern and decent hall with less rent. Ideal for small receptions of  800people.  Decorations are good, neat and clean. )','2026-03-28 14:58:47.805220',94,19,36),('Ganeshan Mahadevan',2,'Basically it looks great and the hall is also air conditioned and a few fundamental mistakes and a design disaster. There are no washrooms on the floor where the function takes place except for the room.\nGround floor two P points and one washroom. Second floor dining has a kitchen  but i didn\'t expect the washroom to be there.\nThe lift is self deciding one. Beleive in slow and steady winning the race.\nNo parking... You car you bring your parking.\nOtherwise the manager is great and all neat all good except for the above lost all the rating.','2026-03-28 14:58:47.808025',95,19,36),('Ritesh N',5,'Nice big function hall in the middle of the city. Plenty of underground parking. Main Hall is wheelchair accessible.','2026-03-28 14:58:50.212064',96,20,38),('Kamal K',3,'No car parking available when in peak marriage reception function time.  Restrooms are below average.  AC is wonderful and one of the best cooling I have ever experienced.','2026-03-28 14:58:50.216730',97,20,38),('Shivani M',4,'Big hall, air conditioned. Could accommodate 1000 students + their parents + dignitaries and their people. So, pretty big hall. Neatly maintained - both the hall and the rooms, as well as the dining area. Overall good place in the heart of the city.','2026-03-28 14:58:50.221008',98,20,38),('Pavithra Suresh',4,'Over the years the grandeur of this marriage hall has only increased. Really spacious and ample car parking. They don\'t have inbuilt LD Tv\'s.\n\nThe rooms are spacious too.\nSeparate dining hall.','2026-03-28 14:58:50.225124',99,20,38),('Senthil kumar',4,'This place is suitable if you are looking for a high capacity lavish function. The place has a good parking space and the hall looks super cool clean and neat. It is well maintained and the AC flow was good.\n\nThough it had a good parking space. But it doesn\'t have proper sign boards to find the parking space.\n\nThe hall is located in a prime location in Chennai.','2026-03-28 14:58:50.228994',100,20,38),('Alagesan DMDK',5,'Very fast & nice app with indicators but there one issue I want to change colours of my MA becoz I have 3 MA usage. There is no option moving averages colo...','2026-03-28 14:58:55.045470',101,21,40),('Vasanth S',2,'Small hall only, located in 3rd floor (lift available). Bike parking is Ok, approx 30 bikes can be parked but car parking is very poor. You have to park in the road only and the road also very congested.','2026-03-28 14:58:55.047340',102,21,40),('Paul S',5,'Mini hall reasonable to book naming ceremony and ear piercing and reception.mini function. But parking facility needed','2026-03-28 14:58:55.048961',103,21,40),('Supraja Haridoss',3,'Suitable for mini occasions. Medium size hall with adequate air conditioning and fans. Average size parking and dining hall','2026-03-28 14:58:55.050699',104,21,40),('prema vathy',1,'Very worst Hall ever seen one AC also is not working but the name is Manimegalai A/C hall cheating very bad....','2026-03-28 14:58:55.052742',105,21,40),('vidhya gomathi',5,'We decided to conduct our daughter’s puberty function in this marriage hall, and it turned out to be a wonderful decision. Everyone working at the hall was extremely kind and treated us just like their own family. The arrangements were very affordable, and the cleanliness was absolutely perfect in every aspect.\nI have never had such a pleasant experience in any marriage hall before. My heartfelt thanks to Mr. Vijay and sincere thanks to Mr. Vijay’s mother as well. They made us feel very comfortable and went out of their way to support us and do many favors for us.\nThis hall truly feels very auspicious, and we are extremely happy with our experience.','2026-03-28 14:58:57.888067',106,22,42),('Jency Auxilia',5,'The hospitality and support made a huge difference. We\'re grateful for your help in making our event a success.\nMr Vijay is an amazing host! The venue was beautifully managed, and the team was very cooperative. Thank you for everything!\"','2026-03-28 14:58:57.891892',107,22,42),('Achintya Ramanujam music school',5,'Mahal looking neat and clean, Having good vibes, we had utilize the place for the shruti Kendra Spiritual camp. Safe and neat place for kids and children.','2026-03-28 14:58:57.895053',108,22,42),('Jayaram Murugan',5,'Very affordable price and great ambience. Really supportive and friendly approach by mahal owner. Fully satisfied with the choice of booking this place. Very clean and neat.','2026-03-28 14:58:57.898291',109,22,42),('Durai Arasan',5,'Mahal is a great venue for functions and celebrations. The hall is spacious, clean, and well maintained. Seating arrangements were comfortable, and the overall ambience was pleasant. Owner & Staff were supportive and managed the event smoothly\n\nSpacious hall with good ambience. Suitable for family functions. Overall a satisfactory experience','2026-03-28 14:58:57.901407',110,22,42),('Kss Narayanan',5,'The Bhavan is situated in Gopalapuram, a suburb of Chennai.  Suitable for conducting marriages, and functions.  Every year, Krishna Jayanthi celebrations are conducted here in a grand manner.  20 to 25 animated moving dolls depicting Krishna Leela and stories from Ramayana are installed inside the hall, with sound and light decoration in the background.  Little Krishna in a cradle with all decorations is a  sight to watch.  An exquisite exhibition worth visiting, along with children.','2026-03-28 14:59:04.087972',111,23,43),('krishnan s',5,'The location is relatively good.\nParking :\nOne side they left ofr the hikes and the other side is for the cars. But the staff there will allow maximum 7-8 cars and others have to put their cars at some other place. This place can hold a good amount fo 2 wheelers.\nHall :\nThe hall is spacious. Depending on the design the place will look beautiful as shown in my pitcure.\nFood hall:\nThe food hall is in the second floor with a small lift carrying a max of 3 or 4. It is also spacious and can hold 150 (at the time I visited) with enough people to walk around. They have 5 basins for washing hands.\nEverything else:\nDepends on who choose for your catering and what design you choose.. This is relatively spacious and a very good hall to choose.','2026-03-28 14:59:04.091527',112,23,43),('Barney Teddy',4,'The marriage hall is spacious and good. Lift facility available. Parking is around the premises of the hall. 15 rooms available for stay can be booked too. Ambience is good and pleasant. Dining hall is also spacious can accommodate good crowd. Only concern might be is parking if the movement of vehicles is high. On the whole a good marriage hall.','2026-03-28 14:59:04.095972',113,23,43),('Michael Duong',5,'Went here for a friend\'s Sangeet (kind of like a wedding reception with dancing). The venue was lovely and beautifully decorated. The first floor was the actual venue, the second floor was used as a dining hall, and the third floor had hotel style rooms. Overall it was an amazing experience','2026-03-28 14:59:04.099393',114,23,43),('Thiyagarajan N',4,'Big hall and dining space is 1 story above and on the second story snacks, desserts are served. Centrally located. Negative point is very limited car parking.','2026-03-28 14:59:04.101966',115,23,43),('Karthy S P',4,'ITC is always the choice of corporates, when they launch new products / schemes. It was for SAP Rise product, been there. Though the setup was nicely done, the sound effect from adjacent hall was prominent and we can’t stop them! Percolating 😁. The crew that managed A&V weren’t keeping their voice at low decibel and killing the real presentation 😙.\n\nThe food served was ok! The Veg pulao was GrT.','2026-03-28 14:59:21.223013',116,24,45),('Pachu Fasil',5,'Well furnishin anfd good survices','2026-03-28 14:59:21.226319',117,24,45),('Velmurugan Shanmugam',5,'Excellent place for conferences and meetings. I have been here couple of times and is well maintained with friendly staff.','2026-03-28 14:59:21.229448',118,24,45),('Imtiaz Ahmed',5,'Good and spacious one,  ideal for conducting conclave...','2026-03-28 14:59:21.232236',119,24,45),('Arun Prasad Dhanaraj',5,'The hall is well maintained and good ambience. It is like a palace and you will feel you are the king.','2026-03-28 14:59:21.236064',120,24,45),('Riaz Uddin',5,'Good place for all kind of events and function, dining area can accommodate around 60+ people,','2026-03-28 14:59:25.160331',121,25,46),('Karpagkani Jairaj',4,'Hotel type entry, ample space for function, comfortable dining area and location are major takeaways.\n\nVery limited parking space for cars. Can utilize the roadside for now till the ECR roadwork expansion gets completed.','2026-03-28 14:59:25.166450',122,25,46),('Piratheepan Naga',1,'Everything looks grand and well done except the restrooms and valet parking. The restrooms are smaller compared to the number of people the hall could accommodate. I had the worst experience with the valet parking, they are only taking expensive cars and honking cheap cars to move forward and park by themselves.','2026-03-28 14:59:25.171384',123,25,46),('H A',5,'Performed Marriage receiption . Well maintained  Hall with fine dining facility . Fully air-condioned . Excellent food . Well managed also. Catering service was very good.  when compare to the quality and number of items they are providing during catering service. Thanks to the Management and staff of roze mahal, Chennai for the support they have extended.','2026-03-28 14:59:25.174892',124,25,46),('Chandrasekar J',4,'I attended a marriage function here. The hall was excellent lookwise and ambience wise too. The dining hall was good too. I would recommend it for a function.','2026-03-28 14:59:25.178465',125,25,46),('Praveena Puttum',4,'The hall is very spacious, with a large dining area that can comfortably accommodate guests during events. It offers ample car and bike parking space, which is a major advantage for functions with bigger crowds. A lift facility is available, and rooms are also provided for guest convenience. However, the property is quite old and not very well maintained at present. With proper renovation and regular upkeep, it has great potential to become one of the most popular wedding halls. The only drawback is that the location is slightly difficult to find for first-time visitors.','2026-03-28 14:59:29.300706',126,26,48),('Balaji Murugesan',3,'Very spacious hall, most suitable for family functions. Stage is very large. Superb interior. Excellent and spacious car parking. Balcony is available to accommodate more people. Rooms are available to stay in hall. Dining is very spacious. Major concern wash room is not good. Another major drawback location. Far away from city. Air conditioning is good. Much suitable for very large crowd.','2026-03-28 14:59:29.302276',127,26,48),('Mahesh Prabhakaran',5,'Located amongst factories and godowns in the area this wedding hall has a huge space and is capable to manage large gatherings with a parking space for 50 cars and 100+ bike (approx), maybe more. You can literally have a 1000 people gather here and manage the crowd easily! This place is also very connected to Outer Ring Road (in mins) which makes travelling in and out easier than ever. Note: All figures I mentioned here are approx and based on what I saw real time, please reach out to the hall owners for actual facts and numbers.','2026-03-28 14:59:29.303683',128,26,48),('Nandhini Veerappan',5,'Visited this wedding mahal for a friends wedding. This is a place for grand weddings which can accommodate around 1000 guests. Has a large car parking space outside the mahal. The air conditioning was good as well.','2026-03-28 14:59:29.304926',129,26,48),('Ramani Ramamoorthy',5,'Very big marriage hall with huge parking area for more than hundred cars. Big dining hall and space outside for buffet. The Dias also was huge and could accommodate fifty people.','2026-03-28 14:59:29.306349',130,26,48),('Deepak Hari',5,'Excellent place for small gathering, located near kasi theatre. Fully airconditioning and interiors are excellent. Stilt + 2 floors. Stilt floor is for parking, first floor is dining and second floor is party hall. Party hall has accommodation of 50 members. Dining hall can accommodate 30 members. Bike parking can be done up to 20. Lift provision is also available. DG backup is available.','2026-03-28 14:59:33.258155',131,27,50),('Raja Kumaran',3,'Looking good & Rich look at everything... Windows work designing work wood works & floor works & table chairs & falls sealing & had wash basin toilet & steps . Emergency kit fixed for use... lift facilities\n\nNeat & Clean','2026-03-28 14:59:33.261399',132,27,50),('Jaya lakshmi',5,'An excellent venue for small gatherings, conveniently located near Kasi Theatre. The property is fully air-conditioned and features modern interiors with a Stilt + 2 floor structure.\n\nStilt Floor – Dedicated parking area with space for up to 20 two-wheelers.\n\nFirst Floor – Well-designed dining hall that can accommodate up to 30 guests.\n\nSecond Floor – Spacious party hall with a seating capacity of up to 50 guests.\n\nAdditional amenities include lift access for ease of movement and DG backup to ensure uninterrupted power supply.','2026-03-28 14:59:33.264505',133,27,50),('Kaviya S',5,'Good hall with great ambiance and enough space for dining. Air conditioning was perfect, budget friendly can accommodate 180+ . Neat dining and food we arranged in catering which is recommended by them itself was awesome and they delivered and served food neatly.','2026-03-28 14:59:33.267909',134,27,50),('Vinoth Kumar',5,'The hall is very well maintained and clean. Dining area was comfortable, and the parking space was sufficient for our guests. Management took care of every small detail. Overall, a great experience.','2026-03-28 14:59:33.271320',135,27,50),('Periasamy S',3,'Excellent place for Midle income group family functions. Very nice parking area.','2026-03-28 14:59:36.953891',136,28,52),('Archanaa Raghavan',5,'Spacious AC hall that can seat around 500. Hall includes a big balcony from where one can enjoy comfortable view of the occasion. Free Parking available. The place is well connected','2026-03-28 14:59:36.958318',137,28,52),('deiva shanker',3,'Pros\n\nGood ambiance\nWell maintained\nGood AC\nHugeeeeeeeee car parking space.\nNice rooms\n\nCons\n\nSmall hall bt they have balcony by rarely ppl use it.  Dining s also little small. If you r expecting crowd of around 500 thn it shld b good\n\nHall rental charges r high','2026-03-28 14:59:36.962782',138,28,52),('Thirali Kannan',4,'Superb function palace and can accommodate nearly 1000 guests.  They have AC rooms','2026-03-28 14:59:36.966051',139,28,52),('senthilkumar Thiagarajan',4,'Good place to host small functions with less than 500 guests,located in main road easily accessible by kattupakkam metro (in fact metro entrance is next door to the mahal)','2026-03-28 14:59:36.969687',140,28,52),('S m',4,'Nice halll fully Ac car parking available','2026-03-28 14:59:39.025161',141,29,54),('Hermann Jacob',5,'Perfect hall for wedding receptions and other gatherings. My wedding happened here and we had almost 1600 numbers visiting, and this place easily accommodated it, since it has a huge a/c hall, large dining area, well maintained restrooms and other amenities with ample car parking.\n\nApart from complimentary rooms for bride and groom, there are rooms available for just rs 2000/day. Room are good as well.\n\nFor the cost, this place is the best, compared to the other halls in Chennai.','2026-03-28 14:59:39.028001',142,29,54),('Arul Prabahar',5,'The convention hall managed by CSI christian community. Ample parking space is available.','2026-03-28 14:59:39.030830',143,29,54),('JohnVictor ArunKumar',4,'Good place for weddings. Excellent parking space. The dining hall and the reception halls are air conditioned and large halls with atleast 3000 capacity. Less lifts to handle big crowds, the rest rooms are not very clean to be managed better.','2026-03-28 14:59:39.034255',144,29,54),('Sunil Raj Philip Achen',5,'This is a much spacious place, which is fully airconditioned, for wedding receptions and public meeting. This is owned by the Madras Diocese of the Church of South India and this kept as a serene place. Parking area connected with centre is enormous in this heart of the city.','2026-03-28 14:59:39.037573',145,29,54),('Rajagopalan S',4,'The place is big and can accommodate substantial amount of people. Excellent parking for four and two wheelers. One of the few places in the city with good amount of parking. The dining hall is huge which can host considerable number of guests. The main hall and podium are big. Chairs can be placed on the sides as well. The place for wedding Oonjal is cute and nice. The toilets are neat and clean. The air conditioning all across is good. Podium is quite big.','2026-03-28 14:59:41.600042',146,30,56),('Gayathri shri Kashyap',5,'The mandapam has good location and has ample parking space.The dinning which is in the ground floor has a capacity of 250 people. The mandapam is in the first floor and has a capacity of 1000 people. It is air conditioned. There is a separate stage for reception.','2026-03-28 14:59:41.606288',147,30,56),('Anabayan T A',4,'Big Mandapam in very heart of the city-near Kodambakkam Rly stn. Neat and clean. Not that much decorative','2026-03-28 14:59:41.610118',148,30,56),('Ram Viswanathan',5,'Owned by actor Rajinikant, Raghavendra Mandapam is one of the  popular marriage halls in Chennai.  Strategically located, Mandapam is air cooled, spacious with ample car parking.\n\nGiven the brand, space and locality, it is bound be a costly place to rent and would require plenty of advance notice to get the desired slot.','2026-03-28 14:59:41.613920',149,30,56),('Praveen Kathir',3,'The space is adequate. Stage OK is a great hall in the city.','2026-03-28 14:59:41.617180',150,30,56),('Jamiruddin Khan',5,'Very decent and neat hall !!\n\nWe had our engagement event on 14/12/2025.\nWhile reading the engagement news., we needed that mic system. So along with mic system and speakers it was a very value for money for us.\nThey are offering sound system (JBL speaker with mic system)\n\nWe had 220 members for our event and no issue with car park as 15 cars and 20 bikes were comfortable parked\n\nGood place people !! Do try','2026-03-28 14:59:44.707828',151,31,58),('sri hari',5,'Event date 8 march\nGuests 250 guests can be accommodated ( floating 250-300)\nVery good AC cooling and clean and neat restrooms\nStaffs are very respectful\nVery satisfied with GVS THE ELITE PARTY HALL\nHighly recommend!! 👌👌','2026-03-28 14:59:44.711936',152,31,58),('sathesh chinna',5,'The manager and staff were very cooperative. The banquet hall was spacious for a 200 pax event with attached rooms, and the washrooms were clean and well maintained. Overall, it was a smooth and pleasant experience.','2026-03-28 14:59:44.715697',153,31,58),('Balaji Jayagopal',5,'Very few party halls are well maintained ., in that GVS THE ELITE PARTY HALL is very good !!\n\nOwners of the hall themselves check the party hall before each event whether everything is neat and clean !! Its good thing\n\nSeating :- 200 chairs ( floating crowd 300-350 )\n\nThey have two AC rooms  with bed and cot ( also have locker facility ) . Very practical\n\nReally a nice experience with them !! Recommended for birthday / baby shower /betrothal / reception etc for 200-300 guests !!\n\nWill surely recommend 👍🏼','2026-03-28 14:59:44.719390',154,31,58),('Studio k',5,'Party hall is very beautiful\nReally good maintenance\nEven in anna nagar this neat halls are rare!!\nOur function date is 1st march 2026','2026-03-28 14:59:44.723322',155,31,58),('Bubbly Rosyln',5,'Prefect place for gathering\nIt\'s compact Place\nStage decoration was good 💯','2026-03-28 14:59:49.017299',156,32,59),('Mohammed Ashik',4,'A decently spaced mahal for around 100 people at a time. Some notables are bike parking, centralised AC and easy to find location.Dining hall is a floor above quite decent as well. Overall well suited for birthday parties or house events involving limited guests.','2026-03-28 14:59:49.020781',157,32,59),('Ram Sahai Saxena',4,'I have not seen this Mahal inside but well known place in korukkupet very large area and shop also available there so many functions are celebrated like birthday marriage and marriage receptions must be good I think','2026-03-28 14:59:49.024858',158,32,59),('PADMANABAN R-3025',4,'Like it And Super held in stage.. Only Ac Is Not Available...','2026-03-28 14:59:49.027992',159,32,59),('ROSHINIYA RAVICHANDRAN',3,'The parking space is literally very small and some time lift is not working so it\'s literally hard for elderly people to go through stairs','2026-03-28 14:59:49.032442',160,32,59),('Ganesh Sri',4,'This hall is located in Koturpuram. It offers spacious hall and dining area wherein it can accomodate max of 100 people. It has AC facility and found to be good. If you conduct homam, then there is no facility to remove the smoke. Well maintained hall with sufficient parking space. Parking is available on the main road as well. Overall, for small functions, it is an ideal place as it offers all facilities. Recommended.','2026-03-28 14:59:52.626152',161,33,61),('Dr. S. G. Siva Chidambaram',5,'A wonderful hall, cool and compact for Cultural events, conferences and comfortable conduct of honoured events..','2026-03-28 14:59:52.630690',162,33,61),('Pavithra Suresh',4,'A small community hall apt to conduct punal or engagement functions. Roughly around 300 people can be accommodated.  They have a separate dinning space. The parking inside the compound is for limited cars only. Rest of the cars can be parked on the road near the hall.\n\nThey seem to have renovated the place. They have 2 rooms for the bride and groom family.','2026-03-28 14:59:52.632832',163,33,61),('Rama Lingam',5,'Limited parking lot inside.  One have to park in road.  Wide not so busy road available.  There is no signal in the junction of Adayar Bridge.  The road from library is two lane road.  Taking right turn is tricky.  One has to be careful to avoid accidents.','2026-03-28 14:59:52.635025',164,33,61),('subhadra Krishnamachari',4,'Yes I attended one 60 th year celebration of my relative on 30 th Dec 2024.it is okay for small functions.','2026-03-28 14:59:52.637043',165,33,61),('Prasanna Ajay',5,'We celebrated our son\'s Ayush Homam at Miththam, ECR, on January 02, 2026 and it was an absolutely fantastic experience. The venue itself is beautiful, with an amazing ambiance that perfectly suited the traditional significance of the event.\n\nA huge special thanks to Ashwin, who was our main point of contact. He was incredibly supportive throughout the entire process-from the initial planning stages to late-night meetings to finalize ideas. His dedication made the coordination seamless. Additionally, the decoration team did a stellar job; they executed the theme perfectly according to the plans we discussed.\n\nHighly recommended for anyone looking for a serene and well-managed event space !!','2026-03-28 14:59:56.887958',166,34,63),('Mugunthan Chakrapani',5,'This place is exactly behind tlhe Nithya Kalyana Perumal temple in Thiruvidanthai. To reach this place you have to get in to the temple arch on the OMR. From the main road it will be around 1 km. Let us get in to the place details. This place is built on the traditional method, which attracts most of the people. Marriage within close relatives and friends can happen here. Maximum 75 people can be accommodated in this place to view the marriage happenings. One side you have the stage and people can view the marriage from 3 sides. Big air coolers arranged in all the 4 corners. It was not suffocating as it was 6 to 7 am muhutham in sep month, but not sure about the rooms. Not sure how it will be during the summer season. In the center, you have open terrace with glass covered and this area is filled with water and flower floating on it. Really nice arrangements and worth to host a memorable life time functions here. Rooms are available in the first and second floors with Lift facility available. Car parking is available with ample amount of space just opposite to this place. Dining hall is in different place, which is 200 meters away towards the Perumal temple . Battery car is available to take you to the dinning hall. I m not sure about the rate to host the functions in this place, but overall I feel it is good place to host small marriage functions. People coming from north madras should start early to reach this place.','2026-03-28 14:59:56.891693',167,34,63),('R viswanathan',4,'Attended a marriage event today at Miththam, located near Nithyakalyana Perumal Temple (off ECR). Though it\'s over 30 km from central Chennai, the venue offers a refreshing and peaceful setting.\n\nThe place is traditional and surrounded by greenery, with a calm, old-world charm. Guests can even view the event from the first floor, adding to the experience.\n\nTea, coffee, and juice were served at the venue, while breakfast and lunch were arranged in a separate dining area, just a short walk away. An electric vehicle is also available to shuttle guests between the two spots.\n\nParking is hassle-free thanks to the open surroundings. Overall, a lovely venue for weddings and small functions, if you don\'t mind the distance. Since I am based in proper Chennai, I had to take uber rental for six hours and paid Rs 2500, which I feel could have sent for a better purpose if the venue had been within the city.','2026-03-28 14:59:56.894895',168,34,63),('RAMESH S',5,'We had our daughter’s wedding at Miththam, and choosing this venue was truly a heartfelt decision. The place instantly reminded me of my grandfather’s house — traditional, serene, and filled with warmth. It is a very quiet location with ample parking space and a wonderful, pleasant atmosphere that perfectly suited a family wedding.\n\nOur point of contact, Mr. Ajith, was exceptionally helpful and supportive. Whenever we reached out to him, he patiently clarified all our doubts and guided us through every arrangement, both before and after the event. His coordination made the entire process smooth and stress-free.\n\nMr. Arun was equally supportive and guided us throughout the event with great care and professionalism.\n\nI must specially mention the entire Miththam team — they were cooperative, kind, and attentive at every step. Their dedication made our celebration seamless and joyful.\n\nThank you to the Miththam team for making our daughter’s wedding a beautiful and memorable occasion that we will always cherish. 🙏✨','2026-03-28 14:59:56.898324',169,34,63),('JAGANRAJA APPADURAI',5,'Wonderful place for small beautiful weddings, meetings and celebrations. Nice property, well maintained and perfectly located.\n\nRecently we had a chance to attend our friend\'s wedding function here @ Miththam, Good place, nice architecture with green trees and a natural pond nearby.\n\nRegular maintenance and a better road will make this property a top choice for our functions and gatherings for years to come..','2026-03-28 14:59:56.901299',170,34,63),('Suresh Narayanan',5,'We had the absolute pleasure of hosting our daughter’s three-day wedding celebration at Sree Varaaham, Koyambedu, and it was truly an exceptional experience.\n\nThe venue was impeccably clean, beautifully maintained, and perfectly suited for a grand celebration. The entire team worked tirelessly across all three days to ensure everything ran smoothly for our family and guests.\n\nA heartfelt thank you to Mr. Sathiamoorthy, the Venue Manager, who partnered with us for over 12 months leading up to the wedding, coordinating every detail with dedication and patience. Special appreciation to the owner, Mr. Ravi Kumar, who personally met with us and even attended the wedding to ensure everything was executed flawlessly. That level of care and hospitality truly sets this venue apart.\n\nOutstanding service, warm hospitality, and a genuine five-star experience from start to finish.\n\nHighly recommend Sree Varaaham to anyone looking for a memorable and stress-free wedding venue in Chennai.','2026-03-28 14:59:59.773410',171,35,65),('s Ashokkumar',5,'Sree Vaaraham Hall is a highly recommended, air-conditioned wedding venue located in Koyambedu, praised for its excellent accessibility and thoughtful amenities across multiple floors.\n🗺️ Location & Access\nPrime Location: Situated right on the main road in Koyambedu, eliminating the difficulty of finding it, especially for out-of-town guests.\nConvenience: Easily accessible; the reviewer noted a quick 10-minute drive from JP Hotel.\n🅿️ Ground Floor & Entrance Amenities\nParking: Covered parking lot is available to the left-hand side at the back upon entering the gate (capacity is unknown).\nGrand Entrance: The main entrance features a welcoming atmosphere:\nA waterfall infinity wall designed to relax the mind.\nA huge Ganesha Idol.\nA display of dolls resembling a traditional \'Gollu\' setup.\nVertical Access: Guests have the option of using a spiral staircase or a lift to access the first and second floors.\nGuest Restrooms: Conveniently located at the ground level near the lift.\n👰 First Floor: Wedding Hall & Pre-Function Area\nHallway/Lounge: A long passage provides a functional space for guests:\nAn area for standing, socializing, and having coffee (if counters are set up).\nSpace for setting up activities like a Mehendi artist\'s table.\nFeatures a window overlooking the flyover, offering views of Chennai.\nRitual Area: The \'Unjal\' (Swing) for the couple\'s rituals was placed in this hallway/lounge area.\nWedding Hall: Spacious and well-lit.\nNatural Light: Abundant natural light enters through the numerous windows, reducing the need for artificial lighting.\nStage: Gigantic, located to the right side upon entering, offering ample space for both the bride\'s and groom\'s sides.\nSeating: Flexible arrangement options for the host.\nMusician Area: A small, dedicated stage in the back corner for the musician/orchestra.\nChanging Room (The Suite): Described as being reminiscent of a hotel room with:\nDecent size, allowing multiple people to change simultaneously.\nA bed for resting.\nAn attached bathroom.\n🍽️ Second Floor: Dining Hall\nSpacious Dining: The hall can accommodate many guests at once without feeling overcrowded due to efficient row arrangement.\nComfort: Bright and AC-equipped, ensuring a comfortable temperature while guests enjoy their meal.\nHygiene Feature: A thoughtful amenity is the presence of a paper towel dispenser near the hand washing sink, allowing guests to dry their hands without using a handkerchief.\n✨ Additional Potential Feature\nTerrace: The reviewer believes the hall also has a terrace for hosting functions at that level.','2026-03-28 14:59:59.777690',172,35,65),('Anbu',5,'I had such a fantastic time at Sree Varaaham Hall! ✨ The atmosphere was wonderful, and everything was perfectly organized. I highly recommend this venue for any event! 💖 The staff was incredibly helpful and made my experience truly memorable. Can\'t wait to visit again! 😊','2026-03-28 14:59:59.780779',173,35,65),('Prathima Joishy',5,'Sree Vaaraham Hall is an AC wedding hall located in Koyambedu.  The location is perfect because it is right on the main road, and one will not have to go in circles trying to find the place - especially if you are visiting from out of town.  It took us just 10 minutes from JP Hotel where many guests and us were staying.\n\nUpon entering the gate, you can find the covered parking lot to the left hand side at the back.  I am unsure how many cars can be parked as I did not go that side.  Once you enter the main door, you can find a beautiful infinity wall of waterfall to relax your mind.  There is a huge Ganesha Idol to welcome you to the hall. You can also find a display of dolls to the right or the Ganesha Idol that reminded me of the figurines kept during \'Gollu\' The guest has the option of taking the spiral staircase or the lift to the first and second floors.\n\nUpon entering the first floor, you can find a long passage way where guests can stand and talk, have a coffee or two in case some counters have been set up, keep a table or two for the mehendi artist to sit or one can simply stand at the window and enjoy the sights of beautiful Chennai as this hall looks over the flyover. This is the area where the \'Unjal\' or Swing was kept for the couple to sit while certain rituals were performed.\n\nTo the right side, you can find the spacious and well lit wedding hall. The stage is located to the right hand side once you enter.  Due to the number of windows, natural light can fall through and the lights are not really needed.\n\nI must say this is such a beautiful wedding hall.  The stage is gigantic and both the bride and groom\'s side have adequate space in their respective places.  The changing room reminded me of a hotel room. It was of a decent size and many people could change at once, there was a bed in case anyone wanted to take rest during the function.  There was an attached bathroom too.\n\nThe seating arrangement can be done in anyway the host chooses.  In the corner at the back, there is a small stage where the musician and/or orchestra can assemble to play their hearts away during the function.\n\nMoving to the 2nd Floor, you will find the dining hall that could accomodate many guests at once, but one would not find it overcrowded because of the way the rows were arranged.  Just like the wedding hall, the dining hall is bright and with AC so you don\'t have to feel the heat while eating the delicious lunch!\n\nThere is a sink to wash your hands and what I really liked was the paper towel dispenser kept near by so people could wipe their hands instead of using their own handkerchief.\n\nI believe this hall also has a terrace in case you want to host a function at that level.\n\nThe bathrooms for the guests are located at ground level near the lift.\n\nSree Vaaraham Hall is a nice place to host your special functions and make it more memorable!','2026-03-28 14:59:59.783924',174,35,65),('Kesava Perumal',5,'Overall excellent. Roof top facilities are amazing, enjoying the event with vadaplani and Koyambedu look out.Murtha mandapam arrangements are good with all Pooja items. Kitchen and Dining are very hygenic. I appreciate administrative team coordiate with us from the time of booking till end of the events. I really appreciate Sree Varaaham Hall Management and all other staff members coordination for my daughters marriage to celebrate this event in a joyful and impressive way.\nThanks & Regards\nPrabu','2026-03-28 14:59:59.788962',175,35,65),('Ravi Chandran',5,'Sri Vijalakshmi Mahal is a well-maintained and spacious venue, ideal for weddings and other large gatherings. The hall offers ample seating capacity, clean and organized interiors, and good ventilation. Parking space is generally sufficient for moderate crowds. The staff is courteous and cooperative, ensuring smooth event coordination. It’s a solid choice for those looking for a functional and traditional event space at a reasonable cost.','2026-03-28 15:00:02.982212',176,36,67),('Aravind Radhakrishnan',2,'This hall would be best for small birthday parties and functions like upanayanam.\n\n1) The dining capacity is 55 seats\n2) The hall can accomodate upto 125-150 people.\n\n3) Rooms and washrooms are not clean and are not modern. Washrooms are disgusting.\n\n4) Also, the hall has centralized AC however it not effective on account of Homam smoke (usually common among Hindu marriages and upanayanam).','2026-03-28 15:00:02.985535',177,36,67),('Siva Subramanian',5,'Excellent place for wedding, home function, party etc... spacious parking facilities as well.','2026-03-28 15:00:02.989110',178,36,67),('Durga Dhuliphala',5,'1.Location:- Easy to reach.2.Generater fesilities available.It is most important.3.Lift also available.4.AC HALL.NEAT And Clean.\nTotally good, Comfortable\nFor all types of FUNCTIONS','2026-03-28 15:00:02.992452',179,36,67),('Veeraraghavan Jagannathan',5,'Sri Vijalakshmi Mahal is a well-maintained and spacious venue, ideal for weddings and other large gatherings. The hall offers ample seating capacity, clean and organized interiors, and good ventilation','2026-03-28 15:00:02.995771',180,36,67),('Harini Chandrasekar',5,'We had a truly wonderful experience at SPP Gardens. Our event was a great success and we’re all very happy with how everything turned out. I was especially impressed with the staff support throughout the entire process, the way different coordinators were assigned for food, decor, and overall management made everything seamless.\n\nA special thanks to Seeman and Nirosha, who were our first points of contact while booking the space and guided us from day one.\nA big appreciation to Jagan, who handled the food. He helped us curate an amazing menu and the food was exceptional.\nVinod, the décor incharge, was extremely patient and supportive through all the changes and demands we had.\nAnd Selvam, the event coordinator, ensured the entire team worked together effortlessly on the event day.\n\nOverall, we’re very happy with the venue and the service. Thank you for making our event memorable. I would definitely recommend this event space for your next big day!','2026-03-28 15:00:05.655809',181,37,69),('Sridharan B',5,'We had our daughter\'s reception and wedding. It was an amazing experience.  Lovely ambiance,  attractive well maintained green lawns with some superlative lightings which has glittered in the night sky. We were lucky that weather god supported us too. As far as the SPP team is concerned,  lead by Mr Ram, the entire staff team was really  good, very helpful. Starting from Mr Seemon, Mr Selvam, Mr Jagan, Mr Ruben, Mr. Balaji etc , all were very nice and ensured everything was in place as discussed and agreed. There has been no follow-up for any thing.  Pushpa catering has done a fabulous job. The food was very tasty and they have taken care of our guests very well. All in all an amazing venue to have the wedding function.  Few suggestion: the proximity from living rooms to the venue is longer, it\'s suggested to have more buggy services from rooms to lawns.\nSridharan','2026-03-28 15:00:05.659252',182,37,69),('Dinesh Inbavadivu',5,'Magical place. A wonderful experience. I would definitely recommend my friends. The staffs were friendly, exceptional cleanliness, comfortable and well maintained rooms. The Pushpa island is exceptional - magnificent place to conduct marriages. Thank you to my dear friend Ram and his staffs seeman, Selvam, Balaji & the Decor team - Sakthi decors for making the event a grand success.','2026-03-28 15:00:05.662809',183,37,69),('Dinesh Pandiyan',5,'⭐️⭐️⭐️⭐️⭐️\nBeautiful garden and peaceful atmosphere. Good place for events and gatherings. Well maintained and spacious.','2026-03-28 15:00:05.665872',184,37,69),('Vadivukkarasi Panchatsaram',5,'Very nice place for rich look wedding.....hav gud amenities but car parking was a little not ok....The vallet parking was not provided and asked to park the car outside the venue. We had an argument with the person....','2026-03-28 15:00:05.668690',185,37,69),('mani vannan',4,'Good place to celebrate, but beware from housekeeping they charge 1500 per head total 4 of them bad experience from those.','2026-03-28 15:00:08.347006',186,38,71),('Prabha Karan',5,'Nice 5star community hall','2026-03-28 15:00:08.350533',187,38,71),('RAJANGAM CM',4,'Good','2026-03-28 15:00:08.354291',188,38,71),('Sundeep Kumar',5,'A great place for small functions like engagements or such functions.\n\nHaving few car parks ( around 10 ) and 20-30 bike parking. Place is neat and clean, well maintained. Lift is too big, can carry multiple wheelchairs.','2026-03-28 15:00:10.592705',189,39,72),('Sivaramakrishnan Vaithianathan',5,'It is well maintained and tidy A/c hall. Just sufficient to park around 6 cars. It is good enough for small functions, where number of participants are not more than 100. Public transport facility is poor to reach this place. Only your own conveyance else hired conveyance.','2026-03-28 15:00:10.595654',190,39,72),('Vijayaraghavan Madhuravasal',4,'The chairs are not arranged properly.. simply dumped.\nThe parking guidance is good.\nDining and function halls are fine.\nGood for about 100 people gathering.','2026-03-28 15:00:10.598350',191,39,72),('Venkataraman S',5,'A Nicely appointed, centrally air-conditioned Function hall /dining hall/ and Car Parking. Centrally located in West Mambalam, too.','2026-03-28 15:00:10.602007',192,39,72),('Idhu Namadhu Ulagam',4,'Very easily identifiable.\nBut a but interior.\nJust a km away from Ashok Pillar.\nEnd of Arya Gowda street.\nA small hall in d first floor.\nExcellent fall ceiling.\nLighting are very pleasant.\nGF is car parking.\n2nd floor is dining hall.\n2  lifts are available.  One is for service.\nVery neat n clean.\nFully ac hall.\nToilets are very limited but neat.','2026-03-28 15:00:10.605408',193,39,72),('bharat krishna',5,'I had a great experience at Mantra Hall, thanks to the fantastic service from the manager, A. Kesavaram. He was friendly, professional, and made sure everything ran smoothly. The valet service was prompt and efficient, which made our visit even more convenient. Highly recommend Mantra Hall for anyone looking for a welcoming and well-managed place!','2026-03-28 15:00:13.973937',194,40,74),('Lavanya Rangaswami',5,'We conducted out sons Ayushyahomam here in Jan2026.\nWe loved the hall it was very neat and tidy. Be it the Lift facility or the rooms.\nWell maintained.\nKudos to the manager and supervisor for handling things.\nWould appreciate if tamboolam plates are also provided with manai vilaku etc.\nOverall a great mantap for small functions','2026-03-28 15:00:13.975673',195,40,74),('Uppili Chakra',5,'Hall interior design really nice\n100 persons approx capacity\nDecent approach by the maids\nDinning akso good,\nNeed to reduce the hight of the dinning table','2026-03-28 15:00:13.977442',196,40,74),('Srikant Narayan',5,'I performed my son\'s upanayanam at Manthra Hall, Mandeiveli. The hall with dining room in ground floor and function hall in 1st floor is spacious, well maintained with excellent air conditioning. The manager Shri Keshava Ram is very accommodative with good connections for support activities.','2026-03-28 15:00:13.979263',197,40,74),('Rao P. U',5,'A headache free hall for an audience of 100-120. The ambience is awesome, cleanliness is first class, staff are friendly and the manager Mr. Kesavaram, is polite, approachable and responsive and get the job done.\nOverall it was an awesome experience for us!','2026-03-28 15:00:13.981061',198,40,74),('Sridhar Velu',5,'The ambience and location of this marriage hall is very good. The workers and managers are very friendly and always available to help. They take care very well, explanation of the charges, walk thru of the location and details they share while settlement is clear and transparent. Has lot of car parking, had a very peaceful time for the entire duration of marriage and everyone was appreciating on the cleanliness, the number of rooms available and maintenance of the same is very good. We all enjoyed the entire duration','2026-03-28 15:00:18.336403',199,41,76),('Vasuchi Vasudevan',5,'True to its name, Sri Devi Palace Marriage Hall truly feels like a palace! The ambience, lighting, chandeliers, and cleanliness are top-notch — far better than many halls in Chennai city. Excellent value for money! The hall easily fits 800+ guests, and the ample parking opposite the venue is a huge bonus. Service is outstanding — Mr. Nehru (Manager) and his team are super courteous, professional, and always ready to help. Rooms are spacious with clean, well-kept washrooms. The dining area on the same floor is so convenient, and the air conditioning works perfectly — a must for Chennai! The only small suggestion would be to add a few more washrooms for visitors. Overall, a beautiful, well-managed venue that offers elegance, comfort, and great service — highly recommended for weddings and big functions!','2026-03-28 15:00:18.340527',200,41,76),('Viswanathan Muthurakoo',4,'Very nice. Well kept. I remember visiting this place a decade ago and it looks like the same. Also has additional car parking space','2026-03-28 15:00:18.343708',201,41,76),('Banu shree',5,'The marriage hall was good, could accommodate a 2-3 hundred people comfortably at once.\nParking was limited, but manageable.\nSpecial mention to the evening security guard who was helpful despite the language barrier, it really made a great impression!','2026-03-28 15:00:18.347052',202,41,76),('Vivek Mech',5,'Well-Maintained wedding hall in chennai in terms of cleanliness and electrical fittings.Good spacious for parking area. Perfect place to conduct reception around 200 people.','2026-03-28 15:00:18.350165',203,41,76),('Arjun Jr.',5,'Great Mandapam for Marriage and other big events. Good amount of car parking is there','2026-03-28 15:00:21.757986',204,42,78),('The real trekker',3,'Good atmosphere....\nSuitable for large functions and medium functions...\nEntry way to little bit tough to identify...\n100 + seats dining hall..\nFull AC\nInterior design good..\nNear by bus stand and railway station\nEnough parking','2026-03-28 15:00:21.761375',205,42,78),('Venkataramanan B V',5,'My friends marriage was conducted in this aai auditorium and it\'s very big hall around 500 people can accomodate. This was constructed after 1960.','2026-03-28 15:00:21.764986',206,42,78),('Sridhar Venugopal',5,'The main hall has a ceiling stretching coffee of floors high.  The mantrap though small is well designed.  No pillars and hence a very clear view.  Fully air-conditioned.  Rarely you get to see dining area air-conditioned.  Kitchen and dining area are huge.  Adequate parking and open space in the front side.  Very conveniently located.\n\nMain hall is very well maintained.  However, additional rooms in the residential quarters are very poorly maintained - like a typical government quarters.','2026-03-28 15:00:21.768428',207,42,78),('Sathish Govindh',5,'A great place to host functions and parties, with all the necessary facilities available. It offers a spacious dining area, along with separate dining halls for vegetarian and non-vegetarian guests.','2026-03-28 15:00:21.772613',208,42,78),('Sakthi krishnan',3,'Nice venue with okay parking and a dining hall that fits 200 people easily. The hall size is perfect for mid-sized functions, but the pricing is the main issue. Being asked for 7 lakhs for a reception and marriage here is definitely too costly. Better value can be found elsewhere unless they lower the package price','2026-03-28 15:00:24.252421',209,43,80),('EventZ Squad',5,'SKV Wedding Mahal is a well-maintained and spacious venue, perfect for weddings and family functions. The hall ambience is pleasant, seating arrangements are comfortable, and the overall layout is well planned for smooth event flow.\nThe management team is cooperative and supportive, ensuring everything runs in an organized manner. Parking facilities and accessibility are also convenient for guests.\nA great choice for hosting special occasions and creating beautiful memories. Highly recommended! 👍✨','2026-03-28 15:00:24.257123',210,43,80),('Raja Kumaran',4,'SKV MAHAL\n\n* mugappaier hidden spot but huge spot\n* Kerala classic look at infrastructure and interior\n* 3 Floor and separate rooms facility\n* Ground & 2rd Floor Function Hall by need of space with Restroom and rooms and lift A/C\n* First Floor Dining | Kitchen | Store | Rooms |\n* Dining with capacity 200 - 250 max\n* Goods & Passenger lift available\n* Huge kitchen setup with 10 gas stoves\n* Dining hall with air conditioner\n* Neat and quick cleaning staffs\n* Large space for 2 & 4 & Bus parking\n* Every floor has A/C | Lift | Rooms | Restroom\n\nBut Goods - Load lift only big trouble in the mahal . Please repair and maintenance well for next program. Because so many weight things can\'t take by steps regularly at single function by less manpower','2026-03-28 15:00:24.261372',211,43,80),('Logeshwaran Senthil',5,'The marriage hall is spacious, elegant, and well-maintained, with the capacity to comfortably accommodate up to 1,000 guests. It offers ample car parking space, ensuring convenience for people. Overall, it is an excellent venue that combines grandeur, comfort, and practicality, making it ideal for large and prestigious events.','2026-03-28 15:00:24.264518',212,43,80),('Mandolin Saiganesh',5,'Excellent hall with fantastic amenities..Has a huge parking space..We carry many pleasant memories of performing at this beautiful venue..','2026-03-28 15:00:24.267770',213,43,80),('laxman venkatesh',5,'The Kalyana Mandabam and Banquet Hall is the newest in the area. It is Luxurious and well maintained. It is a one stop solution for all types of functions. There is a large Banquet Hall for all kinds of functions. It could accomodate around 250 to 300 guests. A separate Dining Hall for Vegetarians is available. There\'s a Garden with exclusive Non-Veg Dining Hall. There are around 10 AC rooms for guests. All this is at very affordable rates. Very contented and satisfied with their service.','2026-03-28 15:00:28.196026',214,44,82),('Ganesh Natarajan',4,'Very good and spacious. Ample car parking area. Can be used for multiple purposes.','2026-03-28 15:00:28.198001',215,44,82),('Siva Kumar',5,'Clean and neat gud communication for easy event organization every thing thanks I loved','2026-03-28 15:00:28.200029',216,44,82),('Sridhar Ranganathan',5,'It is a function hall for marriages and family-related functions for about 250 guests. Located on a main road with parking space in and around the hall. It has main function hall on the first floor and a dining hall on the second floor connected with an elevator.','2026-03-28 15:00:28.201834',217,44,82),('Kumar R',3,'Need to improve basic amenities like flush, bed sheets, maintenance of air conditioning etc.\nMini function no problem','2026-03-28 15:00:28.203637',218,44,82),('Bharat K.V.',5,'Had the chance to attend my cousin’s wedding at AVM Rajeshwari Kalyana Mandapam, and what a beautiful experience it was! The mandapam is grandly designed, with spacious halls, an equally large dining area, and huge, comfortable rooms — perfect for hosting a big, traditional celebration.\n\nBut what truly made my day was stumbling upon a collection of vintage Tamizh cinema posters inside the premises. As a Tamizh cinema buff, it felt like walking through a piece of film history.  Don’t miss checking them out if you ever visit — such a nostalgic trip down memory lane!\n\nAlso, the location is great and well-connected, making it easy for guests. Whether you’re there for a wedding or just passing by, take a moment to soak in the charm — this place is more than just a mandapam; it’s a slice of cultural heritage.','2026-03-28 15:00:30.768120',219,45,84),('Kuthbul Akthab',5,'Well maintained wedding hall in chennai in terms of cleanliness and electrical fittings. Good spacious parking area. Perfect place to conduct reception and marriage in a grand way...','2026-03-28 15:00:30.770294',220,45,84),('Dr Sundaravelu Raman',5,'Old world charm visible everywhere,  I have been visiting this kalyan Mattapan dor the past 50 years or more may be , they keep reinventing themselves , the elaborate Dining , reception halls , and large car parking make it ideal for bigger weddings , keep it up AVM','2026-03-28 15:00:30.772669',221,45,84),('Triangle Services Photography',5,'We had the pleasure of covering a wedding at this gorgeous venue &  it was an absolute dream for photography , The hall is not only spacious and well-organized but also radiates elegance with its traditional yet classy architecture ,One of the standout features for us was the beautiful pathway leading to the main entrance lined with greenery and warm lights, it added a magical touch to the couple portraits and candid moments ,The mandap setup, ambient lighting, and overall decor offered a perfect blend of charm and comfort','2026-03-28 15:00:30.775231',222,45,84),('Sivakumar V',5,'An excellent Kalyana mandapam at a very central place in Chennai. Lots of rooms , with good amenities. The main hall huge and good arrangements. Very clean wash rooms . Large parking lot.','2026-03-28 15:00:30.777210',223,45,84),('Simon Antipas',4,'A compact not so elderly friendly hall right off the highway with a provision for a stage at either ends of the hall.','2026-03-28 15:00:33.606533',224,46,86),('Keerthana S P',1,'Very bad ambience overall very bad experience\nNote even 1 star','2026-03-28 15:00:33.609026',225,46,86),('Vijay Bharathi',4,'Parking space best place','2026-03-28 15:00:33.611264',226,46,86),('Sivashankar Mani',3,'Located on road , and has good amount of parking space (around 50+ bike and 10 -12 cars if space is utilised properly)  , dining is in ground floor and reception hall at 1St floor , could accommodate around 200+ memebers at a time.','2026-03-28 15:00:33.613812',227,46,86),('Mohideen Meera',3,'A good hall for local people in surrounding areas, for people from other locations located at far distance. Parking available. Non AC. Hall maintenance Average. Toilets: Available but not cleaned or properly maintained. An Average hall...','2026-03-28 15:00:33.616277',228,46,86),('Raghunath Narasingarao',5,'We did our son\"s engagement last week here.\nVery good . Excellent.\nEspecially Mr Balasubramaniam manager helped us throughout the function before and after. He guided us. Marvelous.\nI strongly recommend this venue.\nOur colleagues ( doctors ) also appreciated.  Seamles air-conditioning,  good housekeeping and support staff. The audio and the decorator also did nice job....','2026-03-28 15:00:38.358895',229,47,88),('RAMAKRISHNAN THIAGARAJAN',5,'The Marriage Hall is very spacious and rooms meant for groom & bridegroom are well equipped. The Dining Hall is big and sufficient to accommodate 100 persons.','2026-03-28 15:00:38.362397',230,47,88),('Nimesh P',1,'Hall and dining facilities all good. But don’t try to use the vallet parking there. It’s not safe to handover ur vehicle to them as I have lost few items from car ! Pathetic experience !','2026-03-28 15:00:38.366394',231,47,88),('Gopalan Kuppan',5,'A nice hall best suited for marriages and parties. Has a lift and decent parking space. Had wheelchairs for elderly.','2026-03-28 15:00:38.370325',232,47,88),('Venkatraman V',5,'Nice\nHall for functions upto around 225 people. Convinently located. Very helpful management and staff. Neat and clean.','2026-03-28 15:00:38.373909',233,47,88),('Eternal Bliss வரம் unlimited',5,'Watching a pillar less huge structure for the first time. A very huge hall, with all amenities and spacious parking, portico. Great place for all events','2026-03-28 15:00:42.621729',234,48,90),('Roshankz',3,'This hall is not suitable for music concerts. The sound quality is poor. It\'s not designed for good sound deliverance. However parking space is ample, seating chairs and restrooms are good.','2026-03-28 15:00:42.626008',235,48,90),('ASHOK LAWYER',3,'Quite a big banquet hall. Would accommodate large crowds. Good for conferences and meetings. Located on the ECR between Adyar and Mahabalipuram. Car parking is inadequate for huge crowds. Traffic jams are a concern during entry and exit.','2026-03-28 15:00:42.630003',236,48,90),('Shekar Chandrasekaran',5,'The Perfect Wedding Venue – Where Excellence Meets Heart\n\nAfter visiting over 35 venues across Chennai, ECR, and Mahabalipuram – including several five-star hotels and top-rated properties – I knew from the very first moment I stepped onto the AMRK Banquet Hall property at RK Convention Center, Neelankarai, that this was where my daughter\'s wedding would be. Sometimes you just know.\n\nAMRK breaks away from the typical marriage hall mold. Set on a sprawling piece of land, it offers a sense of space and serenity that\'s rare to find – no feeling of being hemmed in by concrete jungles here.\n\nThe hall itself is beautifully designed with thoughtful touches throughout. The main event area sits adjacent to the dining space, connected by huge glass windows that keep guests engaged with the celebrations even while they dine. The stage is generously large, offering endless possibilities for decoration limited only by your imagination. Natural light floods the hall beautifully, complemented by excellent indoor lighting that creates a warm, inviting atmosphere. The spacious outdoor portico is perfect for conducting traditional Hindu wedding rituals with ease and grace.\n\nWhat truly impressed me – and many of my guests – was the impeccable maintenance of the property. People kept asking how they manage to keep everything, including the public restrooms, at five-star hotel standards. It\'s a rare level of care and attention to detail.\n\nThe staff were extraordinary. Available literally 24 hours a day, I never once saw a frown or hint of frustration on anyone\'s face. But what made the biggest difference was their attitude: there was never a \"no.\" Even when my requests were a bit out of the ordinary, their response was always, \"Let us see how we can make that happen for you\" – and they delivered every single time.\n\nSpecial mention and heartfelt thanks to Mr. Rajasekar, Fatima Madam, Balaji, and the incredible cleaning crew who worked tirelessly to keep everything pristine.\n\nThe pricing is competitive with top properties in Chennai, and there are excellent accommodation options nearby for out-of-town guests at reasonable rates – a real bonus for wedding planning.\n\nIf you\'re looking for a wedding venue in Chennai, AMRK Banquet Hall is truly a no-brainer. It\'s where exceptional facilities meet genuine hospitality and heart. Our daughter\'s wedding was everything we dreamed of, and this venue played a huge part in making it unforgettable.\n\nCannot recommend highly enough!','2026-03-28 15:00:42.633200',237,48,90),('Sathya Vaidyanathan',4,'Clean and very modern\nStaff were good and lots of space\nRooms were very good, amenities given as well, bathrooms very clean\n\nDecoration was a bit slow and could be improved at some points however\n\nBanquet hall has a hall for food service and a separate hall for function','2026-03-28 15:00:42.637833',238,48,90),('Surya Digital Studio',5,'\"A classy and comfortable venue with great accessibility. The decor and lighting created the perfect setting for our special day!\"','2026-03-28 15:00:47.925472',239,49,92),('Mahima Reddy Kuppani',5,'We recently hosted our wedding at Akshara Mahaall Marriage Hall, Nerkundram in Chennai and had an amazing experience. The hall\'s elegant decor, spacious seating, and well-maintained facilities created the perfect ambiance. The staff was professional, attentive, and ensured seamless coordination. We opted for Kaimanam catering which was outstanding, with delicious dishes that received rave reviews from our relatives. Overall, the venue met our expectations, making our big day truly special. We highly recommend Akshara Mahaall Marriage Hall and Kaimanam Caterings for anyone looking for a beautiful and well-managed wedding venue in Chennai.','2026-03-28 15:00:47.929611',240,49,92),('Kalaivani.K',5,'tlwmAkshara Mahal Marriage HallAkshara Mahal Marriage Hall Nerkundram Chennai\n\nAkshara Mahal Marriage Hall, located in Nerkundram, Chennai, is a spacious and elegant venue ideal for weddings and events. The hall can accommodate up to 300 seated guests and 500 standing attendees, making it suitable for both intimate gatherings and larger celebrations. The venue offers modern amenities, including air-conditioned halls and dining areas, as well as 10 guest rooms (2 AC and 8 non-AC) for the convenience of attendees. Guests can also benefit from parking facilities accommodating up to 10 cars. While the hall provides in-house decoration services, it allows outside catering, offering flexibility to clients. Overall, Akshara Mahal is known for its spaciousness, modern amenities, and dedicated service, making it a popular choice for hosting memorable events in Chennai. citeturn0search9','2026-03-28 15:00:47.933200',241,49,92),('Ramnath Veeraraghavan',5,'Hall is good & well maintained.\nEspecially Manager Balamurugan\'s support is extraordinary.\nHigly suggestable for an event of 300people capacity','2026-03-28 15:00:47.936982',242,49,92),('Karthika Vijayakumar',5,'I had my wedding 2 days before in this hall. First thing I have never seen this much of kindness from a marriage hall owner. He is so good to us and helped us in every aspect and treated us like family. The super cool mandabam had a top notch place in my wedding with best price in the market comparatively. You should definitely opt this place for any functions and you will never regret. Thank you so much sir.','2026-03-28 15:00:47.940201',243,49,92),('Aravind Krishna',4,'Nice marriage hall with 500+ seating capacity and 1500 floating crowd with a huge dining hall and plenty parking area. Only drawback is Bike parking is bit short and toilet facility is less. Other than this, one of the big hall near Maduravoyal area...','2026-03-28 15:00:50.051831',244,50,94),('Nadana Ravishankar Thiraviam',4,'Very spacious and easy accessible mahal. It’s located on the main road and one can easily identify it from anywhere. The building is nice and has good parking space and dining space located at the first floor. Marriage hall is at second floor and few rooms and dormitory is available at third floor. It’s neatly maintained and well equipped but the AC system is not very efficient otherwise it is a good place for marriage and other activities.','2026-03-28 15:00:50.055093',245,50,94),('Praveena Puttum',4,'Nice hall for big marriages\n\nVery spacious and It Is located on the main road but main hall door is sensor based many meters people are getting hurt Bec of it\n\nGood parking space both for bike and car\n\nDining space located at the first floor.Marriage hall is at second floor and few rooms and dormitory is available at third floor.\n\nIt’s neatly maintained hall and rooms but the AC system is not very efficient and common washrooms are not at all neat very bad otherwise it is a good place for marriage and other activities.','2026-03-28 15:00:50.059995',246,50,94),('Saravanan D',5,'Nice ambience. Ample parking space for two wheeler and four wheeler. Fully air conditioned marriage hall and dining hall. Lift facility also available. Good one. Loved it.','2026-03-28 15:00:50.063176',247,50,94),('Britblaster Zeb',5,'This is an Excellent property for conducting Wedding and party\'s. Ground floor they have provided as valet parking, first floor hall converted as dining area and second floor for wedding, reception and party hall as such based on our requirements. Hand wash area is neat and clean with proper Faucet as required with hand wash solutions. Ideal place for conducting any get together etc...','2026-03-28 15:00:50.066379',248,50,94),('Kavvya Ramarathnam',2,'The halls are good and the car parking are great. However bride and groom rooms are cleaned with some washing liquid and smells bad. The Air conditioning system does not work properly in many of the rooms. The bedsheets are not very clean. Please check all these conditions before booking these.','2026-03-28 15:00:53.919246',249,51,96),('Mandolin Saiganesh',5,'Excellent Hall.. Spacious one..Our Saiswarangal Band carries many pleasant memories of performing at this wonderful venue..','2026-03-28 15:00:53.921885',250,51,96),('vaidyanathan T M',5,'Posting about this hall very late\nOur son’s marriage took place in this hall in Dec 23 immediately after the heavy rains\nThey took care of the cleaning and other things very carefully\nThe rooms were comfortable around 12 rooms comes with package and other 12 rooms with additional cost\nOne big plus point is\nProximity and connectivity\nAll marriage hall and dining hall in the ground level\nWith rooms on separate area\nThe car parking facility too was huge\n\nOverall we can give 4.5 /5\n(As rooms upkeep can be updated little more)','2026-03-28 15:00:53.924842',251,51,96),('Sundararajan S',3,'I attended a marriage recently here. Wow...a huge place with plenty of space for cars. The halls and dining place are also equally large. But, for the rental they are charging, which is bound to be high, they could have taken care of the following steps:\n\n(a) There is no roof on the path through which the guests enter once inside the compound. When it rains, it proves extremely inconvenient.\n(b) The toilets could be a little more hygienic.\n\nThough my feedback may also relate to the distance between the places of accommodation and the main hall, I am not sure if something could be done about that.','2026-03-28 15:00:53.927986',252,51,96),('aneesh nair',5,'spacious and nearly arranged kalyana Mandapam... lots of space in dinning area as well... neatly arranged and organised....','2026-03-28 15:00:53.931705',253,51,96),('Chandra Kala',5,'We booked for my daughter’s wedding and everything was just perfect. The staff were extremely helpful and friendly, the arrangements were done with attention to detail, and our family felt very comfortable and taken care of throughout. The ambiance and service added a special touch to our memorable day. Highly recommended for weddings and large family events.','2026-03-28 15:00:57.178232',254,52,98),('Lydia Sweety',5,'Absolutely loved having my wedding and reception at this place! ❤️','2026-03-28 15:00:57.182263',255,52,98),('karthick Raz',5,'We hosted a Reception event on feb 8th.\nManager and his team gave complete support from the day of booking to the end of an event.\nMD of a mahal also gave a nice gesture of coming to stage and handing over gift to us.\n\nPros:\n1. Spacious Enough to handle running crowd of 800+.\n2. Around 10 cars can be parked in Mahal and Valet Parking is available to accomodate rest of the cars.\n3. Customer service is excellent.\n4. Affordable Mahal.\n5. Mahal interiors are so good. Gave luxury feel.\n6. Bride and groom rooms are excellent.\n\nCons:\n1. Location of Mahal can raise questions about parking, but manager and his team managed very well.\n2. Position of stage is bit towards side.\n3. Stage lighting needs to be increased.\n\nOverall the experience and service was so good.','2026-03-28 15:00:57.186065',256,52,98),('John Silas J',4,'Good place for conducting marriages, birthday functions and other gatherings. Seating capacity will be around 500 pax. Good ambience. Parking space not sufficient.','2026-03-28 15:00:57.189964',257,52,98),('Farsin PK',5,'I recently attended an event at Annai mahal and was thoroughly impressed. The venue is modern and well-equipped, with versatile spaces that cater to any event size. The staff were professional and attentive, ensuring everything ran smoothly. The food was excellent, and the location is convenient with great nearby amenities. Overall, a fantastic experience—highly recommended!','2026-03-28 15:00:57.194041',258,52,98),('Sampath Kumar',5,'We truly appreciate the excellent maintenance of the marriage hall. The atmosphere was very clean, well-organized, and pleasant throughout the function. The spacious layout made the event comfortable and enjoyable for everyone. A perfect place for hosting memorable occasions. And my Special thanks to Mr. Prakash for being along with us for the entire function and making it a very good and happy one.','2026-03-28 15:00:59.350090',259,53,100),('shanmughapriya sridhar',5,'We recently celebrated our wedding at Shree Venkatesh Mahal, and we had an excellent experience from start to finish. The hall is spacious, clean, and very well maintained. The mandapam setup was beautifully arranged, and the overall ambience added a traditional and elegant touch to our function.\n\nThe management team was very supportive and responsive throughout the planning and on the event day. They helped us with all requirements and ensured everything ran smoothly. The dining area was also neat and organized, allowing all our guests to enjoy their meals comfortably.\n\nA lot of our guests appreciated the venue and the facilities provided. Parking was convenient, and the location was easy for everyone to find.\n\nOverall, Shree Venkatesh Mahal is a wonderful venue for weddings and family functions. Highly recommended for anyone looking for a reliable and well-managed mandapam!','2026-03-28 15:00:59.353665',260,53,100),('Prasad Padmanabhan',4,'This marriage hall entrance is in between two other marriage halls. 2 way pathway from the main road. Marriage hall is big enough and even the dining hall. Good maintenance.\n\nThings to be improved - car parking space is little congested.( max 20 cars) , some external valet parking can be arranged.  A/C facility to be added to both marriage hall and dining.','2026-03-28 15:00:59.357098',261,53,100),('vishveshwar duraiswamy',5,'Sree Venkateshwara Mahal is a wonderful and auspicious venue. The place is very neat, clean, and filled with full of positive vibes. Our function went smoothly and beautifully, and we are truly glad about how everything turned out. All the staff members were extremely supportive and helpful throughout, making the event even more special.\n\n5 STAR ⭐','2026-03-28 15:00:59.360885',262,53,100),('Hamsa Hari',5,'Very spacious and well maintained by the staffs. Highly recommended for a family wedding 👌👍Number of guest rooms is more than sufficient 🙏🙏','2026-03-28 15:00:59.364244',263,53,100),('A R',4,'Good huge open lawn party place,good garden views ,parking is sufficient for arround 60 cars.entrance from the main road is little narrow.atleast half of the lawn includind stage to be covered with high roofed white coloured  shed,so that any sudden climate change will not disturb the function.','2026-03-28 15:01:03.881613',264,54,102),('Sv photography',5,'One of the best place for outdoor events and wedding venue. Its highly recommended for all events it\'s one of my favorite venue I am photographer @ dhanush_sv_💕💕','2026-03-28 15:01:03.885131',265,54,102),('Bagavath Singh Arul Malar Kannan',5,'Calm and spacious , though closer to the crowded highway...  Has a perfect stage with plants and fountain adding to the ambiance.  A dedicated parking and other amenities, making it suitable for a large community gathering. Easy approach by public transport too...','2026-03-28 15:01:03.888850',266,54,102),('Luciana Nathan',5,'With its pristine upkeep, exceptional cleanliness and spacious parking. Sree neela garden sets the standard for modern marriage in pallikaranai area','2026-03-28 15:01:03.893935',267,54,102),('PIsai Inban',5,'Sree Neela garden is a beautiful open space lawn and well maintained and spacious car parking and lightings look royal and it suitable for all type events,especially weddings','2026-03-28 15:01:03.897956',268,54,102),('Lavanya Viswanathan',3,'One goood place with very big parking area.\nThe outer roads are sooo bad and was very difficult to reach the place due to traffic and extremely smaller roads.\nInside the mahal everything is all quite good  and beautiful. Dressing up room is quite small.','2026-03-28 15:01:06.693177',269,55,104),('Dawood A',4,'Party halls are very well ventilated and lit. Space is adequate for a small gathering, birthday parties, engagements, wedding anniversaries. Price is decent as well, well equipped car parking as well. One downside is only one lift available for basement, ground floor , 1st floor and top floor','2026-03-28 15:01:06.697049',270,55,104),('HARIHARAN PK',5,'Very well maintained.  Function and Dining hall in same floor . Well furnished AC hall.  Lift facility Very helpful for seniors','2026-03-28 15:01:06.700073',271,55,104),('Arun Prasad',5,'Good spacious for 300 pax and a separate dining are there for an affordable budget functions','2026-03-28 15:01:06.702854',272,55,104),('Sridhar Karunakaran',5,'Good place to do function, and marriage, having good parking space for bike and car capacity around 500 people seating.','2026-03-28 15:01:06.705502',273,55,104),('Travel Guru Mani',4,'1. Location as per Google Map 💯\n2. Parking available (30 cars)\n3. Grand entrance\n4. 500 seating capacity at marriage hall\n5. 400 seating capacity at dining hall\n6. Rest rooms were neat and clean, well maintained\n7. Air condition is good','2026-03-28 15:01:10.059872',274,56,106),('Aruvi Gangatharan',5,'Had my friends wedding there. The place is clean and accommodating. Main attraction is the parking space and the dining. 200+ people can eat in one seating. Perfectly suitable for people with a crowd size of upto 1000. The decoration team is also very prompt and the management is friendly. Would highly recommend it for the price and amenities.','2026-03-28 15:01:10.062083',275,56,106),('Thanush',5,'Near the bus stop and railway station just 5 mins walk...\nEasy to identify..\nSuitable for large functions..\nGood maintenence\nParking OK...\nDining hall non ACSituated in the peak area and easy to reach.\nGood locality and well maintained atmosphere.\nLarge space with balcony, large number of seating available. Large and spacious dinning area and kitchen space is good.','2026-03-28 15:01:10.064116',276,56,106),('Karthik Manivel',5,'Spacious and big stage with fully air conditioned. Nicely decorated. Spacious dining. Easily accessible from Pattabiram railway station. Adequate parking facility. The restroom was okay.','2026-03-28 15:01:10.066382',277,56,106),('shanmuga sundaram',4,'Situated in the peak area and easy to reach.\nGood locality and well maintained atmosphere.\nLarge space with balcony, large number of seating available. Large and spacious dinning area and kitchen space is good.','2026-03-28 15:01:10.068693',278,56,106),('Sumesh',3,'Visited this Government Marriage Hall located right opposite to Thiru Vi Ka Nagar Bus Stand, and I must say, the location is spot-on! 🚏 Easy to reach by any mode of transport, and the parking space 🅿️ is quite large — a big plus for city events. Bookings are done online 💻, and the rental cost is very reasonable considering it’s a government-managed facility.\n\nThe hall is spacious, perfect for medium to large gatherings, with the main hall on the 2nd floor and the dining area on the 1st floor. There’s a single lift, which helps but could be more efficient during crowded functions.\n\nHowever, the maintenance needs improvement 🧹 — the hall had visible stains, the lift button had to be pressed hard to respond, and during one of the functions, there was a power cut ⚡ for a few minutes. Not sure if there’s a generator backup, as it didn’t seem to kick in immediately.\n\nOverall, it’s a budget-friendly and well-located hall, but with better upkeep and maintenance, it could easily become one of the top choices in the area for family events and weddings 💒✨','2026-03-28 15:01:12.620487',279,57,108),('Hidayathullah Mohamed Ali',4,'The marriage / function hall is in the 2nd floor, guest rooms are in the 3rd floor, dining hall is in the 1st floor and parking & restrooms are in the ground floor. It can handle a medium sized crowd, i.e., atmost not more than 250 persons.\nPros:\n1. Comparatively tidy especially comparing with Government run function halls.\n2. Parking facility is reasonably good.\n3. It\'s literally opposite to Thiru Vi Ka Nagar bus station.\n5. It can be reached within 5 to 10 minutes from Perambur Railway Station.\nCons:\n1. The traffic around that place is heavy, especially when coming from South Chennai neighbourhoods.\n2. If one expects the place to be 100% clean and tidy, then it\'s going to be disappointing, but comparatively to other Government run function halls, it is reasonably okayish.','2026-03-28 15:01:12.623961',280,57,108),('Devi prasad',4,'It Should be a bit projected.. due to it\'s confused location for people coming from outside...otherwise it\'s good for crowded functions like marriages etc...','2026-03-28 15:01:12.627940',281,57,108),('Mohamed Bilal',4,'Cheap and best corporation hall. It looks like the  hall is very fantastic, but maintenance is zero. The party person\'s behaviour is very bad . They ( party people)are only  money minded people','2026-03-28 15:01:12.631295',282,57,108),('Rajagopalan Nagarajan',5,'Good and spacious Hall located at prime location. Ground floor is for parking and can park 10-15 cars max on top of bike space. First floor is dining and the second floor is for the reception. Have lift facility too.','2026-03-28 15:01:12.634903',283,57,108),('Kathiravan K',5,'Our Baby Shower function held in this hall. Main & dining hall, parking area are enough spacious. Owners were very supportive, staffs too. We didn’t do much decoration, just planned simple decorations ourselves , as it’s a budgeted function. Owners asked decoration people to place white backdrop(from decoration done for previous function held in the hall) & we actually surprised to see that. After that we did decoration ourselves.','2026-03-28 15:01:18.067812',284,58,110),('bharath balaji',5,'We celebrated our engagement on January 25th, 2026, and it was a flawless experience from start to finish. The team truly went above and beyond to make our milestone feel grand and special. We were particularly impressed by the elegant decor and the well-organized seating, all provided at a very competitive price. Plus, their seamless power backup ensured the celebration continued without a hitch. Thank you for making our big day so memorable!','2026-03-28 15:01:18.071885',285,58,110),('Naresh K',5,'We hosted the first birthday for our son and had a very good experience with the staff. The parking had valet option and overall had an absolutely pleasant experience. Badri was a great host who helped us whenever we needed assistance providing good flexibility. Strongly recommended for someone conducting ceremonies without around 200 guests','2026-03-28 15:01:18.074923',286,58,110),('BRINDHA S',4,'Hall is beautiful, accommodating nearly 120 floating population. Owner Anna and his son Mr. Badri are very much adjustable and helping in nature. Regarding decoration their tie-up decorator is very rough in his interaction and the back drops are not neat and clean. Other wise the cleaning women, watchman are very kind. I just this hall for a day function. Best of luck to them.','2026-03-28 15:01:18.077998',287,58,110),('Viswanath Subramani S S',5,'Great Experience at Sri Krishna Mini Party Hall!\n\nWe had a wonderful experience hosting our function at Sri Krishna Mini Party Hall. The ambience is very pleasant and well-maintained.\n\nA special mention to Bhadrikrishnan ji, who ensured every request was taken care of down to the last detail — even our last-minute needs were promptly arranged without any hesitation. Komathi Ma’am and the service team were also very responsive, addressing all our queries quickly and managing the arrangements efficiently.\n\nEven small feedback like the heater and AC remote issues were immediately attended to. I truly appreciate the responsiveness and professionalism of the entire team.\n\nLooking forward to organizing our next function here again!','2026-03-28 15:01:18.081073',288,58,110),('Aysha Mohammad',4,'A charming jungle-themed mini party hall with a warm, lively vibe. Beautiful décor, cozy space, and perfect for intimate celebrations. Truly a refreshing and unique experience','2026-03-28 15:01:22.937957',289,59,112),('logeshkumar chandramohan',3,'We loved the hall and the theme and had fun when we hosted our son\'s birthday party there in Nov 2025.  Hat\'s off for such a unique Venue. The animal statue and the play area were a huge hit among the kids.\nWe faced a couple of drawbacks:\n1. Parking: Even though we arranged valets, it was very difficult as the only option the hall provided was to park in narrow roads that too futher away.\n2. Capacity: The hall gets crowed with 100 guests, especially if the dining area is the same. After thought, would have been ideal if we had rented the space above as well. Minor set back some AC weren\'t turned on untill we noticed and asked them as it was hot even during the monsoon season.','2026-03-28 15:01:22.941051',290,59,112),('Karthikeyan Sabapathi',5,'Amazon jungle theme banquet hall is excellent place in Perungudi parking also there nice place to children like this place\nNeet and clean atmosphere birthday party, bay shower and also function celebrating at Perungudi Shivjay Mini hall Thanks,l.','2026-03-28 15:01:22.944185',291,59,112),('Ashwanth Sivasankaran',5,'Excellent halls to celebrate your supercalifragilisticexpialidocious moments ❤️✨','2026-03-28 15:01:22.947416',292,59,112),('ANANYA',1,'This is a good hall for 50 to 100 people, but the sound system is not working properly, and there are not enough parking spaces for your guests. The area is cramped, and it’s important to consider parking since it can accommodate more than five vehicles. Please take this into account.','2026-03-28 15:01:22.950486',293,59,112),('senthil kumar k',3,'Went there for kid abacus competition. Very old and outdated mandapam. Limited car parking available.\n\nRestrooms are average and old which doesn’t feel convenient.','2026-03-28 15:01:25.602354',294,60,114),('Sureshkumar Kasandi',4,'Marriage hall is space and clean, dinning area is also very spacious. I didn\'t like there rooms... which are not very clean, spl the floor inside rooms not clean.','2026-03-28 15:01:25.606075',295,60,114),('Rajesh A',5,'Nice hall... A/C atmosphere wonderful. You never experienced like this kind of A/C before.\n\nRooms also available with A/C 5+ people can stay in a single room.\n\nOverall everything nice.','2026-03-28 15:01:25.609851',296,60,114),('Divya Priya',5,'I liked this mahal. My marriage reception was also held here in 2018. It\'s nice','2026-03-28 15:01:25.613047',297,60,114),('Mahindra s.v.',4,'Very spacious with good lighting.Good for large families function..Car parking can accommodate 50+.','2026-03-28 15:01:25.616419',298,60,114),('Murali Krishnan Solayappan',4,'Nice marriage hall for small to medium group. But cant handle more than 1000 people. Limited car parking. Early comers gets. Otherwise you can go to a lane (kamatchi amman temple) little further  from the hall, in the main road itself and park there.  The main road\nis highly prone to more traffic jam, so plan more buffer time for your U turn, parking, etc., so not to miss the event :)','2026-03-28 15:01:29.762410',299,61,116),('Indiraajith G.S',4,'Parking mut be good. But they are tackling with valet parking option that\'s ok for that cozy place. But need improvement in parking. Dining hall also not so big. Just can have only 50 to 60 ppl can engage in the dining place. Only party hall is very vast place. Nothing spl in this mahal','2026-03-28 15:01:29.766137',300,61,116),('Mary Subha',5,'Beautiful wedding hall with a spacious setup and pleasant ambience. The arrangements were neat, well-organised, and perfect for a grand wedding. Comfortable guest rooms with uninterrupted air-conditioning. Bathroom heater facilities were available, and the rooms were clean, neat, and well maintained. Very convenient for wedding guests.A wonderful place for memorable occasions.','2026-03-28 15:01:29.770396',301,61,116),('PK Prabhakar',3,'Spacious hall and huge stage. Dining hall s also very good on the first floor. Many rooms for guests is a plus. Gents toilet was horrible, outside the hall and bad cisterns.. parking is another issue. Though off main road the approch is very congested and easily missable..','2026-03-28 15:01:29.773179',302,61,116),('Jagadeesh Vikram C',5,'Nice Hall of 2 Floors with wide ground parking facility and well located in the city vantage point. Mahal having well furnished interiors and embossed exteriors.Hall having large spacious rooms and well organised dining place. Good for Organising Marriage Functions and Ceremonies.','2026-03-28 15:01:29.775272',303,61,116),('Jayarajaganesh Arumugam',3,'The entrance is small. Only around 20 cars can be parked after which security will simply ask you to park outside only. Both hall and dining are in the same ground floor','2026-03-28 15:01:33.260309',304,62,118),('Manickam Nedunchezian',4,'Air-condition at the marriage hall is very effective and good. Dining hall is adjacent to the marriage hall and therefore, very convenient to go to both the places.\nThe chairs are vey strong and good and such furnitures are not found in other marriage halls.\nToilets need lots of improvement. As there is more empty space is available, suggest to build some more bath rooms and toilets.\nCar parking space is available.','2026-03-28 15:01:33.263018',305,62,118),('Isaac John Ravi',4,'Good Airconditioned marriage hall in Pozhichalur, with ample car parking and balcony. An old one but maintained Good. Only concern is the toilets, which are not maintained and old dirty ones.','2026-03-28 15:01:33.265603',306,62,118),('Sri Bhavani',4,'Spacious with car parking and AC.Well maintained decent and located in main road','2026-03-28 15:01:33.268293',307,62,118),('Dhananjay',4,'Spacious hall with ample parking space. The dining is located in the ground floor itself and this place also has a balcony which can be used for seating arrangements.\n\nThe parking is really big and can easily accomodate around 30-40 cars. The infrastructure is a bit old but hardly noticeable.','2026-03-28 15:01:33.271164',308,62,118),('Salman Shariff',5,'Wonderful Place for Birthday Party Functions. I had visited many places to conduct my niece birthday party function but was not fully satisfied. Only after visiting IQBAL MINI A/c Hall I was totally fully satisfied. And I would like recommend others also for making great memories with our family for ospicious occasions at Iqbal mini A/c hall ........','2026-03-28 15:01:35.838869',309,63,120),('Mohammad Zayaan Zayn Malik',5,'Best place for birthday functions and can easily accommodate upto 250peoples 🙌🫶🏻👏 Very well organised and good Incharge….','2026-03-28 15:01:35.842831',310,63,120),('Mohamed Shamsudeen',5,'Yeah , I have recently visited the mini hall , yeah there is nothing to say I\'m okay with that space , my opinion is , if you are taking to functions like engagements or bday parties, this is good (this is my personal opinion)','2026-03-28 15:01:35.846622',311,63,120),('Saida Sherieff',4,'Good place for Seemandam Functions. Good Organizated. Keep it up 👍','2026-03-28 15:01:35.850402',312,63,120),('abrar ahmed',5,'Fastantics place for birthday celebration and superb customer service from management team..','2026-03-28 15:01:35.854154',313,63,120),('Nadana Ravishankar Thiraviam',4,'There are two halls and is located on the main road close to DLF and Other amenities. It’s easily accessible and identifiable. One hall is large and the other one is little smaller than the other. There are plenty of parking lots available. The halls are maintained well and space is good enough to accommodate 200 to 300 people. The halls are neatly decorated and arranged for functions like marriage and parties. Overall it’s a good place for events with all the amenities and bank on the poonamalle road.','2026-03-28 15:01:38.367787',314,64,121),('Crasu Crason',5,'The Jeevan Jyothi Mahal, located right on the main road, is an excellent venue for events of all kinds. The compound is spacious and well-maintained, featuring a beautiful church and three halls that cater to different budgets, making it suitable for both small gatherings and larger functions.\n\nOne of the standout features is the parking area – it’s massive and completely free, which is a huge relief in the city. Accessibility is another big plus; the venue is well-connected and easy to reach from all parts of the city. Overall, whether you’re planning a wedding, a party, or any event, The Jeevan Jyothi Mahal is a convenient, affordable, and well-equipped choice.','2026-03-28 15:01:38.375294',315,64,121),('Rtn Arul Prakasam T',4,'Jeevan Jothi Mahal in Manapakkam is an exceptional choice for hosting family weddings, especially when considering the comfort of elderly relatives. The venue stands out for its thoughtful accessibility features, including dedicated wheelchair-accessible parking and a smooth entrance ramp, making it incredibly inclusive. Located conveniently near MIOT Hospital and DLF Cyber City, it is easy for guests traveling from different parts of Chennai to find. The hall itself is spacious and well-maintained, providing a warm atmosphere for large gatherings. Having landmarks like Dr. MGR Home nearby adds a sense of community. The staff is polite and ensures everything runs smoothly. For families seeking a stress-free experience where everyone feels accommodated, this venue is a top-tier recommendation. It truly bridges the gap between modern convenience and traditional hospitality.','2026-03-28 15:01:38.381511',316,64,121),('Alex Beascoechea',1,'It is incredible they are allowed to disturb the whole neighbourhood - starting by the guests in the Feathers Hotel across the street- projecting their celebrations into public the public space. Right now with what sounds like some tribale danese music with drums.... Here everything is sacrificed for the economic benefit of some individual (the owner of this joint) and the rest have to suffer.','2026-03-28 15:01:38.383936',317,64,121),('செல்வம் சுப்பிரமணியம்',4,'It\'s a very big wedding hall.\nAround 500 peoples can sit in a main hall.\nAround 400 peoples can sit for dining.\nInterior decoration is very nice and AC is there\nMore than 100 cars can be parked. Inside.\nThe hall is situated in main road itself, so it can be easily accessible.\nThis wedding hall is for rich peoples.','2026-03-28 15:01:38.385427',318,64,121),('Anubis_ YT',5,'My matrimonial celebration at this estimable hall was nothing short of resplendent—a veritable confluence of gastronomic opulence and aesthetic grandeur. The catering was, in a word, sublime. Each dish presented itself as an edible sonnet, with a cornucopia of choices so abundant and meticulously curated that it bordered on the encyclopedic. From ambrosial appetizers to the epiphanic desserts, every morsel was a testament to culinary erudition and epicurean artistry.\n\nThe decoration was an exquisite tableau of color and craftsmanship, evoking the grandeur of a baroque opera while retaining an ineffable sense of intimacy. The floral arrangements were positively seraphic; the interplay of light and fabric created an atmosphere so incandescently enchanting that it seemed to suspend time itself.\n\nIn sum, this marriage hall exemplifies the very apotheosis of refinement—a sanctuary where elegance converses fluently with comfort and where every detail, however minute, bespeaks a devotion to perfection. It is not merely a venue, but a memory immortalized in chandeliers, fragrance, and flavor.','2026-03-28 15:01:40.703910',319,65,123),('Mohan Kumar',5,'Is a nice Mahul for conducting various functions like marriage get together party and excetra it\'s has a carpeting facilities and bike parking facilities and the hall is located in the first floor and dining hall is located in the the second floor has a lift facilities too and capacity 500 to 600 people dining hall capacity 100 to 200 overall decent marriage hall.','2026-03-28 15:01:40.705705',320,65,123),('Balaji Ravikumar',5,'One of the biggest halls in the locality. They have so many rooms all well furnished and maintained. Good parking facility, located at the GNT road. Kitchen is very spacious and comfortable. Big AC dining. The AC cooling is really awesome throughout the reception hall. Has a big hall capacity and friendly staff. Highly recommend this place!','2026-03-28 15:01:40.707566',321,65,123),('Rachel',1,'Very worst Mahal I\'ve ever seen in my life before. No proper maintaining, restrooms are so ugly and surrounding places are so much wastages and junk.','2026-03-28 15:01:40.709068',322,65,123),('kuppuswamy srinivasan',5,'This is located at Redhill service road of chemnai to nelloor highway. It has spacious marriage hall with plenty of rooms and spacious covered car park.','2026-03-28 15:01:40.711984',323,65,123),('Madhana Gopal',4,'really liked this wedding hall! It\'s so neatly kept and well-maintained. The air conditioning was great too, making everything comfortable.','2026-03-28 15:01:43.663844',324,66,125),('devaraj dhanakotti',4,'Underground parking for 2 wheelers, Wallet parking for Cars, Basement kitchen, 1st floor function hall with AC, 2nd floor dining with AC, 3rd floor rooms with AC. 1st hall is sufficient for 200~250 people sitting comfortably with sufficient space for entry and exit of seat rows provided. AC was effective even with a lot of people. Large Stage and false ceilings are designed for default decoration and lightings. The steps are wider and spacious to walk as 3 together side by side. 2nd floor dining area can occupy 100~150 people at a time. Hand washing and rest rooms are inbuilt in 2nd floor only. 1 lift is available which can accommodate 5 people at a time.','2026-03-28 15:01:43.667910',325,66,125),('Santosh Kumar',5,'Very good mandapa. Hospitality was very good. Clean & neat. 12 Rooms are very comfortable to stay. Air conditioning was very good. We can suggest en sesha mahal, Royapettah for friends and Relatives.','2026-03-28 15:01:43.671618',326,66,125),('Suresh Abar',1,'Electricity units reading is completely terrible\nSo pls see all electric meters n check\nOtherwise they will make it 3times more electricity charges','2026-03-28 15:01:43.675250',327,66,125),('Venkatasubramaniam R',4,'Compact for 200 guests, right on Peter\'s Riad, Royaoettah near New College. Limited parking in the building, which is on the busy road facing flyover. So vallet parking available. Feast is on the second floor. Ac facility available. Ideal for small events like Reception, Birth Day, etc.','2026-03-28 15:01:43.679176',328,66,125),('Mohammed ashif',4,'This venue in Royapuram is a fantastic find for anyone planning a wedding or a large celebration. It strikes that perfect balance of being in a prime, accessible location while offering enough room so guests never feel cramped. The layout is thoughtfully designed with dedicated spaces for dining as well as separate areas for men and women, ensuring everyone feels comfortable and at ease. Plus, the ample car parking—a rare luxury in such a busy part of the city—takes a huge weight off the hosts\' shoulders. It truly feels like a space that values both convenience and hospitality, making it a worthwhile choice for your special day.','2026-03-28 15:01:46.601496',329,67,127),('Syed Ali A N J (Jumaana Syed Ali)',5,'A beautiful and spacious mahal, ideal for hosting large weddings. It features a large hall on the ground floor, along with a dedicated ladies’ hall on the first floor. For dining, ladies can dine on the first floor, while men have a separate dining area on the second floor. Basement parking is available; however, since the mahal is located on the main road, parking may be challenging if the basement becomes full.','2026-03-28 15:01:46.604899',330,67,127),('Rajesh Rajendran',5,'Best place. . Recommended for big functions . . Neat and clean surroundings. .','2026-03-28 15:01:46.607967',331,67,127),('Mujubur Rahman',4,'I have attended my relative nikkah function on Ramjan Mahal. Ample space for the entrance. Large reception hall.  In the middle they have a lot of pillars, that are minus. The food court was also big on the second floor.\nThey used a mic in the function that was not good. Every time they have the same fault. It\'s not working properly. Parking space ok.','2026-03-28 15:01:46.611333',332,67,127),('Muhammad Asif',5,'One of the top notch marriage function halls in Chennai. Recommended for sure❤️❤️','2026-03-28 15:01:46.615378',333,67,127),('Chembu Mohan Karthik',4,'It is small hall in an narrow road, but good thing is that it got parking underground. It has good view from road and you just have to search for the Raj theater which just next to it. Nice place for small function and marriage who has less number of family member in the list. Thank you','2026-03-28 15:01:51.456029',334,68,129),('Jack G',3,'No proper parking facilities. Very difficult to park the bikes and take out. Location is main road so problem in finding the marriage hall. Inside hall wall looks old, I think they didn’t painted very long time. Dinning area somewhat ok.','2026-03-28 15:01:51.457669',335,68,129),('Rini Prabha',4,'This Mahal is well suitable for function with a fine dining area.\n\nI personally felt it is too small for larger events.','2026-03-28 15:01:51.459241',336,68,129),('Sharath Kumar Venugopal',4,'Really good hall. The top Marriage hall is AC and bottom is for dining. No lift service available. Decent can hold 400 seating and 600 floating.','2026-03-28 15:01:51.460710',337,68,129),('Naresh Kani',5,'Last Sunday My Brother Marriage Function wAs held in this mahal Very nice place..\nLocated near by Saidapet busstand, station and metro. We also stay one night here..','2026-03-28 15:01:51.462155',338,68,129),('Raju Sreenivasan',5,'Great ambience. Beautiful hall. Spacious dining area. Wallet parking was available. It is very close to the main road as well. It can easily accommodate 500 to 750 people','2026-03-28 15:01:55.694034',339,69,131),('sowmya smartha',5,'Amazing experience with Shree Devi Mahal. The owner Vignesh , a gentleman, very understanding , polite and professional.  So much support with anything you ask. You ask something and it’ll be there in front of you in less than 5 minutes. Their supervisor/ support manager Dhana , man never seen a person so fresh and smiling all the time . Never once you see anyone at the venue frown or irritated. Commendable cleanliness. Their kitchen was very very clean and the rooms and the restrooms were also very clean. Any spill at the venue will be cleaned within 5 mins. Such smooth experience. If you book them you will have one less thing to worry about in your wedding.','2026-03-28 15:01:55.697161',340,69,131),('Ravikrishnan Natarajan',4,'A great marriage hall built to host 500 attendees in comfort (fully air conditioned), with a matching dining hall and spacious rooms for the families of bride and groom, though lack of openable windows is a big disappointment. Also, the stench from the drainage especially in the dining space is a real spoiler. Unlayer the grand facade and you have a basic hall that lacks hygiene.','2026-03-28 15:01:55.700491',341,69,131),('Iyengar Ramakrishnan',5,'Rooms were clean and staff was extremely helpful.\n\nTwo lifts which provide ease of access.\n\nGreat place to hold many events.','2026-03-28 15:01:55.703054',342,69,131),('Tamilselvan Rajavel',5,'Well spacious hall. Situated in main road near camproad signal. Parking available for two wheeler and four wheeler. Clean and well maintained place. A/C hall. Stay rooms are available. The street will be more congested in working days. Costly hall.','2026-03-28 15:01:55.705591',343,69,131),('Manoj M',3,'Overall it has 1 floor, Dining will happen in the ground floor and the main party hall in the first floor. It can accommodate upto 75 people with air conditioned facility and this hall is suitable for small functions with seating capacity of upto 75 people. No car parking facility is available that\'s the drawback. Overall it\'s a mediocre party hall. I don\'t know the pricing and other stuffs but if I came to know such things I will update here.','2026-03-28 15:01:58.664988',344,70,133),('Thiagarajan TD',4,'Very compact hall with approx seating capacity for 250-300 pax. Parking in the adjacent area. Hall bang on East Tambaram - Velachery road. People coming from Velachery take the main road via Pallikaranai. Those from Tambaram, straight on to Tambaram Velachery Road.','2026-03-28 15:01:58.668191',345,70,133),('Stidson Santhosh kumar',5,'I had a wonderful experience at *Bhavani Hall* during our recent function. The hall was well-maintained and perfectly suited for the occasion. Special thanks to the *Manager* for the excellent cooperation and understanding of our needs. He not only ensured smooth arrangements but also referred a great *decoration and makeup team*, which made the event even more special. Truly appreciate the support and professionalism. Highly recommended!','2026-03-28 15:01:58.671128',346,70,133),('savitha manoharan',5,'They got good parking space and hall may look small from outside but it got spacious inside. Good place for bday parties and small events','2026-03-28 15:01:58.674203',347,70,133),('Rubadevan Vas',4,'Correct match for party/functions for 250 to  300 headcount. 100 people can sit comfortably on the ground floor with suiting dining hall.\nPARKING 2/4 wheeler is the an ISSUE. No separate parking area is available. Need park on the main road...','2026-03-28 15:01:58.677425',348,70,133),('Sundar S',5,'I am writing to express my sincere gratitude for the excellent service and facilities provided during our Nephew marriage event. Our experience was seamless, and we received numerous compliments from our guests.\nHere are a few highlights that truly stood out:\n•	Stunning Infrastructure & Ambience: The venue is beautifully designed, blending modern elegance with a welcoming atmosphere. The lighting and overall aesthetic provided the perfect backdrop for our celebrations.\n•	Impressive Capacity: The hall is spacious and well-ventilated, comfortably accommodating all our guests without feeling crowded. The layout allowed for smooth movement throughout the event.\n•	Top-notch Kitchen Facilities: The kitchen and dining area were impeccably clean and well-organized. It was clear that hygiene and efficiency are top priorities for your team.\n•	Exceptional Support: Every staff member we interacted with was professional and attentive, ensuring that even the smallest details were handled with care.\nSpecial Mention: Mr. Vinayagamurthy\nA very special thanks goes to the manager, Mr. Vinayagamurthy. His leadership and support were instrumental in the success of our nephew marriage event. From the initial planning stages to the final execution, his proactive approach, calm demeanor, and \"can-do\" attitude took a huge weight off our shoulders. He is a true asset to Umadhiri Mahal.\nThank you once again for making our special day so memorable. We will certainly be recommending your venue to our friends and family.\nWarm regards,\nSundaravadivelan Subramani','2026-03-28 15:02:03.149442',349,71,135),('Sarathvijay M',5,'We had a fantastic experience at Shri Umadri Mahal for our family wedding. A special thanks to the owner, the manager (Mr. Vinayaga Moorthy) and his dedicated team for their support & incredible hospitality. From the very beginning, he was exceptionally supportive, personally connecting us with top-tier catering and decor vendors to ensure everything was perfect.\nThe facility itself is spacious, features ample car parking and is very well-maintained. We truly appreciated a management team that handles the details so well, allowing us to relax and enjoy the wedding.','2026-03-28 15:02:03.155115',350,71,135),('Deva kumar',5,'Went for a book fair\n\nParking area is decent can hold up 25-30 cars and two wheelers\nHall was moderate size and will be very opt for weddings and gatherings\n\nSeparate reception area is available\nLocation is right on OMR service road and it\'s quite convenient\n\nLawn and landscaping was maintained lush green\n\nNice place overall','2026-03-28 15:02:03.159239',351,71,135),('Pavithra Suresh',4,'Huge spacious hall with 2 in built LD screens. Separate dining hall. Ample car parking space. Rooms are neatly maintained. The important point is that water can and bubble top dispensers are kept in the rooms for the needs of the bride and groom family.\n\nThe cleaning team maintains the hall from time to time. The A/c is effective.','2026-03-28 15:02:03.163373',352,71,135),('Saravana Babu Srinivasan',5,'Excellent Experience.  We had our daughter\'s marriage in Shri Umadri Mahal last week.  Mr.Vinayaga Moorthy, Manager for this Mahal made sure that we had all required things in a smooth manner.  He is so polite and was accommodating all our requests for various things even in the last minute, co-operated with us in a cool manner and coordinated things so well that we did not have much hassles.  We were able to concentrate on other priority things because of his involvement. Our wedding went well because of his help and involvement from the time of booking the hall till we checked out of the marriage hall.  Special and Sincere Thanks to him and his team.  Mahal is well maintained, spacious, clean and neat looking.  Major advantage in this Mahal is: Both Dining and Hall are in the same floor,  Dining is just opposite to the main hall.  We strongly recommend this Mahal to families looking for Marriage Halls and for any big family functions, talk to Mr.Vinayagamoorthy, you will find him so cordial and he takes care of all functions as if it is his own family function.','2026-03-28 15:02:03.167414',353,71,135),('Leenus Martin',4,'Attended a baby shower function at the mini hall located at the first floor. Steps are narrow. Dining tables were arranged inside the hall. Hall is enough for around 150 people maximum. A small dressing room is available inside the hall. Car parking is spacious. Can hold around 25 to 30 cars.','2026-03-28 15:02:06.508675',354,72,137),('Sree Sivakumar',4,'It\'s a superb and neat place for celebrations for around 150 people but dinning space is too small and there is no bride and groom room and cot ..it has only 1 small room with sofa alone','2026-03-28 15:02:06.512094',355,72,137),('Kavitha Manohar',5,'Best place to have marriage at an affordable price with rooms and service apartments. We really appreciate them for arranging proper parking for all the guests, who were all happy. All the rooms were clean and A/C was working well. The owner was very kind enough to call back even after the marriage for any concerns. Very supportive Manager, Mr.Raja singh and the Owner & staff. Happy that we conducted our son\'s marriage at SGR Mahal. We highly recommend this hall for Marriages and other functions','2026-03-28 15:02:06.515797',356,72,137),('Suganthy Ananth',4,'On the main road. Big marriage hall. Fully airconditioned. Dining hall in the 1st floor. Car parking is available for limited cars. Rest is street parking only.','2026-03-28 15:02:06.519318',357,72,137),('Rajan Kalambur',4,'Good function hall got two versions. Mini mahal for smaller function and bigger mahal for wedding reception kind of bigger functions. Air conditioned wedding hall with spacious parking on the main road.','2026-03-28 15:02:06.522843',358,72,137),('Aravindhan',5,'My sister’s wedding was held at Perundevi Mandabam on Feb 19th(Reception) and 20th(Marraige) 2026, and it turned out to be a wonderful experience for our entire family. The hall is spacious, well-maintained, perfect for a grand celebration and affordable. The management and staff were very supportive and ensured everything went smoothly. As a brother, I’m truly grateful that the venue helped make her special day so memorable.','2026-03-28 15:02:11.247784',359,73,139),('subhikshamenggservices enginnering',5,'My daughter\'s wedding was held at Perundevi Mandabam on Feb 19th(Reception) and 20th(Marraige) 2026, and it turned out to be a wonderful experience for our entire family. The hall is spacious, well-maintained, perfect for a grand celebration and affordable. The management and staff were very supportive and ensured everything went smoothly.','2026-03-28 15:02:11.253109',360,73,139),('Murali R',4,'Very well maintained with superb car parking... The inside of the Mandapam looks good and air conditioners are maintained well ...\n\nImprove area - wheel chairs assistance for older people will help more also the management provide good support to everyone...\n\nKeep up the good work to the admin and team','2026-03-28 15:02:11.257124',361,73,139),('padma sowjanya',5,'5 Star review !! Exceptional Venue for Our Tamil Celebration!\n\nWe recently rented this beautiful place to host and celebrate our family event, and it was nothing short of exceptional. The facilities were outstanding — spacious, clean, and perfectly equipped for a family event of any size. Every detail, from the setup to the amenities, was thoughtfully designed to make hosting effortless and enjoyable. The guests left with a good note and a positive experience.\n\nWhat truly made the experience special were the wonderful owners. They were incredibly friendly, attentive, and went above and beyond to ensure everything ran smoothly. Their care and attention to detail played a huge part in the success of our event.\n\nWe couldn’t have asked for a better venue or better hosts. Highly recommended for anyone looking for a warm, well-maintained, and welcoming space for family gatherings or cultural celebrations!','2026-03-28 15:02:11.261014',362,73,139),('Sathish Sundharamurthy',5,'We had our known friend wedding here. The location was awesome. The lightings were beautiful. Mesmerizing location. Modern Mandapam in vallakottai and Sriperumbudur area. Love dthis place and the hospitality owners offered. Very accomodtive owners. Blue for money venue.','2026-03-28 15:02:11.264298',363,73,139),('Raja Kumaran',4,'Good Looking Function hall provided by St. Thomas church community.. it\'s not like as usual .. it\'s great and looking luxurious Hall setup. Interior and decor work was appreciatable . Fully Air conditioning Hall\n\nDining with capacity 140 members ( Ground Floor )\n\nWelcome has place to provide stalls and counter. Parking spaces available. Easily located by new peoples.\n\nBus stop : Saidapet Court or Little Mount\nWalkable distance from bus stand.','2026-03-28 15:02:13.618764',364,74,141),('Anbu Nesan',5,'The best convention hall which I have recently went for a function.\nVery neat and spacious. Good parking facility. The best part is, it’s just opposite to chinnamalai church. The view is divine and awesome.','2026-03-28 15:02:13.622007',365,74,141),('thomas raj',5,'Wonderful wedding hall in heart of city with  ample car park ,world famous St.thomas church where the Apostle Saint Thomas himself prayed here in cave and did miracles of spring on the hillock which still comes after 2000years.  The auditorium in 1st floor don\'t have lift which makes the elder and sick very difficult. The ground floor has big dining area with verandah to serve ice cream,coffee and fruits. If vacant it\'s given to all who are in need on a moderate rates.','2026-03-28 15:02:13.625200',366,74,141),('Sathiyanarayanan Mohan',4,'Spacious! Reachable by all modes of Local Transport!\n\nOne of the very few Community Hall for Serving Non-Vegetarian Banquet is allowed\n\nAmple Parking Space! Near to Saidapet Bridge opposite to Vasanth & Co Signal. From Here reaching Guindy or Alandur Metro is easy!\n\nAmbiance is so cool and Fresh! AC dining Hall! Clean hand wash section and Washrooms!','2026-03-28 15:02:13.628446',367,74,141),('Mr JW',4,'Good hall with good amenities 😁\n\nNice parking space\n\nNeat and clean\n\nWell maintained\n\nGood place to conduct family functions and get together parties 🎉','2026-03-28 15:02:13.631597',368,74,141),('Venugopal KS',4,'An old Wedding Hall in the Heart of Chennai city. Well maintained with a Hall capacity of more than 500 and spacious, Dining Hall in the Ground floor with Wash Room. Parking space for at least 25 Veh able. Reachable from any spot. Liked it. 😍','2026-03-28 15:02:16.068087',369,75,143),('Mandolin Saiganesh',5,'Very nice ambience..Our Saiswarangal Band have had the pleasure of making the event of clients a memorable one at different occasions at this venue..','2026-03-28 15:02:16.070824',370,75,143),('Srivatsan Krishnamachari',4,'Located in T.Nagar old property could have bern maintained better.\n\nCar parking is limited but these days they have valet service.\n\nDining hall is ok bestsuited for a guest count of 200 to 250.','2026-03-28 15:02:16.073665',371,75,143),('Nirmal Prakash',4,'Went to Anantha Deepavali, each year it’s conducted in this Mandapam. Lot of happy faces and kids around this location, give a good pleasure.','2026-03-28 15:02:16.082764',372,75,143),('kailash baskar',4,'Spacious, with limited space for car parking, spacious dining hall.\nCan accommodate 1000 people at a time easily.\nRooms were pretty small, ambiance and the locality of the building is top notch.\nSuitable for wedding and other functions.\nCan park the cars on the streets with no restrictions as well. Safe and calm surroundings.','2026-03-28 15:02:16.085640',373,75,143),('Ashwin Sundar',5,'Compact a 300-400 seater\nFloating crowd could clearly manage. Very well maintained with good Air Conditioners. Amole house keeping was available','2026-03-28 15:02:19.528533',374,76,145),('Suresh Krishman',3,'Location is on a Very Very Busy highway. Hence both advantageous and disadvantageous.\nParking for cars limited\nHall suitable for around 150 people. Stage space just ok.\nDining hall good for around 200 guests at a time.\nThough Lift facility is available, to reach the lift one has to climb a flight of steps (close to15). So not friendly to old people and people with special needs.. Function hall in first floor and dining in ground floor.','2026-03-28 15:02:19.532042',375,76,145),('Aryanand P',4,'Excellent place for marriage l. Large hall and for dinning also big hall','2026-03-28 15:02:19.536441',376,76,145),('P.NALLAPERUMAL PILLAI',4,'Nice Kalyana mandapam in Tambaram   Main road..AC hall having nice auditorium of medium sized. Capacity is 300 persons and dining is having 120 packs.','2026-03-28 15:02:19.539861',377,76,145),('Santhosh Nair',5,'One of the famous Marriage halls in and around Tambaram.\nThough they lost a lot of area during road expansion, it still looks great\nLocated approx half a km from the famous hindu mission hospital, this hall can be located easily\nParking facilities are OK and convenient.\nThough the marriage hall is wide, the dining area is bit suffocating when the crowd is more.','2026-03-28 15:02:19.542774',378,76,145),('Abdul Kader M',4,'I visited this place on 25-Jan-2026 for a wedding. The marriage hall is very spacious and has excellent seating arrangements with full air-conditioning. There is ample car parking available.\nHowever, one drawback is that there are only three toilets(Gents) for the entire hall, which feels insufficient for such a large venue','2026-03-28 15:02:23.356370',379,77,147),('RAM KUMAR M',5,'Luxury place. Very big area .fully air conditioned .neatly maintained and ample space for car parking','2026-03-28 15:02:23.359970',380,77,147),('Richardson Jeyapaul',5,'Excellent for marriage and other large events. Hall is more grandeur than a 5 star hotel. Large space for food. Even the garden was huge','2026-03-28 15:02:23.363589',381,77,147),('Vijay Deepak',5,'Great place to be. Spacious but far from city,\nCar parking is big.','2026-03-28 15:02:23.366195',382,77,147),('ABHIJITH S NAIR',4,'GPN Palace is a great place for weddings, receptions, and other events.\n\nLocation:\nIt is easy to reach and has enough parking space for guests.\n\nAmbience:\nThe hall is spacious, clean, and beautifully designed. It suits both traditional and modern decorations.\n\nFacilities:\n\nThe hall is fully air-conditioned and comfortable.\n\nSeating can be arranged for both small and large events.\n\nThe stage is well-made, and the lighting is excellent.\n\nServices:\nThey provide in-house catering with tasty vegetarian and non-vegetarian food. The staff is friendly and helpful, making the event smooth and enjoyable.\n\nCost:\nThe venue is reasonably priced for the quality and services they offer.\n\nOverall:\nGPN Palace is a great choice for hosting special events. Everything is well-organized, and the experience is worth the cost.','2026-03-28 15:02:23.369983',383,77,147),('Ajay Vignesh',5,'This is a completely out of Chennai, though you have good roads from Anna Nagar,  tambaram. You need to travel for an hour to reach this place. This would be good for marriage and small reception crowd. Can accommodate around 800+ people. But you don\'t have sufficient bike or car parking.  Has a decent dinning space. Overall it\'s good for small crowded.','2026-03-28 15:02:29.075526',384,78,149),('செல்வம் சுப்பிரமணியம்',5,'Very spacious marriage and dining hall.\nClean and well maintained.\nParking will be a big problem in peak hours.','2026-03-28 15:02:29.078658',385,78,149),('renuka arjunan',4,'Nice place to hold your big event. Only disadvantage is the distance .. otherwise great place for family occasions','2026-03-28 15:02:29.081652',386,78,149),('Nachiappan Sbm',5,'Located on TH high road, Rajakadai area. This marriage hall both the floors are fully air conditioned, good interior design, spacious and well maintained. Bike parking is available at the back side of this place, not sure about car parking though. Lift facility is available here','2026-03-28 15:02:29.085204',387,78,149),('MANIKANDAN GAJENDRAKUMAR',5,'As a caterer i am giving a review about this Mandabam. The Mandabam is very big, main hall we can make seats for 500 Members and Dining Hall we can make 250 members seating. Vessels more than enough, Manager is friendly, the Kitchen is good enough and there is a separate place for cutting the vegetables and even we can keep the foods in middle of kitchen and dinning so that the food wont get cool in direct AC. No parking Available, I am not sure whether they have any wallet parking or any separate place to park the vehicles. Ground Flour Main hall and first flour Dining Hall.','2026-03-28 15:02:29.089373',388,78,149),('emmy kriz',4,'Very Good area for Sports.. it\'s like resort.. but the resort owner not allowing to cook the non vegetarian inside the campus...','2026-03-28 15:02:31.665116',389,79,151),('Sasidharan K P',5,'Very good ambience. Perfect place for a family lunch. Kids will enjoy a lot with many outdoor attractions like swing, water games, balloon shoot, trampoline etc. Cricket bowling machine available. Ample parking space, calm and serene place quite away from the main road.\nTasty vegetarian dishes served in earthen clay pots and banana leaves. Traditional meals, south Indian marriage meals available. Reasonable cost.','2026-03-28 15:02:31.668829',390,79,151),('Nisha Dinesh',4,'Visited this place for a birthday party 🎉🎊\nSo it\'s evening time,  place was absolutely beautiful with lights on and winter evening\n\nThey provide dance and music classes as parents were waiting to receive their kids from class\nI guess there is cricket practice ground next to it.\nThe interiors of hotel looks ethnic with earthen pots 🍯for water and brick walls adds beauty to the place.\nRegarding food we had North Indian Buffet  which was delicious with naan, kadai mushroom 🍄was awesome.\nHad a great evening spent with nature🌲🍃🍂','2026-03-28 15:02:31.672399',391,79,151),('Eyokesh S',4,'Held a small function in their mini hall and ordered food here. Food preparation and service was good. Eventhough varieties and options are limited, food was neither too spicy nor bland. Main hall is bigger in size and can easily accommodate 200+ guests, whereas mini hall can accommodate 70+ guests. Overall satisfied with the service and would recommend it for small to medium gatherings.','2026-03-28 15:02:31.677092',392,79,151),('Kasiraman Ramachandran',5,'I joined this club with an annual membership mainly for using the swimming pool. The pool is  clean and maintained well. Maximum depth is 5 ft. Coaching sessions are organised based on number of interested candidates. The indoor badminton and table tennis facility can also be used with the membership. The vegetarian food restaurant offers good lunch buffet. A nice place.','2026-03-28 15:02:31.681254',393,79,151),('Ram Mehenthi',4,'Nice and compact wedding or party hall. Good air-conditioned hall. Has a lift to the first floor for dining hall.','2026-03-28 15:02:34.712619',394,80,153),('Àrivazhagi Ma',4,'Hey can u c the space on the stage as well before the stage! Isn\'t it awesome! So many can stand as a family together, as well photographers have their space too. While the strength of the hall can hold so many at a time!\n\nAlso their dinning space with so many to serve and care about are really great.\n\nA stage for musicians too high enough for all to sit and see, while still not disturbing anyone is also set well.\n\nCar parking ...mmm. very much spacious indeed.\n\nGood for a royal family to spend time with all their loved ones eeting together in one place.\nA grand big party hall in and around from Thiruvattriyur till Washermanpet and Royapuram.\n\nOn my way back late night Chennai looked colourful, bright and calm not only in Anna Salai, also called as Mount Road.\n\nThanks to all and particularly God for showering His blessings to 1 &all 🙏','2026-03-28 15:02:34.715625',395,80,153),('krishnan s',5,'The hall is spacious.. And the service is really good.\nThere is a big space for both bike and car parking and people are constantly helping to let us know the parking.\nThe diner area is also big.. They were able to setup atleast 100 chairs and buffet.','2026-03-28 15:02:34.719461',396,80,153),('Balaji Murugesan',4,'Best hall to conduct marriage functions very spacious good parking. Elegant look and easy to commute. Near to metro station. Very good air conditioning.','2026-03-28 15:02:34.722221',397,80,153),('JEYA RAM S',4,'Very Big and good maintained wedding hall at north Chennai and very near to Toll Gate Metro Station. Spacious dining room, 500+ seating capacity hall, 50+ car park etc.','2026-03-28 15:02:34.725288',398,80,153),('Adhimoorthy k s',3,'Affordable, small Hall for a decent small gathering. Parking is a problem.','2026-03-28 15:02:39.585958',399,81,155),('CHARLES INBARAJ',1,'Very very old small mahal with no much facilities, this place is ok for budget friendly people','2026-03-28 15:02:39.590016',400,81,155),('S.P.SHAVARI NATHAN',4,'Mini Marriage Hall with air-conditioned very nice, No parkings inside,only in the street we have to park, 3 marriage hall near by.','2026-03-28 15:02:39.594516',401,81,155),('vinodh raj',4,'On main junction. Near to Triplicane railway station. Authentic place for all occasions.','2026-03-28 15:02:39.599474',402,81,155),('Sriram Karunagaran',5,'It is very good hall for marraige functions . Capacity close to 400 members. The dining is in first floor. Lift facility is available. Rooms are available in ground floor as well as second floor. Bery well maintained. However, those who are worried about parking shall park near temple during week days.','2026-03-28 15:02:39.604441',403,81,155),('Sujata C',5,'It\'s a very huge place. Good air conditioning.lots of car parking facilities. Available staying room is good and neat. A very big crowd can easily have space facilities.good maintenance. Remote area but without any traffic disturbances we can park the vehicles. But the way to enter inside the place is not enough road facility very narrowly road so if any opposite car came we can adjust to go not the enough space to  go freely... Any have the mandabam is very good for a big crowd easily can manage. One time 200 people can take dinning. Good dining and restroom  facilities are there. Good kalyana madapam. It is mostly near the kilambakkam bus stand. And urappakkam erikari bus stop nearby. So easy pubic transport aslo Avilable. Good one.','2026-03-28 15:02:42.223855',404,82,157),('mani vasagan',5,'Good ambience, more than enough car parking, the best hall in this locality. Dining hall and kitchen in the ground floor  gives more convenience. Well maintained garden area, temple within campus, neat and clean toilets, well maintained rooms , worthy to the amount spent. Near by access to GST road and Urapakkam railway station gives comfort to the invitees who attends the function.','2026-03-28 15:02:42.226043',405,82,157),('Subadhra Rakesh',5,'Very spacious hall. Will accomodate nearly 1000 people. Car parking available within the premises. Slightly interior from the main road. Lift is available. Interior decoration are nice','2026-03-28 15:02:42.228406',406,82,157),('Pradeep Purshothaman',4,'It\'s a Famous Mahal, huge car parking, Rooms are okay, need to improve hygiene, there is no heaters and dumy lights in rooms.. In a Dining 220 members can Dine at a single time..A small space entrance for the Mandapam..at a time single car only enter..there is no other option for that..','2026-03-28 15:02:42.231161',407,82,157),('KMSK HARVESTERS (Karthik K)',5,'Silent place and looking good fully air-conditioned with low cost,big car parking, marriage hall is big its enough for a marriage and the place which located mahal is peace full. Room are looking good.','2026-03-28 15:02:42.233701',408,82,157),('VENKATARAMANI RENGARAMANUJAM',5,'It\'s very nice kalyana mandap nearer vadapalani bus stand about a kilometers from Vadapalani temple. Under Ground dinning hall and first floor marriage hall with a capacity about 600 people. There\'s provisions for bride, bridegroom and guest to stay. All the floors are with lift and fully air-conditioned. Open car parking also avaliable adjescent to marriage hall.','2026-03-28 15:02:45.982480',409,83,159),('Viswanathan S',4,'Comfortably spacious wedding hall with a seating capacity for around 250 guests. It has only 9 rooms that includes one each for bride and groom. The bride room is not on the hall but in the first floor only. There are only 2 mini common rest rooms and  bathrooms in the first floor poorly maintened.\nThe car parking for around five vehicles. Nothing special to write about the hall.','2026-03-28 15:02:45.986382',410,83,159),('vimal raj',5,'Decent wedding venue with good rooms and ample event space. Convenient valet parking is available, making it hassle-free for guests. A good option for weddings and gatherings.','2026-03-28 15:02:45.990017',411,83,159),('Vikram Ramamurthy',3,'Very Good place to conduct a small function of 200 people at a time and we can have more than 300 people as floating crowd. We can have a maximum of 10 to 12 Cars parked at a time. The facilities are good. The dining place is good.\nThe only issue is the people who work there ask for a lot of tip money. They plead for money more than once to a person. They ask every possible person for money. They also ask money to the Bride and Groom. The Management should take care of this. Tips should not be forced. People should not tip cos of an Annoying request by the people who work in the Mahal. Thats the Reason I gave 3 star\'s if not I would have given 4 to 5 Stars.','2026-03-28 15:02:45.993475',412,83,159),('suryadigital studio',5,'Excellent interior and exterior design. Wonderful environment and located near main road . Seating space is very good and car parking is also very vast and bike parking is available. Dining hall also so large. Rest room also so neat and clean . This venue is so luxurious and cost also worth.','2026-03-28 15:02:45.996838',413,83,159),('Mohan Loganathan',3,'Good place to conduct birthday, baby shower and other occasions (except wedding)\n\n1. Dining hall is adequate for 30 people at a time\n2. Parking is available for 10 cars\n3. Air-conditioning was good','2026-03-28 15:02:50.420066',414,84,161),('Hari Krishnan',4,'Small AC hall with max 150 ppl capacity. In ground floor & attached with dinning hall too. Good location & suggestable for small gathering & family functions','2026-03-28 15:02:50.423185',415,84,161),('Aruna R',1,'Mahal wise ok food taste good but  catering services very very worst service person not supply properly food 😔 very bad experience in catering and service person 😕','2026-03-28 15:02:50.426514',416,84,161),('Jahnavi Chilakamarri',2,'AC not working at all...being a compact hall would have maintained it much better...','2026-03-28 15:02:50.430436',417,84,161),('SATHANA PRISKILAL',2,'The Decorator is a thief he charged 2000 rupees extra for a broken chair. The hall owner was also a party to it. Be careful guys the Groom and Bride may fall. Cheats. You can very well zoom and see the broken portion stapled','2026-03-28 15:02:50.434264',418,84,161),('GLOBE TROTTER',4,'A classy , contemporary , elegant  Marriage Hall fit for comfortably accommodating 800+ guests . Spread across a large land parcel , there\'s enough space for about 250 + cars . The drop off / pick up point , the Portico , is wide and well planned to ensure there\'s no problem for Guests disembarking and those who board . The Stage itself is massive and can hold about 60 persons. Didn\'t have the opportunity to see the  Rooms , but heard they\'re top notch and maintained very well. Dining hall that can accommodate 250+ guests . The Marriage Hall ceiling is very high ensuring air circulation and has many exit points . Chairs are sturdy and comfortable. Drapes ,  curtains and other decor are pleasing to the eye and ooze luxury.  The Lawns and Parking area needs more greenery and landscaping - but for this would have given 5 Stars .\nTo summarise , this should be the first choice for People who\'d want their Family Wedding conducted in a grand manner. Cheers','2026-03-28 15:02:53.265912',419,85,163),('divya achpal',5,'Attended a wedding. Very big hall. Too big. Ample space to park. Big dining hall. Can accommodate around 3000 people. Space for a sit down meal as well as a buffet. Lots of lobby room','2026-03-28 15:02:53.270220',420,85,163),('MADHANAN NATARAJAN',5,'The marriage hall is situated at Vanagaram (வானகரம்), may be around 25 acres, a costly affair. I am posting my own photos and videos taken on 26th February 2025. Jai Hind.','2026-03-28 15:02:53.273961',421,85,163),('Premnath Ponnuchamy',5,'ShrivaaruVenkatachalapathy Palace is one of the largest Wedding Hall & Convention Center in South India. It has witnessed some of the most significant - Weddings, Political meets, Corporate Gatherings, Exhibitions and Events. The size is a considerable 50,000 sq.ft. and can accommodate more than 5000 people at once.\n\nThe hall was well maintained in cleanliness and has very spacious car parking. The staff also very courteous and helpful . The kitchen and dining hall was well configured and maintained hygienically.\n\nShrivaaru Venkataachalapathy Palace, No. 103, LBR Garden Vanagaram-Ayanambakkam Road, Off, Poonamallee High Road, Rajankuppam, Maduravoyal, Chennai, Tamil Nadu 600095\n\nFacilities:\n\n1) OUTDOOR DINING area available for upto 1000 people.\n2) MINI HALL available on rent for upto 400 people.\n3) OPEN AREA upto 100,000 sq.ft. available on rent for outdoor functions or exhibitions.\n4) Excellent quality inhouse catering division available at Shrivaaru Palace.\n5) One of the largest in TamilNadu\nBuilt up area 50,000 sq.ft. (Centralised A/C)\n20 A/C rooms with attached bathrooms\n6) Hall seating capacity 2000 people\n7) Two A/C dining halls seating 700 people combined\n8) Can be used for multipurpose like exhibition / cultural events\n9) Fully equipped modern kitchen of over 3000 sq.ft.\n10) 4 Acres of car parking space for more than 1000 cars\n11) Elegant front elevation & excellent landscape with fountain\n12) Spacious open garden for conducting buffets\n13) Generator Back up for uniterrupted power supply\n14) Well connected with the city by arterial roads 12-15 kms from the airport\n15) Complete surveillance by CCTV cameras\nIntercom Facility\n\nRestrictions\n1) Alcoholic Beverages.\n2) Abandoned Substances.\n3)  Strictly Vegetarian policy within building premises.\n4) Non-Vegetarian areas allocated for cooking and dining outside the building at Car Park.\n\nHappy Visiting 🎇🎇','2026-03-28 15:02:53.277713',422,85,163),('MANOJ KUMAR',5,'Right from entry to exit, it was a great experience. Be it the ambience inside the palace or outside, neatly planned engineering. Well decorated and maintained.apic and span toilets and floors','2026-03-28 15:02:53.282139',423,85,163),('Mugunthan Chakrapani',4,'This place exactly on the main road just opposite to cresent engineering college in Vandalur, also very close and opposite to Vandalur Zoo. Before I brief about the place, Let me tell my personal experience on how I reached this place. I started from Tambaram railway station by bike. I missed to take extreme left when I was nearing Vandalur Zoo, but my bad I took the center lane and the same took me in Vandalur flyover, then I went for 2 kms to find the U turn and come back another 2 kms to reach this place. While returning back to Tambaram, again I missed to take the extreme left and took the center lane, which took in to flyover taking left and the I took a U turn to reach the road parallel to railway track. Then i travelled around 2 km to find the flyover to cross the track and came back to door step of the Sri Bhavani Palace. So be please be mindful while going returning otherwise it will be absolute Maze for you. Coming back to this place, enough parking space for both 2 wheelers and 4 wheelers. Seperate gate for entry and exit. You can use the lift from parking area to go the function hall in second floor and dining hall in 1st floor or else you have to take the steps. Please mind your step before getting in to lift as floor tiles are not that much flat equivalent to floor steps of lift. Hall size is uneven as the lift occupies the space in the center of the floor, but occupancy level is around 500 people on the float. In the 3rd floor you can find the rooms for stay, but not sure about the no. Of rooms available. Dining hall can hold around 120 to 150 people at time, which is pretty good capacity for this size hall. Always mind to start the function on time to avoid rush on the stage and dining table. Overall this place is good to host all type of functions. Railway station is bit fare from this place, so better go for MTC bus or own vehicle and again you have to be more carefull about the route as I said earlier.','2026-03-28 15:02:57.073293',424,86,165),('Karupa samy',5,'This is a grand venue for all kinds of events. The floors are spacious and neatly maintained. The large dining room and marriage hall had central air conditioning. Only vegetarian functions are allowed. A beautiful marriage hall with a light setting and good design from top to bottom. There is a beautiful temple inside the mahal. The ceiling is completely different, giving it a great look. There is ample parking space. This is a much noticeable venue.','2026-03-28 15:02:57.076816',425,86,165),('Crasu Crason',4,'The marriage hall is very conveniently located on GST Road, right opposite Vandalur Zoo. It has lift access to all floors, which is very helpful, especially for elderly guests. Car parking is available, but please note that the right-side parking is fine, while the left-side parking space is quite narrow and there’s a chance of vehicles getting scratched or hit. I would recommend using the lift, as the staircase is a bit steep and not very comfortable for older people.','2026-03-28 15:02:57.079969',426,86,165),('karuna kadhatchi',5,'Good palace in Vandalur. Spacious and also their coordination is the best . They given clander for this new year . Very happy for they were gifted 😊','2026-03-28 15:02:57.083024',427,86,165),('Sandeep Kumar',4,'Bhavani Palace is a great place for gatherings of around 500–600 people. The location is excellent and the hall is equipped with AC, making it very comfortable.','2026-03-28 15:02:57.085779',428,86,165),('N Balasubramanian',5,'Artistic designed and well maintained hall ideal for small functions of 150 capacity with lift facility.\nCar parking is limited to 3-4 cars on site however vallet parking can be arranged for more cars.\nGood AC effects on the hall and they have attendants to manage and ensure discipline\nOverall a good experience','2026-03-28 15:03:00.394022',429,87,167),('Balaji Suresh',5,'We organized our son\'s Aayushya Homam at Vedashreni Hall.\n\nThe venue is amazing and aesthetically designed. The thinnai area in the first floor was our favourite.\n\nSucharita madam explained the rules of the establishment, timings etc\n\nWe booked for only the first half of the day.\n\nThey will share the contacts of their inhouse decorators and we can proceed with either of them.\n\nParking will be an issue if you are expecting lot of people coming in their own cars. If needed, they will arrange valet service at an extra charge.\n\nOverall we were satisfied with our experience','2026-03-28 15:03:00.397238',430,87,167),('Jayanthi Raghunathan',5,'We hosted my son’s Upanayanam at Vedashreni Function Hall, and the experience was truly commendable. The hall itself is elegant, beautifully blending traditional charm with modern aesthetics and requires very minimal decoration. It is exceptionally well-maintained and radiates a classy, serene atmosphere.\nMs. Sucharitha and her team managed the venue with professionalism and efficiency, making the entire process smooth and stress-free. The facility includes three guest rooms: two smaller ones and a larger room that can comfortably accommodate up to 10 guests.\nThe function hall is located on the second floor, with the dining area on the first floor. A lift is available for easy access. The dining hall can seat around 50 people at a time, while the main hall can comfortably handle a floating crowd of about 170 guests.\nOne consideration is parking—since the hall is situated on a narrow lane and has limited in-house parking. However, they offer a valet parking service through a trusted contact, which can be arranged for an additional charge.\nWhile the pricing may be on the higher side, the quality, ambiance, and overall experience fully justify the cost. It’s an excellent venue choice for a special occasion.','2026-03-28 15:03:00.400378',431,87,167),('Lavanya Ramasami',5,'We would like to express our heartfelt thanks to the management of Vedashreni Function Hall and their entire team for the wonderful support extended to us during the Sadhabishekam celebration.\n\nFrom the meticulous arrangements to the quiet efficiency behind the scenes, every detail was handled with care and devotion, allowing the function to flow smoothly and peacefully. Your cooperation, hospitality, and commitment truly made this sacred occasion comfortable and memorable for all of us.\n\nWe are deeply grateful for your support in helping us conduct this auspicious event in such a serene and well-organized manner. Thank you once again for being an integral part of our celebration.','2026-03-28 15:03:00.404655',432,87,167),('Raghav M S',5,'I was a part of a function very recently and top marks for how the event was organised with respect to the decoration, food, video coverage and everything. Much Appreciation to Sai Deckers for the amazing work.','2026-03-28 15:03:00.408038',433,87,167),('Bala',4,'Big hall but small car parking. Floating no problem\nBKN Auditorium in Periyamet, Chennai, is a great choice for large celebrations like engagements, weddings, and receptions. The spacious hall can easily accommodate a big guest list, so you don’t have to worry about the crowd.\n\nLocated on Ritherdon Road near Anita Methodist School, it’s easy for guests to find and reach. The hall’s elegant decor, lighting, and ambiance create a pleasant atmosphere for any occasion.\n\nYou can bring your own caterers to serve delicious vegetarian food and desserts. The venue also offers a few rooms for outstation guests, changing rooms for convenience, and limited parking space for those arriving by car.','2026-03-28 15:03:02.495486',434,88,169),('Mariappan S',5,'BKN Auditorium is a popular venue for weddings and other events in Chennai. It is located in Periyamet, a central location in the city. The auditorium has a seating capacity and offers a variety of amenities, including air conditioning, parking and catering services. BKN Auditorium is a good choice for those looking for a spacious and well-equipped venue for their event.','2026-03-28 15:03:02.500010',435,88,169),('haston kumar',5,'Fantastic place! The venue is very spacious with excellent air conditioning and impressive acoustic effects. The big stage is perfect for hosting large events, and the seating capacity easily accommodates up to 1,000 people.\n\nThe parking facility is convenient and spacious, making it hassle-free for attendees. They also have a large dining hall, which is a great addition for events that include catering.\n\nHighly recommend this place for hosting any large-scale event or gathering!','2026-03-28 15:03:02.503135',436,88,169),('EDWIN',5,'Lovely place for wedding reception and other gatherings\nIt can easily accommodate 700 - 1000 people\nCentrally located with good transport facilities bus, metro and other mode of transport.','2026-03-28 15:03:02.506465',437,88,169),('Thanush',4,'Its is beautiful place with good space and ambience. At same time 1000 members can take part in the auditorium hall. It is suitable for all kind of functions, dining hall in ground floor and auditorium in first floor with lift facilities, parking available for both car as well as bike the location is in dead end of the road so there is a lot of parking facilities, there is a mini party hall also available with same parking facilities','2026-03-28 15:03:02.509780',438,88,169),('Manimala',5,'All facilities were good. Perfect location. Parking can be increased. AC and food hall is neat and tidy. All our friends enjoyed our friend Saravanans marriage reception recently. Memorable event...','2026-03-28 15:03:07.124878',439,89,171),('balakumar kuppuswamy',5,'My brother\'s Sashtiapthapoorthi was held here. It is a good place for small functions (of around 175-200 max guests) of half or one day duration. The hall is functional and is more than adequate. The dining hall, on the second floor, can accommodate around 90-100 per session. The parking is limited, 12 to 15 cars, with their in-house hands parking them snugly. For more cars, valet drivers have to be fixed. But the nearby streets are a little cramped for space. The AC in the hall is effective, and the lift quite spacious. All in all, a good bet for small, cosy functions.','2026-03-28 15:03:07.127916',440,89,171),('Suresh Krishman',5,'The AC hall is easily reachable from Arcot road. Good for about 150 guests. The AC dining hall compliments the banquet hall. Car parking is limited- may be suitable for about 12 cars. The stage space is ok for small functions.','2026-03-28 15:03:07.130436',441,89,171),('Manimaran Ramasamy',4,'Ok good for normal crowd. Located on the main area near Arcot Road. Neatly maintained Mahal. Limited parking area available here.','2026-03-28 15:03:07.133432',442,89,171),('Sadhu Jag',5,'Attended the sashtiapta poorthi of my relation here.  Was also allotted a room  The room was excellent with ac too in very good condition. The ambience was excellent and the function went on very well.  It was an unforgettable experience','2026-03-28 15:03:07.137304',443,89,171),('Jai ganesh',4,'Decent marriage hall in west mambalam area..\nGround floor car parking for 10-12 cars, bike for 20-25 based on the way they park. Small fns parking is enough but big crowd means surely it will struggle\nAc hall, rooms.\nHalf day option is there which is good for small functions\n10 rooms available but poorly maintained. Fan Ac needs replacement immediately. Dont live in hyder ali period\n\n1 Lift  available but small only\n\nLocation is strategically located but very narrow congested lake view road. Dont come in bus and all.\nKitchen well equipped for inhouse cooking.\n\nDining area is spacious and ac is there\nWhat they have to do:\nThey can buy a ground nearby for more parking space\nRenovate all the rooms immediately otherwise you will definitely loose booking','2026-03-28 15:03:10.148370',444,90,173),('Priya P',5,'I had been to this mandap recently to attend a function. The hall was big and there was space for parking too . The dining hall was very spacious and they are taking steps to keep it clean and tidy .\n\nThe mandap is in a narrow busy road .','2026-03-28 15:03:10.151904',445,90,173),('Nanda Kishore',3,'Attended a function here recently. It\'s a very basic, no-frills hall that can accommodate around 100–150 people. Parking is limited but manageable — roughly 10–12 cars and about 25 two-wheelers.\n\nThe function was on a particularly hot and humid day (~38°C). While the air conditioning wasn\'t powerful, it was sufficient to maintain a decent ambient temperature — just enough to keep the heat from becoming uncomfortable.\n\nOverall, it\'s a modest venue suitable for small gatherings if you\'re looking for minimal facilities and are okay with the basics.','2026-03-28 15:03:10.154845',446,90,173),('Aneesh Deepak',5,'Compact hall with decent car parking facilities for various Ayyappa Bhajans and mini functions.','2026-03-28 15:03:10.157880',447,90,173),('VYAS V',4,'Good parking available in basement. Mandapam is moderate spacious. It is in first floor. Dining hall is also spacious. It is in second floor. All the places are covered with lift. Even aged person can be comfortable here.','2026-03-28 15:03:10.160948',448,90,173),('EDWARD HENRY K',4,'Very Good marriage hall for a medium budget. It has got vehicle parking space too.','2026-03-28 15:03:14.883243',449,91,176),('The real trekker',3,'Near by bus stand...\nNear by metro..\nLittle far from railway station...\nSuitable for medium and large functions...\n150+ seats in dining hall...\nMain hall too big...\nNo lift....\n1st floor dining and 2nd floor reception hall...\nGood maintenence','2026-03-28 15:03:14.885038',450,91,176),('Raja Kumaran',1,'I visited VK Mahal today...but I think that\'s party hall....very small hall & split with dining hall... It\'s was very very Unsatisfied thing... Bcze in Marriage hall or party hall the crowd was get in dining hall with force... catering also want to serve food quickly...but here that\'s not possible....bcze here one table six members sitting by surround... It\'s overall ruin every person\'s time... Plz... management want to change the table arrangements..it will take 20-30 k only... Plz consider the main part of Functions','2026-03-28 15:03:14.886634',451,91,176),('Devi prasad',3,'Poor Maintanence...no locks available for doors and lockers..Good for small family functions & parties...but still they should upgrade their interiors & neatness.','2026-03-28 15:03:14.888111',452,91,176),('Riyasudeen OsmanMeah',2,'Those booking hall, please make sure of A/C usage timings.  They switch off before end of party. They stop ac during photo shoot and whole crowd bitterly exit hall by force. So arrange on AC at exactly party begin.','2026-03-28 15:03:14.889585',453,91,176),('praveena Gift',5,'Excellent party hall, with good dinning area. Air conditioning was so good. They are the only Mahal with such big dining space in that area. Worth the money, they have spacious parking. Vallet parking also available. They owner was very supportive. We were so happy to have our daughter\'s first birthday celebration there.','2026-03-28 15:03:18.183783',454,92,178),('Monika Naidu',5,'We had our wedding reception at S.R. Mahal and it was truly a wonderful experience. The hall was spacious, fully air-conditioned, and beautifully maintained. The lighting and ambiance made our special day even more magical.\nThe management and staff were very supportive, cooperative, and attentive to every detail. Everything was organized perfectly and on time. Our guests were very comfortable and appreciated the venue a lot.\nThank you for making our reception so memorable and grand. Highly recommended for weddings! 💐✨','2026-03-28 15:03:18.186912',455,92,178),('gayathri devi',4,'Nice ambience marriage hall with neat facilities and spacious seating. Clean rooms, and supportive staff, parking space available, and everything went smoothly. Happy with the arrangements and had a pleasant experience!\n\nA clean and well-organized venue with good lighting and seating.\n\nPerfect for all events. Keep up','2026-03-28 15:03:18.189913',456,92,178),('Prasath Siva',5,'The best Mahal around vinayagapuram, amount reasonable and quality best in the market. I had my baby shower ceremony there it\'s bestest ever','2026-03-28 15:03:18.192960',457,92,178),('apsarvan',5,'We definitely recommend for all functions like marriage,engagement and other occasions.we did marriage function on sep-25, Hall is fantastic with well lighting decorative, dining hall and kitchen is well maintained also rooms are in neat and we\'ll maintained.Especially owner is good person and we\'ll supported. Rent is economic comparing to other madapams.Thank you','2026-03-28 15:03:18.195924',458,92,178),('Travel Guru Mani',5,'Grand entrance !\nDetailed car parking area!\nA wide portico!\nLocated in a non-traffic highway!\nA peace feeling landscape around the paradise!\nComfortable dining area!\nAir cooling system is very satisfied!\nA neat and standard washrooms!\nParadise\'s staffs are well groomed!\nEverything is fine !','2026-03-28 15:03:20.776914',459,93,180),('radhika muthu',4,'Very grandeur place for a big shot wedding and events. Ample parking space .','2026-03-28 15:03:20.780324',460,93,180),('Ram Venkatesh',5,'It\'s an amazing wedding hall with all amenities. Located on a highway with excellent connectivity from city.\nThe function hall is exceptional and it\'s designed in such a way that each participant can have a clear no disturbance view of the main stage. Very well and sophisticated.\nThe dining hall is at ground floor and it\'s huge. Very well maintained.\nThe entrance of this venue is beautiful with all lighting and decorations.','2026-03-28 15:03:20.783942',461,93,180),('Nandhan Phoenix',5,'A convenient hall to gather more than 1000 people at a time... Can accommodate up to 200 seatings at a time for food.... They have a huge parking space... And we use lawn space for buffets or corporate events and for other fun activities....','2026-03-28 15:03:20.788078',462,93,180),('R.S. ANANTHAN',5,'Good air-conditioned Kalyana Mahal. Very Big size. Lot of rooms. Huge car parking. Neatly maintained. Hospitality of the staffs are good, especially Manager Mr. Rajmohan iyengar\'s service is excellent.','2026-03-28 15:03:20.791041',463,93,180),('Muneendra Challagulla',5,'We are from Nellore,  recently my engagement is celebrated in RVJ Gardens.  Around 120 people attended. Hall is very nice,  workers over there are very good  and helpful.  They are very cool and helped us a lot.  Owner Prabhu is so good,  he communicates very well. He is polite and kind personality.   I recommend this hall for any auspicious celebrations.  So much of parking space which is other advantage.','2026-03-28 15:03:24.769097',464,94,182),('Keerthi Vasan',4,'We are oraganizer a karate camp on Oct 5th around 150 students are attending this event 🥋\n\nGood place to having a memorable event 😊 clean and neat infrastructure and parking was easy to access then more Mr Prabhu owner of RVJ Gardens give is full hardwork and effort to the entire event....Try to use the Hall for your event with memorable day\n\nThank you 🙏','2026-03-28 15:03:24.772758',465,94,182),('kathiravan jeevagan',5,'RVJ Gardens - The Best Party Hall in Manali. Clean, well-maintained, and affordably priced, located near Manali -chennai.We hosted our reception at RVJ Gardens, and they made sure everything went smoothly. The team ensured that we had the best time, making our function enjoyable and memorable','2026-03-28 15:03:24.776652',466,94,182),('Pramodhu krishnankutty',4,'We recently attended my brother-in-law’s reception at this wedding hall, and it was a wonderful experience. The hall was beautifully decorated, spacious, and very comfortable for all the guests. The overall ambience and arrangements were excellent.\n\nI would also like to mention the manager — he was very patient, polite, and extremely helpful throughout the event. I truly appreciate his involvement and the way he personally took care of every small detail. It shows his genuine dedication to the business.\n\nJust one small suggestion — it would be great if they could improve the outdoor lighting, especially around the trees. Also, placing a clear signboard with the wedding hall’s name and picture on the main road would help guests locate the venue easily, since there are a few other halls nearby.\n\nOther than that, everything was perfect. Highly recommended for family events and reception\'s\n\nThanks\n-Pramodh','2026-03-28 15:03:24.780132',467,94,182),('sowmini sivakumar',5,'We did our daughter\'s Naming ceremony in RVJ Garden , really soo good place to celebrate our memorable special day ,spacious hall and more  parking space with good dinning space  with  good maintainance','2026-03-28 15:03:24.785441',468,94,182),('Anjeline W',5,'Spacious & large hall for your big day.. If you are in Minjur, check ezhil mandapam.. Its hardly 10 mins away from minjur railway station..','2026-03-28 15:03:27.080222',469,95,184),('RANA',5,'Very good marriage marriage hall. Big space for car parking, its like authentic setup, staff also friendly and helpful, affordable also','2026-03-28 15:03:27.084124',470,95,184),('Nivetha',3,'Had to park outside coz the car parking space got full. Otherwise, spacious non-AC hall..','2026-03-28 15:03:27.086592',471,95,184),('Jaya Prakash',4,'Enough parking Space available.  Nearly 400 to 500 persons can sit in Marriage Hall @1st Floor and in Dining Hall @ Ground Floor. Easy to locate.','2026-03-28 15:03:27.090802',472,95,184),('Rajkumar Aravindan',5,'S. Ezhil Thirumana Mandapam, situated on Thiruvottiyur High Road in Minjur, Tamil Nadu, is a spacious and well-equipped venue ideal for hosting various events, including weddings, receptions, and other social gatherings. The main hall is fully air-conditioned and can comfortably accommodate a large number of guests, ensuring a pleasant experience regardless of the weather. The dining area is also expansive, allowing for efficient service during meal times. One of the standout features of this mandapam is its ample parking space, providing convenience for guests arriving by car. The interior design has been praised for its aesthetic appeal, contributing to the overall ambiance of the venue. Additionally, the mandapam offers multiple rooms for guests, which is beneficial for those hosting multi-day events or accommodating out-of-town attendees. Its strategic location on the main road makes it easily accessible from various parts of the city, and its proximity to Minjur railway station, approximately 2 kilometers away, adds to its accessibility. Overall, S. Ezhil Thirumana Mandapam combines functionality with aesthetic appeal, making it a suitable choice for those seeking a venue that offers both convenience and a pleasant atmosphere for their special occasions.','2026-03-28 15:03:27.093948',473,95,184),('Advocate Poovathingal Praveen kumar',3,'Budget friendly marriage hall in Ponneri neatness has to be maintained','2026-03-28 15:03:31.959825',474,96,186),('Suyambu Lingam',4,'Good marriage hall with all facilities. Centralised A/C hall and dining, good parking facilities, lots of guests rooms. One of the best Marriage hall in this area','2026-03-28 15:03:31.967612',475,96,186),('Pravin P',5,'No traffic in that place,peaceful attitude.non AC Marriage hall.only 2 floors have in a marriage hall.Restroom is in left side of the marriage hall','2026-03-28 15:03:31.970172',476,96,186),('Iniyavan',3,'The Party hall can accommodate 100 people .\nThe rooms are ok. The dining area is large .\nBut the stage seems to be small.','2026-03-28 15:03:31.971411',477,96,186),('SK “Suthagar” S',4,'For a budget marriage,this hall is adequate.Have a dining hall with 50+ seating capacity,well maintained. Not in a main road,no car parking and no lift for dining hall are the concerns here','2026-03-28 15:03:31.972980',478,96,186),('Paritosh Patra',5,'19th Feb we visited mahal for the reception, hall was maintained neat and overall hospitality was good.','2026-03-28 15:03:37.268076',479,97,188),('ABHIJITH S NAIR',4,'I recently attended a wedding at Mangalam Thirumana Mahal near Thirumullaivoyal and had a very good experience. The hall is quite spacious, clean, and well maintained, with good air-conditioning and a traditional yet modern look. It can easily accommodate large gatherings and offers excellent facilities, including a nice stage setup, projector screens, and ample seating. There is also sufficient parking space for both cars and two-wheelers, which is a big plus. The attached guest rooms are clean and convenient for out-of-town guests. The management was professional and helpful, making sure everything ran smoothly during the event. Catering and decoration options are flexible  you can bring in outside vendors or use their in-house services. Overall, this is a great venue for weddings, receptions, and other large functions in this area. Would definitely recommend it','2026-03-28 15:03:37.271637',480,97,188),('SA Barkath',4,'Very spacious parking area. Hall and dining very big. AC was very good. Only problem is that you have to enter a small street from the main road to enter the marriage hall.','2026-03-28 15:03:37.275347',481,97,188),('S.Nithaesh Kumar',5,'Good spacious place and good car parking. Only issue for restroom we face to move long distance so it is more inconvenient for aged peoples.','2026-03-28 15:03:37.279033',482,97,188),('Premnath Ponnuchamy',5,'Mangalam Thirumana Mahal, Thirumullaivoyal, Chennai, is an exemplary and budget-friendly destination to host your South Indian style marriage and reception ceremony. An aesthetically designed Kalyana Mandapam offering best in class services for making your wedding day a memorable experience. Being strategically located, this venue becomes easily accessible for all to commute. Mangalam Marriage Hall, Thirumullaivoyal, has an enormous banquet hall, perfect for your indoor celebrations. It would enchant your guests with colorful illumination and traditional decor. Also suited to host your birthdays, anniversaries, family get-togethers, pre-wedding ceremonies, cultural programs, and more.\nMangalam Thirumana Mahal, Chennai, can smoothly accommodate a massive gathering for your special day. It offers ample parking space for guests arriving in private vehicles. The team of decor artists present on-site offer the best services with elegant and charming set-ups. They deck up the banquet with traditional ornate accessories, floral backdrops, or customize according to the theme of the event. Mangalam Kalyana Mandapam, Chennai, has magnificent rooms made available for the invitees arriving from other cities for your wedding. Delicious vegetarian and non-vegetarian delicacies are prepared by the cooks present here. You also get the liberty to outsource your catering services so your guests can enjoy a customized multi-cuisine menu or live food counters. Lock in your next blissful affair with Mangalam Thirumana Mahal, Thirumullaivoyal, Chennai.\n\nHappy Visiting 🥳🥳','2026-03-28 15:03:37.282201',483,97,188),('Nachiappan Sbm',5,'Spacious marriage hall. There are few rooms in first floor, dining area at the basement. Fully air conditioned, well maintained. Two wheelers can be parked inside this Mahal. Very accessible location.','2026-03-28 15:03:40.079306',484,98,190),('tamilselvi senthil',5,'Its decent and good one. Lift available. Dinner at basement. Hall in Ground floor.','2026-03-28 15:03:40.082696',485,98,190),('Lakshminarayanan',5,'A spacious wedding hall with ample parking space for both two and four wheeler on the mainroad. Ambience good.','2026-03-28 15:03:40.085783',486,98,190),('RAMAN SS',5,'Medium hall can accommodate around 150 to 200 people with separate place for dining with lift facility.  No car parking.','2026-03-28 15:03:40.089268',487,98,190),('Bindhu Madhavan',3,'Recently visited this Mahal for a wedding. Ok for a function to host 250-300 people. The biggest drawback of this mandapam is, the rooms. There are only 10 rooms. And more over the rooms have attached toilets which are of Indian type but for bride and the groom rooms (+one more room). The common toilets are horrible. Carry your own buckets and mugs if you happen to use those common toilets. :)\nAverage Marriage hall.','2026-03-28 15:03:40.092485',488,98,190),('JAYARAMAN DURAI SWAMY',5,'𝐏𝐫𝐞𝐞𝐭𝐡𝐢 𝐌𝐚𝐡𝐚𝐥 𝐄𝐱𝐜𝐥𝐥𝐞𝐧𝐭 👌\n𝐇𝐚𝐥𝐥 𝐀𝐫𝐚𝐧𝐠𝐞𝐦𝐞𝐧𝐭𝐬 𝐒𝐮𝐩𝐞𝐫𝐛🤗\n𝐃𝐢𝐞𝐧𝐢𝐧𝐠 𝐍𝐞𝐚𝐭& 𝐌𝐚𝐢𝐧𝐭𝐚𝐧𝐚𝐧𝐜𝐞🥰','2026-03-28 15:03:44.333296',489,99,192),('vinoth kumar',5,'Big hall for wedding','2026-03-28 15:03:44.341056',490,99,192),('Sivagami Purushoth',4,'Went for one function thought it is a budget friendly place with compact Hall and dining place... the function was afternoon so feels too hot otherwise for the price it is ok.... Parking also bit difficult','2026-03-28 15:03:44.346246',491,99,192),('Just Timepass',5,'Small place for low budget families','2026-03-28 15:03:44.352226',492,99,192),('Viswanathan N',1,'Parking not available.\nUn Clean restroom.\nNo ventilation.\nLow lighting.','2026-03-28 15:03:44.355582',493,99,192),('Dinesh Arumugam',3,'Nice and perfect place. Hall is convenient for 700- 1000 members. No traffic problem.  Parking available for bikes.','2026-03-28 15:03:48.647874',494,100,194),('Ganesh Narayanan',2,'A wedding hall they can accommodate 250+ crowd easily @ Valasaravakkam, Chennai. Only 2 wheeler parking available in the hall & the adjacent Parking ground for cars can accommodate around 6-8 cars.\n\nIn the main hall, AC is good but there is no chimney on the stage for smoke from rituals to go out. Not easy to sit inside for long duration due to this.\n\nRooms are ok but maintenance is not good. Some ACs were not working, doors were not getting closed etc. Rooms not cleaned properly.. dust, spider web etc. Bathroom window glass is broken (privacy concern).\n\nOnly 1 lift available in main hall. This Lift for 1st and 2nd floor is old style manual lift. Someone will leave the door open, it stops working and others will end up waiting for lift for ever.\n\nManager and staff are polite and helpful.\n\nReview date: May 2023','2026-03-28 15:03:48.651167',495,100,194),('கார்த்திக் மதிவாணன்',3,'Seating Capacity were about 100 by maximum, located at First floor,  lift available but only 3 members can enter, seperate rooms were nice,  but tons of mosquito make us as sleepless night.... A/C flow okayish','2026-03-28 15:03:48.654711',496,100,194),('Surjii Am',4,'Can accomodate 200+ people at the same time. Well maintained hall and stage.\nRestroom are very dirty and concers periodic maintanence. Located in valsaravakam.','2026-03-28 15:03:48.657858',497,100,194),('Dr.Navin Puttum',3,'The are two Mandapam side by side , both are owned by guha.\nOne hall is small and the other hall is big enough to accommodate around 500 people and dining around 200 people at one go.\nLocation Arcot road towards Gandhi road .\nVery Very busy road as it is residential road. Parking space is there but open one and they have some empty ground to park. To park around 30 cars at a time.\nThe hall spacious and open and fully air conditioned.\nThe rooms for the guests are too small and not well maintained but all the rooms are air conditioned.\nThere are 15 rooms which is not given by other mandapams.\nOverall a good and decent hall.','2026-03-28 15:03:48.661040',498,100,194),('Kanemozhi Ethiraj',5,'The marriage convention hall is very spacious and beautifully maintained. The ambience is pleasant, with good lighting and ventilation. The dining area is large and hygienic, making it comfortable for guests. Parking facilities are adequate, which is a big plus. The staff were cooperative and helpful throughout the event. Overall, it is an excellent venue for weddings, receptions, and other grand functions.','2026-03-28 15:03:52.777082',499,101,196),('Kriya Sakthipriya',2,'First of all it is not a convention hall. It is only a mini wedding hall. Got mislead by the name. It is single storey with hall, rooms, dining area and parking all on ground floor. The dinning area is so cramped and designed poorly with pillars in between. There are three doors to the area and unfortunately they closed two and opened only one. So both guests and serving people had to enter via the same door. There is not enough place to keep the prepared food and serve comfortably. Kitchen is again like a strip and most of the cooked food had to be kept outside. Pathetic designing. Kitchen and dining are not connected. Unnecessary steps and height difference on the flooring. Elders had difficulty in moving. Wash basins were kept in a corner in open, outside the building making it difficult to access. Road to the venue is narrow and many guest were struck in traffic for nearly 20-40 mins for 200 m.','2026-03-28 15:03:52.779735',500,101,196),('Arvind Shan',5,'A wonderful banquet hall at a prime location! The ambience is elegant, the space is well maintained, and the pricing is very affordable compared to similar venues. Highly recommended for any type of functions.','2026-03-28 15:03:52.781953',501,101,196),('Jhansi Trisha',5,'The mandapam is spacious, clean, and very well maintained. The hall has an elegant look with good lighting and ventilation, making it perfect for weddings and family functions. Seating arrangements are comfortable, and the stage area is large and beautifully designed.','2026-03-28 15:03:52.784486',502,101,196),('Kalpana Rajendran',5,'It is spacious, clean, and well-maintained. The seating arrangement and lighting were excellent, making it suitable for weddings and large functions. Parking facilities are adequate, and the staff were cooperative throughout the event.','2026-03-28 15:03:52.787738',503,101,196),('Karthick S',5,'We recently celebrated our baby shower at Happy Hall. Everything went smoothly and the arrangements were excellent. Thank you for making our special day memorable!\nThanks for Vanitha!','2026-03-28 15:03:58.635058',504,102,198),('PAVITHRA KRISHNA',5,'I recently celebrated a function at this hall and it was a wonderful experience. The space was neat, spacious, and well-maintained. All arrangements were smooth and comfortable for guests. Overall, very satisfied and highly recommend this hall for events','2026-03-28 15:03:58.636349',505,102,198),('Srinivesan Srinivesan',5,'Very new Party hall with excellent interior and air conditioning.Function area and dining area separate floors.Good parking area in the basement. Hall manager and staff were very helpful.Suggested Decoration, photography and catering services were affordable and high quality.Thanks for the help and support!','2026-03-28 15:03:58.637810',506,102,198),('Nagarajan Kavitha',5,'Every Nice party hall and interiors also Very good reasonable price overall Very good definitely I refer my friends and relatives to this happy hall 😀','2026-03-28 15:03:58.639195',507,102,198),('Selvin Thangadurai',5,'A beautifully maintained function hall-clean, organized, and perfect for hosting any event.','2026-03-28 15:03:58.641185',508,102,198),('Rajagopalan saravanan',5,'Good evening to all\nI am R. Saravanan from orchid pharma Ltd\nOn 4 th of Oct 2025 I have celebrated my baby first birthday day function in AMSAM MAHAL\n\nIt\'s is very pleasant and more convenient to accommodate around 1000 members at a time with fully air conditioning and very comfortable to all my relatives , friends and my family members\nAs far as the dining is concerned it is well spaced to dine 150 members at a time with comfort zone without any swet\n\nAnd for car and two wheelers parking it is very spacious to hold 100 four wheelers and 250 two wheelers at a time with all safety measures at most care by the people\n\nI would like to tank to the owner of Amsam Mahal Thiru Er. Elumalai to provide a such fabulous and wonder world in nenmeli\n\nThanks to all to make on that day a wonderful in my life\n\nBy\n\nR. Saravanan M. Sc., Phd.,\nInternational marketing\nOrchid pharma Ltd\nChennai\n💐💐💐\n🙏🙏🙏','2026-03-28 15:04:01.809025',509,103,200),('Sathyanarayanan P (Sathya)',5,'Big and good marriage hall which is situated outside of Chengalpattu (5.6 kms). Do not pay more than 150 Rs for auto from Chengalpattu railway station to Amsam Mahal. Surrounding of this mahal is very scenic.\n\nMarriage Hall is lit well and it\'s fully Air conditioned, Bride Groom is very big with attached toilet with heater facilities. They have two separate dinning hall and big kitchen. It can accommodate 100 - 150 members.\n\nIt has big corridor with a small Vinayagar temple. Bikes can be parked inside the entrance and cars on open ground next to marriage hall. Opposite to hall we have a small super market.\n\nFACILITIES AVAILABLE:\n1. MINI HALL apart from main hall\n2. About 10 individual rooms for guests.\n3. Lift','2026-03-28 15:04:01.812678',510,103,200),('94 THENMOZHI',5,'One of the most amazing hall around Chengalpattu  district , adequate space hall with aqueduct room available ,  100 bike and 150 car parking available , with reasonable prize within our bucket list , Grasp  this amazing opportunity for ur special events','2026-03-28 15:04:01.816296',511,103,200),('Venu Gopro',4,'Nice infrastructure... Full A/C mahal under best price. with 200 car parking slot.','2026-03-28 15:04:01.820316',512,103,200),('karikalan arumugam',4,'Nice mandapam with air conditioning. Good parking facility available.','2026-03-28 15:04:01.823926',513,103,200),('Karthikeyan',2,'Located at 1st floor no much space on floor steps to get in and no lift option also. 2nd floor is dining as same not much spacious steps at a time only one person can move on other need to wait to go on further. They need to improvement on this main facility arrangement','2026-03-28 15:04:05.351287',514,104,202),('SpiDy_Js Creations Studio',5,'SA Mini Hall is often used for Anniversary party planning, Corporate and conference, Wedding and engagement, Baby shower planning, Birthday party planning, SA Mini Hall has all the amenities required along with rooms and huge halls for dining purpose.  it is a very good place,everything is easily available.','2026-03-28 15:04:05.354928',515,104,202),('Vinoth kumar Mohan',5,'Wonderful place to celebrate mini functions and simple wedding can do, more than 250 sitting capacity in reception hall, dining hall more than 150 sitting capacity, complete hall full air conditioning availability, very neat and clean toilets, included Two air conditioning room for manamagal & manamagal with the double cot bed and dressing table with attached restroom, micset and musical system available.','2026-03-28 15:04:05.358806',516,104,202),('Santosh Kumar U',4,'The hall is compact and good for a gathering of 100 to 150 people. Budget friendly.','2026-03-28 15:04:05.362467',517,104,202),('Sathish Kumar',5,'Specially made for small functions, lowest price for highest comfort\nCool, Neat and clean','2026-03-28 15:04:05.366062',518,104,202),('Jayanthi sebastine raja',5,'We are from madurai stayed at this venue. Rooms are good. Hospitality is good. Manager was so friendly and helped us to visit places. Thank you for your service','2026-03-28 15:04:09.464791',519,105,203),('santhosh sivasamy',3,'Positive things -  Rooms are clean and no bad smell. Linens and towels are also good.\n\nNegative things - Very small room. Only soap provided, No shampoo, toothbrush and paste.  Parking is very tiny.  Only 6 cars can be parked (2rows, 3 columns) Room service is also average. Lobby smells very bad. For Rs.2000 tariff this seems average.','2026-03-28 15:04:09.468388',520,105,203),('Hema Arun',4,'Good party hall for small functions 100people. Dining capacity 30-35 people. The only disadvantage is that bride and bridegroom rooms are not available in the party hall on the 1st floor. Rooms are available only on the 3rd floor. Even for restrooms we had to move to different floors. Lift is small. Otherwise the interior works were good. Hall AC maintenance is good. Workers are polite and cooperative. The manager was friendly and listened to all our requirements. All wedding items for pooja are also available. They arranged everything on time. Decorations they have a tie up which also was reasonable and neat. Car parking is available for limited cars but the opposite road is the lake view road which is very wide so no problem for parking. Overall a good party hall in the main area.👍','2026-03-28 15:04:09.472091',521,105,203),('Prasanth',5,'I recently hosted an event and it was an amazing experience! The hall was spacious, clean, and beautifully decorated. The staff were super helpful and made sure everything went smoothly from start to finish. The lighting and sound system were perfect for the celebration 🤩','2026-03-28 15:04:09.476865',522,105,203),('Sundaram Krishnamani',5,'We rented this hall for my wife\'s baby shower. The hall was very well maintained and the staffs were extremely polite and helpful. We will recommend this to all of our friends and family.','2026-03-28 15:04:09.480416',523,105,203),('siva ரஞ்சித்',4,'It\'s nice very spacious for car parking but hall is lightly small, sum washing place needs some lights and rest rooms are little bit dirty another wise it\'s ok','2026-03-28 15:04:14.358017',524,106,205),('Abdul Hafeez',5,'A decent and with a good parking space marriage hall. Last Thursday we attended a wedding here.. It was good and spacious. Restrooms are pathetic..','2026-03-28 15:04:14.361271',525,106,205),('Pavithra Srinath',1,'We had a very poor experience at BJN Party Hall. The air conditioning was terrible and made the entire function uncomfortable. On top of that, the owner demanded extra charges at the last minute for cleaning the hall, kitchen, and toilets – all charged separately during the function time, which was completely unprofessional and stressful.\n\nThis hall is not worth the money, and the poor management spoiled our special occasion. I would not recommend this place to anyone looking to host an event.','2026-03-28 15:04:14.364806',526,106,205),('Jagan clk',1,'Not worth for money\nBJN PARTY HALL & the owner spoiled our function.\n\nWorst Hall with poor/ no AC condition.\nowner is money minded. The worst and clumsey kitchen space for cooking. The labours working in the hall, will be stealing the things.\n\nOwner behavior is very very cheap, he will be asking extra on the function time separate separately for cleaning the hall,cleaning the kitchen and cleaning the toilet\nPOOR AC Hall.\n\nThe party hall is not worth for 1star rating also.','2026-03-28 15:04:14.368856',527,106,205),('karthik kumar',5,'This is good for a small gathering of 500-700 members','2026-03-28 15:04:14.372021',528,106,205),('Acu Healer Shanmugalakshmi R',5,'The wedding hall Rani Palace, which has four levels including stage setup, air-conditioning facilities,lift facility and a dining area, was excellent.\n\nIt has created a sweet experience in life that cannot be forgotten.','2026-03-28 15:04:20.163631',529,107,207),('Mallinathan',4,'A very big A.C.Mahal in Maraimalai Nagar.\nGround floor parking.\nFirst floor Dining.\nSecond floor Function hall.\nNice and calm place.\nLarge spacious for function and dining.\nStaff\'s are nice approach.\nBut cleaning is need to improve.','2026-03-28 15:04:20.166987',530,107,207),('Mugil Vanan',5,'Hall is so big and looks amazing. Food area is also so spacious. Very easy to reach the palace, get down at kattankulathur railway station and just opposite 10min walk , palace is situated','2026-03-28 15:04:20.169669',531,107,207),('Jay Kumar',5,'Best for Marriage,party functions and political events , all political events are in this party hall in chengalpattu surrounding. Really large space for peoples capacity under good parking space.','2026-03-28 15:04:20.172491',532,107,207),('Ramesh Lal',5,'ALWAR PALACE is one of the finest Mahal located at Katankalathur(1Km from SRM college). It had 5 floors and there are Mahals present inside. First floor is completely for dining and can accomdate nearly 300 members. Second floor can be used for any functions such as Wedding, Reception, etc. Basement is exclusively for parking. The main speciality of this Mahal is they provide different kinds of grand things for Bride entry, dance, DJ shows, etc. One can book this Mahal for a gradeour wedding.','2026-03-28 15:04:20.175184',533,107,207),('mohanavenkatachalam ramachandran',5,'SPS Mahal is one of the finest venues with an aesthetic ambience in Kelambakam....I am happy that I chose this Mahal for my daughter\'s  wedding. The services and the support from the owner Sri Panneerselvam and the courteous staff Sri Packiarajan & team made the occasion  a memorable one, not only for us but also to the invitees and the guests. Trust this feel will linger in the minds of everyone who use this Mahal for the happy moments in their families. The sheen of the Mahal and the shine of the beautiful lights, new chairs and effective Air Conditioners add to the fresh feel throughout the function. Thanks to the Mahal owner and the staff.','2026-03-28 15:04:23.740438',534,108,209),('Darrien Xavier',4,'Went to a marriage, 1st floor we could dine in and then 2nd floor marriage hall , pretty good , but older people might feel uneasy , there is a lift for them , pretty good standard hall could host 600-800 people','2026-03-28 15:04:23.745214',535,108,209),('Hari krishnan R',4,'Very good marriage hall with huge space. It can accomodate nearly 750 persons.  Equipped with lift and centrally air conditioned. In the case of dining hall 200 people can have food at a time. For  chennai based it will be feeling like too far. Parking facility has to be improved','2026-03-28 15:04:23.748441',536,108,209),('Sivakumar V',4,'A Kalyana mandapam in kelampakkam,  Chennai.  It has spacious  halls for  the function and for dining. Open car parking.\nWell maintained. Cost - wise , it is  as much as other mandapams with  similar facilities  at such locations.','2026-03-28 15:04:23.751687',537,108,209),('Karthick K',5,'Nice place with full amenities to host big to small events and family function.\n\nFully centralized AC and more car parking. Well located and easy to access.\n\nIt includes rooms for guest, kitchen and dining area in each of the floors.','2026-03-28 15:04:23.754759',538,108,209),('Jayakumar Wilson',5,'Big mahal, airconditined, maintained very clean. Dining hall is spacious. Good parking facility is available.','2026-03-28 15:04:28.082681',539,109,211),('Mr JW',4,'Very good hall\n\nAmple space for car parking . One of the biggest parking in Chennai\n\nHuge hall with more than 500 seating capacity\n\nHuge dining area\n\nNeat and clean\n\nWell built new property\n\nRecommended','2026-03-28 15:04:28.084223',540,109,211),('Dinesh Kumar Arumugam',4,'Very spacious marriage hall in and around Kundrathur and Porur.\n\nPlenty of cars can park and no worry on that. Marriage hall at 2nd floor and dinning at 1st floor, don\'t the reason for this.\n\nReception area very wide and people can see the function clearly.\n\nOnly thing, six rooms only available at this Mandapam. They should have called more compare the capacity and very difficult, unfortunate there is no nearby hotels and accommodation available.\n\nThis is far away from city, but local residents can go for it for big functions. Rates are little high, but no option.','2026-03-28 15:04:28.085897',541,109,211),('SIVA KUMAR',3,'Well spacious function hall, dining and parking.\nBut roadside name board should be changed like STAR HOTEL entrance and some more gardening will boost the attraction','2026-03-28 15:04:28.087699',542,109,211),('Rajan C G',5,'Well maintained, nice place  for wedding ceremony. Karne dining hall at first floor, Mandapam at 2nd floor . Can easily accommodate 30 cars in CCP at ground floor. Also there is big space for more than 50 cars behind.','2026-03-28 15:04:28.089304',543,109,211),('Ar Ram Ki',4,'Bang on the main road, easy to access. Spacious Frontage to park ample cars and perform and plan any inviting activities. Ample car parking in the rear. 2 Driveway is there. Dining in the ground floor with kitchen in the rear to easy access and maintenance.\n\nHall is pretty big and has 2 Dias on opposite sides. AC is good. Acoustic needs to be improved and I did not see any lift. If they have lift it will help elderly people to access.','2026-03-28 15:04:31.068959',544,110,213),('srineevasan subramanian',4,'AC hall is good. The rooms for the guests which is situated nearby car parking lot with 2 floors were good.\n\nSuggestion to improve is - the bride and bridegroom room & the rooms behind the stage can be improved a lot.\n\nFurther in all the rooms, they can give the AC remote control and the Fan regulator for betterment of guests.','2026-03-28 15:04:31.073748',545,110,213),('Baskaran Thirunavukkarasu',5,'We conducted marriage for my son on February 06/2026. Kalyanam Mandapam is so good and the mgmt team helped in a professional way. Thank you so much to the owner and the team','2026-03-28 15:04:31.077222',546,110,213),('Boopalan Sankar',1,'Money mind in Mandapam. In near locations have good and affordabe so and design have also he will money money total not worth for 1 lakh for doing your worderful day here so pls consider. Thank you I have experienced that.','2026-03-28 15:04:31.080372',547,110,213),('Vedachalam Muralidharan',4,'Marriage hall is good which can accommodate approximately 700 to 800 people. Parking is okay','2026-03-28 15:04:31.083767',548,110,213),('priyadarshini TD',5,'This place has a beautiful spacious hall which can fit 350 to 400 people. Parking space upto 50 cars. Dinning space upto 135.\n\nThe owner as well the manager are very professional, kind enough to explain about the place and their hall features. I would recommend this place for your family functions.\n\nThe stage decoration is done by jp palace team.','2026-03-28 15:04:33.994903',549,111,215),('vignesh D',4,'It is located near maraimailar nagar railway station.\nGood and nice place with humble parking .\nCleanliness - average .\nSpace - very good.','2026-03-28 15:04:33.997206',550,111,215),('sathish kumar',5,'Very comfortable place, big stage,hall and good location from GST Road, parking space good..  infrastructure super 👌','2026-03-28 15:04:33.999480',551,111,215),('Ramaswamy Jayaraman',5,'Fantastic marriage hall. Lots of space. Carparking is available. Easy to locate','2026-03-28 15:04:34.003637',552,111,215),('Dhananjayan S',5,'There need a parking asst.Most imp. the entrance always occupied by others two Wheelers.Need to hv a watch man atleast at the fuctiin time and the organisers may be charged,if want the the gust could be chatged and most may happily pay rather to handle the hurdles.Thanks.','2026-03-28 15:04:34.006944',553,111,215),('gautham sankar',3,'The hall is quite big, but the rooms aren\'t that well maintained. Also you only get very limited amount of cots(around 5)but there are ample amount of beds at an affordable rate. Overall if you want a grand wedding this is the venue.','2026-03-28 15:04:38.048759',554,112,217),('Lakshminarayanan',5,'A nice spacious wedding hall  for various function. With parking area for four and two wheeler on the main road. Spacious dining hall. Lifts  and stairs available to move from one floor to another. Rooms also sufficient.','2026-03-28 15:04:38.051245',555,112,217),('Srividhya Venkatesh',5,'AC in the hall was good. Ample car parking. Dining hall is spacious. It\'s cheap too.. run by Gujarati trust..1000 members seating capacity','2026-03-28 15:04:38.054119',556,112,217),('செல்வம் சுப்பிரமணியம்',4,'Very big marraige hall.\nWalkable distance from bus stand.\nSituated in main road.\nVery well maintained.\nAround 300 vehicles can be parked.\n2 Lifts is available.\nMarriage hall is  in 2 nd floor.\nAsking 500 peopLe can sit\nDinning hall is in 1 at floor.\nAround 400 people can sit for dining.','2026-03-28 15:04:38.056295',557,112,217),('Manigandan G',4,'Good, species,\nPrime location,\nNearby bus stops\nParking is well designed\nHuge parking space\nLift provision is available\nGreat view\nGreat location','2026-03-28 15:04:38.058893',558,112,217),('Srinithi Rajendran',4,'My first time here and I genuinely wish more people invite me to functions at this venue. That is the kind of benchmark this place has set.\n\nIt was my cousin brother’s wedding and we had a full vegetarian menu planned across three sessions, dinner, breakfast and lunch. Everything was handled exceptionally well. From the ground staff to the serving team, buffet management, food quality and cleaning crew, the entire operation was super organised, timely and maintained with great discipline.\n\nThe venue has great parking space, which makes it very convenient for guests. It also has multiple wedding halls, along with lifts and escalators, making movement smooth and comfortable for elders and large gatherings. The entire space is spacious with a lovely ambience that adds to the overall experience.\n\nThey do charge on the higher side, but they ensure the output is consistent and top notch in every aspect of execution. The food quality across all three sessions was impressive and guests were truly satisfied.\n\nThe rooms are decent and comfortable, though the washrooms could definitely be improved. However, if your priority is hosting a function with a well executed menu and smooth coordination in a grand setting, this is a great choice.\n\nHighly recommended.','2026-03-28 15:04:40.848775',559,113,219),('Deepika Deivabalan',5,'We hosted my brother’s wedding and reception at M Weddings & Conventions, Chennai, and the experience was truly wonderful. The entire team was extremely professional, supportive, and kind throughout the event.\n\nOur guests had great feedback about the stay, food, and overall hospitality. The staff attended to every request politely and ensured that our guests were comfortable at all times.\n\nThe wedding breakfast and lunch were excellent and widely appreciated by everyone. The décor team was also very patient and accommodating with our requirements, and they executed everything beautifully.\n\nAs a family, we were extremely satisfied with the service and hospitality provided by the team at M Weddings & Conventions. We would definitely recommend this venue to our friends and family for their special occasions.','2026-03-28 15:04:40.852084',560,113,219),('Udaya Sankar',5,'Heartfelt thanks to Chef Umapathi and the entire culinary team at M WEDDING and Conventions for the outstanding buffet arranged on 21st February 2026.\n\nEvery dish was delicious, perfectly cooked, and beautifully presented. The variety, authentic taste, and quality truly impressed all our guests, and many personally appreciated the food.\n\nSpecial compliments to Chef Umapathi for maintaining consistency, hygiene, and rich flavors across the spread. The buffet added great value and elegance to the occasion and made the event even more memorable.\n\nWishing the team continued success and looking forward to many more wonderful experiences.','2026-03-28 15:04:40.855809',561,113,219),('Kishan V P',5,'Very nice and spacious a)c hall. Escalator and ample xar parking with valetwas wonderful.\n\nA/C hall wuth good ambience.','2026-03-28 15:04:40.859762',562,113,219),('Srinivasan B',5,'M-Convention is an excellent venue for hosting a wide range of events. The complex houses multiple spacious halls within the same premises, making it highly convenient for conducting parallel functions, conferences, weddings, and large gatherings. The infrastructure is well planned, and the premises are neatly maintained.\n\nOne of its major advantages is the ample and well-organized parking space, which comfortably accommodates a large number of vehicles without congestion. In addition to providing the venue, M-Convention also offers catering and event management services, enabling clients to coordinate all event requirements under one roof.\n\nThe only drawback is the approach road, as the connectivity and road condition leading to the venue are not very good. However, once inside the premises, the overall facilities and services provide a satisfying experience.','2026-03-28 15:04:40.862982',563,113,219),('Ramakrishnan Nagasubramani',5,'It\'s located inthe prime area. Decent and good. But there\'s no place for cooking to serve hot.','2026-03-28 15:04:44.793956',564,114,221),('Arun P C',5,'This function hall is medium-sized and can accommodate up to 500 people at a time. The food court is located above the hall and there is a balcony with seating. It\'s a good place to organize birthdays, weddings, and other parties with an average crowd of around 500 people. The only drawback is that the parking area is not very spacious. Function hall is just 100 meters from the main road, where you can easily catch buses.','2026-03-28 15:04:44.797606',565,114,221),('Karthikeyan Balamani MSc MBA',5,'Rajeshwari Navaraj Mahal – A Perfect Venue for Weddings & Events! 💍🎉\n\nI recently attended an event at Rajeshwari Navaraj Mahal, and it was a great experience.\n\n✅ Stage – Well-decorated and spacious, perfect for ceremonies. 🎭✨\n✅ Parking – Ample space for both cars and bikes. 🚗🛵\n✅ Dining Area – Well-organized with hygienic food service. 🍽️👌\n✅ Restrooms – Clean and well-maintained. 🚻✨\n✅ Ambience – Beautiful interiors with good lighting and ventilation. 🌟🏛️\n\nOverall, a well-maintained venue with great facilities! Highly recommended for weddings and special occasions. 🎊🥳','2026-03-28 15:04:44.800676',566,114,221),('Mathi M',4,'Nice place for family functions, with ground floor parking, first floor with balkani, dinner on the second floor, lift facilities are added.','2026-03-28 15:04:44.804746',567,114,221),('Richard',3,'Medium sized hall with Ac but unfortunately parking facility is bad. Only 8 cars can be parked and it\'s very congested.','2026-03-28 15:04:44.808156',568,114,221),('Sudhakar G D',4,'Absolutely amazing marriage hall! The space is huge, well-designed, and can comfortably accommodate a large number of guests. The interiors are elegant, the lighting is beautiful, and everything feels very well maintained. Parking was spacious and convenient, which made things stress-free for guests. Overall, it’s a perfect venue for weddings and big celebrations—highly recommended!','2026-03-28 15:04:46.964995',569,115,223),('Akshay S S',5,'Recently visited Harsha Gardens and it’s easily one of the grandest and most beautiful venues! The place is huge with spacious main hall, lovely green lawn and a butterfly fountain.\nEverything from the lighting and decor to cleanliness was top notch. Staffs were super polite and supportive. Parking was ample and location is right on the main road.\nIt’s a bit far from the main city and few rooms are compact. but that aside, this place is perfect for weddings, receptions and big celebrations. Totally loved the vibe here and would definitely recommend it to anyone planning an event around Padappai!','2026-03-28 15:04:46.968081',570,115,223),('Ramana\'s',5,'very nice Good maintanance plenty of Space Good coulatory','2026-03-28 15:04:46.971171',571,115,223),('Ganapathiappan Sankaran.C.',3,'The hall is located on the outskirts of Chennai, conveniently situated on the main road. The ground floor houses the dining area and is equipped with a ramp for easy access by the elderly and physically challenged. A lift is available to reach the first floor, where the main function hall is located. The hall can accommodate around 500 guests and offers ample car parking space. There is also a spacious open area with a beautifully maintained garden and an attractive water fountain.\nHowever, the toilets require attention — the ladies’ restroom is on the ground floor and the men’s restroom is on the first floor, both of which need basic maintenance improvements. Guest rooms are available on the second floor for stay arrangements.','2026-03-28 15:04:46.974211',572,115,223),('lidiya lavanya',4,'Beautiful garden with a well-maintained function area—perfect for every events. Peaceful atmosphere, though a few more shaded spots would make it even better','2026-03-28 15:04:46.977357',573,115,223),('Dinesh Kumar Arumugam',4,'Saidayappa Kalyana Mandapam, situated near Chennai, is an old and renowned venue that can accommodate large crowds.\n\nIts proximity to Poonamallee and ample parking space make it an attractive option. The fully air-conditioned hall has a capacity of over 500 and features a unique two-way staircase. However, the air conditioning could be enhanced for better comfort during hot weather.\n\nAlthough the venue is pricey, it offers a wide range of amenities, making it suitable for those seeking a luxurious experience. The venue is not only ideal for functions but also for community gatherings.\n\nTo maintain high standards of hygiene, improvements to the interior and wash areas are necessary. The dining area, located on the ground floor, offers easy access and can accommodate over 250 guests.\n\nIf budget is not a constraint, Saidayappa Kalyana Mandapam is an excellent choice for hosting grand and memorable events.','2026-03-28 15:04:51.509937',574,116,225),('devaraj dhanakotti',5,'This Marriage Hall is the best place for Marriages in and around Chennai City because it is on the outskirts of City area and located on the Highway, easier commutation or transport. Everyone can have pleasant time with relatives, friends and family. The main hall is located in first floor and the dining area is located in the ground floor making the perfect balance for the people to roam around without hassles. Overall it can accomodate around 1500~2000 people with all the comforts. The parking area can accommodate around 20 cars. Separate two wheeler parking area also available. Entrance garden and pond with the founders statue is the highlight location for taking some good memorable photos.','2026-03-28 15:04:51.512841',575,116,225),('Prabhu P',5,'The location is left side on the highway, if you are driving from Chennai.\n\nWell suited for large events ~1000+ people can be easily managed, no parking trouble for 2-wheelers and 4-wheelers.\n\nOne of the traditional, spacious and nicely maintained place for wedding or any big events.','2026-03-28 15:04:51.514984',576,116,225),('Aravinth Kumar',4,'It\'s in Poonamallee - Bangalore highway road, so fantastic connectivity. It is just 2 km from Chennai outer ring road. Opposite to panimalar college. It has ample car parking facilities before the Mandapam. Two wheeler parking lot is comparatively smaller along the side.','2026-03-28 15:04:51.517147',577,116,225),('Muthu',4,'Well spacious marriage hall outskirts of Chennai. It is in the main road of the highway. Has lot of parking space. Although it is far away, but nice marriage hall. Well maintained. It is A/C marriage hall. First floor has big hall. Ground floor dining hall.','2026-03-28 15:04:51.519086',578,116,225),('P Sridhar',5,'Pretty decent Marriage hall with all major amenities situated close to Ambattur Telephone Exchange.\n\nCentralized A/c is too good in Hall as well as in Dining area.\n\nAmple Car Parking is there; ofcourse Valet Parking only.\n\nIt\'s a worthy choice for people in and around Ambattur area.','2026-03-28 15:04:55.156842',579,117,227),('manickavasagam bala',5,'Very good, only issues the Google map is not updated the location properly where it drops on the flyover stop, it causes lot of inconvenience.\nRequest the hotel to update the right location in Google which will help the people.\n\nOther wise everything was good to go for any function, very spacious','2026-03-28 15:04:55.160115',580,117,227),('Hari Krishnan',5,'Spacious hall with max seating capacity of 450-500 people comfortably. Car parking space available in ground floor. Lift services are there so elders can be comfortable as well. Rest rooms are clean and hygiene with separate gender markings. Overall a great hall for functions and ceremonies','2026-03-28 15:04:55.163366',581,117,227),('Muraleedharan Kaithrikovil',4,'Class ambia6 and suffi6 car parking. But don\'t follow Google map. That will guide you thru highway. Then you have to re route about 15 KM to reach the location. You r supposed to exit the highway well in advance to reach the venue.','2026-03-28 15:04:55.167010',582,117,227),('SHEIK GANI',5,'Awesome and well maintained This place is amazing wonderfully planned for any kind off function that can be celebrated here. The food is also amazing tastes yummy and the Serivce is so cultural that you will never have to shout or wait for that extra food. So watchful grand function great parking  available','2026-03-28 15:04:55.170733',583,117,227),('Ramesh S N',4,'Big air conditioned hall suitable for weddings with ding hall at ground floor and first floor. The reception stage is big and attractive.  The parking can accommodate close to 40 cars easily.  Nice location straight in arcot road cl9se to vadapalani temple','2026-03-28 15:04:57.989238',584,118,229),('Praveena Puttum',4,'Hall is a spacious venue with a very large dining area that can comfortably handle big gatherings. Car and bike parking can be managed well, making it convenient for guests. The assistants and staff maintain good cleanliness standards, adding to the overall experience. As the property was previously a theatre, the hall has a grand layout with a wide stage and prominent highlights that make events look impressive. The air conditioning works very well, keeping the space comfortable even for large crowds. Overall, the hall is big, functional, and suitable for weddings and major functions.','2026-03-28 15:04:57.992145',585,118,229),('VG Ganesan',5,'Excellent place for marriage functions. Both dining and after dining attached. They have a separate entrance as well after finishing dining which is highly appreciated. They have wheel chair accessibility and grill to hold wherever possible. Excellent restroom. Kudos to management','2026-03-28 15:04:57.996662',586,118,229),('Mandolin Saiganesh',5,'Very nice hall..Our Saiswarangal Band shares Pleasant memories of performing at this venue many times at the reception event..So glad that we made it a memorable occasion for our clients..','2026-03-28 15:04:57.999349',587,118,229),('GLOBE TROTTER',4,'Padma Ram Mahal @ Arcot Road is a modern marriage hall with a huge parking lot ( 30  Cars approx plus 2 Wheelers ) . Valet parking is available.\nThe hall can easily accommodate about 750 guests and the dining hall about 250 .\nThe hall is extremely well maintained , bright and classy . The main dias is big - decorators have a wide area to do their decors . Overall , a good Marriage Hall in the heart of the City.','2026-03-28 15:04:58.003700',588,118,229),('jayashree kidambi',5,'I had the pleasure of getting my makeup done for a Saree Symphony Ramp Walk competition. For the prelims I took Dhivyaa\'s  help to do a special double saree draping , simple hair style with bun and simple make. It gave an elegant look. And for the finals , I choose to have the traditional Andal Kondai , pinnal jadai and a simple make up. Dhivyaa did an awesome job to suit my needs by understanding what I liked and the way I wanted. She understands her clients taste. Our journey was beyond makeup, a journey of bonding and understanding one another  in a better manner. Thank you Dhivyaa for your time and efforts . I would highly recommend her services. She is very prompt and on time.','2026-03-28 16:35:35.166590',589,119,231),('shreya ananth',5,'I had an amazing and seamless experience with Dhivya. It all started with the trial..she was very open to suggestions and patiently listened to everything I wanted. On the wedding day, her team arrived on time, and to everyone’s surprise, the bride was ready well before the event start time, which left our families amazed. I absolutely loved my bridal look, and she even went out of her way to do my mom’s makeup as well. I would definitely recommend her services to anyone looking for a professional and reliable makeup artist.','2026-03-28 16:35:35.169862',590,119,231),('Swetha Sankaran',5,'Had an amazing experience working with Dhivya akka for my makeup recently. She was very professional and friendly as well. She ensured I was comfortable at all times and asked for my preferences too. She also was very particular when it came to my personal allergies and other concerns relating to makeup products and was so open to ideas. Very talented and unique. On the whole, would recommend her to all my friends and family for any type of functions, shoots or events! 😊😊','2026-03-28 16:35:35.173035',591,119,231),('Rukhmani Narayanamurthy',5,'Working with Dhivyaa was an absolute pleasure :)) She created a natural and elegant look exactly as I had wanted, while also offering thoughtful suggestions that enhanced the final result. Her approach was professional yet friendly, making the entire experience stress-free and enjoyable. She was punctual, knowledgable and ensured every detail was perfect. I would highly recommend her to anyone looking for a skilled and reliable makeup artist.','2026-03-28 16:35:35.176098',592,119,231),('Padminee Krishnan',5,'Dhivyaa is so good with her make up skills. She is very gentle, understands the needs and deliver the service quickly and efficiently. She is very friendly too. Highly recommend Allure for Sure for all your make up, styling and draping needs !!','2026-03-28 16:35:35.179153',593,119,231),('Graceline',5,'I just want to say a big thank you for making my hair beautiful and giving a fantastic pleasant change in my face.i wanted a presentable look but she went beyond that to make it absolutely  the best day of my life for making me feel beautiful for first time in my life. Everyone who saw me appreciated how beautiful I was and how great my hair was. No words to say. She is a fantastic makeup artist and hair stylist with a professional and pride in her work. Thanks again for a lovely memorable experience','2026-03-28 16:35:43.777102',594,120,232),('Priyanka V',5,'Loved my Hydra facial ! My skin felt super clean, hydrated, and glowing right after with no downtime. Relaxing and totally worth it—highly recommend! Thank you sister for the wonderful service.','2026-03-28 16:35:43.781124',595,120,232),('Aravind Elangovan',5,'We had a wonderful experience with Angel Bridal Makeup Artists for my brother’s wedding. The bride looked absolutely stunning,elegant, graceful, and glowing throughout the day. The team was so professional, friendly, and patient, and they really made the entire process smooth and stress-free. Their attention to detail and flawless work truly made the day extra special. Thank you so much for making the bride look her best on such an important occasion. Truly well done and highly recommended.','2026-03-28 16:35:43.785578',596,120,232),('judeth j',5,'Hi Sis,\n\nThank you so much for arranging such a wonderful session. I’m really happy I got the chance to join!\n\nBefore the session, I didn’t know much about self-grooming, but the way you explained each step so clearly—and showed how to use each product—was just awesome. Now, I understand my daily and weekly skincare routine really well.\n\nOnce again, thank you for organizing this amazing session!','2026-03-28 16:35:43.789451',597,120,232),('vijayalakshmi ramachandran',5,'Wonderful hairstyle done in a very short time during my seemandham function. Thank you so much Angel 🥰','2026-03-28 16:35:43.792920',598,120,232),('Sriranjani Mukundan',5,'We got Anitha to do makeup for my engagement.. she was really professional and did my makeup, hairdo and saree draping exactly the way I wanted to get done. She was so nice and accommodating of my requests and will definitely recommend.','2026-03-28 16:35:46.495371',599,121,237),('Deena Jane',5,'The makeup was subtle and warm, just the way I wanted. The finishing was so neat and elegant without being overdone. It truly made my day even more special.','2026-03-28 16:35:46.498923',600,121,237),('Sonalli Elango',5,'Excellent makeup, prefect saree draping and very friendly. Made my day beautiful with her work. Thank you Anitha akka','2026-03-28 16:35:46.502637',601,121,237),('Priya Vijay',5,'Best in work at affordable fee. Thank you  Anitha akka for your work on my valakappu and to my sister\'s engagement. You made our day beautiful and the stay was still the day end. Thankful i reached you for my big days.','2026-03-28 16:35:46.505970',602,121,237),('Rajeshwari R',5,'Very nice makeover done Anitha mam. Thank you google for helping to find good makeup artist','2026-03-28 16:35:46.509298',603,121,237),('Sweetii Over (deepi)',5,'Hi sis I have learned the saree prepleating and box folding it is very useful to new beginner  given hands-on pratice also clearly explained  really enjoyed the class and friendly too  thank to Yogi bridal studio','2026-03-28 16:35:49.551985',604,122,238),('Divya Priya',5,'I had zero knowledge about saree draping, Just came for my personal learning ,i never thought I could pre pleat so perfectly thank you yogi bridal and yogi mam for giving me this knowledge','2026-03-28 16:35:49.554580',605,122,238),('signaturekurls',5,'The Hydra facial service is exceptional. Yogi Ma\'am is very professional, friendly and made sure I was comfortable throughout the treatment. The results is noticeable - My skin feels amazing, and I highly recommend this Relaxing and Refreshing Experience.','2026-03-28 16:35:49.556206',606,122,238),('RENUKA VIJAY',5,'Hi your teaching method is  very nice , also clearly explanation, that sessions very useful  to me,and also  kind of approach very decent  like friend  your are  respectful mentor','2026-03-28 16:35:49.557696',607,122,238),('Janani Lakshmi Govindarajan',5,'I have booked for my daughters first birthday celebration. She did a fantastic job and friendly too. Each and every steps she asked according with my satisfaction she did the makeup. Its so affordable too, even she take care my daughter’s too🤣😂. 100 percent satisfaction with her makeup😍','2026-03-28 16:35:49.559141',608,122,238),('raji raghu',5,'Am totally satisfied 💗.... My dream comes true bcoz of paramu mam... When u got a correct mentor definitely we\'ll achieve our ambitions....i got most talented paramu mam now i am ready to start my career 🫰','2026-03-28 16:35:54.916630',609,123,239),('Harini prakash sai',5,'I already had a basic understanding of makeup, but I joined this course to update and enhance my skills. The training was conducted with a lot of patience, and they provided me with in-depth knowledge on every aspect of makeup. The course was truly worth learning, as it helped me gain a clear, detailed, and professional-level understanding.','2026-03-28 16:35:54.919777',610,123,239),('Janani Sri',5,'I had the wonderful opportunity to attend Paramu Mam’s Advanced Makeup Class (Aug 13–30, 2025) and it was truly an amazing experience! ✨\n\nHer teaching style is very professional yet friendly, making even advanced techniques easy to understand. She not only explained the latest trends in makeup but also gave us hands-on practice with detailed guidance. Each session was structured, interactive, and packed with tips and tricks that are not usually shared elsewhere.\n\nWhat I loved most was her patience in clearing doubts, her attention to detail, and the way she encouraged creativity in every student. I now feel much more confident with advanced looks, from bridal to editorial styles.\n\nHighly recommend Paramu Mam’s classes to anyone who wants to take their makeup skills to the next level. 💄👏','2026-03-28 16:35:54.923112',611,123,239),('Gokula Sanjay talks',5,'Thank you so much mom.... learned very well... you are very sweet mom, team also very supportive... nail art class is also very good....','2026-03-28 16:35:54.926427',612,123,239),('Sowndarya Lakshmi J',5,'I truly enjoyed your master class mam! 🌟 It was such a valuable experience—I\'ve learned so many new techniques and also gained deeper insights into the art of makeup. Your passion and clarity have truly inspired me mam, and I now feel even more confident and motivated to grow in this field. 💄✨\nThank you for sharing your knowledge so generously. Looking forward to learning more from you in the future!','2026-03-28 16:35:54.929592',613,123,239),('Maheswari Ramesh',5,'I had the best experience with Deepika as my makeup artist for my wedding. Being a dusky girl, I was a little worried about how the makeup would turn out, but she did complete justice to my skin tone and made me feel beautiful in my own skin. She knows how to enhance natural beauty without overdoing it, and that truly impressed me. Her work is amazing and she is perfect for all skin types. I personally experienced her talent, and even in the future, if I ever need makeup, I would blindly choose Deepika again. Highly recommended ♥✨','2026-03-28 16:36:03.391087',614,124,244),('SANGEETHA V',5,'Deepika makeup was super it matched the skin tone perfectly without being overdone Even during the trial makeup itself I confirmed that only she should do my makeup she is the best From now on I will book her for all my events. The makeup was correct without being overdone and she is also a very friendly person they truly made this day memorable thankyou so much ♥️♥️','2026-03-28 16:36:03.394934',615,124,244),('Aishwarya kannan',5,'Deepika did my reception and marriage look. Both was fabulous and she finished everything within the time. It never felt like a makeup session instead it was like a jamming session with our friends 😄','2026-03-28 16:36:03.398497',616,124,244),('Saravanan N',5,'From my experience with her. I definitely recommend... Blindly choose Deepika for makeup... She will never disappoint your expectations....','2026-03-28 16:36:03.402375',617,124,244),('Swetha Segajanandam',5,'It was a very nice experience to book Deepika for my baby shower makeup. She did her best and result of her efforts came beautifully. I got many compliments for the whole look❤️\n\nAll the best keep doing the work that you are doing🙂','2026-03-28 16:36:03.405829',618,124,244),('S M',5,'Thanks a lot for the great work for our bride Kaviya yesterday..\n\nTasleem was friendly and  helpful from the beginning..she was coordinating really well\n\nSebantina was very professional with Salon service.\n\nNamitha was really such great and dedicated artist..we are really impressed with all the patience she was handing. Extremely kind and professional towards her never give up spirit.\n\nAkshara, Thanks a lot for accepting and understanding the client need.\nYou have very nice bunch of resources over all...Great teamwork by Team Akshara..🥰💞💐🎉\nEvent Date : 5 March 2026\nOccasion: Engagement','2026-03-28 16:36:06.508141',619,125,249),('Grace Doll',5,'I’m extremely happy with my first Botox hair treatment experience. The results came out beautifully my hair feels healthier and looks amazing. Big thanks to the hairdresser for the care, patience, and excellent work. Will definitely visit again the hairdresser did an amazing job and made me feel very comfortable. Thank you for the wonderful service....\nShe made my day ❤️ 💕 💗 💙','2026-03-28 16:36:06.512809',620,125,249),('Jeevitha R',5,'I had a wonderful experience at Akshara Bridal Studio! I visited for a haircut, and Sebastian did an excellent job. She was extremely kind, patient, and very friendly throughout the session. She listened to what I wanted and gave me exactly the look I had in mind. I really appreciated how comfortable and relaxed she made me feel during the entire process. The studio has a pleasant atmosphere, and the staff are also welcoming and professional. Overall, it was a really nice experience, and I’d highly recommend this place to anyone looking for quality service and a friendly stylist.','2026-03-28 16:36:06.516192',621,125,249),('Sarah Antony',5,'I am a sensitive skin person and I chose my wedding makeup only with akshara, I was a Malayalam christian bride. Since i had quite a not a good experience with my engagement with another person, I had hard time choosing Makeover artist but when I reached akshara bridal studio they were patient enough to do the trial in the late evening and they use separate brushes for each client and it wasnot harming my face skin. So then I chose Akshara for my wedding makeup and everybody appreciated their good work on my face specially my Husband, also my skin remain healthy the day after without reacting to the cosmetics. Hema maam uses all imported cosmetics safe to skin. Thank you Hema Maam. Also special thanks to Aishu who did the pencil curl hair do the exactly same as I asked for, she gains so much trust. Curly hair girls pls do choose her for the curl hair styles. Big thanks to the draping, person who did touch up, the entire team. Thank you thank you  ♥','2026-03-28 16:36:06.519809',622,125,249),('Indhumathi Sundaram',5,'Akshara Beauty Salon did an extraordinary job, I went for manicure, hair setup and deTan. They did a fantastic job special mention to Sebastian. Their customer service was good plus their services. The staffs were friendly and approachable. Recommended.','2026-03-28 16:36:06.525086',623,125,249),('Mp Dheena',5,'Makeup artist noor the best artist for my wedding. The work so beautiful don my wife bridel look. So nice work thank you noor sir','2026-03-28 16:36:16.623810',624,126,250),('Shruthy laya',5,'I had the pleasure of Noor doing my hair and makeup for my wedding and reception .\nVery experienced professional and his makeup was awesome , he has given me perfect look as I wished for. Moreover he was very friendly and made me feel comfortable . Very good service and I loved this . Thank you so much , great work','2026-03-28 16:36:16.626788',625,126,250),('anand periasamy',5,'I enlisted Noor\'s makeup services for my brother\'s wedding, and I\'m immensely grateful. The flawless artistry on his big day surpassed my expectations, leaving him looking radiant. Your professionalism and skill ensured a stress-free and enjoyable experience.','2026-03-28 16:36:16.630475',626,126,250),('Palanivel K',5,'Noor, my friend, has been our family\'s go-to makeup artist for weddings. With each event, our family members consistently request his services. However, due to his busy schedule, securing his bookings has become increasingly challenging. I wish him all the best in his thriving career.','2026-03-28 16:36:16.634577',627,126,250),('chelladurai kumar',5,'Noor, a makeup artist from Chennai, caught my attention through a Google search. Although I initially had doubts about his availability for our function in Bangalore, I reached out to him. To my delight, he accepted the offer and provided makeup services for everyone. The outcome was fantastic, and everyone was pleased with his work.','2026-03-28 16:36:16.638085',628,126,250),('Anitha Rajesh Kumar',5,'I have been choosing Beyond Passion since my wedding. I am so glad I found them! :)\nVery professional, polite and neat service. Always on time. They recently dolled me up for my baby shower as well. Quality of products used is very good. Flawless look and it also had such good stay!\nPriya did such a wonderful job! Definitely gonna keep coming back & recommending you to my friends & family.. ❤️','2026-03-28 16:36:24.635222',629,127,255),('Hydrinchristhala Vasu',5,'I absolutely love the makeup and she has done and excellent job with more patience and explaining very well about all detailing . Exactly how I want my look to be done she has done the same .  💯 will recommend beyond passion make up to  my friends and relatives too. I m soo happy to work with u ppl. Nivedita did a great job.','2026-03-28 16:36:24.641739',630,127,255),('Shivani Krishnamurthy',5,'I just wanted to say a MASSIVE THANK YOU for the makeup you did on myself, my mum and my sister on my wedding day in August!!! You were so lovely and such a calming influence on the day of the wedding, I loved everything about the makeup and it lasted right until the end of the night, even after some pretty energetic dancing!!!\nMagi is a fabulous make up artist. She knows the ins and outs of every product she uses, and takes care to ensure that her clients feel comfortable and great about themselves! She was very gentle with my face and unlike a lot of MUAs, was very considerate when it came to me putting in suggestions of my own – we worked to create my looks together! Kudos to  Magi\nI cannot forget the day when Magi had come home to meet us all and take our inputs. She was so sincere and honest that I signed her up without Trial makeup. My every conversation with Magi has been fruitful and I felt very pretty during the events. Everyone keep praising me about the makeup till date and few of them have taken up the contact. The team was always 15 minutes prior to the discussed time. Priya did a great work with my Bengali drape and hairstyle. She is a great intern. Hema was a sweetheart. Mom and my sister loved her work.\nOverall Magi is a superstar and an asset to Beyond Passion. I give Magi much more than 5 stars if possible. Well i am looking forward to be dolled up for the future events. Beyond passion will go a long way with talented stars like Magi, Priya and Hema.\nTo give more details It was 2 days and 4 events of makeup for the 3 of us. I am so happy to have signed up Beyond passion for all the events. Magi made sure there is variation in my makeup for all the events and Priya is a star in the making.','2026-03-28 16:36:24.643456',631,127,255),('Anil Kumar',5,'I just want to say a massive thank you for making me look so beautiful on our special day. So many people complimented me on how gorgeous I looked, and I had lots of comments on the stunning eyes too! 🥰Thank you also for doing my hair which i showed you from a picture.\n\nYou really made me feel at ease for me to get ready\n\nI really enjoyed the moment of being a bride and a heroine','2026-03-28 16:36:24.644935',632,127,255),('Kirthika Reddy',1,'I regret to say that my engagement day was marred by a disappointing experience with Dhivya, my makeup artist.\n\nDespite being booked for my event, she arrived late, citing traffic as an excuse. It was evident she had another wedding scheduled, which she prioritized over mine, ultimately spoiling my special day.\n\nCharging a hefty fee for a mere 15 minutes of makeup application without offering an apology further exacerbated the situation.\n\nI urge others to consider these factors before booking her services.\n\nFor these people it’s about money, for us it’s about our special day.','2026-03-28 16:36:24.646430',633,127,255),('Suganya Jayant',1,'Worst makeup artist I have seen in my life. She didn’t know how to drape saree itself , she spoiled my 2 lak rupee saree with high heat. Makeup n hairstyle not even stand for one hour. High disappointed on my big day. I paid Rs. 8500 for makeup(Babyshower) but this make didn’t worth for 2000. Without finishing makeup she s keep on asking money. For Hairstyle I should give “00000” marks , veryyy worst. Totally I feel like she s scammer. Highly not recommended 👎🏻👎🏻👎🏻👎🏻👎🏻👎🏻👎🏻👎🏻👎🏻👎🏻👎🏻','2026-03-28 16:36:28.426417',634,128,260),('Kamalini sarasri',5,'We approached her via Instagram and She made my day very beautiful as I want my Makeover to be Match my skintone and she did it superbly.. Also I asked her to do Double Saree Draping & It was wonderful as well..She suggests Everything that suits me perfectly..Thank you Very much JB makeups..','2026-03-28 16:36:28.429200',635,128,260),('Kowsalya Udhaya',5,'I am extremely happy with my bridal makeup and received many compliments from friends and family. I would highly recommend this beauty parlour to any bride looking for elegant, long-lasting, and professional bridal makeup.','2026-03-28 16:36:28.432366',636,128,260),('Narmadha Srinivasan',5,'I attended 5 days self grooming class.\nMam was so sweet, she explained everything in a simple and neat way, I had really a feeble knowledge about makeup, but now after completing the class I can actually do a party makeup for myself..\nI learned a lot of hairstyles, box folding method of saree and much more..\nReally loved the sessions 🩷','2026-03-28 16:36:28.434932',637,128,260),('Deepika Priyanka',5,'She made my baby shower function so beautiful and awesome 🥰she suggests which suits correctly to me\nAnd done it beautiful. The makeup was so light and even tone to my skin . I really loved it very much akka and she also so kind and friendly person. Thank you akka 🥰\nI really refer to my friends akka ❤️🫂','2026-03-28 16:36:28.438489',638,128,260),('Vaishnavi Suresh',5,'Had an amazing experience with Nithya mam! Despite a last-minute call and no prior planning, she handled everything so professionally and did a fantastic job. Truly skilled and dedicated—highly recommend her!','2026-03-28 16:36:36.759616',639,129,261),('Sripriya Raman',5,'Awesome design Nithya. Very creative. Liked your prompt service. Even after so many days mehendi stayed in both hands. Definitely will go with her service again.','2026-03-28 16:36:36.763424',640,129,261),('Padmini',5,'Very good experience, she made me feel great about myself and the makeup was on point.','2026-03-28 16:36:36.767215',641,129,261),('Subha Dharshini R',5,'I love your work 😍properly time managed👌made a excellent work for all 4 people within the limited time...Thank you so much','2026-03-28 16:36:36.770791',642,129,261),('Monika Venkatesan',5,'She is very professional and it felt like having one of mu frnds doing my makeup for my engagement. The makeup is long-lasting and no irritations on skin. The mehendi and its stain are absolutely gorgeous.Got compliments for the both the works.','2026-03-28 16:36:36.774132',643,129,261),('Shankar Elumalai',5,'I booked this Bridal Makeup Artist in Chennai for my wedding, and the experience was truly amazing from start to finish. As a groom, I was surprised how perfectly the Groom Makeup Chennai was done to give me a fresh and confident look. The artist is a very Professional Makeup Artist in Chennai who understands skin tone and facial structure well. Being a Wedding Makeup Artist in Chennai, he knew exactly how to make me camera-ready without overdoing it. I also noticed why he is listed among the Top Makeup Artist in Chennai by many people. The pricing was clear and fair, which makes him a Best Makeup Artist in Chennai With Price. For anyone searching for a Makeup Artist in Chennai For Wedding, I strongly recommend this service.','2026-03-28 16:36:46.163777',644,130,266),('V G Surya',5,'The Wedding Make Up Artist in Chennai made my wedding preparation very easy. The Professional Makeup Artist in Chennai listened carefully to my needs. The Makeup Service in Chennai was organized and clean. The Bridal Makeup Service gave me a confident groom look. The Professional Makeup looked natural in real life and photos. The Wedding Makeup Service lasted throughout the ceremony. I felt relaxed during the entire process. My family was very happy with the results. This is the Best Wedding Makeup Service.','2026-03-28 16:36:46.172676',645,130,266),('Sakthivel S',5,'Choosing the Best Bridal Makeup Artist in Chennai was one of the best decisions for my wedding. The Wedding Makeup Artist in Chennai focused on groom-specific makeup needs. The Makeup Service gave me a polished and fresh appearance. The Professional Makeup Service balanced my skin tone perfectly. The Bridal Make Up Chennai finish looked very natural. I received many compliments throughout the wedding. This is truly the Best Makeup Service for any groom.','2026-03-28 16:36:46.177876',646,130,266),('Ramesh Kumar',5,'Vijay is truly gifted when it comes to men’s makeup and grooming. I approached him with very little idea about how groom makeup works, but he guided me patiently. He explained every step clearly and made sure I was comfortable. The final outcome was stunning — clean, natural, and very photogenic. He also gave good suggestions for skincare before the wedding, which helped improve my overall look. The makeup stayed perfect through hours of events and photography. His calm attitude and professionalism made the entire experience stress-free. I would strongly recommend him to all grooms in Chennai!','2026-03-28 16:36:46.181830',647,130,266),('Abdul Ameed',5,'I wanted a natural look for my wedding, and he completely understood my preference. The makeup didn’t look heavy, and it stayed perfect till the end of the event. He was patient and ensured every detail was done right. My family was so impressed that they also booked him for other functions. His work truly enhances natural beauty without overdoing it. If you’re searching for the best bridal makeup artist in Chennai, I’d say he’s the one!','2026-03-28 16:36:46.183615',648,130,266),('Iniya S',5,'It\'s an honest review....Bhavani is a professional makeup artist...in the sense...she is using excellent makeup products....and also gave a natural look...and budget friendly....','2026-03-28 16:36:54.380307',649,131,271),('Allen Thomas',5,'Excellent work done by @bhavasmakeup artistry, Thank you for making our special day so bright with your makeup skills.','2026-03-28 16:36:54.383219',650,131,271),('Varshini',5,'I booked senior artists from Bhavana\'s team for my engagement\'s makeover, hairstyling and saree draping and for groom\'s makeover and hairstyling.\nAmazing work. Very professional and punctual.\n\nThough 3 hours was asked for the entire get ready for me and 1/2 hour for groom,  everything was completed within 2 hours for both bride and groom. It helped us to be relaxed and gave us extra time to enjoy our day.\n\nThe output was amazing. Our skins looked very natural yet flawless. Very minimal base and minimal products. We were delivered what we asked for.\n\nAlso, had to mention, I reached out to Bhavana just 1 week before my event as my previous MUA\'s booking got cancelled. Somehow, she accomodated us in their tight schedule.\n\nThanks a lot to the team - Bhavana, Priyantha and Swetha.\n\nSpecial thanks to Priyantha for giving us a wonderful look and very comfortable and happy experience ♥️','2026-03-28 16:36:57.313098',651,132,276),('Akshi Anvi',5,'I had my wedding and reception makeup done by Bhavana and I’m extremely happy with the overall experience. She was very professional, patient, and understood exactly the look I wanted. The makeup looked elegant, long-lasting, and felt very comfortable throughout the event.\nThe attention to detail, hairstyle, and finishing touches were absolutely perfect and I received so many compliments from everyone. The team made me feel calm and confident on my special day☺️.\nHighly recommend their service for anyone looking for beautiful and flawless makeup. Thank you for making my day even more special❤️☺️','2026-03-28 16:36:57.316601',652,132,276),('Gayathri B',5,'Hi Bhavana,\n\nI Absolutely loved my makeup today😍😇\nIt looked flawless and made me feel so confident—and stress-free throughout my engagement 🤗\nNothing got smudged, and the makeup stayed perfect throughout.\nI truly loved your work and felt beautiful the whole time ✨ Again, thank you so much for your work..\n\nWanna take a moment to appreciate Surya’s work also, she did my hair very well, and my saree draping was on point!!! Thanks to you and your team, ❤️ Iam excited to get dolled up again by you for my wedding too🤗🤗','2026-03-28 16:36:57.320061',653,132,276),('Nandhini Manickaraj',5,'I recently got my wedding makeup done by Bhavana, and I couldn’t be happier with the experience. The makeup was absolutely beautiful and perfectly enhanced my features without looking heavy at all. Bhavana was extremely professional, calm, and attentive to what I wanted. She clearly understood my preferences and delivered exactly the look I had in mind. The saree draping was also perfect. The best part was how well everything photographed. I received so many compliments especially for my wedding look and felt confident and comfortable the entire time.','2026-03-28 16:36:57.324702',654,132,276),('leo praveen kumar',5,'Hello bhavana 💛\n\nA heartfelt thank you to Bhavana and team for your dedication and passionate work. You truly exceeded our expectations and proved us right in front of everyone for choosing you as our makeup team.\n\nYour professionalism, attention to detail, and commitment made a huge difference, and the results were absolutely wonderful. We are truly grateful for your effort and talent. ✨💄','2026-03-28 16:36:57.328086',655,132,276),('Rajab Nisha',5,'It was absolutely the best day of my life,thank you so so so much for making me feel beautiful for the first time in my life!i had bridemaids and everyone looked amazing all created go to you only thanks so much.........','2026-03-28 16:37:07.193420',656,133,277),('sangeetha Ram',5,'The makeup was too good.. I\'m so happy for your service.. thank you meena','2026-03-28 16:37:07.196725',657,133,277),('revathy ramu',5,'The best upcoming MUA....Perfect finishing can only given by her.','2026-03-28 16:37:07.199298',658,133,277),('Santhosh Sandy',5,'Wonderful experience, the finishing was so good.. Great service','2026-03-28 16:37:07.202001',659,133,277),('REBECCA GILDA',5,'The Service Was Too Good ,Kind And Friendly Environment','2026-03-28 16:37:07.204581',660,133,277),('Anusha Srikanthan',5,'Sheela is an excellent and skilled makeup artist who is kind, patient and very knowledgeable in her field. She works in tandem with the hair stylist and created perfection for our wedding on all three days! Besides her technical work, she was in communication throughout before the wedding AND during the event making us feel calm. She is always on time to the events and finished our look way ahead of time giving plenty of time for photos. Her prices are very very reasonable for how talented she is!!!\n\nThe Sangeet look was glossy with a light feel to it and a bun hairstyle. The makeup complemented the colors of my lehenga beautifully. Please see the pictures attached for references. She also knew how to set the look for my husband on all three days with makeup, hairdo included and did an amazing job.\n\nThe wedding reception look had a slightly different feel to it and complemented my purple outfit 💜 The infinity style draping was excellent and the hairdo went well with our look. She handled our decorator delaying the delivery of gypsies for the hair with ease and finished on time! Kept me calm the whole evening.\n\nThe marriage day was just perfect! Through the tears and emotions during the wedding, Sheela\'s makeup didn\'t fade at all! I loved the saree draping and hairstyles too. Both her and her stylist came very prepared for all our events. It was very helpful for me when she had asked for our outfit colors and the look we wanted ahead of time to prepare accordingly!\n\nOverall, Sheela and her stylist comes with my highest recommendation if you would like a stress-free and beautiful wedding experience! ❤️','2026-03-28 16:37:11.066152',661,134,282),('Sumathi Sumathi',5,'I booked Sheela Sujesh for my bridal makeup and I couldn’t have asked for a better artist. She made me feel comfortable throughout the process and the final look was stunning yet very natural. Everyone loved my makeup. Thank you Sheela for making my big day even more special.”','2026-03-28 16:37:11.069739',662,134,282),('Rohith Srinivasan',5,'Had a great experience with Sheela Sujesh Bridal Makeup Artist. The makeup was neat, elegant, and perfectly suited for the occasion. She was very professional, patient, and made the whole process comfortable. The final look turned out beautiful and lasted throughout the event. Highly recommended for anyone looking for bridal makeup in Chennai. ✨','2026-03-28 16:37:11.074411',663,134,282),('Ashwini M',5,'I loved how calm and caring sheela was while getting my daughter ready for her wedding, the makeup done was simply flawless enhancing my daughters features without looking heavy and cakey. The best decision to choose her for my daughters wedding. I highly recommend her😊','2026-03-28 16:37:11.077923',664,134,282),('subhashini R',5,'Highly professional, specializing in both subtle and bold looks...Thank you so much sheela ka for the wonderful natural and subtle makeup look... You are really amazing and everyone appreciated the entire look ... You are very punctual and sincere. I appreciate the time and effort you put into creating the perfect look for me on my special day....','2026-03-28 16:37:11.081346',665,134,282),('Teepshika Sundar',5,'I had the best experience with Honey! She was punctual, super friendly, and made me feel so comfortable throughout the process. Her work gave me such a beautiful, natural glow — exactly what I wanted for my special day. I was so impressed with her makeup for my engagement (for which I didn’t even take a trial!) that I immediately booked her for my wedding and reception as well. Every look she created was flawless and perfectly suited for the occasion. I would definitely recommend Honey to anyone looking for a stunning yet natural makeup look for their special day!','2026-03-28 16:37:20.055433',666,135,283),('Priyadarshini Iyengar',5,'Honey did an amazing job in decking me up for my engagement.. she was calm and composed through out the session and handled everything in a kind way..','2026-03-28 16:37:20.059317',667,135,283),('VidhyaLakshmi M',5,'I had the absolute pleasure of working with Honey Priya for my sister\'s wedding, and I couldn\'t be happier with her work! She did an incredible job - my sister looked absolutely stunning. The makeup was flawless , natural and held up beautifully throughout the entire temple wedding even in the hot weather.\n\nLater that evening , she completely transformed my sister\'s reception look with a glam makeover for the reception . My family also loved both the looks .\n\nWhat impressed me the most was her professionalism. She was always on time and well prepared. Her attention to detail and ability to bring out the best features with such a soft , elegant and natural finish truly stood out.\n\nWe were so impressed that I booked for her for my own wedding - and I am glad I did : )','2026-03-28 16:37:20.063184',668,135,283),('R Niranjana',5,'♥️Thank you so much for doing beautiful makeup and hair do for me and my daughter. You are a great makeup artist.❤️','2026-03-28 16:37:20.067145',669,135,283),('kavitha s',5,'I attended professional make up work shop held by Honey Priya mam. She was so particular about delivering all the minute details about the knowledge of makeup. She was a good instructor and does awesome job. She also helps in all means possible. She extends her help right from choosing a product to assist us with buying them. Feeling happy attending the workshop and working with her.','2026-03-28 16:37:20.071069',670,135,283),('Alagulakshmi Guru',5,'Suba did amazing makeover for my sister wedding,we booked her for 3 days wedding function for my sister ,myself as bridesmaid and for groom, her hands were magic ,she holds so much patience ,friendly and such a hardworking women irrespective of heavy rains . Many of my guests appreciated her work and enquired about her ,if any of you looking for amazing work and friendly budget 💝 she is the one 🥰','2026-03-28 16:37:24.527333',671,136,288),('Linda Poongulali',5,'Excellent work..\nI booked Suba for my bridesmaid makeup\nAnd she did an amazing job\nShe is so professional and perfect in what she does..\n\nI’m happy with the result..\nHairstyle and saree draping was on point..\n\nThanks Suba','2026-03-28 16:37:24.529733',672,136,288),('Deepa Mani',5,'Awesome makeup & hairstyle for my daughter and made her so beautiful. ❤️Appreciated by my family & friends. Amazing and elegant make-up artist. ❤️ Very Professional. Excellent Knowledge & Skill for Saree Pre-Pleating. ❤️  I was extremely impressed with her commitment. She suggested jewellery & attire for my daughter. All the best Suba. Keep Rolling... ❤️❤️❤️Highly Recommend!!!  ❤️❤️❤️','2026-03-28 16:37:24.532384',673,136,288),('Vaishnavi Raj',5,'Suba is one of the best MUA and an awesome person in and out, and does saree pre-draping so well. I got a chance to do it with her. Can’t thank her enough❤️ keep it up and do more…. I’m rooting for you Suba.','2026-03-28 16:37:24.535279',674,136,288),('PöóJã ŠhŘî',5,'I took saree pre-pleating classes from Suba! Very neat and satisfied explanation it was!! She covered all the areas, let it be from the business angle or personal one!!! Very very happy to have met her and learn from her!! ❤️😇','2026-03-28 16:37:24.538260',675,136,288),('Advaith raj',5,'I would like to thank Metilda for the wonderful makeup and beautiful Iyengar-style Madisar draping she did for my son’s Upanayanam. The makeup was very subtle, elegant, and perfectly suited for the occasion—I really loved it. The Madisar drape was neat and done excellently.\n\nWhat I appreciated the most was her patience and calm approach. She handled everything very sweetly and never rushed through the process. Her professionalism and pleasant nature made the whole experience very comfortable.\n\nHighly recommend her for anyone looking for graceful makeup and traditional draping.','2026-03-28 16:37: