ofessional Makeup Artist in Chennai who understands skin tone and facial structure well. Being a Wedding Makeup Artist in Chennai, he knew exactly how to make me camera-ready without overdoing it. I also noticed why he is listed among the Top Makeup Artist in Chennai by many people. The pricing was clear and fair, which makes him a Best Makeup Artist in Chennai With Price. For anyone searching for a Makeup Artist in Chennai For Wedding, I strongly recommend this service.','2026-03-28 16:37:32.995383',681,138,291),('K Sujatha',5,'Vijay is a true professional and an artist in every sense. I’ve tried several makeup artists before, but none matched his perfection. He created a soft, glowing bridal look that enhanced my natural features beautifully. His blending skills are unmatched, and the makeup looked just as flawless in person as it did in photos. He maintained complete hygiene and used top-quality products suited for my skin type. I also loved his friendly and patient nature, which made me feel completely relaxed. Every stroke of his brush showed expertise and passion. If you’re a bride looking for someone you can trust completely, Vijay is definitely the best choice in Chennai.','2026-03-28 16:37:32.999065',682,138,291),('Karthik Karthik',5,'Vijay and his team handled my pre-wedding, wedding, and reception makeup, and every look was unique and breathtaking. From soft engagement makeup to a royal bridal look, he customized everything perfectly. His understanding of facial features and color tones is amazing. The makeup stayed intact even through long ceremonies and photoshoots. I felt completely comfortable, and he was so kind and professional the entire time. Every detail, from hairstyle to lashes, was handled beautifully. My family and guests couldn’t stop praising his work. He truly made my special days even more memorable. I would recommend Vijay to every bride looking for the best bridal makeup artist in Chennai.','2026-03-28 16:37:33.003596',683,138,291),('Rani Raja',5,'Vijay is hands down the best wedding makeup artist in Chennai! I hired him for both my engagement and wedding, and he delivered two completely different yet equally stunning looks. He took time to understand my preferences, outfit colors, and lighting setup. The makeup looked natural in person and perfect on camera. I really appreciated how punctual and patient he was throughout the process. The products he used were high-end and suitable for my sensitive skin. He even guided me with hairstyle and jewelry coordination. I received endless compliments from guests and photographers alike. Vijay truly made me feel like a celebrity bride. I would recommend him to every bride-to-be in Chennai!','2026-03-28 16:37:33.006839',684,138,291),('Megavardhini Mega',5,'I found Vijay through Google reviews and decided to try his services for my wedding — and I’m so glad I did! He was incredibly professional right from the trial session. Vijay designed a look that suited my saree, skin tone, and overall personality perfectly. The airbrush finish gave me a radiant bridal glow that lasted more than 10 hours. I didn’t feel heavy or oily at all. Everyone at the wedding complimented how natural yet stunning I looked. He also coordinated with my photographer to ensure my makeup looked great on camera. Vijay is truly the best wedding makeup artist in Chennai — worth every penny!','2026-03-28 16:37:33.009898',685,138,291),('vishali gopinathan',5,'Hi all. I had my engagement make up done by sai bridal studios. I am glad to say I chose the best of them all. The perfectly showed my beauty enhanced. Everyone said I look like a doll. I am so happy. Definitely gonna have them as my marriage MUA.','2026-03-28 16:37:36.050079',686,139,294),('Sai Lohitha',5,'Really i am in love with the makeup of hema akka she really rocked it each and every person was asking me abt her makeup....she really made me a doll for my spl event... without any questions go for her she is the perfect one 💗🤌🏻','2026-03-28 16:37:36.054769',687,139,294),('Akshara Rajaram',5,'It was at the very last moment my makeup was finalized with you.. but you did wonders!! I was very satisfied with your work and the way you handled it. Everyone loved your work and told that I looked very pretty🥰🥰. Kudos to you and your assistant for making me look beautiful on my day❤️🤗','2026-03-28 16:37:36.058445',688,139,294),('Valentina Thompson',5,'Sai Bridal Studio truly worked magic for my makeup at my daughter\'s party. I felt incredibly pretty and confident, thanks to their skillful artistry. The friendly staff created a warm and inviting atmosphere that made the experience even more enjoyable. Throughout the event, I received numerous compliments on how beautiful my makeup looked, and it stayed flawless until the end of the celebration. Even the curls in my hair were intact throught out the event, adding to the overall charm. Thank you, Sai Bridal Studio, for helping me shine on this special day! I would highly recommend her for your special day to make you look extra special.','2026-03-28 16:37:36.062259',689,139,294),('Prisilla Jenifer.R',5,'I got my engagement makeup done by hema it was a marvelous job done by her the make up was perfect I dint expect such a work coz this the first time am done with the makeup by her thank you so much hema for you made me dolled up and even the saree was perfect thank you ramya thank you both 💯✨','2026-03-28 16:37:36.065881',690,139,294),('Amala Rajan',5,'Latha Bridal Makeup Artist absolutely exceeded expectations! My daughter looked radiant for both her engagement and wedding day, thanks to Latha\'s expert touch. The makeup was flawless and perfectly suited to her features. Latha even made me, the mother of the bride, feel beautiful and confident on my daughter\'s special day.  They have a true talent for highlighting natural beauty and creating a look that lasts.  We couldn\'t be happier and highly recommend Latha\'s services! I certainly recommend Latha for any of your family occasions and she will be the beautician for any of our future family functions... love every bit of both Viji and Latha\'s expertise...','2026-03-28 16:37:39.247958',691,140,295),('Austin Ames',5,'Excellent makeup done by Latha mam. My wife asked for Natural Look - but Latha and her team did it marvellously. Big thanks mam.','2026-03-28 16:37:39.250372',692,140,295),('Roshni Rajan',5,'Latha akka has indeed become a part of our family.. starting from my engagement in Kodaikanal then both my weddings and reception.. the professional makeup that akka did was really exceptional.. and also it will be very u grateful if I dint tell about viji aunty also.. starting frm the hairstyle, makeup finish, touchups, saree draping and even giving me the right combination of bangles.. she is truly talented, professional and  dedicated in her work.. her punctuality should really be mentioned.. i highly recommend Latha akka for your makeup needs','2026-03-28 16:37:39.252917',693,140,295),('Ramesh M (Krishnan)',5,'Best team for puberty makeup and pre photoshoot. I would definitely recommend her.','2026-03-28 16:37:39.255057',694,140,295),('Deepa senthilrajan',5,'Had a dream come true moment for our daughter outdoor and indoor puberty makeover. Thanks a lot mam.','2026-03-28 16:37:39.257224',695,140,295),('Ramya Viji',5,'I booked Zaraaha sis for my engagement, marriage, and reception, and her work was absolutely amazing. The makeup stayed really well throughout the events, and the results were beyond my expectations. Whatever look I described to her, she transformed it into the best possible outcome. She also did the groom’s makeup, and it looked very natural with a perfect skin-finish and subtle touch. Overall, both my husband and I are extremely satisfied with her beautiful work. She truly made our special days even more wonderful. You can completely believe and trust her for your big day.','2026-03-28 16:37:42.355381',696,141,296),('Yesther Yadhavan',5,'I booked zara mam for my engagement, and I absolutely loved her work! The makeup was flawless, elegant, and perfectly suited my look. I really appreciated her calm and patient nature throughout the process — it made everything so smooth and stress-free. The groom’s makeup was also done neatly and naturally. The best part — everything was perfectly done within budget! Highly recommend her for anyone looking for a talented and composed makeup artist who delivers amazing results without overcharging.','2026-03-28 16:37:42.358974',697,141,296),('Megha I',5,'I had an amazing experience getting my Makeup & Hair done by zara mam for my engagement , reception, wedding nd my baby shower. She did a really fab job and was very patient. Her professional attitude and creativity is something I was totally drawn to. I will surely be going back to her for all my future events. Thank you so much zara mam.','2026-03-28 16:37:42.362459',698,141,296),('Divya Divi',5,'I booked her for my marriage...Makeup and hairstyle was perfectly done as expected... Very soft and talented person...Those who are looking for budget friendly makeup can blindly go with her...happy to say this honest review for her.... Thank you Zaraaha makeup for making my big day more beautiful... Waiting for the next event... Love you sis..','2026-03-28 16:37:42.366035',699,141,296),('Nithyakalyani D',5,'Saree draping was perfect and I really liked the makeup look on me. Initially, I hesitated to book without trial makeup but then I loved the work she did.','2026-03-28 16:37:42.369582',700,141,296),('Durga dhavamani',5,'Though it is late.. I would like to share my thanks and feedback on the makeup done for me. I am really satisfied and happy with the look created on me for my pre-wedding. Thank you so much for the beautiful makeover.\n\nI extremely liked the kind and friendly nature of her work, there was no chance of getting uncomfortable around her. I highly recommend her service for anyone looking to feel and look their best 😍🤩🙏','2026-03-28 16:37:50.700060',701,142,297),('J.k.Satheesh kumar',5,'Absolutely breathtaking transformation! Gayathri is truly a magician with her brush. Her attention to detail, flawless blending, and expert contouring skills were redefined, making me feel more confident and beautiful. She has a deep understanding of feminization makeup, enhancing natural beauty while creating a stunningly realistic look. Whether for personal expression, an event, or a professional shoot, their artistry is second to none. Highly recommended for anyone looking to experience the power of makeup at its finest!','2026-03-28 16:37:50.703863',702,142,297),('Rajee Rajeswari',5,'🌟 5/5 – Excellent Service!\nI had a wonderful experience at this beauty parlour. The Manager & Staff especially Tamil are very professional and friendly. Especially loved my haircut, pedicure, and facial — all were done with great care and perfection. The atmosphere is clean, relaxing, and welcoming. Highly recommend this place for anyone looking for quality beauty services!','2026-03-28 16:37:50.707858',703,142,297),('gomathi devaraj',5,'Gayathri is a go to professional makeup artist who can do any kind of makeup up in very short time .. First I tried her make up for my engagement and everyone in my family loved it since it was a natural look  .. Inspired by my engagement look my mother in law booked her for my wedding as well and then we continued to book only Gayathri since we had other bad experiences with other make up artist lately.\n\nStory continues she is our family makeup artist now .. 😆 LOL.... we booked her for my post wedding shoot,  Baby shower and maternity as well ... ☺️ such a lucky n amazing 🎨 👩‍🎨 artist GAYATHRI is 🥰🥰🥰🥰','2026-03-28 16:37:50.711516',704,142,297),('Balaji K',5,'We went for a maternity photoshoot for my wife at Elements and booked Gayathri as the makeup artist. She was incredibly talented and kind. We were very happy with the hairstyle and makeup she did. Personally, I was amazed by the way she took care of my wife, assisting her with dress changes and providing three different hairstyles along with touch-ups. I highly recommend her for the quality of her work and her kindness towards her clients.','2026-03-28 16:37:50.715367',705,142,297),('Anjana Ramesh',5,'I met Akshaya at my best friend’s wedding and instantly knew she had to be my makeup artist. Choosing her for my wedding was the best decision! She took the time to understand my vision, skin tone, and preferences through multiple sessions, voice notes, and calls. Her “Construct Your Own Makeup” concept helped me feel calm and prepared for my big day. Akshaya is incredibly skilled, detail-oriented, and approachable—she truly listens and delivers. I can’t recommend her enough for any occasion—she’ll make you look and feel amazing inside and out!','2026-03-28 16:37:53.725877',706,143,302),('Monika B',5,'Akshaya is truly incredible. She did my hair for my engagement and I loved it so much that I immediately booked her for my wedding and reception too. She was always on time, super professional, and really took the time to understand what I wanted. Her suggestions were spot on and her saree draping was flawless... it stayed perfect all day!\n\nMost importantly, she made sure I felt calm, cared for, and beautiful throughout. I’m so grateful to have had her by my side on such special days. Thank you so much, Akshaya. I’ll definitely be booking her for all my future events and highly recommend her too..','2026-03-28 16:37:53.729617',707,143,302),('Pavithra Nandagopal',5,'I had a wonderful experience with Akshaya Makeupartist. She is incredibly talented, professional, and truly understands what suits your face and occasion. From start to finish, she made me feel so comfortable and confident.\nI absolutely loved the final look — it was elegant, natural, and exactly what I wanted. I received so many compliments!','2026-03-28 16:37:53.733123',708,143,302),('vidhyadhari myd',5,'I had the pleasure of getting dolled up by Akshaya for my brother-in-law’s wedding and reception, and I’m so glad I chose her! She was absolutely punctual, super focused, and truly dedicated to her work. What stood out the most was her calming presence! she handled everything so smoothly and professionally, even under pressure, always with a smile on her face.\n\nShe created the look exactly how I asked and how I needed it, subtle yet glam and I absolutely loved it. I really appreciate all the effort she put in and would highly recommend her!','2026-03-28 16:37:53.736360',709,143,302),('shreya ramakrishnan',5,'I am very grateful to have had Akshaya do my makeup for my engagement . The whole time i was stressed out , she made me feel extremely comfortable and calm. Her work is absolutely brilliant and she is highly talented and i really hope she goes places with her talent. Thanks akshaya.! You are awesome!❤️','2026-03-28 16:37:53.739577',710,143,302),('Janani Marimuthu',5,'I had a great experience at this bridal shop! I went for an eyebrow shaping service, and it was quick, painless, and done perfectly in under 10 minutes. The person handling the service was clearly very experienced, and their skill made all the difference. Highly recommend this place for anyone looking for professional and efficient beauty services!','2026-03-28 16:37:58.082003',711,144,303),('Meenu Kutty',5,'I had a wonderful experience with her.she had very patient while doing makeup and l loved the makeup and hairstyle.','2026-03-28 16:37:58.086227',712,144,303),('Akshathaa A',5,'I had bridal service in Archu\'s bridal park artist is good and she is humble in her profession .Good to go with the service and with afford price as well with bridal set also available with artist','2026-03-28 16:37:58.090732',713,144,303),('Dharani',5,'I received the saree .I loved  the saree and now to drape it. I’m so moved with a hand written note from you . Thanks again ❤️','2026-03-28 16:37:58.095239',714,144,303),('Shabana Thahseen',5,'Great service by her. I recommend every one to give a try.','2026-03-28 16:37:58.098898',715,144,303),('Anejana Chellappan',4,'Pros:\nPrompt response: The manager I spoke to was quick to respond, could communicate in English, and listened to the requirements and concerns before suggesting their packages.\n\nEfficient management: There was no confusion on coordination or arrangement. Zero communication misses/overlaps. The team that came to do our services could communicate well in English.\n\nPrompt service: I had booked their services for two days and on both the days the team came on time and wrapped their service well within time.\n\nPatient and skilled artists: If we were unhappy with what they did or wanted last minute changes, they redid whatever we asked them to without any push-backs. They also stuck to our references and did our hair and makeup accordingly. In case, they had better suggestions they also recommended them on the basis of skin texture and hair volume.\n\nHigh-quality products: They use all the products they mention in the catalogs. If you have preferences, you can state them upfront and the team would use the same.\n\nPricing:\nWe were charged 24k for party makeup for 2 days (50% advance.) Prices for convenience and extensions, lashes etc. are separate. Please note that the rates are subject to change according to the management.\n\nCons/Suggestion:\nWe preferred the work of the senior hair artist on the first day over the artist on second day. The hair on first day lasted longer and they way she did her work was also seamless.\n\nSo in case, you are particular about a style and want the best hands, I think you should ask for the senior artists.\n\nThat said,I would really like to opt for their services again if need be.','2026-03-28 16:38:06.010879',716,145,304),('Nikhar Jain',5,'A huge thanks to Roshini for making me feel like the best version of myself on my big day. The makeup truly enhanced the real me and looked exactly the way I had always dreamed of—elegant, natural, and rich at the same time. I was never sure about a middle hair partition, but Roshini trusted it and assured me it would look beautiful, and she was absolutely right. The entire process went so smoothly, with zero worries or tension—what more could a bride ask for? I loved every bit of her work and felt confident and radiant throughout the day. Thank you for understanding my vision so perfectly and bringing it to life so effortlessly❤️','2026-03-28 16:38:06.017315',717,145,304),('Salha Amina Nasser',5,'I had absolutely no idea what I wanted for my reception hair and makeup, but Roshni and her team worked pure magic! Within just 2 hours, they created the perfect look that was elegant, flawless, and exactly what I didn’t even know I wanted. My makeup lasted all evening without a single touch-up, and my hair stayed perfect through all the dancing and photos.\n\nRoshni is not only incredibly skilled but also so calm and professional. she made the entire process stress free and enjoyable. Her team was super friendly, attentive to detail, and made me feel completely comfortable. I received endless compliments on my look, and I couldn’t be happier with their work. Highly, highly recommend Roshni for any bride who wants to look and feel her absolute best!','2026-03-28 16:38:06.020687',718,145,304),('Raji Senthil',5,'Loved the work done by the artists! Yashvi and the team were great! Ruchita is super reliable! I will highly recommend Rosh to anyone looking for great artists. Very timely, great attitude and fabulous taste  Thank you for making my special day truly special 💖','2026-03-28 16:38:06.022148',719,145,304),('Shivani Sharma',5,'Had a wonderful experience with Rosh and her team. I was literally a bride in a crisis who had no plan about her look, hair and makeup but Rosh and her team totally helped me out and made me an absolutely beautiful bride for my engagement. They are very polite, helpful and definitely expert in their jobs. Loved the whole experience.','2026-03-28 16:38:06.023288',720,145,304),('jenifer arp',5,'I had zero knowledge about the products and how to use it. Also at first I was not that confident about myself but Angel akka motivated us a lot and politely educated us from the scratch. Even after our endless mistakes she didnt get tired to teach us till we mastered it. And now we are here as a professional makeup artist... I\'m very proud to be her student...\n\nAngel Akkaaawww watch us, we\'ll make you proud by our works... Thankyou so much akka for tolerating our torchers, silly behaviours and us.😂😂 Love you Akka❤️ and missing our class 🥺','2026-03-28 16:38:15.002114',721,146,309),('Sharmila R',5,'If you are looking for the greatest mentor in Chennai, go with angel makeover studio. The manner she teaches is very friendly. Her teaching is really kind and helpful. The products (vanities) she provided for students were all international brands of the highest and best quality. A cozy environment. She will clear all of your doubts no matter how many times you ask. On the first day of class, I had no knowledge of makeup and am now completely confident in it. All credit goes to her. I will offer 5 stars 1000% worth the money. I\'m so happy ❤️🥰🫶.','2026-03-28 16:38:15.006092',722,146,309),('Harini Saravanan',5,'Proud and happy to say, that I\'m both a bride and a student of Angel Mam❤️ Best choice i ever made.❤️\n\nFirstly, as a bride, one can blindly choose her for their big day. Undoubtedly she will make you look the best version of yourself on your big day, with her magical hands..💯🪄 and that too at a very much reasonable cost.  She is very punctual and highly professional at her work.💯👏\n\nThen, as a student, I\'m very much passionate  about becoming a makeup artist, since my college days and couldn\'t join anywhere as i couldn\'t afford it. But after joining here, i swear i really felt destiny made me wait these long to choose her as my mentor. And again at an affordable cost with a vanity kit that includes all necessary products, with which a complete makeover can be done..💯\nShe teaches everything about\n✅makeup more practically,\n✅gives the product knowledge,\n✅on what all to invest and not,\n✅Social media handling\n✅Professionalism\n✅Internship\nShe makes sure that we do enough practice to clear our doubts and correct our mistakes.\n✅The next best thing is portfolio shoots, where we get 200% confidence. Tabrez anna is very kind and more patient in taking pictures of our model. Pictures will be more than professional which is really helpful in building our portfolio. Huge respect to you anna..🙇‍♀️❤️\n\nAnd finally, Mam-uuu (that\'s how i call her😜), thank you so much for being such an amazing mentor, lovely friend and for sharing a beautiful bond with me.. am forever thankful to you for all this love...❤️ Love you to the moon and back mam-uuu..❤️🤗\nYou are Angel in Real Life..👼❤️','2026-03-28 16:38:15.009967',723,146,309),('Keerthana Kumar',5,'I am a student of her ❣️ she is so sweet and lovely . The classes are  fun , enjoyable and worthy . wonderful future guidance 💫 she is more like a sister to me 💞 . Great memories .we loved her class🤍🎊','2026-03-28 16:38:15.014528',724,146,309),('Venika Dev',5,'Sharing this review from the bottom of my heart. Angel Ma\'am is very sweet and she has lot of knowledge. I did have few knowledge but there was a lack of confidence in my work but this place has completely boosted my confidence with the way she is teaching her students. This place has a great ambience and the vibe which makes you feel at home and also there is no less knowledge imparted over the students. The ultimate part is the live session students would be getting from her work on the clients. We get lots of hands on like this which would actually makes you feel a complete make up artist ♥️','2026-03-28 16:38:15.017592',725,146,309),('Aadavan R',5,'When it comes to hair and saree draping and styling I always prefer.  Nandhini bridal work is very good and neat with perfect finishing… you are someone that I can feel comfortable around….♥️ I loved all the makeup and hairdos you did for me…  overall I highly recommend nandhini bridal to anyone looking for a skilled and friendly makeup artist…♥️♥️♥️','2026-03-28 16:38:18.613699',726,147,314),('parvathy 022415',5,'Had absolute pleasure of working with Nandhini Bridal Avenue and I\'m from Pondicherry she travelled from Chennai to here well appreciated for her dedication professionalism and incredibly attentive to my preferences they took effort to understand my skin type the occasion and the kind of look I was going for ,absolutely nailed it\nHas expert knowledge in the products they handled\nHighly recommended for anyone who wants to glow radiant and for photoshoots','2026-03-28 16:38:18.617650',727,147,314),('Aarthi',5,'Your work is elegant and flawless – You truly enhances every bride’s natural beauty!','2026-03-28 16:38:18.622139',728,147,314),('Kiruthika durairaj',5,'Absolutely loved the look! The makeup was flawless and lasted all day — truly professional work!','2026-03-28 16:38:18.625627',729,147,314),('Rekha Mahendran',5,'One of my friend referred her,  I booked for my engagement.   I preferred a very natural look she did very well, fully satisfied definitely refer to my friends and family','2026-03-28 16:38:18.629661',730,147,314),('Anitha Princy',5,'I recently had my makeup done by Ms. Padhmavathi for a function at home, the result was awesome. She was extremely professional and delivered exactly what I was hoping for. Her work truly exceeded my expectations, and I received so many compliments and positive feedback on my makeup during the function. I am very satisfied with her service and would highly recommend her to anyone looking for a skilled and professional makeup artist.','2026-03-28 16:38:22.416007',731,148,315),('VARSHA VAIDHYANATHAN',5,'I booked certain services with Padmavathy Maam at the last minute. She was very generous to accommodate me and my mother. A special mention to Saranya , who worked very hard ! Keep up the good work 😊','2026-03-28 16:38:22.419007',732,148,315),('Swapna K Prashanth',5,'I recently hired Padma to do my makeup for my cousin\'s wedding celebration that happened in Dec 2022 and I am so glad I did! From start to finish, the experience was incredible. Padma was prompt and professional, arriving on time and with all of the necessary equipment and supplies we requested for.\n\nWhat really stood out to me was how attentive she and her partner Jenee was to my needs and preferences. All her recommendations for Henna and saree ironing contacts were great.She took the time to listen to what I wanted and made suggestions based on her expertise, ultimately creating a look that was both beautiful and comfortable for me to wear.\n\nThroughout the process, she made sure I was comfortable and happy with the results, and was always willing to make adjustments as needed.\n\nThe final result was stunning - my makeup looked flawless and lasted throughout the entire celebration. I received so many compliments throughout the night and felt truly confident and beautiful.\n\nOverall, I would highly recommend her to anyone in need of a talented, professional makeup artist. She is incredibly skilled, attentive, and personable, and truly made Thank you, Padma and Jenee for your amazing work!\"','2026-03-28 16:38:22.421444',733,148,315),('Vijayalakshmi',5,'Awesome work. I satisfied with all the services.  bridal work awesome . They r very Friendly. I\'ll suggest my friends also. Thank u very much .','2026-03-28 16:38:22.424434',734,148,315),('Rajalakshmi Kripa Shankar',5,'I was looking for a make-up artist for my daughter for an occasion. Since my daughter was young, i wished that the products they use shouldn\'t have harsh chemicals.. And Padma, your products are gentle on skin and the facial kit you gave us was really awesome. It made us look fabulous for the evening. Your service and your calmness throughout the event was wonderful ❤️🥰.. Would definitely recommend for my friends and family 😊.','2026-03-28 16:38:22.427396',735,148,315),('Gunna masthan',5,'I did haircut, facial and hair spa here.\nReally very satisfied with the service.\nStaff explained everything properly and took good care. Calm place and neat work. Will definitely come again.','2026-03-28 16:38:35.085816',736,149,316),('Vignesh.B N.Balaji',5,'My wife did party makeup and hair styling in Radiance studio .Makeup looked very natural, not too heavy  Stayed long without any issues. Totally satisfied with the service.','2026-03-28 16:38:35.089113',737,149,316),('jhancy rani',5,'Hair spa was very relaxing. My hair feels soft even after few washes facial also gave nice glow. Worth tha price','2026-03-28 16:38:35.092432',738,149,316),('nagamani Vk',5,'I came for party makeup and hair styling. Makeup looked natural, not too heavy . Stayed long without any satisfied. I recommend RADIANCE for everyone.','2026-03-28 16:38:35.095981',739,149,316),('Radha Balaji',5,'Very happy with my haircut 🙂\nI was little confused about style,but they guided me nicely. Hair spa was realxing and worth the money Friendly staff.','2026-03-28 16:38:35.099330',740,149,316),('shoba R',5,'I am very much satisfied with saranya\'s makeover .  Her makeover during my wedding is mind-blowing. Her dedication towards her work is awesome. Thankyou so much saranya u made my day !!!!','2026-03-28 16:38:38.586713',741,150,321),('Madhu Mitha. R',5,'Had my makeup done by Saranya Santhosh\nbridal makeup artist . She gave me a beautiful, flawless look that felt natural, and the hairstyle she created was so pretty . The makeup and hair held up perfectly for hours.','2026-03-28 16:38:38.590218',742,150,321),('UMA MAHESHWARI',5,'I am very much satisfied with Saranya akka makeover.Her makeover during my engagement is awesome look.she gave me a natural look.Hairstyle she was created so pretty.Makeup and hairstyle was held up so perfectly for hours and till the end.she took care of me all the minute .so outcome of makeup was come excellent.Thank you so much Saranya akka u made my day akka😊','2026-03-28 16:38:38.593755',743,150,321),('sarveshwari s',5,'Very good artist\nVery good saree draping on time service\nNeat and crisp makeup\nDefinitely gonna rebook again thanks for making my special day special 💜 💜 💜 💜 💜','2026-03-28 16:38:38.597110',744,150,321),('sowmiya p',5,'I had an amazing experience with SS BRIDAL STUDIO She perfectly understood my vision for a natural yet radiant bridal look. Her makeup was flawless, lasting all day and night, She was also incredibly helpful and made me feel so comfortable. I highly recommend her!\"','2026-03-28 16:38:38.600279',745,150,321),('Anjali Ramesh',5,'Booking Srity Beauty for you wedding is probably the best decision you\'re going to make. I literally didn\'t have to worry about anything as she and her team took care of makeup, hairstyle, saree draping and jewellery for all my wedding events - Vratham, Engagement, Reception, Unjal and Muhurtham. She will work with you based on your requirements and constraints. I had a worry free wedding because of Srity. Thank you.','2026-03-28 16:38:43.121847',746,151,322),('Komal Vaidya',5,'Absolutely loved her work! It was my first time wearing a saree and she made me feel so comfortable and confident. She did my makeup for my wedding, mehendi and reception — and I received endless compliments at all three events. Highly recommend! 💛✨','2026-03-28 16:38:43.125258',747,151,322),('Sanjeevini Barik',5,'A huge thank you Srity for creating the most beautiful looks for me on my reception and wedding day. I honestly couldn’t have asked for a better makeup artist. You understood my ideas so naturally, even when I wasn’t able to explain them properly, and you brought everything to life with such ease and perfection.\nYour calm energy, patience and the way you paid attention to even the tiniest details made the whole experience so comfortable for me. I truly felt like the best version of myself, and the number of compliments I received is all because of your incredible talent. Thank you for being so genuine, so warm, and for putting your whole heart into the work you did for me. I’m really grateful that you were a part of my big days, and I’ll always remember how beautifully you made me look and feel. And also a big thanks to Priya to make me so comfortable throughout the process...','2026-03-28 16:38:43.128723',748,151,322),('priya surianarayan',5,'I had a wonderful experience with Srity. I booked her for my makeover for a cousin’s engagement and wedding, and she delivered exactly what I wanted. The makeup was natural, subtle, and beautifully done. She took the time to understand my preferences in advance, patiently discussed every detail, and even suggested what would suit me best.\n\nSrity and her team are extremely professional—they arrived right on time for a 4 AM muhurat without any follow-up or reminders. I received so many compliments on both days, and I felt completely at ease throughout.\n\nI would highly recommend her to anyone looking for a truly seamless and delightful experience.','2026-03-28 16:38:43.131867',749,151,322),('Gitika Gitanjali',5,'Srity Ma\'am gave some amazing bridal makeovers for my wedding. It was most effortless makeup. She takes a lot of care for the comfort of bride and her enthusiasm shows up in her work. She provides jewellery along with makeup. It makes the bridal makeover arrangements hassle-free. Would recommend everyone to try her out. Keep shining, Srity Ma\'am 😊','2026-03-28 16:38:43.136358',750,151,322),('Ashwini Nisha K',5,'Thank you so much for your excellent work. I was so happy that day ❤️ Everyone said the makeup was so good😍. You are also very friendly, 🫂and you changed my mood with your magic🪄. Thank you very much, sis. 😊\nActually my wedding makeup didn\'t go well so I was so worried about my reseption makeup. But this was totally beyond my expectations. And makeup stayed very well until 2 to 3 pm really thanking🤗 you from bottom of my heart.  Wishing you all the best for all u future works.👍  Ini yeadhachum event date fix panna odanea unaga book panniruvan. 😀','2026-03-28 16:38:50.826303',751,152,323),('paurnasankari paurnasankari',5,'You\'re a rockstar! 🤩 Your makeup skills are on point, and you totally nailed the look I wanted for my special day. From the flawless foundation to the stunning eye shadow, everything was perfection! 💄 But what really stood out was your friendly nature and amazing vibes - you made me feel super comfortable and relaxed, like we were old friends! 😊 Your attention to detail and creativity truly made me feel like a queen. You\'re a great partner to work.','2026-03-28 16:38:50.829960',752,152,323),('Dhanalakshmi Elavarasan',5,'Hi This Dhanalakshmi Elavarasan,\nI highly recommend MONI SHIVA MUA because she is very professional and Friendly. 💯 cool handling I\'m so satisfied with you akka. 🎊 Your make my Dream day very Special.🪄❤️ I recently seen my weeding album photos are very nice I\'m So Happy akka.😍🎉And most important very budget friendly also. 🥰 Thank you So much Akka 🥰','2026-03-28 16:38:50.833924',753,152,323),('Sandhiya Kavi1919',5,'I was completely satisfied and loved your work. Everyone gives positive feedback about your work.My family members were so happy. Amazing work and getting so many compliments for that.  At the end I felt so so happy.Thank you akka for made me smile on my big day','2026-03-28 16:38:50.837053',754,152,323),('Divya Shanmugam',5,'Moni shiva makeup artist did reception and marriage makeup fr me , I really loved your makeup on me sis , everyone appreciated , makeup really came well, I would definitely suggest to my frds , thank u so much , makeup artist is really friendly and professional 👏','2026-03-28 16:38:50.841764',755,152,323),('lakshmi kirthivasan',5,'I recently had the pleasure of working with a truly talented makeup artist for my son\'s Upanayanam ceremony, and I am absolutely thrilled with the results. The makeup artist, Priya demonstrated exceptional skill, professionalism, and creativity throughout the entire process.\n\nFrom our first consultation to the final touch-up before the event, she exhibited a deep understanding of the requirements and the cultural significance of the Upanayanam ceremony. She listened attentively to my preferences and provided valuable suggestions, ensuring that the makeup perfectly complemented my appearance and the overall theme of the event.\n\nThe final result was a flawless and natural look that lasted throughout the day. She draped my Madisar so well that I didn’t have any issues and didn’t have to adjust at all.\n\nShe maintained a relaxed and friendly demeanor, making me  feel comfortable and at ease during the makeup application process. This professionalism extended to her hair do assistant also who worked seamlessly together to ensure that everything ran smoothly not only for me, but for my relatives too.\n\nFurthermore, Priya utilized high-quality products, which made the makeup not only looked stunning but also felt light and comfortable, allowing me to fully enjoy the event without any discomfort.\n\nThe compliments received throughout the event are a testament to her outstanding artistry.\n\nIf you are seeking a makeup artist for any special occasion, I wholeheartedly recommend Priya vinoth.\n\nThank you once again @ Priya Vinoth Ramanfor your exceptional work and for helping make my son\'s Upanayanam a truly memorable and beautiful','2026-03-28 16:38:54.262610',756,153,328),('Bhargavi G',5,'I had a family wedding on 2nd and 3rd April for which I opted for hairstyle and saree draping service from Priya Vinoth. While the outcome was neat as I expected, what was even better that she patiently understood the kind of look I wanted for the two days and gave suggestions to make it look more elegant. She was right on time and handled everything with so much care, that I felt completely relaxed and pampered. I would highly recommend Priya for her makeover services. You should definitely try it at least once.','2026-03-28 16:38:54.264759',757,153,328),('Priya Dharshini',5,'Actually to be honest  everyone at my sister\'s reception said that I looked very grand and classy. I personally didn\'t expect this grand and neat look. I was so happy and completely satisfied in both reception and marriage look. Seriously I was worried about my makeup and hairstyle because first time I\'m doing it after my marriage. You really did magic on me. Marriage look was very neat and traditional. Makeup and hairstyle stayed long on both the events. You were on time and handled everything with so much patience and care. I would highly recommend Priya vinoth for makeup services.','2026-03-28 16:38:54.266130',758,153,328),('Prasitha Lakshmi',3,'I got Mrs. Priya\'s contact through a Facebook Group and Booked her for Guest Make up, Hair and Saree Draping in September.\nMrs. Priya was very punctual and promptly came to the location on time although it was drizzling outside.\nI wanted a very subtle and natural look which was achieved with very minimal products however the eyeliner and eye make up wasn\'t a breeze, it was uneven more than once and we have to take the make up remover in a earbud to remove it and finally I was comfortable with me putting my eyeliner myself. Hairo was a simple braid covered with Jasmine flowers that looked good when she completed it but it wasn\'t stable at all even after using a lot of hairpins, and I had an ironing done at Naturals too the previous night! By the time I went to the venue in an AC car (almost 15 minutes away - 2kms), the clips became all loose and I had to redo it more tightly. Saree drape was beautiful, quick and really comfortable to carry on for the entire function. The overall charges was 5000/- which included travelling too. Wishing Mrs. Priya all the best for her career 🌟','2026-03-28 16:38:54.267382',759,153,328),('lakshmi kannan',5,'I booked Priya for my parents 60th wedding function... she did a fabulous job.. and was on time .. Her madisar draping for so perfect and hairdo and makeup was as per my requirement and overall had a very wonderful experience and would recommend to my friends and family.','2026-03-28 16:38:54.269551',760,153,328),('Kasthuri Logaiah',5,'The make up work was very neat and professional. I really liked the artist\'s work.\nShe travelled long way from Pallavaram to annanagar, Chennai to do the work. Time management was her unique and special thing from her team.\nOn whole I liked the entire make up (hairdo, face makeup, lehenga and saree styling). I got many compliments from my friends and relatives. Thank you team for your wonderful work.','2026-03-28 16:38:57.646643',761,154,330),('Sathanya Vijayasundar',5,'I\'m Sathanya, the state awardee for best child artist 2017, for the movie Nisabdham. Niranjana ma\'am did the hair and makeup for the event for me. It was so so amazing and I was thoroughly satisfied. Definitely a memorable one for me!','2026-03-28 16:38:57.648992',762,154,330),('Tharika Thiru',5,'Niranjana ma’am, what a fabulous job you have done! You delivered exactly what you promised, and we are 100% happy with the outcome. Your artistry added so much grace and charm to my daughter’s function, making the day even more memorable.\n\nWe are truly happy that we found you at the right time. You brought that natural and elegant look which is what we wanted. Thank you for making this occasion so special for our family.','2026-03-28 16:38:57.651950',763,154,330),('Kavi R',5,'Niranjana mam was absolutely very professional and the work she did was too perfect. You don\'t need to say anything, her hands are like magic which does exactly what we need. Prices are very reasonable. She is very friendly and one can easily approach her. Thank you mam for making my day so special 💖','2026-03-28 16:38:57.654301',764,154,330),('Arumugam S',5,'Awesome experience 👏 I went for a haircut and facial and it was amazing. The staff were all welcoming and well skilled✨️ and niranjana mam nailed it with the haircut. I love🫶 the finished outcome and will come back for more. Thank you so much (^.^)(*＾▽＾*)🖤💕♥️😍','2026-03-28 16:38:57.656841',765,154,330),('Akila Vikey',5,'I recently completed the makeup course and it was a wonderful experience. The trainers were highly professional, patient, and explained each technique in detail. From basic skin prep to advanced bridal looks, everything was taught step by step with practical sessions. The products and tools provided for practice were of good quality. Mam was very friendly, guided me well and explained everything patiently. I really learned a lot from this course.','2026-03-28 16:39:05.426357',766,155,331),('Anu SD bridal studio',5,'I\'m Anitha Thank you for such an amazing MUA class, love the way you you actually teach with praises and positivity. I have seen makeup people who criticise how one looks, to say that look how we hid your flaws. Your tips and techniques are very useful,  tq so much Divya mam','2026-03-28 16:39:05.429977',767,155,331),('Hema Rathnam',5,'This is Hema I Completed in Beautician course at Divya bridal studio and academy. It was very wonderful experience. Now I opened new saloon at Korattur area in the name of Pearl beauty Hub. Thanks to Divya ma\'am.','2026-03-28 16:39:05.433763',768,155,331),('Ramya Ramya',5,'First of all thanks to Divya mam and their academy , Mam\'s teaching style and patience was very unique and her way of approch is very sweet ,I have learned a lot ,mam can explained very well about this make up course in good manner ,so many techniques are how to handle in proper way and  they are give many products in practice session ,it is very useful to us thank you for the valuable time with Divya mam and their academy','2026-03-28 16:39:05.436970',769,155,331),('Praveena Sam',5,'I approached Divya\'s bridal for my engagement makeover..Mam was so patient enough to understand my expectations and the outcome was really good more than what I even thought..all were really happy with the overall look was neat and elegant.will definitely suggest their work for upcoming brides','2026-03-28 16:39:05.440166',770,155,331),('Priya satz',5,'I just wanted to say thank you so much for doing such an incredible job on last minute maternity shoot make over.both hair do and makeup was so good and I loves it ... I was so excited, as everything came out well.I really felt incredibly beautiful and it was really a subtle look...that I always wanted it to be. It was perfect! Make up was so beautiful as it is natural finish..and very affordable too ....You really made it so easy too! I can\'t thank you enough for helping me in last minute and made my special day even more special!..Thank you subha !! Awaiting for my baby\'s first bday to book it once again....','2026-03-28 16:39:10.153491',771,156,336),('Sanju Krishnakumar',5,'Firstly thanks for being on time and that shows the professionalism. I loved the makeup and everyone complimented me for the makeover, all thanks to you and the hairstylist. You understood the look I expected and I thoroughly loved the final look. The makeup stayed in tact even after removing the Sandanam post nalangu. I expected a subtle look which should be in my skin tone and that is what you gave me too. Overall you will be one of my fav MUAs and hope to meet you in future events. Thank you ☺️ ❤️','2026-03-28 16:39:10.157113',772,156,336),('siran jeevi',5,'Hi i did my 7 days makeup and hair style class it was very great. Subha mam was very polite and kind. They give full knowledge about makeup and hair style. They provide the all makeup products for hands on practic. And more over they providing the food for there students it was fabulous. And now my makeup carrier was started. Thankyou so much mam for giving this much knowledge about the makeup 🙏.','2026-03-28 16:39:10.160713',773,156,336),('PREETHI R A',5,'Akka , Thank you so much !! Your makeup and hairstyle made my day very special 🥰 .\nI have tried with few MUA earlier and I got disappointed where many person suggested me not to put on makeup further and finally found you and I was completely filled with happiness and satisfied all you did where Everyone said makeup was so good and it was so perfect .\nI don’t have much words to explain this , but u r the best and finally found the perfect person .\nThanks you so much Akka and lots of love ❤️.','2026-03-28 16:39:10.163938',774,156,336),('Vinitha Sekar',5,'I have choosen you by seeing ur insta profile.i think this is the best decision i have made.\nThanks a lot for making my day very special. As requested, u have given natural makeup look.\nI don\'t think other makeup artist will provide such a best in low budget.\nUr punctuality and dedication is amazing.','2026-03-28 16:39:10.167700',775,156,336),('C. Malathi',5,'Hii, i am malathi i booked a slot for bridal and reception makeup look by Divya\'s bridal studio and Beauty academy . It was soo nice ,neat nd elegant finish,we just loved it🤩😍 I recommended muhurtham for HD makeup look and reception for Glass skin makeup ,without charges for practice session makeup ,facial massage and mehandi.  Got compliments from many🥰 if anyone looking for a good makeover near mugalivakkam you can definitely book a slot with her. She will do thee best with best price also. Thankyou Divya\'s bridal studio and Beauty academy for making us pretty😍definitely it was too good beauty parlour in mugalivakkam👌👍','2026-03-28 16:39:13.606819',776,157,341),('Jeya Sree',5,'I have  taking herbal henna colouring with protein pack.. it\'s really worth to have the pack... The colour s awesome.. I love it.. protein pack makes hair smooth and strong.. reduces my hair loss.... Thankyou so much akka for your service.. 😍','2026-03-28 16:39:13.610225',777,157,341),('Supriya Dillibabu',5,'Women\'s day offers service are unique and worthy... It\'s satisfied for my self... Really good service.. beautiful gift buying also😍😍','2026-03-28 16:39:13.615157',778,157,341),('sandhya N.D',5,'\"I recently visited Divya\'s Bridal studio and had an exceptional experience! The staff were incredibly attentive and listened carefully to my needs. They were approachable and super polite, making me feel right at home.\n\nThe makeup they applied exceeded my expectations - it was flawless and lasted all day. The hairstyle they created was stunning, and the saree draping was impeccable - it stayed perfectly in place till the evening.\n\nI\'m so impressed with the service and would highly recommend the studio to anyone looking for top-notch beauty services. The team truly knows their craft, and their professionalism shines through. Can\'t wait to go back!','2026-03-28 16:39:13.618328',779,157,341),('Vidhya Dhanasekaran',5,'All the services are awesome, I have taken hair pack many times it was worth, and it maintains my hair, and makes it shiny.','2026-03-28 16:39:13.622128',780,157,341),('Revathi V.M',5,'I booked Sivanandavalli for my seemantham. A basic package for myself, my mother, and my mother-in-law. The duo were extremely professional and wonderful to work with. From the very beginning, they were highly responsive and clear in their communication, which made the entire process smooth and stress-free. Since our event started early at 4:30 AM, they arrived at the venue by 1:45 AM and got started right away without any hesitation. I especially appreciated their high standards of hygiene—not just in their tools, but in how thoughtfully and cleanly they conducted themselves throughout the process. They listened carefully to my preferences and were incredibly patient and supportive in guiding my mother-in-law through her first experience with a makeup artist. I couldn’t have asked for a better experience and would highly recommend this duo without hesitation.','2026-03-28 16:39:16.867005',781,158,342),('Akshaya Sudhakar',5,'I booked Sivanandavalli for wedding makeover and she truly satisfied my expectations. She carefully listened to all my requirements and delivered what I envisioned. The makeover was flawless and perfectly suited to the occasion. I’m extremely happy with her work and would highly recommend her to anyone looking for a professional and talented makeup artist.','2026-03-28 16:39:16.869531',782,158,342),('Pavithra Balram Jaganathan',5,'Iraivi and team did my makeup, hairdo, and saree draping for baby sprinkle event. They showcased professionalism, they were on time and completed the work well in advance. She did subtle makeup and hairdo as I asked her with reference. They were well prepared had everything needed for the work carried with them. Was easy to communicate and share my preferences. Recommend them and would book them again in future','2026-03-28 16:39:16.873019',783,158,342),('ashmitha',4,'Thank you for creating such a flawless and radiant engagement look. The makeup was elegant and long lasting . Truly loved your work—couldn’t have asked for better!','2026-03-28 16:39:16.876092',784,158,342),('Srinidhi Srikanth',5,'Siva is a great MUA she maintained the original skin tone and did a wonderful work for my engagement the saree draping was very perfect and the whole family just loved the look she is perfect in maintaining timings','2026-03-28 16:39:16.878773',785,158,342),('Sadhana Saravanan',5,'I had an amazing experience with Keerthana . She was right on time, very sweet, and exceptionally skilled at her work. My makeup looked stunning and received a lot of compliments. I also appreciated her professionalism—clean brushes and high-end, luxurious products made the experience even better. Highly recommend her services! It is worth every penny\nThank you Keerthana for making my day special ❤️','2026-03-28 16:39:22.978791',786,159,343),('Mahanya',5,'I had a wonderful experience working with Keerthana for my engagement look. The trial session was incredibly helpful. She understood my expectations, skin type, and tone. She also explained the products used and gave tips to prep for the event. I got so many compliments on my look and the pictures turned out great! Would definitely recommend her and look forward to working with her again. :)','2026-03-28 16:39:22.982143',787,159,343),('Deepthi Bhargavi',5,'We 3 sisters got our bridal and bridesmaid makeup done by Keerthana for my sister\'s wedding events. I must say I am stunned by the \"make you at ease\" nature of Keerthana.. made the whole process so comfortable and fun filled. The outcome was so natural and stunning. The products she use are of great quality cuz my sister who has a sensitive skin felt the most comfortable with her work and products. The timeliness, quality of work, dedication and liveliness she gives is outstanding. We felt so beautiful 😍 Thanks to Keerthana for making sure we are out of tension and her great job. Highly recommend for on time, charming service. Love her work.','2026-03-28 16:39:22.985774',788,159,343),('San J',5,'Keerthana is absolutely amazing at what she does! Makeup on point and exactly how you want the look to turn out. I\'ve had her do my makeup for my wedding and recently again for my baby shower cause that\'s how good she is! Her timing and understanding of what is expected is impeccable❤️\nCan\'t wait to get dolled up by her again!','2026-03-28 16:39:22.989197',789,159,343),('Divya Potluri',5,'I had the pleasure of getting my makeup done by Keerthana for my wedding reception, and I couldn’t be happier with how everything turned out! From the moment I met her, she was incredibly friendly and made me feel completely at ease. She listened to my preferences and delivered a flawless makeup look along with hair styling that was exactly what I wanted – elegant, timeless, and perfect for the occasion.\n\nThe highlight was definitely how she styled my saree, the draping was done to perfection, and I felt absolutely stunning in it! She paid attention to every little detail, ensuring that everything, from my makeup, hair to the saree, was in sync and looked picture-perfect.\n\nI would highly recommend Keerthana to anyone looking for a talented, professional, and genuinely kind makeup artist who goes above and beyond to make your special day even more magical!','2026-03-28 16:39:22.992933',790,159,343),('Deepika Viswanathan',5,'I have booked my brother Reception…. She has done best Makeup for bride and groom...She is  doing amazing makeup ...we really very satisfied for her work... affordable price.😊','2026-03-28 16:39:28.152406',791,160,345),('Aj j',5,'Had an amazing experience with the artist and everything was amazingly detailed. The makeup had so much quality in it and the way it was done is really mesmerizing. After a while of hard work there was amazing result.Im pretty sure my family will be a regular costumer from now on❤️','2026-03-28 16:39:28.155811',792,160,345),('Hema Kabaleeswaran',5,'Zara and her team was the best with hair dos make up and saree draping for all our entire family. We received a lot of compliments from all guests in our event. Would definitely recommend her as their work is exceptional.','2026-03-28 16:39:28.159291',793,160,345),('Yasmine Thahir',5,'Alhamdulliah,She was so professional yet easygoing and relaxed. She made me feel calm and secure that I would look amazing… and I did! I had a relaxing moment in an extraordinarily hectic day while and I was so happy with the way my makeup turned out','2026-03-28 16:39:28.162676',794,160,345),('Uma Raveendran',5,'Zarina is thorough professional. She uses high end products and ensures that the makeup is done according to her client\'s wishes. We had an amazing experience with her.','2026-03-28 16:39:28.165898',795,160,345),('Deepalakshmi N',5,'Padma is a very kind and professional MUA I have ever worked with. I booked her for my sis wedding recently and she was so patient enough to understand the requirements and created the look as my sis expected. She was very flexible and friendly in nature. I recommend her for your special day and definitely she will fullfill your expectations.','2026-03-28 16:39:32.525485',796,161,347),('Subashini Anbumani',5,'Padma is really an amazing artist. She did a great work for my baby shower function. Her Hairdo, makeup and saree draping work were really perfect. She made sure everything was comfortable with us too.\nOverall my experience with padma was great.','2026-03-28 16:39:32.533331',797,161,347),('Monica Sridharan',5,'“I booked her for my party makeup, and the experience was really nice. She was professional, punctual, and extremely understanding of my preferences. The makeup looked elegant, felt very comfortable, and stayed intact the whole day. I received numerous compliments, and my photographs came out beautifully. I would highly recommend her services to anyone looking for a skilled and reliable makeup artist.','2026-03-28 16:39:32.536236',798,161,347),('Akshaya S',5,'Padma priya Makeover Artistry did an amazing job! She understood my face shape and delivered a stunning look within my budget. Ensured my comfort throughout the process. Highly recommend! Neat, precise, and exceptional work. All the best for her future growth! 💄💅','2026-03-28 16:39:32.538824',799,161,347),('Priya Manoharan',5,'Excellent makeup artist! Clean work, beautiful finish, and very professional. Highly recommended 👍','2026-03-28 16:39:32.541742',800,161,347),('Vishakh',5,'Awesome party makeup by Padma Ma\'am...She is very punctual (I never expected some one can come for a party makeup for one person at the mid night) and skillful. Makeup and saree drapping were perfect. She knows how to give a natural glow. Highly recommend Service.','2026-03-28 16:39:36.570660',801,162,348),('Meenakshi Mohanraj',5,'I personally book her for all my occasions.\nRecently we booked Shrutipa sister for my brother\'s Engagement for doing makeup for bride and me.Her work was absolutely topnotch.Bride was very much satisfied.Groom loved it to the core that he she turned bride into completely gorgeous.She will maintain timing perfectly.Will suggest many things once we book her.Most importantly she was so patient even the function extended more than the timing we said.THANK YOU SHRUTIPA FOR ALL THESE THINGS❤️.Sure🥰 will be booking you for all our upcoming occasions 😍🎊❤️🫶','2026-03-28 16:39:36.573427',802,162,348),('Sowjanya Nageshwara Rao',5,'I just wanted to say a big thank you for your amazing work! You were really fast and efficient with the saree draping, and your service was very professional. We truly appreciate the way you handled makeup and styling for all 9 of my family members so smoothly. Everyone looked great and was very happy with your work. Would definitely recommend you to others!','2026-03-28 16:39:36.577232',803,162,348),('shri haritha',5,'I got my makeup , drapping and hairdo from padmavathy akka , shrutipa makeover\nShe did a great job, i loved my overall look😍❤️','2026-03-28 16:39:36.580276',804,162,348),('nisha rajendran',5,'I got my party makeup done shrutipa.The makeup artist was highly skilled and really listened to what I wanted. She matched the makeup perfectly to my outfit and skin tone, giving me natural look that lasted all night without smudging. I received so many compliments at the event! The entire experience—from consultation to final touch-up—was professional and pleasant. I’ll definitely be coming for future events','2026-03-28 16:39:36.582875',805,162,348),('Asha Mitha',5,'I got to know about Ms.Pushpa (Bridal Makeup Studio) through my fiancé, who had seen her amazing work on his friend for their family function. I was really impressed and decided to visit her in person to discuss my engagement look.\n\nWhen I first met her, I told her that I had never done full-face makeup before and didn’t want to look too heavy or overdone. I even asked for a trial, but she gently told me not to waste my money, she asked me to trust her and promised she would give me the perfect natural look. Her confidence and calm attitude made me feel comfortable right away.\n\nOn the engagement day, even though I arrived late, she stayed calm, patient, and completely focused on her work. During the makeup process, I was honestly a bit scared because it felt like she was applying too much at first. But she smiled and reassured me, saying, “Please trust me , I’ll make sure you look your best.” I was still a little nervous, but when I saw the final look, I was completely amazed! She made me look so elegant, glowing, and natural, exactly how I had imagined.\n\nNo matter what was happening in the room, even with people talking or other distractions, she never lost focus. I had to change my saree in between the event, and she helped me through the entire process, adjusting my saree beautifully and touching up my makeup to make sure everything stayed perfect. I could truly see her dedication and the 100% effort she put in till the very end.\n\nShe used high-quality products, worked with such care, and even waited till the end of my nalangu ceremony to do a final touch-up, which meant so much to me. My family and I were beyond happy with the result.\n\nI’m really glad I chose her, her work truly speaks for itself! Thank you so much for making my special day even more beautiful ❤️','2026-03-28 16:39:41.403305',806,163,349),('Suji Abhi',5,'I have done my engagement makeover from Pushpa mam. She has done it very well! I got many compliments for the makeup!\n\nRight from the day I booked the slot for my engagement, she was in touch with me clearing all sorts of silly doubts I asked with patience!\n\nShe suggested me with HD makeup and Airbrush makeup! I chose to take HD makeover for my engagement and it really came up well!\n\nI have attached my pictures along with this review! All the pictures are raw and none of them were edited! The saree picture was taken at the end of the function! Her saree draping was perfect and awesome!\n\nBefore the function day we went to her place for saree ironing and folding, so that it became like a readymade saree draping and she has done it very quickly! She provided me with bridal jewel set matching my lehanga which I was allowed to choose by myself! The package included hair extensions and colour lens too!\n\nThe makeover (makeup and hairstyle) time took around 3-4 hours to complete! Probably it might vary from person to person!\n\nOverall I had an awesome experience with her and I will surely recommend her to everyone I know!😊','2026-03-28 16:39:41.406956',807,163,349),('Priyatarshini Madavan',5,'Thank you so much sis for your wonderful work 😍😍😍and really I loved it very much and everyone said your makeup is so good 😊. specially the makeup was perfectly matched with my skin tone and hairstyle was also so perfect. Thank you so much sis🥰🥰🥰.','2026-03-28 16:39:41.410762',808,163,349),('Akila K',5,'I booked pushpa mam for my wedding. We booked for 3session viradham, reception and wedding.\nStart from the beginning, i randomly got her profile in instagram I trusted completly by seeing at her works. Being a medium skin tone i was really worried about the outcome but on my big day she made me a like a doll. I got lot of appreciation for my makeup.\nThank you mam for your great work. You can see her works in instagram and trust her blindly.','2026-03-28 16:39:41.413857',809,163,349),('shalini sundaramoorthy',5,'I have booked Pushpa mam for my engagement,Top notch service, without any second thought you can go for it!!!!\n\nI am so glad I would be able to book her for my wedding as well.She is too perfect in her work and ensures to give the best output😍\n\nI have got lot of compliments with respect to my make over.Added to that accessories provided by her are fabulous.She gave me a perfect glowing look as I requested♥️\n\nI am pretty much satisfied with her service,I trusted her on my big day,she did an amazing job✌️\n\nI have attached the pics for reference none of them are edited they are raw pics.','2026-03-28 16:39:41.418639',810,163,349),('Sam Visak',5,'Had a great experience at Sakthi\'s Salon ❤️ Didn\'t think I\'d become a regular customer this soon!\n\nThe services I avail most often are threading, waxing, hair washes and pedicures. Sakthi ma\'am always makes sure I\'m comfortable throughout the service, and is a lovely chatty companion as well! What keeps me coming back are her divine massages.\n\nShe spends an ample amount of time for each customer, and never rushes the process just to get it over with. I haven\'t experienced this kind of patient and dedicated treatment from other salons, who usually want to quickly move on to the next customer.\n\nShe is very transparent about the kinds of products she uses, and I find the pricing to be extremely affordable, while the outcome is top notch. Can\'t wait to try other services soon. I\'d definitely recommend a visit❤️','2026-03-28 16:39:50.864382',811,164,351),('mano Naarayanan',5,'She provides the best service at a reasonable price. I had a facial and hair spa treatment from Shakthi, which was really relaxing. I saw glow after the facial ,She has always been friendly and kind.','2026-03-28 16:39:50.867786',812,164,351),('Janani sri M',5,'Hi I booked my grooming for engagement marriage and reception it was perfectly done by Sakthi sister in a very perfect way and the output was flawless. Had a friendly experience and my make up lasted for long hours even my wedding was out of mahal. Thanks for the experience. Highly recommended','2026-03-28 16:39:50.870710',813,164,351),('veena nivetha',5,'I booked her for my bridal grooming, engagement, marriage and reception from starting to ending her service was very very nice. And my look was natural in my all functions. She never compromise her products, use only standard products for her client\'s. I give you more than 5stars. I guaranteed 100% for her work and services..','2026-03-28 16:39:50.874088',814,164,351),('Chitra 