and hairstyle was amazing and was also budget friendly... Love it so much','2026-03-28 16:40:03.271221',822,166,361),('Kathir kathiresan',5,'Very good makeup artist and very kind person I m very happy to our makeup look  thank u so much','2026-03-28 16:40:03.273610',823,166,361),('Prem Kumar',5,'The makeup was flawless and looked amazing in photos.The artist did a great job of creating the exact look my wife  wanted.The eye makeup was stunning and really made my eyes pop.The artist was skilled in subtle, natural-looking makeup.','2026-03-28 16:40:03.276165',824,166,361),('Sujitha M',5,'Excellent service...👌🏻👌🏻👌🏻...good results for facial...and I love smoothing results also... 👱🏻‍♀️I like her kindness and I feel comfortable with her..🥰🥰🥰..\nAffordable price also...😇😇😇','2026-03-28 16:40:03.278434',825,166,361),('Bharath Kumar',5,'I had an amazing experience at this salon! The haircut was absolutely super—exactly what I was looking for. The stylist was super friendly and really listened to what I wanted, offering great advice on what would work best for my hair type. The atmosphere was relaxed, and the service was top-notch. I left feeling like a new person! Highly recommend if you want a stylish, professional cut. Will definitely be back!','2026-03-28 16:40:05.911487',826,167,362),('mohana priya',5,'It was again a wonderful experience at Aara Beauty Parlour. I took a service of silver facial and hair spa. Ms. Divya showed her facial‑massage skills well, highlighting the facial outcome with massage strokes on certain points. And a dedicated personality I found—Ms. Sarasu—kudos for her passionate job! Minutes with different strokes and massage therapies she applied on my head left me completely stress‑free and relaxed, with a spa glow. My hair, which was dull and rough, became soft and manageable. Last but not least, Ms. Latika guided me throughout my session in the parlour.kudos to the entire team.Parlour shines with new look in new location.','2026-03-28 16:40:05.915200',827,167,362),('Kavya Devraj',4,'Sara provided very good pedicure service, very good massaging technique and was very good and pleasant service over all and was very good with eyebrows as well.\nLathika provided pedicure service for my mom, however should work on improving their pedicure service. It was a little disappointing that it didn\'t match the expectations.','2026-03-28 16:40:05.918828',828,167,362),('Kathampavasagan',5,'Excellent experience! The staff are very polite and professional. They explained everything clearly and used good quality products. I loved the service and the results. Will definitely visit again.\"Lathiga','2026-03-28 16:40:05.922463',829,167,362),('Swarnadharani Seran',5,'Excellent service! I’m completely satisfied with the output. The bridesmaid makeup turned out amazing, and the host was very friendly and made us feel comfortable throughout.','2026-03-28 16:40:05.926443',830,167,362),('Eddy Jones',5,'I’m extremely happy with the party makeup and hairstyling done by Nowshad Begum. She understood exactly what I wanted and enhanced my look beautifully without overdoing it. The makeup was elegant, long-lasting, and the hairstyle was perfectly styled to suit me. I wish her all the very best.','2026-03-28 16:40:11.500776',831,168,363),('Emmi Offi',5,'Alhamdulillah innaki ennoda cousin sister ku engagement ;mashallah makeup artist is a creator of confidence and beauty. With skill, creativity, and passion, they enhance natural features and help people feel their best. Proud to be a makeup artist who transforms looks, boosts confidence, and turns art into beauty every day. 💄✨ alhamdulillah','2026-03-28 16:40:11.504133',832,168,363),('Ayesha Siddiqua',5,'I’m extremely happy with the engagement makeover of my sister. The makeup was done very professionally, enhanced my features, and lasted throughout the event. Thank you for such beautiful work Nisha sis','2026-03-28 16:40:11.507212',833,168,363),('Vankala Bhavani',5,'I had the absolute pleasure of getting  bridal make up done by Nisha. From the very first consultation to the big day, she was professional, patient, and incredibly talented.\n\nShe truly understood the look I was going for—elegant, timeless, and radiant—and brought it to life even better than I imagined. My makeup lasted the entire day and night, through the tears, laughter, and dancing, without needing any touch-ups!\n\nNot only did I feel beautiful, but I felt like myself—just the most confident version. The products used were high-quality and skin-friendly, and the entire experience was so calming and enjoyable.\n\nI received so many compliments throughout the day, and the photos turned out stunning thanks to the flawless makeup. I highly recommend NishaGhouse to any bride looking for someone who truly cares and delivers perfection.\n\nThank you Nisha for making me feel like the best version of myself on the most important day of my life! 💖','2026-03-28 16:40:11.510676',834,168,363),('Pooja Sri',5,'I was so happy😍 that you did bridal makeup as well groom makeup and saree dropping was really nice.. Airbrush makeup was really nice.. I\'m very much satisfied and you came before that we planned..  you are very punctual, very professional and very kind.. Thanks for your wonderful works. ☺️✨','2026-03-28 16:40:11.513510',835,168,363),('Sugapriya Muruganandam',5,'“I had a wonderful facial done by Nathiya. She was very professional and gentle. My skin feels fresh, clean, and glowing. Highly satisfied with her service.”','2026-03-28 16:40:19.686885',836,169,365),('Kavitha Kavitha',5,'Good service...... Staff for very friendly','2026-03-28 16:40:19.690432',837,169,365),('Pavithra Anand',5,'Very nice service. Highly satisfaction.','2026-03-28 16:40:19.694277',838,169,365),('Keerthi Priya Parthiban',5,'Got my haircut done and I really loved the result! The service was neat, friendly and they understood exactly what I wanted. Thank you for the great experience!','2026-03-28 16:40:19.698485',839,169,365),('Madhav Rajesh',5,'Nice service..... Staff are friendly.....Good','2026-03-28 16:40:19.702350',840,169,365),('Keerthi Keerthi',5,'I\'m so satisfied your mekup,& you are so caring person sathya sister... your mekup qualities very good..👍👍 I\'m so so happy si🥰🥰🥰🥰😍😍😍😍 thank you so much for your mekup... all the best 👍 for your future ❤ 😘 💗','2026-03-28 16:40:29.155401',841,170,370),('meenu somu',5,'We are very much satisfied with her work. The make over looked so natural and long lasting for the whole day. So professional and did it so quickly and neatly. Highly recommended','2026-03-28 16:40:29.157257',842,170,370),('Sandhiya',5,'Makeup was really really nice and the skin finish as requested came out very well.Makeup artist was very friendly and patience in handling the last minute rush of marriage rituals. Just loved her work.\nThanks Satya','2026-03-28 16:40:29.158823',843,170,370),('Gaja Lakshmi',5,'Perfect makeup look 😍','2026-03-28 16:40:29.160312',844,170,370),('Kirija Kirija',5,'Very good meakup l love did 💜💜👍👍👍👍👍👍 keep going sis','2026-03-28 16:40:29.161812',845,170,370),('Unique Naturals (UN)',5,'Sk beauty verse academy is very best choice good  coaching academy very clean and hygiene hostel if anyone willing to learn and update your career you can blindly choose sk beauty verse academy','2026-03-28 16:40:33.408840',846,171,375),('Gopinath Shankar',5,'I had a best and wonderful experience with SK Beauty Verse Academy. They have all advanced equipments and well experienced staffs to make you feel glow and beautiful. They are the best here in Chennai and much recommended.','2026-03-28 16:40:33.412034',847,171,375),('pooja sri',5,'I had satisfied service by SK Beauty verse. I booked them for my marriage and reception. I\'m totally happy with their customized service and on time presence. I\'m suggesting SK Beauty verse to our memorable functions. Hope this review helpful to others.','2026-03-28 16:40:33.415086',848,171,375),('Madhan',5,'\"I recently visited Sk beauty verse, The staff is incredibly professional and attentive, ensuring that all my needs were met with care. The ambiance of the parlour is both relaxing and stylish, creating a perfect environment for a pampering session. I opted for a facial, haircut and the results were exceptional. I also appreciated the high-quality products used. Highly recommend Sk beauty verse for anyone looking to indulge in some top-notch beauty treatments.','2026-03-28 16:40:33.418120',849,171,375),('Monica Monica',5,'We approached SK Beauty Verse for my engagement function. They did mehendi,bridal makeup for both bride&groom, Hairstyle,saree draping,Eye makeup. I got ready for function without any tense and looked fabulous on the day. Thankyou skbeauty verse mam & team members for making the day beautiful.','2026-03-28 16:40:33.422375',850,171,375),('SK Full Of Love',5,'I had a wonderful experience at Purple Parlour. I opted for a layered haircut and a facial, and I’m truly impressed with the results. The haircut was styled beautifully, and the facial left my skin looking fresh, glowing, and well cared for.\nThe staff at Purple Parlour were professional, polite, and attentive throughout the service, which made the entire experience very comfortable. What made it even more enjoyable was the lucky spin offer for bills above ₹1500. It was a fun and engaging idea, and the gifts I received were genuinely useful and absolutely worth it.\nOverall, Purple Parlour delivers excellent quality services along with thoughtful customer engagement. I felt happy, pampered, and satisfied. I would highly recommend Purple Parlour to anyone looking for great service and a delightful experience.','2026-03-28 16:40:38.157190',851,172,376),('Mythili',5,'Amazing makeup skills in professional way from Venmani Akka.. My family loved the makeup, hairstyle and the saree draping is extraordinary.. Overall look was fabulous.. Highly recommended..  One of the most talented MUA in Redhills.. Trust them guys they give you the best in affordable price..','2026-03-28 16:40:38.160703',852,172,376),('Kavi Kavi',5,'Am regular for eyebrows threading to the purples bridal studio.... painless, quick and perfect shapes... all the services are affordable and neat service.. highly recommended for the beauty services and makeover ... bridal makeup , hairstyle and neat saree draping..  saree box folding is very affordable and pricing just 250 only','2026-03-28 16:40:38.164496',853,172,376),('Rekha dharani',5,'“I recently completed the saree pre-pleating class, and the learning experience was great. The instructor explained each step in a simple and easy manner, and made sure I understood everything. Very professional and helpful. Highly recommend their classes!”','2026-03-28 16:40:38.169354',854,172,376),('Sara Deepan',5,'Recently I done facial and eyebrows in this studio . Next day I saw my face with amazingly. Really staff doing superbly and friendly they suggesting facial for our skin tone . I suggest everyone this parlour for grooming and facial all. Thank you purple bridal studio','2026-03-28 16:40:38.172745',855,172,376),('Naseema Naseema',5,'\"I had such a wonderful experience! The makeup was absolutely flawless and perfectly suited my face and skin tone. The blending, detailing, and finishing were just amazing. She was very professional, patient, and made me feel so comfortable throughout the session. The final look was elegant, natural, and long-lasting. I received so many compliments! Highly recommended for anyone looking for a talented and dedicated makeup artist. Thank you for making my day extra special! 💄✨\"','2026-03-28 16:40:45.092149',856,173,377),('Angelin Sharon',5,'“Mubeen Makeup Artist’s work is truly outstanding. They perfectly understand our preferences and deliver exactly the look we ask for. The final outcome is always flawless. After seeing the posts and stories, I can confidently say it’s on another level. Wishing you many more milestones — keep rocking!” 💄✨','2026-03-28 16:40:45.095604',857,173,377),('Charulatha K',5,'I had the absolute pleasure of having mubeen and her amazing team do my makeup for all my wedding events, including the engagement and I couldn’t be happier with how everything turned out! Right from the start, I told her I wanted a skin-finish look , something that felt like me, not too heavy or dramatic and she delivered it perfectly every single time. The makeup looked flawless yet so natural, exactly how I dreamed of looking on my big days. Mubeen was super flexible and down-to-earth, making her easy and comfortable to work with, even amidst the busy wedding chaos. Her team was just as friendly and professional, and made me feel completely at ease. I\'m so glad I chose mubeen and would love to work with her again!','2026-03-28 16:40:45.098828',858,173,377),('Swetha',4,'Her makeup was absolutely beautiful and perfectly done. The way she blended the foundation looked so smooth and natural, giving a flawless finish. The eye makeup was especially stunning — well-defined, neat, and enhancing the overall look without being too heavy. The colors she chose suited the outfit and skin tone perfectly. Her attention to detail, from the eyebrows to the lipstick, made the entire look elegant and classy. It truly highlighted her skills and made the whole appearance look confident and radiant.','2026-03-28 16:40:45.102105',859,173,377),('Mohammed Riyaz',5,'Thank you, Mubeen Make Up Artist, for the wonderful makeover and for making me feel so confident and beautiful. Your talent, creativity, and dedication truly reflect in your work. I really appreciate the effort and care you put into every detail to give me the perfect look. You made my special day even more memorable, and I’m so grateful for your amazing work.','2026-03-28 16:40:45.105268',860,173,377),('Priya guru',5,'I have known Azlin for 4 years now, she has gained trust like no other mua that I keep calling her for every event of mine. Today on 31st Jan 2026, 