all the very best mam for your future endeavours...','2026-03-28 16:40:48.684045',864,174,382),('Keerthi',5,'Nisha was our hairdresser and saree draper for a family wedding. I had an excellent experience and highly recommend her services.\n\nThe saree draping and hairstyling were absolutely perfect and received many compliments. She was also very friendly and accommodating, adjusting to our needs and ensuring the entire process was seamless.\n\nAlso she was punctual and understanding, making us feel incredibly comfortable and gave thoughtful suggestions that truly enhanced the final look.\n\nIt was a pleasure to work with someone so highly talented and genuinely dedicated to their craft.','2026-03-28 16:40:48.686070',865,174,382),('saranya viswanathan',5,'I recently got my party makeup done, and I am very happy with the service. The makeup was done beautifully and suited my face perfectly. It looked natural, elegant, and lasted throughout the event. The work was neat and professional. Excellent job! I would definitely recommend the service to others.','2026-03-28 16:40:56.047202',866,175,383),('Pankajavalli Varadharajan',5,'She is an awesome makeup artist and really good human .\nI booked her ( Mrs Jenifer) for my parents sashtiapthapoorthi ( 60th wedding anniversary)to do makeup for my mom and myself.\nShe is so friendly in nature and very caring person of my skin sensitivity.\nEspecially she took her time to analyse my skin and proceeded with her professional procedures.\nI become Big fan her professional ethics\nI am not telling any sugar coated words, truly i experienced such a wonderful output on that day.\nEven her makeup towards my mom is excellent and also comfortable for my mom.\n\nThank you jeni for ur service.\nYou made our day more happy 😊😊😊😊😊😊😊','2026-03-28 16:40:56.051141',867,175,383),('Vanitha Rangarajan',5,'I’m extremely happy with the service at this parlour. The MUA are skilled, patient, and very welcoming. They took time to understand my needs and delivered perfect results. The hygiene, quality of products, and overall experience were outstanding. Highly recommended!','2026-03-28 16:40:56.055031',868,175,383),('Rekha',5,'She genuinely listened and tailored a look that highlighted my daughter\'s features without being too heavy. I felt that my daughter looked her absolute best. The service was prompt, professional, and very respectful. I will certainly recommend her.','2026-03-28 16:40:56.058723',869,175,383),('Bhuvana Eshwari',5,'I am a regular customer for hair cut and threading. This is the first time did makeup and hairstyling for baby shower. In affordable price, they did a great job and the look was mind blowing. Thank you Jenni.','2026-03-28 16:40:56.061526',870,175,383),('Seyezhai R.',5,'I would like to extend my heartfelt thanks to the Beautician Ms.Radii for the absolutely stunning makeup done for my daughter’s engagement! From the very beginning, she was professional, kind, and truly attentive to every detail.\nThe makeup was elegant, perfectly suited to my daughter’s personality, and lasted beautifully throughout the event.She has an incredible eye for color and style, and she made sure the look was both natural and radiant — exactly what we wanted for such a special day.\nThe products used were high-quality, the hygiene was impeccable, and the overall experience was so comfortable and enjoyable.\nI would highly recommend Radii to anyone looking for a talented and dedicated makeup artist.','2026-03-28 16:41:03.746874',871,176,388),('Manjula Gunaa',5,'I booked her for my son’s birthday makeup and I’m extremely satisfied. The makeup was natural, classy, and stayed perfect throughout the function. She is very professional, calm, and understands skin tone well. Thank you for making my day special 💖 Highly recommend her.','2026-03-28 16:41:03.750362',872,176,388),('jayakandhan kandhan',5,'\"Had a fantastic experience with Radii . She is extremely talented, responsive, and friendly. The makeup was applied perfectly and looked amazing in photos. I felt so comfortable and confident I will definitely be booking her again!\"❤️💙💙','2026-03-28 16:41:03.755046',873,176,388),('Bhavya Np',5,'Had a very good experience with Radhika, it was a first time i had booked her by looking into reviews. Very happy and satisfied by her patience and style in her work. 👍','2026-03-28 16:41:03.758435',874,176,388),('Divya Krishan',5,'I would highly highly recommend Makeup Artist Radhika for all your makeovers on your big day,it was extremely elegant.The most important thing which makes her special is unlike few other makeup artists, she is very polite, listens to all your requirements patiently yet professional. Her behaviour and hospitality is awesome. Please keep up this quality with all your clients no matters how far you reach..!!','2026-03-28 16:41:03.761868',875,176,388),('Priya Dharsini',5,'I had a wonderful experience with Nithya Mam for my reception and mugurtham. The makeup was flawless, natural, and perfectly suited to my outfits and skin tone. It stayed fresh throughout the events without any touch-ups. She was very professional, calm, and attentive to my preferences. Thank you for making me  and feel confident on my big day! She was very punctual and arrived much earlier than expected. She stayed with me throughout the event and made me feel very comfortable. I didn\'t give her enough time for the mugurtham, but she managed it beautifully and delivered an excellent result.   makeup! She also did a makeover for my man,he looked handsome with the makeup! Highly recommended for both bride and groom.','2026-03-28 16:41:11.153443',876,177,393),('Jeni Jennifer',5,'I had my Mugurtham and Reception makeup done by Makeup Artist Nithiya. She did an amazing job! The makeup looked beautiful, natural, and lasted the whole event. Very professional and friendly. Highly recommended!','2026-03-28 16:41:11.156974',877,177,393),('Archana Archana',5,'“I’m honestly so happy and satisfied with the makeup service. From the beginning, she was very patient and understood exactly what I wanted. Enakku romba natural ah, elegant ah look venum nu sonnen, and she delivered it perfectly. Makeup over ah illa, very classy and soft glam ah irundhudhu. The base was so flawless and lightweight — full day irundhum heavy ah feel aagala.\nEye makeup, hairstyle, everything was perfectly matched with my outfit and jewellery. Blending was very neat and professional. Most importantly, she made me feel so comfortable and confident throughout the session. Naan romba tension la irundhen, but she handled everything calmly and made the whole experience stress-free.','2026-03-28 16:41:11.161087',878,177,393),('Rajalakshmi Samibabu',5,'Absolutely loved my baby shower makeup! Nithya mam gave me a beautiful, glowing look that felt natural but polished. I received so many compliments. Highly recommend! Hair do is the highlight of the show, it was too good👍','2026-03-28 16:41:11.165513',879,177,393),('RAMYA SURESH',5,'Nithya mam made my day more beautiful ❤️ she is very  professional with her work  , I was able to carry the makeup upto 7 hour without any mess , she  is very friendly to work with , thanks a lot for making my day a memorable one mam.','2026-03-28 16:41:11.169289',880,177,393),('Raji palani',5,'A big big thank you to Poornima and team for there amazing work. Within short period of time Poornima and team did a great job for 4 events of the wedding at Grande bay resort Mahabalipuram. We are very happy with their service. Team was very fast Especially Poornima with her many years of experience made sure she brought the best in all member\'s. We all were very impressed that she was able to finish 8 members make up and hairdo within 3 -4 hours for each event. Yet charged very reasonable then any other experienced make up artist would. Looking at her hardwork and sincerity we had also invited her to be the make up artist for the 2nd reception as part of the wedding for the bride and groom along with the bridesmaid. Within 3hrs again Poornima and team did a impeccable job. A special thank you to Poornima for accomodating us and not only was she a great makeup artist but has now become apart of the family. We are very very happy to have had met you Poornima.  ❤️❤️❤️ I highly recommend Poornima to anyone that is looking for sincerity, hardwork and such professionalism in there work.','2026-03-28 16:41:16.663045',881,178,398),('Sunandha Thamaraiselvan',5,'Hired Poornima yesterday on a very short notice. She did a great job from selecting suitable make up for my saree color, understood the occation, and the make up didnt smudge for 8+ hours. Not even a hair was out of place. Loved her work, would 100% recommend her and hire her again. Pakka professional!','2026-03-28 16:41:16.666751',882,178,398),('Faaiza Hameed',5,'I chose Poornima makeup artist for my engagement and it was the best decision. The makeup was flawless, lightweight, and stayed perfect throughout the event. They listened to my preferences and enhanced my features beautifully. I felt confident, radiant, and received so many compliments. Highly recommended for bridal and engagement looks','2026-03-28 16:41:16.673178',883,178,398),('Lakshmi',5,'Poornima did my makeup for 4 events in a week. She arrived on time , made suggestions and also brought extra items to enhance my final look. She made me feel comfortable. Her  makeup skills are impeccable and my final look on each occasion exceeded my expectations. She will definitely be my makeup artist for all family occasions during my trips to India.Thank you Poornima for everything .','2026-03-28 16:41:16.682051',884,178,398),('sheena eugine',5,'I absolutely loved my sister’s reception makeup! The artist perfectly captured the soft, elegant look we wanted.Both the makeup and hairdo lasted all day—from the ceremony to the reception—without needing any touch-ups. She received so many compliments! Highly recommend for any bride who wants to look radiant and feel confident on her big day.','2026-03-28 16:41:16.696025',885,178,398),('U23CC0020-Jeevitha',5,'I had an amazing experience with her. From the moment we started, she made me feel comfortable and confident. She paid close attention to my preferences and worked with such precision and creativity. The final result was flawless, elegant, long-lasting, and exactly what I envisioned. Truly a talented artist and a wonderful person to work with. Highly recommend!','2026-03-28 16:41:25.180684',886,179,400),('saibaba.c. 1946',5,'I have booked her for my grand daughter\'s puberty function...she did very good job and we all very satisfied with her work thankyou Pinky Such a sweet person by heart aswell','2026-03-28 16:41:25.184490',887,179,400),('Nish Wanth',5,'Great work.. It\'s not very easy to adapt to all situations for a women during the work.. Your really doing a great job .. keep rocking.. very much satisfied with her work... The best 💯','2026-03-28 16:41:25.188170',888,179,400),('Rekha takashi',5,'Superb party makeup she did for me mum very friendly and good work','2026-03-28 16:41:25.191333',889,179,400),('Ezhilarasi B',4,'I have done facial and Hair Coloring here. Service was very nice and she is very friendly to clear our doubts.','2026-03-28 16:41:25.194351',890,179,400),('Saronika Devakumari',5,'I got my makeup done by amazing makeup artist Beulah akka\nfor my son’s 1st birthday, and I am extremely happy with the overall experience. She did a fantastic job matching my skin tone perfectly .it looked very natural and flawless. The makeup was elegant, longlasting, and exactly what I wanted for such a special day. The hairdo was also done beautifully and completed the entire look so well. I received so many compliments, and I felt very confident throughout the event. She is not only highly skilled but also such a kind, calm, and beautiful person to work with. She offers her services all across Tamil Nadu, which is a big plus. I am very much satisfied with her work and would definitely recommend her to anyone looking for a professional makeup artist. You can trust her completely and go to her without any hesitation.','2026-03-28 16:41:28.402802',891,180,405),('Deepika Deepika',5,'Booked her for a family function and the result was beyond expectations. Very neat work, clean finish, and the makeup looked fresh for long hours. Hair styling was also done with great attention. Truly a stress-free and satisfying experience.thank you Beulah sis','2026-03-28 16:41:28.406458',892,180,405),('pradeep kumar',5,'Amazing makeup experience 🤍\nNatural look, perfect skin tone matching, and beautiful hairstyle. Very professional and friendly. 100% satisfied  recommend to all','2026-03-28 16:41:28.409976',893,180,405),('Padma Priya MS',5,'I attended the 4-day Saree Box Folding class at Pink Bridal Studio and Academy and had a great learning experience. The sessions were well-structured, easy to follow, and perfect for self-learning. Mam explained each step clearly, and I now feel confident in folding sarees professionally. Highly recommended for beginners and bridal professionals alike!','2026-03-28 16:41:28.413491',894,180,405),('Preethi. P',5,'Well satisfied about this saree folding class.','2026-03-28 16:41:28.416878',895,180,405),('Dr Ashika',5,'I booked Jiya Makeup Artistry for my wedding and reception, and I couldn’t have made a better choice. A huge thanks to Sathya akka, Mani bro, and Priya (drapist) for their incredible work. They were extremely professional, punctual, and well-organized throughout the entire process.\nThe makeup was exactly how I wanted it — subtle, neat, and beautifully glowy. They truly understood my preferences and delivered everything perfectly, while also keeping the atmosphere so warm and jovial, which made the whole experience even more special and stress-free.\nI would wholeheartedly recommend them to anyone without a second thought. Sathya akka has definitely become my go-to makeup artist for all my future events!\n❤️❤️❤️','2026-03-28 16:41:33.449212',896,181,406),('nandhinee k',5,'I booked Sathya mam makeup for my Wedding. She did an absolutely stunning work. The makeup was so natural and outcome was exactly as I requested. Everyone complimented my makeup. I was so happy of her work and how the makeup turned out.','2026-03-28 16:41:33.452480',897,181,406),('Revathy',5,'Jiyamakeupartistry isn’t just a makeup service for me it feels like family.\nSathya and her wonderful team have been a part of my most precious milestones : my Sangeet, engagement, my daughter’s cradle ceremony, and now her 1st birthday. Over time, this has grown into a beautiful emotional bond.\nSathya’s makeup is truly effortless. There’s a calm confidence in the way she works, and the results are always elegant, natural, and exactly what I hope for sometimes even better than I imagined. Beyond her talent, her warmth, professionalism, and care make every event feel special and stress-free.\nHonestly, I find myself looking for reasons and occasions just to book her again. That’s how much trust and love I have for her work.\nThank you, Sathya, for being a part of my journey and my family’s happiest moments. I’m so grateful for you and your team ❤️','2026-03-28 16:41:33.455680',898,181,406),('Pradeepa Satish',5,'Hi dear,\n\nI would like to sincerely thank you for such a wonderful seminar and for your patience in explaining each and every detail so clearly. There was no show-off, no exaggeration, no drama—everything was just so sweet, simple, and crystal clear.\n\nI asked so many questions, and you patiently cleared all my doubts. I came out of the session feeling completely satisfied and happy. I travelled all the way from Chennai to attend this class, and I can truly say it was absolutely worth the money. The knowledge you shared was extraordinary, and the session was very well organised.\n\nA special thanks for the amazing makeup demo—both the models looked fabulous, and your techniques were explained so clearly. Who does this level of teaching with so much honesty and openness?\n\nI already loved your work, but after this seminar, I’ve become a huge fan of you.\n\nLots of love 💖','2026-03-28 16:41:33.458989',899,181,406),('gowri reddy',5,'I honestly don’t have enough words to express how wonderful this class was. It was exactly what I expected—and even more. From the way the session was planned to how everything was explained so patiently, it made the entire learning experience extremely comfortable and satisfying for me.\n\nI felt very at ease throughout the class, which made it easier to understand, ask questions, and truly absorb what was being taught. Every detail was explained so clearly, and the guidance felt very genuine and encouraging. It never felt rushed or forced; instead, it felt calm, structured, and thoughtfully delivered.\n\nI truly appreciate the amount of effort, time, and hustle you’ve put in to make this class happen. It clearly shows the dedication and passion you have for teaching and mentoring. All the hard work behind the scenes really reflected in the quality of the session.\n\nI’m extremely grateful for this experience and feel very satisfied and confident after attending the class. Thank you so much for creating such a positive and meaningful learning environment. It really means a lot 🤍','2026-03-28 16:41:33.462197',900,181,406),('Keerthi Sekar',5,'I had an amazing experience with my makeup artist on my special day. The makeup was flawless, long-lasting, and perfectly suited my skin tone and outfit. I felt confident and beautiful throughout the event. Thank you for making my day even more memorable!','2026-03-28 16:41:37.927044',901,182,411),('Avanti Narayanan',5,'Bhuvi did airbrush makeup and hair styling for my Sangeet and wedding events and I was really happy with the final looks for both! She used high quality products and a neat and clean working space and came prepared with everything needed. The makeup lasted well for both events over multiple hours, and hair styling and accessories were also perfect. Bhuvi is also an expert with saree draping and helped with both six and nine yards saree tying for my events. Thank you Bhuvi :-)','2026-03-28 16:41:37.930599',902,182,411),('Supraja Krishnan',5,'Lakshmi, my makeup artist, was fantastic. I booked an appointment on short notice and the owner Bhuvii was kind and gracious. I wanted a soft no make-up makeup look with a dewy glow and Lakshmi did a wonderful job, she was super quick and meticulous as well(we had a time constraint). I was very happy with the end result. Highly recommend this studio.','2026-03-28 16:41:37.934159',903,182,411),('Arthi',5,'Wow! What else I can say? Thank you for making me so beautiful on my big day. Bhuvi was a pleasure to work with. Having her do makeup and hairdo at my reception and marriage was one of the best decision I ever made. Her way of handling each & every step of hairdo and make up was cool, professional and neat. You mad me feel so comfortable. Thank you so much for all your help, you are one seriously talented woman!','2026-03-28 16:41:37.937812',904,182,411),('Divya Bhaskar',5,'As a person who has never done any makeup except kajal and eyeliner in my life, i was very apprehensive about doing makeup for my wedding. Got bhuvi\'s recommendation from a known to. She did a trial makeup for my minimal make up look and it very much For both my reception and wedding, bhuvi came on time for the makeup, finished the job perfectly on time and did an excellent job. For both my looks, i got appreciated very much and i loved how the look came out perfectly. Very professional, polite,punctual and talented make up artist. I would definitely recommend her for bridal makeup services.','2026-03-28 16:41:37.941408',905,182,411),('Mehamoodha Nousheen',5,'I had an amazing experience with Shyamala Makeover Artistry! The makeup look was absolutely stunning and exactly what I had envisioned.Thank you so much for your amazing work! The makeup look was perfect, and I truly appreciate your effort and attention to detail.','2026-03-28 16:41:44.964948',906,183,413),('Preethi Raman',4,'Did bridesmaid makeup. Had a good experience in makeup. The look was neat and stayed for longer than expected. Amount charged for make up and hair do was reasonable.\nDid saree draping from one of her assistants. Wasn’t very much impressed with the saree draping as it wasn’t perfect. Could have done better.\nOverall, Shyamala is knowledgeable and can trust the makeup, hairdo.\n\nMakeup-5/5\nHairdo-5/5\nSaree draping -3.5/5','2026-03-28 16:41:44.968082',907,183,413),('Hemalatha',5,'I had booked bridal makeup for my engagement. She did bridal makeup, saree draping and hair do. The look was neat and loved it🤩. Thank you so much sis❤ and keep rocking🌟🤝','2026-03-28 16:41:44.971034',908,183,413),('Karunya Siva Chembian',5,'Bridal makeup and saree draping, hair do was amazingly done by Shyamala. Thank you so much, Everyone loved the makeup and I love all the looks. It was so skin like lite weight makeup. ❤️❤️❤️❤️','2026-03-28 16:41:44.973940',909,183,413),('Shruthi Madhavan',5,'I know its pretty late but I availed her service during October for my brother’s wedding. Very much impressed with the overall makeup, hairdo and saree draping. The team handled all the bridesmaids with utmost ease and accomodated the suggestions that each of us gave. Personally, I’m game for subtle makeup and nude shades. She gave the perfect look as per my desire. If you’re looking out for a perfect look at an afgordable price, this is the best pick!\n\nMakeup -5/5\nHairdo -4.5/5\nSaree draping -5/5','2026-03-28 16:41:44.976304',910,183,413),('Subha Elango',5,'Got my post wedding make up done by sridevi . The make up was fabulous 😍 it turned out well than what I expected .\nGot so many compliments 😊\nSo happy I found her !!\nShe is very passionate make up artist .\nWill highly recommend her for all your events .','2026-03-28 16:41:58.195804',911,184,415),('sushmitha kandheri',5,'Love her eye makeup the most and that flawless base🤌🏼🤩 Sridevi is very very patient and perfect when it comes to makeup\nWould highly recommend 👍🏻','2026-03-28 16:41:58.199409',912,184,415),('hamsa ashokan',5,'One of the best makeup artist in chennai..... I have booked her for my sister marriage for reception and wedding look.... The finish was awesome everybody said the makeup was very nice..... Everybody was so happy with her work... She did exactly wht we asked her..... Very much skin like finish with glow...... Definitely you can book her for your special day to make it even more special!!!!!','2026-03-28 16:41:58.203293',913,184,415),('Lavanyamithu Lavanyamithu',5,'I\'m absolutely delighted with the exceptional services I received at Neem trends parlour! From the moment I walked in, I was treated like royalty. The eyebrow shaping was precise and tailored to my face shape, the facial was rejuvenating and left my skin glowing, and the hair spa was heavenly - my locks have never felt softer! The staff were knowledgeable, friendly, and made me feel pampered and relaxed throughout the entire experience. The ambiance was calming and serene, perfect for unwinding. I highly recommend neem trends parlour to anyone looking for top-notch beauty services. The attention to detail, professionalism, and warm hospitality make it a must-visit destination. Can\'t wait to go back and indulge in more of their amazing services! 🌸💆‍♀️✨ 5/5 stars\"','2026-03-28 16:42:03.492956',914,185,420),('Gunasekaran A',5,'We are truly delighted with the work Gokulapriya has been doing in the field of makeup.\nFor the past two years, she has served as the makeup artist for our government school village kids’ dance performances.\nThe transformation of the children after her touch is remarkable—on par with professional television programs.\n\nWhat makes it even more special is that she offers all of this completely free of charge for our organization.','2026-03-28 16:42:03.495898',915,185,420),('Radhika KasthuriBabu',5,'One of the best parlours I have ever visited! The results are excellent and the service is outstanding. They carefully analyze your skin type and recommend the most suitable facial. The massages are wonderful and very relaxing. I’m a regular customer, and every visit has been consistently great. ✨💆‍♀️','2026-03-28 16:42:03.498272',916,185,420),('suchitra Panda',5,'\"I\'m absolutely thrilled with the eyebrow shaping service I received! The technician was professional, skilled, and made sure I was comfortable throughout the process. The results exceeded my expectations - my brows look perfectly shaped and defined. Highly recommend this salon for anyone looking for great eyebrow care. Thanks for the amazing service!','2026-03-28 16:42:03.502087',917,185,420),('reshma venkatachalam',5,'Service is really good. Kani is the person you should go. She is really professional, gentle and pay attention to details. I have Got my eyebrows and facial done. Extremely satisfied with their products which is really good without side effects.','2026-03-28 16:42:03.505967',918,185,420),('Saranya Ponraj',5,'\"The makeup turned out absolutely beautiful. The hairstyle was done neatly and stayed intact throughout the event. I was also very happy with the saree draping. It was done perfectly and looked elegant. Overall, I am extremely satisfied with the service.\"','2026-03-28 16:42:06.116028',919,186,425),('shanu',5,'I booked Karthika mam for my cousins wedding and the work was very excellent. She was very quick and the output was amazing . Very kind to the client , suggesting ideas etc. overall extremely satisfied.','2026-03-28 16:42:06.120025',920,186,425),('sanju georje',5,'I got my makeup done by her  and I absolutely loved it! 💕 The makeup was so beautifully natural, simple, and light – exactly how I wanted it. Even after sweating a lot, it stayed perfectly for almost 7 hours without any touch-ups. She’s truly the best at what she does, and I really love her work every single time. Highly recommend!','2026-03-28 16:42:06.124152',921,186,425),('A Shruthi',5,'Had a great experience with kartika and the make up is too good and very satisfied also.','2026-03-28 16:42:06.128156',922,186,425),('Anton Steffania',5,'I was Extremely Satisfied with the Makeup Hairdo and the Saree Draping. The makeup was subtle and natural. Everything was done just the way I wanted it to be. I truly loved the overall look.','2026-03-28 16:42:06.132144',923,186,425),('Atchaya Mohan',5,'Really Loved the session. Hands on practice was very very helpful and motivating. Both the mentors were awesome and guided us properly throughout the session. And kept checking on us each and every 10-15 mins it helped me to stay focused on the session. Thank you so much ma\'am 💕 for teaching me this awesome class.','2026-03-28 16:42:13.658304',924,187,426),('Vaishu Sree',5,'Hi mam\n\nThank you very much for your thread bangle workshop. It was an extraordinary learning experience. Your detailed explanation on wrapping techniques and hands on experience was very informative.\nVery budget friendly and beginner friendly class. Also your support after class is very nice. With a zero knowledge was able to make these bangles after your workshop\n\nRegards,\nVaishali','2026-03-28 16:42:13.660198',925,187,426),('SHABANA RAFI',4,'First time, I\'m wrapping this. First attempt itself I can do my own creative. This credit is goes to fully for sathya mam. Without hesitation she is clearing all doubts  and practicing further improvements. I\'m proud that I\'m the student of sathya mam','2026-03-28 16:42:13.661798',926,187,426),('Lakshmi Priya',5,'It\'s really a great and engaging session.  Clear ah solli kuduthanga porumaiya neat ah ..Really nice class. I have also done bangles with the kit they provided worth the money 🥰','2026-03-28 16:42:13.663292',927,187,426),('Ajayhari 0506',5,'I recently completed my nail course at satya nail artisty... Mam was so friendly and welcoming,i had a amazing experience..I  learned so much and practice d every types of nail types...it was very knowledgeable and helpful.. thank you satya mam for teaching me','2026-03-28 16:42:13.664857',928,187,426),('Yuvalakshmi Kr',5,'Had a wonderful experience! Kavitha mam knows exactly what her clients need and always begins with a neat, clear conversation before starting her work. She even worked on our mom, and she truly understands what makeup suits each age and how to match it with the right jewellery. The bride and I looked absolutely stunning, and we received so many compliments on our makeup. As a bridesmaid, I felt confident and glowing throughout my sister’s reception, all thanks to her amazing touch.','2026-03-28 16:42:17.123801',929,188,431),('kaniyaa Arts',5,'Kavitha sis made my day special. she is very experienced makeup artist with your budget. I had an incredible experience in my wedding and booked for my sister wedding also in the month of Feb! I def. recommend their services!!','2026-03-28 16:42:17.126963',930,188,431),('revathy partheeban',5,'\"Had an amazing experience with Safora Bridal Makeup Artist! They absolutely nailed the look I wanted, and the final result exceeded my expectations. Super happy and highly recommend!\"','2026-03-28 16:42:17.130032',931,188,431),('Hema Tahrani Logesh',5,'Kavitha is incredibly professional and kind; I can always relax while she does make-up. I will gladly utilise her services again in the future because the quality she provides is always excellent! She did a wonderful job, and everyone looked stunning! I would wholeheartedly suggest her to anyone.','2026-03-28 16:42:17.132806',932,188,431),('Kirthika Ramaraj',5,'Booked Kavitha ma\'am for my wedding after having a trial session. Her work is phenomenal! She catered all my specific needs and ensured I looked my best on my big day. Best thing about her is she is very punctual, uses quality products and her packages are affordable. Overall I\'m happy with my experience from the trial session, pre bridal service to the wedding day. Would highly recommend her!','2026-03-28 16:42:17.135747',933,188,431),('Edhitha Krishna',5,'Actually I loved the class I attended chitra mam’s class for ₹4000, and I must say, it was one of the best decisions I’ve ever made. She didn’t just teach the syllabus she made sure we understood every concept with love, care, and clarity. Her teaching touched my heart deeply. I felt like I wasn’t just a student, but like her own child. She completed the full syllabus with patience and dedication. I’m truly satisfied and grateful beyond words. Thank you, Ma’am, for making learning such a beautiful experience. You gave me both knowledge and confidence. I’ll always remember your class with a smile and warmth in my heart.”','2026-03-28 16:42:25.790355',934,189,432),('pallavi Saravana kumar',5,'Mam ... Really I\'m very happy to join ur class semma mentor mam neenga what a explanation u have given us without hesitation u repeated everything again n again .. For 2500  semma worth class for 3 days\nEthanaiyo class poirukan paid huge amounts really im not satisfied with their explanations .. mam neenga semma love you mam...\nEagerly waiting to meet you again for  updations..','2026-03-28 16:42:25.793708',935,189,432),('A K Raja rajeswari',5,'Took personal self grooming session. Session lasted for 2 days. I am happy as I learnt several techniques in makeup for my face including hairstyles for my hair type. The artists were professional, knowledgeable and used high quality products for grooming, suitable for my skin type. I had one day of teaching and one day of self practice where I got to ask doubts also they overlook the grooming I did, suggested improvements when needed. Totally worth the money. I would definitely recommend to anyone looking for self grooming sessions.','2026-03-28 16:42:25.797286',936,189,432),('sanjana sweet',5,'Best best best Mentor and best Teaching. With zero knowledge now as a professional Makeup Artist. Oly bcz of my Mentor Chitra Mam and Lovable Priya Mam. With hole bundle of care for all students and organisation it’s oly by Ur Sir Dhamu. 100% worthy for ever penny.','2026-03-28 16:42:25.802039',937,189,432),('Menaka R',5,'I have completed 10days master class in chitras mam academy, which was really a good and worth , Mam taught us a real meaning of makeup and I’m soo glad to been a one of the student of chitra mam and priya mam, more thankful to whole Chithra’s makeup team❤️❤️❤️','2026-03-28 16:42:25.806042',938,189,432),('Sowmya Shiva',5,'Dhana\'s makeover is absolutely stunning and makes sure what the client is expecting the look to be.Very professional and friendly in handling clients. I booked her for my wedding makeup look, it was stunning and gorgeous with the original features of my face. Everyone in my family liked her makeup and we are suggesting her work to our known circles.','2026-03-28 16:42:34.167317',939,190,437),('Nivedhini Ramesh',5,'Hii Sis, I dont know from where i could start. Thanks for making my day wonderful! Everybody told that makeup done was really beautiful and it was super stayed in my face till evening. I used to sweat a lot and also we completed our makeup by 8 AM i think and it was stayed the same till 2 PM. Thanks once again! I didnt regret even a min for choosing you! Next for every event i personally want you to do my makeup...','2026-03-28 16:42:34.170764',940,190,437),('kavitha interface',5,'I am very satisfied dhana work, more complements for my makeover, humble person. Thank you dhana you have magic🪄 in your hand🥳🥳🥳','2026-03-28 16:42:34.174138',941,190,437),('Uma quenchtechnovalley',5,'\"Even after travelling from Chennai to Madurai, Lux Glamup did a fantastic job! Subha and her team transformed the bride and 8 bridesmaids with stunning makeup looks within a short period, maintaining exceptional quality. Highly recommended! for big day\"','2026-03-28 16:42:37.094045',942,191,442),('Priya Naresh',5,'I booked  Subha Makeup Artist for Reception. She gave me a gorgeous glossy makeup look that was absolutely stunning! The 12-hour stay was impressive. Highly recommend for any occasion!!','2026-03-28 16:42:37.100976',943,191,442),('mallika jagannathan',5,'Lux_glam_up -- Subha is a fabulous makeup artist. I booked her for my Engagement , Reception, and wedding. She knows the ins and outs of every product she uses and take care to ensure that her clients feel comfortable and great about themselves! She was very gentle and polite with my face and unlike a lot of MUA\'s. All the very best  Subha wish to see you in a top most position.','2026-03-28 16:42:37.105652',944,191,442),('sathvika omprakash',5,'I booked lux glam up for my engagement makeover and it turned out more than my expectations and she made me look really very beautiful.. subha is highly recommended makeup artist praised for her professionalism, flexibility, and ability to enhance her clients natural beauty','2026-03-28 16:42:37.108836',945,191,442),('Paravastu Vaidehi',5,'Subha make up very good. Did with good makeup. She came all the way to hyderabad  for the babyshower.','2026-03-28 16:42:37.112161',946,191,442),('Shruti Balaji',5,'Kavitha did my makeup for all my wedding events starting from the cocktail to the wedding (which included a total of 5 sessions) and I could not be more thrilled to have chosen her as my make up artist as it was the best decision I took.\n\nKavitha was super easy, professional, responsive and communicative right from the beginning and agreed to do multiple calls with me even prior to the wedding to help me understand how to take care of my skin and diet in the months leading up to the big day. She was extremely thoughtful, friendly, and approachable in all her interactions and put me at ease from day one.\n\nWe had a session prior to the wedding where we decided all my wedding looks and she was very knowledgable about all the elements of my looks right down to the smallest detail (make up, skin care, hair, nails, etc). As chennai was a relatively new city for me, this was a big blessing.\n\nDuring the wedding, Kavitha was an amazing make up artist. She was thorough, professional and reassuring throughout. She was very quick with her work and able to understand the time pressures and stressors of our super packed wedding schedule. Each of my looks was even better than how we’d imagined it to be. I received so many compliments from all our wedding guests about how natural my skin looked and how good the make up was, for which Kavitha deserves all the credit.\nHer style is to work with your skin type and make sure that you’re happy with the end results. Everyone said that her make up elevated and enhanced my looks and that nothing looked out of place or over the top (which was exactly how I’d wanted it!).\n\nAs an added bonus, Kavitha has a fantastic presence and positive energy which made getting ready with her an absolute joy that I’ll cherish as a special part of my wedding experience.\nI’d highly recommend Kavitha’s services and would not hesitate to go back to her for any make up needs in India.','2026-03-28 16:42:38.366670',947,192,443),('jebin william',5,'We had an amazing experience with Kavitha, who did the bridal makeup for my wife on our wedding day. She was incredibly friendly, professional, and made the whole process so comfortable and enjoyable. Kavitha was very accommodating to our requests and went above and beyond to ensure everything was perfect. The quality of her work was outstanding—my wife looked absolutely stunning, and the makeup stayed flawless all day. Highly recommend her to anyone looking for a talented and reliable makeup artist!','2026-03-28 16:42:38.370222',948,192,443),('Mounisha Prabhu',5,'I had Kavitha do my makeup for all my wedding events at Coimbatore. Kavitha\'s kit and brushes were always organized and clean, and she\'s super punctual. She did an amazing job for my reception and wedding day, and I loved how she listened to my ideas and brought them to life. Thorough professional.  Her team was very efficient. Looking forward to work with you again. Thanks a lot Kavitha!!','2026-03-28 16:42:38.373934',949,192,443),('Kavi',5,'I took up an everyday makeup training session with Kavitha Sekar, and it was the best decision! She explained everything so clearly, from skincare prep to simple techniques that actually work for my face. I now feel confident doing my makeup in minutes and still look put together. She’s warm, patient, and incredibly skilled — highly recommend her if you want to learn makeup that suits you. 💄','2026-03-28 16:42:38.377168',950,192,443),('Jessi Jebin',5,'Kavitha sekar was did my makeup for my wedding, and she did an amazing job! She made me feel confident and beautiful, just the way I imagined. She was professional, calm, and so kind—highly recommend her!','2026-03-28 16:42:38.380787',951,192,443),('Priyanka Jawahar',5,'Two pretty girls came and made me pretty😍 Loved their work. Very dedicated and affordable mua in Chennai. They came on time and finished their work very quickly as I had requested them. Since I am in my postpartum period and having a Baby, I was really worried about many things... like appearance, Baby feeds if necessary in between the session and how I am goin to make it for the function. But they did their work fast and after seeing myself in the mirror I gained a lot more confidence to carry myself back again. Thank you dolls. Looking forward to work with them again.','2026-03-28 16:42:43.324268',952,193,444),('Mahalakshmi Manthiram',5,'They are just amazing.. They did my engagement makeover. Makeup, hairdo and saree draping were flawless.  I received tons of appreciation for the look they gave. They are very friendly and Punctual. Still I regret that I missed to have them on my wedding\'s mua as they we\'re alrdy booked..','2026-03-28 16:42:43.327758',953,193,444),('Ganesh',5,'I found them through Instagram and booked them for my marriage reception at Tuticorin. Though there wasn’t enough time to make up( min of 2.5 hrs ). They did make over for both bride and groom in 1.5 hrs with best output.\nMake over was so natural and many appreciated their work\nSpecial mentions\nBrown Color eye lens/showdowns was very good and noticed by all\nHair styling - curls was beautiful and it was so refreshing in photo session\nBride makeup - It was so natural and make over was done in short time\n\nI would recommend them for future too\n\nHave a best couple make over and be beautiful at your wedding','2026-03-28 16:42:43.332982',954,193,444),('Divya Sambath',5,'They are doin an excellent work...upcoming successful makeup artist around❤️they make us comfortable while doing it❤️book urs special day to make more beautiful 🎂','2026-03-28 16:42:43.336057',955,193,444),('Samhethaa N',5,'Loved their way of approach which is very friendly. And on my big day they just recreated what I asked for. Even the minute corrections were taken care of. Thank you. ❤️','2026-03-28 16:42:43.339191',956,193,444),('Jaya Priya',5,'Thankyou so much for making my big day more beautiful ❤️ and extraordinary with bestest makeup transformation. The makeup was really natural and so magical🪄✨ .I\'m fully satisfied and happy with your services sis.\nWill connect with you definitely for next functions🎉🎉 .','2026-03-28 16:42:50.388670',957,194,445),('Nivedha G',5,'Thank you so much for this beautiful makeover . I\'m so happy and Fully satisfied with your work. The makeup and hairstyle is truly amazing 🤩.\nThank you 😊.','2026-03-28 16:42:50.392336',958,194,445),('kamini kitty',5,'More happy and more satisfied with the makeup! It stayed perfectly even after I danced. Sweat was managed so well, and I was able to continue the shoot without any touch-up stress — all because of the amazing makeup.\n\nThey were punctual and very clear about the time required in advance, which helped us plan everything smoothly. The entire team was friendly, calm, and extremely professional. Every single step was explained, shown, and confirmed before proceeding, which made me feel very comfortable and confident.\n\nOverall, the work was excellent. Truly 100/100 — super happy with the makeup and the experience! ✨💯\n\nThank you!','2026-03-28 16:42:50.396516',959,194,445),('Banupriya',5,'Loved my muhurtham makeup sis🥰...it looks Very natural and elegant....both of the artist was very friendly...polite and that makes me more comfortable 🥰😊 My skin tone was perfectly maintained and the look suited me beautifully.... Thank you for making my special day even more and more better...♥️🥰all my family members liked my look and it was absolutely stunning.','2026-03-28 16:42:50.400017',960,194,445),('Hemasri RaviKumar',5,'Hi Jeba,\nThank you so much for making my day. Makeup was really good. The output was exactly what I expected. Everyone complimented me. Thanks a ton ♥️ Your kindness and attention detail is appreciated.','2026-03-28 16:42:50.403619',961,194,445),('mythili nandagopaol',3,'Thank you for the beautiful makeup for my function. I really loved the natural, glowy base and the lip color — everything matched my saree\n\nJust a small note for next time: a slightly stronger blush and a bit more eye definition might stand out even more in photos  thank you','2026-03-28 16:42:54.390429',962,195,450),('Anu sundar',5,'Seriously Makeup was awesome and the way share did my hairdo and makeup are excellent. Stay romba nalla irunthuchu . Everyone in the temple compliments me. Thanks a lot akka 🥰','2026-03-28 16:42:54.393809',963,195,450),('Manisha Mathu',4,'Makeup excellent ah irunthuchi,nice look superb','2026-03-28 16:42:54.397116',964,195,450),('Diviya sri',5,'Excellent service... Made my day.. thank you...','2026-03-28 16:42:54.400420',965,195,450),('SIVA RANJANI',5,'Her work was very much satisfying and  budget friendly','2026-03-28 16:42:54.403826',966,195,450),('supraja m.r.',4,'Kaviya is doing a perfect work. She\'s very sweet and professional. I loved the saree draping part very much, she does it quick n perfect !! Reasonable charges and I would definitely recommend her.','2026-03-28 16:42:58.888731',967,196,451),('saraniyadevie K',5,'You can book her without any hesitations. I looked into many profiles before booking her but she is the best at such affordable package. All of my friends and family asked about the makeup that she done not just a good but great job. Both my reception and marriage looks were amazing. She is such a sweetie.. not only her makeup but she\'s also great the way she handled during the sessions. DON\'T MISS to book her on your big day.','2026-03-28 16:42:58.891886',968,196,451),('gayathri ragavan',5,'You are truly an incredible artist and individual. Best makeup artist and hair dresser. Not only did you make me feel the most gorgeous I have ever felt, you kept me calm and really coached me for the whole day. I am so blessed to have you in my big day. Thank you times infinity! for making our day most special. I really hope I can hire you again for another event in the future.. Thanks Kavita and Team❤','2026-03-28 16:42:58.895127',969,196,451),('Rasika K',5,'Kaviya makeup artist is one of the  most affordable and quality makeup artist I have ever seen. She is really very kind and her work and dedication is really awesome . Myself and my sister loved her makeup and hairdo . I will for sure recommend everyone of you to choose her for your big day.','2026-03-28 16:42:58.899379',970,196,451),('vijayalakshmi paulraj',5,'Kaviya was very friendly. The outcome was great. It was a dedicated work. Both Makeup and hairstyle was fantabulous and satisfied with reasonable cost and time management.\nWe will recommend her in future with our friends and family members. Thanks a lot ❣','2026-03-28 16:42:58.902443',971,196,451),('NIKKITHA Thakur',5,'She is one the amazing make-up artist I have ever met. Be it your marriage, reception or any special occasion we can reach out to her without any hesitation as she will do a flawless makeup as per your needs. Have taken her bridal make up service and have referred many friends and she has always proven her skill to be the best.','2026-03-28 16:43:06.705420',972,197,452),('Sripoorani K',5,'I have seen her work, flawless finish and perfect stay throughout the event. Highly recommend her.','2026-03-28 16:43:06.708969',973,197,452),('Rinita Sherene',5,'I did collaboration shoot with her and dat too 2 looks on the same day. She is very professional, friendly and kept me comfortable during the makeup and shoot times. We just had 1hr of time to complete the 2nd look (1st look-kerala bridal look/Western outfit) which is entirely different but she finishes the makeup quicky and both the looks came out so amazing and got positive feedbacks from all my fellow mates. It was so satisfying at the end of the day and to me after receiving the positive comments. Thank u so much for all the efforts. she is the best.','2026-03-28 16:43:06.712064',974,197,452),('Vidya Muthukrishnan',5,'Yoge did make up for my brothers wedding and my baby shower it was amazing ... Thanks yoge!!!','2026-03-28 16:43:06.715120',975,197,452),('dheepika palani',5,'My engagement makeup is done by yogeshwari and her work is very  professional  and event went very well .\ni am very satisfied with her cooperation and perfection and also I feel very comfortable .','2026-03-28 16:43:06.718870',976,197,452),('Kowsi S',5,'⭐⭐⭐⭐⭐\n“Extremely satisfied with the makeup artistry! The artist was punctual, well-prepared, and ensured my skin was prepped perfectly before starting. The look was flawlessly blended, camera-ready, and lasted throughout the entire shoot without any touch-ups. The finish was elegant, enhancing my natural features without feeling heavy. Highly professional service and truly skilled work — I would definitely recommend for any special occasion or photoshoot. Totally worth it guys ✨ once again thanks sis love