I bought a shampoo and conditioner that\'s great. I like that it\'s affordable price. Definitely worth for money and such a wonderful service. Thank you so much mam.','2026-03-28 16:43:19.838469',984,199,462),('shalini dhanasree',5,':\n\nI got a haircut and spa treatment here, and the experience was wonderful. She is very friendly, respectful, and genuinely cares about each customer. She provides great guidance and ensures that everyone gets the best service. Personally, I also purchased a shampoo, conditioner, and face oil, and they are really good. Highly recommended!.','2026-03-28 16:43:19.841406',985,199,462),('Yamini Priya',5,'Can’t thank you enough for all that you did for me — the make-up, the hair and just a great catch up! Thought I looked great which is something I NEVER feel so it was nice — thanks so much.\n\nSuch a fabulous skin finish look ❤❤ it\'s was just an amazing makeup💄','2026-03-28 16:43:19.844584',986,199,462),('thamizh meenu',5,'Had a nice experience at Puvisha Beauty Parlour. The haircut was done exactly the way I wanted, and I really loved it, it came out very well. The staff were friendly and made me feel comfortable. They took their time, listened to my preferences, and the result was neat and stylish. The place is clean and comfortable too. Definitely a nice spot for regular haircuts. Would recommend 👍✨','2026-03-28 16:43:29.110830',987,200,467),('Harish Kanna',5,'This was our 11 month baby’s first haircut which went smooth and the outlook was beyond our expectations. To mention that the ambiance is clean and the hospitality provided by the staff makes our experience to review this with a smile. Thanks to the team PUVISHA.','2026-03-28 16:43:29.113768',988,200,467),('Kirtanaa Lakshmi',5,'Best service with reasonable price. Highly professional neat and clean service. Blindly go without any second thought.','2026-03-28 16:43:29.115931',989,200,467),('Siddharth Prabhu',5,'Very nice to receive customer and staff also well trained person  overall excellent','2026-03-28 16:43:29.117891',990,200,467),('Saraswathy Saranya',5,'Iam going for beautician class teaching clear step by step','2026-03-28 16:43:29.119953',991,200,467),('prabha k',5,'had a wonderful experience learning saree draping in this class. The instructor explained each step clearly and patiently, making it easy even for a beginner like me. I learned proper pleating, pinning techniques, and different draping styles. The class boosted my confidence, and now I can drape a saree neatly on my own. I would definitely recommend this class to anyone who wants to learn professional saree draping.','2026-03-28 16:43:32.606472',992,201,472),('Mageswari M',5,'It was a very good experience to learn something new with the good atmosphere and the crew member. This session was very useful to upgrade my skill regarding saree draping. Thank you so much \"Makeup Trends\"','2026-03-28 16:43:32.610198',993,201,472),('Susmitha S. Nath',5,'The saree drapping class with makeup trends was a good experience. I didn\'t know that there are this many varieties of saree drapping. I learnt pre-pleating, box folding  and saree drapping which I felt is very beneficial.Thanks to makeup trends.','2026-03-28 16:43:32.614050',994,201,472),('Sneha Nallathambi',5,'Recently I booked them for my Engagement, Marriage and Reception makeup.. Special thanks to Latha sister for doing her work at the best for both bride and groom..👏👍❣️ She is very friendly and being very kind and polite❣️🥰 She cooperated with us very humbly and fulfilled all my expectations with all other requirements 🤝 She made all the events awesome. Am completely happy and fully satisfied with her works🥰 Thank you soo much Latha sister and all the others who accompanied with her. Good Work Great Job👌 Keep going 👏👍','2026-03-28 16:43:32.618289',995,201,472),('Kalai Magal',5,'I am really liked them this class that mam also very so sweet I like him any doubt I am asking that mam slowly everything teach them🙏 thank you mam, and sir','2026-03-28 16:43:32.621758',996,201,472),('KC S',5,'Sudha was great to work with for my wedding and for a family event several years later. She is patient, kind and is very receptive to our needs and preferences and I like that not every bride looks the same with her hair and makeup services. This goes on to show how the looks are tailored for each person. She was very responsive to all my queries before and during the event, and went above and beyond to make my day special. Would certainly recommend her services and looking forward to working together in many such events in the future!','2026-03-28 16:43:41.138390',997,202,473),('Saj F',5,'Me and my friends had service from Sudha for a wedding event. V r in our 50’s.She gave us a radiant and youthful look. The makeup was so natural and elegant. She is highly professional and has a warm personality. I would wholeheartedly recommend her to others without any hesitation.','2026-03-28 16:43:41.141104',998,202,473),('Shobana Ragland',5,'Sudha akka does wonders ! She has styled me for more than 15 occasions and every-time the outcome was BEST 😊 Everyone appreciates my look. She is just amazing 🤩\nI recommend her 100% 💯','2026-03-28 16:43:41.146767',999,202,473),('Madhumitha Vaishali',5,'Sukhi ma\'am is professional and very skillful makeup artist, go for her without a question! She\'s like our family MUA!','2026-03-28 16:43:41.149845',1000,202,473),('HARIVALLABHA MALOLAN',5,'It was a wonderful experience working with Sudha ❤️ She was prompt and perfect in every way imaginable. She made the whole \"getting ready\"  part of the wedding seamless and comfortable. I would highly recommend her services for all events. Thanks to her, I had a lot of fun and the best wedding day possible. I feel really lucky to have had her during my wedding.','2026-03-28 16:43:41.152884',1001,202,473),('kalaivani m Mani',5,'I had a pleasure of having this makeup artist for my reception and wedding. Her work is truly amazing and she made me feel stunning on both occasions. What\'s even better is her budget-friendly pricing. I highly recommend her for professional makeup services- talented, accommodating and made my special days even more memorable!♡♡♡','2026-03-28 16:43:46.241513',1002,203,478),('Ramya Natarajan',5,'The service I got here was bridesmaid makeup and hairdo form the artist Deepika. She made me look so pretty with subtle make-up as I wanted and did her work with utmost care not like working for money.','2026-03-28 16:43:46.258792',1003,203,478),('ragavendira m',5,'We have booked her for baby shower function. She has done exceptionally well. Thanks.','2026-03-28 16:43:46.260399',1004,203,478),('Ashika Goudham',5,'I had a wonderful experience with Yasho Beauty studio and I’m extremely happy with their service. The makeup artist from her team a arrived right on time. I had opted for a skin-finish makeup look, and she executed it perfectly — the makeup looked very natural, flawless, and exactly how I had imagined. What I really appreciated was her patience; she involved me in every stage of the process and kept asking for my suggestions before moving forward.\n\nThe saree draping was handled very smoothly and neatly, and it stayed perfect for the entire event. It clearly reflected her experience and professionalism. The hairdo was also done beautifully, and it matched the reference image I had shared with her exactly. On top of all this, every service was provided well within the budget I had mentioned, without compromising on quality at all.\n\nOverall, I’m truly satisfied with the complete experience and the results. I strongly recommend Yasho Beauty Studio to anyone looking for a reliable, professional, and talented makeup artist for their special occasions.','2026-03-28 16:43:50.582886',1005,204,479),('ahalya manoharan',5,'I have booked yasho beauty and bridal studio for our brother\'s wedding they have done a amazing job we booked her for 2 bridesmaid makeup for me and my sister we outshined our bride 😜 thanks yashoda for a wonderful job and you are very talented in what you are doing also very much comfortable to communicate with. All our relatives and parents were very much satisfied with your work. Special mention to the hairstylist her work was unique and very friendly really loved our hairstyles. 🧿','2026-03-28 16:43:50.587184',1006,204,479),('divya lv',5,'Very awesome and neat work. Everyone admired me and complimented me as I looked awesome on my bro\'s engagement day. Thanks to yasho beauty and bridal studio, specially to yashodha and her team.','2026-03-28 16:43:50.593242',1007,204,479),('Ganesh Jagannathan',5,'We booked Yasho Beauty and Bridal Studio for our baby shower and later for our son’s 1st birthday, and We couldn’t be happier with the results. Yasho did an amazing job both times — the makeup looked beautiful, natural, and perfectly suited to each occasion.  Yasho is very professional, friendly, and passionate about her work. I truly appreciate the care and attention she put into making those special days even more memorable. Beyond her amazing skill, she’s so kind, patient, and genuinely caring. Highly recommend her services! Thank you, Yasho, for making our special moments even more memorable!','2026-03-28 16:43:50.594829',1008,204,479),('rohini devi',5,'I had such a wonderful experience with Yasho bridal makeover 🤩! She’s incredibly professional, knowledgeable, and genuinely passionate about what she does. My baby shower makeover turned out even better than I expected. She took the time to explain each step and tailor the makeover to my needs. Highly recommend to anyone looking for high-quality make over with a personal touch! Thank you sister for making me look the best on our big day 😍','2026-03-28 16:43:50.597309',1009,204,479),('Muthu Prakash',5,'Super makeup with long lasting...\nAmazing makeup look 😍😍','2026-03-28 16:43:53.960211',1010,205,481),('P.komala Priya',5,'Facial work really good ,\nam happy with her work. I did hydra facial in Durga beauty parlour it\'s make my face glow .deep clean dead cells removing white pores making face healthy n glow everyone should try it','2026-03-28 16:43:53.963604',1011,205,481),('Moni sha',5,'I did hydra facial today in durga beauty parlour....\nMy skin became so soft and glowing.... I really love it...\nEspecially durga sis character such a sweet person..','2026-03-28 16:43:53.966898',1012,205,481),('Keerthana Madhanraj',5,'I gave my saree for pre pleating\nShe has done her work good and neat I liked her way of giving the saree back In a good manner .\nAt the same time she has done the work in affordable price\nWho all r staying in gummidipoon or near to the area please do make use of her not only for saree pleating and for all services she is doing .','2026-03-28 16:43:53.970057',1013,205,481),('Teju prasad',5,'We have done hydra facial here... Satisfied with their facial massage...♥️','2026-03-28 16:43:53.973216',1014,205,481),('Deepika Shanker',5,'I really had a great time with you Akka... Such a friendly person you are and you did really a great job in hair do and makeup. I really loved it 😍Messy hair bun was great and makeup was perfect.... I loved my reception look on my sisters wedding..... Thank u so much akka❤️❤️','2026-03-28 16:43:56.967190',1015,206,482),('Sridhar Ravi',5,'Unga make up was flawless ka ..and yur character and d way yue treated me felt very comfortable🫂felt lyk my own sister 💯may yur career grows well and gud wid god\'s grace ❤️','2026-03-28 16:43:56.970388',1016,206,482),('C Sangeetha',5,'Very professional and punctuality....Iam thankful to abhi in my occasion in short period...Especially hairstyle and saree pleat...Smiling face and lovely abhi. In future also we will keep on touch with u...God bless u and ur professional.','2026-03-28 16:43:56.973725',1017,206,482),('Priyadharshini B',5,'Best makeup artist in town,super friendly co-operative and understands the clients wishes and gives her best in to endure the beautiful face with her makeup work','2026-03-28 16:43:56.977039',1018,206,482),('kavitha kavitha',5,'Thank you for doing such excellent makeup....I\'m really satisfied with both reception and muhurtham makeup','2026-03-28 16:43:56.980659',1019,206,482),('Madhav Haygreev',5,'They are of thr best make up artists in Vizag. We had booked Ms.Srirpriya for doing the makeup & saree drape for my Mother during all events of my Wedding. She did a wonderful job with respect to makeup, hairdo, saree drape. She was also very polite, kind & caring throughout the process & ensured my Mother looked her best for all the occasions. Highly recommend Aruna Makeup Artists & especially Ms.Srirpriya who is very friendly for some amazing makeup.','2026-03-28 16:44:01.387938',1020,207,483),('Nivetha Velmourougane',5,'Aruna was very friendly. I loved her saree draping, On-Spot and Perfect.\nShe also did a great job for my Hair-do\nLoved it. ❤️','2026-03-28 16:44:01.391152',1021,207,483),('Ammu Ammukutty',5,'I had a amazing experience with Aruna makeup artist.the look she created on me was flawless, long-lasting,nd perfectly suited my skin tone .the attention to detail and hygiene was impressive.i felt confident and beautiful throughout the event and also got soo many compliments from my relatives.highly recommended for anyone looking for a professional makeup artist 🥰✨','2026-03-28 16:44:01.394325',1022,207,483),('Fathima Sharmila',5,'\"Huge thank you to aruna for making me feel like a queen on my special day🥰! Their professionalism, kindness, and skill are unmatched✨. Highly recommend!\"❤️🫶🏼....','2026-03-28 16:44:01.397437',1023,207,483),('sankari sankari',5,'She gives Perfect 👌 look with elegant skin finished work...\nVery sincere, punctual ....her work\nI like so..so ...much her involvement of beauty work,  thank u...dr 😊  and 🫶🫰','2026-03-28 16:44:01.400221',1024,207,483),('Priya Sitla',5,'I had an amazing experience with Gayathri, the makeup artist. She first carefully analysed my skin and planned the look accordingly, which made such a big difference in the final result.\n\nWhat I loved most is that she also helped set the accessories perfectly with the saree. She even pre-pleated it beautifully and draped it neatly.\n\nMore than a makeup artist, she guided me like a sister throughout the entire process. I felt comfortable, confident and completely at ease.\nHighly recommended','2026-03-28 16:44:05.757386',1025,208,484),('Aiswarya Mahadevan',5,'Helloo..\nGayathri did my engagement makeup. At first I was a little confused since it was my first time, but the final look was abosultely beautiful and stunned. The makeup matched my skin tone perfectly and I was very satisfied. Because of that I have booked her for my wedding as well😍😍.\nHighly recommended!','2026-03-28 16:44:05.760845',1026,208,484),('Sandhya Venkatesh',5,'I booked Gayathri for my baby shower event. She is very kind and her work is fabulous. My entire family is very much satisfied with her work. I highly recommend people to chose her for your big events. Her products are very good and worth for every penny. Makeup was long lasting and saree draping was also very nice.','2026-03-28 16:44:05.764416',1027,208,484),('kaviya manivannan',5,'Highly recommend!!!\nI would like to extend my sincere thanks to Gayathri for enhancing my day with elegance and confidence. This was my first time entrusting her with pre-pleating my saree. She promptly took my measurements and returned it immediately, fully accommodating my urgent needs. The result was exceptional—a perfect fit for my body.I commend her sincerity, as well as her determination and passion for her craft. Thank you once again.','2026-03-28 16:44:05.769028',1028,208,484),('Narmatha Gopal',5,'Had an amazing experience with Gayathri\'s makeover. She  completely understood what I wanted, resulting in a flawless look for my function. She is very friendly and delivered perfectly as I expected !! I highly recommend her!!','2026-03-28 16:44:05.772067',1029,208,484),('RV',5,'Very natural and lovely  makeup done by Sowmya for me , my sister our kids on our parents Saadabhishekam with reasonable pricing .\nLots of hairstyle options to chose from which was done beautifully.\nVery professional and punctual.\nFlexible to the required time slot  as most tamil  brahmin functions are early in the morning.\nInfact we were late but she was always before time .\nThe only thing  con if i may suggest is improvement in the iyer style madisar draping which according to my relatives was not upto the mark.\nWould highly recommend her services','2026-03-28 16:44:09.902406',1030,209,485),('Latha Maheswari',5,'She is so kind and fast doing time management is excellent while finishing the make over.... Her make over is very natural with our own skin color... I strongly recommend to everyone... Totally awesome and her cost is so reasonable.... Tq so much mam','2026-03-28 16:44:09.905841',1031,209,485),('Karthiga Gunasegaran',5,'I’d like to give you a 5-star review! You did an amazing job on my engagement makeup; it looked just as stunning as a marriage reception look. My relatives also appreciated your work, and the pricing was perfect for me. I’ll definitely recommend you to my friends and family!','2026-03-28 16:44:09.909366',1032,209,485),('Cindrella Gnanasekar',5,'Loved the way she was so professional and also caring about the person whom she is working with.\nU can trust her 💯 and book her for your family occasions and believe me everyone will surely compliment you for your makeup, hairdo and overall look. Thank you laras makeover 😍 you are truly a gem','2026-03-28 16:44:09.912957',1033,209,485),('Chittu Kutty',5,'Thank you soo much Sowmya mam.very nice makeup done for my sister in law marriage.saree draping and makeup for so perfect. I would recommend definetly.she is so passionate on her profession so the outcome was  💯 perfect and trust worthy.thanks a lot mam.','2026-03-28 16:44:09.917225',1034,209,485),('Divya Murugan',5,'We recently booked Ashwini for a family function, where makeup and hairstyling were done for four of us. Each look was thoughtfully done, keeping individual preferences in mind. The makeup looked fresh, elegant, and lasted well for hours. Hygiene, punctuality, and professionalism were top-notch. Thank you for making our day feel extra special❤️','2026-03-28 16:44:17.858322',1035,210,486),('pavi saran',5,'Really did my makeup so well as I wished and it turned out to be the perfect one.❤️she❤️ asked my suggestion for each and every step which is very important for the brides to be asked. You can go ahead without any trial❤️ everyone liked my makeup and especially my groom loved it as it looks like me in my enhanced skin😌 really thank you ❤️','2026-03-28 16:44:17.860354',1036,210,486),('Keerthana Gowda',5,'Amazing Make-up........ I got my daughter\'s make-up done for a photoshoot it was amazing and lasted through out...... The artist was very kind, she had great quality make-up products I 100 percent recommend her','2026-03-28 16:44:17.862301',1037,210,486),('Matheesha De Alwis',5,'This was my first time in India for a wedding, and I wanted to hire a makeup artist to get ready for the occasion. After browsing through a few options on Instagram, Ashwini’s work really stood out. From the moment I contacted her, she was warm, professional, and accommodating — she confirmed the booking without asking for an advance, which gave me added comfort as a first-time client.\n\nShe arrived right on time at the hotel and did an absolutely excellent job. The makeup was flawless, elegant, and lasted through the entire event. I received so many compliments! Ashwini was calm, efficient, and clearly experienced — I’m so glad I chose her. Highly recommended!','2026-03-28 16:44:17.864239',1038,210,486),('Agnes Merlin',5,'She made me look extra pretty on my brother\'s wedding. No extra makeup no mess just pretty❤️ Thank you so much dear ❤️😍','2026-03-28 16:44:17.865847',1039,210,486),