nd stress-free.\n\nBrides and bridesmaids alike have noted that Thiya is adept at understanding and enhancing each individual\'s features, ensuring everyone feels beautiful and confident on the big day. Her attention to detail and willingness to listen to client preferences have been highlighted as key strengths.\n\nFor detailed reviews and to see more of her work, you can check her profiles on wedding planning platforms like WeddingBazaar and other similar sites.','2026-03-28 16:44:35.189132',1050,213,497),('Karthika',5,'Iam so happy with your bridel work you done by fabulous  makeup look keep going do always best..','2026-03-28 16:44:35.192656',1051,213,497),('DivyaShree B',5,'Best part of being a make up  artist is you\'ll never get bored of your job.... doing a great work...keep doing....a great support from one of ur happiest client 💖','2026-03-28 16:44:35.195837',1052,213,497),('DARKOGAMING YT',5,'Wow fabulous.. Very nice make up','2026-03-28 16:44:35.198820',1053,213,497),('Porkodi M',5,'Very good experience in hairstyle class. She was very calm and clear in her way of teaching. I had went with zero knowledge in hairstyle. And now with her support iam was very well equipped with techniques and tips in her class. And her academy is also well cleaned and neatly maintained. And she taking classes in affordable prices and iam dam sure everyone can use this opportunity for your future update. And thank you sis for your kind support. 😍😍😍','2026-03-28 16:44:44.352549',1054,214,498),('ramya raj',5,'I got a layered haircut, Hair spa and Hydra facial with Gaya\'s makeover owner Mrs.Saranya and had such a great experience! she was super professional, friendly, and really quick with the service, but still made sure everything was done perfectly. The salon itself was clean and comfortable. I walked out feeling super fresh and happy with the results. Highly recommend Gaya\'S Makeover and studio & Academy. Thank you for your lovely support and services.','2026-03-28 16:44:44.355142',1055,214,498),('Saranya G',4,'I recently did a Hydra Facial at the clinic, and I’m really happy with the results. The process was smooth. After the facial, my skin looked visibly brighter and cleaner. The staff were polite. Would recommend this facial for anyone looking to deeply cleanse and rejuvenate their skin.','2026-03-28 16:44:44.358007',1056,214,498),('Saranya',5,'I took Hydrafacial in Gaya\'s makeover \"The ambiance is too good to be true... Everything is perfect from the products used to the satisfactory service\". My skin feels so soft and hydrated.','2026-03-28 16:44:44.360820',1057,214,498),('Aliya Afreen',5,'Excellent hydra facial done. Every process was nicely explained. Advanced led masking and nice tools used in overall treatment at a very budget friendly price.','2026-03-28 16:44:44.363320',1058,214,498),('Sneha Saha',5,'I am very satisfied with the makeup, hairstyle and saree draping. Mrs. Jayashree was very punctual and ethical. She had brought all her necessary items for doing her work and she did her job very neatly. I had opted for a minimal party makeup in Bengali style, which costed me ₹4,500. And it was totally worth the price. She was so sweet and polite. I would definitely book for an appointment in future again.','2026-03-28 16:44:51.343866',1059,215,503),('Sonukumar J',5,'Excellent service with unmatched perfection and Hospitality is awesome. They understand our expectations and exceed the expectations.','2026-03-28 16:44:51.347061',1060,215,503),('anitha c',5,'🤩Thank you so much for doing my hair and makeup for my baby shower photoshoot 😍Thanks for your professionalism, flexibility,  and kindness. ❤️  The hair was incredible and the makeup was lovely👌🏻Thanks for making me feel very pretty and comforting.  I feel so lucky I met you and really hope we can stay in touch.  Thanks for being part of my special day. Many of my  friends are asking for your contact and details  and we are more than happy to recommend you.🤩❤️👍','2026-03-28 16:44:51.350341',1061,215,503),('Revathy Gnanamurugan',5,'I would like to appreciate the makeup artist who have done a wonderful job .... My friend was looking extraordinary in jayashree vasanth\'s Makeup and hairdress... The work was flawless.. she was very friendly and caring to the core .. Thank you for your fantabulous work 🥰🥰🥰','2026-03-28 16:44:51.353452',1062,215,503),('Chockalingam Kowshipriya',5,'Amazing work and also she came on time even during nivar cyclone... Very professional in her work... And much satisfied after seeing my marriage album!!!','2026-03-28 16:44:51.356465',1063,215,503),('sripriya Chandrasekaran',5,'From the trial session to the wedding day, her work was outstanding. She understood my daughter’s vision perfectly and created a bridal look that was graceful, radiant, and picture-perfect. We received countless compliments. Truly a gifted and professional makeover artist. Five stars!”','2026-03-28 16:44:54.243530',1064,216,504),('Mohana Priya',5,'yesterday i done my hair cut in abi makeover studio, it\'s dam good, it\'s completely change my look, So happy finally I got my expecting hair style, very good service, Thankyou so much , i highly recommend, don\'t miss it guys 👍','2026-03-28 16:44:54.252305',1065,216,504),('Monika Mohan',5,'I just wanted to thank you for the amazing makeup you did on myself and my daughter. I loved everything from makeup, hair do till saree draping. You chose right product to blend with skin tone. The makeup looked perfect and great on camera too. I will always refer you to people!','2026-03-28 16:44:54.256104',1066,216,504),('shobana devi',5,'Abi has done a great make up in my sister\'s engagement ceremony which has been highly appreciated by all my relatives. Overall the service was good and professional.','2026-03-28 16:44:54.260068',1067,216,504),('Yaazhisai Yamuna',5,'They did a very good job in straightening my hair. I recommend it','2026-03-28 16:44:54.263931',1068,216,504),('Saranya Ravichandran',5,'We hired them for parents’ 80th birthday function photoshoot, and they did a wonderful job. Captured the moments beautifully and was very patient with our family. The photos turned out great and really preserved the emotions of the day. Highly recommend their work!','2026-03-28 16:44:58.036796',1069,217,505),('Charita Reet Darbin',5,'The photoshoot was an amazing experience! Everything felt so comfortable and natural, and the photographer knew exactly how to capture the best angles. The attention to detail, creativity, and patience made the whole session so much fun. The final pictures came out absolutely stunning – filled with warmth, elegance, and real emotions. Truly a beautiful experience that I’ll cherish forever.','2026-03-28 16:44:58.040807',1070,217,505),('Preetha Parthiban',5,'We had a great experience with our photographer. He was extremely polite, kind, and punctual—arriving right on time and handling everything smoothly throughout the event. He made sure to cover all the important moments with complete professionalism and ease.\n\nThe owner was also very kind and ensured the pricing was very reasonable, making the entire experience stress-free and budget-friendly. Highly recommended for any special occasion!','2026-03-28 16:44:58.044496',1071,217,505),('Keerthana Ede',5,'It was a great experience, the photographer and videographer have done a great job , we were happy to choose them','2026-03-28 16:44:58.049018',1072,217,505),('EASVARI MOTORS P LTD ANNANAGAR',5,'Excellent place for budget and great customer service my album was delivered very promptly.  I strongly refer this studio.','2026-03-28 16:44:58.053112',1073,217,505),('Fearless Dreamer',5,'We had an absolutely wonderful experience with Wide Angle Photos team. The entire team was professional, friendly, and truly passionate about their work. The stunning pictures captured by photographer Ram at my daughter’s wedding were beyond our expectations.\n\nA special mention to Showkath,  he is not just an excellent leader guiding his team with dedication, but also a highly talented photographer himself. Most importantly, he is a genuinely kind and warm person who made us feel completely comfortable and relaxed throughout my daughter’s wedding day\n\nWe wholeheartedly recommend Wide Angle Photos to anyone looking for exceptional photography services. They truly turn moments into lifelong memories\n\nThank you\nMirza Ghulam','2026-03-28 16:45:01.239406',1074,218,506),('MUSKAAN FATHIMA_S',5,'I am Muskaan, We are very happy with my sister’s wedding photos, they look beautiful and outstanding. Showkath and his team were punctual, friendly, and made everyone feel comfortable\n\nThe photos, albums and videos were delivered on time, and the whole family loved the results. We highly recommend Wide Angle Photos for reliable and quality wedding photography','2026-03-28 16:45:01.241488',1075,218,506),('FARDEEN Khan',5,'Showkath and his Wide Angle team  did an absolutely amazing job capturing our wedding event\n\nThe team were 2 hours before the event started and from the moment they arrived, we felt that we were in safe and in professional hands\n\nThe photos and videos turned out really amazing,  they captured not just the big moments, but all the little details that made the day special\n\nOur guests and all our family couldn’t stop complimenting the team, and honestly, half the time we didn’t even realize they were there,  yet they caught every emotion perfectly\n\nWe are so grateful and can’t thank Showkath and the Wide Angle team enough for giving us memories we will cherish forever. Absolutely the best team for your special day\n\nThank you Wide angle photos','2026-03-28 16:45:01.243710',1076,218,506),('Sasitha S',5,'Choosing WIDE ANGLE TEAM for our wedding photoshoot was an excellent decision. Their talented team beautifully captured every moment of our special day and far exceeding our expectations. The photos are absolutely stunning, and we are thrilled with the results. We wholeheartedly recommend Showkath and his team for exceptional wedding photography. Wishing them continued success in creating cherished memories for many more couples.','2026-03-28 16:45:01.245776',1077,218,506),('Arman Adeen',5,'Showkath, the owner, was exceptional in his follow-up and kept us updated from start to finish. He patiently addressed all my inquiries and delivered on every promise, giving us the best experience possible. Thank you, Showkath, for making our wedding memories so special and unforgettable. I strongly recommend WIDE ANGLE & TEAM for their wedding photography to anyone who is getting married','2026-03-28 16:45:01.247750',1078,218,506),('Mohana prasaad R',5,'We wanted to take a moment to express our heartfelt gratitude for your tireless effort, professionalism, and incredible talent in capturing our engagement, pre-wedding shoot, and finally, our wedding.\n\nFrom the very beginning, you made us feel so comfortable, and your calm presence helped turn every moment into beautiful pictures and memories. We were amazed by how seamlessly you worked throughout all the events—never missing a moment, always being in the right place at the right time, and doing it all with a smile.\n\nA special thanks to Narashiman Sir and Prasath Sir for handling everything with such patience and dedication.\nNarashiman Sir ensured that every single important person in our family was captured throughout our big day.\nPrasath Sir handled the entire crowd during the reception and muhurtham effortlessly, and we truly appreciate his coordination and support.\n\nThe entire team excelled in every single aspect—whether it was being on time, patience, calmness, kindness, or the way each moment was captured so beautifully.\n\nHeartfelt thanks to the whole team who was present throughout all our events. Sorry if we missed mentioning anyone’s name specifically( as im not aware of everyone name individually ) every single person gave their absolute best throughout this journey, and we are truly grateful.\n\nAlso a special thanks to Vishalini for being so kind, charming, and always communicating everything on time.\n\nThank you once again for making our special moments even more memorable.\n\nReally looking forward to work with such a wonderful team again in future events.\n\n-Devi&Mohan','2026-03-28 16:45:06.679739',1079,219,507),('Meera Premnazeer',5,'We had Yadhavan and his team handle our pre-wedding and wedding shoots, and they were absolutely fantastic! From start to finish, they were attentive to every detail, made us feel so comfortable, and captured everything beautifully. The pictures and videos turned out even better than we imagined! It was so natural, elegant, and full of emotion. We loved, loved the final results and were super impressed with their professionalism and creativity. Thank you so much, Yadhavan and crew, for making our special moments unforgettable!','2026-03-28 16:45:06.682848',1080,219,507),('sakthivel chen',5,'It was really nice having the Team CWP throughout my wedding journey. Right from the engagement, pre wedding & reception shoot , till last everything was smoothly coordinated by the entire team ( consulting team , photo/ videography  crew , editing team ) . Kudos to The Team CWP.\nEntire family is happy with the photography and final outputs\nLooking fwd to have a  next 📷 shoot in future','2026-03-28 16:45:06.685401',1081,219,507),('Anandhi Sivasankaran',5,'We hired Creative Wedding Photography for all our wedding events, and we couldn\'t be happier with the results! From our first consultation (Vishalini and Narasimhan) to the final photo delivery, the experience was seamless and enjoyable.\n\nPrasath , Narasimhan and Mukesh were incredibly professional, making us feel at ease throughout the day. They arrived early, communicated clearly, and blended seamlessly with our guests. Prasath made us very comfortable for the pre-wedding photoshoot and suggestions for poses were based on our characters.\n\nThe creativity in their work was outstanding. They captured candid moments beautifully, along with stunning posed shots that perfectly showcased the venue and our personalities. The use of natural light and unique angles added a magical touch to our photos.\n\nEvery detail was meticulously captured, from the intricate decorations to the emotions shared among family and friends. We loved how they told the story of our day through their lens.\n\nThe editing was impressive, enhancing the images without overshadowing the natural beauty of the moments. They were kind enough to edit the album layouts as per our choices as well. We received our albums in a timely manner, and the online platform made it easy to share with family and friends.\n\nOverall Experience:\nWe wholeheartedly recommend \'Creative Wedding Photography\'  to anyone looking for wedding photography. Their passion, talent, and dedication truly made our special day unforgettable. The price is also reasonable and is definitely worth their service.\nThank you Narasimhan and Prasath for the continuous follow ups and updates! It was a pleasure working with you.\nThank you for capturing our memories so beautifully!','2026-03-28 16:45:06.689590',1082,219,507),('Prithev Madhavan',5,'Excellent team of photographers. The way they dealt with my relatives and friends was so nice. They made the whole experience enjoyable.\n\nThe whole team was  so friendly and we really felt very comfortable.\n\nTheir posing session must be mentioned here.they made us come to their studio before the event for a posing session . We were not sure then, but this session helped us in getting more images at the event within the limited period available for portraits.\n\nThank god we found creative wedding team for our once in a lifetime event.','2026-03-28 16:45:06.693342',1083,219,507),('Yuvaraj.M',5,'​The photos delivered were absolutely stunning, and the team did an incredible job covering my function. They were professional, efficient, and captured all the best moments. Highly recommended!','2026-03-28 16:45:17.922320',1084,220,510),('Sanjay',5,'I had a nice experience with them I done my brother\'s son\'s first birthday they done it very perfect work. Their album quality and frames are really very good 💜😊','2026-03-28 16:45:17.925461',1085,220,510),('Kugan Kugan',5,'I am done a big frame here for my loved ones. They done a great job. Their work very neat and perfect','2026-03-28 16:45:17.928989',1086,220,510),('Lingesh Waran',5,'I conducted a birthday event for my 1 year old child so for this precious day we need to capture this and treasure it.. Anitha studio handled it great and captured our memorable day...❤️','2026-03-28 16:45:17.933163',1087,220,510),('Leo Ackerman',5,'Very nice experience i bought frame and it has good quality 😊 there\'s employee, shree who is kind and get us what i needed respect to that man!!!!😊','2026-03-28 16:45:17.936299',1088,220,510),('Jagdeesh Raju',5,'Had a great experience at Sreesha Digital! We took our family photo there and the entire process was smooth and professional. Special thanks to Karthi for the excellent support and guidance. The photo editing, background change, frame selection, and final quality were all completed on the same day. Really impressed with the quick turnaround and quality of work. Highly recommended!','2026-03-28 16:45:25.839353',1089,221,515),('Ninthusha Satkunalingam',5,'I’m absolutely in love with my wedding albums — the quality, detailing, and overall finish are beautiful. Sreesha Digital did an amazing job bringing everything together so perfectly.\n\nThe customer service was also excellent throughout the process — very responsive, patient, and helpful with all my requests and changes. They really listened to what I wanted and delivered beyond expectations.\n\nIf you’re looking for stunning wedding albums with great service, I would 100% recommend them!','2026-03-28 16:45:25.843109',1090,221,515),('Shaun Satkunalingam',5,'I had a fantastic experience with Sreesha Digital for my album project. The work looks incredibly professional and the turnaround was impressively quick. They were highly responsive, understood my vision, and delivered polished results on time. I’m genuinely impressed with the quality and efficiency. Highly recommended for anyone looking to get top-notch album work done with great communication.','2026-03-28 16:45:25.847098',1091,221,515),('Aswin.Nilaksha',5,'We had our wedding albums done by Sreesha Digital, all the way from the UK, and the experience was amazing from start to finish. The quality of work is outstanding, with so much attention to detail, and the albums turned out absolutely beautiful. Customer service was excellent, very responsive, professional, and easy to work with despite the distance. Highly recommend Sreesha Digital for anyone looking for high quality wedding albums!!','2026-03-28 16:45:25.851013',1092,221,515),('Karthik Ramaswamy',5,'Thorough professionals and prompt service. Mr. Sreelesh went above and beyond to service my photo requirements and the staff (Jeeva) were excellent at their jobs and delivered within my requested time. Highly recommended 🙏🏽','2026-03-28 16:45:25.853893',1093,221,515),('Maha Lakshmi',5,'VM photography was not only a master behind the camera but also a true professional. They arrived on time, maintained a friendly and approachable demeanor, and made us feel at ease throughout the session. They patiently listened to our ideas and incorporated them seamlessly into the shoot.”\n\nI highly recommeded to VM photography...','2026-03-28 16:45:27.877732',1094,222,520),('nivedha murali',5,'Had a great experience working with VM photography.\nThanks a lot for capturing the beautiful moments on our engagement. Really happy to have chosen you for our wedding. I would highly recommend this photography to consider for your joyous occasions.','2026-03-28 16:45:27.880868',1095,222,520),('Sathyakumar Panneerselvam',5,'Had tried VM photography for baby shower event. The quality and coverage of raw photography itself was amazing. Final output as album and video editing was really satisfying. Album quality, timely delivery and price is unbeatable. Will recommend for any future events personally.','2026-03-28 16:45:27.884054',1096,222,520),('E. I.',5,'The quality is amazing.\n\nWhen we hired them we only expected them to take few sub-par photos and videos and send it to us.\n\nWe were, fortunately, wrong.\n\nThey went far beyond our expectations by the amount of work and the quality of the work.\n\nThey compiled all the video footage into a movie-like video with stunning video effects.\n\nHighly recommend this company for taking pictures of your marriage , Upanayanam, or any event.','2026-03-28 16:45:27.887028',1097,222,520),('Nirmala K',5,'My sister\'s engagement photo was taken in VM photography. Very well photography and Editing Well done. Thank you so much for your work.','2026-03-28 16:45:27.890750',1098,222,520),('Gayathri . K',5,'We are beyond happy with our wedding photos anna💚 Each picture tells a story and brings back all the emotions of our big day💗💗The photographers were so patient, creative, and professional. Choosing this team was the best decision for our wedding❤️ Highly recommended💯','2026-03-28 16:45:31.511036',1099,223,521),('Jasmine Jose',5,'We chose DLM Photography for our wedding and reception, and it was one of the best decisions we made! Their team was incredibly punctual, professional, and genuinely humble throughout the entire experience. They captured every moment beautifully — from the smallest candid details to the big emotional highlights.\n\nTheir work exceeded our expectations in every way. We are truly grateful for their dedication and the stunning memories they created for us. Highly recommended to anyone looking for top-quality photography!','2026-03-28 16:45:31.514024',1100,223,521),('Reshma RS',5,'DLM is an amazing photography team! From start to finish, the experience was fantastic. The pictures turned out absolutely beautiful, and the album quality exceeded our expectations. Professional, friendly, and very talented. We loved every bit of it and would highly recommend them to anyone!❤️','2026-03-28 16:45:31.516389',1101,223,521),('Nirmal Kumar',5,'The DLM team did a wonderful job capturing our wedding! They were friendly, professional and took beautiful photos that perfectly preserved our memories. Kamlesh\nmaintained excellent communication, always keeping us updated on timelines and delivery. He made the final stages smooth and stress-free. Highly recommend the DLM Photography and especially Kamlesh, for his exceptional service!','2026-03-28 16:45:31.519000',1102,223,521),('Ar.Karthika Devi K',5,'Team with 100% dedication and passion towards photography. Highly recommended team.\n\nI had my reception in JK hotels, Coimbatore which was captured by wonderful team (DLM Photography)\n\nFrom the start till the end they had a wonderful rapport with both of our family. Mr. Kamaleshwaran, the owner, is a true master in his work and managing his team. He and his team was very much genuine and humble to each and every one with our family members. Especially his team of 4 members who captured every single moment with the utmost care. We didn’t expect this type of dedication and hard work from the team. They did a great work in bringing out the smile from all our family members.\n\nReally a goto team when you require Dedication, Professionalism, Punctuality. Thank you DLM team for capturing the wonderful portraits in our Wedding.','2026-03-28 16:45:31.521465',1103,223,521),('Aparajitha Sekar',5,'We are extremely happy with our decision to choose this team for our wedding photography. From the very beginning, they were professional, friendly, and well-organized. They covered all the wedding events beautifully and ensured that no special moment was missed.\n\nA special thanks to Vinoth for his dedication, patience, and creative eye. He made us feel very comfortable in front of the camera and captured both candid and traditional moments perfectly. The coordination during the events was smooth, and the team blended in so well with the crowd.\n\nThe final output is really good — the photos and videos are high quality, emotionally rich, and truly reflect the joy of our wedding days. We are extremely satisfied with the overall experience and will cherish these memories forever. Highly recommended for anyone looking for reliable and talented wedding photographers!','2026-03-28 16:45:36.097653',1104,224,522),('sahana naik',5,'Had an amazing experience with the Once More Photography team for my baby shower! ✨ From start to finish, they were professional, proactive, and very well coordinated. Arrived on time and captured every single moment so beautifully!\n\nSpecial thanks to Vinoth (the founder) – he shot my wedding too, and that experience made me trust him again for this big milestone. 💕\n\nBig shout-out to Jansi for her seamless coordination and to Vignesh & Aravind for the stunning clicks! 📸 Truly appreciate the team’s effort and dedication.\n\nIf you’re looking for someone to capture your special moments, I do recommend them!','2026-03-28 16:45:36.101336',1105,224,522),('tarun kumaar s',5,'We’re extremely happy with the wedding album we received—it turned out absolutely beautiful! Every moment was captured so thoughtfully, and the quality exceeded our expectations.\n\nThank you for being a part of our special day and for your professionalism and dedication throughout. We’re really glad we chose you as our wedding photography team 😊','2026-03-28 16:45:36.105034',1106,224,522),('Mythili Manivannan',5,'Had a wonderful experience with the Once More Photography team for my baby shower! The entire team was very professional, proactive, and well-coordinated. They arrived right on time and captured every moment beautifully. I was really impressed that they shared all the raw photos the very next day itself!\n\nSpecial thanks to Raji and Nancy for continuous follow-ups and coordination, and Vignesh for the stunning clicks. Truly appreciate the team’s effort and dedication. Looking forward to working with you all for many more future events. Wishing the team all the very best! 💫','2026-03-28 16:45:36.108355',1107,224,522),('Vignesh D',5,'Not just photos, but memories beautifully captured 📸\nEvery picture tells a story. The patience, creativity, and passion behind the camera really show in the final results. Thank you for such wonderful memories. Highly recommended photography page 💯\nSpecial mention to Raji and photographer vignesh and others','2026-03-28 16:45:36.111802',1108,224,522),('Jeya Kumar',5,'A huge thank you to your team. We are so happy and glad for choosing Zhagaram. The members of the Zhagaram team are absolutely professional in whatever they do. They have been very friendly. We had a wonderful experience with levels in curves. Our reception and marriage pics were amazing. Photographers know what to capture and they were patient enough to get the perfect shot. They made sure that we are comfortable with our poses and were very responsive whenever we contacted them.','2026-03-28 16:45:40.077341',1109,225,524),('Vinitha Arumugam',4,'Completely satisfied. Highly recommend if u r looking for budget friendly photography. The crew was punctual for both the events and post wedding photoshoot. Team was always available and patient when we asked them to make any changes. Special mention to Barath for making our wedding and reception montage amazingly. Thanks to Dharshan bro for being responsive and clearing all my doubts. The only negative comment I have is our parents couple photo has not been taken for both Reception and wedding, apart from that overall satisfied.\n\nI would like to give 4.5 stars out of 5❣️','2026-03-28 16:45:40.081688',1110,225,524),('Jenyton Nielsina',5,'I have booked Weddings by Zhagaram for my engagement and wedding. I was really impressed in their work and their friendly approach. Young talented team with such a patient and polite behavior. They were very responsive and professional. Photo quality and their editing was amazing. Candid shots and couple pics were to the best😍. Eventhough many last minute changes and confusions due to pandemic situation, without any hestiation they planned everything very neatly and did their job in a fabulous way. Thanks a lot to Dharsan bro and his team❤ keep rocking team📷','2026-03-28 16:45:40.085708',1111,225,524),('Mabel Esther',5,'I chose Zhagaram Photography for my brother\'s wedding as I was impressed by their works and the cost was budget friendly too. They did an amazing job and the pictures turned out really great! They are the best Wedding Photographers and Candid Photographers in Chennai ❤️ Do book them for your occasions and you won\'t be disappointed!','2026-03-28 16:45:40.091239',1112,225,524),('GOWTHAM reddy',5,'\"We signed up with them for our baby shower event, and they provided excellent service. The entire experience was smooth and everything was executed flawlessly.\"','2026-03-28 16:45:40.095413',1113,225,524),('Mahalakshmi R',5,'As a mother, my child’s wedding day is one of the most emotional and important days of my life. I am so grateful that Jaihind Photography was there to capture every beautiful moment so perfectly.\nFrom the beginning, their team was very respectful, polite, and well-organized. They handled everything with such professionalism and patience, especially during the busy wedding rituals. They understood the importance of each ceremony and made sure no special moment was missed.\nWhat touched my heart the most was how beautifully they captured the emotions — the smiles, the tears, the blessings, and the joy of our entire family coming together. When we received the photos and videos, I was overwhelmed with happiness. Every picture tells a story, and each one brings back the exact feelings of that day.\nThey were also very kind and cooperative with all our relatives and elders, making everyone feel comfortable while taking photos. The quality of their work is excellent, and the editing is very elegant and natural.\nI truly appreciate their hard work and dedication. Because of them, we now have lifelong memories that our family will cherish forever. I wholeheartedly recommend Jaihind Photography to anyone looking for a trustworthy and talented team for their special occasions.\nThank you for making our family’s happiest day even more special. 🙏💖','2026-03-28 16:45:44.146154',1114,226,525),('Jenithran Gopalarasa',5,'Our register marriage took place in February in Chennai, and we came to know about Jaihind Photography through Instagram. From the very beginning, we were extremely impressed with their professional approach and dedication to their craft.\n\nA heartfelt thanks to Mr. Saran, Ms. Nithya, and the entire Jaihind team for their exceptional work. Their candid photography was outstanding — every emotional and joyful moment was captured with such precision and artistry. Each photograph tells a story and allows us to relive those precious moments in a truly heartfelt way.\n\nThe team’s professionalism, creativity, and attention to detail were remarkable. The wedding album was designed beautifully and finished to the highest standard, exceeding our expectations.\n\nWe are truly grateful to Jaihind Photography for preserving our special day so beautifully. I would highly recommend them to anyone seeking a talented, reliable, and passionate photography team.','2026-03-28 16:45:44.147455',1115,226,525),('Siranjeevi Narasimman',5,'Choosing Jaihind Photography for our wedding and reception was one of the best decisions we made during our wedding planning journey.\nFrom start to finish, the entire experience was smooth and stress-free. Weddings can be overwhelming, but their team brought such calm, positive energy that it made a huge difference for us. They were extremely professional, yet so friendly that it felt like having supportive friends capturing our big day.\nWhat we loved most was how naturally they captured everything. Nothing felt forced or overly staged. The candid moments with our families, the laughter with friends, the emotional rituals, and even the small details of the décor were documented beautifully. They truly understood how important these memories are and treated every moment with care.\nDuring both the wedding ceremony and reception, they were very organized and coordinated everything perfectly. They guided us patiently for couple shots and group photos, making sure no important combination was missed. At the same time, they allowed us to enjoy our day without constantly interrupting the flow.\nWhen we received our photos and videos, we were honestly blown away. The editing was elegant, the colors were vibrant yet natural, and every picture felt alive. Looking through the album brought back all the emotions of that day.\nIf you’re looking for a photography team that is reliable, talented, and genuinely passionate about their work, we highly recommend Jaihind Photography. They didn’t just capture images — they captured the story of our wedding in the most beautiful way.\nThank you once again for giving us memories we will treasure forever! 💛','2026-03-28 16:45:44.149115',1116,226,525),('Dr.V.VIJAYAKUMAR',5,'We had a wonderful new experience with Jaihindh photographer and their team during our wedding session. They put us at ease and made us feel serene from the start, and the photographs reflect that. They caught each important moment in a lovely and natural way. The attention to detail, patience, and competence were truly excellent. The final photographs surpassed our expectations and will be cherished forever. I recommend them to anybody looking for a dependable and wonderful wedding photographer.','2026-03-28 16:45:44.150924',1117,226,525),('Gurupriyan',5,'All the pictures were beautifully captured, and every moment was handled with great care. We found them through our relative, and choosing Jai Hind Photography turned out to be a great decision.\n\nThe team took time to understand exactly what we wanted and ensured it reflected perfectly in the photographs. You can truly see their passion towards photography in their work. We are very happy with the outcome and would definitely recommend them to others.','2026-03-28 16:45:44.152660',1118,226,525),('Lakshmi S',5,'We are extremely satisfied with the services of Deepanklixx Photography. Their photographer showed great dedication, the follow-up process was seamless, and the final results were outstanding. Thank you for your excellent work.','2026-03-28 16:45:47.101961',1119,227,527),('Deen Deepan',5,'Hi, I\'m Deepan.\nI recently booked a photography package from DeepanKlixx for my sister\'s engagement. The photographer was very friendly, and the album designs and models were absolutely superb. The pricing was also very reasonable.\nThank you so much, DeepanKlixx!','2026-03-28 16:45:47.105240',1120,227,527),('Sophia Mary',5,'A big thank you to the entire team — you’ve given us something we’ll treasure for a lifetime. I highly recommend them to anyone looking for wedding photography that feels personal, professional, and heartfelt.','2026-03-28 16:45:47.108757',1121,227,527),('niyamathur rahman',5,'I had an amazing experience with the photography services for my marriage. The photos came out beautifully, capturing every special moment with perfect detail and creativity. What impressed me even more was that it was budget-friendly without compromising on quality. I highly recommend their services for anyone looking for professional and affordable wedding photography!','2026-03-28 16:45:47.120087',1122,227,527),('Jeevitha B',5,'I recently had the pleasure of working with Deepanklixx Photography for , and the final product exceeded our expectations. We received a beautiful mix of candid shots and posed portraits, all perfectly edited to highlight the best moments of our event.\nThank you, for your outstanding work. We look forward to working with you again in the future!','2026-03-28 16:45:47.123214',1123,227,527),('Sharmila Selvam',5,'“We are extremely happy with the wedding photography. Every special moment was covered so perfectly and naturally. From candid moments to traditional shots, everything was covered amazingly well. The quality, creativity, and attention to detail were exceptional.We couldn’t have asked for better photography—thank you for giving us memories we’ll cherish forever.”\n\nWe also really appreciate their professionalism and commitment to timelines. Everything—from edited photos to the final album—was delivered exactly as promised, without any follow-ups or delays. Their punctuality and organized approach made the whole process stress-free for us.\n\nOverall, their dedication, quality of work, and timely delivery made them an excellent choice for our wedding photography.\n\nHighly recommended!!!🥰✌️✌️','2026-03-28 16:45:51.612141',1124,228,528),('Priyadharshini P',5,'Absolutely loved the photo frame! The quality is excellent and the finish is beautiful. They even did a wonderful job and making it so special for our family. Delivery was quick and the packaging was perfect. Highly recommend!','2026-03-28 16:45:51.616524',1125,228,528),('AA Kids World',5,'I had an amazing experience with Surya Digital Studio for my daughter\'s half saree function. Their video and photography work was outstanding, capturing every beautiful moment with perfection. The way they brought the photos to life in the video was truly mesmerizing, and their selection of background songs was just perfect, enhancing the emotions of every scene.\n\nThe attention to detail, creativity, and professionalism they exhibited exceeded my expectations. I highly recommend Surya Digital Studio for anyone looking for high-quality photography and videography services. Thank you for making our special occasion even more memorable!','2026-03-28 16:45:51.619830',1126,228,528),('Suresh S',5,'Had a great experience at the photo studio! The team was professional, friendly, and made the whole shoot comfortable and fun. The photos came out beautifully — really happy with the results!','2026-03-28 16:45:51.623068',1127,228,528),('sharmila kasi:ref',5,'We recently had Surya Digital Studio handle the photography and videography for my sister\'s wedding, and we couldn\'t be more delighted with their truly premium work! From our initial consultation to the final delivery of the albums and videos, the entire experience was outstanding and exceeded our expectations in every way..And special thanks to Surya photographer 🙏','2026-03-28 16:45:51.626191',1128,228,528),('Pavithra M',5,'We recently booked for our engagement, and I am extremely happy with their work. From the very beginning, they were professional, punctual, and very friendly, which made us feel so comfortable in front of the camera.\n\nThe photos have come out beautifully – they captured every emotion, every detail, and all the candid moments perfectly. Their creativity, patience, and dedication truly reflect in the outcome. The editing was also very natural and elegant, which we really loved.\n\nA big thank you to the entire team for making our special day even more memorable. I would definitely recommend them to anyone looking for quality photography with a personal touch.','2026-03-28 16:45:56.785709',1129,229,530),('A.Siva Rama Krishna',5,'Highly Professional, friendly, and highly recommended for capturing those candid moments!\n\nThe lighting and composition were stunning, and the turnaround time was impressive.','2026-03-28 16:45:56.788766',1130,229,530),('Lakshikha Sree',1,'The owner of the shop displayed dispecable attitude. And the quality of work was questionable even after letting him know that the photo was important. Poor response.','2026-03-28 16:45:56.791472',1131,229,530),('Santhosh S',5,'Ss photo  photography studio it\'s a wonderful studio please all visit that studio professional and style photography dresses  I really comfort and full satisfied photos  🤍 i love it photo indoor outdoor any event successfully that\'s studio ✨','2026-03-28 16:45:56.794496',1132,229,530),('Ponnurangam Nimilan',5,'Booked SS Digital for my daughter\'s wedding.  We loved the way Mr.Hari Babu interacts and the dedication he shows towards his work. He has a good (smiling) team and they together do a great job. Hari Babu is very sincere to what he commits and he gives the best. The quality of the photos and videos (4K) are really great and natural.','2026-03-28 16:45:56.797003',1133,229,530),('Aaditya',5,'Excellent Experience at PTS Studio Chromepet\n\nI had a wonderful experience at PTS Studio Chromepet. A clean, comfortable, and very well-maintained environment. The whole process was smooth and stress-free. The staff there handled the job with great professionalism and completed everything quickly without compromising on quality.\n\nThe staff were extremely friendly, polite, and accommodating. I also appreciated the availability of a wash basin and mirror to freshen up and prepare before the shoot.\n\nMost importantly, the photos turned out to be of excellent quality. Highly recommended for anyone looking for professional and efficient photography services!','2026-03-28 16:46:02.501319',1134,230,532),('rev priya',5,'Excellent work, very accomodative in customer requirements.\nHighly recommend their service.\nKeep up the good work👍','2026-03-28 16:46:02.504525',1135,230,532),('Annamalai Ganesh',1,'Not worth for the photoshoot for my 2 year old baby in shop. Cost is very high and photo editing is very bad. Did not like at all. They have a condition like minimum of 5 photos atleast which does not seem good. We wasted 2300 rs for 10 photos. Did not like the photos and editing too. Thanks. Kindly take the feedback .','2026-03-28 16:46:02.507578',1136,230,532),('Sharmilee Somasundaram',5,'I came to studio through Google location. I was quite perplexed at 1st because I haven\'t done collage frame before. It was a gift for my sister\'s marriage. I\'m completely satisfied. And it\'s way worth than my expectations. They were very humble they gave idea to collage the photos in the way I liked. Thank you so much...','2026-03-28 16:46:02.510609',1137,230,532),('Kalieswari Palanisamy',5,'I had a very good experience at this photo studio. They provided my passport-size photo in just 5 minutes. The photographer was professional, soft-spoken, and even guided me to get ready properly before the shot. Highly recommended for quick and quality service!','2026-03-28 16:46:02.514012',1138,230,532),('Rubab banu',5,'Showkath is an amazing photographer and an even better person. From the very first conversation, he was kind, helpful\n\nThe photos are absolutely beautiful. Wide Angle Photos Team captured real emotions and all the special moments so perfectly that we love reliving our day through his pictures. Showkath was professional, friendly, and even delivered the full gallery earlier than promised\n\nWorking with Showkath was such a smooth and happy experience from start to finish. We are incredibly grateful for these memories and would 100% recommend him to anyone','2026-03-28 16:46:05.766464',1139,231,537),('MUSKAAN FATHIMA_S',5,'We are extremely happy with the photos from my sister’s wedding, they came out absolutely beautiful, and every picture feels special to us. Showkath and his team were punctual, friendly, and came on time and they ar very friendly which made everyone in the family feel comfortable throughout the day\n\nThey delivered the final photos on time, and the entire experience was smooth. All our family members were truly happy with the results. We would gladly recommend Wide Angle photos to anyone looking for a reliable and talented wedding photography team','2026-03-28 16:46:05.779650',1140,231,537),('Madhumidha P_CSE',5,'We are so happy to have had Showkath and the team as our wedding photographers , they are so easy and fun to be around and work beautifully.  Everyone in both of our family was so glad to see them too\n\nWe also decided to add the video package at the last minute, and the results were absolutely stunning beyond what we imagined. On top of that, we were amazed at how quickly the photos, album and videos were delivered within the time as they promised\n\nWe honestly recommend Showkath and his team more highly. Thank you so much for capturing our special day so beautifully','2026-03-28 16:46:05.783015',1141,231,537),('Mhd Hamdan',5,'Wide Angle Photos and team photographed our wedding recently Sep 04 2025 , and the pictures are absolutely outstanding. The team was so professional, well dressed and friendly, and helpful making everything run smoothly. I highly recommend Wide Angle Photos and  team with a full 5*\n\nThank you for making our memories','2026-03-28 16:46:05.786349',1142,231,537),('Ashwini Ashok Kumar',5,'Wide angle team turned my wedding into a fairy tale. 100% genuine efforts on finding the perfect moments and shots that will leave you breathless. The team made me feel comfortable, happy,  really charming way, with a funny laugh and sense of humor that makes you want to keep going. Special shout out to the director of the team Mr.Showkath who has become one, among my family members. I strongly recommend Wide angle photos for any couple looking to truly tell their story.\nBest wishes team wide angle photos,\n-Ashwini','2026-03-28 16:46:05.789523',1143,231,537),('Pavithra Sivaprasad',5,'We are absolutely thrilled with the photography and videography services provided for our engagement and wedding celebrations. From the very first interaction to the final delivery, the team displayed exceptional professionalism, warmth, and punctuality. They had a wonderful ability to make everyone feel comfortable in front of the camera, capturing candid emotions as well as beautifully composed moments.\nEvery photograph and video tells a story and perfectly reflects the love, happiness, and sacredness of our special days.\n\nWe would like to extend our heartfelt thanks to Keerthi and the entire photography team for their excellent coordination and seamless efforts throughout the event. Their professionalism, dedication, and attention to detail made the entire experience smooth and stress-free, allowing us to truly enjoy every moment.\n\nWe truly admire their passion, patience, and dedication, and we couldn’t have asked for a better team to document these once-in-a-lifetime memories. Highly recommended for anyone seeking premium, trustworthy photography and videography services.','2026-03-28 16:46:12.707937',1144,232,538),('Praveen Selvaraji',5,'From start to finish, Ashokarsh Chennai team delivered an absolutely exceptional experience.\n\nAdmin & Sales:\nThe pre-event coordination was seamless, refined, and completely stress-free. From transparent quotations to package selection, Harish guided us with clear explanations, valuable suggestions, and a friendly yet highly professional approach that instantly built trust. Everything was handled by Harish with clarity and true professionalism, making the entire planning process effortless and reassuring.\n\nEvent Coverage:\nOur two-day wedding (reception in the evening and wedding in the morning) was covered by an 8-member team, including traditional and candid photographers, videographers, and assistants. While we may not know everyone’s names, but every single member was warm, polite, and highly professional. The photo and video quality were truly marvellous, beautifully capturing emotions, rituals, and candid moments. This team didn’t just capture our wedding—they elevated it into a timeless, cinematic memory. Our entire family was extremely happy with their work and genuinely delighted.\n\nPost-Event & Delivery:\nThe post-wedding process was handled flawlessly by Sowmiya, reflecting the same high level of excellence. Delivery of soft copies, copying raw footage to the SSD, beautifully crafted magazine album, and all other deliverables were managed perfectly by her. She was extremely jovial and handled everything effortlessly. Approval was taken for each and every deliverable, ensuring perfection at every stage. All the changes we requested were incorporated without any hesitation. Overall, Sowmiya took complete care of delivering everything in a perfect and professional manner.\n\nOverall, every family member was fully satisfied. They didn’t just document our wedding—they made it memorable and timeless. One of the best decisions we made for our wedding. Highly recommended.','2026-03-28 16:46:12.710658',1145,232,538),('Vimalesh Mallikarjun',5,'Gopi and team did a fantastic job for our baby’s Ayush homam. The team was patient and baby friendly, doing their best to engage the baby to get the right shots. Excellent customer service and responsiveness from the team on all requests before and during the event. Very structured process right from the beginning which was helpful in ironing out the details before the event. Their professionalism, warmth and candid nature is highly commendable, putting us at ease to enjoy our function without worrying about photography.\n\nHighly recommended!','2026-03-28 16:46:12.713800',1146,232,538),('aarthi ramamoorthy',5,'I had a wonderful experience with Ashokarsh Photography for my maternity shoot and baby shower. The team was extremely professional, friendly, and made us feel comfortable throughout the sessions. A special thanks to the amazing crew — Gopi, Shanmugam, Kumaran, Ranjith, Adhi, and Rajesh — for their dedication and effort in capturing every special moment. Their creativity and attention to detail truly reflected in the beautiful photos. I’m really happy with their work and would highly recommend them.','2026-03-28 16:46:12.716485',1147,232,538),('Gayathri Senthil',5,'Hi.. We booked Ashokarsh for our Big day( Marriage). We had one reception and a temple wedding intimately with close circle  outstation in madurai and another reception bash in Chennai. We totally had 4 events covered by them. Additionally we had a complimentary pre- wedding photoshoot. One big team handled our chaotic multitasking wedding perfectly with a warm smile and took us through all the events. Pre wedding shoot was our best memory as we had a great time during arrange marriage phase. Their quality of stills, their pose knowledge saved lot of our times during busy schedules. They are the best in town and worth every penny. We are yet to receive the album and will post a review soon post albums.','2026-03-28 16:46:12.720012',1148,232,538),('Hannah Sharon',5,'Candid Red provided phenomenal service at our wedding! They were incredibly professional all throughout the shoots, and they went above and beyond to ensure that the final product would be cherished by us for years to come. The Album was very Impressive, the whole family Enjoyed all the photos, Videos.. Super talented team, Perfect in Timing. Everything was Beautifully Captured ❤️& makes us so happy every time we re-watch our wedding videos...','2026-03-28 16:46:18.822718',1149,233,541),('Asvin Kumar',5,'One of the best decision we made is choosing Candid red for capturing our wedding ceremony.\nAnbu gave us good deal on the package and  also adding our custom wishes.\nVibin, Prashant,Kavi, & team made us so comfortable by organizing Pre-wedding photoshoot. so that we become friends there by eliminating the shy part during wedding photo sessions.\nPricing is so competitive and worth every penny for the services CR offered.\nCR provided 2 excellent mega size albums and replica mini albums which were best of it\'s kind.\n\nOverall I strongly recommend considering Candid Red for any photography occasion.\nAsvin & Sasi\n#SaaSvi','2026-03-28 16:46:18.824298',1150,233,541),('vinoth kumar',5,'They were perfect, on time, reliable and flexible. My wedding pictures were great thanks to them. I would suggest them to be more active in social networks. I recommend candid red studios for their commitment.\nI wish they could be more creative.','2026-03-28 16:46:18.825749',1151,233,541),('Gopinath RS',5,'Candid Red team exceeded my expectations with their professionalism and creativity. The photographers were punctual and made me feel at ease throughout the shoot. The photos turned out beautifully—well-composed, natural, and perfectly edited. Their attention to detail and ability to capture candid moments really stood out. Overall, the service was worth every penny, and I highly recommend Candid Red Photography to anyone looking for high-quality, artistic photos.\n\nStarted my journey with them for my son’s photography and now , they are our family photographers for all our family functions :) thank you and keep up the good work 👍','2026-03-28 16:46:18.827274',1152,233,541),('Priya Vaidyanathan',5,'I had used Candid red\'s service for my wedding and it is one of the best decision. Their service is top  notch. They\'re prompt and reachable. The output is beautiful. photo album, video anything you name. And it\'s amazing that they\'re providing such services at a very reasonable price. Super happy to have them do our wedding photography.😇💙','2026-03-28 16:46:18.828666',1153,233,541),('Thinesh Slo',5,'Last minute planned pre wedding shot , Gobinath handle it very well . Thanks ✨','2026-03-28 16:46:23.215310',1154,234,544),('Ram Jayaraman',5,'Very well done! Mr Gopinath is a consummate professional. This was for a family event. We are very happy with his work!','2026-03-28 16:46:23.218789',1155,234,544),('Magical Flute',5,'Amazing work. Studio has got really Good ambience.Its my first visit to the Studio and i really felt very comfortable . Very co operative. Very comfortable to work with. Other than Photography Skills, I personally Like  his Sincerity, dedication for the work.\nGuys, You all should also have nice time working with @Nagadev Photography.','2026-03-28 16:46:23.222110',1156,234,544),('visu deepan',5,'You and your team members have been amazing, so professional and friendly. They are  very very dedicated persons\nYou have captured our day so perfectly and very good clarity  photos we could not have asked for more from you. this guys creating wonderful memorable   videos and my photo albums also is wonderful. thanks team We will continue to recommend you to everyone!!','2026-03-28 16:46:23.225663',1157,234,544),('Monisha .S',5,'Thank you for your wonderful service on my daughter\'s marriage. More than our expectation you did a good job.... Thank you NAGADEV PHOTOGRAPHY AND TEAM for your tireless efforts within our budget, the best result.. I would like to have the same experience in the marriage event too. Wish you all the best👏👏👏👏👍','2026-03-28 16:46:23.229140',1158,234,544),('KARTHICK B',5,'\"Thank you team for your excellent service and exceptional value for money. Your professionalism, punctuality, friendliness and dedication made the whole experience smooth and enjoyable. The quality of your work exceeds expectations, delivering stunning photos that truly capture the moment. I appreciate how you balance creativity with great customer care, making every rupee well worth it. Looking forward to many more future events together!\"','2026-03-28 16:46:26.449856',1159,235,546),('Edwin Prasanth',5,'Awesome photography❤️ Meraki capturing the best moment which is the life time memories. Meraki photography is the best photography I have ever seen in Chennai. They are putting extraordinary efforts as input and the output photos are coming very flawless and mind-blowing 😍. In my marriage I kept Meraki photography. I loved all their works. Reception photos, marriage photos, pre wedding photos all are came very well. Its all about life time memories for us 🫶🏻😍❤️. The Best part is each and every photo which is taken by Meraki photography will speak 😍and tell the stories 😍of us. They are excellent talented guys 😍❤️. I loved their works ❤️','2026-03-28 16:46:26.454445',1160,235,546),('Senbagam S',5,'We wanted to appreciate the hospitality we received during our maternity shoot..You people made us so comfortable during the entire shoot and I am super happy to see the show run by women😍\n\nA big thank you for your coordination in organising things Nancy and thank you Kavitha for the amazing pictures and Reshma for her elegant makeover🥰\n\nWe really had an amazing experience at Meraki and the effort you guys made for the back drop & pics was commendable\n\nI am looking for many more shoots & memories with you❤️','2026-03-28 16:46:26.459075',1161,235,546),('Sowmiya K',5,'The best and bestest affordable photography.Ms.kavitha shanmugam did a very great and smart job. She is superb talented. My baby photoshoot and birthday shoot it\'s really looking attractive and beautiful. Stories from Meraki is more comfortable for me and my baby also..','2026-03-28 16:46:26.462788',1162,235,546),('manju dhanasekaran',5,'We are extremely happy with this service. They are very budget friendly too.This young team always gives their level best and we are really impressed with the outcome. The photos have turned out to be very beautiful. Kavitha is a talented girl and I will definitely recommend her. All the best to her and the team.','2026-03-28 16:46:26.466690',1163,235,546),('Suresh Kumar',5,'Dhilip Studio is truly one of the best wedding photographers in Chennai. Their candid wedding photography captured all emotions perfectly. From engagement to wedding rituals, everything was documented beautifully. The team is very professional, friendly, and experienced. Highly recommended for anyone looking for premium wedding photography services in Chennai.','2026-03-28 16:46:30.291404',1164,236,547),('Mohamed Faizal',5,'We had an absolutely amazing experience with Dhilip Studio for our wedding photography and videography. From start to finish, the entire team was very professional, friendly, and supportive.\nThey beautifully captured every special moment of our big day with great creativity and attention to detail. The candid shots, traditional photos, and couple portraits all turned out stunning. The wedding album quality is excellent – the design, editing, and finishing are just perfect. Every page brings back emotional and happy memories for us.\nThe wedding video was beyond our expectations. The highlights, background music, and editing were done so beautifully that we have already watched it multiple times with our family. Everyone who saw the album and video truly appreciated the quality and effort put into it.\nThe team was punctual, patient, and made us feel very comfortable throughout the entire event. They ensured that no important moment was missed and handled everything smoothly.\nThank you, Dhilip Studio, for making our special day even more memorable. We highly recommend them to anyone looking for professional and high-quality wedding photography and videography services.','2026-03-28 16:46:30.295602',1165,236,547),('Niranchanaa Shuresh',5,'Excellent photography. Thanks to the team. We had choosen them as our wedding photographer.They are budget friendly and also provide the required output within the stipulated time.The edit and quality of candid video and photos are toooo way goooddd. Do choose them for your events🤗🤗😎','2026-03-28 16:46:30.327976',1166,236,547),('Manju Kumar',5,'Very happy with the photography service provided to my students bharatanatya Arangetram function\nMr. Dilip always tries to do his best. They always try to take as many photos as possible and spend time and space. All the photos are good and everyone loved it. Highly recommended and worth the money. Very good experience during the ceremony and after.','2026-03-28 16:46:30.331944',1167,236,547),('Jayashree Duponi',5,'Had a very simple, smooth and stress free experience with Dhilip for my baby’s first birthday party. He understood our needs and delivered exactly what we expected. Pictures were beautiful and all of us loved the outcome. I’ll definitely be choosing Dhilip for the next time we require photography services and i highly recommend his work to anyone out there looking for a photographer.','2026-03-28 16:46:30.335663',1168,236,547),('Sathanraj',5,'The entire photoshoot was completed smoothly. We had an early morning beach shoot for my 1-year-old baby, and the experience was wonderful. The photos turned out absolutely superb—very candid and exactly what we expected, even better. He arrived on time and handled my daughter very gently and patiently throughout the shoot. Overall, it was a really pleasant and memorable experience','2026-03-28 16:46:37.222906',1169,237,549),('shanthakumar',5,'Mr Sam from Cruze Photography Studio is absolutely wonderful to work with from start to finish! We hired him for my son\'s birthday session and were so impressed by his professionalism and creativity. When we received the final photos, we were blown away. He managed to capture every special, candid moment and the lighting and composition were stunning. We will treasure these memories forever.\nI would wholeheartedly recommend Mr Sam to anyone looking for a talented and kind photographer.','2026-03-28 16:46:37.225258',1170,237,549),('Surya Narayana',5,'We have been availing his services for the past couple of years, and he has beautifully captured memorable moments from our family celebrations, including those of both our children. We have been extremely happy with his work.\nHe patiently captures the best moments without requiring any intervention, demonstrating remarkable patience and professionalism. He is highly flexible, travels as needed, and blends effortlessly with family and friends, which makes everyone comfortable.\nWe are truly satisfied with his services and highly appreciate his dedication.','2026-03-28 16:46:37.228305',1171,237,549),('Sivaranjini K.V',5,'We had a wonderful experience with our photographer for my baby’s first birthday. He is a very friendly person and made us feel comfortable throughout the event. He patiently adjusted to our timing and even waited calmly when we took some extra time. What we loved the most was that he captured beautiful and natural moments, which made the photos even more special. Truly grateful for his work and highly recommend him','2026-03-28 16:46:37.230855',1172,237,549),('shekar manik',5,'We booked Cruze Photography for our corporate shoot, and it was an excellent experience. Sam is an extremely humble and honest person even though our payment got delayed, he never once escalated or complained. After the payment, he continued to support us with multiple rounds of video re-edits and corrections without any hesitation. Truly professional and dedicated to client satisfaction. Highly recommended for corporate events and shoots!','2026-03-28 16:46:37.233576',1173,237,549),('Mayuri Appaji',1,'Zero professionalism, worst customer support and no proper studio set-up. I don\'t know how people comment him as \"Approachable😆\".  He calculates every moment as MONEY MONEY MONEY. Who will pay Rs.150/- for one raw soft copy picture? Don\'t get cheated by seeing good reviews, to my knowledge all fake.\nPs: His editings were horrible, thank God we ended up getting only soft copies paying Rs.500/-. 😏','2026-03-28 16:46:45.632361',1174,238,551),('Balachandran M',5,'Good customer service & rapid process.\nThe way 96 Studio taking care of customer expectation is simply superb.Good work & continue to support the same','2026-03-28 16:46:45.635802',1175,238,551),('Sekar Ji',5,'Super studio low cost..very good work...xerox print out all available','2026-03-28 16:46:45.638832',1176,238,551),('Vinoth Kumar',5,'Recently we worked with 96 studio team.nice experience and they thinking new content and friendly move. And quality of camera they using in photos shoot... Cost wise also they negotiations and support','2026-03-28 16:46:45.642302',1177,238,551),('SanKrya Global',5,'Good & friendly staff','2026-03-28 16:46:45.645997',1178,238,551),('vignesh js',5,'Amazing photography by Sarathy na! Loved our wedding album — each moment beautifully captured. Highly professional and friendly Photographer . Definitely recommend!”','2026-03-28 16:46:55.901623',1179,239,556),('Keerthana Gs',5,'I\'m very much happy with sar photography. For our house warming ceremony we reached out yo sar photography.  They  will reach ontime to the location , and their work was tooo good. I\'m very much satisfied with their work ...For my daughters birthday also I\'ll go  with sar photography..','2026-03-28 16:46:55.904883',1180,239,556),('Sundaravalli K',5,'The photos have come out so beautifully! You’ve been our photographer for the past 12 years, and honestly, you’re the best!','2026-03-28 16:46:55.908071',1181,239,556),('Kavitha S',5,'Sarathi was a such a awesome person who takes lively photos. His work was amazing and the way he takes pic is very unique. He is not only a photographer but very kind hearted and wonderful person. His skills are very different and unique cos he understands customer needs. All the best sarathi for your amazing future','2026-03-28 16:46:55.911166',1182,239,556),('pavi r',5,'Sarathi is such an hard working photographer, very talented in his profession.  No words to describe this photography.  I would surely recommend Sarathi India Photography for my friends and family.  Apart from his professional Sarathi anna is very kind person,  friendly too.  Your click is one of my best in Lifetime. All the very best Sarathi 👍 for your projects 😇','2026-03-28 16:46:55.914450',1183,239,556),('Shanthiskitchen Shanthi Ramachandran',5,'Engaged them for our grandsons upanayanam recently and we are delighted to see the video and album which were upto our expectations and mainly we could get them within the stipulated time too.Definitely would recommend them for their prising ,quality and the good work 👍Best wishes from all\nOf Us 💐💐','2026-03-28 16:47:00.652220',1184,240,561),('Praveen Ashok',5,'Harish and team are the best. They gelled along with the family and made it like their family function. It was so seamless and the edits and everything committed was well done! A great team overall','2026-03-28 16:47:00.656042',1185,240,561),('Gopenath MK',5,'It was a pleasant & great experience with Applied Photographers. The photographers are very much experienced. Balu had supported us very well. Their patience, sincerity and dedication towards work must be appreciated. BEST WEDDING CANDID photography to cherish our beautiful moments.','2026-03-28 16:47:00.660322',1186,240,561),('Naveen Howie',5,'Prompt service. I had my passport picture clicked, printed and handed over in 10 mins. Very affordable as well. I can just email them back for new prints when needed. Highly recommended!!','2026-03-28 16:47:00.664091',1187,240,561),('Swathi Kumar',5,'@ Harish A very big applouse to you for taking marvelous pictures and video’s of our son’s upanayanam function.They had taken almost some thousand pictures without any hesitation and has delivered us a wonderful cinematic short video for which we got awesome reviews. I highly recommend @Applied photography for any event. Once again thank you so much for the team.And ofcourse since our marriage they are the one who clicks for each and every event and still continues…','2026-03-28 16:47:00.667622',1188,240,561),('gayathri anbu',5,'We have done our wedding, baby shower, birthday, and outdoor shoots with Vicithiram Studio, and every single time they have delivered exceptional quality. Their creativity, consistency, and dedication make us feel completely confident. At this point, we don’t even look for any other options — we blindly book them because their output is always top-notch. Vicithiram Studio has truly become our go-to team for capturing our precious moments','2026-03-28 16:47:06.300993',1189,241,563),('K Nandhini',5,'My wedding was beautifully captured by VicithiramStudio. They covered every nook and corner without getting tired even for a moment, while we were the ones exhausted! The quality of their work is absolutely top-notch. I strongly recommend VicithiramStudio to everyone.','2026-03-28 16:47:06.304602',1190,241,563),('Manoj Kumar',5,'VicithiramStudio captured our wedding with unmatched dedication. They worked nonstop, covering every corner and every expression. The editing is top-notch—rich colours, perfect clarity, and a beautiful cinematic flow. Their creativity in framing and storytelling sets them apart from everyone else. Totally worth it! I strongly recommend VicithiramStudio😎','2026-03-28 16:47:06.308358',1191,241,563),('Navin Aravind',5,'I had picked them for my wedding shoot and for post wedding. The crew was amazing and was suggesting multiple idea and creative photos for us . We really enjoyed having them in our special day shoot and all way on time service . Well professional team . Further with no quality compromise and budget in pricing they were able to provide us best clicks as expected without missing out the special movements . I would highly recommend them to go ahead with them for your special day .','2026-03-28 16:47:06.312170',1192,241,563),('dinesh kumar',5,'“We booked them for our marriage photoshoot and the output was outstanding. The team captured every moment perfectly with great attention to detail. Their creativity, lighting, and candid shots were top-quality. Timely delivery, polite behavior, and excellent professionalism. Truly worth it!”','2026-03-28 16:47:06.315453',1193,241,563),('Lakshmipathy V',5,'I book one photographer but iam not satisfied with he work and my album work not complete then i give my wedding photos to Krishna from vimbam photography he completed my album work in 2weeks\nI satisfied with his work .\nHe surprise with additional mini clone album and photo pendrive  box and acrylic photo frame..','2026-03-28 16:47:14.410947',1194,242,565),('M SIVA KUMAR',5,'The photography style of vimbam Photography was very good, and we knew that they had put a lot of work into the package they gave us. The file selection option they provided made it very easy to select.It was very easy for my wife and I to select files from different locations.They made it in 10 days to take time  album delivery From the date we selected.','2026-03-28 16:47:14.415088',1195,242,565),('Ajay',5,'Recently I bought several photo frames and I’m really impressed The quality is excellent and the prices are very affordable Highly recommended','2026-03-28 16:47:14.419277',1196,242,565),('Arumuga Selvam',5,'He is very imaginative and professional.  I heartily suggest it to anyone searching for a memorable, tension free photo session.  You won\'t get such a high-quality, professional pictures at this low cost. Highly recommended.!','2026-03-28 16:47:14.422917',1197,242,565),('Malathi susila',5,'We book Vimbam for Pre - birthday shoot and also Birthday event shoot. For both shoots Vimbam Team came on time and we enjoyed the photo shoots with our baby.\nWe likes the way he handled to create a good and beautiful poses and now that makes the beautiful moments of our baby\'s first birthday.\nI will recommend Vimbam Photography for your special occasions.','2026-03-28 16:47:14.426617',1198,242,565),('Hariprasad Mahakali',5,'We\'ve known and followed Siva\'s work for a few years before we reached out to check her availability to cover our wedding. My spouse and I had already seen Siva\'s portfolio and had inspiration from her wonderful feed filled with beautiful memories of couples she had worked with before.\n\nWe were thrilled that she was available and interested to cover the candid photography and traditional videography for our event and post wedding couple shoot.\n\nShe carefully articulated the distinctions between the different type of photography coverage options for the event. We really appreciated her time to understand our vision for the wedding, get to know us as individuals and also ensure to call out any concerns upfront that may happen during the shoot.\n\nDuring our main event, Siva and her team promptly arrived much earlier than scheduled, captured the event decor beautifully and also the entire flow of events. The team had great suggestions for the poses and also for the portrait locations in the venue. They ensured to capture all the important moments of our wedding in detail and also moments with our families that we will cherish forever. They were very accomodating with all our guests and ensured they captured candid moments of both family and friends.\n\nThe traditional video was captured really well and our families often revisit the video to relive specific favourite moments from the day.\n\nThe physical album photos were left for us to choose and the quality of the prints and the photobook turned out incredible.\n\nOur post wedding couple shoot was shot at the beach and we had some lovely candid moments captured beautifully there as well.\n\nWe truly respect her work and value the memories she documented for us to treasure for life. We\'re so so glad and thankful that she covered our wedding and we were rest assured that the photos and video will be well taken care of. And with no surprise, all of us absolutely LOVED what Siva and her team delivered.\n\nTLDR: They are incredible at what they do, just book them already!!!','2026-03-28 16:47:18.610423',1199,243,570),('Sahana Ramakrishnan',5,'We had an amazing experience with Simple Pictures Co. for our wedding. I’ve been following their work since they started, and I always loved how their photos feel natural, unfiltered, and yet so beautiful.\n\nTrue to their name, their style is simple and aesthetic, capturing real moments effortlessly which is what I’ve always wanted for my wedding. They didn’t direct us to pose a certain way; instead, they focused on capturing the true, unscripted moments as they naturally unfold. Extremely professional team, and open to ideas. They listen, suggest, and make sure everything comes together beautifully.\n\nThe final photos and albums were delivered on time and customized perfectly. My family and I loved the results, and we couldn’t have asked for a better team to capture our big day. Highly recommend and such a fun team!!','2026-03-28 16:47:18.614954',1200,243,570),('Vignesh Sompur',5,'Choosing Simple Pictures as our wedding photography team was easily one of  the best decisions we took for our big day! They did an amazing job capturing all the special moments from our wedding. The photos and videos turned out beautiful, and we love how natural and well-timed they were. The team was also very friendly and made us feel comfortable in front of the camera. They were professional, punctual and most importantly very easy to work with. They really paid attention to all the little details, and it shows in every picture. We chose the video montage, and it turned out great! It captured all the fun and emotional moments so well, that watching it brings back all the lovely memories.!\nWe truly appreciate their hard work and the wonderful memories they captured for us. We highly recommend Simple Pictures to anyone looking for a great wedding photography team!','2026-03-28 16:47:18.619064',1201,243,570),('Arjun Balan',5,'We hired Simple Pictures Co. for our wedding and reception.\nThey were a breeze to work with. Since we reside in the US, they coordinated with us across different timezones, and also with our parents as needed before the wedding. Right from communication (before and after the events) to the capturing the wedding, they were well organized. They have a multi-faceted team that can work across cities (we had 2 receptions in different cities), across skill sets - Candid and Video and photography.\n\nThey hit it out of the park with our wedding video montage and couldn\'t have asked for a better team to help us capture our memories. Thank you Simple Pictures Co. for all the work and flexibility you\'ve provided!','2026-03-28 16:47:18.622688',1202,243,570),('Swati Iddya',4,'Simple Pictures was hands down one of the best decisions we made for our wedding.\nFrom the moment they arrived, they brought calm, friendliness, and a magical knack for catching moments we didn’t even realize were happening. They never once forced stiff poses; instead, they captured us laughing, tearing up, and dancing like no one\'s watching—which, turns out, they definitely were (with cameras in hand, thankfully).\nEvery click felt effortless, and every frame was filled with genuine emotion. Their candid style made us feel at ease, and their team? Just a delight. Clear communication, super accommodating, and all-around lovely humans behind the lens (special mention to Joshua).\nThe final output—photos, videos, and our photo album—left us grinning ear to ear. Importantly, no post wedding choosing/selecting pictures from a mountain of raw repository!\nSimple Pictures made reliving our big day a joy.\nIf you\'re looking for someone to document your day with heart, humor, and zero awkward “hold hands and look at each other” moments, these are your people. Cheers to Ram and team! :)','2026-03-28 16:47:18.626217',1203,243,570),('Sudhanshu Shukla',5,'We had an absolutely amazing experience with Rohan Mishra Photography! The entire team was professional, friendly, and made us feel completely at ease throughout the shoot. They beautifully captured every emotion and moment, and the final photos turned out far beyond our expectations. Their attention to detail, creativity, and commitment to quality are truly commendable. Highly recommend them to anyone looking for timeless and beautifully captured memories!','2026-03-28 16:47:22.632723',1204,244,572),('Anupam Ameta',5,'We had such a lovely experience with Rohan Mishra Photography! The team was so warm and patient, and made us feel completely at ease throughout the shoot. They beautifully captured all our special moments, and the photos turned out even better than we imagined. Truly grateful for their amazing work 💛!!','2026-03-28 16:47:22.636370',1205,244,572),('Harini Murali',5,'As a US-based NRI couple, we’re extremely fortunate to have worked with Rohan, Pooja and team. They were an essential part of why our wedding was a resounding success—not only did me and my husband love working with them but so did our families, friends, and guests with whom Rohan’s team equally covered and showcased in the best possible ways. In preparing for the event, Rohan very patiently answered all of our questions and concerns over both email and WhatsApp; their pricing structure was very transparent and easy to work with. One big plus was that Rohan was able to arrange for drone photography and also live-streaming —I highly recommend asking for those amenities much in advance! Especially for brides, having Pooja to guide with outfit placement & poses during your photoshoot is very helpful. They are truly a creative and lively team, able to turn our awkward poses into naturally beautiful moments. Rohan’s team did a fantastic job packaging the post-processed photos into a neatly composed book, very study and rich in color. His team’s photography style and picture quality (which you can easily check on his Instagram) comes alive in print—absolutely brilliant!','2026-03-28 16:47:22.640124',1206,244,572),('Paula Simpson',5,'My husband and I wanted a wedding shoot that was a bit different. We wanted photos that weren\'t over-processed, but had lots of colour and showed our personalities. Rohan and Puja listened to what we wanted- even though it was a bit different- and the resulting photos are amazing. We could not be happier.\n\nAs well as gorgeous images that are fun, they are perfectly what we wanted. Added to that, they are super awesome to work with, lots of laughter and they were happy to listen to us if we had ideas.\n\nThanks guys, you truly are amazing, far better than any other photographers we saw. You are also consistent- your photos have consistent style and that\'s why we knew we could trust you. Technical skill and creative flair, and people who are great to be around!','2026-03-28 16:47:22.644496',1207,244,572),('sabiha sultana',5,'Working with Rohan Mishra Photography was an absolute delight. Their professionalism, patience, and creative vision brought out the best in every shot. Each photograph tells a story, and we are so grateful for the beautiful memories they’ve captured. Their eye for detail and ability to capture authentic moments made the experience truly memorable. The final photographs reflect both skill and artistry, and we couldn’t be more pleased.','2026-03-28 16:47:22.648804',1208,244,572),('Kamesh Rao',5,'Very best photography team in the Chennai…. Definitely you can choose this team for your family functions without any thought and they will make best memories for your lifetime…. Good dedicated team…. Wishing you all the success in your future endeavours…','2026-03-28 16:47:27.274272',1209,245,573),('Geetha Kesavan',5,'Saro did the photography and videography of my daughter\'s engagement as well as wedding. They did a fabulous job.They had covered the events extremely well. Additionally they provided exclusive candid moments which were amazingly natural. The video looked like Manirathnam.movie. it was picture perfect. The exclusive poses of bride and groom were simply superb. All in all their work is exceptional. Their attitude is extraordinary. They obliged to my special requests. They are the best choice and i vouch for them 💯. The albums are done extremely well. Thank you saro for making our special event so memorable with your picture perfect clicks','2026-03-28 16:47:27.277817',1210,245,573),('Suresh',5,'Teaming Up with Saro Videos photography after 10 Long years & still with same Quality. Your entire Team deserves a huge applause for making our occassions More fruitful. Especially in making everyone smile & laugh throughout. Photography quality is just commendable. Wishing you great 👍','2026-03-28 16:47:27.281363',1211,245,573),('Vishal b',5,'I booked Saro videos for Marriage and Reception. Photography of Prashanth was Really good, the way he tells our relatives and family members to smile was really great and he kept the crowd engaging. He’s very professional and he takes stunning pictures, guides the groom and bride for various cinematic poses which when seen through the camera was stunning. Everyone in our family and other relatives loved his way of telling to smile when people don’t react. Such a gem of a person he is. Prashanth is highly recommended for wedding and reception photography. And Videography too was pretty good. Prashanth and his team did an amazing job of enlightening every moments captured through their camera lenses.','2026-03-28 16:47:27.284768',1212,245,573),('Palanichamy R',5,'had an amazing experience with this photographer. They were professional, friendly, and made the entire shoot feel comfortable and effortless. The attention to detail and creativity really showed in the final photos—every shot was beautifully composed and edited. They listened to what I wanted and delivered results that exceeded my expectations. Highly recommend to anyone looking for high-quality, professional photography!','2026-03-28 16:47:27.288325',1213,245,573),('Vigneshvaran Sethuraman',5,'To the wonderful My Wedding Clicks team,\n\nI wanted to express our deepest gratitude for the magic you created at our family\'s recent wedding.\n\nYou didn\'t just photograph the bride and groom; you captured everyone and every meaningful moment, all while making us feel completely natural and at ease.\n\nThank you for your incredible artistry and for preserving our joy so beautifully. I truly can\'t recommend you highly enough!','2026-03-28 16:47:35.974129',1214,246,575),('Surya G',5,'I had the best experience with My wedding clicks . The photos were super excellent and beautifully shot! The photo album turned out even better than we expected, with every moment captured perfectly. The photographer ( Diwakar) was very cooperative, professional, and made the entire experience smooth and enjoyable. I was really satisfied and ordered a photo frame which turned out to be excellent as well. Highly satisfied , budget friendly and would definitely recommend!','2026-03-28 16:47:35.977420',1215,246,575),('yashwanth',5,'They are really a good team. Met at our friends wedding and booked instantly at the wedding seeing their team effort','2026-03-28 16:47:35.980595',1216,246,575),('Pranay Kumar',5,'MyWeddingClicks truly offers the best wedding photography services in Chennai! Their team is not only professional and incredibly talented but also super friendly. Our wedding photos turned out absolutely stunning! Plus, their rates are very reasonable. I highly recommend them for all your wedding photography needs!','2026-03-28 16:47:35.983606',1217,246,575),('Anirudh Nambiar',5,'My Wedding Clicks – A Visual Delight!\n\nMy wedding clicks beautifully captures moments with creativity and precision. Their attention to detail, perfect use of lighting, and natural storytelling make every shot stand out. Whether it\'s portraits, landscapes, or events, their work reflects professionalism and passion!!','2026-03-28 16:47:35.987142',1218,246,575),('Banu Srinivasan',5,'We Know Nandhini Photography for over 6 years and extremely happy with their quality of work. They have dedicated team and their photographers are very professional They cover each and every aspect of traditional wedding. Each and every team member are very punctual and they gel very well with customers. They are very competitive and give quality output. I will recommend them for any occasion at any time. Our recent association was in September 2025 for my friend’s daughter marriage and they were very happy with the dedicated service of Nandhini photography I wish them good luck. Srinivasan- Chennai','2026-03-28 16:47:44.727920',1219,247,580),('Srilakshmi N',5,'We had Nandhini photography capture our son’s upanayanam. The photographers were patient and took and good quality images. They suggested good poses for family and group photos. Videos were also good','2026-03-28 16:47:44.731038',1220,247,580),('arun kumar',5,'Truly outstanding Team support with head of Nandini mam, SRMAP has conducted convocation I\'m technical person the team has extended their support very appreciable, and last minute request also have been given support very quickly','2026-03-28 16:47:44.734102',1221,247,580),('kanchan raja',5,'We recently had the pleasure of working with Nandhini Videos for our wedding, and we couldn\'t be happier with the results. From the initial consultation to the final delivery of our photos, every step of the process was handled with the utmost professionalism and care.\n\nThe photographers were not only skilled but also incredibly personable, making everyone feel comfortable and natural in front of the camera. They captured every precious moment beautifully, from the candid smiles to the intricate details of our décor. The quality of the photos is exceptional, with vibrant colors, sharp details, and an artistic touch that truly brings the memories to life.\n\nWhat impressed us the most was their ability to blend into the background while still capturing the essence of our day. They were unobtrusive yet always in the right place at the right time. Their attention to detail and creative vision resulted in a stunning collection of photos that we will cherish forever.\n\nCommunication was seamless throughout, and they were always responsive and accommodating to our requests. The final gallery was delivered promptly, beautifully edited, and presented in an easy-to-navigate format.\n\nWe highly recommend Nandhini Videos to anyone looking for a talented and dedicated team to capture their special moments. Thank you for making our wedding day unforgettable!!!','2026-03-28 16:47:44.736824',1222,247,580),('Lakshmi Srikanth',5,'Wonderful photos and a great experience from the beginning to the end. We recommend  Nandhini  photography for any event.','2026-03-28 16:47:44.741075',1223,247,580),('Vignesh Lokanath',5,'We wanted to have a family photo and was searching for a good photo studio within Medavakkam. I contacted a couple of them but I got good response from Pixeldesign.\n\nWe had an excellent set of photos from here. The studio is inside a deadend and is hidden from the main road of Velachery-Tambaram Main Road.\n\nThey have 2 options,\n1. 30 mins 1000Rs: We can take as many shots and poses and combinations as possible within 30 mins.\n2. 100Rs per photo: If we already have a pose in mind and just want to take one then this option is good. If you don\'t then each click of the photo costs you 100rs. 100rs is not for the photo that you select from many clicks.\n\nI felt the 1st option is great but thought the price is slightly higher. But the setup in the studio was great and photos came out very well for us.\n\nThe photographer was very patient with every pose and combination we asked and even adjusted a few poses to get the right photo. Though they had another photoshoot to go for they gave us the right amount of importance and care.\n\nAs promised they sent the downloadable drive link for all the photos within 2 days.\n\nI will be visiting them again to frame a couple of those photos.\n\nImprovement Points:\n1. The studio is slightly cramped, if they can expand to a bigger place then it would be easy to move around. We were 5 and felt very cramped.\n2. A couple of ties could have been kept at the studio to cater for the needs of those who take pictures in suits.','2026-03-28 16:47:47.088447',1224,248,582),('velu P',5,'Excellent editing. Very satisfied. Please read comments fully to understand it\'s in-depth.\n1. 1st incident when I took official photo in another top studio consider it\'s name as A - where he rushed like anything and took for namesake and handed over. That\'s it task completed\n\nCame to Pixel Design Photography, did same official photo shoot , and he listened carefully, patiently and edited perfectly. Very satisfied his works and efforts. Marvel\'s work.\n\n2. 2nd incident during same period gave one unique customized photo frame to another famous studio consider it\'s name as B - where he not even ready to listen, not even tried , no patience and completed task with no use of it.\n\nSame period of 1st incident, came to Pixel Design Photography - handovered that unsatisfied photo frame and explained. He listened fully & understand the requirements clearly and explained how the outcome will be. The outcome is really awesome. Im very very happy.\n\nHighly recommended pixel design photography. Hereafter I won\'t go anywhere and missed these many years. Really worth of it. Value for money. Excellent editing and customer satisfactions.','2026-03-28 16:47:47.090291',1225,248,582),('Pushparani V',5,'Excellent service. Really I\'m very happy Pixeldesign photography services. I gave unique customised photo frame. First he listened patiently, carefully and answered how the outcomes will be. He did same how I told and sent for review. Then I told multiple changes and he did patiently and neatly. So cooperative with us. Spent enough time to make the product outcomes perfectly. Im very satisfied. No Rush nothing . Everything they did in a perfect manner. Handled very carefully and made it very beautiful. Kudos to PixelDesign photography. Highly recommended for to capture most memorable moments...','2026-03-28 16:47:47.091951',1226,248,582),('Mariana Ravina',5,'Absolutely loved the birthday photography!\nThe photo editing was flawless and enhanced every moment beautifully.\nThe album is well-designed and tells the entire celebration story perfectly.\nTruly grateful for such amazing work—highly recommended!','2026-03-28 16:47:47.093724',1227,248,582),('Dronex Aerospace',5,'A huge thanks to Prithiv and his team at Pixeldesign Photography. They are truly among the top wedding photographers in near by Medavakkam. The two-day coverage was handled with so much creativity and patience. Loved our albums and videos.','2026-03-28 16:47:47.095383',1228,248,582),('Mohammed Saif Hussain',5,'We had an outstanding experience with Sujith and team! Their patience was commendable, and the quality of their work was truly fantastic. The introduction of cloud sharing technology made the photo selection process effortless. I highly recommend their services for capturing special moments.','2026-03-28 16:47:49.320932',1229,249,583),('Sanjana Rajasekar',5,'We had the absolute pleasure of having Sujith and his team from Incognito Frames as our wedding photographers. The results were beyond our expectations! They never made us pose, but instead candidly captured all the joy and festivities. Their dedication extended beyond the wedding events. Despite my delay in photo selection, Sujith\'s team exhibited nothing but patience and understanding, always willing to make edits to ensure our complete satisfaction. Their thoughtfulness and dedication are evident in every interaction and in the stunning quality of their work.\n\nChoosing Incognito Frames was undoubtedly one of the best decisions we made for our wedding. A heartfelt thank you to Sujith, Soumya and the Incognito Frames team.','2026-03-28 16:47:49.323917',1230,249,583),('Sujith',5,'Absolutely thrilled with our experience with Sujith and the Incognito Frames team!\n\nWe booked a family photo shoot to capture our daughter Aadhya and ended up with a collection of memories we’ll cherish forever. The session ran for about 3 hours, and Sujith was patient, creative, and fantastic with kids—he kept the energy positive throughout. The candid moments he caught of Aadhya feel so natural and full of personality.\n\nThe edited photos look amazing—beautiful colors, thoughtful framing, and just the right finishing touches without feeling overdone. We’ve already shared them with friends and family, and everyone’s impressed.\n\nHighly recommend Incognito Frames if you want someone who truly cares about capturing your story, not just staged poses. Thank you, Sujith, for giving us such priceless memories!','2026-03-28 16:47:49.326429',1231,249,583),('Adityan Ramkumar',5,'We recently had the pleasure of having incognito cover our family function, and we couldn’t be happier with the results! From the moment they arrived, their calm and professional presence put everyone at ease. They captured every emotion so beautifully — the laughter, the conversations, the small candid moments that make family events truly special.\n\nHighly recommend to anyone looking for someone who not only takes photos, but tells a story through them. Thank you for giving us memories we’ll treasure for a lifetime.','2026-03-28 16:47:49.329668',1232,249,583),('Sathya Priya',5,'We recently did a Maternity shoot with Suji. Not only this ..but right from my wedding our go to photographer is Suji. He did a brilliant work and we absolutely loved the way the images turned out. Thank you once again for the beautiful pictures captured 😊','2026-03-28 16:47:49.332640',1233,249,583),('Mariappan S',5,'One stop solution for all your Photography needs. Wedding Photography Pre/post wedding, candid photo ,videography, traditional photo, videography, teasers and drone shoots. Industrial Photography Product photoshoots for business. Fashion and Portfolio Photography for individuals and models.','2026-03-28 16:47:55.268972',1234,250,584),('Blossom Francis',5,'Loved the work and the output. On time delivery of quality products. They were able to get the exact output that I was looking for. It was a farewell gift and the people who received it were delighted. The entire office was mesmerized by the work. Kudos to you.','2026-03-28 16:47:55.270665',1235,250,584),('Gowtham Prasanth',5,'We had so much fun getting our pictures of our engagement and Marriage taken by Harrisraj photography. Mr.Harrisraj and his team are professional, creative and talented. I would never hesitate to recommend him to anyone who wants a true professional and customized photography experience.\n\nWe\'re so pleased with the quality of albums and the lasting memories we have. And definitely you ppl turned out to be our all time family photographer 😀\n\nMany thanks again for capturing our memories at its best.','2026-03-28 16:47:55.272367',1236,250,584),('Mohan Thilak',5,'Harrisraj Photography is known for their professional shoot irrespective of the value... Harish and team had been exceptionally displaying the best of their creativity and the outcome of each and every event is fantastic.  I had the opportunity to engage with Harish team for atleast 3 of my family events and lot many BNI events and every event was flawless. Harish used to always create a vow factor very silently.  Best wishes to Harish and team for a great journey ahead','2026-03-28 16:47:55.273713',1237,250,584),('Angeline',5,'I did my portrait shoot with Harrishraj photography and the output was excellent. One of the premier Photo Graphy Team based out Chennai. Every Output will mesmerize you... For all of your photography Needs.... Harrishraj Photography is one stop solution...','2026-03-28 16:47:55.274945',1238,250,584),('Preethi Ramadoss',5,'They are a wonderful team of young and talented persons who grasp concepts quickly and deliver the results exactly like how we wanted. They are extremely talented photographers. I got all my products photoshoots with them and I\'m more than satisfied with their work. Good job guys keep it up 👍','2026-03-28 16:48:00.040696',1239,251,587),('GANESH M',5,'@Whitebuds Thanks for the This wonderful album and frame (Compliment). Am happy with your work.','2026-03-28 16:48:00.044086',1240,251,587),('Ashwinkumar T',5,'Photography skills are truly amazing. Very well organized and patient photographers. The album was too good . Extremely  professional team. Please continue the excellent work!\nHighly recommend','2026-03-28 16:48:00.047969',1241,251,587),('Ramaswamy Viswanathan',5,'White Bud Photography: Highly talented and very professional. They are good with the theme. Got a chance to work with them for my kid first birthday, these people are so kind and more adjustable to handle the photo shoot. Hard to make a kid in a position to capture a good snap, but they did it without hesitate to take many shots till they get satisfied. Happy with their service and pricing. I wish the team all the best.','2026-03-28 16:48:00.052043',1242,251,587),('Hari Prasad',5,'Thank you Vishnu for the Awe-somatic wedding pics/videos and kudos to the entire team, they were so friendly and made us feel so comfortable while shooting. Their ideas for the pics and videos are so unique and wedding album design was too good. We were surprised to see the pen drive given in the wooden box with Bride/Groom names printed on it. Keep up the good work and all the best for your future projects. Once again thanks for making our wedding so memorable :)','2026-03-28 16:48:00.055358',1243,251,587),('Ayisha',5,'I had contacted Jayanthi for my husband’s niece’s wedding. Very prompt in response. Reasonable pricing and excellent quality of work. They put in all the efforts to satisfy our likings and needs. Particularly Jayanthi was very patient and flexible with timing issues which usually rises during mehendi and wedding situations.\nI will be happy to book her for future weddings in my family and refer her service to friends and families .','2026-03-28 16:48:03.962223',1244,252,588),('K Shyamala',5,'Excellent rapport building, I have had a lot of photo sessions starting from my marriage, baby shower, my son’s 1st bday and alot of other family pictures. Wonderful photography, chemistry of relationships is well captured. Thank you for all the wonderful memories that you have helped frame & capture😍👏👏','2026-03-28 16:48:03.966203',1245,252,588),('Nivedita Narayanan',5,'We used Jayanthi\'s photo and videography services for a sadabhishekam recently. From the get-go, it was obvious that she is an absolute professional -- and an exceptional one at that. She was patient with kids, empathetic with elders and did a fantastic job of covering all events and people over two days. She sticks to all timings agreed and is a pleasure to work with.\n\nThank you, Jayanthi, for making our celebration memorable. We look forward to using your services again.','2026-03-28 16:48:03.969180',1246,252,588),('Reena Reen',5,'Jayanthi is an awesome Event photographer. She was the official photographer for our Expos. Her candid photos were amazing and we were very impressed with her professionalism and quality of work.\n\nShe worked with us closely to make sure her work met our expectations and that she had captured all of the items on our shot list . She definitely felt like part of the team! She was patient enough to capture all our requirements without rush and does a fabulous job of editing the images with a quick turnaround time.\n\nWe look forward to working with her again next time.\n\nI would highly recommend her for any event!','2026-03-28 16:48:03.971782',1247,252,588),('Nandana Sethu',5,'She\'s an amazing and kind hearted person. I had an amazing experience working with Jayanthi Ma\'am! Her talent and professionalism made the shoot stress-free, and the results were stunning. Highly recommend!','2026-03-28 16:48:03.974304',1248,252,588),('vaibhav sudhan',5,'I availed 3 services for my son\'s photoshoot, my daughter\'s photoshoot and our family\'s 60th marriage anniversary celebration. I must say, the experience was truly exceptional.\n\nThe team displayed outstanding professionalism, creativity, and patience throughout each session. Every photograph beautifully captured the emotions and essence of the moment. Their attention to detail, lighting, and composition was remarkable, turning every frame into a lasting memory.\n\nThe final results exceeded our expectations - vibrant, elegant, and timeless. I sincerely appreciate their dedication and artistic excellence. Highly recommended for anyone looking to preserve the special moments with perfection and class.','2026-03-28 16:48:10.903085',1249,253,590),('Kaushik Srinivasan',5,'One of the best places to get your family photoshoots for events like Maternity, New Born baby, Birthdays shoots.\n\nShalini (Prop assistant) and Bala(Photographer) was super patient and helped in getting the photoshoot done as per our ask. They also improvised a lot and were cooperative.\n\nGood props and ambience of studio was excellent.\nThe get ready room was decent equipped with AC.\n\nHighly recommended.','2026-03-28 16:48:10.906690',1250,253,590),('Navin Kumar Ilangovan',5,'We had a wonderful experience with RA Photography for our baby’s one-month and one-year photoshoots. The entire team was extremely courteous, patient, and professional. They made our baby and family feel very comfortable throughout the session.\n\nThe setup, handling of the baby, and overall coordination were excellent.\n\nWe are very satisfied with the service and highly recommend RA Photography for baby photoshoots.','2026-03-28 16:48:10.909830',1251,253,590),('Mano Chandar',5,'We took a photoshoot for our baby Aarush with RA Photography, and it was a wonderful experience. The entire team provided excellent service, and we are extremely happy with the outcome of the photoshoot.\n\nA special thanks to Shalini, who took exceptional care of our baby throughout the session. She patiently set up the themes beautifully and handled our baby with so much care and attention. She ensured the baby remained calm and comfortable during the entire shoot, which truly made a big difference.\n\nThe photographer Ezhumailai, did a perfect job. Every click was captured beautifully, and the quality of the photographs is outstanding. His professionalism and eye for detail are clearly reflected in the final pictures.\n\nAlso, thanks to Vikki for his great support during the session.\n\nOverall, the output of the photoshoot is excellent, and we are very satisfied with their service. Highly recommended!','2026-03-28 16:48:10.912857',1252,253,590),('Tamil Rekha',5,'Second time we came for shoot for RA Photography for our baby... There service is too good... Raw  n edited pics both are too good... Highly recommended','2026-03-28 16:48:10.916250',1253,253,590),('Pavithra Kumar',5,'We recently had our family portraits with them and we were amazed by their work. Mr. Karthik had captured best of our moments in an awesome way. We just love the pictures and had received a lot of positive feedback on the same. A young hardworking beautiful couple creating inspiration out there ❤️','2026-03-28 16:48:18.305693',1254,254,595),('V',5,'We did a shoot with friends last year and Karthik and his team did an amazing job. They were professional, kept everyone calm, listened to ideas and tried to incorporate them and made the whole session very enjoyable. The final output was truly beautiful and everyone who has seen the pics has complimented. They manage to capture the essence we were going for.  Thank you so much!!','2026-03-28 16:48:18.309722',1255,254,595),('Keerthana Suresh',5,'We chose Karthik for our maternity shoot after seeing his work on Instagram. We liked how his pictures spoke raw emotions. And when we did shoot, he made us comfortable though we\'re shy and new to posing. Outputs were amazinggg! We totally loved it. Would highly recommend LK photography. Worth it!','2026-03-28 16:48:18.313408',1256,254,595),('Kiruthika Murugesan',5,'We had our baby milestone photo shoot with LK photography. Huge thanks to Mr Karthik & team for capturing our memories. The pictures are aesthetically pleasing. He was very patient and took beautiful pictures even though my baby was not cooperating all the time. They ensured that we were comfortable during the shoot too. Thank you Mr Karthik and team.','2026-03-28 16:48:18.317103',1257,254,595),('arun kumar',5,'Had a great experience with LK photography team. the entire team was friendly and adjustable with no strict rules on timing, no. of pics, etc. Karthik is highly creative and setup the background, other materials according to our taste, dressings. Our photos turned out very well as expected and delivered on time. Editing and color grading was done exactly as we imagined. I will recommend LK photography team for any events.','2026-03-28 16:48:18.322304',1258,254,595),('Harish Kanaparthy',5,'Small but well equipped for photoshoot or short videos. Good ambience with lots of Props. Good lights at makeup & dressing.','2026-03-28 16:48:21.643660',1259,255,600),('Rtr. Athavan A P',5,'We hired Raval Studio for our wedding in Chennai, and they truly delivered the best candid photography experience. The entire team was so professional and captured every special moment beautifully. They offer affordable packages without compromising on quality. Definitely one of the top wedding photographers in Chennai!✨','2026-03-28 16:48:21.646623',1260,255,600),('Gayu P.B',5,'Such a fantastic experience with Raval Studio! The team is super friendly and patient. I highly recommend them for wedding photography in Chennai. They captured our memories beautifully with a perfect mix of traditional and candid shots. Easily one of the top wedding photographers in Chennai!','2026-03-28 16:48:21.649947',1261,255,600),('Swapna Sreenivasagan',5,'The most professional photographers . They have a beautiful cozy setup studio. Neat and clean place . Their props can be used for almost any type of photoshoot you can think of . They have props for baby and new born shoot as well. Dedicated neat and bright room for dress change. Charges were nominal and team was super flexible to hearing us out and doing more than we expected. Loved their work., the photos they took for us and their suggestions was so useful. Got the most unexpected beautifully edited pictures and the cutest frame from them that will always be special in our hearts and in our home. Thank you team Raval.❤️','2026-03-28 16:48:21.652601',1262,255,600),('samjustin raj',5,'I recently booked Raval studio for a photo shoot, The place was clean, spacious, and equipped with high-quality lighting and backdrops. The staff was helpful and made sure everything ran smoothly. The vibe was creative and relaxed, which made it easy to work. I’ll definitely be coming back again. Highly recommend this place to photographers and content creators!','2026-03-28 16:48:21.655894',1263,255,600),('Muthu Ganesh',5,'Mr. Bala was extremely professional and truly saved the day for us. We contacted him at the very last minute since our celebration was scheduled for the next evening, and he responded immediately without hesitation. Not only that, he arrived at the venue an hour in advance, which clearly shows his commitment and dedication to his work.\n\nThe photos turned out absolutely extraordinary. The clarity and quality were top-notch — even when we zoomed in very closely, there was hardly any pixelation. He mentioned that he would be using a high-end camera, and the results definitely proved it.\n\nWe highly recommend Mr. Bala for any special occasion. In fact, we’ve already decided that we’ll be calling him for all our future celebrations. I completely vouch for him and his work, and I’m confident that anyone who hires him will feel the same way.','2026-03-28 16:48:29.767083',1264,256,602),('Sudha Krishnakumar',5,'On 10th Feb we had our School Reunion.  As suggested by a friend, contacted Click Click Photography for our group photo. He came on time . Very patiently Clicked till he got the best. We had requested him to give the hardcopy by 2pm the same day. He gave it infact before time.\nThank you Balamurugan','2026-03-28 16:48:29.771201',1265,256,602),('Shoba Shekar',5,'I found Click click photography through a random Google search (as I live in Delhi) and decided to go ahead with a photoshoot for a relative in Chennai right after speaking to Mr. Balamurugan. Even though it’s a new venture, his friendly and refreshing way of handling customers really stood out. He patiently guided my relative through the shoot, kept me updated throughout, and made sure all our requirements were taken care of. Very budget-friendly too..would definitely recommend!','2026-03-28 16:48:29.775119',1266,256,602),('R Sankaranarayanan',5,'Bala Murugan is a fantastic photographer who truly brings life to every click! I’ve never come across a professional so dedicated and diligent—he values time and was at the venue sharp at 10, not a second before or after. His commitment, creativity, and eye for detail are unmatched. I strongly recommend Click Click Photography if you want your images to feel alive!','2026-03-28 16:48:29.778812',1267,256,602),('VIJAY MANICKAM',5,'I had a great experience with Click Click Photography. They provided me with excellent photos, and I’m very satisfied with the quality. The photographer approached me in a very professional and friendly manner, which made the entire process comfortable and enjoyable. I truly appreciate their service and would highly recommend them to others looking for quality photography.','2026-03-28 16:48:29.782291',1268,256,602),('Jayaraj Ravi',5,'Our Entire family was so impressed with your album work, awesome work by you guys when it comes to both photography as well as the album, Especially the album was so premium and we are so happy when seeing those photos, Definitely you guys will be our go to photographer\'s for any of our upcoming family events. So impressed with your work bro and thanks alot for your patience in handling the event...🥰❤️','2026-03-28 16:48:33.266047',1269,257,607),('keerthana sudar',5,'I am very happy with his work. He is friendly, patient, and very adjusting with our requests. The photos turned out really beautiful. I will definitely come back to him for all our future function photography.','2026-03-28 16:48:33.269755',1270,257,607),('Bharath Kumar',5,'Hi Saran...\nWe are very satisfied with the album and the output came very well than we expected.\nThanks a lot for bearing with us from pre-wedding shoot till this album delivery. Continue your good job and best wishes.\n\nRegards,\nBharath & Susi','2026-03-28 16:48:33.273740',1271,257,607),('sathya m',5,'Thanks to Engineers photography All the photos are beautiful and capture the moment perfectly All the photos are absolutely stunning and we couldn\'t be happier!','2026-03-28 16:48:33.276821',1272,257,607),('Raghul Karunakaran',5,'One of the best photography centers I\'ve visited—excellent work and highly recommended!','2026-03-28 16:48:33.280432',1273,257,607),('Joydeep Das',5,'Studio 24 Photography (24x7) in Pallavaram did an outstanding job covering our wedding reception, both photoshoot and videography, and we couldn’t have imagined anyone else capturing our big day.\n\nTheir work was truly impressive and remains very special to us.\n​\n📸 Stunning captures – Every key moment, from candid smiles to the grand entry, was captured beautifully with great attention to detail.\n\n🎥 Smooth videography – The reception film was well-edited, emotional, and felt like reliving the event all over again.\n\n🤝 Professional yet friendly – The owner is my school friend, but beyond that, the team was extremely polite, patient, and easy to work with.\n\n🕒 Great punctuality – They were on time, well-prepared, and managed the entire event coverage without any hassle.\n\n🎯 Highly recommended – Truly commendable work; would happily choose Studio 24 Photography again and recommend them to friends and family for any special occasion.','2026-03-28 16:48:38.366753',1274,258,608),('Sanjay Alonely',5,'Best place in Pallavaram for International Passport & Visa photos. I needed photos for a European Schengen visa which has very strict lighting and head-size rules. The photographer was very professional, used high-quality lighting, and ensured the biometric specs were perfect. Being open 24/7 so close to the airport makes it very convenient for travelers. Highly recommended for their technical knowledge of different country requirements.','2026-03-28 16:48:38.370112',1275,258,608),('Ullas Peethambaran Karthikeyan',5,'I have to say amazing service. Let me share my experience yesterday. We need a photo to be stocked in a consent form which needs to be presented in immigration but unfortunately I forgot the photo and we had only 2 goes for the flight. Someone reached this Studio 24 and caked Prabhakar. He was of great help and helped me to get the photo ready in 10 minutes. Just to mention the time that it was around midnight 12.\n\nPrabhakar is amazing and his service during the need time is early appreciated.','2026-03-28 16:48:38.373141',1276,258,608),('Madan Kumar',5,'Excellent Customer Service,Ambience And Most Satisfied Customized Services, Pleasing Hospitality And Very Professional Services Offered To All Classes Of Customers, Highly Recommended Photo Studio for all your Customized Needs. Overall Awesome Professional Services Offered, Rocking, Doing Really Great, Wishing You All The Best I In All Your Future Endeavors Successfully 👍👍👍','2026-03-28 16:48:38.377495',1277,258,608),('Madhan M',5,'Absolutely five stars! This studio is the go-to for birthday photoshoots. The team is incredibly kind and made the whole process smooth and easy. They are so cooperative and really know how to capture joy. Highly recommend!','2026-03-28 16:48:38.380867',1278,258,608),('Vicky R',5,'We had a wonderful experience doing our baby\'s photography at Lights Play Photography Studio. Mr.Alex and his team was gentle and creative, making sure the baby is interacted throughout the session. The photos turned out absolutely beautiful, capturing precious moments with such warmth and detail.\n\nThe studio environment was excellent and make you feel you were in the right place. They have wide range of themes and perfect little props accordingly,\n\nI truly appreciate their professionalism  and the lovely memories they helped to creat for us!!!\n\nAll the best guys and appreciate your innovation and efforts you put for our satisfaction!!!!!!!\n\nThank you Lights Play Photography Studio','2026-03-28 16:48:57.232645',1279,259,610),('sudha PMK',5,'I recently taken some portrait professional photo shots from Lights Play photography and photos came out  well. Photographer Alex is polite with customers and knowledgeable on taking photos and providing necessary advice. Good service and keep it up!! Sudarsan','2026-03-28 16:48:57.235085',1280,259,610),('Thomson Tomi',5,'We booked for my daughter\'s 5th birthday party shoot. To talk about our photography team, Alex and co did an amazing job. Very patient, well organized and good pose suggestions! We are totally impressed by the work and the outcome of the album. Such a pleasure to have them booked for an occasion. I would definitely recommend. Thank you Alex and team!!','2026-03-28 16:48:57.238136',1281,259,610),('karthik sankar',5,'Their work speaks more than anything else. Very nice ambience and good suggestions from Alex and team to get the perfect output. . Very happy with the photos 😊','2026-03-28 16:48:57.240480',1282,259,610),('Gojith Ram S K',5,'Recently visited Lights Play Photography Studio in Pallikaranai, and had a great experience. The studio is clean and well-equipped, with friendly staff who made me feel comfortable throughout the session. The photographer showed genuine creativity and attention to detail, helping suggest poses and ensuring each shot looked natural.\nHighly recommend this studio for anyone looking for memorable, high-quality photography in the area!\".','2026-03-28 16:48:57.242531',1283,259,610),('SELVA KUMAR',5,'Both the Photographer and Videographer are polite and addressed our needs. Quality of the album/photos are great for the money. Post production team responded well to our queries and made the process easier to get our Album. Overall good experience in terms of attentiveness, quality and response. Thanks Yazhini Fotos!','2026-03-28 16:49:01.895828',1284,260,615),('gopi varadharajan',5,'I have too my wife baby shower and my baby birthday here. Good experience. There is problem between with my colleague and photographer. The mistake is done by my colleagues due to some misunderstanding. But the photographer handles were well. They are more professional in their work. I wish to continue your service long run.','2026-03-28 16:49:01.898709',1285,260,615),('John Arc',5,'We held a family get-together on a Sunday night and decided it would be fun to take family pictures. Yazhini Fotos was a fortunate discovery for us while searching for candid photographers. When we asked Boopathi whether the photo session could happen right away, he agreed and his crew did a phenomenal job. The results of the photo shoot, especially considering how short notice it was, It is noteworthy to acknowledge his patience in ensuring an interesting, enjoyable, and unforgettable photo shoot. Many thanks to the group.','2026-03-28 16:49:01.901764',1286,260,615),('CYCLONE TRACKER',5,'\"Yazhini Nizhal Padangal - The Photography Studio provided an exceptional experience! From start to finish, their professionalism and creativity shined. The team\'s attention to detail captured the essence of my moments beautifully. I was impressed by their expertise and dedication. I highly recommend their services for anyone seeking top-notch photography. Thank you for immortalizing my memories so brilliantly!\"','2026-03-28 16:49:01.904360',1287,260,615),('Ravikumar S',5,'I think Yazhini Fotos has some of the best photographs I have ever seen. Thank you very much, Boopathi. He is a very skilled photographer who arrives on time. Extremely satisfied with the photo service offered for the first birthday celebration. To note he travelled all the way form Chennai to Thirunelveli to take our shoot','2026-03-28 16:49:01.907841',1288,260,615),('Praveen Kumar',5,'\"He has been incredibly supportive and helpful throughout our work together. He always guides and helped me at my marriage works , caring like a brother. I truly appreciate his support.\" Apart from a Photographer for me he is a truly god given Brother ❤️🙏🙏🙏🙏Thank u Anna all for your works u cared like a brother I never forget in my life ❤️🙏','2026-03-28 16:49:08.789596',1289,261,617),('Tamizh Mohan',5,'Very professional... Sarath is new to me, I feel that don\'t know how it works, but after I get my soft copy I\'m really satisfied, picture quality was good... awaiting for album let\'s see ...','2026-03-28 16:49:08.793087',1290,261,617),('Senthil V',5,'Sarath did an amazing work in my sisters betrothal. Very friendly and calm. He adjusts well to the situation and. Clicks with patience..  I happened to book him in the last minute but he did not disappoint me. Captured the moments in perfection. Gives lot of energy and ideas for candid photos. I would definitely recommend him for capturing celebrations and events.','2026-03-28 16:49:08.796616',1291,261,617),('sarvani velu',5,'Overall it was very good experience working with him. Photos came out well. Loved each and every picture. All the moments were captured beautifully. Thank you so much for making my day more memorable.','2026-03-28 16:49:08.799856',1292,261,617),('Praveen Kumar',5,'Splendid service. They heeded our choices and in some cases modified them to produce a better-quality outcome. For both pre-wedding and wedding they delivered all the videos, album quickly. Overall I really loved their service.','2026-03-28 16:49:08.803175',1293,261,617),('Bhavani Durai',5,'I had one of the best photoshoot experiences here. The studio setup was clean and well-equipped with great lighting. The photographer made the entire session fun and relaxed, helping me pose confidently. The edits were natural and beautifully done. Pricing was also very reasonable for the quality they offer. Truly a 5-star experience!','2026-03-28 16:49:12.178181',1294,262,620),('MR Venkatesh',5,'The album design and cinematic wedding video by Seasonz Photography were absolutely stunning. Every detail was handled with perfection. We are extremely satisfied and would highly recommend them to anyone looking for quality wedding photography.”','2026-03-28 16:49:12.181239',1295,262,620),('NS KARUNYAN',5,'I had a very positive experience overall. From start to finish, everything exceeded my expectations. The level of service was outstanding, and I felt well taken care of throughout the entire process. Every detail was thoughtfully handled, making my time enjoyable and hassle-free. I truly appreciated the effort that went into making it a memorable experience. experience overall. From start to finish, everything exceeded my expectations. The level of service was outstanding, and I felt well taken care of throughout the entire process. Every detail was thoughtfully handled, making my time enjoyable and hassle-free. I truly appreciated the effort that went into making it a memorable experience.','2026-03-28 16:49:12.184631',1296,262,620),('M JOTHI',5,'Such a lovely studio! The staff made me feel comfortable right from the moment I walked in. They were friendly, creative, and paid attention to every little detail. The pictures turned out amazing — natural, bright, and full of life. I’m definitely coming back!','2026-03-28 16:49:12.187337',1297,262,620),('Harini Cutie',5,'I had a wonderful experience at seasonz photo studio. The photographers were highly skilled, understood exactly what I wanted, and guided me with perfect poses and lighting. The final edited photos were stunning and delivered on time. Excellent service from start to finish!','2026-03-28 16:49:12.190641',1298,262,620),('Karthickprabha 11',5,'I recently visited SIVASAKTHI STUDIOS and was blown away by the level of customer service. The staff was incredibly attentive and made sure all my needs were met. The work was very well done. Loved having you in today.Thank You For The team \" Sivasakthi Photography\"','2026-03-28 16:49:24.386730',1299,263,621),('Iman R',5,'Recently my salon shop board work was completed by their team @mitra_photography & sivasakthi photography. They perfectly designed the salon name board, standing board foam sheet and also gave the photoz  with frame. Quality work, neat finishing and on time delivery. I really liked their service. Thank you team..!❤️‍🔥🌟','2026-03-28 16:49:24.390134',1300,263,621),('jothi',5,'I’ve been a regular customer of Sivasakthi Photography, and they have never failed to impress me. They always arrive on time and deliver photos and videos promptly without any delays. I choose them for all my personal and professional events because of their consistent quality and reliability. The whole team is extremely supportive, friendly, and cooperative. Highly recommended!','2026-03-28 16:49:24.393528',1301,263,621),('Mohana Priya',5,'The overall experience with them was very good. We were very happy with the pictures and service. One of the budget friendly shop in the surroundings.','2026-03-28 16:49:24.397055',1302,263,621),('Shruthi Sri',5,'Mathi sir  and his team from Sivasakthi Photography did an amazing job for my sister  photo shoots They understood exactly what I wanted and guide smoothly from start to finish. The photos, videos, and overall delivery were excellent.\n\nThank you mathi sir ♥️and team - really appreciate your work All the best and keep growing....👍','2026-03-28 16:49:24.400229',1303,263,621),('Susha Sanjiv',5,'Click Factory Photography team 👍👍\nI want to express my sincere appreciation for Mathew and his team. Mathew is one of the most professional and productive people I have ever met! His exceptional leadership and support throughout our daughter’s wedding at the Hyatt Regency made a huge difference.\n\nSince we are in USA .. I had to call several  times  to  arrange wedding arrangements  ..Mathew would answer my calls and messages within the hour. Mathew was always helpful, clear, and explained everything perfectly.  Quality albums were delivered in just 10 days, and the video was perfect as well.\n\nAfter the wedding, Alexi, the CRM Post-Production Head, was extremely supportive and responded promptly to all my calls and messages.\n\nClick Factory Photography team has truly captured our special occasion perfectly. We are very thankful to them!','2026-03-28 16:49:32.280290',1304,264,622),('thiru veeramanigandan',5,'We had the most wonderful experience with this fabulous photography team. From start to finish, they were professional, friendly, and incredibly talented. They didn’t just take photos — they captured emotions, candid smiles, and every precious detail perfectly.\n\nThe quality of the pictures was stunning, and their editing style was elegant and natural. They made everyone feel relaxed, which truly shows in the photos. We couldn’t have asked for a better team to capture our special moments. Highly, highly recommended!\n\nChoosing this photography team was the best decision we made. They turned our beautiful memories into timeless treasures. Every photo tells a story, every frame holds emotion. Their passion and dedication truly shine through their work. Thank you for making our moments unforgettable!\nWe will definitely book click factory photography team for our upcoming occasions❤️\nThank you brooos 🫂for capturing our special moment🥰','2026-03-28 16:49:32.283533',1305,264,622),('Vijay Surya',5,'The team at Click Factory Photography was amazing! They captured every special moment of our event beautifully.\nWe are so happy with our photos from Click Factory Photography. The quality and attention to detail are outstanding.\nFrom start to finish, the experience with Click Factory Photography was professional and enjoyable. Highly recommend their services!\nThe photographers were friendly, creative, and made us feel comfortable throughout the entire shoot.\nThank you, Click Factory Photography, for the stunning photos we will cherish forever!','2026-03-28 16:49:32.286619',1306,264,622),('HARIHARAN R',5,'We booked Clickfactory Photography for my sister’s wedding, and they delivered exactly what they promised—no drama, no excuses, just solid work.\n\nLokesh and his team were professional, punctual, and knew what they were doing from start to finish. They captured all the key moments without being intrusive, handled the crowd well, and stayed focused throughout the events.\n\nCandid shots were especially good and felt natural, not forced. The team coordination was smooth, which matters a lot during a busy wedding schedule','2026-03-28 16:49:32.290856',1307,264,622),('Alice',5,'Had a great experience with Click factory photography team!\n\nIt’s one of the best wedding decision ever…The team made us feel comfortable. They captured the moments exactly the way we dreamed of. They made our wedding memorable & every picture feels so natural…Their patience, creativity & eye for detail for every shot are truly magical….Thank you Click Factory photography team, will cherish them forever….✨','2026-03-28 16:49:32.294207',1308,264,622),('Ramya Prabha',5,'One can really trust their team for quality work and on time delivery! I had an amazing experience with RG photography and will continue to contact them for any event in our family.','2026-03-28 16:49:35.299443',1309,265,624),('Kousalya T',5,'We loved working with Nivash and his team.  From our pre-wedding shoot till the wedding day, they made us feel so comfortable and captured everything perfectly. The photos are stunning. The final albums are gorgeous. We highly recommend them.','2026-03-28 16:49:35.302652',1310,265,624),('Siva K',5,'R G Photography – Nivash & Team\n\nI cannot thank R G Photography – Nivash & Team enough for capturing the most precious moments of our lives so beautifully! From our wedding and reception to our baby shoot, they have been with us every step of the way, turning our memories into timeless treasures.\n\nNivash and his team are not just photographers; they are true artists with an incredible passion for their work. Their patience, dedication, and hard work are evident in every shot they take. No matter the situation, they always maintain a polite and friendly attitude, making us feel comfortable and at ease in front of the camera. Their smiling faces and helping nature created a joyful atmosphere, ensuring every session was a fun and memorable experience.\n\nWhat sets them apart is their eye for detail and commitment to perfection. They never rush through the process but instead take the time to capture the perfect angles, lighting, and emotions, ensuring every photograph tells a beautiful story.\n\nIf you’re looking for a team that truly cares about your special moments as much as you do, R G Photography – Nivash & Team is the best choice! Highly recommended for anyone who wants stunning photography with a personal touch.','2026-03-28 16:49:35.305627',1311,265,624),('Janani Sivaram',5,'Selecting [RG photography] for our wedding photography was one of the best decisions we made. Their professionalism, passion, flexibility and exceptional talent culminated in a flawless experience from start to finish. We wholeheartedly recommend [RG] to anyone seeking a skilled wedding photographer who can transform beautiful moments into lifelong memories. The team RG is very friendly and listens to our needs and captures in the way which we want. They promptly answered all our queries and carefully listened to any specific requests we had. The final album which we got was flawless and extraordinary and we are speechless! Thanks RG for making our wedding like the way we imagined ❤️!','2026-03-28 16:49:35.308839',1312,265,624),('Sneha M',5,'They were our photographers for our wedding, reception, Sangeet and photo shoot. Loved their work and would suggest for any event or shoots. Team was very co-operative and enthusiastic during the shoots, felt comfortable during the entire process. Output of the photos and album was fantastic, everyone in our family and friends loved it. Thank you for capturing our memorable moments in the most beautiful way','2026-03-28 16:49:35.312091',1313,265,624),('Arul isai Udhaya Sivaneri',5,'Had a great experience.We came for our baby photo shoot... Our photographer Mr. Vasanth was really friendly, comfortable and his patience was remarkable. We enjoyed the experience and loved the photos. Thank you 👍','2026-03-28 16:49:43.021267',1314,266,625),('anand srinivas',5,'\"Had an amazing experience at [Magic lens studio ] yesterday! The photographer captured our family moments beautifully, and the lighting was perfect. The team was professional, friendly, and made us feel comfortable throughout the shoot. We loved the final photos and can\'t wait to frame them. Highly recommend [magic lens studio ] for your photography needs! 📸❤️\"\n\nexceeded our expectations! The photographer was talented, creative, and attentive to detail.','2026-03-28 16:49:43.025113',1315,266,625),('kirthika logu',4,'The staff really were patience when my baby didn\'t cooperate had a good experience when MagicLens Studio','2026-03-28 16:49:43.028934',1316,266,625),('Anuradha Bhavani Subbiah',5,'Had a wonderful and a happy experience for our 1 year old baby birthday photoshoot. PC by Mr. Vasanth. He was very patient and helpful during the photoshoot. Family pics and theme photoshoot turned out to be great.','2026-03-28 16:49:43.033299',1317,266,625),('Bhavani Narmadha',5,'We went for Maternity Photoshoot at MagicLens Studio. Pics came out more than our expectation. We feel so glad after seeing our Beautiful pictures. Lot of variations and creativity in pics. You will definitely feel the worth for your Money!! If you wish to get adorable and valuable pictures, you can blindly go here. I highly recommend to all! Thanks a lot, Mr.Sivam! You gave attractive memorable picuturs for us!','2026-03-28 16:49:43.036698',1318,266,625),('Ramesh S',5,'I had an urgent baby photoshoot to be done because we had planned the tonsure and ear-piercing ceremony the next day. I came across PictureandPictures Photography online and contacted them for a home photoshoot. Even though they already had other plans, they agreed to help on short notice and arrived on time.\n\nThe photoshoot went really well — the pictures turned out beautiful! The pricing is also very affordable, and the team was extremely cooperative and friendly.\n\nThank you to the entire team for supporting us last minute and capturing such lovely moments. Highly recommended!','2026-03-28 16:49:47.744728',1319,267,630),('Jaga Magadhira',5,'Thanks for Jagan to capture wonderful memories☺️ so beautifully your photography skills highly recommend [Picture and pictures] to anyone looking for a talented and reliable photographer. Can\'t wait to work with them again!\"\n\n*Pros:*\n- Excellent communication and planning\n- Friendly and professional demeanor\n- Creative and high-quality photos\n- Quick turnaround time for receiving photos\n\n*Cons:* None!','2026-03-28 16:49:47.747928',1320,267,630),('Surana Parveen',5,'Jagan anna becomes part of our family😊he builds the relationship very friendly apart from his profession. He has top level of patience towards his passion., he waits for the happy moment to freeze🤩,  exceptional photography, I admire the technical skill and attention to detail in your photos, it\'s really impressive, our holl family really very satisfied with his job, we eagar to work with u again, I Heartfully recommend him for everyone, wishing u all the best jagan anna👍i hope u have a great future, keep working with as family 😊tqq','2026-03-28 16:49:47.751072',1321,267,630),('Sundareshwaran sivakumar',5,'We are incredibly grateful to have had Jaganathan and his team capture the most important day of our lives. From the very beginning, they were professional, creative, and deeply passionate about their work.\n\nThe quality of the wedding album is outstanding — every moment, from the tiniest details to the big emotions, was beautifully documented. The candid shots were especially brilliant, bringing back memories in the most natural way. The color tones, clarity, and composition show the photographer’s skill and artistic eye.\n\nWhat we appreciated most was their calm and friendly nature. Even in the chaos of wedding rituals, they made us feel comfortable and never intrusive.\n\nThank you for making our memories timeless. Highly recommended for anyone looking for genuine and heartfelt wedding photography.','2026-03-28 16:49:47.754057',1322,267,630),('Pravalika D',5,'Thank You soo munch….🙏\n\nWe saw the album and the videos as well. Output is really awesome. Picture quality and the editing are also too good.','2026-03-28 16:49:47.757369',1323,267,630),('Vasan Arul',5,'Nishanth and his team, including but not limited to Gokul and Ambrish, did such a wonderful job capturing ceremony after ceremony for us during our wedding week. Their professionalism was only matched by their kindness and care throughout the process and we could not have asked for a better group of people to be there for us for an event that meant so much to myself and my family.\n\nPlease consider them for your wedding or engagement shoots, they are truly the cream of the crop.','2026-03-28 16:49:55.097577',1324,268,632),('Lasya Karthik',5,'The absolute best there is! Incredibly talented and fun team to work with and they bring the loveliest positive energy. Worked with them for my engagement and wedding both, and would book them again in a heartbeat. We can\'t stop looking at our albums (which the team turned around in an insane 3 days after our event!)','2026-03-28 16:49:55.099323',1325,268,632),('prathyusha t',5,'It was absolutely fantastic working with the team. I’m not kidding, we’re sad it’s all over today. You guys made us feel super comfortable and we’re extremely patient with us, so thank you so much for that! It felt like we were hanging out with our friends 😄\nYou guys are an excellent team and I’m so glad we got to work together!♥️\nHopefully, we get to meet again sometime :)\n\nAnd thank you so much, Amar, for making it to the wedding and sangeet! And, you got yourself an A class team! ✨\n\nTake care you guys! can’t wait for the pictures!!♥️','2026-03-28 16:49:55.101745',1326,268,632),('Uday Shenkar',5,'I recently had the pleasure of a photoshoot with Amar, and it was an experience beyond words. Amar\'s ability to create a comfortable and enjoyable atmosphere made the entire shoot feel like a delightful collaboration rather than work. His creative insights and generous spirit enriched the artistic quality of each photograph. With Amar, it’s not just about capturing images; it’s a continuous journey of learning and mutual inspiration. His humility and artistic synergy are evident in every shot, turning them into lasting memories. If you\'re looking for a photographer who can truly resonate with you and bring out the best in your moments, Amar is the one. His team\'s work is exceptional, and I highly recommend them for anyone seeking quality and creativity.','2026-03-28 16:49:55.104203',1327,268,632),('Mahanth Krishna',5,'One of the best decisions we took for our big day was choosing Studio A. Their pictures just show how much they love their work and we really appreciate the team’s patience and effort ❤️\nThe team is a bunch of fun and friendly people who are very punctual, patient and attentive.\n\nWe didn’t have any expectations on how we wanted the pictures to be but even if we had expectations, they would have done much better than that 🥰\n\nWe trusted them for freezing our beautiful moments and now we have shots that we can cherish for lifetime.\n\nWe are super happy about the fast delivery of photos and the wedding album :D','2026-03-28 16:49:55.106650',1328,268,632),('Mani Gandan',5,'VS Photography captured our moments beautifully with their professional and creative approach. Their team was friendly and the final results exceeded our expectations—highly recommended for any special occasion!','2026-03-28 16:50:02.306436',1329,269,637),('Bhavashri R',5,'I came across VS Photography on Google and decided to hire them for my wedding. It was the best decision! The photos are excellent, and I am very satisfied with their professionalism and talent.😍Thank you siva sir.👌','2026-03-28 16:50:02.308299',1330,269,637),('Ken Takakura',5,'VS Photography delivered exceptional quality with great attention to detail. The creativity, lighting, and editing were absolutely professional. The entire experience was smooth and comfortable. Highly recommended for anyone looking for premium photography services.🤩👍🏻','2026-03-28 16:50:02.310024',1331,269,637),('Karthi L',5,'We hired VS Photography for our wedding and couldn\'t be happier. The team was punctual, creative, and very professional throughout the event. They captured every special moment perfectly. If you want a stress-free experience and amazing memories, go with them!\"❣️','2026-03-28 16:50:02.311340',1332,269,637),('Vidya Sekar',5,'Photography Siva is a master of their craft! We hired them to capture our engagement ceremony and they absolutely nailed it! Siva\'s attention to detail, creativity,were top-notch. They made everyone feel super comfortable in front of the camera, and the photos are just stunning. The way they captured the essence of our special day is just incredible. If you\'re looking for a photographer who truly understands the moment and delivers exceptional results, look no further! Highly recommend Photography Siva.','2026-03-28 16:50:02.312873',1333,269,637),('Mohanraja Selladurai',5,'Excellent experience with Foto World, Chennai Selaiyur/Tambaram.\nWe recently used Foto World’s services to create our holiday photo albums, and we couldn’t be happier with the results. The entire team was highly professional, talented, and courteous from start to finish. The quality of work was outstanding, and everything was delivered on time, exactly as promised. Quick turnaround as we had only 3 days for for uk flights after holiday.\nA special mention to the designers Mani and Julie—they were truly exceptional. Their creativity, attention to detail, and patience in incorporating our feedback made a huge difference to the final albums.\nThe owner was extremely friendly and approachable, making us feel comfortable throughout the process. The receptionist Punitha also deserves appreciation for always greeting us with a smile and patiently responding to our many queries.\nOverall, Foto World exceeded our expectations in terms of service, quality, and professionalism. Highly recommended for anyone looking to create beautiful, high-quality photo albums! 📸✨','2026-03-28 16:50:11.937124',1334,270,642),('steward gracian',5,'Good photo studio for various photo needs.\n\nI visited for a photo frame. They have ready made frames and print quality is good.\n\nI got 10*12 frame for Rs.770\n\nPros:\n\n✅ Decent collection of Photo frames and gift items\n\n✅ Supportive and helpful staff\n\n✅ Very quick turnaround time. I got my frame in less than 3 hours\n\n✅ Cost is okay.\n\nCons:\n\n❓Inaccessible as it is in the first floor\n\nPros >> Cons','2026-03-28 16:50:11.941069',1335,270,642),('Sathya Sadhu',5,'Very helpful and fantastic work. Above all, very thorough and professional. One of the posters I had done had a small glitch which I might not have noticed until I would have looked close. But they proactively mentioned the issue and offered to reprint the image. Now that’s what I call as being professional and running a honest business. Will come back for more work in the future!','2026-03-28 16:50:11.943977',1336,270,642),('Ravi Sankar Ramasamy',5,'Very professional photo studio with great attention to detail. The photographer and all staff understood our requirements clearly and delivered high-quality photos. Smooth experience from start to finish. Highly recommended. Keep it up!','2026-03-28 16:50:11.947088',1337,270,642),('Aravind',5,'I took a passport-size photo in this shop. I was in a hurry to submit it, and on the way I lost it because it slipped from my pocket.\n\nI came back to the shop and explained everything. They gave me another copy and asked for only half the price.\nGood shop, polite staff — I totally recommend it.','2026-03-28 16:50:11.950200',1338,270,642),('LAVANYA RAMESH',5,'Had a very pleasant experience with this photography team. The photos are really good, with nice angles and natural editing. The album quality is excellent, and the finishing looks premium. My family liked the final output very much. Overall, we are happy with their work and the service provided♥️✨️','2026-03-28 16:50:20.549161',1339,271,647),('Jaya sri',5,'They captured my engagement photos so beautifully.\nEvery moment was natural and turned into unforgettable memories ✨📸\nGreat response, budget-friendly photography, and a truly professional team. The album also looks amazing—I absolutely loved it. Thank you so much for making our special day even more memorable ❤️','2026-03-28 16:50:20.552655',1340,271,647),('Manikandan Marimuthu',5,'We recently received the photo album for my Dhasvika\'s (my brother\'s daughter) birthday party, and it is truly outstanding! The quality is superb—the colors are vibrant, the layout is professional, and the album itself feels durable and high-end. They managed to capture the atmosphere and all the special moments so well. We are beyond happy with the result. A fantastic job and a wonderful keepsake. Thank you to the team for their amazing work!\".......','2026-03-28 16:50:20.556378',1341,271,647),('thanuja bysani',5,'Life Lights Photography did an awesome job for our baby’s naming ceremony! The album was beautifully made, with every picture capturing the joy and special moments of the day. It’s something we’ll cherish forever.\n\nCommunication was smooth and complimentary throughout, which made the whole experience easy and pleasant. The calendar you gifted was such a thoughtful touch — very nice and memorable.\n\nThank you for making our naming ceremony even more special with your wonderful work. 💖📸','2026-03-28 16:50:20.560337',1342,271,647),('Chandu',5,'Hello, Life Lights Photography!\n\nJust checked out the photos from the bridal shoot—wow, they turned out amazing! You really nailed the vibe. The bride looks gorgeous, and the lighting and tones are super soft and dreamy, perfect for the theme.\n\nLoved the natural poses and how everything just flowed so nicely. Great job with the setting too—it all came together beautifully.\n\nCan’t wait to see more of your work!','2026-03-28 16:50:20.563975',1343,271,647),('Abinash William Marcus',5,'One of the best in understanding client needs and delivery. Sathish the MD always comes to the venue to ensure everything is set on the ground. My family loved the team and the way they planned to ensure everything is captured. Good job.','2026-03-28 16:50:23.894199',1344,272,652),('christ school',5,'Service was very good they took out sports day function and it came out very well ... We are very satisfied.. Sathish was so co-operative and friendly..','2026-03-28 16:50:23.897223',1345,272,652),('Radha Babu',5,'We recently had our pre wedding shoot done by Satzz photography , and despite our initial confusion about the venue,timings, Sathish was incredibly friendly and adaptable. He made the entire plan flexible to suit our comfort. Such a dedicated and talented person with creative ideas and tremendous efforts. During the shoot, we were unsure about the poses but his suggestions were fantastic. Although we were a bit shy at first, we soon felt completely at ease, as if he were a friend rather than an outsider. The whole experience was wonderful and the pictures turned out beautifully, with an aesthetic charm. After the shoot, Sathish took the initiative to edit some photos, adding features we didn’t even know were possible. Thank you, Sathish, for this amazing experience, which has become a cherished memory for us.','2026-03-28 16:50:23.900466',1346,272,652),('Arjun S',5,'Sathish is an exceptional person, exuding calmness and professionalism throughout the entire process. We recently had the pleasure of doing our pre-wedding shoot with him, and from a customer’s perspective, it was a truly wonderful experience. As someone who’s not very confident when it comes to posing for photos, Sathish was incredibly helpful, guiding us through the entire session and ensuring that we were always at ease. His patient and approachable nature made us feel comfortable, and his expertise shone through in every shot.\n\nWe were thrilled with how the photos turned out, and his creative direction added a unique touch to the shoot. Without a doubt, I would highly recommend Sathish to my friends and family. He goes above and beyond to make the experience enjoyable and memorable.\n\n#Greatwork #Dedicated.','2026-03-28 16:50:23.903835',1347,272,652),('Imran roshan',5,'The best and the most happiest team that i have worked with. Whole team helped us with the props and the ideas and obviously the talented photographer Mr. Satish captured our moments so beautifully. I would highly recommend this team to any one who\'s looking to capture their moments','2026-03-28 16:50:23.906797',1348,272,652),('Syed Mazhar',5,'Thank you for capturing the joy and happiness in each picture. We are beyond grateful for your talent and passion. The photographs you took have exceeded our expectations, and we will cherish them forever. Thank you for capturing the raw emotions and candid moments in such a beautiful way.','2026-03-28 16:50:27.119959',1349,273,653),('Anu priya',5,'One of the best photographer I ever seen. He was patient, helpful and Photo quality was excellent and perfect. Highly recommend!!!. Over all amazing experience','2026-03-28 16:50:27.122099',1350,273,653),('geetha basker',5,'My engagement album done by appu anna....thank u so much anna very very happy so impressive such a wonderful moments captured by u is ultimate to remember....once again thank u anna no words to explain that album did happiness....next waiting to see marriage album done by u only','2026-03-28 16:50:27.125021',1351,273,653),('gowthami parthiban',5,'Through Instagram, I became acquainted with Mitra Photography and was quite captivated by his photographs. Kiruba and his group are incredibly helpful and competent. The photos were of very high quality. Kiruba was very approachable and would highly recommend Mitra Photography','2026-03-28 16:50:27.128325',1352,273,653),('Madhu Gunasekaran',5,'Such a wonderful photographer I have met 😊😊😊.I like the way he treated the clients .....he clicked the photos wonderful 😊👍👍👍👍 congratulations Mitra photography','2026-03-28 16:50:27.131425',1353,273,653),('Sathish Kumar',5,'Our baby shower photoshoot done by Bright Dreams Studio was good, and the overall output met our expectations. The pricing is affordable and reasonable for the quality delivered. One thing to keep in mind is to select the photos on time to avoid any delays in delivery. Also, it’s better to plan the timing properly on the day of the occasion to ensure everything goes smoothly. Overall, a good experience.','2026-03-28 16:50:31.183508',1354,274,654),('rahul Kumar',5,'Just got back from an amazing photo shoot and I\'m absolutely blown away by the results! The photographer was super professional, creative, and made me feel totally at ease in front of the camera. The whole experience was so much fun and the final pics are just stunning. Highly recommend! 😍\"','2026-03-28 16:50:31.187604',1355,274,654),('kavitha N',5,'We have done our baby photoshoot in bright dreams really very happy to see the final output in the album and photos are fabulous 👌 Team cooperate very well and they have did excellent work thank you so much ji...really very happy 😊','2026-03-28 16:50:31.191187',1356,274,654),('Tamilselvi P',5,'Awesome photography.babyshoot was really good.the photographers  were so polite and taking the baby photos with much patience.it was a great experience with bright dream studios.thankyou BDS for making my hrithvi\'s 1st birthday more memorable.🩷🩷🩷','2026-03-28 16:50:31.194462',1357,274,654),('Jenina Jayaseelan',5,'We booked in events BDS for our wedding their process of photography and videography each and everything was value for money,The album work was so good  we got is slight delay due to some issue because we not directly booked them we booked them by events ,but the work and all the edit was extraordinary..The work they have done on our post wedding outdoor photoshoot result came so fabulous.🤩\nThanks for Bright Dream Studio\nFor the wonderful work on our wedding  day Everyone directly call and book them to capture your wonderful movement and memories on your special day.🤍','2026-03-28 16:50:31.197398',1358,274,654),('Sabeetha Dhamodharan',5,'I had an amazing experience at this photo shop! The quality of the photos exceeded my expectations, with sharp details and vibrant colors. The staff were extremely professional, patient, and friendly, making the whole process smooth and enjoyable. I was pleasantly surprised by how reasonable the prices were, especially for such high-quality work. They truly prioritize customer satisfaction and deliver excellent value for money. Whether you need photos for personal or professional purposes, this is the place to go. Highly recommended and will definitely return for future needs','2026-03-28 16:50:38.698636',1359,275,655),('jananthiya saravana kumaar',5,'I had a wonderful experience with RR Photography! Their team is very professional, friendly, and creative. The quality of the photos was excellent, with great attention to detail and perfect lighting. They captured every moment beautifully and made the entire process smooth and enjoyable. Highly recommended for anyone looking for high-quality photography services!','2026-03-28 16:50:38.701992',1360,275,655),('MARUTHAYE A',5,'Great work service. They have given the good frame works.Its worthy for the money . They delivered the products on time with complete gift package.I suggest RR photography for everyone for your memorable collections😊✨','2026-03-28 16:50:38.705270',1361,275,655),('Pʀᴀʙʜᴜ Gᴀᴍɪɴɢ_YT',5,'Album is awesome with various variety of sheets like glitter maatt halogram and everything 👍🏻👍🏻👍🏻','2026-03-28 16:50:38.708804',1362,275,655),('Dylan Charles',5,'Excellent service. Rakesh brother was very polite and got the photos quickly !!!','2026-03-28 16:50:38.711983',1363,275,655),('Aravinth Manoharan',5,'Thilak and his team were punctual and dedicated. They were friendly, polite, and committed throughout. Thilak accommodated all editing requests perfectly. The reception album was unique and exceeded expectations. Surprises added extra delight. Despite competitive pricing, quality is assured. Overall, Click Moments Studio processed our family memories exceptionally','2026-03-28 16:50:42.760441',1364,276,660),('Mahaesh Sreenivasan',5,'I would like to start this review by thanking Thilak bro. From the reception day to album delivery very punctual and dedicated in his work.\n\nFirstly he and his team were very friendly on the day of reception, very polite in taking photos in guests phone. Very committed to the last moments until the stage lights are switched off.\n\nSecondly coming to album preview and editing in which he obliged to all my requests and did it perfectly.\n\nLastly the reception album is very unique enjoyed by my whole family and extremely satisfied. Some images had a golden border in it which stands out ❤️\napart from other images. Never expected such a beautiful album, it\'s beyond my expectations and not to miss the two surprises which we\'re lovely ❤️❤️\n\nComing to price point, they have various packages according to our needs, we can choose from it. Don\'t be surprised if the price point is lower than other competitors, but quality is assured.\n\nI\'ll conclude my review by thanking Thilak bro and Click moments Studio for processing all the memories of our family in an exceptional manner. Thanks a lot bro ❤️','2026-03-28 16:50:42.763949',1365,276,660),('logesh kumar',5,'I have my own experience with this studio on providing them the wedding photography for my sister.\nQuality and professional wise they are awesome.\nYou can ahead with them by having full confidence with their work of ethics. Reasonable price with high standard work.','2026-03-28 16:50:42.767821',1366,276,660),('S.HARI KISHORE',5,'Mr.Thilak from clock moments was very humble and showcased very good photographic skill and took great creative photos of our maternity photo shoot and seemandham function. The quality of the photo album was great. The touch work on the selected photos was great . The overall experience we had with click moments was great . I highly recommend click moments to others who are looking for photo coverage for their functions or photo shoots.','2026-03-28 16:50:42.770946',1367,276,660),('Ashik Ali',5,'I am extremely pleased with Thilak\'s outstanding work at my marriage and reception functions. His dedication and creativity in capturing both photos and videos added a special touch to the moments. Thilak\'s attention to detail and commitment to delivering quality results were truly commendable. I highly appreciate his efforts in creating lasting memories of our special day. I wholeheartedly recommend Thilak for his exceptional photography and videography services.','2026-03-28 16:50:42.774157',1368,276,660),('S.hemalatha',5,'Nice work and great patience throughout.They captured every movement beautifully, all with a wonderful smile.As far as I know, the budget is very affordable, and I would like to recomend to my family and friends.','2026-03-28 16:50:53.152061',1369,277,661),('Kanmani Kumaran',5,'Am very very so happy to be a one of the customer... SK Photography made our little champ birthday more memorable with best best photography and album design with affordable price!!! i am damn sure to refer this guy  to my all friends for their event tooo... He is a very friendly person also!!! Am really very satisfied in his work... Thanks bro...😍👍','2026-03-28 16:50:53.156002',1370,277,661),('Amaldev P',5,'I recently visited SK Photography and had a great experience. The photos they took were really nice and of high quality. Their service was excellent, and the staff were kind and professional. What stood out to me was their dedication — they work 24 hours! I showed up at 6 AM while they were still resting, but they still welcomed me and helped me a lot. Plus, their prices are very affordable. Great service, great people, and great photos. Highly recommended!','2026-03-28 16:50:53.160428',1371,277,661),('Bavi',5,'Really good person. Helped me in need with sudden requirement for passport size photo.','2026-03-28 16:50:53.163918',1372,277,661),('Syed Ibtisam',5,'Amazing service…Helped me when all the shops were closed on Sunday…-','2026-03-28 16:50:53.167284',1373,277,661),('Aru Mugam',5,'I recommended D panda studio 100 percent. Vera level Photos, Album Designs & Frame work in High Quality with Low Price. Especially  Photography is Top Notch. He is an amazing photographer and energetic, engaging and lot of fun and super creative and truly professional in his field.\nD panda Studio Urapakkam made us feel very happy......! with their Work of Album & Frame Designs.\n\nReally I\'m Not Expect This Much\n\nAbsolutely Best and amazing\n\n! Thank You','2026-03-28 16:51:00.148594',1374,278,666),('Pradeep B',5,'Really Good Service he\'s done my Engagement and Marriage,My daughter 1st B\'day and my Family Function Event\'s also','2026-03-28 16:51:00.151707',1375,278,666),('Peter Vinodh',5,'Honestly, I never expected my wedding album to be designed so beautifully! Amazing work, team. And the fact that it’s so affordable and top quality – truly impressive. Keep up the great work. Thank you!\"','2026-03-28 16:51:00.155269',1376,278,666),('aki akima',5,'Our son’s photoshoot turned into a beautiful experience thanks to this wonderful photographer. His kindness, friendliness, and talent made such an impression on us that he now feels like a member of our family. We would love to have him be a part of all our future celebrations.🥰','2026-03-28 16:51:00.158652',1377,278,666),('Euniya Ajith',5,'\"Amazing Studio Experience!\"\nI had a wonderful experience with this studio! The photographers and staff were incredibly nice, friendly, and professional. Their service truly exceeded my expectations, and the pricing was very reasonable. I was thoroughly impressed with the entire experience and will definitely be returning again and again. Highly recommended!','2026-03-28 16:51:00.162001',1378,278,666),('Lakshmipriya Praveen Kumar',5,'We had a wonderful experience with Zero Watts Photography right from the events until the final album delivery. We’re truly happy with the outcome. The team has done an excellent job capturing every special moment so naturally and beautifully. The quality of the photos and album finishing is impressive, and everything was delivered as promised.\n\nThe team’s dedication really stood out — they even adjusted and compromised on their timely meals just to make sure they didn’t miss any important moments. They were always keen on capturing more candid shots and couple pictures in between events, ensuring we had plenty of beautiful memories to perfectly fill the album. That extra effort truly shows in the final output.\n\nA special thanks to Abhinaya for her constant support and smooth coordination throughout the process. She was patient during photo selection, responsive to our queries, and ensured timely delivery.\n\nOverall, a professional and reliable team. Highly recommended! ⭐⭐⭐⭐⭐','2026-03-28 16:51:04.960737',1379,279,671),('Jayasheela J',5,'Absolutely loved working with Zero Watts! They were very friendly, patient, and made the entire shoot comfortable and enjoyable. The photos came out beautiful with great attention to detail and natural edits. Truly captured the moments perfectly. Highly recommended! ✨📸','2026-03-28 16:51:04.965223',1380,279,671),('Sanjana Srinath',4,'Had an amazing experience with Zero Watts. Being a first time customer with them, everything was done really well, from initial coordination to handing over the deliverables in time. Photography team arrived early and did a good job covering the event. Can slightly improve on traditional videography but overall, the job was very well done and definitely worth the price paid for. Album had come out very beautiful, thanks to Mr. Karthick, candid videography was also really nicely taken by Mr. Mani.\n\nSpecial mention to CRM Hari Krishnan, who coordinated everything wonderfully. I had no stress on having to go back to them with doubts or clarifications at all, because he handled every single thing with a lot of warmth and grace, and gave immediate resolutions, making our first time customer experience memorable. Will be definitely opting for their services again!','2026-03-28 16:51:04.969673',1381,279,671),('Sankari J',5,'The whole process was so smooth! From the initial discussions to the date of wedding - they were so prompt in helping us with questions/ any queries and on the day of the event - as a bride I was so blank - but the photographers ensured we did click a lot of photos and kept saying it’s all one time memory!!\nIn addition our pre wedding shoot was such a great memory - it was captured by Jackson and Mukesh ; thy literally came to the spot with so much ideas ; props all done for us with lot of enthusiasm!!\nMain event was handled by Kamalesh , Ram , ,Billa , Nithin , sharan. They were so supportive and friendly!!\n\nThanks to Abhinaya who’s my CR who quite literally contacted me right after the wedding and ensured to be in contact with me until I received my final deliverables!!\nThis whole team was such a blessing on my big day!! Strongly recommend them❤️❤️❤️❤️❤️','2026-03-28 16:51:04.972980',1382,279,671),('Preethi Raju',5,'It was a wonderful experience to work with them for my wedding. It was a super duper fun experience and totally satisfied with their work. They have an excellent photography team, editing part was amazing and their customer support is really impressive and im thankful to each one of you photographers skills, editor and who are all worked behind. Thank you so much once again\n\nAnd there are many competitors but I chose Zerowatts just because of their premium quality. So you are guys are the best! Best!! Every Zerowatts client can feel this!','2026-03-28 16:51:04.976173',1383,279,671),('Murali Krishna Chinthala',5,'I was hesitant at first to go with an unknown photographer.   But Vijaykumar and his team did a commendable job at my daughter\'s engagement.   Not only was their pricing budget friendly,  they did not compromise on the work and their output was better than expected.  I would recommend JVK.','2026-03-28 16:51:07.786970',1384,280,674),('Roja Raja',5,'A genuine feedback from my side\nAmazing work! The photographer is truly talented and made us feel so comfortable throughout. The photos turned out beautiful and natural. Totally worth it.','2026-03-28 16:51:07.790276',1385,280,674),('Pranesh Saisridhar',5,'I have availed the photography services of Mr. Vijayan for multiple occasions such as maternity photoshoot and family functions. His work output has been excellent on all occasions and I have even recommended him to some of my friends. He provides good inputs about posing, ensures all family members are included in photographs and is also cordial and open to our suggestions. I will definitely consider hiring him again in the future for photoshoots and functions.','2026-03-28 16:51:07.793775',1386,280,674),('Affrose Jamila',5,'A genuine feedback from us\nWe\'re very happy with the stunning photos and videos captured by your team at our reception! Their professionalism, attention to detail, and ability to capture the essence of our special day were truly impressive. The way they handled was seamless, and their expertise in photography shone through in every shot. We highly recommend JVK studio to anyone looking for exceptional photography services.  Thank you for making our memories last forever and for the fullest support 🙏😊','2026-03-28 16:51:07.797408',1387,280,674),('Deepika Deepu',5,'Very professional and awesome quality for the price.. now a days photography is not less than 1.5 lakhs. Here it\'s so budget without compromising the quality. His team came soo early even before we got ready. Very dedicated team.','2026-03-28 16:51:07.801786',1388,280,674),('mahesh kannan',5,'Vijay Babu exceeded our expectations, Their professionalism, creativity, and attention to detail made our wedding day truly unforgettable. The photos are stunning, and we can\'t stop reliving the memories. Vijay Babu team is not just a photographer, but a master storyteller who captured the essence of our special day. We highly recommend them to anyone looking for exceptional wedding photography service. Also My Thanks to their team for their wonderful work.\nThanks ❤️','2026-03-28 16:51:10.913738',1389,281,675),('Ranjith',5,'The team at Vijay Babu Photography are genuinely good-hearted people who deliver exceptional work. Their editing skills are outstanding, making the pictures look incredibly real and visually stunning. We had a truly amazing experience working with them, and we\'re so grateful for their professionalism and dedication. Thank you, Vijay Babu team, for an unforgettable experience....','2026-03-28 16:51:10.917189',1390,281,675),('sithantha seelan',5,'Simply exceptional work and professionalism... I had totally forgotten to get the album.. But the entire team and the owner personally made sure to courier it to the other end of the country...\nVery good quality work with reasonable pricing.. wish I had found for the AI version.\n\nI right this as a thank you especially to the owner who is surely a rare gem to find in that place.. Thank you\n\nPs. They were the official photographers of the first birthday bash of my daughters.','2026-03-28 16:51:10.921698',1391,281,675),('Latha Perumal',5,'The photographer did an amazing job capturing our special moments! Their attention to detail, creativity, and professionalism resulted in stunning photos that exceeded our expectations. Highly recommended!','2026-03-28 16:51:10.924788',1392,281,675),('Uma Ramesh',5,'In my own experience I would like to recommend Vijay Babu team for all upcoming functions. He had won many  awards for  his work, His teammates are very sweet .He is having lattest camera. With that he will does majic.With candid camera he brings beauty. I used to run behind him for my daughters marriage.Finally he turned as god\'s gift.I will recommend vijai babu team.','2026-03-28 16:51:10.927736',1393,281,675),('Not Hariscar yt',5,'An extraordinary wedding photography experience marked by elegance, precision, and heartfelt storytelling. The team worked with a calm, premium presence—never intrusive, always attentive. Each photograph carried a refined aesthetic, capturing genuine emotions with artistic brilliance. The final deliverables were polished to perfection, making the memories feel timeless and luxurious. Absolutely recommended for those who value high-class visuals and exceptional service.','2026-03-28 16:51:15.312195',1394,282,676),('GOPINATH R',5,'The wedding photography service delivered an exceptional, signature-level experience from beginning to end. The team showcased remarkable artistic vision—every frame felt intentional, elegant, and beautifully composed. Their ability to capture grandeur, emotion, and intimate moments with such sophistication truly sets them apart. The final photos and films displayed premium color science, editorial framing, and a cinematic finish that felt effortlessly luxurious. This is not just documentation—it is fine art storytelling. A perfect choice for those seeking unmatched quality and a truly elevated wedding photography experience.','2026-03-28 16:51:15.316217',1395,282,676),('Dhanush 123',5,'Thank you, Fly High Media for making my wedding memories so special. The photos and videos came out absolutely beautiful. Your team worked with great dedication and love. Truly grateful for your excellent service','2026-03-28 16:51:15.320266',1396,282,676),('Sadha Sivam',5,'Fly High Media did an outstanding job at my sister’s wedding! Every moment was captured beautifully – from the candid smiles to the emotional ceremonies. The photos were vibrant, natural, and full of life, making us relive the big day every time we see them. Their team was friendly, professional, and made everyone feel comfortable in front of the camera. Highly recommended for anyone looking to preserve their wedding memories perfectly!','2026-03-28 16:51:15.324441',1397,282,676),('Yogaraja K',5,'I couldn\'t be happier with the incredible experience provided by Fly High Media for my wedding photography needs. From the initial consultation to the final delivery of the photos, their team demonstrated professionalism, creativity, and attention to detail. They truly captured the essence and emotion of our special day, delivering stunning images that we will cherish forever. I highly recommend Fly High Media to anyone looking for exceptional wedding photography services.\"\nFeel free to adjust or expand upon this draft to better suit your preferences or specific experiences with Fly High Media.','2026-03-28 16:51:15.328177',1398,282,676),('sona smk1997',5,'I got married on June 08, 2025, and choosing a Vismaya Photography (Ebby bro and his team)for photography was one of the best decisions we made. Right from the pre-wedding shoot, they were so patient, friendly, and perfectly in sync with us, which made everything feel comfortable and fun.\n\nThe photography and videography were absolutely amazing, capturing every emotion so beautifully. The album quality is top-notch—elegant, premium, and filled with memories we’ll cherish forever. Everyone who saw it loved it and couldn’t stop appreciating the work.\n\nA huge thanks to Ebby bro and his awesome team for making our wedding memories truly magical. Highly recommended! ✨🤍','2026-03-28 16:51:19.762215',1399,283,678),('Janani Gunasekaran',5,'It was very nice to have vismaya as a part of our wedding ceremony. We felt very comfortable during the photoshoots each and every photo of ours turned out really well. We would definitely love to recommend vismaya to our friends and family.','2026-03-28 16:51:19.765683',1400,283,678),('SURIYARASAN RAGUPATHI',5,'Vismaya photography was doing their great job as we had our entire wedding events with them they are super cool and clever on the understandings of the clients ideas and expectations. They arrived on time, maintained a friendly and approachable demeanor, and made us feel at ease throughout all the sessions . They patiently listened to our ideas and incorporated them seamlessly into the shoot. And we had great experience with them especially in our wedding and post shoot . Thank you Vismaya for making beautiful memories in best capturing👍🏻❤️','2026-03-28 16:51:19.769211',1401,283,678),('Soundar Chandrasekaran',5,'We had a wonderful experience with Vismaya Photography. They considered all our requirements. Especially the way they managed our wedding crowd and the quality and making of our wedding were top-class. They are very patient and helpful. All photos and videos were superb and excellent album quality, fulfilling all our required conditions. Special thanks to Vismaya & team for the wonderful delivery!','2026-03-28 16:51:19.772692',1402,283,678),('Nikhel Joy',5,'We had a wonderful experience with Vismaya, one of the best photography brands out there! The quality they maintain for every client is truly incredible. The way they capture and portray couples is simply amazing. We absolutely loved our marriage album—it’s a treasure filled with memorable moments that we’ll cherish every time we look at it. We highly recommend choosing Vismaya to ensure a “wow” experience. Thank you, Vismaya team, for making our special day even more unforgettable!','2026-03-28 16:51:19.775933',1403,283,678),('Ayush Sudhiv',5,'They are expert for candid photos and videos no one in Chennai can match them...Team Memories and More exceeded our expectations in every way! Their candid video and photo coverage of our wedding was simply phenomenal. They captured the most intimate, joyful, and emotional moments of our special day with such grace and professionalism. The candid shots were our favorite - they perfectly captured the laughter, tears, and love shared between us, our families, and friends. The video was like reliving the entire day all over again! We can\'t thank them enough for preserving our wedding memories in such a beautiful and authentic way. If you want genuine, heartfelt, and stunning wedding photos and video, look no further than Team Memories and More.','2026-03-28 16:51:24.518500',1404,284,680),('Gayathri Manikandan',5,'The photos that you have captured was really wonderful and the fact that you guys shared few good pictures on the day of wedding was something to be appreciated.\nYou captured so many precious moments from the day that will stay with us all forever. Exactly what we wanted, thank you so much you’ve done an amazing job. Even the post wedding shoot pictures were amazing. Choosing your photography was one of the best decisions made as part of our wedding. You guys were the best, thank you!','2026-03-28 16:51:24.521997',1405,284,680),('shavin raj',5,'As someone who has experienced the outstanding services of Memories and More Photography Team, I am compelled to share my exceptional experience.\nThe team\'s creative flair is evident in every photograph they capture. They have an incredible talent for finding unique angles and perspectives, making each photo a piece of art. Their expertise in lighting and composition transforms ordinary scenes into extraordinary memories.\nFrom our first interaction to the delivery of the final album, their professionalism was impeccable. They were punctual, well-organized, and equipped with high-quality gear. Their ability to handle unforeseen situations with grace and efficiency was admirable.\nThe team\'s interpersonal skills are noteworthy. They made us feel comfortable and at ease, which is crucial for natural and candid shots. Their patience and understanding in accommodating our requests added a personalized touch to their service','2026-03-28 16:51:24.525290',1406,284,680),('Agnes Shivani 99',5,'From the first click to the final delivery, Ruben Photography stands out as a paragon of excellence in the world of photography. My experience with them was nothing short of remarkable.\nRight from our initial interaction, Ruben Photography exuded professionalism. They were prompt in their responses, clear in their communication, and always available to address any queries or concerns. Their approach to scheduling, planning, and execution was seamless, making the entire process stress-free.\nThe skill level of Ruben Photography is evident in every frame. Each photo is a testament to their technical prowess and artistic eye. They have a unique ability to capture the essence of the moment, turning fleeting memories into timeless art. The creativity in their compositions, use of light, and attention to detail is unparalleled.\nThe team at Ruben Photography went above and beyond to understand our needs and preferences. They made sure everyone felt comfortable and at ease during the shoot. Their friendly demeanor and expert guidance helped in bringing out the best in every subject.\nThe final photographs exceeded our expectations. The quality of the images, from clarity to color balancing, was exceptional. They provided a perfect blend of candid and posed shots, each capturing the emotion of the moment beautifully.\nDespite their meticulous attention to detail, they were prompt in delivering the final photographs. The turnaround time was impressive, and the way they presented the final album was both elegant and professional.\nChoosing Ruben Photography was one of the best decisions we made. They not only captured memories but also created an enjoyable experience. Their passion for photography and dedication to client satisfaction shines through their work.\n\nI wholeheartedly recommend Ruben Photography to anyone looking for a photographer who can capture the essence of their special moments. Their ability to blend professionalism with creativity ensures that your memories are in the best hands','2026-03-28 16:51:24.529060',1407,284,680),('BVS Pandeeswaran',5,'Dear memories more Team,\nfirst of all thanks for ur Team members, and supporting workers,\nThey are given me Wonderful photography , then  one of the best memories in my life, also my family members told beautiful. indoor and outdoor shoots amazing ... finally album booklet Vera level ... also outer box and design work super...\n****I pray to God that you will rise more and more like this... I am sharing my favorite photos ....\nThank\nYou\nSo much ♥️','2026-03-28 16:51:24.533766',1408,284,680),('TAMIL SELVAN NSN',5,'We had an absolutely wonderful experience with the team for our wedding photography! Their dedication, creativity, and passion truly reflected in every frame - each picture felt so natural and beautifully captured. The entire team was extremely professional and friendly, making us feel comfortable throughout the shoots.\n\n(Outdoor photo shoots and editing sooo good special, thanks to Rajesh & Brito Doss)\n\nAnd Album  and Candid Video is very good , wedding story video edit also amazing, everything on time and exactly as promised. From wedding to candid moments and traditional shots, everything was handled with such perfection.\n\nHighly recommended for anyone looking for a photography team that goes the extra mile to make your memories timeless! 💫📸','2026-03-28 16:51:28.177951',1409,285,682),('Bavishya\'s World',5,'Pixel Factory Photography is one of the best photography I have ever seen. We are truly delighted with this puberty photoshoot album. Each picture is beautifully captured and thoughtfully edited, bringing back precious memories every time we look through it. The quality of the album is excellent, with rich colors, fine detailing, and a very elegant finish. The care taken in selecting, designing, and presenting the photographs is clearly visible. This album is not just a collection of photos, but a timeless keepsake that we will cherish for years to come. Heartfelt thanks for such wonderful work. Highly recommend.','2026-03-28 16:51:28.181655',1410,285,682),('rahul lakshmanan',5,'Excellent service for baby photoshoot and birthday function. Very professional, great creativity, and beautiful photos. They were very patient with the baby and managed everything smoothly and the album quality is also very good with a premium finish. Totally satisfied 👍','2026-03-28 16:51:28.185265',1411,285,682),('Divya Bharathy',5,'We had the most wonderful experience with pixel factory photography.On my baby shower . He is well professional photographer highly recommend for anyone  pixel factory.','2026-03-28 16:51:28.189957',1412,285,682),('Aishwarya saravanan',5,'Excellent and professional. Rajesh is so polite and perfect towards his profession. Very happy with the output. Going forward will book him for future ceremonies.','2026-03-28 16:51:28.193067',1413,285,682),('SANTHIYA RAMALINGAM',5,'Before marriage, I told my husband that our photoshoot should be the best. He told about Vinoth anna , and he assured me they\'ll take care of it and do a great job. I agreed, and I\'m glad they did!\n\nAt the marriage and reception, they took amazing photos,We don\'t know how to pose, but they made us pose in the best way . They were very free-minded and patient, which made the photos turn out great. Every photo they took was satisfying, and I don\'t have words to describe how super the album is.\n\nAll our relatives, friends, and family were amazed by the photos, and they appreciated the effort put into it. The photos exceeded my expectations, and I\'m really happy. A big thank you to Vinoth anna and the team for doing such a great job!.','2026-03-28 16:51:35.090568',1414,286,684),('Udaya Nandhini',5,'Mango moments studio provides professional and affordable services. When I say affordable, it doesnt mean that they sacrifice the quality of the deliverable. Infact the quality of the photos was so high more than what was fixed as price. I should definitely say the turn around time right from sharing the raw image, providing the complimentary frames and album was so quick. The photographer anna was so polite, humble and calm throughout the event and captured all the small details through photography. He was on time to the event as well. Also their professionalism respecg to editing the photography was on point. While we were asked to confirm the final album, we only suggested few changes, because most of it was already taken care before -so it was so easy for us to review the album before print and confirm it quickly. Overall myself and my whole family was fully satisfied with their service and definitely will recommend them for any special occasion. I will look forward to engage the mango moments studio for my upcoming events also. Thank you so so much mango moments studio for making our baby shower event so memorable and special without any hassles.','2026-03-28 16:51:35.093701',1415,286,684),('Resh Reshma',5,'We really got a wonderful outcome .....very satisfied work😊😊😊😊 I will recommend to my family and friends 😀☺️','2026-03-28 16:51:35.096787',1416,286,684),('Joseph jo',5,'Mango Photography did a great job .\nI’m really impressed with their work .\nThe output was really good and it was not much of a hassle to deal with the team .','2026-03-28 16:51:35.100280',1417,286,684),('Balakrushnan Elanchezhiyan',5,'Dear Mango Moments ,\n\nWe wanted to extend our sincerest gratitude for beautifully capturing our wedding and reception\n\nFrom our first consultation to the final delivery of the photos, your professionalism, creativity, and dedication were truly outstanding. You not only captured all the key moments but also the candid emotions and intricate details that made our day so special. Looking through the photos, we\'re constantly reminded of the joy, laughter, and love that filled every moment.\n\nYour ability to make everyone feel comfortable in front of the camera, and your keen eye for unique shots, resulted in a collection of images we will cherish for a lifetime.\n\nThank you again for your Work and  will wholeheartedly recommend you to anyone looking for an exceptional photographer.','2026-03-28 16:51:35.103889',1418,286,684),('Gana Pathy',5,'I know AB Photography personally from past 35 years. Very descent and budget friendly shop. He has so much variety of packages and range of quality and they are all well profesional then new commers. We are like family members we meet all of our functions and festivals.','2026-03-28 16:51:39.060208',1419,287,685),('Logeesh Ajith',5,'Absolutely thrilled with our experience! The photographer was extremely punctual, arriving right on time as promised. They came fully prepared with creative props for the photoshoot, which made everything so much fun. Their patience and friendly guidance in suggesting different poses helped us feel completely comfortable in front of the camera. The quality of the photographs exceeded our expectations—every shot was perfect and full of life! Overall, a highly recommended photographer for anyone looking to capture their special moments beautifully.','2026-03-28 16:51:39.063685',1420,287,685),('Dhanraj Seervi',5,'AB Photography did my maternity photoshoot and it was a wonderful experience. They suggested the best poses and locations, making me feel comfortable and confident. The pictures came out elegant and emotional memories to treasure forever. Truly the best for maternity shoots.','2026-03-28 16:51:39.067044',1421,287,685),('Praveen N',5,'AB Photography made our wedding truly memorable. They captured every moment beautifully, from candid emotions to grand portraits. The photo album and video came out stunning with a modern touch. Highly professional and very creative. strongly recommended for weddings','2026-03-28 16:51:39.070304',1422,287,685),('Arul Kumar',5,'We booked AB Photography for both wedding and reception and the results were fantastic. They didn’t miss a single detail from rituals to fun moments. The albums and videos were perfectly edited with trending styles. Excellent service and very friendly team.','2026-03-28 16:51:39.073514',1423,287,685),('evan Lincy',5,'Thank you so much SPB photography for Capturing every precious moment beautifully. They are True professional, reasonable cost, timeliness, maintain friendly approach. They given Attention to detail, professionalism, and creativity truly surpassed our expectations. We felt comfortable and confident, which really came through in the final shots. Got the pics on the day of event itself. Faster response. Pre-wedding shoot, get ready shoot, wedding and reception all raw photos were very nice. Special thanks to BALA anna excelled at the work by offering professional photography services, and artistic visuals. Right from the first meeting to the final pictures of the event, DANNY bro was way beyond our expectations. Your photos were unsurpassed in detailing our most precious moments. For a photographer who is genuinely dedicated to their work, look no further than. We wanted to have a special couple pictures and SURYA bro was a pro in giving us our best couple pictures. KARTHICK bro created a relaxed and comfortable mood for the whole session. He never forgets to make us smile. It was an absolute pleasure to work with DASS anna. He went above and beyond to ensure our satisfaction. Are you looking for a photographer who captures your moments exactly how you want them to be captured? Look no further than SPB photography , they understands your requirements and delivers exactly what you are looking for. I strongly recommend SPB photography. Once again Thank you all for your amazing work ❤️🙏','2026-03-28 16:51:42.039684',1424,288,687),('Vishal',5,'Very super and great team work 💪🏻. I love your work , my wedding reception photos very excellent...... Thank you spb bala & Team','2026-03-28 16:51:42.043215',1425,288,687),('BMI 1010 KARTHIGA. A',5,'Very much happy and satisfied with the service of SPB PHOTOGRAPHY -- I have gone through many photoshops but i was satisfied with both price nd service here __ every pic they captured with all love nd captured every single moments💯 -- totally happy with them thanks team ❣️','2026-03-28 16:51:42.046469',1426,288,687),('Logan M',5,'Awesome work with professional etiquette.\nPure hard work and dedication.\nHighly recommended for all your functions❤️❤️','2026-03-28 16:51:42.049872',1427,288,687),('VIP_INK TATTOOS',5,'An excellent job done by the photographer\nFriendly service\nCheap and best','2026-03-28 16:51:42.053659',1428,288,687),('Manoj Kumar',5,'Excellent work by Lokesh and team! They were very polite, flexible, and confident throughout. The video output was cinematic and brilliant, and both photos and videos were shared on time. Overall, a superb experience!','2026-03-28 16:51:46.508797',1429,289,688),('Mohanasundaram KMS',5,'We have hired \"Saradhas studio\" to cover photo & video for my Son\'s marriage at Chennai during 26&27th Oct.\n1)Pre wedding :\nVideo output is phenomenal, it is as good as a movie\n2)Attitude :\n- The team(particularly Lokesh) so very humble , creative, very collaborative and they worked hard until late night\n- Infact they made a quick collection(over night) of the pics taken in the reception and projected in the wedding next day which was appreciated by the guests\n3)Overall :\nOutstanding work\n- Well done tezm \"Saradhas studio\" and keep it up','2026-03-28 16:51:46.511982',1430,289,688),('Mona Leo',5,'It was absolutely fun filled being associated with Saradhas studio couple of times for our special days! They have captured every ounce of our happy moment flawlessly! Feels like family now. Thank you Guru and lokesh for treating us the best at all times!!\nI wish the entire team never ending success and good luck.\nAs I always say, you will be our first choice to capture our special moments henceforth! Thanks for cultivating our trust on you! Long way to go 😊','2026-03-28 16:51:46.515107',1431,289,688),('pradhap kumar',5,'Saradha’s studio did an fantastic job on our all family events… They are good at capturing all the moments in event’s… very helpful and patient… Photo quality was perfect.. Good job guys!!!\n\nYou are always our first choice for event photography..👍🏻👍🏻','2026-03-28 16:51:46.519764',1432,289,688),('Reshu M',5,'\"Your photos are absolutely stunning! I love the way you capture the light and the colors.\"  it\'s Such a memorable day for us. You\'ve done such an amazing job. Thank you❤️','2026-03-28 16:51:46.523129',1433,289,688),('Rama Devi T',5,'Had a great experience with Fox1creativestudioz, especially Giridharan. The team was professional, punctual, and very easy to work with.\nOur engagement photos and album exceeded our expectations — beautifully edited and delivered on time. We’ve received many compliments from friends and family :)\nAffordable packages with excellent quality. Highly recommend Fox1creativestudioz for memorable and professional photography!','2026-03-28 16:51:51.151128',1434,290,690),('Bharathi Selvam',5,'I have booked the studio for my brother\'s wedding. They are the best both in terms of works and deliverables. Very patient and cool. Since the booking day to album delivery, the work was very professional and attractive. Thank you.','2026-03-28 16:51:51.154944',1435,290,690),('Sahaya Ragul',5,'Hi , my native is Thoothukudi but my sister\'s wedding was happening in Chennai, so I found this amazing photographers studio online , they offered a wonderful wedding package the photos album was wonderful and fully satisfied. A special mention to the candid photographer they did an amazing job capturing the moments . Overall experience was too good. I\'ll recommend them 💯 percent . Thanks giri bro and team .','2026-03-28 16:51:51.158686',1436,290,690),('Karthick D',5,'An excellent photoshoot experience from start to finish. Very professional, punctual, and creative. The photos were well-edited and exceeded my expectations. Would definitely recommend to others.','2026-03-28 16:51:51.161771',1437,290,690),('Niranjan Govindaraju',5,'I don\'t have any words. They are the best wedding photographers you might get. Very patient, polite and address all your concern thoroughly. Highly 👍🏻','2026-03-28 16:51:51.165071',1438,290,690),('Shanmugavelu Jayaprakash',1,'Don\'t go for this, very poor service. Just to reprint the photo which I have taken here before took 240 for 16 copies. For three photos 720 overall. Such a waste of money, finishing also poor, i need to retake again other studio. Such a bad service','2026-03-28 16:51:58.136459',1439,291,691),('Santhosh Ram',1,'Delivery given late both the time I gave a photo for framing. I was constantly reminding them to have the photo frame ready by 6 pm, but only at 6.30, they are going out to vendor for fixing glass. Pathetic. If someone wants ontime delivery, don\'t give it here. Quality also satisfactory','2026-03-28 16:51:58.139682',1440,291,691),('AhalyaS Manian',5,'We took few family portraits both casual and professional. We did enjoy taking it too. It was indeed a comfortable and nice experience. The portraits came out beautifully. We are all satisfied with the?service.  Thank yo so much for giving such a good memory to cherish. I wish vishmaya team a good future with all your endevours.','2026-03-28 16:51:58.142674',1441,291,691),('Sanjini Murugan',1,'I contacted Vismaya Wedding Photography for package details and took some time because it\'s my wedding time and to consider my options while I\'m busy with wedding shopping and other works. Unfortunately, their follow-up message was quite rude and unprofessional, essentially blaming me for not responding quickly.\n\nAs a customer, it\'s normal to take time before making a decision. Instead of being patient and understanding, they chose to send a message that felt accusatory and disrespectful. This is not the way to handle potential clients.\n\nCustomer service is a huge part of any business and the tone, respect, and approach matter. Due to their harsh response, I’ve decided not to go ahead with them. I hope they reflect on this and understand that professionalism and patience are key to gaining trust and bookings.','2026-03-28 16:51:58.145935',1442,291,691),('Sasi Kumar',5,'Awesome work done by them and cost effective. We recommend all to use their services they provide…All the best for the entire team..','2026-03-28 16:51:58.149625',1443,291,691),('Manimegalai Arul',5,'We couldn’t be happier with our experience! They captured our wedding reception perfectly. They were professional, warm, and blended seamlessly into the celebration. The final gallery was beautifully edited and delivered promptly. We’ll treasure these memories forever. Pictures were delivered to us on said time, always made sure we are good with final output, requests and suggestions were welcomed and rectified soon. Thank you and highly recommend!','2026-03-28 16:52:01.167374',1444,292,696),('Chandana Priya',5,'Mr.photography took great photos  for my son\'s 10 th birthday celebration 🎊🎊🎉. amazing pictures.. affordable price..Tqsm..💐','2026-03-28 16:52:01.170653',1445,292,696),('Nivetha Gj',5,'I had an amazing experience working with Mr Photography! They were professional, punctual, and made the entire shoot feel comfortable and fun. The photos turned out absolutely stunning—crisp, well-lit, and beautifully edited. You can tell they really care about their craft and clients. Highly recommend to anyone looking for high-quality photography.','2026-03-28 16:52:01.173760',1446,292,696),('Inthujey gj',5,'I had an exceptional experience with mr.photography.Their professionalism and creativity truly stood out. The photos captured every special moment beautifully, and I am very happy with their results. Highly recommended!','2026-03-28 16:52:01.176910',1447,292,696),('sai praveen',5,'Mr.photography took great photos and videos for my sister\'s wedding and baby shower function, especially the Album looks too good and classy.\nHe\'s professional and too good at photography.\nThanks for the compliment gifts and photo frame.','2026-03-28 16:52:01.179846',1448,292,696),('Mohanaprasath P M',5,'Whohhh.. Thank you so much snootmeister team. It’s was very comfortable to work with you guys. These guys are the best in providing all types of photography and videography services. They made us feel very comfortable in order to get amazing pictures. The team has experienced photographers who can take the best pictures of you even if you are a not a good poser. They capture the best candid moments of your event undoubtedly. I would also like to mention about their amazing drone services. It was very different to see my own even from a Birds Eye point of view. Amazing work guys.','2026-03-28 16:52:10.070385',1449,293,697),('Mithila P K',5,'We had the most wonderful experience with Janush studios for both our pre-wedding photoshoot and complete wedding photography. From day one, the team was professional, friendly, and incredibly creative. They made us feel so comfortable in front of the camera, capturing our true emotions and moments so naturally.\nOur pre-wedding shoot turned out magical — every frame looked straight out of a fairy tale. On the wedding day, they didn’t miss a single detail, from candid laughter to emotional moments, and delivered pictures that we will cherish for a lifetime.\nThe quality, creativity, and passion they put into their work truly stand out. Thank you for turning our memories into timeless treasures. We couldn’t be happier with the results and highly recommend JANUSH STUDIOS to every couple looking for perfection in their special moments! 💖📸','2026-03-28 16:52:10.073675',1450,293,697),('Vedhavalli',5,'Thank you Janush Studios team, I wanted to take a moment to express my  sincere appreciation for the amazing work you did during our recent photoshoot. The photos you captured exceeded my expectations and truly captured the essence of the moment.\n\nYour professionalism, expertise, and creativity were evident throughout the shoot, and you made the entire process seamless and enjoyable. You provided clear direction on how to pose and made me feel comfortable in front of the camera.\n\nI was particularly impressed with your attention to detail and ability to capture the perfect shot. The lighting, angles, and composition of the photos were spot on, and the final product was truly stunning.\n\nYour passion for photography and commitment to excellence is evident in every photo you take. I am grateful to have had the opportunity to work with you and cannot recommend you highly enough to anyone looking for a talented and professional photographer.\n\nThank you again for your incredible work. I look forward to working with you again in the future.','2026-03-28 16:52:10.076391',1451,293,697),('Dilaxshini R',5,'I like the Snoot Meister Photography crew. my family members were so happy with their work. My portrait album was superb. Their skills and creativity shine in every shot. Book them for your next event and see for yourself why they\'re the best in Mogappair!\"🔥','2026-03-28 16:52:10.080017',1452,293,697),('கலைச்செல்வி',5,'Snoot Meister Photography Team was absolutely Best !! I have had the pleasure of working with him twice and i would recommend to anyone. They captured so many beautiful memories of my kids that I will be able to cherish for the rest of my life. Thank you, thank you so much to Mr.Vijaykumar and Snoot Meister Photography Team.','2026-03-28 16:52:10.082812',1453,293,697),('Shyam Kumar V',5,'I recently gave my photo , albums , poster design work to Fotofarbe Studio, and they did an excellent job. The quality, clarity, and final output were perfect. The team was very professional, quick, and easy to work with. I’m fully satisfied with their service and would definitely recommend them for any photo or design needs. Great work.','2026-03-28 16:52:17.633139',1454,294,701),('Karishma Feroz',5,'The photo frames are very nice & good looking. & the quality was awesome! Delivery time period was very quick. Me and my family was so satisfied with the work! Thank you so much','2026-03-28 16:52:17.635979',1455,294,701),('Savio Fernando',5,'Job was done to our utmost satisfaction.\nGreat professionalism was shown in all respects.\nWish you a great success and to achieve many more mile stones in your career.\n🙏🙏','2026-03-28 16:52:17.638625',1456,294,701),('kaviya kannan',5,'I am doing a resin art work and needed good quality photocopies and above 250 gsm .The papper quality is really what I expected and Price also affordable.','2026-03-28 16:52:17.641932',1457,294,701),('vezha vendan',5,'After checking the reviews, we went half-minded for a family photoshoot, but he guided us very well with the poses and took 27 photos with a set dress. We were impressed with his work. He gave us the soft copies immediately. He charged ₹500 for 27 photos, which is a little overpriced, but we are satisfied with the photos.','2026-03-28 16:52:17.644686',1458,294,701),('Jagannath Panda',5,'It has been great experience overall,Very polite and kind with a lot of patience,Had Hired him for my son’s birthday,would recommend him strongly!Thank you for your service.','2026-03-28 16:52:20.545917',1459,295,706),('cynthia ganesan',5,'So far this photographer has done 6 events for us. We repeatedly keep booking him for all our events cos he is that good. He is always on time, very polite and flexible too. He does extensive homework for each type of photoshoot and picks out nice locations too. His candid pics are the best. He is very understanding and caring during maternity photoshoot. Overall we are very happy with our experience with him and his team.','2026-03-28 16:52:20.549501',1460,295,706),('Drkalpana V',5,'Excellent  and dedicated  Photographer,  He is so friendly  ,our daughter  half saree ceremony photographs,album quality  is so good,memorable','2026-03-28 16:52:20.553039',1461,295,706),('Edwin S',5,'Recently we arranged thillai photography for our daughter\'s birthday party. They gave their 100% efforts and made the memories, a wonderful one. We liked the album prepared by thillai photography and met our expectations. Keep up the good work','2026-03-28 16:52:20.556242',1462,295,706),('Aishwarya Manikandan',5,'Amazing photographer Mr. Thillai. They captured every moment in our marriage and post wedding shoot perfectly, and the photos were stunning. Highly recommend for any event!','2026-03-28 16:52:20.559262',1463,295,706),('Karthika R',5,'Did our pre wedding photoshoot here. Wonderful place with dreamy themes. They were sweet enough to accommodate  us though we came a late. Clean, neat and maintained well. Happy about the whole experience!','2026-03-28 16:52:26.312818',1464,296,707),('vijay vj',5,'Wonderfull place. We did pre wedding photoshoot there, staffs were friendly and the spot are amazing but need little bit maintenance even though it was nice place.','2026-03-28 16:52:26.316507',1465,296,707),('abi shek',5,'The Place is good for Post or PreWedding Photoshoot. The staffs are friendly. Starting from big car parking space till makeup room and a very clean restroom. Nice place to photograph. ambience is amazing. Very good lighting with reasonable budget. It was a wonderful experience. Many photo graphical elements adds beauty to picture.Will surely recommend to my friends.','2026-03-28 16:52:26.318933',1466,296,707),('Arvind Kannan',4,'This is Arvind kannan Fashion/wedding photographer from chennai.. Today I went for one post wedding photo shoot.. It\'s raining the location.. But the place is really neat..  Good place to shoot for pre wedding and post wedding shoots📸.. Have good experience.. Cheers to all photographers📸..','2026-03-28 16:52:26.321116',1467,296,707),('Gayathri sri',4,'Thanku for beautiful place for beautiful capture😍\nWonderful environment gives us a beautiful memories in future 📀\n\nA very good place for pre/post wedding, maternity shoot\n\nThey give private room for makeover - properties and places were 👌🏻 maintained\n\nPeek hours gives a perfect clicks📸\n\n*Make your own arrangements for snacks and water*\n\n*Prepare timings properly they are very strict with the timings no extra timings will be given*\n\nWorth spending...!!❕','2026-03-28 16:52:26.322681',1468,296,707),('Karthik R',5,'Sameer captured our daughter’s bday celebration. Excellent pics. Loved the quality work! All candid moments nicely captured- didn\'t force to give poses and all.\nMost importantly delivered the soft copy of pics within couple of hours 👍\nHighly recommend Sameer’s photography!','2026-03-28 16:52:29.099660',1469,297,708),('Intersect CS',5,'Great professional service!\n\nThe album is clean, neat, and nicely designed without the clutter you often see with other local photographers.\n\nThe style is simple, elegant, and high-quality.\n\nPerfect for anyone who likes a minimal and classy finish.','2026-03-28 16:52:29.102736',1470,297,708),('MANOJ KUMAR',5,'Quality Frames in Affordable Price A Quick Response from the team and They made us Delivery of the Frame in a Quick span of Time Highly Recommend','2026-03-28 16:52:29.105972',1471,297,708),('Vicky R',5,'Excellent service! They really took the time to find the best angles and make sure every shot looked professional. They made the whole process comfortable and smooth. Plus, their prices are very reasonable for the quality you get. Highly recommend!','2026-03-28 16:52:29.109092',1472,297,708),('Harini Chinnaraj',5,'It was a very quick and proper response from the team. They have finished my work very early which  was very surprising for me. Had a wonderful experience. Thank you','2026-03-28 16:52:29.112093',1473,297,708),('Aldo Demel',5,'We chose Cutepic Studio, for our baby shower photography, and I was genuinely surprised by the quality of their work. I would easily rate them 10/10 for the dedication and effort they put into every single detail and it clearly reflects in the final output.\nWhat impressed me the most was that I didn’t have to suggest anything at all. From choosing the location to guiding us with poses, everything was handled by their team so smoothly and professionally. The results came out way beyond my expectations.\nA big thanks to the entire team for such commendable work. I’ll definitely be working with them again in the future and would happily recommend them to my family and friends. Without a doubt, one of the most promising and budding photography teams around the OMR area.','2026-03-28 16:52:36.591595',1474,298,709),('uma 1991',5,'I contacted CutePic studio only by phone and received an immediate response. Even though I never visited the studio, they made sure to understand and complete my requirements entirely over the call. The customer service was excellent and truly impressive. The final output was exactly as I expected—really amazing work!','2026-03-28 16:52:36.594766',1475,298,709),('shyam T',5,'I recently did my baby\'s 1st birthday photoshoot with Cutepic Studio. The team was extremely punctual, arriving right on time and ready to capture every special moment. Their professionalism and attention to detail truly stood out—every important moment from the event was beautifully covered.\n\nThe photos turned out amazing, capturing the joy and emotions of the day perfectly. What impressed me even more was their quick turnaround—we received the album in just 15 days, along with a lovely complimentary frame that made the memories even more special.\n\nA big thank you to the entire Cutepic Studio team for your dedication and timely delivery. I’m truly grateful and look forward to working with you again for many more milestones to come!','2026-03-28 16:52:36.597998',1476,298,709),('Suresh N',5,'“We chose Cutepic for our baby shower and it was such an awesome experience! Everything went smoothly right up to the album delivery, and the photos turned out so beautiful. Big thanks to Cutepic for capturing these unforgettable moments ❤️📸” Special thanks Arsath bro.','2026-03-28 16:52:36.601203',1477,298,709),('Somasundharam N',5,'We just received our photos from our baby\'s photoshoot Cute Pic Studio and we are absolutely in love with them! the team was so welcoming, showing an immense amount of patience and care with our little one. It\'s a true skill to get a baby to cooperate for a photoshoot, and they handled it with such grace and professionalism. The studio had a great selection of 20 different backgrounds and a huge variety of props, which gave us so many beautiful options. The quality of the photos is exceptional, and they truly captured some magical moments. If you need a baby photoshoot, this is the place to go!','2026-03-28 16:52:36.603673',1478,298,709),('HARI MORO',5,'Best wedding photographers In ko Studio photography Chennai. my relatives wedding Tirupati and Chennai reception high quality best price','2026-03-28 16:52:45.584973',1479,299,714),('venkat sabarish',5,'I ordered 3 family photo frames with KO studio and i was satisfied with their work. They made a good work on the frames in a negotiable price.','2026-03-28 16:52:45.593691',1480,299,714),('Mathangi Ramakrishnan',5,'Best best best photographer in the city.!! Muthu uncle has become one of the family member ❤️ Even when we were tired, uncle and his team forced us to take a lot of pictures (very very rare step in this market).. He took a lot of effort to make all of us look and feel good.. Undoubtedly he is going to be part of all our future events 💜','2026-03-28 16:52:45.597451',1481,299,714),('Karthi Prabhakaran',5,'The ambiance was pleasant and welcoming. The quality of the images and prints was exceptional.\nAfter reading the Google review, I decided to visit this studio and had a very enjoyable experience. The staff was friendly and cooperative, and the photographs they provided were excellent. I highly recommend this studio for any photography needs.','2026-03-28 16:52:45.601775',1482,299,714),('Swaminathan V',5,'KO studio is very professional and cooperative. Mr. Muthuraman is highly creative and an artistic photographer. Excellent job guys keep it up. Best wishes!','2026-03-28 16:52:45.603504',1483,299,714),('suganya R',5,'Very Nice 👌 photo shoots and album also professional and good quality Thankyou vasanth bro...','2026-03-28 16:52:51.030149',1484,300,719),('Ramkumar M',5,'One of the best guy Mr vasanth very knowledgeable and he explains everything details to clients regarding about photo session and output so everybody try it with him for best memories in your life.....','2026-03-28 16:52:51.033723',1485,300,719),('Ram Kumar',5,'Great packages,Helpful and friendly customer service,they are the kindest and genuine people.The prices were absolutely reasonable,they have many great plans and options to choose from,it was such a great valuefor an amazing services.','2026-03-28 16:52:51.037114',1486,300,719),('R.Sugumar',5,'Awesome photography worth of money\nVery nice experience wonderful work God look bro','2026-03-28 16:52:51.040142',1487,300,719),('Bhvani Hema',5,'Nice and super photography there welcomed us very kindly\nThe amount was very lesser then othear studio','2026-03-28 16:52:51.042683',1488,300,719),('Shara Saran',5,'We are extremely happy with 96 wedding photography for their photography work and candid videography.\n\nThe team beautifully captured the best moments of our daughter half saree ceremony function with  natural emotions, genuine smiles, and perfect timing.\nThe candid photos are lively and heartfelt, while the candid video is emotional and well-edited, making us relive the day again. The quality, creativity, and professionalism were excellent throughout. Album craftsmanship also nice work.\nTruly grateful for these wonderful memories and would highly recommend them for capturing most remembering moments in her function.','2026-03-28 16:52:55.242364',1489,301,724),('GAYATHRI BALAN',5,'​We hired 96 Wedding Photography for our maternity photoshoot and baby shower and we are absolutely delighted with their service and the final results!\n\nArun was exceptionally patient and cooperative. He handled the entire event professionally, ensuring he captured all the special moments.\n\n​The final album came out too good! The photo selection, editing, and quality are all superb. We couldn\'t be happier with how perfectly they captured the joy and excitement of our baby shower.\n\n​We highly recommend 96 Wedding Photography!','2026-03-28 16:52:55.245841',1490,301,724),('Vidya Kamaraj',5,'96 WEDDING PHOTOGRAPHY was awesome 😇. As a bride, I was very happy with their work. I felt completely comfortable with the photographers—they were very friendly and made me feel at ease. They captured every single moment just as I had hoped. The album turned out beautifully 👌.“They didn’t just capture photos, they captured our moments.”','2026-03-28 16:52:55.249283',1491,301,724),('dhanraj Sahira',5,'96 Wedding Photography did a fantastic job with my baby’s birthday event &  album with photos. Every moment was captured perfectly, and the final album turned out beautiful. Truly satisfied with their work 😊','2026-03-28 16:52:55.253263',1492,301,724),('vishnu kamaraj',5,'Amazing photography! Every moment was captured beautifully and naturally. We are extremely happy with the engagement photos, and the final album result is absolutely superb🫡🤗','2026-03-28 16:52:55.256751',1493,301,724),('Venkateshwaran Ganeshan',5,'We had the absolute pleasure of choosing DC Studios for our family wedding photoshoot, and we couldn’t be happier with the experience. From start to finish, everything was handled with perfection and professionalism.\n\nDinesh, the proprietor, is truly a man of punctuality and commitment. He arrived well in advance at the venue, ensuring that every detail was in place before the celebrations began. The preparation and planning were executed flawlessly, which gave us immense confidence and peace of mind on such an important day.\n\nHe and his team were incredibly dedicated and attentive. They covered every single moment — from the smallest, most intimate details to the grandest highlights of the event. Their workmanship is exceptional, and the quality of the photographs speaks for itself. Every frame reflects creativity, clarity, and emotion.\n\nWhat impressed us the most was how smoothly they managed the crowd. Weddings can be chaotic, but the team handled everyone with patience and professionalism, ensuring that no special moment or guest was missed. Their coordination and crowd management were truly remarkable.\n\nKudos to Dinesh and the entire DC Studios team for their outstanding service. We are deeply grateful for the beautiful memories they’ve captured for us, and we highly recommend them to anyone looking for top-notch photography services.','2026-03-28 16:52:59.233995',1494,302,726),('Verramani Verra',5,'Absolutely amazing experience with DC studios !\n\nWe hired them for our son\'s wedding, From start to finish, they were professional, punctual, and incredibly easy to work with. The photographer was so patient and great with the entire event, and they managed to capture every beautiful, candid moment without ever feeling intrusive.\nThe quality of the photos is stunning – vibrant, clear, and full of emotion. Each picture truly tells a story, and now we have these precious memories beautifully preserved forever. Our family and friends were blown away by how wonderful everything looked.\nI would highly recommend dc studios to anyone looking for professional, heartfelt photography. We’ll definitely be booking with them again for future events.','2026-03-28 16:52:59.238309',1495,302,726),('MUTHUPANDI KANDASAMY',5,'DC has done a wonderful job for my house warming ceremony. He captured every moments beautifully. He has become a good friend of mine and I highly recommend him to Grace your special occasions.','2026-03-28 16:52:59.241696',1496,302,726),('VENUS CATERING SERVICE GURUMURRTHY',5,'My father 60th wedding  booked DC studios ,very dedicated service, good  team album quality  cinematic finish we feel more than we paid','2026-03-28 16:52:59.244752',1497,302,726),('Vicky D',5,'We heard a lot of great things about DC studio work from my friends who hired their services for their wedding. We had to go with DC for our wedding after that and we feel we made the best choice. Photography was excellent. They captured our precious memories beautifully. Their candid photography is top notch. The team was very easy going and accommodating. They didn’t complain one bit even though some things didn’t go according to the plan. Loved their attitude. Post Production work is quick and efficient in delivering our suggested changes. For hassle free and best experience go with dc studios.','2026-03-28 16:52:59.247915',1498,302,726),('Aparna Mohan',5,'Best ever photography skills they have and I assure that u guys will receive all the photos and videos within time ♥️ . For us they suggested a package of reception  , marriage & pre wedding photoshoot which was the best choice we had made  . One of the best in town ✨ Very happy with their work 🎊','2026-03-28 16:53:03.007020',1499,303,728),('Ashwini Prakash',5,'Impress stills did a wonderful job in decorating and setting up Audio Visuals for my grand father’s 80th birthday party in GRT, Chennai. Thank you very much.','2026-03-28 16:53:03.009308',1500,303,728),('Priti Sankaran',4,'Luckily we had good photographers assigned to capture our engagement & wedding moments, and the final output came out really great, like a memory to cherish forever. Thank you so much team for the beautiful album, video and reels.\nDeliverables could have been speeded up though.','2026-03-28 16:53:03.011318',1501,303,728),('Uma Thyagarajan',5,'It was just amazing and stunning. They did it better than we expected. Of course our relationship with Impress still is 11 years now. We have engaged them for many events and will continue to do so in the future.\nThank you Impress stills and surge ahead confidentially.','2026-03-28 16:53:03.013359',1502,303,728),('Kaavya Bharath',5,'Excellent coordination Team Event I ...every single detail was fulfilled and executed perfectly.way to go! Wishing you more such successful events in the forthcoming years !','2026-03-28 16:53:03.015629',1503,303,728),('Subashini Jothi',5,'would like to express my heartfelt thanks to you and your team\'s support and timely service. Your dedication and efficiency truly reflect the quality of your photo studio. Keep up the great work! My entire family has given Wow to you and your team for deliveeing  live photo fram on stage, even though it was short notice you helped us to assist  to surprise my bride and groom.','2026-03-28 16:53:10.435892',1504,304,730),('Sankumar Vr',5,'I would rate Eden Photo Garden with 5 Rating for the Very Good Service rendered by them. Right from  beginning be it discussing our requirement finalizing the package that would suit us - to Photo  shoot during the  event and delivering it - it had been professionalism throughout.  Employees were courteous and we had a very smooth interaction  with them. In nutshell it\'s worth the money.  Cheers.','2026-03-28 16:53:10.444526',1505,304,730),('akash C',5,'Has a wide variety of customization options for photos... Can put pics on exam pads, keychains, old style picture frames, bottles, awards, albums, etc.','2026-03-28 16:53:10.448152',1506,304,730),('TAMILARASAN LAKSHMANAN',5,'Eden team really did a great job for our wedding!! We truly loved the shots they took with a calming presence which made us feel completely at ease.\nThank you so much!!','2026-03-28 16:53:10.449998',1507,304,730),('Sivakumar Selvakumaran',5,'We booked eden and they made our decision feel right and worthy . Than being professional they are a friendly team who pulls off the best from you . Do employ them  to make your occassions a step ahead memorable.','2026-03-28 16:53:10.451991',1508,304,730),('Kokila Sundharam',5,'We had an absolutely wonderful experience with this baby shower photoshoot😍The photos and videos came out beautifully, capturing every special moment with so much care and creativity❤️ The coordination throughout the event was smooth and professional, making us feel completely comfortable. We are extremely satisfied with the final output and truly appreciate the patience and dedication shown. Thank you for giving us such precious memories to cherish forever!','2026-03-28 16:53:11.660284',1509,305,735),('Kavitha Dk',5,'Feather Touch Photography Santhosh and his team are amazing! They are super talented, very friendly, and really takes the time to get the perfect shot. They make you feel comfortable and never rush the process, which makes a huge difference. The photos turned out beautiful—better than we imagined! Highly recommend for anyone looking for a great photographer.','2026-03-28 16:53:11.666262',1510,305,735),('Madhan',5,'Booked Feather Touch Photography for my cousin wedding & reception. Really happy with their service. Customer Service is very good. Friendly staff and album/picture quality is top-notch👌 Very happy with the results. Very cooperative, creative and takes into account all our preferences and implements them. They are passionate about their work.Will definitely recommend them for all types of events.','2026-03-28 16:53:11.667949',1511,305,735),('Mathi Surekha',5,'We couldn’t have asked for a better photographer to capture our most special moments! From our engagement to our baby shower, you’ve been more than just a photographer—you’ve are more family photographer for all our occasions. Each picture tells a story, and we’re so grateful for the memories you’ve preserved for us. Thank you for your incredible work and for being such an important part of our journey!”','2026-03-28 16:53:11.669255',1512,305,735),('Amreen Basha',5,'Our experience with feather Touch Photography team turned out unexpectedly awesome. Their team is truly talented and kudos to them. And had to mention Santosh, you have done a very good work from the event date till delivery of our album, I have never seen such a beautiful photo album which you guys done for my wedding. During our wedding it was soo fussy full of dancing. You managed to capture very beautiful moments, I\'m soo glad I chose you. Definitely we are booking you for all our future events. Good job Santhosh and his team wish you reach greater heights👍🏻','2026-03-28 16:53:11.670681',1513,305,735),('Karthikeyan C',4,'Will be good if they deliver the product within the time frame they promises.','2026-03-28 16:53:18.651492',1514,306,736),('Thangarajh NT',5,'Professional and dedicated approach!\nPhotographer was available even at 4.00-4.30AM','2026-03-28 16:53:18.655056',1515,306,736),('vani gugan',5,'The best!\nI did 2 albums, My baby\'s first birthday photography, 5 frames with them - Everything turned out perfect, just like the way I wanted.\n\nI always communicate my need via phone or message to them. They delivered everything in such a high quality!\n\nMy most favourite is 20*30 frame for my baby. They did a phenomenal job there. They patiently made changes to all major to minor corrections I told them. Kudos to the great work team!\n\nAnd nevertheless to say, their charges are actually minimal to the amount of work they do. So if you are looking for a premium quality work in the best price, just choose Prabhu digital stores!','2026-03-28 16:53:18.658716',1516,306,736),('Vishwa Alagiri',5,'I ordered a wedding collage frame for my friend\'s birthday. The result was very satisfying. They were very responsive and extremely friendly. The collage work was perfect and this gift made my friend unforgettable.\nTHANK YOU VERY MUCH!!!','2026-03-28 16:53:18.662367',1517,306,736),('Ragul',5,'Really want to thank prabhu digital studio for making amazing collage frame work...and their staff are so humble and kind...and this studio have more than 50 years of experience I know..and doing fabulous wedding works etc....\nkeep shining 💓🌟best service 👍💯','2026-03-28 16:53:18.665852',1518,306,736),('vetrivel sudhakar',5,'I had a wonderful experience with this photo studio. The team is highly professional, patient, and friendly, making the entire photoshoot comfortable and enjoyable. The quality of photography is outstanding, with great attention to lighting, angles, and detailing.\n\nThey truly understand customer requirements and deliver results beyond expectations. Timely delivery, reasonable pricing, and excellent customer service make this studio stand out.\n\nI strongly recommend this studio for family photos, kids photography, portraits, and special occasions. Keep up the great work! 👏📸','2026-03-28 16:53:30.232722',1519,307,741),('Ram Prasad S',5,'I had a very pleasant experience at this photo studio. The staff were professional, patient, and clearly experienced. They guided me well with poses and expressions, making the entire shoot comfortable and stress-free.\n\nThe studio is clean, well-maintained, and equipped with good lighting and camera setups. Photo quality was excellent, with clear detailing and natural color tones.\n\nDelivery was on time, and pricing felt reasonable for the quality of service provided. Overall, a reliable studio for passport photos, family portraits, and professional shoots. I would definitely recommend this place.','2026-03-28 16:53:30.235969',1520,307,741),('Ajay Sargunar',5,'We had a wonderful experience with Sivam Digital Studio during our reunion photoshoot and group picture session. The service was very cost-effective without compromising quality. They delivered the pictures (both hard and soft copies)on time, which we truly appreciated.\n\nThey were also very flexible, friendly and cordial throughout the process, making everyone feel comfortable during the shoot. Highly recommended for anyone looking for great value and reliable photo services! - Batch of 1995, Kendriya Vidyalaya No.1, AFS Tambaram','2026-03-28 16:53:30.239026',1521,307,741),('Pradeepa Ann',5,'I got my visa photo taken here and received the prints instantly, which was very convenient. The owner is professional and courteous. I also got a painting framed here, the quality and framing was very good. However, the frame I selected appeared more lustrous and golden than expected in person than it did on the screen. That said, Definitely a reliable place for quick photo services and framing needs.','2026-03-28 16:53:30.242153',1522,307,741),('Dharshini GR',5,'It was good, they even editing to make you good. My passport size photo came out amazing. The photo was clear and good.','2026-03-28 16:53:30.245329',1523,307,741),('Sivaraman N',5,'Our relatives had took the Catering Service from Sriram Marriage Vegetarian Food for lunch. Food Tasted good and was well taken care.','2026-03-28 16:53:33.385444',1524,308,746),('Prasanna kumar',5,'Wonderful Food offers an amazing variety of delicious vegetarian dishes that are both flavorful and fresh. The food is well-prepared with the right balance of spices, and the service is quick and friendly. A great place for anyone looking to enjoy tasty veg meals in a clean and comfortable setting.','2026-03-28 16:53:33.388823',1525,308,746),('Radhika Shanmuga',5,'All the  items are wonderful. Services are also so nice. Good. Keep it up. Especially Puliyotharai  rice and curry leaf rice are super','2026-03-28 16:53:33.392043',1526,308,746),('Guru Prasath',5,'The veg biryani was super delicious 😍 Perfectly cooked rice, rich spices, and great taste. Highly recommended!','2026-03-28 16:53:33.395258',1527,308,746),('Jeba',5,'The meals is good. Choice of food is also nice. Really enjoyed the food','2026-03-28 16:53:33.398384',1528,308,746),('shiva g.u.',5,'Excellent foods which we have ate in birthday function... quality and quantity was very good.. thanks for divine caterers and events','2026-03-28 16:53:42.030995',1529,309,747),('Sasinthar 26.91',5,'The best food , very good service so kind & humble..my family was very happy tq to divine cateres & events , I\'m bravely refer to others ..nobody forget my reception bcoz of food , awesome taste','2026-03-28 16:53:42.033408',1530,309,747),('Athira Arputharaj',5,'Dear Sir,\n\nFood was extremely good and tasty... Thank you add so much for making our function a great success and memorable. Staffs were so kindful','2026-03-28 16:53:42.035398',1531,309,747),('Kavi Yarasu',5,'Taste and service of divine caterers & team no one will compramise , reasonable price and quality of food 200% , I have own experience with my family function for this year 2.henceforth if they any function in my home i always recommend to my Divine caters not only catering they like family...keep rocking same gavaskar bro & Divine caters....soon will meet in upcoming functions🎉🎉🎉🎉🎉','2026-03-28 16:53:42.037066',1532,309,747),('Gokul Krishnamoorthy',5,'Tastes good., Best service ever. 🥰😍','2026-03-28 16:53:42.038761',1533,309,747),('teekaraman',5,'The biryani provided by the catering service was very delicious and well-prepared. The rice was perfectly cooked, soft, and flavorful, and the spices were balanced nicely. The meat was tender and blended well with the masala. The aroma and taste were excellent, making the dish enjoyable for everyone. The quantity and quality were also very good, and it was served fresh and hot. Overall, the biryani from the catering service was satisfying and appreciated by all the guests.','2026-03-28 16:53:46.280437',1534,310,752),('Lavanya Viswanathan',5,'Such a good and kind cetering service.\nBread alwa was excellent\nVeg and non veg food both are tooo good from them.\nTheir serving boys are also tooo friendly and polite.\nHygiene is maintained so neatly.\nTheir supervisor keeps everyone in accordance to the program. He coordinates very well.','2026-03-28 16:53:46.283198',1535,310,752),('Earnest Raja',4,'We enjoyed the chicken biriyani and pulka with chicken gravy, and the taste was good overall.  In the chicken 65, most of the pieces were bone-heavy, whereas the chicken gravy contained more fleshy pieces. It would be better if fleshy pieces were used in the chicken 65 as well, considering the cost. This improvement would enhance the overall dining experience.\n\nHowever, the Pricing felt quite high for the quantity and quality provided.','2026-03-28 16:53:46.284965',1536,310,752),('Vinodhini V',4,'One of the tasty and yummy Chicken Biriyani I had in the recent. Rice was well cooked and masala was blended perfectly and had a nice aroma. Service was neat and satisfactory.\n\nVegetarian dish can be improved as Gobi 65 was quite oily.','2026-03-28 16:53:46.286763',1537,310,752),('1 Million Views Tamil',5,'One of the best premium caterers in Chennai !! Hands down I tried their Mutton Biryani & was an Blissfull moment to my taste buds !!\n\nDefinitely do check them out for any of your functions.','2026-03-28 16:53:46.288242',1538,310,752),('hari prasath (Hp)',5,'I\'ve ordered for my baby\'s first birthday.\nWe have utilised almost all the count (100 non veg and 120 veg)\nAll the guests said food was good.\nBudget friendly option compared to others.\nWe have also customised our order they have given option for us to explore new items.','2026-03-28 16:53:50.460521',1539,311,754),('Vinodh G',5,'My marriage reception caterers Best one catering served amazing food. Every items served was good  in taste and with good quality.\n\nPradheesh is very supportive in understanding the client needs and was polite and listened to every details which were provided.\n\nOverall a pleasant experience with caterer and guests appreciated the food served.','2026-03-28 16:53:50.463618',1540,311,754),('Prakash A',5,'On behalf of our family, we extend our sincere appreciation to the BEST ONE CATERING team and the wonderful welcome ladies who made today’s baby shower an unforgettable event Thank you for your exceptional catering service and the warm hospitality. The food was delicious, the arrangements thoughtful, and the overall experience delightful. We appreciate your hard work in making the baby shower a memorable occasion. You have truly helped make this celebration magical.','2026-03-28 16:53:50.466790',1541,311,754),('2024 Raghunath B',5,'The best one catering service is truly one of the best. The food they provide has an excellent taste and is prepared with great care and quality ingredients. Every dish is flavorful, fresh, and delicious, making the entire dining experience very enjoyable. In addition to the amazing taste, the quality of the food is maintained at a very high standard','2026-03-28 16:53:50.470035',1542,311,754),('sri Vidhya',5,'“A big thank you to our food master for the absolutely delicious food! Everyone kept saying the taste was wow and truly enjoyed every dish. Even when there was a small last-minute shortage, you handled it so quickly and arranged everything perfectly. Your effort and management made the event even more special. Truly appreciate your dedication and hard work!”\n\nThe taste for the food is 1000 out of ten .It\'s top notch 🥳','2026-03-28 16:53:50.473683',1543,311,754),('Maheswari Arun',1,'Very good taste...\nBut provide worst quantity... Asking more chiken... Servers Said directly \"No\"... Three persons same anwer\nThis is not our culture ... For providing food...  Insulted... Everyone not beggers... We are coming for blessings...\nAnd happy moments... That is one Christian marriage....','2026-03-28 16:53:52.755314',1544,312,756),('Subha Ramiah',5,'I am a Masterchef USA Season 10 Top5 chef who was brought up in Chennai. This week there was an Urgent need to cook for my charity and all of its needy children and parents on the inauguration of Catherine Technical Institute on March 29th, 2025 for http://www.catherinehopefoundation.org\n\nI reached out to Baskaran and Solomon Srinivasan of Envyn Caterers and immediately they responded with an amazing menu and an affordable charity pricing for “Traditional Chennai Biryani Leaf Service” in 24 hrs .\n\nMr. Solomon personally took responsibility and designed the menu working with me even to make my favorite “Indalian Fruit Salad (Indian+Italian)” for pairing with their amazing Biryani lunch round up.\n\nThey came on time with hot food, worked with me on site to prepare “Healthy Juicy Indalian salad” and provided what I call “100/10” food service -10 times more than what I expected.\n\nThis review coming from me is from my tastebuds, stomach & of course my heart.  The children have never eaten anything remotely close to this amazing lunch!\nThey (1st grade to 10th grade active kids) and 10+ disabled kids and their parents) usually eat rice and sambar in a bowl with little portions just to get by!!  This feast was once in a lifetime event for them - thanks to General Manager Mr. Solomon who personally took interest to visit and serve them in his own hand!!!\n\nMy Biryani & Raitha in Masterchef competition achieved “Best of Episode” rating from the MC judges “Michelin star Chef Gordon Ramsey, Chef Aaron Sanchez and Mr. Joe Bastianich”… HOWEVER I WAS BLOWN AWAY BY THE TENDER Goat Meat (1 kg Basmati Rice to 1.5kg meat ratio) , Egg Plant Curry, beautify portion packed fruits, Chicken 65, bread halwa, pickle, Raitha and Appalam”\n\nOUR HEARTS AND STOMACH ARE FILLED WITH NUTRITIOUS FOOD AND ENERGY !!!\n\nI would rate their food, cost, service and attitude to carry out the TAMILNADU tradition and Biryani Capital of the world Chennai is outstanding 5/5 stars!!!','2026-03-28 16:53:52.759179',1545,312,756),('Thangaraj Dillibabu',5,'i ordered 4kg chicken biriyani combo, package was awesome ( i open the parcel after 3 hours of delivery still i got hot biriyani) and taste is superb. i strongly recommend these caterers for your function guys.','2026-03-28 16:53:52.763927',1546,312,756),('I1',5,'Food was very good and tasty. They reached on time and service is really good. Overall awesome experience.','2026-03-28 16:53:52.767304',1547,312,756),('Andrew Abraham',5,'One of the best caterer for weddings , events , birthday parties. They serve exceptionally delicious food with so much professionalism and quality in their service. Mr. Roberts Bhaskaran who runs this unit for over 25 years stands tall when it comes to customer service & satisfaction . Known popularly for their amazing briyani’s , I would highly recommend Ennwyn Caterers. 👍🏻','2026-03-28 16:53:52.770770',1548,312,756),('Priya bala',5,'We hosted guests for dinner, breakfast, and lunch, and I really liked the overall experience.\nHaving everything in one place the menu, buffet vessels, and service staff was very convenient for us.\nPrice was good.\nThe food overall was great and well appreciated. The kichadi and ashoka were especially good, and the service boys were polite and helpful.\n\nOne small suggestion would be to have a few extra plates available handy .\nOther than that, we were very satisfied and look forward to booking with you again sir','2026-03-28 16:53:55.509196',1549,313,757),('Priya Balasubramanian',5,'5/5 stars!I was grateful to host 120 guests and I would  recommend Royal catering services and his team .From the initial inquiry until the end  , Syed sir was following up on every thing, even provided us  customized menu which i really appreciate.The food was outstanding, and our guests loved it. The service was excellent .service  staffs service was very professional . Syed sir\'s attention to detail and commitment  made our event truly special. We appreciate his hard work and look forward to working with him again! Highly recommend!','2026-03-28 16:53:55.512209',1550,313,757),('Th',1,'Disappointing Experience with Royal cartering service..\nYesterday I ordered 2 bucket mutton biryani  for ramzan (cost around 5100/-) but unfortunately, it was a huge letdown. The quantity provided was very less than what was promised, leaving many of my guests without enough food.\nThe rice was undercooked and hard, which made it inedible. This was not only embarrassing but also a waste of money.\nI would not recommend  to anyone. They failed to meet even the basic expectations of a catering service.','2026-03-28 16:53:55.515087',1551,313,757),('Rajalakshmi G',5,'Biriyani was excellent in taste... And the quantity was more... Correct in time for delivery... All the dishes were very good.. thanks royal catering...','2026-03-28 16:53:55.517027',1552,313,757),('vijaya lakkshmi',5,'Very nice catering to place order for family function. But mention about water bottle, they would have served mini water bottles instead of half liter. But taste and service was very awesome 👌','2026-03-28 16:53:55.519129',1553,313,757),('Deepa Palaniappan',5,'Delicious food.. Nice service','2026-03-28 16:54:02.894964',1554,314,758),('Sudhan',4,'Good service and food tastez ok','2026-03-28 16:54:02.898127',1555,314,758),('sathish S',5,'Very tasty food and quality service','2026-03-28 16:54:02.901343',1556,314,758),('jsharmila sharmila',5,'They give a good foods and they made very one happy face with fullfill our hungry. I appreciate his works💯','2026-03-28 16:54:02.904575',1557,314,758),('Santhosh Santhosh',5,'Good and testy food good service vonder fully','2026-03-28 16:54:02.907808',1558,314,758),('nivas',5,'Recently visited to attend satabhishekam on 27.12.25 at PSB hall. The catering was done by sreemannar catering.To my great surprise I observed this catering company is able to discharge the hosting in a very scrupulous manner. The lady supervisor is ensuring snacks are displayed for counter service yet august gathering was served in their chairs.Tissue papers for handwipe too,good quality.The taste of breakfast or lunch is really delicious. Caterers without waste of time served and some guests were specifically served for wanting dishes without fuss that too patiently and politely.None of the dish could be found fault.diners were handed the thamboolam bag meticulously. Beeda or pan icecream was served to all people without blemish.Though wanted to say my appreciation to the catering staff posted there,in hurry missed it. Because after so many occasions or gatherings entrusted with various caterers this one seems on zenith. Hospitality can be done by any one but with less flaws is more difficult now a days for present generation in hurry. If the same outlook and sincerity in their efforts are continued, this caterers situated in Nehrunagar arumbakkam,soon will reach golden heights. Money only not criterion but service to mankind is service to god. Wishing this organization to grow rapidly but with same principles','2026-03-28 16:54:08.742756',1559,315,763),('Venkatesh S',5,'We have done 2 functions with Mannar Catering Services, I can 100% say they are the best awesome taste, quality, service, on time etc. I usually never give reviews but wholeheartedly I must say these people should reach great heights for their exceptional service. Many guests still say food was delicious 😋. I wish them a great success a head. Mr. Dhanasekar from Mannar Catering services he is a great pillar to this catering service.','2026-03-28 16:54:08.745902',1560,315,763),('Saikumar Sb',5,'Great service and wonderful taste, presentation was nice well laid out. All items were served hot and tasty.','2026-03-28 16:54:08.748621',1561,315,763),('sabarish sabu',5,'Food was amazing. All the food items was good. Especially their hospitality felt like home','2026-03-28 16:54:08.751649',1562,315,763),('Rajidinu Kamal',5,'Food was amazing taste\nVery very good..','2026-03-28 16:54:08.754763',1563,315,763),('vignesh.B',1,'Had my sister\'s wedding with this caterer food tasted good but the service was the worst the dont know how to maintain and manage bigger crowds but the people brag about doing big weddings of 1 lakh or more people but cant manage 4000 ppl at best , the refilling of the food was so slow that people left without eating as u can see from the photos, and no one acknowledges the mistake they do and keep making catchy  Instagram posts to lure ppl\nHonest opinion: too overpriced ,manipulative , wont advice to any other person','2026-03-28 16:54:12.108503',1564,316,764),('Hariharan Srinivasan',5,'\"We used Saraswathy Catering for our son’s marriage, they made the whole process stress free and were allowing us to fully enjoy the entire event.  The food was absolutely delicious; our guests are still raving about the tastiness of the food throughout the event. The presentation was beautiful, and everything was served hot and on time. Their team was professional, kind, and incredibly efficient until the completion of the event. We were particularly grateful for how accommodative they were and in managing the humongous crowd. \"\n\nWe also have used them in different occasions in both of my son’s upanayanam function, etc and nowhere we could not see any flaws in their execution.  We highly recommend them!','2026-03-28 16:54:12.110266',1565,316,764),('shoaib ibrar',5,'Got to taste their food at a friends reception. The food was good and a lot of varieties on the table which was overwhelming and some special deserts which was also tasty.','2026-03-28 16:54:12.111976',1566,316,764),('Vijay Eabi',5,'Excellent service and most recommended dish pan and veg soup','2026-03-28 16:54:12.113589',1567,316,764),('HARIKRISHNAN K',3,'The service and maintenance were commendable, and the staff were polite and attentive throughout. I especially liked the desserts — they were delightful and well-presented. The rest of the dishes were moderate in taste, but the variety offered showed great effort and planning. The food was served fresh and on time, which added to the overall experience. However, the quantity seemed a bit too much for most guests to finish, and slightly reducing it might help avoid wastage. Overall, a good experience with a few areas that could be fine-tuned.','2026-03-28 16:54:12.114960',1568,316,764),('Bala Subramani',5,'I ordered a Mutton Biryani combo with Vanjaram Fish for 120 members for a function at my home. The food was delivered on time, and tracking details of the food truck were also shared, which was helpful.\n\nThe Mutton Biryani was excellent, and all the other items—Vanjaram Fish, Egg Masala, and Pepper Chicken—were also very good. As promised, mutton biryani pieces were served unlimited as per each person’s requirement, which was a major highlight. Tissues and after-meal (Saunf) were also provided.\n\nMr. Sudhakar, the supervisor, managed the service extremely well and ensured everything ran smoothly.\n\nOverall, I am very happy with both the food and the service. All our guests were satisfied, and would definitely recommend them!','2026-03-28 16:54:17.403841',1569,317,765),('Hannah Princy',5,'R S catering made our special day extra special. The food mutton briyani was too good and excellent. The way mutton cooked was mouth melting and taste was excellent. We ordered pineapple Kesari for sweet and the sweet was too good with perfect texture and taste. The taste of chicken 65 is also the best and everyone loved and complimented the food taste and freshness.\nThe staff was very professional and attentive ensuring everything went smooth and they were friendly and everyone mentioned that the hospitality service was outstanding where guest felt welcomed and well cared.\nThe food was delivered on timecwithout any delays and the live GPS tracking also helped in monitoring the progress. The price was also very decent and on the whole you provided a exceptional service and it\'s highly recommended.','2026-03-28 16:54:17.405480',1570,317,765),('Selva Prasad',5,'The food was well prepared & tasted fresh, with good variety to cater. Overall it was a satisfying experience. But main thing is that a unlimited pieces were they surprises us, that people can enjoy. Mutton Briyani was very Juicy & tasty as well. Thanks to RS Caters for your continues follow ups and coordination till end of the event. I am really grateful to continue with you for future orders.','2026-03-28 16:54:17.407056',1571,317,765),('priya darshini',4,'At yesterday’s birthday party, both the Chicken Biryani and Veg Biryani were served and were well appreciated by the guests. The biryanis were flavorful, aromatic, and overall very tasty, receiving positive feedback from most attendees. However, the Chicken 65 had a minor issue—some pieces were quite hard, which affected the texture and experience slightly. Despite this, the overall response from the guests was good, and the food quality and taste were largely enjoyed by everyone.','2026-03-28 16:54:17.408487',1572,317,765),('Insurance Hub',5,'Gopi was an highly dedicated entrepreneur and the way he care for his clients satisfaction is truly sensational.  Today we ordered food for our business forum in the occasion of a cricket match, the briyani was simply anazing taste with lot of chicken peices and bread halwa was really awesome.\n\nThank you gopi for your great biriyani and that too you delivered on morning to the ground by 7.30am itself.\n\nExcellent customer service\n\nRaja\nYoung entrepreneur school\nChennai chapter 2','2026-03-28 16:54:17.409929',1573,317,765),('Muthu Haritha',5,'Hatsoff to the entire Subiksham Catering team 🙏\n\nEveryone at the function appreciated the food — it was truly delicious, flavorful, and homely. The service was neat, polite, and perfectly organized. The way your team served the food with such care and patience was just awesome 👏\n\nEven though we gave a small order, you accepted it with the same dedication and respect as you would a big event. That really touched our hearts ❤️\n\nSpecial thanks to sir — I’ve always been a fan of his videos, and now after experiencing your service in person, I admire your team even more 🌟\n\nMany caterers refuse or laugh at small counts of our function, but your positive response and professional approach showed your true values and passion for your work.\n\nTasty food, great service, humble hearts — that’s Subiksham Catering! 🍽️💫','2026-03-28 16:54:21.495755',1574,318,768),('sathish kumar',1,'My brother in law\'s marriage at vandavasi,We are not satisfy with your dishes, taste, no taste.. Not worth for money.. Idly and idiyappam is not freshly prepared, its packed one. Karakulambu very worst taste.. Chips are powdered.. Rasam is not well.. Rice is not well cooked..i will not give even a single star.. talking very kind and polite..','2026-03-28 16:54:21.500786',1575,318,768),('Sofiya gowthami',5,'Recently I attended my Friend Wedding in Umaidhri Conventional Hall .OMR .I already hered about this catering services but first time I attended there event really I was impressed by there arrangements and ambience &  People\' received by there welcome girls very neatly.Live Fresh juices , snacks ,Chat items ,live coffee and finally in the leaf Service every service boys very neatly politely served all dishes I liked  .first i thought they are over showing in there insta reels but it\'s true i realise in this my friend event .Also i recommend my family events too thank you Subiksham team all the best','2026-03-28 16:54:21.502490',1576,318,768),('gokul vasudevan',2,'Booked them for my marriage(dinner, breakfast, lunch), got to know them from word of mouth and Instagram ad.\n\nTaste which was promised not delivered.\n\nFor dinner- gravies were average and overall taste was not up to the mark. Guest reported the same to me.\n\nFor breakfast- Guest told vada doesn’t look and taste like fresh. Tiffin Item were also not up the mark.\n\nDisappointed with their service and this really affects my overall reputation & marriage experience towards the guests.\n\nGuest were asked to give good review for the return of steel bottles.\n\nFeels like subiksham trying to place high prices as their competitors, hope they should compete in Taste first.\n\nLesson learned: Do take a taste check before booking a caterer and don’t trip for fancy words.\n\nOverall experience (taste, service): 2.5/5','2026-03-28 16:54:21.504422',1577,318,768),('Pradeep Kumar',1,'We recently attended my sister’s wedding where the catering was provided by Subiksham Catering Private Limited. Unfortunately, the food quality was very disappointing — the dishes lacked taste and flavor. One of our relatives even commented that it tasted like plain watery gruel rather than proper food.','2026-03-28 16:54:21.505921',1578,318,768),('Kishore Kalai',5,'Venus Catering service is one of the best catering service. I have ever met. All the dishes served on my leaf was really fantastic. In this reception. The counters which was provided near the function Hall had really hot authentic quality which includes bun, butter, jam, popcorn sugar can install Panipuri and et cetera. My family really enjoyed, and we have also confirmed to go with Venus scattering Service for our upcoming wedding events. Thank you so much, Gurumurthy Sir.','2026-03-28 16:54:28.950450',1579,319,769),('sholinghur Rajesh Kumar',5,'This is Rajesh Kumar, who gave opportunity to Venus Catering,  all the food they served at our wedding function was so yummy and the way they Served melted us, Gurumurrthy sir have become one of our family member after this function, each of our relative was very much satisfied with the food as well as hospitality. Thank you so much, sir, for making our function, this much grand.','2026-03-28 16:54:28.954344',1580,319,769),('Spooky 25t',5,'Today, I had food at Venus catering service reception dinner at Prince Mahal, Neelangarai. The Food served was hot and delicious. Starting from pickle till ice cream. They have provided counters was too good. I have been for many other events, but Venus is so special in all aspects like service, food, quality, and presentation, best suitable for all wedding events.','2026-03-28 16:54:28.958253',1581,319,769),('M. Karthik',5,'Tester at Venus catering service on 30 January. All the food quality were excellent. All of my relatives were satisfied at this scattering. We can go for the scattering without any further doubts. Really great from to last ice cream. The quality was top notch really liked. I have got a scattering Service visiting card from the owner to book for my upcoming family wedding event.','2026-03-28 16:54:28.962368',1582,319,769),('Venkateshwaran Ganeshan',5,'I would like to express my heartfelt appreciation to Venus Catering and its proprietor, Mr Gurumoorthy, along with his dedicated team members, for their outstanding service.\n\nFrom the very beginning, they clearly understood our requirements and expectations. The menu was thoughtfully prepared exactly as discussed, and the delivery was completed ahead of time. What truly impressed us was how efficiently they utilized the extra time for their pre-preparations, ensuring everything was perfectly organized and ready.\n\nEvery single item mentioned in the menu was delivered exactly as promised—irrespective of portion, quantity, or size. There were no compromises at all. Most importantly, the taste was exceptional. Each dish was flavorful, fresh, and thoroughly enjoyed by everyone.\n\nTheir professionalism, commitment, and consistency clearly reflect how their business continues to grow and earn the trust of more and more customers.\n\nWishing Mr Gurumoorthy, his family members, and especially his hardworking catering team continued success, prosperity, and many more milestones ahead. Highly recommended!','2026-03-28 16:54:28.965704',1583,319,769),('Divya Lakshmi',5,'Hi,This is Divya Lakshmi from paddapai.I just wanted to thank you so much for the food which you provided for my brother\'s wedding and reception held on March 5th .I was just blank on choosing catering service ,I took Mr Dharmadurai Anna\'s number for Google and contacted him regarding the availability for catering service.The way he approached us was really very excellent and friendly.Food quality was delicious, authentic and brushing with flavours. The service and staff of SRI Diya Catering was professional,well trained and near. One of the best catering with affordable price and organised team. Dharmadurai anna was too reliable. He took care of everything from top to bottom. Apart from being a catering service he became a part of our family member. This is not just for review,a very true words from my heart. Thank you so much Anna. You will be our trusted family catering service forever. Waiting for our next family functions to book you team. Everyone who attended the function said the food was just amazing,,,\nThank you Anna','2026-03-28 16:54:33.356041',1584,320,774),('Mohan Raj',5,'High-quality food at an affordable price. The best part is the excellent service provided by the catering staff. They serve the food professionally and take great care of the guests. We can completely trust them and enjoy the function without any tension.\n\nThank you Darmadurai brother. He taken care of our function as our family member❤️❤️❤️','2026-03-28 16:54:33.360457',1585,320,774),('jegan jegan',5,'I recently booked Diya Catering for my daughter\'s first birthday party, and they exceeded every expectation! From start to finish, they were punctual, professional, and incredibly attentive to every detail. The sambar rice was top-notch—perfectly spiced and a crowd favorite—while the flavors of the starters were extraordinary, leaving everyone wanting more. The food overall was outstanding and became the talk of the event. Their care and service were fantastic, turning a special day into an unforgettable one. Highly recommend them for any celebration!','2026-03-28 16:54:33.364092',1586,320,774),('Akshi Anvi',5,'We had an amazing experience with the diya catering service at our reception on Jan 30,2026. The food varieties were truly impressive, with every dish prepared perfectly and full of flavour. A special mention to the veg fish fry — it was absolutely top-notch and one of the most loved items by our guests. The rasamalai was equally delicious, soft, and perfectly sweet, making it a memorable dessert.\nThe overall presentation, taste, and quality exceeded our expectations, and many of our guests personally appreciated the food. Thank you to the entire team for making our special day even more memorable with such wonderful catering.','2026-03-28 16:54:33.367006',1587,320,774),('Adhi Kesavan',5,'I had ordered Sri Diya Catering Services for my wedding reception. From the beginning of the order they kept in touch with us and planned the event well,All the food was delicious, Most importantly they communicated well using Walkie Talkie during the service and served us very well. All our relatives praised the food. Overall we were completely satisfied. I would like Thanks to the owner Mr. Dharmadurai and the Sri Diya Catering Service team. 🥰🤝','2026-03-28 16:54:33.370255',1588,320,774),('Sammy',5,'We booked KMR Caterers for my sister’s wedding, and they did an amazing job from start to finish. The food quality was excellent, with a wide variety of delicious dishes that all our guests loved. Everything was served fresh and on time, and the staff managed the crowd very professionally. Many guests appreciated the taste and presentation. Thanks to their service, our wedding felt grand and complete. Highly recommended for any special occasion.','2026-03-28 16:54:37.513211',1589,321,776),('Dharani Kalimuthu',4,'Very impressed with the food quality and hygiene.\nThe chutneys and gravies were rich and tasty.\nThey maintained punctual timing throughout.\nGuests appreciated the traditional banana leaf service.\nWorth every rupee spent.','2026-03-28 16:54:37.516613',1590,321,776),('Arun Kumar',5,'The catering service was absolutely wonderful. The food quality was excellent, and every dish was delicious and fresh. The presentation was neat and attractive. The staff members were polite and served guests with a smile. All our relatives appreciated the taste and variety. Highly recommended for wedding functions.','2026-03-28 16:54:37.519718',1591,321,776),('Athulya P R',4,'Authentic Tamil style food with amazing taste.\nBanana leaf meals were served beautifully.\nEvery guest enjoyed the traditional flavours.\nClean and hygienic preparation.\nVery satisfying catering service.\nGreat experience with this catering team.\nThe food was hot, tasty, and fresh.\nThe dessert section was a big hit.\nStaff were polite and cooperative.\nLooking forward to booking them again.','2026-03-28 16:54:37.524067',1592,321,776),('Shadow yt',5,'My friend refernce kmr catering service in my brother wedding reception. Iam booked 1000 people veg order. All items and chat items, LED stalls, service persons very amazing. Very highlighted Badamhalwa, jackfruit briyani, bisibiabath very Delicious.                                             Iam only 20% payment only pay before event but no compromise quality and quantity.                                            All my feriends and family members everybody positive feedback.                                                                    Iam high recommend KMR catering services in future my family functions..','2026-03-28 16:54:37.527606',1593,321,776),('Illayaraja',5,'Good food. I definitely recommend this catering service','2026-03-28 16:54:45.180920',1594,322,777),('Aerospace Engineering Association IITM',5,'We had ordered food from S2 Caterers for our Aero Nite event at IIT Madras, and the experience was excellent! The quality and quantity of the food were both outstanding.\nThank you for making our event a success! We’ll definitely reach out again for future occasions.','2026-03-28 16:54:45.183904',1595,322,777),('maha lakshmi',5,'Excellent 👌👌 food as well as guest visit also soo good it\'s amazing 😍😍 no waiting for the food communication in team approach is super👌👌','2026-03-28 16:54:45.187300',1596,322,777),('Latha Muthu',5,'Excellent catering service. Hari and Karthik were very kind and humble. Their service was very nice. Food taste was toooo good.Best caterersfor all events.','2026-03-28 16:54:45.191379',1597,322,777),('Ranjith R',5,'I recently had the pleasure of experiencing S2 Catering, and I must say — they absolutely exceeded expectations! From the delicious spread to the professional service, everything was top-notch. The food was fresh, flavorful, and beautifully presented. Special mention to their South Indian dishes — authentic taste with a homely touch!\n\nTheir team was punctual, well-organized, and very responsive to our needs.','2026-03-28 16:54:45.194833',1598,322,777),('vicky anbumani',5,'Excellent juicy mutton briyani 65 and specially prean gravy i personally suggest this cmlimbracatering you can blindly trust them and enjoy your function without any tension 🥳','2026-03-28 16:54:49.325597',1599,323,782),('venkatesh M',1,'CM Limra Caterers completely ruined my wedding experience.\nThey handled catering for my engagement in Chennai, and the food quality was good, which is why I trusted them and booked them for both my Christian wedding and traditional wedding in Karaikudi.\nHowever, the traditional wedding on February 22 in Karaikudi was a total disaster.\n\nDespite their promises and claims of being experts—especially biriyani—the biriyani was overcooked, the rice was completely ruined, and the overall quality was far below what they had delivered in Chennai. They had clearly promised no chicken wings, yet wings were found in the biriyani.\nThey also forgot to add white sesame seeds (ellu) in Chicken 65. When I questioned this, their response was casual and irresponsible—they said they forgot and even claimed it was “not part of the menu.” I honestly don’t understand how Chicken 65 can be served without white sesame seeds.\n\nOther issues:\nParotta was not cooked properly\n\nThey offer ponnu mappilai virundhu utter waste they use gimmick words\n\nTheir bread halwa is one of the best i know but they ruined that too seriously i can\'t believe what they did to us\n\nMutton gravy was below standard\nFood quality was nowhere near what they advertised or delivered earlier\nI personally spoke to the owners Suhail and Sudarshan, but instead of taking responsibility, they manipulated the situation and kept changing their statements. If customers are not knowledgeable about food, they may believe their explanations—but the reality is very different.\n\nWe paid several lakhs, yet they refunded only ₹20,000, which is unacceptable given the damage caused to a once-in-a-lifetime event. On top of this, they cancelled my upcoming event on February 26 at the last minute and refunded the amount when I was already in a very difficult situation.\nThis experience caused immense stress, embarrassment, and disappointment to my family and guests.\nPlease think twice before booking CM Limra Caterers, especially for important life events. Based on my experience, they are highly unprofessional and extremely manipulative when things go wrong.','2026-03-28 16:54:49.328768',1600,323,782),('P.Nithya Sree',5,'Absolutely delicious biryani. We ordered both veg and non-veg meals for our family wedding reception. The quality, taste, and quantity of the food is stunning. All our guests kept asking which catering service the food was ordered from.\n\nThe service team was very good. Really appreciate your service and your food too. We are planning to order again for our family\'s upcoming functions.\n\nSpecial thanks to the entire Limra Catering team.','2026-03-28 16:54:49.333214',1601,323,782),('Vinoth Kannan',2,'The big day was unfortunately ruined. Despite many objections, I chose to book Limra from Chennai for our native wedding event because I wanted to provide the best food possible.\n\nBiryani was the main dish, but they failed to deliver even the bare minimum quality. Most of the plates had soggy, overcooked rice. It was truly disappointing, especially in a region that is known for its food culture.\n\nThe previous day’s Idiyappam had the same issue. Although feedback from relatives was mixed, my only intention was to serve the best food to everyone. We trusted Limra for that — but sadly, it did not meet our expectations. We FAILED.','2026-03-28 16:54:49.336254',1602,323,782),('Prashanth Udhayakumar',5,'Catering was done very well. Food was excellent and especially the biriyani — the best! 👍🏻\nAll non-veg starters were really good. Price is also very nominal.\nTheir coordination and transparency throughout the service was great. Really satisfied! ✅','2026-03-28 16:54:49.339391',1603,323,782),('iam kaffeinated',5,'I had ordered for my Daughters 1st birthday and they had delivered on time and in sufficient quantity and everyone was satisfied with the taste and hygiene standards . The welcome drink , dessert and as well as Mutton Biryani were relished by all family members and we were able to relax a bit due to their hospitality. Thank you for making the event special','2026-03-28 16:54:52.136764',1604,324,784),('Raja Muni',5,'Very low budget but tasty and quality very good delivery timing very sharp\"','2026-03-28 16:54:52.139987',1605,324,784),('Tamil Tamil',5,'We ordered breakfast and lunch for our house warming ceremony.\nIt was very very tasty.\nThank you for SL STAR CATERING serving us the best food..','2026-03-28 16:54:52.143482',1606,324,784),('guna sekaran',5,'Very good.......  Tasty food  for affordable price','2026-03-28 16:54:52.146784',1607,324,784),('Govidan Tk',5,'SL  Star Catering Services  team. Wedding Reception and Marriage very good variety of food items at nominal price. The stalls put up in the reception hall was amazing. Excellent taste and they served very hot all dishes are very tasty. I received excellent feedback from  our both family members and friends.','2026-03-28 16:54:52.150308',1608,324,784),('shiva priya',5,'We booked Anandhaa catering service for our baby shower function & we were glad that we made the right choice..!\nThe food was extremely good and all the function attendees praised us for the tasty food. Everyone were very happy with the taste of food & the service provided.\nChildren were specially taken care of what they wanted while they were served with food.\nOverall we had a very pleasant experience with the caterer…they were on time & the service provided by people was very satisfactory..! ❤️','2026-03-28 16:54:58.760136',1609,325,785),('Santhosh IT',5,'Today I had my house warming ceremony and food was delicious.I have not expected this one .\nI strongly recommend everyone to book with Anandha catering services.Their Staffs are also very nice and hospitality is amazing .\nWe all are happy in our family and thankful to the service provided .\nRates are also nominal and 100% worth for money .','2026-03-28 16:54:58.763154',1610,325,785),('Balamurugan G',5,'Excellent catering service. The food was absolutely delicious and well presented. The staff were polite and punctual. Truly made our event special','2026-03-28 16:54:58.765833',1611,325,785),('vasudevan I.v',5,'We have wonderful experience of of having a delicious breakfast on our grahapravesham on 16 th April. Please keep it up','2026-03-28 16:54:58.768214',1612,325,785),('Akshaya Kasinathan',5,'We booked for my sisters wedding. The food, arrangements they did was just wow. Their service was really super, they took care each and every one. We actually got good reviews from our friends and family. I highly recommend Anandhaa catering for ur special day','2026-03-28 16:54:58.770992',1613,325,785),('mani maha',5,'We had a great experience with this catering service. The food was delicious, fresh, and well presented. All dishes were served on time and the quantity was more than sufficient for our guests. The staff were polite, professional, and well organized. Many guests appreciated the taste and quality of the food. Overall, we are very satisfied and would highly recommend this catering service for any function.','2026-03-28 16:55:07.933743',1614,326,790),('chitra krish',5,'I have recently attended a marriage reception in NPR Hall, near Kovilambakkam. The food served was very tasty and excellent. Moreover, the persons who served were very kind enough to serve whatever we asked. They even asked us what we require and provide the same. Totally, both the food and the persons who served were very good enough to recommend them to any of our known sources.','2026-03-28 16:55:07.937301',1615,326,790),('Deepa Yuvaraj',5,'Very nice and a good taste of food for all kinds of function without doubt just gohead they give good service and tasty food','2026-03-28 16:55:07.940383',1616,326,790),('Ponvel Selvam',5,'Hi Everyone,\n\nWe had our wedding on the 28th of August, 2025, and chose Haritha Catering Services for both the reception and the wedding. The food was of excellent quality and tasted amazing. A big thank you to the entire team for providing such wonderful service. Wishing you continued success and many more opportunities to serve with the same dedication and quality!','2026-03-28 16:55:07.943680',1617,326,790),('M.santhanam KPM',5,'What I personally like about them is that they don\'t compromise on taste in their cooking, they serve quality delicious food and their care is also very good.','2026-03-28 16:55:07.946655',1618,326,790),('Saranya N',5,'We had a great dinning in one of freinds daughter birthday party. Motton biryani was top notch. Great service from the team as well.','2026-03-28 16:55:16.718330',1619,327,795),('Murali S',1,'The service was extremely poor and completely unacceptable. Guests are bound to leave dissatisfied and disappointed. The individual serving the food demonstrated a total lack of responsibility, professionalism, and attention to detail. There was no sense of urgency, courtesy, or basic hospitality. If this continues, it will seriously damage your reputation and drive customers away.','2026-03-28 16:55:16.721526',1620,327,795),('Karpagam K',5,'Excellent food and Service done by Mr.Kasi Pandian. He helped us right from menu planning, timely delivery and tasty lunch. I will definitely and willingly recommend him for all our\nfamily functions','2026-03-28 16:55:16.724398',1621,327,795),('Ahmed Ali',5,'Fantastic nice super\nKitchen master very very good\nVery nice talking all Workers','2026-03-28 16:55:16.727801',1622,327,795),('Ratnasamy kamaraj',5,'Had our daughter marriage function on 20th August  2023 .\nService and food was well appreciated by all our guest.\nDinner was highlight. Both quality and quantity was well planned and  personal attention was given by both Mr.Ramakrishnan and his Son Mr.Kasi Pandian. All our guests was highly impressed by food and services.','2026-03-28 16:55:16.730792',1623,327,795),('Ajith .p',5,'Sister wedding event given order to TCS catering\nFood was excellent and service good','2026-03-28 16:55:24.837076',1624,328,800),('santhana murugan',5,'Sister engagement given the catering order. Quality of food excellent\nThanks Dinesh','2026-03-28 16:55:24.840587',1625,328,800),('SIVAMANI BALAN',5,'Good catering services and I give ratings for 10/10','2026-03-28 16:55:24.844038',1626,328,800),('J. Prince',5,'We booked them for our house warming as well as for my son’s reception. Taste of all the dishes were excellent and all the guests were very much satisfied with food and shared their appreciation.','2026-03-28 16:55:24.847394',1627,328,800),('vellappa',5,'We booked them for our house warming ceremony ..all our guests complimented the food specially sambhar ven pongal ..thanks to Mr.Dinesh Sir for giving us the best breakfast and lunch....','2026-03-28 16:55:24.850317',1628,328,800),('Rajesh Kumar G',5,'⭐⭐⭐⭐⭐\nWe had ordered Chinese food menu through SMR Event Management for my daughter’s birthday on 5th August, and it was a fantastic experience! The food was flavorful, fresh, and perfectly suited for both kids and adults.\n\nOur guests couldn’t stop praising the taste — especially the noodles and Mutton Pepper Masala.The team ensured timely delivery and everything was neatly packed. Really impressed with the quality and service. Thank you, SMR,(Mr Udaya Kumar)for making the celebration even better with your amazing food!','2026-03-28 16:55:34.631996',1629,329,805),('Sri Kumar',5,'Feast is what that stays in heart in any event. Thank you, Udhay bro. U r excellent in what u do. You made our day by staying with your commitment and serving us tasty food. You not only served us good food but also gave us some stats to plan for the guests. You were honest in telling us the count to volume ratio helping to control cost. Very Customer friendly and honest person. Thank you again.','2026-03-28 16:55:34.635124',1630,329,805),('janani dinesh',5,'would like to mention that the catering service was truly amazing. The food was very tasty, of premium quality, and offered at an extremely economical price. We placed an Ayyappa Puja order with them, and they did an excellent job.\n\nIt was not just regular Ayyappa Puja prasadam—the taste was rich, luxurious, and felt very premium. I highly recommend SMR  catering services for both quality and value.','2026-03-28 16:55:34.638301',1631,329,805),('Gopi Krish',5,'The food and service were absolutely awesome! Every dish was delicious, fresh, and full of flavor. The staff were polite, attentive, and made sure we had a great food. Briyani and bread halwa chance ah ila.. the taste was awesome.. udhaya anna thanks alot for my making daughter birthday with tasty food.. ur boys was excellent.. well organised.. no words to express my happiness.. thanks a lot anna...','2026-03-28 16:55:34.641446',1632,329,805),('Shobana Bala',5,'I just wanted to express how truly satisfying it was to receive compliments about the food. The service was outstanding as well, and it warmed my heart to see everyone enjoying the ilaneer payasam – it was simply remarkable! I insisted on adding the agra pan sweet to the menu, and I’m so glad it made such a positive impression on those who tried it. Keep up the wonderful work; I’m genuinely rooting for your continued success. All the best to you! SMR CATERING','2026-03-28 16:55:34.644994',1633,329,805),('saravanan pksk',5,'Food was very good. Recently I have held my baby first birthday at the party hall. Food was very good. Thanks','2026-03-28 16:55:39.534406',1634,330,807),('Y Madhu',5,'Thanks for making my reception event so delightful. I thought the taste of food would be ok ok.but after the event we all realised food was awesome. Not tried this briyani taste anywhere in Chennai. Thanks Sangeetha catering for a delicious and hygiene food.\nAll my family events we fixed Sangeetha catering for further.','2026-03-28 16:55:39.538089',1635,330,807),('Abitha B',4,'Decorations awesome 💯 and food is not bad 😊 thankyou for Sangeetha catering 💐','2026-03-28 16:55:39.542373',1636,330,807),('KD raji KD',5,'taste food next time any family circle functions i refer it’s sangeetha catering service ⭐️⭐️⭐️⭐️⭐️','2026-03-28 16:55:39.547068',1637,330,807),('gold fruit',5,'Recently  My daughter betrothal function\nheld  in  kalmandapam party hall , every moment was very nice , Staff  are  polite and hospitality\nEvery guest enjoyed Mutton Biryani  ,  all dishes  are  very  tasty\nIf  you seek  catering,  Sangeetha Catering\nwill be  Best choice','2026-03-28 16:55:39.559873',1638,330,807),('Madesh Baskaran',5,'Best catering service in Chennai','2026-03-28 16:55:46.300815',1639,331,809),('Dhayalan arumugam',4,'I got good experience and their food also nice','2026-03-28 16:55:46.304309',1640,331,809),('G U N A',5,'Good service especially foods','2026-03-28 16:55:46.307988',1641,331,809),('veldurai sakthivel',1,'Shocked by seeing their rating in google reviews, this catering has capable to get 1star that\'s all\nYesterday 02mar2025 dinner and morning 03mar2025 breakfast i had with this catering on behalf of my colleague marriage in ADPT NITHI MARRIAGE HALL,ALANDUR.\nDinner review as below:\nsweet not even to break in hand,regular paneer butter masala with tasteleass chapathi, dry tomato rice in the name of VEG BRIYANI,onion Raitha without curd, sambar with worst quality dhall, average rasam, அவியல்,potato வறுவல் Nd poriyal are ok,\nLast but not least they add வாழை இலை as one of the item in their menu,\nBreakfast review as below\nHalf boiled or baked Ravai கேசரி in the name of kasi அல்வா, stone idly with regular round ஷேப் in the name of heartin idly, tasteless pongal, poori ok, readymade இடியாப்பம் with vadakari ok\nAlso வாழை இலை is one of the menu in their item,\nThey make think buffalo and other animals make eat after disposal,\n\nNo order in supply\nDispute raised within them while supply,\nLess Manpower for supply\n\nDon\'t go blindly with google review\nThis is my honesr review,','2026-03-28 16:55:46.311448',1642,331,809),('Hemaharish',5,'The taste was so good and then the arrangement was good tho','2026-03-28 16:55:46.315184',1643,331,809),('Aparna Gopalarangan',5,'When it comes to orchestrating a seamless wedding experience, food and hospitality play a pivotal role in leaving a lasting impression on guests. The A to Z catering arrangements for my sister’s wedding were entrusted to Mr. Babu, the proprietor of Madipakkam Saraswathi Catering, who demonstrated exceptional professionalism and artistry in executing every detail flawlessly. Mr. Babu showed remarkable attention to detail, ensuring that all the necessary items for each event were meticulously prepared and delivered on time.\n\nTaste-wise, the catering stood out with its wide variety of dishes, each reminiscent of comforting home-cooked meals. The food was not only flavourful but also balanced, appealing to diverse palates without sacrificing authenticity.\n\nMadipakkam Saraswathi Catering made the wedding not just an event, but a cherished memory for all involved, under the guidance of Mr. Babu, orchestrating a beautiful culinary experience with flawless execution, impeccable timing, heartfelt hospitality, and artistic finesse. For anyone seeking a catering service that treats your occasion with respect and creativity, his work stands as an exemplary benchmark.','2026-03-28 16:55:54.417214',1644,332,811),('Anusha Gopalarangan',5,'We had a fantastic experience with Babu and their team! The food was absolutely delicious -  every dish was fresh, flavorful, and beautifully presented. From the very first meeting to the final course served, the entire experience was seamless, professional and beyond expectations. The way they managed and arranged everything was simply impressive, making the whole setup look grand and elegant. The team was super helpful, attentive, and made sure everything went smoothly from start to finish. Their efforts truly added a special touch to the event. Would definitely recommend them to anyone looking for great food and excellent service!','2026-03-28 16:55:54.421084',1645,332,811),('Swetha Shankar',5,'🌟 A Review Straight from the Heart for Saraswathi Catering (Madipakkam) & Mr. Babu 🌟\n\nSome people are born with a special gift, and Mr. Babu of Saraswathi Catering is truly one of them. The way he cooks is nothing short of divine — it feels like food blessed by the gods themselves.\n\nI first tasted his food at the Kamakshi Amman Temple in Karthigeyapuram, and honestly, it felt like I was eating food straight from heaven. Later, at a friend’s function, I couldn’t resist asking who the cook was — and there was Babu, smiling from the corner. From then on, he became our family’s go-to chef for every special occasion.\n\nWhen my baby’s naming ceremony came, we didn’t think twice — Babu cooked for us, and his rasam was simply out of this world. My mother still talks about that rasam even today!\n\nWhat touches me most is that Babu doesn’t just serve food — he serves love. During a very difficult time, when we had to arrange food for my mother-in-law’s death ceremonies, our large Brahmin family (who usually never eat outside food during such times) trusted him completely. I just sent him the menu once, and everything came perfectly — no reminders, no tension, just comforting food made with care.\n\nBabu’s smile itself feels like an ingredient — it fills your heart as much as his food fills your stomach. He brings not just flavor, but peace and happiness to everyone he serves.\n\nI truly wish that God blesses Babu with all the health, wealth, and happiness in the world — because he deserves nothing less. 🙏✨','2026-03-28 16:55:54.424806',1646,332,811),('Srinivasan Hariharan',4,'We had a wonderful experience with Madipakkam Saraswathi Cater\'s Babu and their team! The food was absolutely delicious — every dish was flavorful, fresh, and beautifully presented. The way they managed and arranged everything was truly impressive; the setup looked grand and well-organized. Their attention to detail and professionalism made the entire event seamless and enjoyable. Highly recommend them for anyone looking for top-quality catering with a touch of class!!','2026-03-28 16:55:54.428720',1647,332,811),('Shyamala A',5,'We know Babu anna and his father for nearly 30 years, he has catered for all the functions in our house. The food and the arrangements are all very excellent  and he is a very good and dedicated person. Yesterday we had a function in our house , the food and the services were very good. Thank you anna','2026-03-28 16:55:54.432186',1648,332,811),('Ramanan M',5,'Recently, our family had the wonderful opportunity to attend a wedding celebration. It was truly a memorable and joyous occasion filled with happiness, laughter, and beautiful moments. One of the highlights of the event was undoubtedly the dinner that was served. The food was absolutely fabulous — every dish was rich in flavor, perfectly prepared, and presented with great care.\n\nFrom the appetizers to the desserts, each item had an exceptional taste that reflected both quality and authenticity. The variety offered catered to everyone’s preferences, and every bite was a delight. We genuinely enjoyed the entire dining experience, and it added so much more charm to an already special celebration. It was truly a feast to remember.','2026-03-28 16:56:09.003702',1649,333,816),('Shri Vatsan',5,'The catering was spot‑on—fresh, tasty dishes that hit all the right notes, and the service team was friendly, prompt, and super attentive. Everything ran smoothly, making the event stress‑free and enjoyable for everyone. Highly recommend!','2026-03-28 16:56:09.006682',1650,333,816),('Rajesh',5,'Sree Ambal Catering did an amazing job! The food was delicious and presentation was top-notch. Ilaneer payasam and panneer are awesome. Great service and very accommodating too. Highly recommend for your events!\" :)','2026-03-28 16:56:09.010463',1651,333,816),('Suresh G',5,'Ambal catering took care of my Son wedding reception in Shri Vaaru Mandapam, Vanagaram on 20/2/26. We received very good feedback from all our guests.\n\nOur guest estimate was very poor, but Ambal catering managed the crowd with ease. 50% extra guests attended the reception and everyone was served dinner with out any major hiccups\n\nWe thank them for the support and will strongly recommend them for my friends with out any hesitation','2026-03-28 16:56:09.013133',1652,333,816),('Avinash Kumaran',5,'We had this team cater for my sister’s wedding, and their service was simply outstanding! The food they provided was fabulous — every single dish served on the leaf was perfect. Even if you try to find a flaw in their menu, you won’t find one!\n\nThe quality, taste, and presentation were all top-notch. Every guest and family member praised the food and the excellent service — from the staff all the way up to the owner, their professionalism and warmth were remarkable.\n\nI was so impressed that I chose the same catering team for my own wedding, and once again, they delivered fabulously! The consistency in their cooking and service is something truly special.\n\nIf you’re planning a wedding, I strongly recommend giving them a try. Once you experience their catering, your family and guests will be talking about your wedding food for years!','2026-03-28 16:56:09.015824',1653,333,816),('Gayathri Sankaranarayanan',5,'Year 2023 we got introduced to Shirdi Sai Catering service in a marriage....the food was fantabulous and all the arrangements.  With that GOODWILL we gave him the contract to organise for my in-laws SATHABHISEKHAM which was held during SEPTEMBER 2024. The arrangements were FANTABULOUS.  Below is the note I personally wrote to the owner of Shirdi Sai Catering. One of the best in the market currently with affordable budget range & ensuring VALUE FOR MONEY, SUPERIOR QUALITY & GRANDEUR.\nTHIAGU BROTHER - Now that all the Euphoria has settled I really want to extend my heartfelt THANK YOU & GRATITUDE to the ENTIRE TEAM OF SHIRDI SAI CATERING.  We APPRECIATE all the arrangements and the way your team managed the crowd. The small small nuances like having Padmavathi Thaayar & Lord Balaji in paruppu thengai koodu + that Small Chocolate hampers with occasion name & with my in-laws photo were I need to say like directors touch in a film it was THIAGU brothers touch in the catering.  Overall, we received positive feedback from almost all the guests and family.  Hope we celebrate more happy functions with your team.\n\nWith lots of love\nGayathri Sankaranarayanan & Family','2026-03-28 16:56:14.544111',1654,334,821),('Sridhar Pandian',5,'Namaskaram,\nSai Catering came to my student\'s performance and did everything properly. The food was of very high quality and delicious. Therefore, even though we had asked Sai Catering for our home function, they provided very high quality and delicious food and made us and all our relatives happy. We express our gratitude to them. Those who see this review, please ask Sai without any thought. Ask Sai Catering for your home special and enjoy it too...','2026-03-28 16:56:14.547616',1655,334,821),('Suresh',5,'Shirdi Sai catering we order for my daughter wedding function around 500 people, and the entire experience was absolutely wonderful. The team was absolutely good. Thanks to Mr.Thiyagarajan','2026-03-28 16:56:14.550411',1656,334,821),('D M',5,'I tasted the food at a wedding catered by Velachery Shirdi Sai Catering and it was really delicious. Every item was fresh, well-cooked, and full of flavour. Truly enjoyed the meal!','2026-03-28 16:56:14.553255',1657,334,821),('yuvaraj',5,'Shridi sai catering. I had best experience with this catering. They service wide variety for our family function. They provides us an option to customise the menu and very much accommodative for our requiredment. Thank you','2026-03-28 16:56:14.556918',1658,334,821),('Divya S',5,'We hired Shanmuga Catering for a recent wedding reception and the morning Muhurtham, and they were exceptional! The South Indian food was authentic and tasted amazing—our guests couldn\'t stop praising the flavors. A special shoutout to the owner, Satya, who managed the entire crowd with so much professionalism and ease. The service was prompt and seamless. Highly recommended for anyone looking for top-tier catering in Chennai!','2026-03-28 16:56:20.271880',1659,335,826),('Rokesh Cs',5,'We recently arranged catering from Shanmuga Catering Services for my son’s first birthday celebration, and the experience was excellent.\n\nThe food quality, taste, and presentation were outstanding. All our guests really enjoyed the meal and appreciated the authentic flavors. The team was very professional and ensured everything was served on time.\n\nEvery dish was fresh, flavorful, and perfectly prepared. The Chicken Biryani and Chilli Fish were especially loved by our guests, and the Shahi Tukda was a perfect sweet ending to the meal.\n\nThank you to the entire Shanmuga Catering team for making our son’s first birthday celebration memorable. Highly recommended for anyone looking for quality catering services!','2026-03-28 16:56:20.274992',1660,335,826),('Koteesvaran Govindraj',5,'Scs is excellent food quality professional and attentive staff....Great taste on time delivery best pricing..overall excellent caterer...Thank you for your service and made our day so special with your food.....','2026-03-28 16:56:20.278203',1661,335,826),('Jagan Nagalingam',5,'We recently hired this catering service for our baby shower, found through a last-minute Google search. Honestly, we didn’t expect the food to be this delicious! The service was excellent, all dishes were served hot, and the taste was absolutely amazing. Highly recommended for anyone looking for reliable caterers in Chennai, especially around Valasaravakkam. Special thanks to Mr.Satya🙌🏼','2026-03-28 16:56:20.281389',1662,335,826),('Jaison Robin',3,'First time booked this catering service and almost all the items for the full veg meals were nice and fantastic.quantity was enormous and well provided.\n\nBest items : Sambhar | Vathakolambhu | bread Halwa | Paal Payasam | National Poriyal\n\nWhy it didn\'t top the 2 stars are for the following reasons\n\n1.Rice could have been cooked well. As it was little shredded, For hotels i guess it would have worked out but for home supplying home function - they got to work on this one more better.\n2. Veg briyani was not having any veggies in it only beans were in it. Especially one of them said they saw a tiny piece of carrot.kinda disappointed\n3.Paper Roll for serving was not provided either !!\n\nHonest feedback from each n everyone for providing their feedback review into this as one.\n\nFeel free to reach out if anything else','2026-03-28 16:56:20.284632',1663,335,826),('Neeraja R',5,'The best wedding planners and catering services you could ask for no exaggeration just facts they\'ve been doing this for 40 years & it\'s evident, they had planned & catered for my wedding like their own family wedding, it was seamless and the food was top notch received endless compliments for the same, people who flew in from other states found the food to be divine❤️ which is exactly what I wanted. Thank you to Mr.Balaji Srinivasan & his Team - Karunkaran Sir, Moorthy Sir, Hariharan Sir, Durga Maami and everyone else part of the team for seamless execution and the incredible warmth of the team.\n\nFor a corporate girly seeing SOPs in place for everything & adhering to the same is reassuring & they have their own fleet of vehicles to get everything on time to avoid last minute hiccups.\n\nWedding industry is mostly unorganised, Toggling between vendors to get everything together can be incredibly draining, if you want a hassle free seamless experience trust the expertise of Sri Vigneshwara Caterers.','2026-03-28 16:56:30.220159',1664,336,829),('Praveena Puttum',4,'Good catering service at very reasonable rates in Nanganallur circle. I personally tasted their food and it was really satisfying. The highlight for me was the Fried Rice and the Sambar Rice – both were flavourful and perfectly cooked.\n\nEverything was served hot and fresh, and the team ensured the food reached on time with proper serving assistance. The quality and quantity were exactly as promised, which is highly appreciable.\n\nWhat I liked most is that the food tasted homely and healthy without any unnecessary additives. Overall, it was a great experience and I’m sure they will continue to earn a good reputation in the coming days.','2026-03-28 16:56:30.223579',1665,336,829),('Rajamani V',5,'For our  function in hall, we had so many options of caterers both already known and heard as well as those whom  I come across in insta and fb. Sri Vigneswara caterers are one whom I selected through online when I saw their profile as well as their  mentioning SOPs. I was skeptical on freshness since it has to be brought from almost 9 km away. But the owner assured on freshness and serving hot. As committed, the food and bakshanams were very good and guests gave positive feedbacks.','2026-03-28 16:56:30.226963',1666,336,829),('Masilamani',5,'Good catering service at affordable rates in Nanganallur circle. Timely despatch of food with adequate serving assistance is commendable. Food quality and quantity is as assured by them. Well commended for taste without adding any unhealthy  items. I am sure that they will gain more repute in the days to come\n- P. Masilamani\nAsstt.Commandant CISF(Rtd)\nNanganallur Chennai.','2026-03-28 16:56:30.230293',1667,336,829),('Adyasree Prakriti Sivakumar',5,'We’ve been with them for quite a few functions and we’ve never been disappointed. They outdo themselves each time. Special mention to Karna and Mr. Balaji for exceptional leadership skills and their management of services. Food quality, taste is always outstanding.','2026-03-28 16:56:30.233691',1668,336,829),('Ganeshkumar Ramadoss',5,'We had a great experience with Sai Lakshmi Catering services. The food was absolutely delicious, well prepared and beautifully served. Guests couldn\'t stop praising the taste. I will definitely order again for my upcoming functions in Sai Lakshmi.\n\nThank you very much for your outstanding catering service with High quality tasty food. Really very happy with the service.','2026-03-28 16:56:35.822025',1669,337,834),('selva ravagan',1,'🚨🚨 I had the worst experience with Sai Lakshmi Catering. I booked them based on the Google reviews, but now I seriously doubt how genuine those reviews are. The food quality was very poor and they completely ruined my function.\n\nFirst of all, they came late. On top of that, they even left some of the food inside the van instead of properly arranging everything on time. Because of their delay and careless handling, the entire event was affected.\n\nThe taste was bad — especially the payasam, which was not good at all. Many guests complained about the food quality. The service was unprofessional and poorly managed. There was no proper coordination from their side.\n\nAnother major issue is that if you book for 100 people, they prepare food exactly for 100 people — not even a little extra. In family functions, guest count can slightly vary, and any experienced caterer knows to keep some buffer. This shows a complete lack of planning and responsibility.\n\nThis is honestly the worst catering service I have ever seen. If you care about your family function and don’t want unnecessary stress or embarrassment, please think twice before choosing them.','2026-03-28 16:56:35.825355',1670,337,834),('Saadhvik Theyjo',4,'We booked them for breakfast catering for our house warming function, and the experience was wonderful. The food quality was good.The taste was authentic and homely, and all our guests appreciated it. The team was professional and handled everything smoothly. Highly recommended for family functions.One small suggestion for improvement,the idlis could have been kept covered to retain their softness and hygiene. Apart from that, everything was well managed.','2026-03-28 16:56:35.828515',1671,337,834),('Sastha A',5,'Hi, have seen the ratings and comments from people and ordered food with Sai Lakshmi Caterers. Food was really good !! And most importantly guests were happy and given good feedback about food. I strongly recommend you guys can go-ahead with Sai Lakshmi Caterers for your function.','2026-03-28 16:56:35.831723',1672,337,834),('Abishan Bose',5,'I ordered food for my company’s corporate event as a last-minute requirement. I was connected with Ms. Keerthana for the service. She was very kind and patiently explained everything, ensuring the food arrived on time. Overall, the experience was good, and the food was very tasty and of great quality.','2026-03-28 16:56:35.834779',1673,337,834),('Prakash A',5,'\"Dear Shankar Uncle and the RK Caterers team,\nI wanted to send a huge thank you for the incredible catering at my sister’s engagement. The food was truly unbelievable! From the refreshing welcome juice to the last scoop of ice cream, every single item was rich and delicious.\nOur guests haven\'t stopped talking about how tasteful everything was. Your service team was also wonderful and professional throughout the function. Thank you so much, Shankar Uncle, for providing such amazing food and helping make this auspicious day so special for our family. We truly appreciate it!','2026-03-28 16:56:42.137071',1674,338,835),('KISHORE KUMAR S',5,'The food was absolutely excellent, and all our guests were delighted with both the taste and the quality of service. The team managed everything so smoothly, making the entire event truly memorable. They were punctual, and every detail was perfectly aligned.\n\nA special thanks to Mr. Shankar for his dedication and guidance-from helping us choose the right menu to ensuring everything went perfectly till the end. Also, a big shout-out to Mr. Saravanan and Mr. Srini for taking care of the service and arrangements flawlessly.\n\nThis is by far the best catering service l\'ve experienced, and I would definitely choose them for all my future family events.','2026-03-28 16:56:42.141352',1675,338,835),('Balaji Arumugam',5,'We are beyond grateful to our amazing marriage caterer for delivering an unforgettable culinary experience at both our wedding and reception. Every single dish was prepared with perfection, served with warmth, and appreciated by every guest.\nMany of our family and friends personally complimented the food, saying it was one of the best wedding meals they’ve had. We highly recommend your catering service to anyone looking for quality, taste, and excellence!','2026-03-28 16:56:42.144650',1676,338,835),('Manonmani',5,'The food quality and taste were excellent. Catering for around 600 members, the team delivered consistently good food with great taste, freshness, and proper quantity. All dishes were well cooked and well appreciated by everyone. Overall, it was a very satisfying experience, and we are happy with the service. Especially, the food was delivered before the committed time.','2026-03-28 16:56:42.148484',1677,338,835),('karthik kar',5,'Excellent food and service. All our guests were very happy and satisfied. Thanked us even for such good. We are very thankful to make our function a great success .','2026-03-28 16:56:42.151997',1678,338,835),('jaya thulasee',4,'We ordered breakfast and lunch from Lakshana caterers for our house warming function. They arranged food on a correct time that we mentioned and the taste was also good. They have many options in their menu list to select.\nBut when u order the number of counts u should order the exact number otherwise it will not be sufficient.\nOver all we liked their service.','2026-03-28 16:56:45.988800',1679,339,840),('Senthil kumaran',4,'We ordered lunch for 70 people, and everything was exceptional.\n\nThe food presentation was beautiful, and the taste was delicious. I received many compliments from our guests about the quality and variety of the dishes. They were truly impressed!\n\nI also wanted to commend your team on their prompt response and patience throughout the planning process. Your team was always available to answer my questions and accommodate any requests, which made everything much smoother.\n\nOverall, Lakshana Catering Service exceeded my expectations and played a significant role in making our baby shower a memorable event. Thank you again for your outstanding service!','2026-03-28 16:56:45.992523',1680,339,840),('Kiruba Shankar',5,'Had availed services of Lakshana Caterers.\n\nThe chicken biryani was flavorful and aromatic, a definite highlight, the chicken pieces were well cooked and soft. The brinjal dish was exceptional, offering a delightful and well-seasoned vegetarian option. The chicken 65 was spicy and well-marinated. The accompanying raita was a refreshing and cooling counterpoint to the richer dishes, perfectly complementing the biryani. The catering service was very good overall.\n\nExceptional briyani !!\nWould rate it out 10/10.','2026-03-28 16:56:45.995709',1681,339,840),('Saranya S',5,'Consistent taste everytime...we booked Lakshana catering for past three functions..... everytime guests are more than satisfied with the food taste...vathakozhumbu, parrupu payasam was ultimate....serving service is also good.... happy customer always..I recommend this provider for all our great occasion','2026-03-28 16:56:45.999362',1682,339,840),('Diwa',5,'Always the best in business and the taste is in very high quality, no one can tell much wrong about the taste, also their serving is top class, just give your food order to them','2026-03-28 16:56:46.002798',1683,339,840),('bhavani Simhan',5,'We had arranged catering from Sri Aravind Catering Service for my daughter\'s arangetram on 29th of July 2023. The food and the packaging was all too good. We received a lot of appreciation for the food and the arrangements. Thanks to the caterer Mr.Ramesh for the wonderful service which made our event even more special and memorable for us.','2026-03-28 16:56:56.389238',1684,340,842),('Sanu Seetharaman',5,'We ordered for our house warming function with aravind catering, it\'s our first time we experienced with aravind catering . From menu selection to execution step by step they execute as a professionals. At first we had a doubt about their taste but after tasting their sample meal we are very  happy , then we proceed further. All our guests happy with their service and taste . Reasonable price also .\nSai aravind catering will be our default caterers for further functions .','2026-03-28 16:56:56.392401',1685,340,842),('Balaji Sundaram',5,'Excellent tasting food at Budget friendly rates. Enjoy their sumptuous feast. Highly recommend their catering services.','2026-03-28 16:56:56.395524',1686,340,842),('raghuraman kumaraswami',5,'Absolutely superb catering service under the able management of Sri Pammal Ramesh and his good team.We had the opportunity to use their services for a nischayathartham function recently.      The items served were a mix of South Indian and North Indian and the guest really enjoyed their variety and taste.                      Pricing is reasonable and approach courteous and friendly.Would highly recommend and wish them well for all their endeavours.','2026-03-28 16:56:56.398530',1687,340,842),('Suchithra Krishnan',5,'Aravind catering is such a nice catering services. We have done so many function with them. My son poonal, my daughter arrangetram recently happend At Rani seethai hall on July 26th. We had a evening buffet the food quality was awesome and the service was excellent. Everyone appreciated that the food was very very tasty. I recommend this service people 100percent.','2026-03-28 16:56:56.401741',1688,340,842),('Sekar Sambandhan',5,'Catering staffs are very kind instructive,organised. Foods are very nice hygienically served.','2026-03-28 16:56:59.346832',1689,341,847),('Tsm Aditya',4,'The event is on 8-03-2026 the food was tasty and the service was good especially elener payasam was too good','2026-03-28 16:56:59.350415',1690,341,847),('S Ekambaram',5,'08:03:2026 Afternoon food all nice I like it food  sambar Satham, Panner masala','2026-03-28 16:56:59.354073',1691,341,847),('Siddarthan Suresh',5,'The food was amazing... especially the mimic of non-veg was outstanding','2026-03-28 16:56:59.357698',1692,341,847),('sanjay M',5,'It was so good to taste the food and the service provided was too good','2026-03-28 16:56:59.360797',1693,341,847),('patrick Leo',5,'Hi everyone,\nThe function lunch was well organized and enjoyable. The food quality was very good, with a nice variety of dishes that suited everyone’s taste. The starters, main course, and were all served.\n\nThe seating arrangement were comfortable, and the overall coordination was smooth. The staff support and service were appreciated.\n\nOverall, it was a successful and pleasant event🫶','2026-03-28 16:57:02.516341',1694,342,848),('Haji Haji',5,'Assalamu alaikkum.\n\nWe recently had the pleasure of experiencing Bismi catering and it was absolutely outstanding.\nBismi catering is the one of the best catering service in chennai. The arrangements made the gathering more memorable. Jazakallah heir for Mubarak bai and Team...👍','2026-03-28 16:57:02.519749',1695,342,848),('Vino Click\'s',4,'Food was very yummy 😋 Semma soft motton ,, serving person was very good 😊,, you can believe and give orders... By Vino Clicks Photographer','2026-03-28 16:57:02.523184',1696,342,848),('Soundarya',5,'The food was delicious. Everybody until the very end had adequate food and piece. Their service was also commendable. I had a dinner meal and the food was not too heavy on the tummy.  Overall this catering is highly recommended.','2026-03-28 16:57:02.527071',1697,342,848),('Mridula Murali',5,'Mutton briyani was delicious and hygienic. Every dish was well-cooked and perfectly seasoned. Guests really enjoyed the food','2026-03-28 16:57:02.531204',1698,342,848),('anbu sundharam',5,'Very nice service high quality food\'s good to go with phs','2026-03-28 16:57:11.377791',1699,343,849),('murali murali',5,'Excellent food quality. .service also very good....good team work','2026-03-28 16:57:11.381006',1700,343,849),('Shan Shopify',5,'Nice and served well no disappointed in food good in taste','2026-03-28 16:57:11.384158',1701,343,849),('Lakshmi SOwmiyarajan',5,'Excellent service. Very very tasty food. Menu according to our family\'s likes and choices. The people are very neat and clean. Very courteous behaviour. Sumptuous and tasty food. Great price too','2026-03-28 16:57:11.387239',1702,343,849),('sanjith prasanth',5,'Super taste.....very good food ....wish you all the best','2026-03-28 16:57:11.390631',1703,343,849),('Magesh Kumar',5,'FEEDBACK REPORT: VIKASH CATERERS & CONTRACTORS\nEvent Date: 7th December 2025\nSubject: Appreciation for Exceptional Service\nOverall Rating: ⭐⭐⭐⭐⭐\nCulinary Excellence: The food quality was outstanding and received high praise from all guests. The taste and presentation exceeded expectations.\nLeadership: Special thanks to owners Geebach and Ramesh for their hands-on management and ensuring the event ran smoothly.\nTeam Performance: The catering team was professional, efficient, and attentive to every guest\'s needs.\nHospitality: The staff provided a warm and welcoming atmosphere, maintaining high standards of service throughout the event.\nValue for Money: The balance between premium quality and affordable cost was impressive.\nConclusion:\nVikash Caterers & Contractors delivered a top-tier experience. Their commitment to quality and hospitality makes them a highly recommended choice for any event.','2026-03-28 16:57:14.680890',1704,344,854),('Ajay Chandrasekar',5,'Vikas caterer catered for our birthday event. Food was really good. Service was awesome.. All liked the food. They can manage any last minute food preparation. On time. Cost efficient.\nHighly recommend them for small or big veg catering events.','2026-03-28 16:57:14.683713',1705,344,854),('Vijayachandiran R',5,'Timely service and great taste. Even though we placed the order at the last minute, the team managed everything very well and handled the service professionally. Truly appreciated.','2026-03-28 16:57:14.686382',1706,344,854),('Priyasri',5,'All foods are amazing especially brinji,payasam,sambar then food quality and food quantity more then i expect. Thanks for your catering service🤩🤩🤩.','2026-03-28 16:57:14.688745',1707,344,854),('Mythili Kumari',5,'Food was really good and hygiene factor are maintained till last.sambar taste was really authentic with home made Masala','2026-03-28 16:57:14.690775',1708,344,854),('Sankara Pandian',5,'Kasikannu Catering world,made our family function memorable with their delicious food near and pleasant service.They provided traditional taste and everything was well organized.All guests were very happy,thank you for wonderful service.I happily recommended you all,you can choose this Kasikannu Catering world with 100% trust.Thank you','2026-03-28 16:57:22.017473',1709,345,855),('Ranjith Kumar',5,'Kasikannu Catering Service was truly outstanding! Everything was perfectly organized, and the staff were friendly and professional throughout the event. The food was fresh, delicious, and beautifully presented—our guests couldn’t stop praising the taste. Truly one of the best catering services in Chennai!','2026-03-28 16:57:22.020803',1710,345,855),('N. Ajith kumar Ajith kumar',5,'We are so glad we choose kasikannu catring. Their professionalism, taste, and presentation made our event feel grand and elegant. Highly recommend','2026-03-28 16:57:22.024241',1711,345,855),('Logesh Kannan',5,'If you want a stress free weeding with memories good kasikannu catering is the answer. The team is very professional and the dishes taste like home with a touch of luxury','2026-03-28 16:57:22.028056',1712,345,855),('S Prakash',5,'We were amazed at the level of detail - from Food variety to presentation. The flavors were rich, authentic, and loved by all. Truly a premium catering experience in Chennai','2026-03-28 16:57:22.031811',1713,345,855),('Boopathy D',1,'We had food from SRI IYYAN CATERING SERVICE last month at my brother-in-law’s house wedding, and the service was good at that time. Because of that experience, we booked them again for my cousin sister’s marriage function. However, this time they provided the worst service.\nThe welcome drink was served only after everyone had arrived. Later, the dinner was brought around 8 PM, when the function was already over and most of the guests were leaving. There was no punctuality at all.\nIn addition, all the food items were too spicy. Children could not eat, and even many elders left the food without finishing it. The ice cream flavor that we requested was not provided, and we had also asked for beeda, but that was not served either.\nThe total amount was ₹94,000, and we already paid ₹90,000. Despite this, they spoke very disrespectfully and even used offensive words. We have recorded everything.\nPeople who run a business should behave politely and professionally. They must think before speaking and should not use inappropriate language. We have never seen such a terrible catering service before.','2026-03-28 16:57:29.752062',1714,346,860),('Bala Murugan',5,'Outstanding Catering – Highly Recommended!\n\nWe booked this SRI IYYAN CATERING SERVICE for our wedding and reception, and they truly exceeded all our expectations. From planning to execution, everything was handled in a very professional and organised manner.\n\nThe food quality was absolutely fantastic — delicious, fresh, and beautifully presented. We received compliments from all our guests for the taste, variety, and overall quality of the food. Even after the event, many guests personally reached out to appreciate the catering.\n\nThe service was excellent. The staff was polite, well-trained, and attentive, ensuring smooth coordination throughout the event without any hassle. Hygiene, timing, and presentation were maintained perfectly.\n\nOne of the biggest highlights was their pricing — very reasonable and affordable compared to current market rates, while still delivering top-notch quality and service. Truly great value for money.\n\nIf you are planning a wedding or any special event and want amazing food, stress-free execution, and reliable service, I would highly recommend booking them without a second thought.\n\nWe would choose them again for our next event without a second thought.\n\nThank you for the wonderful service! 🙏✨','2026-03-28 16:57:29.755633',1715,346,860),('Maragatham Sankar',5,'We hired them for our reception, and they were absolutely incredible! From the initial planning stages to the last drink served, the service was impeccable. The food was not only delicious, but it was also presented beautifully, and our guests are still raving about the \"Veg foods which taste exactly like non veg\" weeks later. They were very accommodating to our dietary requests and helped make our special day stress-free and memorable. Highly recommended!\"','2026-03-28 16:57:29.759061',1716,346,860),('Parthasarathy Loganathan',5,'\"The catering for my son Aravind wedding was nothing short of exceptional. From the first appetizer to the final dessert, the quality of the food was consistent and impressive.\n\nThe Highlight: The Blue berry Kaju Kathili, Fish fry, Prawn thokku was a crowd favourite—perfectly cooked and bursting with authentic flavor. It’s rare to see large-scale catering maintain such gourmet standards.\n\nThe Service: What truly set them apart was the hospitality. The team handled the flow of 800+ guests without a single bottleneck.\nIf you want an stress-free experience where the food becomes a talking point of the wedding, I highly recommend Iyyan catering service for your family functions.','2026-03-28 16:57:29.762168',1717,346,860),('gorgeousme Tamilselvan',1,'We really had a bad experience with this Catering service. Worst ever customer service and not even having courtesy to accept there mistake.\n1. Didn\'t deliver on time extremely late and they came around 6.45pm to distribute coffee and dinner at 8.10pm where as mugurtham was 6 to 7.30 pm.\n2. We specifically asked for ice cream flavour and they messed up.\n3. Important one sweet beeda not even given at the end.( Forgot to bring from there end)\n4. We asked for less spicy briyani they gave too spicy and end up in wasting food no one like it.\n5. Mainly we booked this Catering for vathakuzhambu completely waste of money.\n\nFood is most important in any function this catering service entirely spolied our function mood and not worth for money . Also need to mention in this review we keep on calling them but the response with such attitude.','2026-03-28 16:57:29.765594',1718,346,860),('AMEERULLAH E',5,'Delicious foods with low prices and service are best','2026-03-28 16:57:39.435348',1719,347,863),('Sanaa',5,'Service was too good in that catering customer was soo happy 😊😁','2026-03-28 16:57:39.438999',1720,347,863),('Sakthisadhana Pvr',5,'Food is very good customer was soo fantastic 😍😊','2026-03-28 16:57:39.442600',1721,347,863),('Suvedha',5,'Good quality and service customer so satisfied thanks 🙏','2026-03-28 16:57:39.446504',1722,347,863),('Div',5,'Food quality is too good 😊','2026-03-28 16:57:39.450862',1723,347,863),('Pawan Kumar',3,'Visited for Haleem, thank god, there wasnt queue for that. Tried their mutton haleem, it was good, especially their generous fried onion servings.Next day visited again for Chicken haleem which too was good.Other deep fried items are outsourced, so didnt feel like trying. Biriyani counter was like railway ticket counter, so skipped biriyani both the time. If they had spent a marginal money on crowd management rather on Instagram influencers it would have been better.','2026-03-28 16:57:41.887462',1724,348,868),('Madhan Singh',5,'Zaara Biryani serves very good and tasty biryani. Both the Hyderabadi style and Chennai Muslim style biryani are excellent in taste and well prepared. The flavors, aroma, and quality are really impressive.\n\nOverall, a great place for biryani lovers. Highly appreciated 👍','2026-03-28 16:57:41.891923',1725,348,868),('Ramesh Babu T',3,'Its the month of Ramadan and there\'s no dearth of Iftar outlets across Chennai, what with every other eatery parading their offering.\nWe decided to try the Irani Haleem unveiled by Zaara Caterers.  Having heard of them in raves, our expectations were running high.  And there wasn\'t much disappointment and that\'s strictly about the food.  The biryani was awesome, spiced right, hot and fragrant with succulent pieces of the protein.  The kebabs and tandoori were good too.  The haleem was a just a \'so-so\' leaving us a bit underwhelmed.  Double ka Meetha was okay.\nThe entry to the makeshift venue is narrow with stalls on both sides.  The kebabs counter was throwing out fire sparks on the entrants.  The ambience is crowded with a long queue for billing, which was sluggish. The seats are limited and fleeting, musical chairs type!  They could do with a team to clear the trash left by the diners.\nA selection of the menu on takeaway would work better.','2026-03-28 16:57:41.895510',1726,348,868),('Gunasundari Brammanandam',5,'Amazing food and desserts are worth the price. Must visit place for once but won\'t likely visit again.','2026-03-28 16:57:41.900623',1727,348,868),('Mohanraj Pandian',3,'Quite crowded got haleem for 150 rs need to try other dishes','2026-03-28 16:57:41.904001',1728,348,868),('Amjath Sheriff',5,'I really thank Richard and the whole team for giving us the best food for my Daughter wedding. Right from the snacks , starters , welcome drinks , desserts and ice cream, the main menu Biryani ! everything tasted so delicious. All the guests are still talking about the food .\nThank you so much eat and go catering for the great food and service .','2026-03-28 16:57:47.785703',1729,349,869),('Yaso Jas',5,'One of the best  catering service allover tamilnadu. Biriyani taste was very delicious....\nMust try..\nVeg meals and dessert excellent...','2026-03-28 16:57:47.789005',1730,349,869),('anbu nithi',5,'Yesterday We ( CSI RAJAGOPAL HSS ROYAPURAM ) celebrated CHILDREN\'S CHRISTMAS FUNCTION. Ordered Chicken biryani from EAT AND GO Caterers.\nIt was nice and tasty.Quality and quantity was also best.Our students enjoyed the food.Thank you very much.Merry Christmas!!','2026-03-28 16:57:47.792035',1731,349,869),('Akshaya Baskaran',5,'Booked them for service almost 3 times now. Never a miss. All the dishes were very tasty. Very promising and trustable','2026-03-28 16:57:47.795149',1732,349,869),('Elakkiya Senthil Kumar',5,'Best quality and good taste, their dessert is always bestest one. Their food delivery is on time.','2026-03-28 16:57:47.798174',1733,349,869),('Ram kumar',1,'Very bad experience we had for margazhi virunthu. We waited for 1.30 hours paid 650 rs for a meal. Our expectations were high and their food and taste is not up to our expectations as well as worth for the money we paid. Very below average taste sambar was too sticky not even arachivitta sambar, mysore rasam not even close to the taste of original mysore rasam, vathakozhambu was in runnyconsistency nothing tasty i can mention here totally disappointed. Please don\'t go and waste your precious time, my personal experience will b happy if it helped someone. Thanks','2026-03-28 16:57:50.607320',1734,350,872),('Vidya Rao',5,'Huge thanks to Mr Santhosh & the catering team of Arasuvai Arasu  for serving up a culinary experience that wazed every one\' s taste buds at our son\'s wedding reception @Anand Farms ! 😊\nFrom the starters to the main course and desserts, every bite was a flavour explosion!! Our guests are still raving about the food, and we\'re so grateful for the amazing spread you put together. Your team\'s hospitality and service were top-notch, making our son\'s wedding reception truly special. Thanks for bringing our vision to life and making our day so delicious! 😋','2026-03-28 16:57:50.611069',1735,350,872),('Bharath Ram',3,'We went to have the Lunch by arusuvai arasar margazhi lunch in vidhya Bharathi kalyana mandapam.\n1. Variety was very good, you get 3 sweets 3 porial and kootu.\n2. Podi, Sambhar, Vetha Kulambu, Mor kulambu, Rasam and getti thayir.\n3. Vada, Vendakka fry, mormulaga and pickle and appalam etc.\nWhile the Menu was very nice and plates were neat and clean, I expected a bit more tastier veggies and Kootu.\nThe expectation is high when you pay Rs. 650 -/ per plate.\nOverall good experience but could be improved a bit more to match the expectations.','2026-03-28 16:57:50.615487',1736,350,872),('DHANA SEKAR LAKSHMANAN',5,'Towards Diwali 2025 they exhibited and Sold their Sweets and Savouries in Ethiraj Kalyana Mandapam, Alwarpet. Quality of items, Staff Behavior, Ambience and Everything were Excellent.\n\nThe Quality and Taste were Unique. I cannot stop myself when eating their Sweets and Savouries.','2026-03-28 16:57:50.619430',1737,350,872),('Sai Prasad B.',5,'We ordered two meals from Suvega by Arusuvai Arasu through Zomato, and they were excellent! The vazhapoo poriyal and kootu were absolutely amazing — every bite felt like pure happiness. Please share our compliments with the owners and the entire team.','2026-03-28 16:57:50.623281',1738,350,872),('Rajesh Rajesh',5,'Good and awesome food and excellent service of staff and well hygienic','2026-03-28 16:57:59.140799',1739,351,874),('Gans Kumar',5,'These people so amazing. Their attitude is the most perfect and satisfies everyone needs.we dont want to be near the table and they take care the guest like their own. These are my guest words for them. Kumar and his brother are doing real great service. I wish them to grow along with universe.','2026-03-28 16:57:59.145073',1740,351,874),('Singaravelan Singaravelan',5,'Good food','2026-03-28 16:57:59.148475',1741,351,874),('Shankar Muthu samy',5,'Fully satisfied with their service. We have given them order for our baby shower function. All of our relatives praised the food quality and taste.','2026-03-28 16:57:59.152369',1742,351,874),('PRABAGARAN',5,'Best people in Market with Great attitude.\nAlmost every visitors of our function is happy with the food.\nGreat thanks to Mr. Arunachalam and Sarath for great co operation and Service. Food is tasty\nI highly recommend...','2026-03-28 16:57:59.156493',1743,351,874),('Pragassh MG',5,'Excellent taste and dedicated service worth the pricing. Booked them for 4 occasions and all the guests appreciated the food we served. Their live counters were great and guests who arrived late also enjoyed hot and delicious meals. Kudos to the owner Mr.Barath for such care and consistency. Highly recommended.','2026-03-28 16:58:08.686842',1744,352,879),('Dinesh Babu',5,'We booked Balaji Catering for our housewarming function,  both the breakfast and lunch were extremely tasty. The food was delivered on time, and all our guests appreciated both the taste and the quality of service. Overall, we are very happy that we chose them for our big day. I strongly recommend Balaji Catering for any special occasion.','2026-03-28 16:58:08.689462',1745,352,879),('vidhya sree',5,'We ordered breakfast for our housewarming function just a day in advance. Despite the short notice, the food was delivered on time and it was very tasty. Thanks to Maha Barath Balaji Catering for the great service!','2026-03-28 16:58:08.692939',1746,352,879),('Arunkumar Sharan',5,'We had this catering for our wedding.. the food was excellent and the service was very good.. Everyone who served where soo generous.. Especially Barath Balaji sir was exceptional in his work\nThanks a lott sir','2026-03-28 16:58:08.696390',1747,352,879),('Mahalakshmi Arunkumar',5,'We have been booking balaji catering for years for many events in our house. Recently we booked here for our daughter\'s wedding. The buffet setting and chat stalls were very nice and pleasant. Balaji sir took care of everyone personally, we are grateful. Everyone who attended the wedding said that the food was delicious and enjoyed.','2026-03-28 16:58:08.699898',1748,352,879),('doc blog',2,'This catering service providing food to industries nearby oragadam & sriperumbudur.\nSemiboiled rice,machine made Chappathi (mix of maida & wheat! ), average side dishes.','2026-03-28 16:58:17.239086',1749,353,884),('Rajesh Sharma',5,'The service here has been unbelievable in terms of quality, response, cleanliness value . They have set high standards& people who are attached to this caterers are impeccable.I would strongly recommends Amrutha food services to all my friends and relatives .','2026-03-28 16:58:17.243099',1750,353,884),('New Life Charitable Trust',5,'The New Life Charitable Trust is very happy and feeling honoured to present this review about M/s. Amruta Hospitality Services, our long time Associate. True to the name Mr. Diwakar Deena Thayalan - He is a great man who is very generous (Thayalan) and the food that they serve is also \"Amirtham\" (Amrutha).  I can declare from the bottom of my heart that this organisation has fed the Senior Citizens of The Ne Life Charitable Home - good quality, tasty and hygienic food on time without fail throughout the pandemic period. Not just that they have been celebrating all their family events with a feast at The New Life Charitable Trust - Home for the aged. We pray for the Ayul, Arokiam and Sowkiam of Mr. Diwakar and all his family members together with the employees and other contacts of M/s. Amruta Hospitality Services. The society needs men like Mr. Diwakar who is highly philanthropic and inculcates this quality in others too. Under his able administration M/s. Amruta Hospitality Services is doing an excellent job in food industry. By feeding quality food they are indeed doing a dedicated quality service. Wishing them all the best for progress and prosperity !!!','2026-03-28 16:58:17.247191',1751,353,884),('Lalitha Gopalakrishnan',5,'Amruta Hospitality Services in food industry plays a very important and noble role. For good food when there is a frantic search by all, the value and dedication they give is unparalleled, prompt with exceptional quality. May the Managing Director together with his employees and all associates be blessed with high progress and prosperity.','2026-03-28 16:58:17.251195',1752,353,884),('ARANGS SAS',5,'Excellent and tastey food severved all these years by amtutha is  great always.keep going ahead in future also.best wishes','2026-03-28 16:58:17.254888',1753,353,884),('Shobha Krishnan',4,'We had recently booked Haritham events for my seemantham and the event was a huge success! Everyone loved the food, the decor, and the overall arrangements. We received so much positive feedback, especially for the food.\n\nBreakfast: The spread was simple and minimal, but very tasty. Though a little on the pricey side, the quality was excellent and the idlis were perfect.\n\nLunch: Absolutely delicious. The different variety rices, sweets, and ada pradhaman were all appreciated. Thank you for that extra chakka pradhaman.\n\nSouvenir: The cute magnet at the entrance was such a thoughtful touch, the whole family was delighted.\n\nOverall, everyone was really happy, and that meant so much to us—because honestly, my husband and I go to a function mainly for the food! 😅\nHearing appreciation from others as well truly made us happy.\n\nThanks again, Meera maami, for making it such a memorable experience and for your constant support and assistance throughout the planning and till the end of the event.','2026-03-28 16:58:24.489211',1754,354,889),('Aparna Siva',5,'We conducted our daughter’s wedding on Feb 6 at Chennai and entrusted Haritham Events with catering and allied services. Coming from Singapore, we were very particular about cleanliness and high standards. Raghu & his sister Meera went above and beyond to  deliver top quality service. The food was awesome, aesthetics were tastefully done. Meera especially attended to our calls even in the middle of the night. Everything was professional and well appreciated by all our guests from India and abroad. Wishing them all the best in their future endeavors!!','2026-03-28 16:58:24.494911',1755,354,889),('Brindha Kannan',5,'We recently engaged Haritham Events for our Grahapravesam, and they took care of the decorations, kolam, and catering for us. They truly offer an end-to-end service, which made the entire process smooth and stress-free.\n\nRaghu and Meera were instrumental in helping us finalise the details. A special thanks to Meera, who was always available to clarify our doubts and assist in planning every aspect of the event. Her support truly made a difference and contributed significantly to the success of the occasion.\n\nThe catering was excellent—the food was served fresh and hot, even though it was prepared at their T. Nagar kitchen and our home is in Thiruvanmiyur. The tasty food was appreciated by everyone. The service team was attentive and ensured that all our guests were well taken care of.\n\nThe mixture and Mysore pak in the thamboolam bag were a big hit with all. We also want to thank them especially for procuring the palm leaf thamboolam bags—they were thoughtful, eco-friendly, and well-received.\n\nThe team also paid attention to finer details—like providing a table cover for the reception area table—which reflected their professionalism and thoughtfulness. We’re really happy with their service and would gladly recommend them to anyone looking for professional event management.','2026-03-28 16:58:24.499365',1756,354,889),('kalameham ethirajan',5,'Haritham events Raghu & Meera made us feel they are our family and made all the marriage arrangements like what they would have done for their Daughter and Son.\nEvery arrangements from Go to Finish is meticulously planned and executed to the fullest satisfaction to both the families and all people who graced the occasion.\nSimply extraordinary people and exceptional service with love and care.\nEvery other function management from our family will be by them for sure.\nOfcourse Raghu and Meera have become my family.','2026-03-28 16:58:24.504656',1757,354,889),('Sushma Saparam',5,'We had so much fun planning a surprise party event for my parents 25th Anniversary  with Haritham Events that even after 6 months people still recall the fun celebrations and the amazing food served by them.\n\nMy brother and I had only drawn a rough outline of what we wanted and had clue on how to go about. Plus time differences and lack of time to coordinate had put tremendous pressure on us. The fact that we were visiting India for the special celebrations was totally not known to my parents . So everything had to be hush hush.\n\nAll we did was a couple of video calls with Haritham and like magic everything fell in place. Right from booking the venue to curating the menu it was an amazing experience to say the least.\n\nOf course we had to take our close relatives & the special people (who we needed to be there to make it special for my parents) into confidence and it was all done so smoothly through whatsapp groups by Team Haritham\n\nAnd imagine we met them in person only as we landed in Chennai. It was like a thriller unfolding as we surprised our parents who were shell shocked to see us.\n\nFrom there all the surprises that Haritham had so meticulously planned unfolded in smooth succession. They had the most brilliant MC and DJ on board who made the evening so lively and full of fun.\n\nAnd what do i say about the food... wah ..wah..wah... it took us to another level of ecstasy. The Indori Paneer, Bikaneri Gatta, Mungodi Soup, Lacha Paratha.....to name a few.... were out of the world.\n\nWe never knew we could have Mango mousse, red velvet mini cup cakes and panacottas for desserts. We had never had them in any wedding before. We were blown away by the options given by Raghu.\n\nAll the arrangements were impeccable and their hospitality is to be experienced. Their service staff are always around with a smiling face ready to help with anything.\n\nThe happiness on my parent\'s face that day cannot be described and so precious for my brother & me that we will forever be grateful to them for pulling off such an amazing event. Right from return gifts, the cake to the decor everything was handpicked and fantastic.\n\nSpecial mention to their photography team. Photographers were so much fun to work with. They made us at ease and looking at all the photographs now gives me goosebumps.\n\nA big shout out to Raghu , Shyamla and Meera for making our event so perfect.  Very difficult to meet such genuine people. If you ask me i would say just give them the date and name the event, sit back and relax. They will deliver an absolutely beautiful, creative and memorable event for you.','2026-03-28 16:58:24.508291',1758,354,889),('Monisha DG',5,'We hired Sri Sairam catering service for my baby shower and it was a wonderful experience. The food was absolutely delicious and all our guests truly appreciated the taste and quality. Many of them complimented both the menu and the service.\n\nThe presentation was neat and the staff was professional, courteous and well-organized. Everything was served fresh and on time, making the event smooth and stress-free. Highly recommended for any special occasion.','2026-03-28 16:58:32.368834',1759,355,892),('Bharani dharan k',5,'We were browsing to try something different for our house warming function. We had come across SSC and were impressed with the reviews and the menu choices. We placed order for dinner BF and lunch. They were on time, food was served hot, service was upto the mark. Taste of the food was very good, homely and delicious. Thanks to Prince and all the staffs involved.','2026-03-28 16:58:32.372243',1760,355,892),('Balaji Rajendiran',5,'Balaji here from Mannivakkam , For my wife’s ninth-month baby shower, we chose SSC Caterers, and the food was absolutely delicious. It was light, easy to digest, and perfectly suited for the occasion.\n\nI would highly recommend SSC Caterers to others. They provide A-to-Z services for functions like marriages and receptions, and the overall service was truly premium. You will definitely get one of the best catering experiences.','2026-03-28 16:58:32.375911',1761,355,892),('SpideyVas23',1,'Very bad experience when taking their service for reception and ordering items from them\nDuring reception, requested for food catering for count of 200. Clearly mentioned that I expect 150 people. To be sure I asked him to provide for 200.\nDuring the end of the event, he charged for 250.\n\nSecond time, took. His service to get somas and murukku.the products were good.\nBut later we order the same again for another function, he ordered the items from a different vendor. I believe his catering is not possible on time.\nHe should have mentioned not possible.\nInstead to make profit, he took our order and made the items from different vendor.\nThe different vendor food is not the same as earlier.','2026-03-28 16:58:32.379222',1762,355,892),('Swathi Krishnamurthy',5,'We had a very pleasant experience. Loved their hospitality so much. They served all of us with so much attention and love, like it was their own family\'s event. They deliver food on time. 100% recommended!','2026-03-28 16:58:32.382767',1763,355,892),('Arun Prakash',5,'Recently my brother marriage and reception held on October 27th @ Annai Mahal thiruverkadu for that we booked VR VARAHI CATERING SERVICE. The food was absolutely so delicious, and the hospitality was top notch. Our family, friends and guests were so happy and every one appreciated us because the quality and taste of food they delivered and their services. Special thanks to Mr.Dhananjayan caters head you made our special day truly unforgettable and once again thanks for your excellent services.🙏💐','2026-03-28 16:58:38.391935',1764,356,897),('Arunkumar R',5,'Best quality and taste in reasonable price ...\nServing with smile...\nHighly recommended','2026-03-28 16:58:38.395025',1765,356,897),('B Sathish',5,'For my brother marriage reception,I gave a vegetarian dinner order. The food was good and tasty. My friends and family also liked the food and good feedback.Thank you so much for the super tasty food!','2026-03-28 16:58:38.398170',1766,356,897),('Jaga deesan',5,'For my daughter\'s birthday party, I gave a vegetarian dinner order to VR Varahi Catering. It was excellent and tasty. All the guests liked the food and said it was superb. The noodles and tattu idli were especially amazing. Thank you so much for the super tasty food!','2026-03-28 16:58:38.401253',1767,356,897),('subathra shanmugam',5,'The Food Was Delicious And Extraordinary Taste... They Were Very Polite And Timely Delivered.... Their Service Was Excellent... MY Relatives And Friends Also Gave Good Feedback At My Sons Birthday Event...We Were Very Happy... Especially That Thakali Rasam Was Amazing... Kannamooditu Catering Kudukalam😍\nThank You VR Catering And Services','2026-03-28 16:58:38.404317',1768,356,897),('C. Krishna',5,'First a fall this owner is very humble and respectful.\nHe is very transparent in the business.\nVery good team handling and good volume of team members.\nQuality of briyani is dam good taste like homemade. No msg and artificial substance in the briyani .\nAll briyani are firewood made.\nJustified for the meal.\nNo foul smell after eating and hand washing.\nBread halwa with nuts .\nChicken 65 was tender and well cooked up .\nIf you focus on quality and money is not a matter then you can take him forward.','2026-03-28 16:58:43.544747',1769,357,899),('Universal Monarch',5,'I contacted Sheriff Catering for my office birthday treat, and I must say—it was a fantastic experience!\n\nI came across Mr. Sheriff through Google after reading some positive reviews, and decided to go ahead based purely on our phone conversation. He understood my budget and offered a great deal with just a few tweaks. Not only did he deliver on time today (28th May), but he also exceeded expectations!\n\nThe buffet setup was impressive, complete with décor I didn’t even ask for. The food quality was top-notch—flavorful, well-portioned, and definitely value for money. He truly saved me from going heavy on the pocket.\n\nHere’s what was on the menu:\n•	Chicken Biryani\n•	Pepper Chicken Gravy\n•	Onion Raita\n•	Brinjal Curry\n\nMy colleagues (35pax) were all praises for the food and overall service. Mr. Sheriff is not only professional but also humble and accommodating.\n\nI’d definitely recommend him for any catering needs!\n\n⭐️⭐️⭐️ Highly recommended ⭐️⭐️ ⭐️','2026-03-28 16:58:43.547942',1770,357,899),('Bhuvana Radhakrishnan',5,'Our school get-together function conducted today was excellent. The food was of high quality, the ambience was refined and pleasant, and the buffet arrangements along with the service were impeccably managed. Heartfelt appreciation to Mr Mabu Sheriff\'s organising team for their thoughtful planning and execution. appreciate the efforts and coordination of everyone involved. Well done! 👏','2026-03-28 16:58:43.550679',1771,357,899),('Nasreen Banu',5,'Outstanding catering service! The food was not only delicious but perfectly prepared—every dish burst with fresh flavors that melted in your mouth. The team arrived right on time, set up seamlessly, and handled everything with professional grace. We were thrilled with every detail, including the beautiful presentation and accommodating our special dietary requests without a hitch. Highly recommend for any event—you won\'t be disappointed!','2026-03-28 16:58:43.553766',1772,357,899),('vijayalakshmi dhandapani',5,'Exceptional Catering for My Son’s Birthday – Highly Recommended!\n\nReview:\nI recently hired this catering service for my son’s 1st birthday celebration after reading their excellent reviews on Google, and I must say they truly lived up to the reputation! From start to finish, everything was handled professionally and with great care.\n\nFood Quality & Taste:\nEvery dish was outstanding! The Biryani was the star of the show – rich in flavor, perfectly cooked, and truly pakka bhai veetu Biryani, made using the traditional firewood style, which gave it that authentic taste you simply can’t find everywhere. The aroma itself had everyone excited!\n\nThe Chicken 65 was crispy, tender, and seasoned to perfection, making it a hit with both kids and adults. The Bread Halwa was divine – soft, sweet, and loaded with flavor and full of badams &. Cashews, just like a homemade delicacy. And the Abugatta ice cream? Fully made up of nuts not more sweet annd it was very subtle. Absolutely amazing! Creamy, chilled just right, and the perfect way to finish a fantastic meal.\n\nService & Presentation:\nThe team was on time, well-organized, and maintained everything impeccably. The food was served hot and fresh, and the staff made sure every guest was taken care of without any delay.\n\nOverall Experience:\nChoosing this catering service based on Google reviews turned out to be one of the best decisions for our celebration. The quality, taste, and authentic preparation methods made our son’s birthday truly special. A huge thank you to the bhai & entire team for your dedication and outstanding service.\n\nIf you want delicious, traditional-style food with amazing service, I highly recommend this catering service. Will definitely book them again for future events!','2026-03-28 16:58:43.556421',1773,357,899),('Venkat S',5,'⭐⭐⭐⭐⭐\nWe had the pleasure of engaging this catering team for my daughter\'s wedding, and I must say they exceeded our expectations in every way.\nRight from day one, their staff were extremely polite, well disciplined, and highly professional. What impressed us the most was their consistency. The same quality of service and food was maintained throughout the event, and they ensured that every guest, including the very last person in line, received everything exactly as promised.\nTheir team handled the entire service with great care, attention, and respect toward the guests, which made the occasion even more special for our family.\nTruly value for money, and a team you can rely on for important family events.\nI would strongly recommend their catering services to anyone looking for quality, professionalism, and excellent hospitality.','2026-03-28 16:58:51.656627',1774,358,901),('Mohana Priya Venkatraman',5,'We had booked Arudhra catering for our wedding . The food was outstanding . Over that their care for the guests was amazing . Their A to Z services was top notch .','2026-03-28 16:58:51.660054',1775,358,901),('Anitha R',3,'We ordered food for an event. Except the pongal, sambar and asoka halwa which were good in the breakfast menu, other items tasted very average. Lunch tasted better and good.','2026-03-28 16:58:51.663661',1776,358,901),('Rakesh Prem',5,'I made a good experience with Arudhra caterer. Food was great and everyone liked it. We plan to go with the same caterer for our next function.','2026-03-28 16:58:51.667103',1777,358,901),('Kavitha Santhanam',5,'We have arranged food from Arudhra catering services for my son’s first birthday celebration. Requested to arrange food for 50 people, food provided was more than sufficient to serve for 50 people. Quality and quantity of the food was really good. Delivery was done on time. I used to give more love for food and i expect real taste in it. The food really amazing and it met the expectations as well. All the guests are really satisfied with the food and so happy. Thank you for providing such a good experience.','2026-03-28 16:58:51.670312',1778,358,901),('Lakshmi Narasimhan',5,'We arranged Sholinga caterer for our daughter marriage on February 22, 2026 at Shri Umadri Mahal.\nOutstanding food taste and quality. All the guests who attended the Reception and Marriage have showered full praise for the great taste and variety. We have attended many weddings but this taste at different  level.Apart from the quality of food,  another comment made by many are that food was served  hot  and with excellent hospitality. With around 1300 persons attending Reception and around 500 attending Muhurtham, still the taste was the same from first to last Bandhi. Shri Venkatesan, Shri Madhavan and team  ensured all the rituals went on very smoothly and all the required items for each ritual provided seamlessly. Shri Venkatesan\'s personal involvement in the  rituals showed the full commitment and conducting as their family marriage.\nApart from amazing taste and exemplary coordination, the high point of Sholinga catering, is their honest, straightforward and transparent approach in each and every detailing prior to the marriage and this is highly appreciated and made us very comfortable. Hence  highly trustable and gives us 100 percent confidence. We conducted marriage for two and half days.\nIt is extraordinary  that each and every item served in all the sessions including kattu sadham,  they maintained  high quality taste which is amazing.\nReally God\'s grace that we employed Sholinga catering for our daughter marriage. Our special thanks to Shri Rangarajan for the excellent coordinations and clarifications and along with Shri Venkatesan for apt and worthful suggestions\nBest wishes to them.','2026-03-28 16:58:56.752894',1779,359,906),('Murugan V',5,'🙏Our experience with Sholinga Caterers (Rangarajan Kannan) for my daughter\'s wedding on February 21st and 22nd at Swarna Sudharshan Hall was nothing short of divine. In a celebration where food is the heart of the event, they exceeded every expectation, ensuring every guest left happy and satisfied.\n\nHighlights of their service:\n\n* Exceptional Quality: From Vritham tiffin, lunch, dinner, muhurtham tiffin, lunch and Seer Pakshanam to the final Kattu Satham, every morsel was fresh and flavourful. Many guests remarked that they kept going back for more, praising the menu\'s curated focus on taste over show-offs.\n\n* Proactive & Courteous Staff: The team was incredibly attentive, constantly checking on guests with a sincere \"Innum venuma?\" Small gestures, such as a dedicated staff member assigned solely to open water bottles, made a massive impact.\n\n* Flawless Organisation: Dining hall transitions were seamless with zero wait times, even with a large crowd. The setup and cleanup were executed perfectly, and the lack of food wastage was a testament to their precise planning.\n\n* All-in-One Excellence: Beyond catering, we utilized their services for Vaidhiga requirements, poo malai vagaira, Mangala Vadhyam etc...  They excelled in every department, treating the event with the personal attention of a close relative.\n\n* Incredible Value: Their pricing is remarkably reasonable given the high standards and professionalism they maintain.\n\nWe are deeply grateful to Rangarajan Kannan for making our celebration so memorable and stress-free. If you want a wedding where the food is talked about for Years, we 100% recommend Sholinga Caterers!','2026-03-28 16:58:56.757963',1780,359,906),('Srinivasan Vardha Rajan',5,'We extend our heartfelt thanks to Sholinga Catering Services for the wonderful service provided during our daughters\' marriage held on 20th February 2026 at Rama Mandram.  They truly made the entire event grand and successful.\nThe taste and quality of the food served throughout all the three days were exceptional. Each and every guest appreciated the delicious meals and the impeccable service.\nA special thanks to Kumar, Balaji, Varadharajan, Tirumalai and the entire team for their dedication and hard work. They ensured that everything ran smoothly and made the celebration truly memorable for our family and friends.','2026-03-28 16:58:56.759619',1781,359,906),('LATHA TAMIL SELVAN',5,'Special Thanks to Mr.Rengarajan.\n\nThe catering service at my son\'s wedding  function was truly excellent. The food was of very high quality, prepared with fresh ingredients, and was extremely tasty. Every dish was well presented and served hot. The entire arrangement was organized in a systematic and professional manner. The staff were polite, punctual, and managed the event smoothly without any confusion. The cleanliness and hygiene standards were well maintained throughout the function. Overall, the catering service was highly appreciated by all the guests who attended the marriage and contributed greatly to making the event a grand success.','2026-03-28 16:58:56.761179',1782,359,906),('Srilakshmi Parthasarathy',5,'Sholinga Catering recently catered our son’s Upanayanam held on March 1st. From the moment we entered the venue until the very last minute of departure, every aspect of the function was handled with immense care, warmth, and professionalism. The Udhagasanthi menu was exceptional, thoughtfully prepared with dedicated specialists assigned to individual dishes, reflecting their attention to detail and commitment to quality. Every penny spent was truly worthwhile. As our Muhurtham was scheduled early in the morning, their valuable suggestion to arrange a mini tiffin followed by a grand Muhurtham lunch proved to be one of the best decisions for our function, allowing us to focus more on the main meal service. The intermittent time constantly had the service of fresh juices and fruits punch which no guest could dislike. The food quality fully met—and even exceeded—our expectations. Guests not only came to bid farewell but also made it a point to personally appreciate and compliment the splendid food, making the entire occasion even more memorable for us. Madhavan swami from this family stood as the backbone for the entire event and on the whole they made us feel blessed.\nPranams.','2026-03-28 16:58:56.762631',1783,359,906),('SUNDARAM BABU Venkatesh',5,'Outstanding Culinary Excellence by Amrudh Catering Services\n\nAmrudh Catering Services delivered an exceptional dining experience across breakfast, lunch, and dinner for our various events. Their culinary craftsmanship, impeccable presentation, and consistent quality truly set them apart. Each menu was thoughtfully curated, offering a perfect balance of taste, nutrition, and variety that delighted every guest.\n\nFrom delectable breakfast spreads to sumptuous lunches and elegant dinners, every dish reflected professionalism, hygiene, and attention to detail. Their team demonstrated remarkable hospitality, punctuality, and seamless service, ensuring a flawless experience throughout.\n\nWe highly appreciate their commitment to excellence and wholeheartedly recommend Amruth Catering Services for any occasion that demands superior taste and refined service.\n\nDr. SB Venkatesh, Dy IG','2026-03-28 16:59:00.600453',1784,360,908),('m sukanya',5,'Ordered catering for 35 with specific customization, and they did a fantastic job. The spice level was perfectly balanced exactly medium as requested and the food had a genuine home made taste. Everyone enjoyed it.','2026-03-28 16:59:00.601997',1785,360,908),('Hariharan K',5,'Had the best vegetarian breakfast and lunch for a house warming function from Amrudh Catering Service. The food was absolutely delicious and one of the best is Vatha kulambu with different taste.. Timely delivered. Catering boys are very kind and supportive.. Highly recommend them for any event!','2026-03-28 16:59:00.603342',1786,360,908),('MUHINDER Pannirselvam',5,'Ordered for home catering services for my sister\'s pre-wedding rituals. The food served was very neat, hygiene and tasty. They provide customized food, along with serving requirements. The serving boys were nice, friendly, and respectful.','2026-03-28 16:59:00.605600',1787,360,908),('Uvaraja Kumaran',4,'We order food for a baby shower function. All the dishes prepared by them tastes could. It would be more good if they have little more ghee for pongal and Sambar rice.\nWe ordered morning tiffin, afternoon seemantham food and chapathi for relatives who stays in home.\nThe chapathi made by them is very soft and tasty. Everyone liked the taste and service. Thanks for making our event a memorable one for friends and family.','2026-03-28 16:59:00.607382',1788,360,908),('sandhya kannan',5,'I had requested for lunch for a pooja of 10 people at home. Although I requested just one day before they ensured to deliver delicious food on time. Vaathyar mama also appreciated the food taste. Everyone was happy with the food.\n\nThank you to mama and Mami for the timely support.','2026-03-28 16:59:03.236001',1789,361,910),('Meera Balaji',5,'Jul 2025: We ordered food for upanayanam function. The breakfast and lunch was very delicious.Sambar,rasam were very good.special mention for the elaneer idly,elaneer payasam and mango roll which were recommended by them when we finalised the menu - it was outstanding. The serving staff were very well mannered,kind and polite. Thank you Janani caterers for making the function memorable at a reasonable cost.','2026-03-28 16:59:03.239300',1790,361,910),('Sivanandan Ganapathi',5,'I am G Sivanandan, Retired Army Person, Poonamallee, Chennai -56,\nI went to my neighbour house warming function, there Sri Janani catering service people were preparing and serving breakfast an awesome taste, neat service at the moment I think to book Sri Janani catering for my elder Son\'s marriage.\nHere after  I booked Sri Janani catering service  for 1200 paxs dinner & 300 breakfast, they served for 1400 dinner & 345 breakfast. Especially the trolley service & supervising & serving is outstanding.\nI enjoyed my son\'s marriage without tension on catering side.\nOnce again I thanks to Sri Janani catering service team. My friends and relations appreciate caters and asked their details, In future only Janani catering service for all my function... 👍👍👍\nJai Hind\nJai Bharath\nVande Madaram.','2026-03-28 16:59:03.243070',1791,361,910),('Saravanan Palanisamy',4,'We ordered food for 30 members and Sri Janani Catering generously accepted the order in spite of their busy schedule.\nFood was delivered on time, taste and service was good. I recommend booking them for your family events.','2026-03-28 16:59:03.247228',1792,361,910),('Naveen Raj',5,'Excellent service by Harish and team. They managed to provide each and every menu with top class taste and sufficient well for all the guests.\nWe had unexpected increase in the guest count but the food was flawlessly served to everyone. We experienced a romantic diner for us (the couples) with amazing decoration on our dining tables.\nTaste of the food was really delicious, we had around 12 different varieties of food and each of them tasted brilliant.\nGuests were so happy with the food and they bid bye-bye with a happy smile 😃 😄','2026-03-28 16:59:03.250964',1793,361,910),('kaloni subramani',5,'Hemambika catering service gave us a memorable and stress free grihapravesam. The food was exceptional and delicious. Carefully curated menu and prompt execution. The live dosa and poori counters were the highlight of the event. Our guests couldnt stop complimenting the wonderful food. Finally the Bakshanam (mainly the adhirasam) reminded my grandmother\'s kaipakkuvam. Overall highly recommended !!!','2026-03-28 16:59:05.112860',1794,362,911),('Keerthi Mohan',5,'We were absolutely delighted with the catering for my dad’s Sadabhishegam. The entire experience was seamless, from the planning to execution, everything was handled with such professionalism and care. The authentic Palakkad-style sadhya was simply outstanding. Every dish was flavorful, traditional, and prepared to perfection. Our guests couldn’t stop raving and complimenting the food!\nA special mention to Rajesh, for the way everything was managed. timely service, neat presentation, and an evident passion for maintaining authenticity. Truly, you went above and beyond in making the occasion memorable for our family. Thank you for delivering such an exceptional experience! We are sure to recommend you every occasion we get wholeheartedly.','2026-03-28 16:59:05.116354',1795,362,911),('Subramanian Sankar',5,'Very polite, very humble, very tasty, etc.,etc., are the value addition of Hemambika caterers.\n\nThey serve not only food but together with love and affection.\n\nI would strongly recommend to others for their functions.','2026-03-28 16:59:05.119990',1796,362,911),('THINYAM SUBARAMANIAN NARAYANAN',5,'Excellent food. Courteous service. Neat and clean service staff. Thanks to RAJESH KRISHNA\n,HEMANBIKA CATERING SERVICE. I CAN VOUCH FOR HEMANBIKA FOR ANY CATERING REQUIREMENT at all levels of requirements including major auspicious ,social events.\nMy best wishes for HEMANBIKA CATERING TO GROW GREAT HEIGHT IN CATERING MANAGEMENT. to serve all vegetarians in Chennai City.','2026-03-28 16:59:05.123327',1797,362,911),('K R Ramakrishnan',5,'Hemambika Catering Service was the caterer for my engagement in Chennai in October 2025. They are very professional and have provided best quality, high hygiene food which was loved and appreciated by all guests. Highly recommend them for future functions','2026-03-28 16:59:05.126405',1798,362,911),('caroline janet',5,'Excellent service from Limra Catering! They set up a live stall for popcorn and bhel puri that was a huge hit. The team was punctual, the snacks were fresh and high-quality, and the pricing was very reasonable. Will definitely hire them again.','2026-03-28 16:59:09.914647',1799,363,912),('Ajith Kumar',5,'Good and budget friendly catering services must recommend if you are searching for catering services for your house functions','2026-03-28 16:59:09.916852',1800,363,912),('rajesh kumar',5,'Good and comfortable budget\nMostly recommended mutton briyani very tasty good👍🥳\n\nThanks Nizam & Naveen','2026-03-28 16:59:09.918972',1801,363,912),('NAVEEN KUMAR E',5,'Yeah!!! This Limra caterers did my event is really very gud one ✨\nThnx to Nizam bro ❤️','2026-03-28 16:59:09.921004',1802,363,912),('Jerald Jerald',5,'I can\'t believe u did my event spcl 🙏🔥','2026-03-28 16:59:09.923055',1803,363,912),('Med cube',5,'We had a wonderful experience with Theertha Catering and Mr. Arunkumar. The food quality was excellent, taste was authentic, and every dish was prepared with great care and hygiene.\n\nThe service was very professional, well-organized, and delivered on time without any delay. Guests truly appreciated the taste and presentation.\n\nMr. Arunkumar and his team were very polite, responsible, and committed to making the event successful.\n\nHighly recommended for any function or special occasion! 👌✨','2026-03-28 16:59:19.450914',1804,364,914),('Dhatsha A Pillai',5,'Theertha served some absolutely delicious food for BOSS 2025 — timely, healthy, hot, and hygienically presented.\nThe breakfast was authentic in taste, with perfectly soft idlis that melted in the mouth and a lip-smacking chicken gravy. The quantity was just right.\nLunch was equally delightful — the biryani was hot and flavorful, served with dalcha, onion pachadi, a sweet, chapatis, and a rich non-veg gravy. The portions were generous, and every dish reflected care and quality.\nOverall, the food was a five-star delight — wholesome, satisfying, and truly memorable! 🌟','2026-03-28 16:59:19.453936',1805,364,914),('Ganesh K',5,'I had the opportunity to enjoy food prepared by Teertha Caterers during a Pongal event lunch at Aiyavoo Mahal, and it was absolutely fantastic. The food was delicious, authentic, and perfectly suited for the festive occasion. Every dish was fresh, well-balanced in taste, and neatly served. The overall dining experience was very satisfying. Highly recommended based on the quality of food served.','2026-03-28 16:59:19.457777',1806,364,914),('MODERN LEGENDS',5,'We engaged Theertha Catering for a large event and they truly exceeded expectations — especially their non-vegetarian offerings. The mutton biryani had tender, juicy pieces infused with aromatic spices, and the Chicken 65 was crisp on the outside and succulent within. Every bite spoke of care and quality.\n\nThe food was served in generous portions, enough for all guests — many of whom complimented the flavors. The team was punctual, courteous, and maintained excellent hygiene standards during preparation and service.\n\nTheir non-veg menu isn’t just an afterthought — it’s a highlight. Highly recommended for anyone looking for delicious, top-notch non-veg catering for weddings, parties, or functions.','2026-03-28 16:59:19.461009',1807,364,914),('SATHISH KUMAR',5,'Hi Arun,\nYesterday I had lunch at your stall, I had chicken biryani with chapati, brinjal gravy, and chicken gravy. Seriously, it was an awesome, aromatic biryani after a long time! The chicken was also perfectly cooked.\n\nWe were six members at one table, and everyone felt the same way. We can confidently recommend Theertha Catering Service for any occasion.\n\nRegards,\nGV\nInspire Chapter\nChennai CBD - A','2026-03-28 16:59:19.464691',1808,364,914),('Saravanan G',5,'Excellent experience i had the service is so royal and the taste is awesome🤘 excellent caters really highly recommend','2026-03-28 16:59:24.181949',1809,365,918),('Ajay Shankar',5,'Had tried their dinner at a recent marriage function of my colleague in SS Mahal, Kolathur. The vegetarian food was really tasty. The simulation of some dishes to resemble some non-veg dishes were cute too. Thank you for the tasty food.','2026-03-28 16:59:24.186480',1810,365,918),('Mukesh',5,'The ice I love it they serve excellent taste of icreams my child\'s loved it','2026-03-28 16:59:24.189418',1811,365,918),('Tamil Govid',5,'Kolathur ram caterers is excellent from service to dishes all are excellent 👌👌','2026-03-28 16:59:24.192723',1812,365,918),('SANTHOSH Y',1,'Very worst catering service.taste is very bad please dont waste your money.Ram catering waste catering service dont book them.\n0/5 very bad and some of the dishes was very bad in smell.\nPlease dont waste your money booking this garbage catering.','2026-03-28 16:59:24.194996',1813,365,918),('prakash sekar',5,'The food was delicious and well-presented. The service was excellent, and all guests were satisfied. Highly recommended catering service.\n1.	Food taste quality ⭐⭐⭐⭐⭐\n2.	Food variety ⭐⭐⭐⭐⭐\n3.	Presentation & plating ⭐⭐⭐⭐⭐\n4.	Service & staff behavior ⭐⭐⭐⭐⭐\n5.	Cleanliness & hygiene ⭐⭐⭐⭐⭐\n6.	Overall satisfaction ⭐⭐⭐⭐⭐','2026-03-28 16:59:37.686511',1814,366,919),('Surya Moorthi',5,'Love the work .. like we need not worry about a single arrangement n stuffs .. They take care of each small thing from pin to plane ☺️☺️.. experienced Good n looking forward for more ♥️keep going Mano ☺️By the way , you&  Your Team is just fab ..','2026-03-28 16:59:37.690773',1815,366,919),('Gopi',5,'The service was very good than expected. Also the catering boys served politely','2026-03-28 16:59:37.693852',1816,366,919),('ARUN G',5,'I have placed an order in the last minute, just by seeing the google reviews.\nSaravana Caterers did not disappoint me. Food was very good. Neat packing. Taste and quality of the food is remarkable. Thank you for accepting the small order..😊','2026-03-28 16:59:37.697193',1817,366,919),('Saba rish',5,'Excellent catering and event management service provided by Saravana caters for our wedding… they all are so humble and professional… all the food taste was so good especially their palaakai biriyani is highly recommended must try… taste it feel it and book it 🌟🎉','2026-03-28 16:59:37.700969',1818,366,919),('Prabhu M',5,'We had a wonderful experience with Velan caterers. The food was delicious, fresh, and loved by all our guests. Every dish was well prepared and served on time.\n\nWhat impressed us the most was their professionalism and coordination. The team handled everything smoothly, maintained proper setup and alignment, and ensured the service ran without any delays. They were polite, attentive, and very well organized throughout the event.\n\nHighly recommended for anyone looking for tasty food and reliable service!','2026-03-28 16:59:40.832484',1819,367,924),('Ajay Kanniyappan',5,'We had an amazing experience with Velan Caterers! The food taste was absolutely top-notch — every dish was flavorful, fresh, and beautifully prepared. All our guests truly enjoyed the meal and kept complimenting the quality.\n\nThe service was just as impressive. The team was very kind, polite, and professional throughout the entire event. They treated us like family and made sure everything was handled perfectly. From start to end, they took complete care of every detail.\n\nIf you book Velan Caterers, you don’t have to worry about anything — just relax and enjoy your event. They truly go above and beyond to make everything special. Highly recommended!','2026-03-28 16:59:40.837712',1820,367,924),('Vanitha Dileep Raj',5,'The food was very well appreciated by everyone. All the dishes were made deliciously. Hospitality by all the team members were wonderful.  We changed several food items and gave several feedback to suit our friends and relatives. All were received well and incorporate promptly.  We are very delighted to have engaged Velan Caterers for our Wedding event.','2026-03-28 16:59:40.856720',1821,367,924),('Shaukath Mangalore',5,'The catering arrangements for my daughter\'s pre-wedding ceremony on 17/07/2025 was handled perfectly by Velan Caterers.\n\nThe taste of Mutton Biryani, chicken 65, bread halwa, kheer &  naan was perfect & most of the guests praised the food that was served.\n\nEven the vegetarian food was cooked perfectly with good taste.\n\nThe service boys & the cleaners did a very good and clean job.\n\nA lot of praise to N. Sendhil Kumar for good co-ordination & handling this event in a superb manner.\n\nI will fully recommend Velan Caterers for all future functions.\n\nKeep it up bro..... 👆👍💐💐','2026-03-28 16:59:40.865526',1822,367,924),('Vijay Surya',5,'Exceptional Food: Customers consistently highlight the \"amazing\" and \"delicious\" quality of the dishes. The food is praised for its authenticity and bold Southern flavors that go beyond standard fare.\nSignature Payasam: Their payasam (like the Payasam) is a major highlight, often described as \"mind-blowing\" and a perfect finish to a meal.\nThe courteous and attentive staff who help create a welcoming, home-like atmosphere.\nTheir \"shops\" or restaurant outlets are noted for their elegant design, blending rustic South Indian elements with modern.','2026-03-28 16:59:40.868481',1823,367,924),('Radhika Raja',5,'We chose Sri Sai Hasini Catering for my sister’s wedding, and the food was absolutely delicious. Every dish was flavorful, well prepared, and beautifully presented, and all our guests appreciated the food so much that we received only positive feedback. Everyone truly enjoyed the dining experience, which made the wedding even more special for us. Heartfelt congratulations and appreciation to Uma ma’am and her entire team for delivering such wonderful quality and service. We are extremely happy with our choice and would love to book them again for our future family functions.','2026-03-28 16:59:47.608504',1824,368,926),('Amirtha Lakshmi',5,'Very tasteful food and good hospitality provided by Hasini caterers. Would highly recommend for any big occasion.','2026-03-28 16:59:47.611167',1825,368,926),('Venkat Ramanan',5,'Very good quality food and great service','2026-03-28 16:59:47.613859',1826,368,926),('Ragupathy Vaidyanathan',5,'Good arrangements and excellent food. All the items served were tasted good. Hospitality was also good.','2026-03-28 16:59:47.616642',1827,368,926),('Rajesh',1,'They usually do wedding catering & when we did house warming in 2018 they clubbed us , the food was very average and we must pay the transportation cost which is not fair considering their high quote , may be they are best in the area but definitely I would skip them. It is funny that they replied since I have reviewed non veg hotels I can\'t be their customer🤣further more they lay conditions when I should review it is customer choice and further this not your website.','2026-03-28 16:59:47.618987',1828,368,926),('Md Murshid',5,'I ordered food for my daughter\'s wedding they give me different varieties at affordable price the quality of serving is too good date deliver the food on time thanks for Madras caterers and take outs for making my daughter a memorable experience I refer best for others','2026-03-28 16:59:55.843961',1829,369,928),('Dhana Sekar',5,'We ordered catering for our house warming function. The food quality was excellent, tasty, and well within our budget. All our guests appreciated the food. Highly satisfied.','2026-03-28 16:59:55.846880',1830,369,928),('monisha manivannan',5,'I recently booked them for house warming function both breakfast and lunch. Food taste was awesome, everyone appreciated. All items were so good.','2026-03-28 16:59:55.849673',1831,369,928),('Iyyanar Iyyanar',5,'Good service affordable price,best quality\nKerala food was too excellent','2026-03-28 16:59:55.853081',1832,369,928),('Md Mahtab',5,'Madras Cateres and take Outs Canteen Food is a Affordable price, Good Quality and Tasty Food 😋, thank you #madras Catereres and take outs 💓','2026-03-28 16:59:55.855977',1833,369,928),('Varsha Ithakshi',5,'We had booked them for our wedding, based on a relative\'s recommendation. And I must say they delivered as promised...so many people praised the food.. not just in terms of taste, but variety too. Usually in Chennai, the north Indian food is the regular stuff, but their menu was vv good & the presentation too!\nRaghavasimhan mama & their entire team is very accommodating & extremely sweet! They are open to suggestions & customisation and very nominal also. Definitely go ahead with them without any second thoughts. They went over and beyond the expectations.. especially with the cute little juice corner! That was something, which we didn\'t even discuss.','2026-03-28 16:59:58.801416',1834,370,933),('ANAND',5,'AWESOME is too less a word!\n\nSeshadhri and his team were Marvellous. Excellent Co-ordination, Delicious food, Cost Effective and Wonderful Service..\n\nWill always go with Srinivasa Catering for all our family function henceforth. This is the least that we can do, for the amazing food that had for the last three days!','2026-03-28 16:59:58.804678',1835,370,933),('Ravi Krishnaswamy',5,'Very good caterers. Good food, reasonable price, humble people, excellent service.\nVery flexible, understanding team.\nOur coordinator Venkatakrishnan was extremely good.\nWe engaged them for a wedding and are fully satisfied.\n\nWill recommend them on any day.','2026-03-28 16:59:58.808041',1836,370,933),('Adithya Narayanan',5,'One of the best caterers in city. We have called them for more than three functions in our family. Young and knowledgeable team. All guests were very happy from the service provided.','2026-03-28 16:59:58.811239',1837,370,933),('aniruth girish',5,'Surely worth ur money. Ordered 20 tifen for morning BF and 50 meals lunch for my son Ayush Homam on 3rd august 2019 in Mudichur Tambaram. Very neat hygienic service. Most of the guest for the function wished the food was very good mainly the dish AKKARA VADISAL. Seriously yummy taste. Thanks for the making it.','2026-03-28 16:59:58.814611',1838,370,933),('Rithika M',5,'The food was most delicious and they provide unique varieties of food and it was enriched the function. The service was too good 😊','2026-03-28 17:00:02.929882',1839,371,934),('Balakumaran Balakumaran',5,'We ordered tiffin for our 🏠House warming function taste and service super 👌price also reasonable ✨ and friendly behaviour ....','2026-03-28 17:00:02.933274',1840,371,934),('Palani V K',5,'Super food service good quality and reasonable price all the best team','2026-03-28 17:00:02.936685',1841,371,934),('doss doss',5,'Such a wonderful catering service near gummidipoondi affordable price quality and tasty foods','2026-03-28 17:00:02.939957',1842,371,934),('Muthu Kumar',5,'Very excellent food and serve','2026-03-28 17:00:02.942966',1843,371,934),('jeeva samy',4,'Really good briyani we have here .\n\nThe quantity was enough more than what we are paying\n\nThe atmosphere of the shop needs more improvement\n\nAnd the service also needs improvement\n\nOther than biriyani was good\n\nBriyani taste  8/10\nBriyani quantity,,9/10\nService                  ,5/10\nAtmosphere.        5/10','2026-03-28 17:00:14.661192',1844,372,935),('rana deep',4,'Don\'t try:-\nBeef biryani (worst)','2026-03-28 17:00:14.664644',1845,372,935),('Ronin R',1,'Fake photos. It is road side with tent like setup. By the time I went egg was not available and when I asked initially he said doesn\'t come with egg and have to pay extra 10 later he said it was not available.\nBiryani taste was fried because of last left over.he could have said that.\nDont go by Youtubers and reviews.','2026-03-28 17:00:14.667841',1846,372,935),('Mahesh Kumar SE',5,'Excellent catering service.. One of the best biryanis I have ever had in Chennai.. Owner was very friendly throughout the process & made sure that everything went smooth..\n\nIf you have had Biryani in their roadside shop, the biryani you get from their catering is 10 times more tastier than their shop…','2026-03-28 17:00:14.671465',1847,372,935),('1031_DILLIPKUMAR BN',1,'Meet or not well cook, Not Recommend for child','2026-03-28 17:00:14.675217',1848,372,935),('Mahi Pilot',5,'The food they provide is not only with incidences but also with the care and humanity. The taste of food semes like form mom\'s kitchen.\n👍','2026-03-28 17:00:22.457707',1849,373,940),('Antony Raj',5,'The team was professional, friendly, and accommodating, making sure every detail was taken care of.\n\nThe menu options were vast and catered to all dietary needs. The food was presented beautifully and tasted amazing. Our guests raved about the quality and variety of dishes','2026-03-28 17:00:22.461096',1850,373,940),('DHARSHNI L.G',5,'Being an hosteller and finding home foods that is full of quality is literally everything... Grateful for the team\'s friendly approach and proper food delivery on time...never faced any issue on the food quality....','2026-03-28 17:00:22.464235',1851,373,940),('Daril Deehen',5,'Placed an order as bulk and they delivered instead of rain. Really friendly arrangements and service. Really Happy with the service...','2026-03-28 17:00:22.467688',1852,373,940),('Vinoth Kumar',5,'The food is good as home food  and the service they provide was genuine .just had a good experience with kpn caterings','2026-03-28 17:00:22.470926',1853,373,940),('G Vasudevan',4,'Good veg south indian tiffin, mixed rice etc , very homely and tasty food','2026-03-28 17:00:30.739659',1854,374,945),('Chandu V',4,'The food was absolutely delicious — every dish was fresh and full of flavor. The service was warm, quick, and attentive without being overbearing. Cozy ambiance and comfortable seating.','2026-03-28 17:00:30.742721',1855,374,945),('RS Venkateswaran',5,'Take away pure vegetarian mess. With limited seating facility available. Wonderful vegetarian food.','2026-03-28 17:00:30.745867',1856,374,945),('ilavalagan p',4,'Rates were higher take 2-5 min for delivery.available for breakfast,lunch and dinner parcel and dine in available','2026-03-28 17:00:30.748666',1857,374,945),('Naveen Kumar',4,'Food was good and tasty.','2026-03-28 17:00:30.751832',1858,374,945),('Kowsi J',5,'This catering service is really awesome and very punctual,highly recommendable for all the events...as the main chef takes care of everything,so no worries about the service and food...','2026-03-28 17:00:34.271150',1859,375,947),('Anu Murali',5,'Recently they served very good food for our house warming.They served neatly and service is too good.Every one who attended the function likes very much.authentic and tasty food.chappathi channa, and payasam are delicious and I like the most.even we suggest this for our neighbours.price is also reasonable.','2026-03-28 17:00:34.274314',1860,375,947),('Murali Krish',5,'Recently we are arranged KV catering services for House warming ceremony\nGreat experience with KV catering services\nThey\'re provided very tasty and delicious foods ,All varieties of different types of Foods\nVery very Nice\n\nEspecially KV catering Properter presence at location very useful and helpful with us\n\nTotally it\'s very great experience\nWe are fixed our Mindset for all future events this Catering only......','2026-03-28 17:00:34.277895',1861,375,947),('Javeed',5,'Authenticity in taste is what I love about them. Their service quality is also the one we can\'t skip appreciating. If you want authentic vegetarian food for your special occasions, KV catering is the go-to option at the price considered.','2026-03-28 17:00:34.281465',1862,375,947),('sathyanarayana B',4,'This catering team is very efficient and neat with their food preparation. They served food for our function, and all the items were very tasty. The top dishes among the food were pongal and vadai.','2026-03-28 17:00:34.285492',1863,375,947),('〆THARUN',5,'Mutton biriyani taste is so good. The bestest biryani I ever tried.','2026-03-28 17:00:39.627754',1864,376,948),('Vinoth',5,'Mutton and chicken biryani were totally worth it All the guests were satisfied, and this is my third order from Dhayalan Catering.','2026-03-28 17:00:39.631118',1865,376,948),('Nalan flower Decoration',5,'Mutton biryani yummy tasty','2026-03-28 17:00:39.633520',1866,376,948),('Sharadha Chandra Shekhar',5,'Good','2026-03-28 17:00:39.636478',1867,376,948),('Lokesh C',5,'The food service was truly impressive from start to finish. The staff Jayshree polite, attentive, and always ready to help with a smile. Orders were served on time, ensuring a smooth and enjoyable dining experience. Each dish was presented beautifully and tasted fresh and delicious. The team maintained excellent cleanliness and hygiene throughout the service. Special requests were handled with great care and attention, showing their commitment to customer satisfaction. The pleasant atmosphere made the meal even more relaxing and enjoyable. Staff checked in regularly without being intrusive, maintaining a perfect balance of attentiveness. Overall, the service reflected professionalism and genuine hospitality. I would definitely recommend this place for its excellent food and outstanding service.','2026-03-28 17:00:51.355847',1868,377,949),('Malleshwari Boya',5,'Excellent food and service..!  Traditional taste with hospitality. Highly recommend Namma veettu kalyanam catering..\n\nMust try this one','2026-03-28 17:00:51.358808',1869,377,949),('Nirosha V',4,'Guest were praising the food throughout the function. Thank you for the wonderful service tq jena and our team','2026-03-28 17:00:51.361688',1870,377,949),('Durga Durga',5,'The food was absolutely delicious, and every dish was served hot and fresh. The team was incredibly professional, attentive, and made sure everything ran smoothly. We received endless compliments from our guests. Highly recommend for any event!”','2026-03-28 17:00:51.364875',1871,377,949),('ajay karthik',5,'Excellent food and service traditional taste with perfect hospitality.tq so much jeena sir','2026-03-28 17:00:51.367574',1872,377,949),('Lenin Stephen',5,'We ordered 50 nos mutton Briyani for house function. The mutton biryani was very flavourful and  perfectly cooked. The chicken tikka was tender, juicy, and had a great taste. All the dishes were well prepared and thoroughly enjoyed by everyone. Thank you caterers 💐💐💐','2026-03-28 17:00:58.165685',1873,378,954),('jai krishna',5,'The food was truly delicious, especially the mutton biryani 👌. We really appreciate the consistency in taste you’ve maintained over the years.\n\nI personally prefer your catering for all my functions, and I’ve been referring you to all my friends and family as well. Please keep maintaining this same quality and taste always.\n\nGreat job 👍','2026-03-28 17:00:58.168486',1874,378,954),('Linto TI',5,'I have tried many caterers in Chennai, but hands down I can say that Honey caterers are the best so far. The chicken 65 had no coloring and was so tasty, the biriyani had the right amount of spiciness and tasted of authentic Chettinad flavour. The brinjal salna was so yummy not like the usual taste, very refreshing yet so yummy. The gulab jamuns felt like they were just made at home. The biggest highlight of it all was that they provided the plates, even a waste bin for waste disposal. We would recommend anyone in Chennai to take orders from them.','2026-03-28 17:00:58.170814',1875,378,954),('Laila Rajaratnam',5,'Thank you Honey Caterers for a fantastic buffet at our house prayer meeting. The food was very delicious and tasty. The staff was professional and set up was right on time. Everyone enjoyed the dinner. It was  pleasant working on the menu with your team. We would definitely use you again. Thanks.','2026-03-28 17:00:58.174573',1876,378,954),('mathu mathi',5,'The mutton biryani was very tasty, with soft meat and rich flavor.\nThe rice was well cooked, spicy, and smelled amazing.','2026-03-28 17:00:58.177652',1877,378,954),('Avinash Tadavarthy',5,'Shakthi and the Petals N Drapes team did an amazing job handling the decor for all events of my sister’s wedding. From the start, they were easy to communicate with, very responsive, and flexible in turning our ideas into reality. They offered a wide range of creative options and delivered impeccable decor, creating a unique and enjoyable atmosphere for each event. Their choice of designs and colors added a touch of grandeur, and the team was always available on the event day for any last-minute needs. Highly recommended!','2026-03-28 17:01:01.007903',1878,379,955),('Jutika Sampat',5,'Shakti & team at Petalsndrapes do a fantastic job, taking care of all the minor details. Shakti is very polite & soft spoken. My daughter s wedding decor was absolutely stunning & a wow factor at all the events. Highly recommend PerslsNDrapes.','2026-03-28 17:01:01.011267',1879,379,955),('kavya sekar',5,'We had a wonderful experience with petals n drapes. Start from our wedding decor, reception to my recent baby shower event they have been a major part in all our life events. They listen to each and every fine details of the client\'s needs and execute it beyond the expectation. The whole team is a bunch of Pure talents and Professionalism.\nEspecially Mr. Sakthi who acts as a front man to all the clients. The immense growth of the team feels very personal and connected to us. All the very best to future endeavours.','2026-03-28 17:01:01.014506',1880,379,955),('shaik nawailah maheen',5,'If there’s only one choice i had/ one person i’d recommend that would be Mr shakti. This man has moved mountains for us. He took up our project very last minute, we had a million problems from our end. Venue selection to multiple visits. His team, sameer, prakruthi everyone were so so sweet and patient. May his business grow and may you end up on the top list cause you deserve it all. Thankyou would fall short for what they’ve done.','2026-03-28 17:01:01.017850',1881,379,955),('Rhea Sampat',5,'Sakthi and his team did such an incredible job for our wedding and we were over the moon with how everything turned out. Starting right from the decor at home for our puja and mehendi, everything was so well executed. For all our main functions, right from the pre wedding reception until the pheras, we saw the team tirelessly working day and night to put together something so different for each of the events and beautifully integrating all of the personal elements we wanted. All of our guests were in awe of the decor throughout and the teams efforts really showed! Fantastic work by everyone at Petals N Drapes!','2026-03-28 17:01:01.022432',1882,379,955),('Nibin K C',5,'I came all the way to Chennai from Thrissur for attending the beautiful engagement function of my little sis Aishu.. we reached the venu very earlier. The moment I entered the venu hall it was as if getting into a world of my dreams… The ambience you created is just more than anything… Each and every thing .. the placement, the colours,, the aroma.. just awesome..  will definitely recommend your team with pleasure…!!!\n🙂🙂🙂','2026-03-28 17:01:04.149888',1883,380,956),('Priya Dharshini',4,'I have booked Naanal Decors for my housewarming event. Absolutely loved the decoration! The team was super professional and made it just the way I wanted. Thank you Mr.Christopher and team for made our special day more memorable!','2026-03-28 17:01:04.153120',1884,380,956),('Rajmohan R',5,'I feel excited to write a review for Naanal Decors and their outstanding work done for my brother wedding. It took me lot of time to think on what to write because there is no words to describe Mr. Christopher work and dedication towards his commitments. We planned beach wedding for first time but had lot of confusion and doubts on how we are going to make it success. We approached several vendors but out of all, Naanal was the one who said yes for all our requirements and almost fulfilled it. There are two major requirements missed by Naanal team which was planned but considering Mr. Christopher efforts on other areas, we haven’t taken it as a big issue but that needs to be corrected by Naanal team. Overall, Naanal decors is the best event management whom you can trust and plan for your events. Thanks! Mr. Christopher and team for making our family wedding as most memorable and successful!!! Kudos! Team!!','2026-03-28 17:01:04.156415',1885,380,956),('Ramya Sanjana',5,'Yesterday, on 26/01/2025, I celebrated my wedding, and I must say I had an amazing experience with Naanal Decors!\nI completely trusted them with the decor, and they did an incredible job. Everyone loved the decor and appreciated the neatness and attention to detail. They even matched everything perfectly to my outfit and theme it was flawless.\nThe name board, in particular, stole my heart!\nI will definitely recommend them to all my friends and family. Keep up the fantastic, professional, and punctual work.\n\nThank you so much! by MILTON AND RAMYA😍😍😍😍','2026-03-28 17:01:04.159855',1886,380,956),('Richards S D',5,'Beautiful work done by the team naanal decors👌Great team ,creative ideas and smooth arrangement yet elegant.Definitely recommending them to everyone ❤️','2026-03-28 17:01:04.162457',1887,380,956),('Vanisri Sivakumar',5,'Choosing Pandian sir and his team for our daughter\'s wedding at MRC was one of the best decisions we made. Their professionalism and keen eye for detail were apparent from day one. They offered thoughtful suggestions and ensured every aspect of the setup was prompt and completely stress-free. The resulting decorations were simply exquisite—elegant, vibrant, and beautifully crafted, they absolutely captivated our guests and brought such warmth to our celebrations. We highly recommend them for their unwavering commitment to quality, professionalism, and delivering absolute peace of mind for any event\'s decorative needs. Thank you for your truly fantastic work!!!','2026-03-28 17:01:10.635494',1888,381,958),('Raju Family',5,'My family recently conducted my daughter’s wedding at AMRK Banquet Hall and the contractor  we arranged to do all the decorations is Pandian & Co.\n\nOn hindsight this was the best decision we could have made as Mr. Pandian and his staff did wonderful job in coming up with very creative ideas starting from providing us sketches and via discussions at his office.  His team that includes Mrs. Harini Pandian were friendly and keenly listened & understood our expectations.  The key factor we enjoyed working with them was creative value-add they constantly provided through out the wedding preparations process.  Mr. Pandian is truly a professional and always has Plan B as we had some rains during Mehndi/Sangeet event and we had to make last minute arrangements for our guests.\n\nI will not share the cost but my whole family feel it was worth every rupee.  So thank you Mr. Pandian, for your very competent support and help with our daughter’s wedding decorations. Well done and needless to say, I will recommend your Co. with no hesitation.  Best wishes.','2026-03-28 17:01:10.638857',1889,381,958),('ramesh raja',5,'We had a wonderful experience with Pandian Decorators for our son’s wedding. From the very beginning, they patiently listened to all the changes we insisted on and gave us plenty of good options to choose from. Their flexibility and professionalism made the entire process stress-free.\n\nOn the wedding day, the decoration looked absolutely amazing on stage and received so many compliments from our guests. We are fully satisfied with their work and would highly recommend Pandian Decorators to anyone looking for creative, reliable, and elegant wedding decorations.','2026-03-28 17:01:10.642400',1890,381,958),('D Venkatesan',5,'We hired the services of Pandian Decorators for decoration relating to my daughter\'s wedding on 4th and 5th March, 2026 at AVM Rajeswari Kalyana Mandapam. The planning, execution and display of every single decor for different events was of a high Professional calibre. Everything happened like clockwork so much so that it was all ready much before we needed to think about ticking another item in the check box. Wishing Pandian Decorators further success in their business.','2026-03-28 17:01:10.646060',1891,381,958),('Suresh Thirumalaichari',5,'Mr Pandian did the decoration for my daughter\'s wedding at MRC. He came with entirely different and distinct four themes for four occasions of the marriage. (1) Mehandi (2) Engagement (3) Reception (4) Wedding. All the four wonderful and well appreciated by all the guests. Mr Pandian is a patient listener and intervenes only when required. The execution was astounding. And, finally the most important aspect of him: He does not over-charge and provides additional information to keep it cost-effective without compromising on the grandeur. All the very best to him and his team','2026-03-28 17:01:10.649955',1892,381,958),('Guruprasath Krishnasamy',5,'The backstage decoration for my son’s birthday was absolutely outstanding. The Astro Bot (PS5) theme was brought to life with vibrant colours and perfect detailing. Every element matched the game’s aesthetic and made the event feel magical. The organiser’s creativity and professionalism truly exceeded our expectations. We’re extremely happy with the outcome and highly recommend their services','2026-03-28 17:01:15.156756',1893,382,962),('Sowjanya Chandrasekar',5,'We contacted Kokila mam for my brother\'s Nalungu function decoration. She was very patient in hearing our ideas and explained her perspective. The decoration turned out very beautiful and all of us loved it. Thank you for your sincere service.','2026-03-28 17:01:15.160189',1894,382,962),('Madhumithra Raja',5,'I had availed their welcome board services and they had done a good job of it.\n\nLooking forward to collaborating with them in future.','2026-03-28 17:01:15.163329',1895,382,962),('keerthana sundaram',5,'Excellent service from the event organizers who handled our welcome boards and signage! The representative who managed our project demonstrated outstanding communication skills throughout the entire process. She provided clear, detailed explanations of the UV printing process, which helped us understand exactly what to expect.\nWhat impressed me most was her patience and professionalism when handling our multiple revision requests. Despite the numerous edits we requested, she listened attentively to each change and implemented the modifications promptly without any hesitation. Her customer service approach made the entire experience smooth and stress-free.\nHighly recommend their services for anyone needing quality signage and professional event support.','2026-03-28 17:01:15.166869',1896,382,962),('Aishwariya Venkatramanan',5,'We are very happy with the decorations\nVery affordable\nThank you Kokila','2026-03-28 17:01:15.170460',1897,382,962),('Yaseen Aamir',5,'We had a fantastic experience with Mr. Karthik for our wedding decor. He took our vision and turned it into a reality with such elegance and style. The venue looked breathtaking, and we received so many compliments from our guests. Highly recommended for his professionalism and eye for detail!','2026-03-28 17:01:20.816014',1898,383,964),('Rajashri ganesh',5,'We are extremely happy with the decor for our wedding. Every detail was thoughtfully planned and beautifully executed. Karthik sir understood our vision perfectly and brought it to life with so much elegance. From the setup to the final look, everything felt magical. Thank you for your patience, creativity, and hard work—it truly made our day special.','2026-03-28 17:01:20.818592',1899,383,964),('Rishita Shah',5,'We had the absolute pleasure of working with Karthik and his team for our special event, and we couldn’t be happier with how everything turned out. From start to finish, Karthik was nothing short of amazing — incredibly professional, responsive, and truly passionate about what he does.\n\nThe decor was stunning — every detail was thoughtfully curated and beautifully executed. From the floral arrangements to the lighting and stage setup, everything looked elegant, vibrant, and exactly how we envisioned it (if not better!). The space was completely transformed into something magical.\n\nKarthik was patient with all our ideas, offered helpful suggestions, and was always ready to go the extra mile to make sure everything was perfect. His creativity, attention to detail, and calm demeanor made the whole experience stress-free and enjoyable.\n\nWe received so many compliments from our guests, and it’s all thanks to the amazing work by Karthik and his talented team.\n\nIf you’re looking for someone who genuinely cares and will deliver exceptional decor, look no further than Karthik. Highly recommend!','2026-03-28 17:01:20.821085',1900,383,964),('joe priya',5,'Ofcourse it will be an star rating for giving the best we wanted . Team has bought All our dreamy expectations to an reality.  Additional last minute support on Garlands and DJ was an life saver .\n\nGo for it with no doubts to experience a dreamy Wedding and reception decor . Extremely happy to work with Karthik and his team for their endless support on the decoration , garlands & DJ , customized name boards.','2026-03-28 17:01:20.824190',1901,383,964),('venkata subramanian',5,'Excellent. Karthik was accessible anytime, understands what we need and delivered exactly what we needed to meet better than our expectations. Keep it up Hi Look Decorators. Great job with great professionalism. Punctual. Very much appreciated by all our guests who attended the event.','2026-03-28 17:01:20.827015',1902,383,964),('bala guhan',5,'I had a wonderful experience with Shiva Decors yesterday for my daughter’s Half-Saree ceremony. The venue was beautifully decorated with fresh flowers and had a lovely ambience that was highly praised by our guests and family. We couldn\'t be happier with how everything turned out.','2026-03-28 17:01:24.425179',1903,384,967),('subramani r',5,'had booked Shiva and team for my engagement décor. Initially, I was quite confused about the decoration ideas, but Shiva guided me well and delivered an outstanding setup. The decoration was beautiful, elegant, and grand—beyond my expectations. Thank you so much Shiva and team for making my special day even more memorable!”','2026-03-28 17:01:24.427991',1904,384,967),('Harishita S',5,'The decor for my mom’s 60th birthday was absolutely beautiful and exceeded our expectations. Shiva did a wonderful job and was very patient in listening to all our suggestions and corrections. He made sure every change we asked for was done perfectly, and the final setup looked elegant and special. Truly grateful for the effort and dedication—highly recommend his work!','2026-03-28 17:01:24.430548',1905,384,967),('Harish Balasubramanian',5,'Shiva is best in his work. Had planned for my daughter\'s 1st birthday and he had done an amazing job. We shared him few ideas and finalized one of it. The outcome was so great that everyone loved and was beyond what we actually expected.','2026-03-28 17:01:24.432970',1906,384,967),('Satish Anand',5,'Shiva\'s creativity and his team was really fantastic, they delivered the design exactly what was in my mind and finalised for my Sons birthday party. The outcome was simply superb! Thanks a lot 🙏 keep up the good work!','2026-03-28 17:01:24.435593',1907,384,967),('uma lakshmanan',5,'RB3 creations did excellent job for arranging varisai thattu, and delivering it on time with all the details that I requested for a puberty function in Chennai. All these things done in 24 hrs as I contacted them last minute from USA. They helped me to buy half saree also from the shop that I have asked. Overall, the customer service excellent, and impressive. Initially recommend this service.\n\nThank you so much Rajaram sir','2026-03-28 17:01:27.035442',1908,385,968),('Ela Selvaraj',5,'Great service. I have booked them for my engagement last month (Dec 2018)  in Chennai. Initially I hesitated because of the work setup at their home. However after listening to their experience I went ahead and it was the best decision. On time delivery and the quality of work is absolutely top notch. I can recommend them strongly, which saves us a lot of time and stress. Cost wise they are very reasonable!','2026-03-28 17:01:27.039667',1909,385,968),('Pavithran D',5,'Thank you for the wonderful decoration and quality of the items. Everyone appreciated the decor, in fact your decorated items were used by photographers extensively in their shoots. Thanks once again for not letting me down in chennai. Good work keep it up !!! 👍','2026-03-28 17:01:27.043853',1910,385,968),('Kishore Kumar S Narasimhan',5,'We ordered 13-plate seer varisai for my brother\'s engagement along with Garland.. Everyone loved the aesthetics and the ingredients. The packing was nicely done. Overall worth for the money and reduces your work to a certain extent!','2026-03-28 17:01:27.047232',1911,385,968),('Jaikrish J',5,'Aarthi plaes decorations is Amazing and Ideas of Aarthi plates Especially Bullcard with Tradition Wedding Dolls was extremely superb Everybody impressed, Thanks Bhavani Madam','2026-03-28 17:01:27.050678',1912,385,968),('sandy premkumar',5,'Our house warming ceremony was handled by the team recently. Right from the start, I loved their enthusiasm and drive. They were able to grasp what I’m looking right from the get go. Both the decor and food turned out to be way better than what I hoped for and the guests were all praise for it. Would definitely go again to them for any of our upcoming celebrations.\nBest wishes for the team to continue their excellent work!','2026-03-28 17:01:28.776911',1913,386,969),('Lavanya Shanthi',5,'I gave (vegetarian and non-vegetarian, cake, popcorn, sugar candy, smoke biscuits,cold pyro, and a welcome drink) orders to Mr. Karthic for my daughter\'s 1st birthday. The food\'s taste and quality, as well as their service, were amazing on our big day. Thank you, Mr. Kartick, for making our occasion really special and memorable. All our guests felt happy about the delicious food, and so many compliments were received from my relatives. I ordered a customised birthday cake; it\'s really top-notch. He is frequently making calls and informing us if there is any insufficient food due to an unexpected increase in count. He is managing well and is much needed. Honestly, there are no disappointments.','2026-03-28 17:01:28.779182',1914,386,969),('Banumathi V',5,'We hired Abroad Events for our event, and the experience was excellent! The food was fresh, flavorful, and beautifully presented. Guests especially loved the Sambar and Vatha Kulambu. The team was professional, punctual, and handled everything smoothly from setup to service.\n\nWhat stood out was their attention to detail and willingness to customize the menu according to our preferences. The service staff were courteous and ensured everyone was well taken care of.\n\nHighly recommend them for anyone looking for reliable and tasty catering. Will definitely book again for future events!','2026-03-28 17:01:28.781627',1915,386,969),('Dhivya Bharathi',5,'They were the wonderful team who gives us budget friendly celebration... From the food, decoration to photos have been arranged excellently... We are very satisfied and content with the way it has been arranged.... Thank u team...','2026-03-28 17:01:28.783615',1916,386,969),('Kohila Warnan',5,'Thanks to Mr. Karthick for perfect wedding arrangements.\nRecently i have availed service for family event & the entire arrangements were budget friendly.\nThe entire arrangements were on time and perfectly aligned, much recommended.','2026-03-28 17:01:28.785514',1917,386,969),('kishore kumar',5,'I am truly overwhelmed by the beautiful Seer Varisai plate decoration done for my engagement. Every plate was crafted with so much love, creativity, and perfection. The colour combination was stunning, and the arrangement reflected such elegance and tradition. Seeing the plates made my special day feel even more meaningful and memorable. Everything was delivered on time with great care. I am extremely happy and fully satisfied with their wonderful work. Highly recommended from the heart thank you soo much umarani..','2026-03-28 17:01:31.637214',1918,387,970),('kalawathy A',5,'I found this yuktha creations from Google and arranged for my sister\'s son house warming function the quality the products and decoration r really awesome and everyone  in India appreciated the arrangement  i thank yukthateam for their sincere work and I will recommend them for those who need decors also for their sincerity dedication and prompt delivery','2026-03-28 17:01:31.641341',1919,387,970),('Monica',5,'Had a awesome doll decoration on our babyshower which add a elegances and beauty to our big day which is so welcoming','2026-03-28 17:01:31.644943',1920,387,970),('Keerthika K',5,'Recently ordered Seer varisai plates for my son\'s ear piercing ceremony, plates are beautifully wrapped & presented well ❤️ Thank you so much for the timely delivery as well.','2026-03-28 17:01:31.648420',1921,387,970),('Bakthavatchalam Varadhamohan',5,'Very experience working, and economically cost,verious budget available. Good response and timely delivery, no tension.he preference customer satisfaction first, money is secondary. Good job keep it up.','2026-03-28 17:01:31.651991',1922,387,970),('hasna arshia',5,'Disa Decorations did an absolutely amazing job for engagement ceremony! The stage setup was stunning , elegant and had a truly royal touch. Every detail, from the floral arrangements to the lighting and backdrop, was perfectly done and exceeded our expectations. The team was professional, punctual, and ensured everything looked flawless till the very end.\nThank you, Disa Decorations, for making our special day look so grand and memorable. Highly recommend them to anyone looking for classy and creative décor!✨','2026-03-28 17:01:38.921055',1923,388,971),('Priyanka Jawahar',5,'A 100% recommendation. Very sincere, budget friendly options, timely clean work admist soo much of confusion and restriction from the venue we booked. Anne is a genuine, dedicated and hardworking event manager. Would love to work with her and her team in our future events too.','2026-03-28 17:01:38.924761',1924,388,971),('Elakki K',5,'Disa Decorations has supported us with two events over the past 7 months, and both times they went above and beyond my expectations. Their commitment is evident—they always complete the setup well ahead of schedule, allowing me to focus on other aspects of the event without stress.\n\nIn today’s fast-paced world, it’s rare to find people who truly take the time to understand your needs, but Disa Decorations is different. They actively listen, ask the right questions to get a clear understanding of requirements, and even share sample images to help visualize the final outcome.\n\nTheir services go far beyond just decorations. They assist with creative invitations, plan fun and meaningful activities for the event, arrange food, and essentially provide an end-to-end solution for hosting events. Most importantly, they beautifully capture precious moments and share them with thoughtful editing.\n\nFrom the founders to every team member, their dedication and sincerity are unmistakable. They don’t work just to get the job done—every event they handle carries a special personal touch that makes it truly memorable.','2026-03-28 17:01:38.928791',1925,388,971),('narmadha b',5,'Thank you for disa decorations private limited for providing us a beautiful decoration on the occasion of my baby\'s first birthday at home.\n\nThey have provided us the best customized design according to our house. Thank\'s giving carry bag and birthday cap everything worked out very well\nDuring this pandemic situation I can  assure that you will get a safe journey with disa decorations. All the working ppl were vaccinated and they maintain a good hygiene.\n\n#Disa Decorations','2026-03-28 17:01:38.932082',1926,388,971),('mercy mercy',5,'Despite of very short span of time (5hrs)Disa Decorations Pvt Limited Ms.Annie Arranged materials for stage setup as per my requirements Nd Gave beautiful stage set up for my Daughter’s First Holy communion more than expected!! Disa Decorations pvt limited is budget friendly with Luxury outlook which is very very rare to get nd yes I got a very professional Event Manager Ms.Annie who literally made the event with High standard!!\n\nI personally Thank the whole team for wonderful output at last moment of my plan\n\nHighly Recommended !!!','2026-03-28 17:01:38.935198',1927,388,971),('jananijanu687@gmail.com jananijanu',5,'Vinoth’s exceptional work has exceeded expectations. The successful execution of the marriage ceremony, as planned, is a testament to his dedication and expertise. His team’s collaboration has been widely recognized, and their efforts have undoubtedly delighted the customers. The positive outcomes and willingness to pay for their hard work are a clear indication of their success.\nVinoth’s continued efforts are commendable, and the team’s collective performance is a source of inspiration. Well done, and keep up the excellent work!','2026-03-28 17:01:40.851148',1928,389,975),('Tejashwini Teju',5,'Posh Petals Events is the premier flower decoration team that executed an exceptional job of decorating for my wedding. Their timely and meticulous stage decoration was truly impressive. I would like to express my sincere gratitude to the entire Posh Petals team for their exceptional work.','2026-03-28 17:01:40.854878',1929,389,975),('Ambiga Murthy',5,'We engaged the services of Posh Petals Decorators for our reception, and Vinoth delivered exceptional services at a very reasonable price. I would highly recommend their services and rate them 10/10.','2026-03-28 17:01:40.858523',1930,389,975),('Bhagyalaxmi',5,'very punctual n tidy work for my baby shower.','2026-03-28 17:01:40.861860',1931,389,975),('Jetti srenuvasulu Srenivasulu',5,'Best n nice decoration for my sis engagement.','2026-03-28 17:01:40.864938',1932,389,975),('leo praveen kumar',5,'A huge shout-out to Nivan Decors for the absolutely breathtaking decorations at Feathers Hotel for our wedding and reception. 🌸✨\n\nEvery element was thoughtfully curated and executed to perfection—from the majestic stage setup and exquisite floral arrangements to the flawless lighting and overall ambience. The décor was elegant, classy, and far beyond what we had envisioned. Truly spectacular.\n\nA special note of appreciation to CEO Mr. Antony Kirubakaran for the impeccable vision and leadership, and heartfelt thanks to Sejal ma’am for the constant coordination and timely updates that made the entire process seamless and stress-free.\n\nWe had countless guests personally come up to us praising the décor, which speaks volumes about the excellence of Nivan Decors. They truly transformed the venue into something magical and unforgettable.\n\nHighly recommended for anyone seeking grand, tasteful, and flawless wedding décor. Thank you for making our special days extraordinarily memorable. 💐💫','2026-03-28 17:01:47.499104',1933,390,977),('Sumalatha S',4,'My sister’s wedding decoration was done by Nivan events and we had selected a set of decorations that suited us. They were kind enough to make changes to it to accommodate our budget, even though it went a little over our budget, it was worthy. The decoration turned out to be very very good and also the venue had some voltage issues but still the team was able to cope up with it and make sure that the event turned out to be a successful one. We are happy with the result and also would recommend them for anyone who wants to get decorations done. They came far away to do this decor for us.\nThank you Nivan Events','2026-03-28 17:01:47.501648',1934,390,977),('Samyuktha Murali',5,'Anthony is one of the best person I have worked with. He has given the output we wanted at a very economical cost. Very prompt in responding and very proactive team. I would definitely suggest nivan for any event at your place.','2026-03-28 17:01:47.504117',1935,390,977),('Nagaraj Varadharaj',5,'I have opted their service for my wedding reception held at my hometown in Udumalpet, Coimbatore. Their decorations are really amazing and more of western style that’s why I opted for their service. I am the regular follower of their Instagram page.  Antony bro is really friendly in nature and helpful and reachable always. They have bunch of decorations which varies from budget to premium. Our whole family is happy with their service. Staffs also really responsible and they arrived to Venue on  time and completed all the decorations on time. They have recreated whatever shown in the sample pictures as it is. Quality of materials they used are premium. There is no compromises in quality based on the budget.Keep up the great work guys.','2026-03-28 17:01:47.506553',1936,390,977),('kaviya sri',5,'So we hired Nivan decors for our engagement. At first I was not sure about what decoration to be made while enquiring other decors they were just showing us decor images with the rate. But with nivan decors it was different, he called us personally to show  virtually how it would look in real by changing color theme, lights etc which suits our attire. At the event day it was more than what we excepted it was classy and neat no clumsy work at all. Thanks nivan decors you did a wonderful job!','2026-03-28 17:01:47.509433',1937,390,977),('Akila Thamizharasan',5,'Shine Flora truly exceeded my expectations with their impeccable decor and attention to detail. Their creativity and expertise were evident in every element, from the beautifully curated floral arrangements to the seamless setup that transformed the entire space.\n\nWhat stood out the most was their commitment to understanding my preferences and bringing them to life effortlessly. The team was professional, efficient, and dedicated, ensuring a stress-free experience from start to finish. Their work added an undeniable charm to the event, making it truly special. I would highly recommend Shine Flora to anyone looking for elegant and high-quality decor solutions.','2026-03-28 17:01:54.279274',1938,391,980),('Chandhrabose P',5,'We recently chose Shine Flora for our event decor, and it was an absolute delight working with their team. From the first consultation to the final execution, they were professional, creative, and extremely responsive to our needs. The decor was elegant, thoughtful, and perfectly aligned with our theme. Every detail, from the floral arrangements to the stage setup, reflected their commitment to quality and aesthetics. Our guests were truly impressed, and we received so many compliments on the decor. I would highly recommend Shine Flora to anyone looking for reliable and stunning event decoration services. Their passion for what they do truly shines through!','2026-03-28 17:01:54.281924',1939,391,980),('Venkatesh kumar',5,'We tied the knot on 12th April at Green Meadows Resort, ECR, Chennai, and choosing Shine Flora for our wedding decor was the best decision we made.\n\nRight from the planning phase, Rahul and Gokul were super approachable and full of creative ideas. We wanted a vibrant, nature-inspired theme to suit the open garden setting — and they absolutely nailed it! The use of colors, fresh flowers, and elegant structures gave the entire venue a refreshing and festive vibe.\n\nWhat stood out most was their eye for detail and how smoothly everything was executed. We didn’t have to worry about a single thing on the day — the setup was completed well ahead of time and looked even better than we imagined.\n\nA big thank you to Shine Flora for making our big day so lively, beautiful, and stress-free. We’d recommend them to any couple looking for reliable and creative wedding decorators!','2026-03-28 17:01:54.284470',1940,391,980),('uma mathu',5,'I recently hired Shine Flora for my daughter\'s wedding, and I couldn\'t be happier with the results! From start to finish, they were amazing to work with. The team really listened to what we wanted and brought our vision to life beautifully. The floral arrangements, centerpieces, and overall decor were stunning, and everything came together perfectly. Our guests were blown away by how gorgeous everything looked. If you\'re looking for top-notch wedding decor, I highly recommend Shine Flora! They made the day feel extra special.','2026-03-28 17:01:54.288077',1941,391,980),('Samuel Abisheik',5,'Our cousins  wedding planning had a lot of last-minute changes, but the Shine Flora team handled everything with a smile. Whether it was changing the floral colors, adding more decor elements, or adjusting the stage setup, they were always willing to accommodate our requests. A Team That Never Says No!\n\nWhat truly amazed us was their 24/7 availability—even at odd hours, they responded to our queries and provided solutions. Their commitment to customer satisfaction is unparalleled. If you need a team that is supportive, dedicated, and exceptionally creative, Shine Flora is the answer!','2026-03-28 17:01:54.291587',1942,391,980),('naresh kumar',5,'Thank you so much Johnson bro and Team for turning our vision into reality for our baby shower function. The decor was exactly done the way we imagined. We are fully satisfied with your work. Thankyou🙂','2026-03-28 17:02:02.102913',1943,392,983),('Banu Anwar',5,'Thank you Johnson Anna and team! We are truly grateful for the incredible effort you put into decorating my sister\'s wedding reception. The setup was nothing short of magical, and it perfectly captured the joyous and elegant atmosphere we envisioned for this special day.\n\nEvery detail, from the stunning stage to the vibrant floral arrangements, reflected your creativity and dedication. Thank you for going above and beyond to make this event unforgettable for our family. We deeply appreciate your professionalism and talent.','2026-03-28 17:02:02.106311',1944,392,983),('Saran kumar G',5,'The reception decor was nothing short of breathtaking! From the elegant floral arrangements to the beautifully lit stage backdrop, every element added a touch of class and charm to the venue. The entrance arch and the personalized welcome board created the perfect first impression for our guests. The color palette, intricate detailing, and thoughtful placement of decorations showed the team\'s creativity and dedication.\n\nA huge thanks to Johnson and his talented team for turning our dream into reality. Their professionalism, attention to detail, and ability to understand our vision made the day truly memorable. Highly recommended for anyone seeking perfection in wedding decor!\"','2026-03-28 17:02:02.109942',1945,392,983),('vimal raj',5,'I wanted to take a moment to express my sincere gratitude for the incredible work your team did in making our recent event a resounding success. From the warm reception our guests received to the stunning Muhurtham decoration, everything exceeded our expectations.\n\nThank you for your professionalism, creativity, and the passion you brought to every aspect of the planning and execution. It\'s clear that your team truly cares about creating unforgettable moments for your clients.\n\nWe feel incredibly fortunate to have worked with you and look forward to collaborating again in the future.','2026-03-28 17:02:02.113507',1946,392,983),('Soffia Innasiar',5,'Hi, JD decorators made wonderful day of my event! Good team work and customized based on my needs with colorful out. Stage, entrance, back drop was all good and superb. Thank you Jhonson for making my big day!','2026-03-28 17:02:02.116455',1947,392,983),('A.Nelson',5,'Very nice;\nVery Hord worker;\nVery proud of you sir;\nNice meet you sir;\nTanks;\nGod bless you sir,','2026-03-28 17:02:08.796371',1948,393,987),('Sha Thri',5,'Good service','2026-03-28 17:02:08.799400',1949,393,987),('JAIN VIJAY KOCHAR',5,'No comments , simply awesome','2026-03-28 17:02:08.802282',1950,393,987),('Ajith C',5,'Good and knowledgeable','2026-03-28 17:02:08.805281',1951,393,987),('Debabrata Chakrabortty',5,'Nice','2026-03-28 17:02:08.808720',1952,393,987),('Vignesh S',5,'Honestly, we didn’t expect everything to turn out this well. From the beginning, the team was very easy to talk to and understood what we wanted without us explaining too much.\n\nIf someone asks me about good Wedding Planners in Chennai, I’ll definitely say Vinayaka Weddings & Event’s. Grace and the team really put their heart into the work. The decor looked beautiful, and so many guests came and told us how nice everything was. We’re really thankful they handled our wedding — it felt special and stress-free.','2026-03-28 17:02:12.794684',1953,394,992),('NANDHAKUMAR S',5,'We were honestly worried about how everything would come together for our big day, but choosing the right team made all the difference. From the first meeting, they were patient, understanding, and easy to work with.\n\nIf anyone is searching for dependable Wedding Planners in Chennai, I would genuinely recommend them. They handled the ecor, coordination, and timing so smoothly that we could simply enjoy our wedding without stress. We’re truly grateful for the effort they put into making our day special.','2026-03-28 17:02:12.797585',1954,394,992),('PURUSHOTH. A',5,'We are very happy with VINAYAKA WEDDING\'S & EVENT\'S. From day one, the team listened patiently and planned everything perfectly. If anyone is searching for reliable Wedding Planners in Chennai, I truly recommend them. Our wedding day was smooth, beautiful, and stress-free. Thank you, Venkatesh sir and team!','2026-03-28 17:02:12.800591',1955,394,992),('Aron Nithish',5,'We didn’t want a complicated wedding, just something neat and well-organized. The team understood that and delivered exactly what we expected.\n\nFinding reliable Wedding Planners in Chennai isn’t easy, but these people genuinely care about their work. Because of them, we enjoyed our wedding without stress.','2026-03-28 17:02:12.803337',1956,394,992),('Ponmanikandan C',5,'We recently had our engagement function, and we are truly happy with how everything turned out. The team clearly understood what our family expected and delivered it beautifully. The decoration was elegant, well-arranged, and exactly how we imagined.\nChoosing the right Wedding Planners in Chennai was important for us, and VINAYAKA WEDDING\'S & EVENT\'S made that decision easy. Their planning, coordination, and attention to detail made the entire event feel calm and stress-free. We’re thankful for their effort in making our special day memorable.','2026-03-28 17:02:12.805347',1957,394,992),('Sangeetha V',5,'Thank you for everyone to Joyous wedding planet for my son 1st Birthday event & more memorable moments. Everything Good Decorations, Photoshoot, Videos and Food Servering Good team coordinations has done. What all need for function we received from you. Thankyou so much definitely we use upcoming event in my family 🫶❤️👍Iam so happy we enjoyed good moment 🫶','2026-03-28 17:02:16.448687',1958,395,993),('Krithika Selvam',3,'The food served at the engagement was outstanding. The starters were fresh, especially the gulab jamun and panner butter masala which were crowd favorites. The main course had a great balance of traditional and modern dishes. The veg biryani was perfectly spiced, and the butter naan was soft and hot throughout the event. Desserts were the highlight — the gulab jamun and kulfi received nonstop praise. Overall, the catering was excellent and well-organized','2026-03-28 17:02:16.450805',1959,395,993),('ѕharn',5,'Absolutely fantastic catering! I booked them for my entire event from start to end, and they made the best of the best — delicious food, great service, and flawless execution.\nThank you so much','2026-03-28 17:02:16.453471',1960,395,993),('E Sindhu',4,'For my engagement, we ordered photography and catering services, which were good. The photography was done well, though more pictures could be added. The catering food was good. Separately, we ordered sweets (not for the engagement), and they were good and affordable. Thank you joyous catering team. Thank you lokesh bro!!!','2026-03-28 17:02:16.455416',1961,395,993),('Mr Alone',5,'We recently ordered food from this catering service for an event. Everything was well-prepared, hygienic, and served on time. The guests really appreciated the taste and presentation. Excellent work by the team!','2026-03-28 17:02:16.457805',1962,395,993),('Julie John',5,'I cannot thank Grace and her team enough. She was AMAZING. I coordinated three events with her while being abroad. We worked through time difference and my many questions. She made every event spectacular. Every guest was impressed with the decor, taking photos continuously.\n\nAmong all my vendors, Grace and her team went above and beyond what was promised.\n\nI highly recommend Cathy events for your decor needs, small and large.\n\nThank you Grace and team, you made my wedding unforgettable!','2026-03-28 17:02:21.586100',1963,396,998),('Sherene Robinson',5,'Hello :)\nCathy events did a wonderful job at my wedding at Garrison church.\n\nLoved the Photo Booth which met my expectations as it was curated on customisation.\nLoved the entrance & the lights on our pathway. Added a lot of aesthetic view to the whole pathway.\n\nThe box with our names in both our wedding & reception was cute!\n\nThe stage had all the elements of colours & lights in perfect match.\n\nThank you for addressing all the last minute queries too. Thank you for making our event & pictures really memorable!\n\nWould suggest them for anyone who’s looking for events! :)','2026-03-28 17:02:21.589165',1964,396,998),('DEEPAK NETAM',5,'Cathy Event did a fabulous job decorating our reception stage. The décor was elegant, detailed, and far beyond what we had asked for. Special thanks to Grace for coordinating everything so smoothly. We were totally satisfied and truly impressed with their professionalism. Highly recommended','2026-03-28 17:02:21.592253',1965,396,998),('Daniel John Paul',5,'Cathy Events Decor did an amazing job with the decor for my wedding at the church! Everything looked absolutely beautiful and exceeded our expectations. Their attention to detail, creativity, and professionalism really stood out. They made the whole place feel magical and memorable. Highly recommend them for any special occasion!','2026-03-28 17:02:21.595510',1966,396,998),('Deepan Raj Aravindan',5,'We have recently hired Cathy Events for our daughter’s first birthday celebration and we are absolutely thrilled with how everything turned out! Their vibrant and high quality decorations was beyond what we have imagined.\n\nGrace was very polite in clarifying all our queries and gave positive suggestions based on our requirement. Ourselves and everyone in the family was excited to see the decorated party hall.\n\nThe room was transformed into a fun, festive space that really set the tone for the celebration. Plus, the colors and designs were so photogenic. Our guests loved taking pictures in front of the decorations!\n\nThank you Grace and Cathy Events, the birthday celebration wouldn’t have been the same without these beautiful touches. I highly recommend this service to anyone planning a special event. It made the day feel even more memorable and added that extra bit of magic!','2026-03-28 17:02:21.598664',1967,396,998),('Suresh Narayanan',5,'We recently celebrated our daughter’s three-day wedding in Koyambedu, Chennai at Sree Varaaham Wedding Hall, and we had the absolute pleasure of partnering with Marriage Colors as our décor and event coordination team. Looking back, choosing them was one of the best decisions we made for this wedding.\n\nFrom Day 1 itself, during the Sangeet/Mehndi evening hosted on the rooftop, Marriage Colors set an extraordinary tone for the celebrations.\nThe lighting design and special effects transformed the rooftop into a magical celebration space. The dance floor setup, vibrant backdrops, and center stage décor were simply phenomenal. Many of our friends and relatives personally appreciated the ambience and overall execution. The buffet layout was equally well organized, allowing us to comfortably meet and greet the groom’s family and guests in a relaxed, festive atmosphere.\n\nDay 2 began with the Vritham ceremony in the morning and concluded with the grand evening reception. The transformation across all three floors of the venue was breathtaking — from the main entrance, patio areas, waterfalls on the ground floor, staircase décor, and main hall entrance to the stage, side setups, Oonjal arrangement, and dining hall. For the reception, the bride and groom had selected a specific color theme, and Marriage Colors meticulously coordinated their fresh flower arrangements to match the palette across the entire venue. The result was elegant, cohesive, and visually stunning.\n\nOne of the most critical and sensitive events was the Janavasam procession from the temple to the hall along a public road — a deeply meaningful tradition for our family. We were concerned about traffic management and public safety. Marriage Colors coordinated seamlessly with the venue and local authorities to ensure smooth traffic flow while allowing us to enjoy the celebration stress-free. Their planning and execution here were truly outstanding.\n\nOn Day 3, for the wedding ceremony, we requested a completely traditional theme. Without hesitation, the team transformed the entire ambiance from contemporary elegance to classic tradition. Every guest who attended the ceremony enquired about the décor team, and we were proud to provide numerous referrals.\n\nBeyond décor, Marriage Colors played a broader coordination role by recommending trusted vendors for the venue, catering, makeup, special effects, MC and DJ for Sangeet, instrumental band for reception, Mehndi artists, fireworks, Sandamelam during Janavasam, and more. Their ecosystem of vendors contributed significantly to the overall grandeur and success of the wedding. Every member of the Marriage Colors team worked tirelessly — Pradeep, Sudakar, Rajesh, Rashmi, Lokesh, Elamparithi, Dharani, Chandru, and Siva. Special thanks to Sudakar and Rajesh for their personal attention throughout all three days. Sudakar, in particular, was an absolute pleasure to work with.\n\nFinally, our heartfelt gratitude to Pradeep from Marriage Colors — the driving force behind the entire event. Our conversations began over a year ago and continued even after the wedding concluded. Pradeep’s professionalism, warmth, constant guidance, and friendly reassurance made this journey not only successful but memorable. We genuinely cannot imagine having executed such a grand and seamless wedding without his support.\n\nThe success and grandeur of a wedding truly depend on the right vendor partnership. Marriage Colors exceeded our expectations in every way. We wholeheartedly thank the entire team and their leadership for delivering an unforgettable experience. We highly recommend Marriage Colors to anyone looking to host a truly exceptional family celebration and look forward to partnering with them again in the future.\n\n— Suresh, Geetha & Family','2026-03-28 17:02:29.256819',1968,397,1001),('Nerissa T',5,'My husband and I selected Marriage Colours for our haldi, reception and wedding. We had an excellent experience with them on all fronts, and would strongly recommend them. 5 stars!\n\nPre-engagement\nWe first met Pradhyumna Venkat in Singapore about 7 months before our event. We came out of the meeting with a positive impression. We appreciated that he was very helpful and generous with his time even before we formally engaged his team. For instance, he recommended a number of different venues in Chennai and checked with them on their availability.\n\nPlanning\nThroughout the planning process, the team’s experience really shone. They took us through each stage of the planning process in a professional and reassuring manner. As we had a strong view and vision of how our events should turn out, we liked that the team took in all our detailed feedback and incorporated them capably, but still made it a point to advise us and provide clear guidance where needed. We had a large number of long calls with them to run through the details, and the team showed great patience and professionalism with us.\n\nService Model\nWe liked their approach of charging us a professional service fee for their planning work, but otherwise asking us to settle directly with the various vendors, after negotiating on our behalf. They had no issues with us deviating from their recommended service providers  and often got us better rates than we were willing to pay. At no point did we get a feeling that they were acting with misaligned incentives or overcharging us. Negotiations on costs for their in-house services seemed to be in good faith. They were diligent enough in their account keeping and tracked everything in spreadsheets.\n\nThey were always delighted in going the extra mile (e.g. groom\'s birthday surprise for the bride). Occasionally, they insisted politely against our judgement, and often those decisions turned out to be big winners.\n\nVendors\nMC provided detailed and useful recommendations on vendors and service providers. Most of the vendors were chosen based on their recommendations (see list below). We were very happy with the services provided. It seemed to us that they were not pocketing anything from these vendors.\n\nRitam and Taranga (venue)\nCitadines (guest accommodation)\nCrownstone by Revathi (makeup)\nBala Tourist Service & Swarna Travels (guest transport)\nUncle Sam’s (food)\nIndosoul (band)\nSrinivas (choreographer)\nPicturemakers (photographer)\nColours of India (dancers)\nFlair Monsters (bartender)\n\nDecor\nWe spent a lot of time conceptualising the decor with MC. We were very satisfied with the final decor for our three main events. The details were carefully executed,  and the decor team used their discretion to make some smart decisions on some details which we had not previously discussed.\n\nActual event\nAll the events went smoothly. MC handled last minute changes and requests capably. Most importantly, our guests had a wonderful time, and they had glowing feedback about their overall experience.\n\nThere were some minor hiccups in the guest communications, as some of our guests did not receive prompt replies. The RSVP management process could have also been started earlier and better designed. However, we did not think that these detracted from the overall excellent experience.\n\nNote of appreciation\nWe would like to thank Lokesh Prabhu, who is the lead wedding planner and main POC for communications with us. He is detail oriented, extremely patient, competent, really passionate about his job, and went above and beyond for us.\n\nOther team members who worked with us and who similar provided excellent service are:\n- Pradeep Chandar (creative director)\n- Uma Rajesh (gift and catering management)\n- Dharani (invites and stationary)\n- Muralitharan (travel and logistics)\n- Pralob (stalls and onsite coordination)\n- Chandru (onsite coordination)\n- Sanjana (guest hospitality and onsite coordination)\n- Ramachandran (ritual management)\n- Kalaivaanan (backend support and coordination)\n- Elayaraja (backend support and coordination)','2026-03-28 17:02:29.258880',1969,397,1001),('Gaurav Bose',5,'Where do I start? Mr Lokesh is the MVP. Single handedly dealt with everything thrown his way before and after the wedding. The MC team is ash great, they were able to accommodate so many last minute requests.\n\nShout out to Barun & Pradeep for the decors, Mr Murali for the transport + communications and the whole team in organizing such a crazy event!!\n\nThis wedding would not be possible without all of you, highly recommend going with them as they know the ins and out of almost every venue.\n\nThey are so happy to work with vendors you bring in and also support you with a very strong vendor list.','2026-03-28 17:02:29.260882',1970,397,1001),('Shalin Sneha',5,'Thanks to the team of marriage colors for designing and executing one of the most spectacular decor at our dreamy beach fairy tale wedding in Kaldan Samudhra Palace! Couldn’t have done it without Pradeep and Pradhyumna Venkat!! The memories made over our wedding will last us a lifetime!! Starting from the beautiful marigold haldi to the Cinderella gala night, fairytale beach wedding and Arabian night reception, the attention to detail was impeccable.. every event blew our mind! The ease and skill with which the decor was executed was astonishing :)! Lots of love xoxo Sneha and Shalin','2026-03-28 17:02:29.262867',1971,397,1001),('Jaideep Sen',5,'The Experience was Brilliant beyond Words.\nAm Speechless 😶 with the Awesome Quality of the Experience.\n\nThe COLOURS of Happiness in a MARRIAGE is Thanks 🙏🙏🙏\nto Mr.Lokesh Prabhu & Team MARRIAGE COLOURS.\n\nShaabaash 🥳🥳🥳','2026-03-28 17:02:29.265410',1972,397,1001),('Sumi Alaudhin',5,'wedding is the one time in your life when perfection means everything. The slightest detail, that flower within the corner, those drapes at the back, the right aromas, ethereal music and a magical atmosphere, everything you could ever imagine to profess your love and seal it forever, need to be at is best.They come up with some of the most beautiful and innovative design concepts that are sure to steal your heart as well as stun your guests. They are also ready to travel to any place of your choice for your destination wedding. From creation to execution, Colors Events deals with everything so that all passes by easily for you. Colors Events have an objective of making every one of the clients upbeat and happy with their administrations and putting them all in their loyal records. They are entirely up for your budget plan and will ensure that every one of the resources is used without bounds and every one of the endeavours is made with full energy. A few of the decor services that the team of Colors Events provides to all their customers ensuring that you have nothing less than a memorable event','2026-03-28 17:02:32.692439',1973,398,1006),('Benny Joseph Visuvasam',5,'Best decor company for weddings, parties of all sizes! They work well with clients in bringing their ideas and desires to reality! Strongly recommend','2026-03-28 17:02:32.696594',1974,398,1006),('Kaarthic',5,'Best decors ,best supportive people ,good designs , Timely delivery .','2026-03-28 17:02:32.700992',1975,398,1006),('Lakshmi Kumar',5,'Setup and arrangements are super .','2026-03-28 17:02:32.704702',1976,398,1006),('Jayasimman Narasingan',5,'Good','2026-03-28 17:02:32.708062',1977,398,1006),('Sajith S R',5,'Loved working with you guys! Thanks for your wonderful decoration work.... As a incharge of my decoration team I recieved lots of appreciation from my faculty and Dean. Thanks a lot to magic events⭐⭐⭐⭐⭐','2026-03-28 17:02:41.152532',1978,399,1007),('Nivea Mary',5,'Thank you very much,everything was nice and perfect','2026-03-28 17:02:41.156214',1979,399,1007),('Karthick M',5,'We had such a great experience with the magic events and wedding planners. They were attentive, easy to work with and professional. They provided anything and everything we needed although we chose to keep it simple. They handled us perfectly and gave our students everything they asked. When it came down to the photos we had a blast! We recommend them highly!','2026-03-28 17:02:41.159898',1980,399,1007),('Narean Kaarthik',5,'It\'s a wonderful moment with magic Events. Our guest are very happy and heard a good reviews about decorations. Definitely i recommend you to my family and friends for upcoming functions.\n\nFrom my end i suggest you to issue uniforms to your working people. I think so that\'s a good for your reputation.','2026-03-28 17:02:41.163047',1981,399,1007),('Hearty Ujjeevan',5,'Magic Events and Wedding Planner\nEvent management company in Chennai, Tamil Nadu ‧ Worth for money decoration , Neat work ,good Quality thanks u magic events.\nThe way they welcomed guests is very Unique.\nYou guys have some special magic in your hands, you have done the work so beautiful.\nYour decoration is very attractive and very memorable with your management .\nNice Unique Designs I fully satisfied Reasonable Amount.','2026-03-28 17:02:41.166018',1982,399,1007),('Svidya Raghu',5,'Lucky We Found Wedding Aaha\n\nWe engaged Wedding Aaha for our daughter\'s wedding in January through online search. It\'s run by Krithika and Dev, both are professionals of top order. They are authentic to the core. They accomodated the themes we suggested within a reasonable budget. They didn\'t made us feel they were out to grab as much money as possible,  like other event managers we contacted before fixing Aaha. They didn\'t even take a single rupee more than what was agreed. In fact, they went to lengths to fulfil our last-minute requests.\n\nWe were very happy with their work, attitude and genuine connection with clients. We certainly recommend Wedding Aaha for managing any event, not just wedding.\n\nKrithika and Dev, wish you the best!','2026-03-28 17:02:45.265355',1983,400,1012),('Lee S',5,'Krithika and Devraj did a wonderful job even when we did not meet them personally until after my wedding.  Everything was planned and executed on WhatsApp with few calls.  Highly recommend them for the decorations.  You give them the idea and it will come to life on your special day.','2026-03-28 17:02:45.268938',1984,400,1012),('S Kan',5,'My daughter’s wedding took place on May 29, 2024 at Radisson Blu, Mahabalipuram (near Chennai). I reached out to Mr. Devraj in Aug 2023. After our very first phone call, we decided to move forward with Wedding Aha (Kritika and Dev). The team helped us coordinate from the US. We worked with the time zone difference and they were very responsive through WhatsApp messages.  We landed in Chennai 2 weeks before the wedding. All the events were very well organised and we want to thank Kritika and Dev for their help and support. I would highly recommend the Wedding Aaha team as event coordinators. Dev and Kritika can provide you my contact details if you have any questions. Thank you Wedding Aaha!','2026-03-28 17:02:45.272226',1985,400,1012),('Gaja Selvakumar',5,'I am extremely grateful for the wonderful event arranged by Mr Devaraj and Krithika mam. This will be the most memorable event for my immediate family. The decorations came out beautifully as per the plan, and the stand for plates was fantastic. The lotus seat, entrance boards, and stalls were superb, and our family thoroughly enjoyed them.\n\nThe smoke effect for the arrival was outstanding, adding a magical touch to the occasion.\n\nThank you again for your stupendous efforts, comforting words during discussions.\n\nThey are really budget friendly. Always they both were positive. Clear all our doubts. The way they speaks itself gives us hope 🙏','2026-03-28 17:02:45.274752',1986,400,1012),('Sanjana Srinivasan',5,'We were referred to Krithika and Devraj by our wedding photographer, and it turned out to be a fantastic recommendation. They are not only prompt and well-organized but also reasonably priced, which was a pleasant surprise. They are easy to communicate with and possess a wealth of knowledge.\n\nWhat stood out most was their creativity and their genuine enthusiasm for listening to our ideas, including our budget considerations. They took the time to understand exactly what we wanted and were patient with all the details and adjustments. Thanks to their creative touch, our wedding venue looked absolutely stunning, exceeding our expectations.\n\nChoosing Krithika and Devraj was truly the best decision for our wedding. We highly recommend them for other weddings, as they combine creativity with attentive listening, compassion, and respect for your budget.','2026-03-28 17:02:45.277323',1987,400,1012),('Parthiban V',5,'The decoration was absolutely beautiful and thoughtfully done. Every detail was well-coordinated, creating a warm and elegant atmosphere. It truly enhanced the overall experience. Highly recommended!','2026-03-28 17:02:51.047655',1988,401,1014),('SURYA PRAKASH',5,'My experience with traditional events was best decorations  And budget friendly also I recommend to my friends they are making what I except output is exactly came 👌👌👌','2026-03-28 17:02:51.050366',1989,401,1014),('Reenhadevi S',5,'Nice work & budget friendly.\nReally superb event organizing team. I like very much for this team work','2026-03-28 17:02:51.052811',1990,401,1014),('gajalakshmi shankar',5,'Had the exact output that we had on mind and was fully satisfied with the decor, friendly people, they addressed every concern and worked with us till the end.','2026-03-28 17:02:51.055556',1991,401,1014),('krithika g',5,'Keep up the good work team. You have provide us the very best event for my brother marriage and they have lot of creative ideas in themes and decoration. Thanks for giving the wonderful event.','2026-03-28 17:02:51.058437',1992,401,1014),('Badri Krishnan K N',5,'Very nice decoration at a minimal price! It was done beautifully and in a short time.','2026-03-28 17:02:58.209134',1993,402,1015),('Arvind Raghunath',5,'Such an humble soul,I gave them very,very minimal time for decorating my little sisters birthday! Not only did they decorate it well,but they did it in a very beautiful manner and in minimal time! Kindly book them more, they are really good at what they do','2026-03-28 17:02:58.213610',1994,402,1015),('SANTHOSH KUMAR',5,'Nice work done by ss decorations and met our expectations what we have it in mind.','2026-03-28 17:02:58.217612',1995,402,1015),('SIPABACUS EKKADUTHANGAL',5,'Well planned and excuted neatly whatever the designs we gave. Very punctual also.. We are very much happy with the service','2026-03-28 17:02:58.221365',1996,402,1015),('Yoke V',4,'I booked them and gave very minimal time for my mehndi event,  but they made our event look good, charges also affordable, their approach is also nice, Thanks for your neat work.,','2026-03-28 17:02:58.225579',1997,402,1015),('Deepak Kesavan',5,'We recently contacted Chennai Events & Decors for our baby shower, and the experience was absolutely wonderful. Surekha assisted us throughout the entire process and ensured that every little detail matched my taste perfectly. She understood my preferences so well and fine-tuned everything with great care and creativity.\n\nThe decor turned out beautiful and elegant, exactly as I had envisioned. What truly stood out was the constant communication — Surekha kept us updated at every stage of planning and made sure everything was executed smoothly on the day of the event.\n\nI’m extremely happy with their work and would gladly choose Chennai Events & Decors again for future events. Highly recommended for anyone planning a special occasion nearby. Thank you for making our baby shower so memorable.','2026-03-28 17:03:04.035686',1998,403,1020),('Hemaharini Balakrishnan',5,'I booked decor services with Chennai Events and Decors for my baby shower at Hotel Turyaa Event Hall, Chennai. I was looking for budget-friendly designs with a premium touch, and I came across their Instagram page. After connecting with Surekha, she suggested options that perfectly fit my budget. Their work turned out so neat and beautiful — my guests were truly amazed. Great job, Surekha and team! Thank you for making my special day even more memorable.','2026-03-28 17:03:04.037444',1999,403,1020),('Pooja Pj',5,'I booked Chennai Events and Decors for my Engagement. I was looking for something nice but still within budget, and I found their page on Instagram. Their work was so clean, pretty, and exactly how I imagined—everyone at the event loved it. Big thanks to Surekha mam and team for being so friendly and making my day extra special.','2026-03-28 17:03:04.039140',2000,403,1020),('Vijayalakshmi P',5,'We wanted to have an elegant setup in our space for my baby shower . We had a budget and it was an intimate event✨\n\nI can’t thank Surekha and her team enough for creating such a beautiful setup for my baby shower. The decor was elegant, traditional, and filled with thoughtful details – from the vibrant bangles to the soft floral touches. 🌸💛\n\nEvery guest loved the ambience and I highly recommend them for anyone looking for creative and hassle-free decor! 💐','2026-03-28 17:03:04.040657',2001,403,1020),('Vini K',5,'Surekha and her team did an excellent job in doing my valaikaapu decor. I found them on insta in my search.I had a budget range but they did very nice arrangements thoughtfully acc to my likes with in the given space . I will recommend chennai events and decors for any one looking for their events in friendly budget with very good outputs.','2026-03-28 17:03:04.042644',2002,403,1020),('Magitha Shyamsundar',5,'Words aren’t enough to express our gratitude to Smile Events for the incredible job they did in arranging and managing our son’s wedding at Ramachandra Convention Hall, Thiruvanmiyur. From the very beginning, they approached every detail — big or small — with so much care and dedication, as if it were their own family’s celebration.\n\nRight from the moment the invitations were chosen, booked and delivered, to the stunning decorations, perfectly chosen music, and the vintage car arranged for the reception — they took complete charge and handled everything so beautifully, allowing us to simply enjoy each moment without worry. Their attention to detail was remarkable and throughout the entire process, Madhan and his team were extremely patient, accommodating all our requests and last-minute changes without any fuss. It was such a relief to have them by our side, as they ensured the whole event went off smoothly and beautifully.\n\nThanks to Smile Events, the wedding was not just an event, but a truly memorable and joyous occasion for all of us. We will always cherish the warmth and professionalism they brought into this special day. Highly recommended for anyone looking for a team that puts their heart into making your celebrations perfect!','2026-03-28 17:03:12.022728',2003,404,1023),('KAARTHIC VR',5,'The bestest event planning team 🤩. We received a lot of compliments for the decorations and event organising for the wedding. Madhan and sharath bros nailed it, they were very calm and empathetic, they considered our every suggestions and planned according.\n\nWe were very satisfied, I would rate 10/5 stars ⭐🥰.','2026-03-28 17:03:12.026789',2004,404,1023),('Jaysankkar Shanmugam Sundaram',5,'We are totally happy as parents to have Smile Events as Decors for our daughter’s wedding which we had it on 30th Nov. The two-day events of 29th Nov and 30th Nov went on very well.\nMr Madhan and Mr Sarath did a fantastic job right from helping in choosing the right decors for each occasion, meeting our expectations in fitting the overall budget and above all delivered as committed and much to all our delight. All our guests have priced the overall décor and its pleasing look and atmosphere.\nWe are fully supported and completely relieved without any stress, timely ready of each decors without need to do followup and  totally professional. We are happily recollecting all the good things which they performed. We wish them all the very best and certainly will recommend them to all our known friends and relatives.\nThank you Madhan and Sarath and all your team!','2026-03-28 17:03:12.030101',2005,404,1023),('Sailesh Raghunathan',5,'I cannot be more proud for this team. Starting from planning with the client to ideating and executing, this team is a dream team to work with.\n\nFor my wedding, I had conceptualised something radically different from normal stage decors and was very specific about getting it right.\n\nMadan and his team continuously gave me confidence that they will pull it through.\n\nOn the D Day, there was nothing I had to worry about. Just the presence of Madan, Sarath and team and their swiftness in working gave me the confidence that they would make it the best day for me.\n\nOn completion, the decor was nothing less than a magical movie set.\n\nThanks to this team. Vouch for their work 100%.','2026-03-28 17:03:12.033969',2006,404,1023),('Altruist',5,'We hired smile event decor to handle the stage decor for our event, and they absolutely nailed it! The team was creative, hardworking turned our vision into a stunning backdrop with beautiful lighting and fresh flowers. No matter how hard it rained,the Setup was on time and everything was flawless. Highly recommend their professional service for any event.','2026-03-28 17:03:12.037209',2007,404,1023),('Uma devi',5,'Beautiful wedding and reception stage decoration at a reasonable price. Nice design and very professional service. Loved the traditional wedding look and the elegant reception setup. Highly recommended!','2026-03-28 17:03:16.554789',2008,405,1027),('Bhavani G',5,'I had some concerns, but the team was incredibly helpful and answered all my questions promptly and the output of decoration it comes very well thank you DGLS Events & Decors','2026-03-28 17:03:16.557732',2009,405,1027),('Anjali riya',5,'The decoration was absolutely beautiful and well-organized. Every details was perfectly arranged and it creates a wonderful ambiance.\n\nGreat wor, very elegant and classy.','2026-03-28 17:03:16.561023',2010,405,1027),('Vijay Chandrasekaran',5,'They made my engagement event a very memorable one. They say every occassion adds up to memory which one can cherish throughout one\'s lifetime.\nAnd my decision to go ahead with DGLS events was a good one because they made it even more special.\n\nI had given them only one requirement which was a budget. But the decor these guys did looked much expensive than the budget i had given them.\n\nEveryone. Literally everyone complimented on the whole decoration and were mightily impressed and were playing guess games as to how expensive it would have been.\n\nI had changed the requirement until one day before and he literally asked me to not worry about anything and he would do it much more than i what I expect and he really kept his promise.\n\nSuch was the work and the quality with which they delivered.\nWould definitely consider them for future events and would definitely recommend to anyone who ask me.\n\nThanks a lot.','2026-03-28 17:03:16.564097',2011,405,1027),('Salaman Joseph',5,'The decoration was great, it was on a level that no one else could have imagined, you did it better than I expected. 🤝👏👏👏','2026-03-28 17:03:16.567622',2012,405,1027),('Monica Venkatesh',5,'I recently placed an order with Raji to organise our special event. Despite coordinating everything over the phone, Raji perfectly understood what we wanted. She gave us multiple suggestions and ideas, each adding a unique touch to the event. The floral arrangements, chocolate doll and the decors were beautifully done with great attention to detail. Everything was organised and delivered on time. I highly recommend Raji for her outstanding service and her ability to manage everything remotely!','2026-03-28 17:03:19.812158',2013,406,1028),('lakshmi rk',5,'Very good understanding of client\'s expectations and delivered with atmost perfection. Friendly and great work by the team. Garden seeru setup was beautifully done. Great work ethics. Definitely recommended. Keep going with your good work.','2026-03-28 17:03:19.815326',2014,406,1028),('Christina amanda',5,'We had taken the border trays and flower urulis , since we said we would like to arrange they provided us full support via video call on how to setup and have us multiple options. They don’t have any time limit whether late night or early mornings they give spontaneous reply’s and suggestions . Even when they forgot to deliver few things they are very understanding and supporting no mater how late it was , I felt they are very understanding and delivered few things last minute without deliver charge. Good service will be taking their service again for the coming events as well. They are very prompt and dedicated.','2026-03-28 17:03:19.818300',2015,406,1028),('Shyam Sundar',5,'Excellent service & work','2026-03-28 17:03:19.821809',2016,406,1028),('Priyanka',5,'They had done a great job in plating and decorating the varsai plates.\nThey exactly know the combination of colors that would look pretty for the big day, whatever may.\nWe all loved their varsai plate decoration.','2026-03-28 17:03:19.825098',2017,406,1028),('Loganayagi',1,'Very very very worst service for jp wedding and events because foods not for hygienic\nSuththam illa karapoaan boochi irunthuchi kolambula not response to catering service persons','2026-03-28 17:03:22.739998',2018,407,1029),('Praveen Kumar',5,'JPEVENTDECORS\nIt is a very good decors and genuine performance from the team.Then the affordable quotation for the eent was 😎. please check them and share it.','2026-03-28 17:03:22.743194',2019,407,1029),('mano stalin',5,'They are very excellent event decorators.Function in a good cost.sep 16 and 17 marriage High court advocate super performance at APL global school.💯👍','2026-03-28 17:03:22.746457',2020,407,1029),('Manikandan Mani',5,'This month 6th Ecr panaiyur Ramesh garden reception work Sneha weds Manoj my budget work finished good.others family & friend any reference  jp wedding event.','2026-03-28 17:03:22.749080',2021,407,1029),('Iyappan K',5,'Wonderful decoration and they takking care of all the things, We got full satisfaction about the JP decoration.👍','2026-03-28 17:03:22.751747',2022,407,1029),('Shan Mugam',5,'Very nice work. Really worth for money. I recommend to my friends. They were also very much satisfied. Very best design.','2026-03-28 17:03:25.403094',2023,408,1030),('aston maxwell',5,'Very good service worth price excellent work fully satisfied in Chennai he is only best try evey one ...','2026-03-28 17:03:25.405526',2024,408,1030),('ABINASH V',5,'Fullfill with our expectations and also budget friendly over all very professional','2026-03-28 17:03:25.408103',2025,408,1030),('Vimal M',5,'I really loved the Decor you have done with the things I asked , the coordination with Arvind and team were so excellent .\nOn the first visit, They clearly explained how all can be done they really worked as per our convince\nA great job Lyca & Team\nStrongly recommend','2026-03-28 17:03:30.907688',2026,409,1035),('joseph charleson',5,'We were fortunate to have done buisness with the li themes for our engagement. Mr.sriram, the owner was a very courteous man and patiently listened to our ideas and also had good inputs. The decor was simple but beautiful. They were on time and completed the job on time. They also had associated photography team - WHOAA, a gem. We also order our garlands from them, so beautiful and very economic. If u are looking for some good decor vendors in chennai, li themes is a must consider.','2026-03-28 17:03:30.910436',2027,409,1035),('yashi reddy',5,'We wanted to celebrate our 10th year anniversary and eventually gave up on that idea given the extensive planning required and budget constraints, we came across LICA wedding through WHOAA photography. We met with Mr.Sriram, who was so welcoming on the idea and we instantly clicked. We had multiple in person meetings and discussions over calls and finally when the event happened it was nothing less that what we had expected. The decor, lighting and everything was so beautiful and so calmly executed without us having to worry about anything. And this was all done worked within our budget , we are so happy that we chose them to be a part of our special occasion. Easy breezy to discuss stuffs and always willing to adjust and make things work. Highly recommend !','2026-03-28 17:03:30.913003',2028,409,1035),('Jenet Shirley',5,'I can’t thank Mr.Sriram enough for the stunning decorations on our wedding day. Every detail was perfect, from the ceremony backdrop to the reception flowers. They truly brought our vision to life, and the decor exceeded our expectations. Our guests were amazed, and everything looked beautiful!\n\nThank you again for making our big day so memorable. I wholeheartedly recommend Lica Weddings to anyone looking for a wedding decorator who truly understands how to create an enchanting, unforgettable atmosphere.','2026-03-28 17:03:30.915077',2029,409,1035),('Sahomanick',5,'📸 Best Wedding Photographer in Tamil Nadu – Cinematic & Photography Experts\n\nLooking for the perfect photographer to capture your big day? Look no further! Renowned as one of the **best wedding photographers in Tamil Nadu**, this talented team specializes in **cinematic wedding films**, **traditional photography**, **candid moments**, and **pre/post-wedding shoots** that truly tell your love story.\n\nWhether you\'re planning a grand celebration or an intimate ceremony, they ensure every detail is beautifully documented with a creative and heartfelt touch. Their cinematic style blends emotion, storytelling, and top-tier editing – turning your wedding memories into timeless treasures.\n\n### Why Choose Them?\n\n* 🎥 **Cinematic Wedding Videos** with a storytelling touch\n* 📷 **High-Quality Candid & Traditional Photography**\n* 🌟 Friendly, professional, and easy to work with\n* 💍 Pre-wedding, Engagement, and Post-wedding shoots\n* 🚗 Available across Tamil Nadu and beyond\n\nTheir friendly approach and passion for photography make the entire experience smooth, comfortable, and fun. Many couples have trusted them to capture once-in-a-lifetime moments – and you can too!','2026-03-28 17:03:30.917924',2030,409,1035),('Sangeetha Murugan',5,'We recently booked our baby shower function with the support of (DDevents)Mr. Suresh and his team, and we are extremely happy with the outcome. From the beginning, his team was very professional, friendly, and attentive to every small detail. The stage decoration was beautifully designed with vibrant colours and elegant arrangements that perfectly matched the theme of our event. The food was outstanding—fresh, tasty, and loved by all our guests. The service was also excellent, with the team ensuring everything was smooth, timely, and well-coordinated throughout the function. Overall, DDEVENTS💥 delivered exceptional work and made our baby shower truly memorable. We sincerely appreciate his dedication and hard work, and we highly recommend his services to anyone planning an event.','2026-03-28 17:03:37.671571',2031,410,1038),('nivedha vijayaraghavan',5,'DD Events truly made our wedding unforgettable. We had around thousand guests and they took complete responsibility for both decoration and catering, delivering far beyond what we imagined. The decor was simply stunning – a beautiful stage, elegant floral arrangements, perfect lighting and well‑planned guest seating, with every corner of the venue looking picture‑perfect. So many people complimented us on how grand and tasteful everything looked. The food was equally outstanding in taste, variety and presentation, and despite the large crowd, the service was smooth and well organised. Our families and friends are still praising the decoration and food even after the wedding. I am extremely happy with DD Events and would recommend them wholeheartedly to anyone who wants their wedding handled professionally, creatively and with genuine care.','2026-03-28 17:03:37.674640',2032,410,1038),('Arokiya Jensi',5,'DD Events made our daughter’s first birthday truly unforgettable. The décor was absolutely beautiful, the food was delicious, and everything was managed with great attention to detail. The team was friendly, well-organized, and very punctual, making the entire experience stress-free for us. The food service staff showed remarkable patience and empathy, which we truly appreciated. Overall, their service was exceptional and completely worth the budget.','2026-03-28 17:03:37.677368',2033,410,1038),('Ajith Kumar',5,'We booked DD EVENTS for our wedding, and they exceeded all expectations. The décor was breathtaking—elegant, cohesive, and full of thoughtful touches. The catering team provided a delicious menu with generous portions, and the presentation was beautiful. Had a Great Mutton Biriyani really no words to say their Communication was smooth, and their professionalism gave us peace of mind on our big day. We received so many compliments from our guests. Truly a five-star experience ! Thankyou DD Suresh and Team we really Loved it really thank you so much','2026-03-28 17:03:37.680615',2034,410,1038),('Prasanth Gunasekaran',5,'We recently had our daughter’s birthday party and chose DD Events for décor and food. For the budget we had, their work was absolutely worth it. The décor looked beautiful, the food was tasty, and their entire service was very budget-friendly. They are truly people-friendly and easy to coordinate with. Their punctuality deserves special appreciation, and the team serving the food did a wonderful job with so much empathy and patience. Overall, we were very happy with their service!','2026-03-28 17:03:37.683793',2035,410,1038),('Vic Ky',5,'Excellent 👌 work design all','2026-03-28 17:03:46.171917',2036,411,1042),('Menaga Senthil',5,'I didn\'t expect this much work sir, I really appreciate you done a very good job sir thank you','2026-03-28 17:03:46.175036',2037,411,1042),('Vishnu Travel &vlog',5,'On of the cheap and best decorator customer stafiction  service Sk events','2026-03-28 17:03:46.178136',2038,411,1042),('Leena Leenasara',5,'Good event management with affordable cost','2026-03-28 17:03:46.181241',2039,411,1042),('Saba Rish',5,'Best of work&best of decorator','2026-03-28 17:03:46.184293',2040,411,1042),('Preeth Gennet',5,'A big thank you to the amazing team @aswindecor who brought our event to life with such grace and creativity. The garden theme was beautifully done elegant, refreshing, and exactly what we had hoped for. Every detail, from the layout to the décor, was perfectly executed. It felt calm, classy, and truly special. You created a space that felt warm, welcoming, and effortlessly beautiful. We\'re so grateful for your effort and professionalism.\nYou made the day unforgettable!','2026-03-28 17:03:55.924828',2041,412,1047),('Preethi Srinivas',5,'I recently had the pleasure of working with Aswin Decor, managed by Sharon, for my wedding reception celebration at the Hyatt Regency. The services delivered were outstanding, and the decoration exceeded our expectations.\n\nSharon and her team expertly designed the backdrop using fabrics and natural flowers, built a beautiful stage, and set up the perfect lighting and DJ. From the very beginning, Sharon was incredibly helpful, providing valuable inputs, brainstorming ideas, and seamlessly incorporating our feedback to bring our dream decor to life.\n\nSharon played a vital role in coordinating the event from start to finish and stayed with us until the end to ensure everything went smoothly. Her dedication, creativity, and attention to detail made our special day truly magical.\n\nI highly recommend Aswin Decor for anyone seeking exceptional event decoration services. Thank you, Sharon, for making our wedding reception an unforgettable experience!','2026-03-28 17:03:55.927935',2042,412,1047),('Wilfred Hebron Moses',5,'Very happy with Aswin Decor. Thanks to their details and beautiful decorations the event was visually stunning. We thank the team who worked tirelessly for the success of the event.','2026-03-28 17:03:55.931326',2043,412,1047),('JANARDHANAN B',5,'\"Aswin decor did a phenomenal job decorating the stage for our wedding & reception. The floral arrangements, lighting, and overall design were absolutely stunning. The attention to detail was remarkable, and the team was incredibly easy to work with. They made sure everything was perfect and exactly how we wanted. We couldn\'t have asked for a better experience!\"','2026-03-28 17:03:55.934417',2044,412,1047),('agilan s',5,'Great work by Aswin Decor whole team👏👏👏They know how to do proper work in a given time... They worked on each & every detail to make event good... They made us very happy & Satisfied.\nI will refer them in my friends circle','2026-03-28 17:03:55.937636',2045,412,1047),('Thulasibabu M',5,'✨ Wonderful Experience with Sanjana Decor! ✨\n\nWe booked Sanjana Decor for our son\'s first birthday celebration, and we couldn\'t be happier with their service! 🎉 From the very beginning, the follow-up was smooth and hassle-free. They even suggested backdrop ideas that perfectly matched our outfits!\n\nThe blue and white balloon theme was executed exactly as we envisioned, making the event even more special. The attention to detail and professionalism were truly commendable. Thank you for making our celebration so memorable!\n\nHighly recommended for anyone looking for a stunning event setup! 💙🤍','2026-03-28 17:04:02.203221',2046,413,1051),('r amirtha',5,'We are so happy with the wonderful service provided for my son’s birthday party. The team was very responsive and ensured everything was done on time. I truly appreciate their timely response, attention to detail, and the beautiful customization they provided to suit our theme. The decoration was elegant and exactly how we imagined it. Thank you for making our celebration so special!','2026-03-28 17:04:02.206347',2047,413,1051),('Solarajan Selvam',5,'Gopaal is very professional and prompt on time. He ensures decorations are ready by the time we request and he recreates the design as it is from the picture we selected. Happy working with Sanjana flower decorations and events','2026-03-28 17:04:02.208909',2048,413,1051),('satyanarayana murthy',5,'Gopal did a good job in flower decoration in reasonable budget for my daughter\'s half saree function. He is polite, hardworking and punctual. We have requested for fresh flower decoration and arrangement was top notch. His referral for catering is also good and i recommend Sanjana events for all type of functions.','2026-03-28 17:04:02.211801',2049,413,1051),('Dhana Dharshini',5,'Sanjana events did the decorations for my son\'s first birthday. They did a really good job and the decorations came out very well. We had this function in our terrace during day, but yet the decorations were very nice in that lighting. The owner is professional during this entire process and they completed their service without any concern.','2026-03-28 17:04:02.214235',2050,413,1051),('sonia agnes',5,'I had ordered 21 plate seer varisai through online to you for our function. Since I was not able to be there personally, I truly appreciate your coordination and support throughout the process.\nFrom the photos and feedback I received from my family, the arrangement looked neat and beautiful. Thank you for handling everything smoothly and delivering it on time.\nIt really helped me feel at peace even though I couldn’t be there in person. I appreciate your effort and professionalism.\nThank you sri sai plate decor .','2026-03-28 17:04:10.093717',2051,414,1054),('nithwin',5,'I have ordered seer plates a day before with my requirements. You have delivered with prompt time. Decorations are really satisfied. And also u have arranged the malai quickly and delivered both at the same time.\n200% satisfied from my bottom of the heart.\nThank u so much.\nI assure that I will share ur contact for the reference','2026-03-28 17:04:10.096971',2052,414,1054),('Reshmaa Babu',5,'I ordered 21 seer plates from sai decorations and really all the items was so good and really looked awesome. So happy with their work. Worth the money ☺️','2026-03-28 17:04:10.099944',2053,414,1054),('Tharun Kumar',5,'We had a wonderful experience with Sri Sai Seer Varisai Thattu Decorations Service. They were extremely punctual and delivered exactly as promised. Every plate was beautifully decorated just the way we requested, with great attention to detail. The vibrant and elegant presentation of the plates truly enhanced the overall look of our function and made it even more colorful and special. Highly recommended for anyone looking for quality and timely decoration service!','2026-03-28 17:04:10.102900',2054,414,1054),('Krishna',5,'Thanks to sri sai decors for making our family function memorable. Daily milk doll plate is the center of attractions.. I placed the Order in the last min, But they make it as the best.','2026-03-28 17:04:10.105592',2055,414,1054),('Vignesh R',5,'I gave order for my son birthday their service was best and budget friendly ❤️','2026-03-28 17:04:17.428831',2056,415,1059),('Venkateswaran Subramanian',5,'Thiru wedding decorator owner vediyappan is good and good , neat work, reasonable price and good approach to customers.','2026-03-28 17:04:17.432290',2057,415,1059),('sridhar chandran',5,'Decoration was awesome and met our expectations. Budget friendly and satisfied our needs.','2026-03-28 17:04:17.435891',2058,415,1059),('suja tha',5,'Very good service and neatly done... All guests appreciated the work','2026-03-28 17:04:17.439048',2059,415,1059),('GUNA Guna',5,'thiru wedding decoator was  so good  and  Good approach, low price work  is so amazing','2026-03-28 17:04:17.442186',2060,415,1059),('Vigneshwaran M',4,'Pleasant, satisfactory decoration at reasonable price from the team. On-time, responsive and customer centric approach in service. Value for Money and would recommend for friends and family. Package and themes options are unique and creative. I have chosen \"Moon Theme\" and guest to the venue are appreciative of decoration perfectness...!!!','2026-03-28 17:04:26.044158',2061,416,1064),('JEFFRIN\'S WORLD',5,'I just gave them the first birthday event a day before they did it so beautiful and extraordinary they are very budget friendly and they did the best ever job GO FOR THEM WITHOUT EVEN A SECOND THOUGHT YOU WILL NEVER BE DISAPPOINTED.','2026-03-28 17:04:26.047368',2062,416,1064),('Archana Shyam',5,'It was literally a last minute plan and I asked for a bouncy castle and it was ready on time. And the cost was so nominal. Thank you for the timely commitment. Very amicable staffs too.','2026-03-28 17:04:26.050911',2063,416,1064),('vidhyalakshmi thilak',5,'We booked party decor for our son\'s first birthday celebration with Carnival events.We are very glad that we found them.They did an amazing job.They patiently cleared all our doubts and were open for suggestions.\nThe final outcome was extremely good.All our guests appreciated the decor.And they were very courteous.A special mention to Me Shankar for his constant follow up and service.','2026-03-28 17:04:26.054117',2064,416,1064),('Venkat Subramanian',5,'The decorations were done professionally and well coordinated. Shankar and his team were on time and execution was seamless. I would recommend their services for any party that needs backdrops and other types of decorations. Good luck team and thanks for the wonderful work!','2026-03-28 17:04:26.057583',2065,416,1064),('bhuvana balasubramanian',5,'It is a great pleasure to write about the decorations done by Mr.Robert during daughter\'s wedding function at Sananda on 28th January. The decorations were beyond our imaginations. Each nd every occasion the decoration was total nd gorgeous nd to our at most satisfaction within our affordable budget.\nSome unexpected surprises made us speechless. He was totally available on those 3 3 days and did whatever help we wanted.\nThank you Robert Sir and best wishes.','2026-03-28 17:04:33.776975',2066,417,1067),('Vishali Prakash',5,'Outstanding work! The decor was elegant, perfectly themed, and exceeded our expectations. From the entrance to the stage, every detail was stunning. The team poured their heart into making our wedding look picture-perfect. They truly turned the venue into pure magic! 💍✨','2026-03-28 17:04:33.780881',2067,417,1067),('Lalitha Subramanian',5,'Robert and team did a fantabulous job with the stage decoration and other arrangements. We were skeptical to spend a lot on decor however the final output was too beautiful and everyone were awestruck by the reception decor.\n\nRobert helped us with every requirement and assisted us till the last minute whatever it may be. He and his team gave us more than we expected. This made our big day truly beautiful and unforgettable.\n\nHeartfelt thanks to Robert and team - Goutham, Lalitha and Family','2026-03-28 17:04:33.784639',2068,417,1067),('raksha kumar',5,'I choose annai decoration for my engagement as well as reception they did a beautiful job evrything was so well planned and arranged the colour combination and thought process is really great . Very affordable and every penny worth decor . So many ppl complimented the decor','2026-03-28 17:04:33.788046',2069,417,1067),('Saran R',5,'We are extremely grateful to Mr. Robert for the amazing decoration at our wedding, which took place on 19th and 20th February 2026. The photo booth and reception décor were especially awesome and beautifully arranged. Every detail was thoughtfully designed, and our guests couldn’t stop taking pictures and complimenting the setup. Thank you for making our big day so special!','2026-03-28 17:04:33.791203',2070,417,1067),('Akila Kannan',5,'Iam extremely choosing  ss events for my wedding deco.Yogesh and his team work really hard to full fill all my dream requirements for the reception and as well as for the wedding.each and every element was done in perfection, looking at my wedding pictures gave me happy tears !! Because it was just like how I imagined, from the entrance arch, lawn decoration, stage backdrop to the wedding day lotus pond … oh my god all the details were extraordinary.. will definitely suggest you for my friends .. keep up the good work Yogesh and team','2026-03-28 17:04:40.755835',2071,418,1070),('Vignesh Vicky',5,'We reached SS Eventzz for our new baby home coming ceremony .....As planned their team stepped in and changed our house beyond expectations...Such a lovely work and our family members enjoyed a lot...Will definitely recommend this team and Thank you so much guys for the wonderful work ❣️❣️','2026-03-28 17:04:40.757407',2072,418,1070),('Rajesh Balakrishnan',5,'My heartfelt thanks to Mr.Dhaneshwar & his crew. Right from the stage decoration idea conception and executing the same with such clarity is laudable. They arranged a traditional photographer Mr.Guna who has been phenomenal and a gem of a person. He is so professional and patiently gave ideas and so far done a very good job. Thank you all for doing an amazing job in executing a perfect day which my family is grateful. THANKS!!!','2026-03-28 17:04:40.759019',2073,418,1070),('Sasi Kumar',5,'I have enquired one day prior even though they did each and everything.. Best team SS Eventzz.. Guys are very expert in balloon and flowers all the very best..','2026-03-28 17:04:40.760576',2074,418,1070),('Arun Sathish',5,'I am extremely happy with SS Eventzz Service and I would highly recommend their services to anyone in need of event management. Thank you for making my wedding event a memorable one!','2026-03-28 17:04:40.761968',2075,418,1070),('Paul William',5,'Special kudos for my best bros Hemanth roy & Bharath from Hello Wedding🫂. Amazing coordination by the team for our marriage event. Everything was well planned and executed smoothly, even last-minute changes. Special mention to the food — the mutton biryani was absolutely delicious and a big hit among our guests! Highly professional, reliable, and stress-free experience. If you want a WOW -  Worthy Wedding they are the one, Strongly recommended! 🙌🍽️✨','2026-03-28 17:04:45.063799',2076,419,1075),('Deepika Baskaran',5,'We couldn’t have asked for a better wedding planner!🥳 From the initial planning stages to the final execution, everything was handled with perfection and professionalism🤌🏽. Every detail was thoughtfully managed, and our big day turned out exactly how we dreamed🔥. Thank you for making our wedding stress-free and magical! ✨ Weddings done right! If you want stress-free planning with top-class vibes, this is the one. Go check them out!','2026-03-28 17:04:45.066753',2077,419,1075),('Jyothi N',5,'Just awesome service by hello wedding. At my son birthday.. decor and stall was extraordinary.. my family and friends really enjoyed.. thanks for this event very joyful.. special thanks to Hemanth and Esther 😍','2026-03-28 17:04:45.069428',2078,419,1075),('Kadeejath Shafana',5,'Hello Wedding team, your dedication to delivering an unforgettable wedding experience is impressive! From the beautiful decor and photography to the mouth-watering food (the biryani and desserts were a hit!), you truly exceeded our expectations.','2026-03-28 17:04:45.073142',2079,419,1075),('Sachu',5,'The Hello Wedding team is the perfect choice for any couple looking for a stress-free and unforgettable wedding experience! They took care of every detail and exceeded our expectations in every way.','2026-03-28 17:04:45.077143',2080,419,1075),('nithya sai',5,'We are extremely happy with the reception and muhurtham decoration. The stage setup, floral arrangements, and overall ambience were beautifully done. The team was very professional, punctual, and handled everything perfectly. The decoration made the event look elegant and memorable. Highly recommended wedding kraft events','2026-03-28 17:04:50.118579',2081,420,1077),('Deepalakshmi S',5,'The decor was excellent. The event organizers understood the exact requirements of the client and made things possible with ease. Over all it was a woundeful event.','2026-03-28 17:04:50.121435',2082,420,1077),('anusha padmanathan',5,'What can I say about them , such amazing amazing decorator in the whole of chennai , they are the best , and aishwarya was the person who co-ordinated the event so well.\nLoved their work and the way aishu spoke and handled things was mindblowing.\nJust close your eyes and go to them , you are sorted for ur big day😍❤️','2026-03-28 17:04:50.124241',2083,420,1077),('sudharsan . K',5,'We booked them for our event and they did an outstanding job. The team was punctual, creative, and very understanding of our requirements. Guests loved the décor and overall setup. Truly one of the best event planners — highly recommend!','2026-03-28 17:04:50.126491',2084,420,1077),('Gameing Porchezlian',5,'Absolutely loved the wedding craft decorations! Beautiful detailing, elegant designs, and perfect finishing. It made our special day even more memorable.”','2026-03-28 17:04:50.129210',2085,420,1077),('evita joseph',5,'We hired Green House Productions for our wedding, which included a Jewish ceremony (something they were doing for the first time), and the entire team was patient, flexible, and supportive throughout the entire process.\n\nEven with numerous changes — including last-minute updates just a few hours before the events — they never once said no. They always responded with “sure,” and somehow everything was executed perfectly.\n\nThe décor and overall theme looked exactly like what I had envisioned — if anything, it was even better than I imagined. They made the entire process feel effortless and were genuinely so easy to work with.\n\nA special shoutout for the floral décor: I was very particular about not having too many roses and really wanted tulips incorporated into the arrangements. The chuppah and my bridal bouquet were exactly what I wanted and turned out absolutely beautiful.\n\nAnirudh and Unnati were amazing — they stayed in constant communication with us and the venue, and because we live in the U.S., we also had to coordinate calls across different time zones. They made everything seamless with their responsiveness and organization. Wedding planning can be stressful, but they minimized stress significantly and truly made the process smoother.\n\nThey also stayed true to the agreed budget, with transparent costs and no hidden surprises, which we really appreciated.\n\nMost importantly, because of their hard work and seamless coordination, we were able to fully enjoy our wedding celebration and be present for every moment.\n\nWe are so grateful for everything they did and would 100% recommend Green House Productions to anyone looking for a reliable, creative, and hardworking event management team.','2026-03-28 17:04:55.036815',2086,421,1079),('Laura Rachel',5,'Anirudh did a fantastic job and words cannot express how grateful we are to him and his team for doing such an awesome job!\n\nWe only approached Anirudh 2 weeks before our actual wedding, he just understood exactly what I wanted without much explanation and he knew the venue so well which eased a huge burden for us. He planned the decor so well for each event based on our outfits, event theme and venue as well as accommodating our requests while keeping every single detail in mind. They made our 3 days long wedding a HUGE success! Most importantly, he kept within our budget without any compromises in quality and he was quick to find alternative solutions when required.\n\nHe functioned without the need for any follow-ups and he is contactable at all times, has a responsive team and he is absolutely amazing when it comes to execution and on time handover! All our guests were in complete awe seeing all the amazing deco, they kept asking who was our vendor and they were all full of praises!\n\nYou can trust Green House Productions and Anirudh any day without a doubt and your event will definitely look amazing for sure! Highly recommended!','2026-03-28 17:04:55.040172',2087,421,1079),('Akshaya Venkat',5,'I booked Greenhouse for all my 3 events at the very beginning almost 8-9 months ahead of time Anirudh, Unnati & team are the easiest people to work with. We had all the details sorted out atleast 2 months ago. On the day of all events they were done so ahead of time, everything looked like a dream and we didnt have to follow up on a thing. They owned everything end to end and executed it so so seamlessly it was like magic. They also understood our vision and recreated things to perfection :D so happy to have worked with them. 11/10 recommend for anyone wanting asthetic and stress free wedding decor.','2026-03-28 17:04:55.043752',2088,421,1079),('Samyuktha Sriram',5,'Greenhouse did an amazing job with our wedding decor. We had three events and the team absolutely understood the assignment and brought our vision to life!\n\nSince my partner and I live in Australia, we weren’t able to be as hands on with conceptualising the event, but after just a few phone calls I knew I could trust the team to take care of all the big and small details.\n\nI’m really glad I chose Greenhouse and would 100% recommend them to anyone looking for tasteful decor for any occasion.','2026-03-28 17:04:55.048016',2089,421,1079),('aakriti arora',5,'I am from Delhi and decided to get married in Mahabalipuram. I came across green house production’s page on Instagram and instantly fell in love with their aesthetics. I met Anirudh on my first visit to the destination and had made up my mind to work with him. He was able to understand our requirements & expectations and beautifully paid attention to every little detail. His team worked relentlessly and all the hard work had paid off when everything came to life. If you are reading this review & planning to work with Green House, I’d say you should go ahead without any doubts because they will be able to do it like no other ❤️','2026-03-28 17:04:55.051398',2090,421,1079),('Shakila Narasimhan',5,'We are glad and happy to work with raga events. Their team made our day so special. It was my son\'s 1st birthday function... they did a great job made our day memorable. I was so concern about the birthday cake.. it cameout excellent more than what i actually expected thank you... raga team. We are very happy.','2026-03-28 17:04:59.950882',2091,422,1082),('Rasul',5,'Raga Event did an amazing job organizing the event. Everything was perfectly planned and executed professionally. The decoration, coordination, and overall management were excellent. The team was very friendly and made sure every detail was handled smoothly. Highly recommended for anyone looking for a reliable and creative event management team!','2026-03-28 17:04:59.954715',2092,422,1082),('soubhagya ig',5,'We had booked RaGa events for our daughter’s first birthday celebration. We had them do the decorations and cake. They did an amazing job. Decoration turned out amazing. The cake was super tasty and was sufficient for the entire crowd. We were so satisfied as it was completely taken care by the event management team.','2026-03-28 17:04:59.959216',2093,422,1082),('Abirami Lakshmanan',5,'We had our son\'s first birthday two weeks back. I saw a random instagram page and called Gayathri mam for details. Before talking to her I seriously had no idea about the party. From day one I confirmed she\'s the one doing my party. She gave me that many inputs about decor and everything. she also suggested me on so many things. She became a family friend for us. From decor to dessert she made it extraordinary. Return gift ideas are fantabulous. All our guests loved the organization and decor. It was really awesome, even we didn\'t expect the outcome like that. She made our day more special. Baby entry was very nice. Cake and desserts are all Yumm. Not only kids we all enjoyed the party well . Thanks to Gayathri mam , Sir and the lil angel for coming, being and making our day more special❤️ Highly Satisfied and Most Recommended ☺️🙏','2026-03-28 17:04:59.963479',2094,422,1082),('Did you See my bag',5,'While searching for wedding planners in Chennai, I came across Raga Events on Instagram. Gayathri from Raga Events responded to all my requests and planned my wedding within the proposed budget.\nAll the guests who attended the function were very impressed with the decor. The decor team recreated the exact image I had shared with them. Both the reception and wedding decor were splendid! Thank you for the beautiful decor!\nThe catering team head was a very nice person and all the items that we wanted in the menu were served. Everyone thoroughly enjoyed every bite of the dishes served. The server boys were polite too.\nThe photography team from Raga Events are one of the most kindest people you can find. I was really nervous during my reception but they made me feel very relaxed. Though I wasn\'t very cooperative, they are indeed one friendly bunch to work with. Thank you for your hard work!\nOverall team Raga Events can make your dream wedding come true! I thank them for making my wedding a truly memorable one. ❤️✨','2026-03-28 17:04:59.968278',2095,422,1082),('Ramapriya',5,'The event was well and perfectly planned and done by the correct time. we enjoyed every moment of it. I would definitely come back again to u with another event..\nSpecially thanks for the food 🍗 yummy and satisfying menu. The entire family has been satisfied\nThank you so much 🎉🙏🥳❤️','2026-03-28 17:05:05.654292',2096,423,1083),('SUJIN JINKINS',5,'It’s been a good experience with RS Events and RS Event & catering services. They took care from home wedding decoration, groom-bride car with decor, photography, bridal makeup, refreshments and return gifts. Especially the food was appetizing and amazing. Thanks to the entire team for sedulous efforts!','2026-03-28 17:05:05.657234',2097,423,1083),('Jenovin Sheeba',5,'Had a good experience with RS event\'s..my marriage event went smooth and everyone appreciated their efforts.\n\nPre /post wedding shoot, wedding mass decorations, photography,bride/groom make-up,car decoration , welcome drinks...\nthanks to the entire team!!','2026-03-28 17:05:05.659933',2098,423,1083),('Lavanya S',5,'Really very happy to share feedback about your backdrop decoration super work we liked very much thanks for your wonderful work 🙏','2026-03-28 17:05:05.662109',2099,423,1083),('DJ Bala Sena',5,'Excellent services regarding wedding package especially feel like wow the Food , Catering services , decoration , DJ,Welcome dance and welcome girls.i will recommend RS Events 100%.','2026-03-28 17:05:05.664166',2100,423,1083),('shruti kalwale',5,'So far the best place that I have seen in Chennai.. Thanks to Ramanan and his “ready to help” attitude, I was able to plan the best birthday surprise for my husband. All the arrangements were spot on and your “ready to help” attitude was much appreciated..\nMy entire family was in awe with all preps.. They listen to your requirement and cater to your needs exactly the way you want. Very helpful people, budget friendly and super peaceful place. Do reach out to them if you want to make any of your day special.','2026-03-28 17:05:12.193071',2101,424,1085),('sharmila ganesh',5,'Thank you for making my husband birthday so magical with the gorgeous decorations. The colors, lights, and every detail looked amazing and created the perfect vibe for the celebration. Your creativity and hard work truly made the day unforgettable. Big thanks to Mr.Raman bro.','2026-03-28 17:05:12.196629',2102,424,1085),('Jeeva',5,'I was arranged my hubby\'s B\'day suprise slot....it\'s really good and awesome decorations😊And the main thing is... owner of that event ...he is very kind and understanding and fulfilled with our expectation with budget friendly....my husbend very happy now...thank you for surprise decorss⭐⭐⭐⭐⭐','2026-03-28 17:05:12.199931',2103,424,1085),('Rakesh Arumugam',5,'I arranged a birthday event for my girlfriend, and the decoration was done so beautifully. It looked really premium and elegant, but the price was very affordable. Everyone loved the setup, and it made the day feel really special. Great service and totally worth it!, Thank you','2026-03-28 17:05:12.202706',2104,424,1085),('sumaiga sasi',5,'Truly Memorable Experience!\n\nI recently booked Surprise Decors Event Management for my husband’s birthday, and they did an absolutely amazing job! The team was very professional, creative, and extremely friendly. The entire setup was something beautiful and elegant.\nThe decorations were stunning and everything was arranged well on time. My husband was really surprised and loved every detail of the setup.\nThank you, Surprise Decors team, for making our day so memorable!','2026-03-28 17:05:12.205826',2105,424,1085),('Raju R, D',5,'good team to book, events and decorations.i booked, this smart event team for my sister marriage,iam fully satisfied About your works brother,thank you sathish bro✨😇','2026-03-28 17:05:15.672925',2106,425,1090),('Ak 97',5,'Their attention to detail and passion for delivering exceptional events shone through. What an incredible celebration! Thanks to \"Smart Event and Entertainment\"  for their outstanding work in making our birthday function a success.','2026-03-28 17:05:15.676268',2107,425,1090),('Mr Naveen',5,'The Event Management Is Awesome and Maker also Good and jeniun . We Thought the Payment so the work Also Be that But They it More addional work And Superb, Being Rock Guys and Thanks For Ur Event','2026-03-28 17:05:15.679908',2108,425,1090),('Abhii Abhii',5,'my mom birthday celebration surprise my mom really happy bro then ur decoration is very nice bro and very lowest cost and very nice and needful work exelente brother thank u so much brother','2026-03-28 17:05:15.683609',2109,425,1090),('Akshaya Kamalakshaya',5,'I recently attended my friend\'s birthday party...the hall and the arrangements were really mesmerising🤩it really had a magical feel🥳','2026-03-28 17:05:15.687090',2110,425,1090),('Guna Sekaran',5,'I recently hired special momentz events for a birthday celebration, and I couldn\'t be happier with the results! The decorations were absolutely stunning—vibrant, thoughtfully arranged, and perfectly matched the theme we discussed. From the balloon arches and table setup to the photo booth backdrop, everything looked picture-perfect.\n\nThe team arrived on time, worked efficiently, and handled every detail with care. What really impressed me was how they incorporated personal touches that made the setup feel unique and special. It created a beautiful atmosphere that both kids and adults enjoyed.\n\nHighly recommend their services for anyone planning a party or special occasion. Great value, professional service, and most importantly, a memorable experience!','2026-03-28 17:05:20.791704',2111,426,1091),('B KRISHNAN',5,'Mr.sekar & his team did a very good job for my sister wedding reception ! Given more complementary service & best price when compared to other event companies ! Thanks once again special momentz team 👍','2026-03-28 17:05:20.794391',2112,426,1091),('Iswarya Devi',5,'I recently worked with special momentz for my child\'s birthday celebration and couldn\'t be happier.They did the best decoration and it turned out to be more than my expectations.They understand your requirement and provide the best.Highly recomend.','2026-03-28 17:05:20.797434',2113,426,1091),('Ishita Gujrati',5,'Amazingly professional!!!😊😊Right from the beginning till execution Sekar was very patiently involved for the birthday celebration requirements. Special thanks to his team as well. The decor went so smooth and just the way I expected. Keep up the good work team.All the best!','2026-03-28 17:05:20.799737',2114,426,1091),('Lavanya Gandhi',5,'I spoke to many decor companies in December 2024 for my kid\'s 1st bday. All of them were very expensive/too corporate for the small party we planned. This team gave us an affordable/budget friendly decor idea. Really impressed with the decoration which was looking too luxurious as well.\n\n1. Perfect decoration with no technical issues\n2. Looked extremely well and fabulous in pictures\n3. Loved their idea of add-ons. It makes it easier to choose based on our requirement\n4. Team  is so customer friendly unlike other companies. So straight forward.\n\nOverall Thank you so much for making our day perfect with fantastic decoration. I would again come back to you guys in future for all our special moments!!! Keep Rocking!!! Continue your great work!!','2026-03-28 17:05:20.802187',2115,426,1091),('Sri Nidhi R',5,'My long search for an amazing decor team came to an end when I got to know them! From our first call, he was so prompt and helped us finalise a design that would fit our requirements and budget. He\'s very understanding and patient.\n\nThey were very punctual, organized and professional. He also managed all the issues on site with top-class professionalism! Which gave us immense peace of mind to just sit back and enjoy our event.\n\nDon\'t even look further for another decor team, if you found A Thisha Decor, just go with them! 😊','2026-03-28 17:05:25.540873',2116,427,1094),('Abijah Roch',5,'A big thank you to Thisha Decor and team for making our son\'s birthday a blast.. A very friendly  approach of Senthil bro and a perfect execution of our requirement really made our event more colourful and awesome... Best place for a budget friendly event management... Keep up the good work team...','2026-03-28 17:05:25.543658',2117,427,1094),('Prabhu Vadivel',5,'We reached out to Senthil for our Daughter event, and he and his team did an excellent job. The decorations were very satisfying, and everything was completed on time before our event began. Thank you for your attention to detail, cooperation, and delivering the expected theme. The price was affordable, and we definitely recommend their services!','2026-03-28 17:05:25.546296',2118,427,1094),('Kavitha Perumal',5,'Booked Thisha Decors for a Pooja Decoration at home. They did an amazing job. They were able to recreate the model shared with them and also provided additional suggestions which turns out to be great. It’s very appreciatable that their work is very mess free. Will definitely book them for our future events. Great job team.','2026-03-28 17:05:25.549385',2119,427,1094),('Cricilla christy',5,'I’ll give a full star because of their work on my son’s first birthday! We are really hearty thanks to Mr.Senthil (director of thisha decor), the decor was speechless for all.. it’s enhanced our birthday party a well.. he’s very cooperative and sincere on his work.. He has done what he promised on the day first… Thankyou Senthil bro, wish you to success more and I will really recommend you to all','2026-03-28 17:05:25.553015',2120,427,1094),('krishnamoorthy p',5,'✨ Excellent decoration work!\nVery professional, creative, and neat finishing. They understood our requirement perfectly and delivered more than expected. Quality materials, on-time work, and friendly approach. Highly recommended for any function or event decoration. 👌🎉','2026-03-28 17:05:37.016346',2121,428,1096),('Divya Jayachandran',5,'Absolutely loved the décor for our engagement! 💜 The stage looked elegant with the perfect blend of purple and white flowers, soft lighting, and a classy setup. The entrance and welcome boards were beautifully done and tied everything together perfectly with the logo we created for ourselves. Everything looked dreamy — just how we imagined! Everyone loved and appreciated it so much. ✨ Overall, the decoration exceeded our expectations — elegant, picture-perfect, and exactly what we envisioned for our special day. Truly grateful to the team for making the place look so magical! 🌸✨','2026-03-28 17:05:37.023993',2122,428,1096),('bhava dharni',5,'I have booked this place for my engagement. They surpassed my expectations. They utilised every single bit of space to the maximum. Gabriel knows how to bring elegance in an aesthetic way. Very beautiful and everyone who came to my function repeatedly kept praising the decor. Thank you very much Gabriel for this amazing work ❤️❤️❤️❤️','2026-03-28 17:05:37.036446',2123,428,1096),('Mario School',5,'We had the absolute pleasure of working with Delite Decors, led by Mr. Tyson, for our school’s Annual Christmas Celebration, which was held as an outdoor event, and the experience was nothing short of outstanding.\nFrom décor to lighting and sound, every aspect was handled with exceptional professionalism and creativity. Despite the space constraints, the stage setup was beautifully designed and perfectly executed, making the entire area look elegant, festive, and well planned. Even when we had our doubts about whether certain arrangements, especially if the seating would work, Mr. Tyson remained calm, confident, and reassuring, and his confidence truly reflected in the flawless final outcome. The chairs were laid out evenly and neatly, enhancing both comfort and aesthetics.\nThe backdrop was absolutely splendid, capturing the spirit of Christmas while complementing the overall theme of the event. Every element was thoughtfully arranged, creating a visually appealing and well-coordinated setup. The lighting added warmth and charm to the celebration, while the sound system was clear and well balanced throughout the program, ensuring a smooth experience for performers and audience alike.\nWhat truly stood out was Mr. Tyson’s attention to detail, his ability to visualize the end result, and his seamless execution. The entire décor came together beautifully, transforming the outdoor space into a festive and inviting venue.\nWe are extremely happy with the services provided by Delite Decors and would highly recommend Mr. Tyson and his team for any event. Their dedication, creativity, and reliability made our Christmas celebration truly memorable. 🎄✨\n-Mario Nursery and Primary School (Kolathur, Ch-99)','2026-03-28 17:05:37.040489',2124,428,1096),('Pavithra Ravichandran',5,'The decorations were amazing and made my wedding extra beautiful!!! Glad we found this great team!! Keep going guysss!!!','2026-03-28 17:05:37.042512',2125,428,1096),('Kaveen',5,'We used Charles and team for our event and we were mightily pleased with their service. Even though booking them was a last minute thingy, the decorations were absolutely stunning and exceeded all of my expectations. I received so many compliments on the party and the decor! We would like to extend a heartfelt thank you for the incredible job your team did.','2026-03-28 17:05:45.111682',2126,429,1101),('Prakash Traders',5,'We cannot thank Believe San Decors enough for the incredible job they did in planning and executing our church wedding! From the very beginning, they listened to our vision with such patience and sincerity. What truly stood out was how they went above and beyond to make everything not just perfect—but unforgettable.\n\nThe attention to detail, the elegant floral arrangements, the serene yet grand altar setup—every element reflected both taste and grace. They managed everything with such professionalism that we were able to truly enjoy our day without stress.\n\nSpecial thanks to the team for accommodating last-minute requests and surprising us with thoughtful personal touches that we never even imagined!\n\nIf you’re looking for a planner who genuinely cares about your big day and treats it like their own, look no further. Believe San Decors made our dream wedding a reality. Highly recommended!','2026-03-28 17:05:45.115014',2127,429,1101),('sarunath zafferin',4,'Believe San decors are best among other decors in Chennai,  Personally  I have witnessed some the amazing works done by them. for my betrothal and my wedding they have done good Job. I guess success for their Decoration is 1. Hard work 2. Low Budget 3. Skilled Labors 4. Creativeness 5. Talented workmanship. Keep growing, in future events will contact Believe San Decors','2026-03-28 17:05:45.118435',2128,429,1101),('Vinoth Vinoth v',5,'Worht the name they deliver watcthey promise or evn more.blindly i would suggest theme','2026-03-28 17:05:45.121590',2129,429,1101),('Shruthi S',5,'We had the pleasure of hiring Mr. Charles for our marriage event, and we couldn’t be happier with the results. The stage décor and aLeo our haldi event was nothing short of breathtaking, and it exceeded all our expectations. His attention to detail, creativity, and dedication was truly mesmerising.\n\nIf we hadn’t chosen Mr. Charles, we would have missed out on such a magical setup. Beyond his impeccable work, he is a kind-hearted and humble person who ensures complete satisfaction for his clients. Thank you, Mr. Charles, for making our special day even more memorable!\"','2026-03-28 17:05:45.124727',2130,429,1101),('Manisha Diraviam',5,'The decor was too good just like how i expected. They created all the minute details i have asked for.\nThe colour matching and all other small details were also beautifully done.\nVery much satisfied with their work for my daughter’s 1st birthday .','2026-03-28 17:05:50.458284',2131,430,1105),('Rabab Kanpurwala',5,'A few days back I had my son’s wedding, and I had hired Creative Splash for the décor. They did a truly fantastic job – everything looked elegant and beautiful, just as I had imagined.\n\nWhat stood out most was their attention to detail. They worked exactly on the theme I gave them and even arranged spotless cream chairs for the Kathakutva function.The team was very professional, attentive, and always quick to respond to my feedback.\n\nI am extremely happy with their work and would highly recommend Creative Splash to anyone looking for reliable and creative event decorators.','2026-03-28 17:05:50.461451',2132,430,1105),('Zehra Ambawala',5,'The decor team did an outstanding job! From planning to execution, everything was handled with utmost professionalism and creativity. The setup was elegant, detailed, and exactly as envisioned. Our guests were thoroughly impressed, and we highly recommend their services.','2026-03-28 17:05:50.465252',2133,430,1105),('Preethi Pushpavathi Kunasekaran',5,'We are very happy with the incredible job the ‘Creative Splash Team’ did for our son’s  birthday celebration! They were professional, creative, and truly went above and beyond to bring our vision to life. Every detail—from the balloon arrangements and table settings to the custom backdrop—was picture-perfect.\nThe team was punctual and worked seamlessly to transform the space into something magical. Guests were impressed with the decor.\nThank you team for making the day unforgettable!','2026-03-28 17:05:50.468652',2134,430,1105),('Sridhar Prasadh',1,'Poor customer handling. Decorations not worth the cost that they charge. Balloon work was incomplete and Standee was installed after the guest arrived at the venue almost after an hour the function had started.  Would never recommend them to anyone. Zaitoon should end their contract as this is tarnishing their reputation.','2026-03-28 17:05:50.472491',2135,430,1105),('manjula venkatesan',5,'Excellent service. First of all they are very patient to listen to our needs. Courteous service &flexible timings.seervarisai thattu & Aarti decorative are all customised according to our preferences. The decorations for seerthattu varisai is done so beautifully &promptly delivered on time to our venue.value for money.','2026-03-28 17:05:53.456141',2136,431,1107),('Muthu Amrutha',5,'“The seeru thatu decoration was very beautiful and neatly done. The flowers were fresh and the arrangement looked elegant. It made my brother’s engagement function more special and attractive. Everyone appreciated the decoration. Very happy and satisfied with the work.”','2026-03-28 17:05:53.459974',2137,431,1107),('Kavitha Malar',5,'Very nice work. All of us are satisfied. No more words to explain.neat and dedicated work Thank you so much for Aarti decor','2026-03-28 17:05:53.464738',2138,431,1107),('Ilakkiya Kannaiyan',5,'I ordered the doll set for my housewarming decor, which turned out to be the best highlight of the entire house. I live in the  USA, Saraswathi packed it so well and made it easy to travel in a suitcase from India. I ordered thorough whatsapp, she understood my requirements and created exactly what I wanted without any compromises. Thank you so much for the wonderful work.','2026-03-28 17:05:53.468031',2139,431,1107),('Keerthi Keerthi',5,'Aarti plates decorations is Amazing and Ideas of Aarti plates with Tradition Wedding Dolls was extremely superb Everybody impressed, Thank you saras mam','2026-03-28 17:05:53.471511',2140,431,1107),('Prasanth R',5,'I approached shades of love for my son\'s first birthday. Really Excellent service from Mr. Deepak. And very thanks to the decorate team. They finished the works at right time with dedication. Great out put...!!!❤️❤️‍🔥😍','2026-03-28 17:06:04.317946',2141,432,1108),('Lijin T',5,'Extremely professional and quality service at an affordable price. The team was able to assemble the design as per our design suggestion. They’ve provided a hassle-free experience to us. Highly recommended service','2026-03-28 17:06:04.320783',2142,432,1108),('Keerthana Pm',5,'One of the best event planners I have come across. I love their dedication, they really worked hard to make my big day a perfect one. It was filled with fun, dj, food and wonderful decoration too. Would highly recommend shadesoflove for planning an event.','2026-03-28 17:06:04.323393',2143,432,1108),('Roghit R',4,'Wonderful event\nHighly recommended this team\nShades of Love ❤️‍🔥','2026-03-28 17:06:04.326185',2144,432,1108),('Kanimozhi Pazhani',5,'Shades of love. As the name says we found the shades of love on their decoration. We gave the work for our son’s first celebration and we are overwhelmed with their work. We had a great experience.','2026-03-28 17:06:04.328564',2145,432,1108),('Kiran Kartheep',5,'The decor they did in my home was superb. Contacted them 10 days before event, they promptly responded and followed up with the design changes. Quickly grasped what i wanted and the decor turned out to be more than what i imagined. Time perfection and finished the decor well ahead of time.','2026-03-28 17:06:11.520711',2146,433,1113),('Suganya S',5,'Thank you so much, team! 😊 The decorations turned out exactly how we envisioned. Great work and really appreciate all the effort you put in to bring the output as we discussed and the quality, execution, and timely delivery are greatly appreciated👍🏼\n\nthank u for not breaking the hope and belief i had on u people 🙂 so many enquired on the decoration work during the function and im really happy sharing ur page to them …\nWishing you a long journey of success ahead.😀👍🏼✨','2026-03-28 17:06:11.524912',2147,433,1113),('Sreeranjini A',5,'I found Shine Decors through google and booked them for my daughter’s first birthday party trusting all the great reviews.. and it was the best decision I took..\nI can\'t express enough how thrilled I am with the incredible job they did for my daughter\'s first birthday party! They absolutely nailed it with the decor, creating a perfect setting fit for my little princess. Every detail I asked for was flawlessly executed, and the result was breathtaking. The veg dinner buffet they arranged was equally impressive, receiving compliments from all our guests. Cannot skip mentioning the Welcome Drink💛\nI couldn\'t have asked for a better experience. Thank you Shine Decors team and Deepan, for making my daughter\'s special day truly unforgettable!','2026-03-28 17:06:11.528423',2148,433,1113),('Jaya P',5,'I was extremely satisfied with the decoration work done by Shine Decors !!\n\nDeepan provided clear explanations right from my initial inquiry and promptly answered all my questions through voice notes, ensuring we were on the same page. On the event day, the team arrived on time and completed the setup neatly well before the event began. They even went the extra mile by adding a few additional props to enhance the decorations !!\n\nA big thanks to Shine Decors for their wonderful support in making my child’s birthday party special !!','2026-03-28 17:06:11.532235',2149,433,1113),('Newton Victor',4,'Fully satisfied with the decoration work done by Shine Decors N Events !!\n\nThey have wonderful team, they\'ve completed the completed the decoration on time.','2026-03-28 17:06:11.536148',2150,433,1113),('Barath',5,'We couldn’t have asked for a better decor team than Wedding Chakra. Their creativity, dedication, and eye for detail are unmatched. The entire setup looked elegant and magical, and the floral arrangements were simply gorgeous. Our guests are still talking about how beautiful the decor was!','2026-03-28 17:06:17.384397',2151,434,1118),('Sree Ram',5,'If you want a truly grand and elegant wedding, Wedding Chakra is the way to go. Their work at venues like ITC Grand Chola and Sheraton is legendary for a reason. The floral installations were fresh and breathtaking, and the lighting created the perfect ambiance for our reception. They truly are the \'Floral Ninjas\' of Chennai. Every guest was impressed by the decor!','2026-03-28 17:06:17.388638',2152,434,1118),('vanitha venkat',5,'Wedding chakra.. we had wonderful experience.Deco super hit. Lots of appreciation from guests. Output was fabulous','2026-03-28 17:06:17.390137',2153,434,1118),('Mano Balan',5,'What truly sets Wedding Chakra apart is their ability to transform a standard venue into a cinematic experience. While many decorators focus solely on the floral arrangements, they understand the architecture of a space. Their use of textured fabrics, strategic layering, and immersive installations creates a sense of luxury that feels both organic and intentional. Walking into a Wedding Chakra event feels like stepping into a curated gallery everything from the floor patterns to the overhead draping is synchronized to perfection. They don\'t just decorate a hall; they design a masterpiece.','2026-03-28 17:06:17.391529',2154,434,1118),('Gokul Raj',5,'Wedding Chakra did an absolutely phenomenal job planning and executing my sister’s wedding. Every detail was meticulously thought out and beautifully brought to life. From start to finish, the entire experience was seamless, and it truly felt like they went above and beyond to make the day magical.\n\nTheir professionalism and dedication were evident in every aspect, and I couldn’t have asked for a better team to handle such a special occasion. I wholeheartedly recommend Wedding Chakra to anyone looking for a wedding that’s not just well-planned, but truly unforgettable. Kudos to the entire team for their outstanding work!','2026-03-28 17:06:17.392984',2155,434,1118),('Babu Kvr',5,'It was nice discussing the decoration details for a family get together with Mr. Bharat and we could finalize it in a short period of time. It was customized to suit our requirements. The job was done perfectly and on time without causing any anxiety to us.\nI am sure they could perform well for any type of events and I recommend them without any hesitation.','2026-03-28 17:06:24.433873',2156,435,1120),('Varsha B',5,'Shribha was our first choice for the wedding decor and they will be our only choice for events going forward. I was very specific about the colour themes, choice of flowers, props etc. Bharath just ensured that I get my dream decor. The team at Shribha understood my requirements well and added their touch (elevated the idea) to what I\'d envisioned. We are truly grateful to Bharath and team Shribha for making our wedding feel like a fairytale.','2026-03-28 17:06:24.437033',2157,435,1120),('Yaseera Parveen',5,'I had such a wonderful experience working with the shriba team for my engagement ceremony .They executed exactly what I wanted under my budget..Every detail matched my vision perfectly. The team was so professional, patient, and really took the time to understand what I was looking for. The setup looked absolutely stunning and elegant, and everything came together so seamlessly on the day. Got so many compliments about the backdrop. I truly appreciate their effort and creativity .. they made the whole event feel so special! Definitely looking forward to working with them again for future occasions.','2026-03-28 17:06:24.440022',2158,435,1120),('Sindhyabala moorthy',5,'Wonderful work done by Shribha for my wedding reception in Ayswarya mahal, Chennai on 26th Jan 24. Everyone loved each and every part of the decoration. Stage decoration was elegant and well executed. Ms.Anu professionally executed our requirements and it was an absolute pleasure working with her. It was exactly the way we liked. It was a successful decoration setup that contributed positively to the ambiance of our wedding reception. Thank you so much team.\n\nSindhya','2026-03-28 17:06:24.443325',2159,435,1120),('Bhavana Shivakumar',5,'Shribha did my wedding decor and let me tell you, I have compliments about it even almost a year later. They weave magic !\nYou can have absolute confidence that you\'re decor will end up looking spectacular on your day.\nThe process of narrowing down the design was so seamless especially because they LISTEN. They heard my entire idea and brainstormed with me  and ensured everything was to my liking.\nI\'m going to be choosing Shribha again and again , no doubts ! You should too! 💞','2026-03-28 17:06:24.446503',2160,435,1120),('Sivasankar Gandhi',5,'The decoration turned out amazing! 👌 It was done on time and exceeded our expectations!','2026-03-28 17:06:30.666648',2161,436,1124),('Kumaresan s',5,'We had a wonderful experience with this wedding planner. Everything was well organized, from decoration to coordination. The team was professional, responsive, and ensured our special day went smoothly. Highly recommended!','2026-03-28 17:06:30.670680',2162,436,1124),('Saheb Bera',5,'This isn\'t just decoration; it\'s an immersive experience. The way the lighting and florals interact created a completely magical atmosphere','2026-03-28 17:06:30.674030',2163,436,1124),('PT YOGESH',5,'The way of decorations was very excellent and very nice 😍....','2026-03-28 17:06:30.677292',2164,436,1124),('Gopi E',5,'Decoration very nice 🤩🤩🤩','2026-03-28 17:06:30.680713',2165,436,1124),('Krithika Aiyer',5,'Nithin and team did an amazing work for arranging the milestone birthday party arrangements.\n\nI will fully recommend ‘My Event Planners’ for any event planning and management.\n\nThank you Nithin and team for this splendid work!','2026-03-28 17:06:34.181607',2166,437,1125),('Poonam Mahto',5,'A big thanks to Nithin and his Team for making my kid’s birthday such an amazing and memorable event! The décor was absolutely mesmerizing and beautifully done, and it truly brought the whole celebration to life. 🌸\n\nThe most wonderful part was that everyone at the party loved the décor, and many even asked me for your contact details — a true sign of your great work! 🙌\n\nWe are so grateful for your creativity, effort, and professionalism in making this day so special. Highly recommended! 💯','2026-03-28 17:06:34.184715',2167,437,1125),('Keerthana Pradeep',5,'I highly recommend My Event Planners! Working with Nithin was an absolute pleasure. He\'s our lifesaver for our Brainobrain Ajax -Thiruvottiyur Graduation function, Satyanarayana puja etc.. for the past 4 - 5 years .\n\n​Nithin truly listens to our vision and he made it a reality, all while staying within our budget. I was especially impressed with how they handled the last-minute vendor change, the stunning floral arrangements, the smooth timeline photos and etc...\n​Thanks to Nithin,and his entire team, he personally made sure all the events ran perfectly, thus we were able to relax and enjoy the moment. If you\'re looking for an event planner who is organized, creative, and professional, look no further! It\'s My Event Planners!!!!!','2026-03-28 17:06:34.187700',2168,437,1125),('Shweta Ravi (SRI ISHANI)',5,'I\'m thoroughly impressed with Nithin’s decoration services for my daughter\'s ear-piercing ceremony! Nithin did an outstanding job, and the price was reasonable. Their willingness to travel to make our event special truly added to the experience. Highly recommend for their professionalism and attention.','2026-03-28 17:06:34.190873',2169,437,1125),('Rashmi Rashu',5,'Nithin is my go to person for all my special events and he does all the decors with so much passion.\nFrom my very first decor till now he has been doing such great work. His work is so neat and does it with dedication. Even though Nithin is compiled with other events, he is always on time and makes sure to enhance the decor with charming properties and sets the decor beautifully. I always recommend and consider him for all my future events and Highly recommend for yours as well🥰','2026-03-28 17:06:34.193443',2170,437,1125),('Divya',5,'I\'m booked for my sister baby shower. Absolutely beautiful decoration by JK Events & Decors! The Baby Murugan theme was executed perfect. The stage looked grand, divine, and very well planned. Everyone loved the setup. The best budget decors around chennai. Highly recommended for JK Events & Decors💜','2026-03-28 17:06:40.343317',2171,438,1126),('G. B. RAJESH',5,'I ordered stage decoration from JK Events, and they did a super job! The setup looked amazing and everyone loved it.❤️‍🔥','2026-03-28 17:06:40.347234',2172,438,1126),('Iliyas Iliyas',5,'J k events is very good team and super working is the best decoration and good person and good quality and cost is very low budget','2026-03-28 17:06:40.350958',2173,438,1126),('Bakya Lakshmi',5,'I\'ve booked decor for my Son 1st birthday party, it was awesome and budget friendly too. In chennai minmum starting price was 25k. But My Son birthday decor one is value for money and price is also low.\n\nI highly recommend JK Events & Decors for your Party.\n\nThanks.','2026-03-28 17:06:40.354238',2174,438,1126),('Keerthana Ravichandran',5,'Decor was as expected as it is, very affordable in pricing and on timing in the finishing ,\n\nThanks JK events and decors','2026-03-28 17:06:40.358173',2175,438,1126),('mercy manoranjitham',5,'One of the Best wedding planners in Tamil Nadu.\nVery perfect work ,Budget friendly,Trustworthy,creative ,punctuality, staff with  Good team work ,  unique designs,exordinory tasty food menu.The Biriyani was outstanding! You\'ve done a great job. That was delicious and a satisfying meal ,\nchicken 65  was amazing ,delicious bread halwa, everything was in very good.\nThe decoration of both church and mandapam was very beautiful & Eye catching.\nThank you Elshadai Team\n& congratulations and God Bless Mr.Thomas & Maria Thomas.\nFrom\nARBA SPORTSWEAR\nchennai\nMrs.Mercy Manoranjitham','2026-03-28 17:06:43.302620',2176,439,1128),('Ignatius David',5,'Fantastic wedding planners and truly creators of magical moments!!! Magicians who will orchestrate magical moments for each and every one present in their events !! Thank you Maria and Thomas for this fantastic Evening of love and happiness that you have gifted us!! You guys are the best!! El SHADDAI FTW 🔥🔥🔥🔥','2026-03-28 17:06:43.305363',2177,439,1128),('Vinodhini Elumalai',5,'Well organised.... Met all over expectations... You are real blessing to us...Budget friendly. Decorations was very graceful in church .Mutton biriyani was awesome no AJINOMOT was added... For 1000 guests we ordered.Served with unlimited mutton pieces and chicken 65.\nHats Off to Maria aunty and Thomas uncle..... God bless you... Gen 12. 2','2026-03-28 17:06:43.308299',2178,439,1128),('Lionel Frederick',5,'We approached El Shaddai for our wedding planning and Maria and Thomas handled the whole event beautifully.\n\nFrom the decorations (both church and homes) to photography to catering to bridesmaid outfits to live streaming, the team meticulously planned the wedding from start to finish and ensured that we had a hassle-free and well-coordinated wedding. They consulted us for our opinion on each and every aspect of the wedding and executed everything to perfection. A special shout-out to their catering service; it was unanimously praised by everyone who attended our event.','2026-03-28 17:06:43.310685',2179,439,1128),('Oviya Saravanan',5,'First of all, a big thank you to the team El Shaddai for helping us have the most perfect wedding day ever! Everything was just amazing. We were extremely happy with their designs, decors, and most importantly \"FOOD\".\nThey were super patient with all our questions during the planning process and during the days just prior to our wedding. We had so many compliments.\nThank you once again for turning our dream into reality.\nIf you’re looking for a wedding planner, here you have a team of them!','2026-03-28 17:06:43.313121',2180,439,1128),('raja satish',5,'Booked this event management team at very last minute for my nephew first birthday celebration planned at out terrace.\nI believed Mr.Nirmal and handed over the complete ownership to him by just mentioning the theme he completely took over and customised as per our budget and did this in a perfect way.\nextraordinary work keep rocking bro\nWill recommend surely for my friends without second thought.','2026-03-28 17:06:46.807371',2181,440,1129),('Vijay Kumar',5,'Tamil Pasanga team was perfect team for all our family function... Our baby shower function was done by tamil Pasanga team... It was a wonderful arrangements.... Thanks for Tamil Pasanga Team','2026-03-28 17:06:46.811180',2182,440,1129),('Karthick R',5,'Amazing work done by Tamil pasanga team. I invited them for my Son’s 1st birthday and the outcome was pleasant.','2026-03-28 17:06:46.814588',2183,440,1129),('Deepika Deepikasriram',5,'The boys are doing so good even, the last minute event.Because we booked day before night and mrng they came, finished the work with full of happiness.\n\nThanks u buddies 💥💥💥','2026-03-28 17:06:46.817856',2184,440,1129),('vinoth kumar',5,'From start to finish, they demonstrated professionalism, creativity, and a keen attention to detail that truly made the event memorable. Every aspect, from the decorations to the activities, was meticulously planned and executed, exceeding all our expectations.\n\nWe wholeheartedly recommend this amazing team to anyone looking to host a flawless and unforgettable event.','2026-03-28 17:06:46.821376',2185,440,1129),('Tryphena Prabakaran',5,'We booked Canaan decors for my sister\'s wedding and engagement. Everything was just perfect. Johnson anna had some really good suggestions and he was accommodating to our ideas. It was great working with them. It was easy to communicate with the team, and I was frequently updated on the status of the decor, on the day of the event, which was reassuring. The outcome was extremely beautiful and everyone loved it :))','2026-03-28 17:06:54.107056',2186,441,1130),('Jonathan Kereth Abraham',5,'We worked with Canaan on the decorations for my sister’s wedding, and it was a wonderful experience! From the very beginning, Mr. Johnson was incredibly flexible and easy to work with. The final outcome exceeded all expectations, the transformation of the auditorium was stunning, and everyone admired the beautiful ambience.\n\nOne of the most touching details was how thoughtfully he incorporated my grandmother’s handcrafted flowers into the decor. He showcased them with such care and elegance, adding a deeply personal and meaningful touch to the entire setting.','2026-03-28 17:06:54.110825',2187,441,1130),('Rathna Dev',5,'Canaan made my sister\'s wedding day truly special.  We employed Canaan for both the church and the reception decor. I was truly impressed by Mr.Johnson\'s attention to detail. He was quick to respond and was always willing to go the extra mile. There was also no ambiguity or vagueness about deliverables and the costs involved. Canaan is an excellent choice for any one getting married in the Chennai area !','2026-03-28 17:06:54.114357',2188,441,1130),('Althea Teresa',5,'Absolutely Stunning Wedding Décor!\n\nI cannot thank Canaan Decors & Events enough for the breathtaking décor at my wedding! Jonny anna is an incredibly calm and charismatic person who put his whole heart into making my vision come to life. I had a very specific aesthetic in mind, and he executed it flawlessly, from the wedding ceremony to the reception.\n\nThe entire setup felt like a Bridgeton fairytale come to life—pure magic, grace, and grandeur. The blend of elegance with modern touches made the entire venue feel magical and warm. There’s something so timeless and enchanting about garden weddings, and Jonny anna and his team brought that dream to reality—especially in the cool-weather setting. The color scheme of pastel blush, powder blue, pale green, and metallic gold accents, along with deep purple and plum hues, created the most whimsical and romantic atmosphere.\n\nWhat stood out the most was how Jonny anna treated this event as if it were his own wedding—every detail was curated with so much care and precision. His dedication, creativity, and passion truly shined through. His team was also a joy to work with—professional, efficient, and incredibly kind.\n\nLOVED IT AS A WHOLE! If you’re looking for a wedding decorator who understands your vision and executes it to perfection, Canaan Decors & Events is the one to go for! Highly, highly recommend!','2026-03-28 17:06:54.119034',2189,441,1130),('Arun Kumar',5,'What a stunning celebration! The decor was absolutely breathtaking. Every detail, from the enchanting entrance to the exquisite stage setup, reflected such thought and care. The blend of elegance with modern touches made the entire venue feel magical and warm. Truly, it set the perfect tone for such a joyous occasion. Hats off to everyone involved in creating such a memorable atmosphere for  my sister’s special day!. Especially Johnson bro personally he came in our way to make things better & beautiful\n\nPersonally i suggest canaan decors for Laity Auditorium than other apporved vendors in their list\n\nNote: The venue was more than the picture attached here.','2026-03-28 17:06:54.122405',2190,441,1130),('dinesha paul',5,'Sathish and the team did an outstanding job decorating for your baby\'s first birthday. The final look was truly impressive, receiving excellent feedback from colleagues and relatives. The decorations looked amazing even through the camera, showcasing the remarkable lighting, design, and overall setup. You extend your gratitude to Sathish and the team for their fantastic work.','2026-03-28 17:06:57.276086',2191,442,1133),('sandhiya s',5,'Our marriage was a successful event and decoration was one of the factor. We checked multiple options and came up with the final one with purple background. Satish was so calm and composed to listen to our suggestions and did the background very well. There were so many alterations in the last time and he did that patiently without charging us extra. The decoration was so grand and colourful.  Thanks a lot sathish, u did a fabulous work!!','2026-03-28 17:06:57.279436',2192,442,1133),('Sarath Kumar',5,'Our customized design has been decorated well for my daughter\'s birthday. People are dedicated and friendly according to our convenience.','2026-03-28 17:06:57.282801',2193,442,1133),('Arun P',5,'We have booked it for my Daughter birthday celebration… We got so many ideas and options from the decor and he keep following us on the design and our cake, dress etc to align with the decorations.. We‘re so happy with the decors and will surely recommend to others as well','2026-03-28 17:06:57.286070',2194,442,1133),('Venkat Mohan',5,'Stage decoration was really awesome. He made the perfect and what we expected he gave the same thanks much😍','2026-03-28 17:06:57.289212',2195,442,1133),('Denzil Dhanasingh',5,'We celebrated my daughter’s engagement at AVM Gardens in Vadapalani in Dec 2024 and chose Balaji Flower Decorations for the event decor. Their services were absolutely outstanding and exceeded our expectations. The decorations were elegant, meticulously arranged, and handled with complete professionalism. We were thoroughly satisfied with their work!','2026-03-28 17:07:04.492676',2196,443,1134),('hema shri',5,'I got my seemantham  decoration from Balaji flowers and they did a fantastic job… 5stars are not enough to rate them. Mr. Kamesh clearly understands our vision and the output is more than expected from pictures. Truly impressed by his work and definitely would recommend him .','2026-03-28 17:07:04.496020',2197,443,1134),('Sneha Sankar',5,'The decor for all my wedding events was taken care of by Kamesh and his team. They work extra hard to ensure your vision comes alive or make sure it\'s even better than what you imagine!\nThey even took care of all the garland and other flower needs as well.\nThe work done was timely and done very elegantly! Would highly recommend them for events at home as well as for large venues!! Thank you, team :)','2026-03-28 17:07:04.499384',2198,443,1134),('Pravanthy Ashok',5,'Taking a moment to thank kamesh.Extremely dedicated and understands what we need and does the best .The decor during my engagement was amazing bought what I expected. Loved it . Would highly recommend it to my friends and relatives as well .','2026-03-28 17:07:04.502657',2199,443,1134),('Balakrishnan R',5,'Fantastic Baby Shower Stage Decoration -\n\nA Magical Setup!\n\nI must say, the stage decoration was absolutely breathtaking! The attention to detail, the choice of colors, and the overall theme created a dreamy and elegant atmosphere. The combination of soft pastels, delicate floral arrangements, and twinkling fairy lights gave the stage a magical touch.\n\nKudos to the decorators for their creativity and hard work! It was truly a picture-perfect stage that made the event unforgettable.','2026-03-28 17:07:04.505508',2200,443,1134),('Manikandan M',5,'Chennai Wedding Decorators did a fantabulous work for our family.We are extremely grateful for the wonderful and beautiful wedding decorations in Chennai.They are budget friendly with an excellent communication team.Their team members are very friendly and easily available anytime.Wedding Backdrop,stage and the entrance with a beautiful passage decoration along with name board and welcome Board were outstanding.Thank you for your support and extraordinary decorations work.Thank you team Chennai wedding decorators.','2026-03-28 17:07:06.603102',2201,444,1138),('Murali Krishnan',5,'Very professional team … exactly understood my requirements and shall  surly recommend their services','2026-03-28 17:07:06.606386',2202,444,1138),('Gopinath Rajendran',5,'Brilliant service by Chennai wedding decorators team.Initially Shiva from the Chennai wedding decorators team started the discussion and we clearly explained to him our requirements.On the day of the wedding, their delivery team executed beautiful wedding decorations.Their wedding backdrop and entrance flower decorations were top notch.I would highly recommend them for wedding decorations.','2026-03-28 17:07:06.609269',2203,444,1138),('naveen kumar',5,'Very professional and friendly, Cares about consumers requirements. They are very transparent and most of all trustworthy.','2026-03-28 17:07:06.612751',2204,444,1138),('Sreedharan U',5,'Excellent and innovative. I am so much happy with the service they are offering.','2026-03-28 17:07:06.615913',2205,444,1138),('Brikit Griminalli',5,'The decoration was excellent at affordable price and the team was very friendly and listened to our requirements in detail and done a great job.. keep up the good work.. 👍','2026-03-28 17:07:17.282181',2206,445,1142),('Savitha Rajesh',1,'We called for quotes and the manner with which they responded itself was a proof enough for their quality. Not someone who seems to be considerate of customers..better ro avoid such service providers..','2026-03-28 17:07:17.284378',2207,445,1142),('Jaya S',5,'The best and awesome work from the team, and affordable price for the decoration, thank you very much','2026-03-28 17:07:17.286685',2208,445,1142),('PA. SEETHAARAMAN .',5,'Excellent service. Custom made to fit expectation. Timely delivery.','2026-03-28 17:07:17.288509',2209,445,1142),('Prabhavathi Rajendran',5,'We are happy with them thankyou so much','2026-03-28 17:07:17.290372',2210,445,1142),('Priya Khandelwal',5,'We hired ‘Manali Decorators’ for all the wedding décor and arrangements at our venue, and the experience was absolutely wonderful. Every setup was beautifully done and perfectly matched our vision. From the main wedding functions to the smallest details, everything looked elegant and well planned.\nThe team was professional, creative, and very supportive throughout the process. Their work truly enhanced the entire wedding atmosphere and received so many compliments from our guests. Highly recommend Manali Decorators for anyone looking to make their wedding décor truly special!\nSpecial thanks to Sandeep Ji for providing truly amazing services❤️','2026-03-28 17:07:21.899044',2211,446,1147),('Komal Sharma',5,'Friend’s wedding comes with a lot of stressa nd being the bride’s close friend, you can imagine how overwhelming it can get. Sandeep, who led the entire event, was absolutely amazing.\n\nHe ensured that every requirement was taken care of, including all our last-minute requests, without ever making it feel like a hassle. He was consistently sweet, calm, and polite throughout all the events, which honestly made a huge difference during such a hectic time.\n\nThe décor was stunning and beautifully executed—everything came together perfectly. If you’re considering Sandeep for your wedding or any event, you can go ahead without a second thought. Highly recommended!','2026-03-28 17:07:21.901323',2212,446,1147),('Sumeet Sharma',5,'I honestly cannot thank him enough for everything he did for us. From day one, he coordinated each and every detail without asking a single unnecessary question. He was always ready for last-minute changes, never complained, never asked for anything extra, and was supportive throughout the entire journey.\nWhat impressed us the most was his honesty and kindness. The décor we initially selected was within our budget, but he himself suggested enhancements saying, “Don’t worry, I’ll take care of it in a way that suits the venue,” as the selected décor was incomplete. He went above and beyond, added many extra elements on his own, and did not charge even a single extra penny for it.\nHe also helped my family with local coordination and arrangements, which was a huge relief. His guidance and support felt like that of an elder brother—serious when needed, caring at all times.\nHis favourite dialogue truly sums him up:\n“Arre Sumeet ji, aap fikar na kare, aap shanti se enjoy kijiye, baaki sab main dekh lunga.”\nAnd he truly lived up to those words.\nSuper budget-friendly, extremely genuine, and always supportive. If you are looking for a decorator who treats your event like his own family function, look no further. Highly recommended!','2026-03-28 17:07:21.904264',2213,446,1147),('Simran Ruhal',5,'I cannot express enough gratitude to Sandeep Ji for making our wedding a memorable celebration with decorations absolutely flawless. From the very beginning, he was attentive, professional, and truly dedicated to bringing our vision to life. No matter what request I had—big or small—he handled everything with patience and expertise, ensuring every detail was perfect.\n\nThe decorations were breathtaking, beyond what I had imagined, and the entire process was smooth and stress-free. Sandeep Ji and his team’s commitment to excellence and their willingness to accommodate every request at any time truly made this experience special. If you’re looking for a decorator who delivers perfection with a personal touch, this team is the one to choose. Highly recommended!\n\nThank you once again for making our big day so beautiful!','2026-03-28 17:07:21.908403',2214,446,1147),('Shalu Thakur',5,'Highly professional and a joy to work with. Mr. Sandeep Thakur and his team made the entire planning process stress-free and enjoyable. Their attention to detail is remarkable—they handled everything from the grand entrance to the smallest decor elements with absolute precision. They are cooperative, flexible, and extremely reliable.','2026-03-28 17:07:21.911916',2215,446,1147),('DHARANI CHELVAN',5,'Star pro events has been one of the greatest best choice in my wedding . The DJ and the entry stage fog ballon blast entry everything was picture perfect this was an unexpected things at my wedding they added more and made my day more special their arrangements timings DJ songs everything was very soothing and excellent I would definitely recommend this event planner and budget friendly.','2026-03-28 17:07:31.276763',2216,447,1148),('Abeehs Sheeba',5,'Hi Star Pro Event Created a stunning and memorable moments on my sisters wedding. From the starting till the end everything was mind blowing. All my Relatives and friends enjoyed the return gifts Photo booth. Entry Bubble Blast and While cake cutting Paper Blast has freezed the moment. Thank you onces again. Don\'t miss to try Star Pro##','2026-03-28 17:07:31.279802',2217,447,1148),('Jothi Jo',5,'💐It was my Son 1st birthday celebration. I am happy with the final execution of the work . The team was well coordinated and the entire event went very well. The back drop , choice of real flowers ittar bar, anchor performance all met to my expectation. 🙏Thankful for Star Pro Events Team entire team for making the special day unforgettable for us !!👍','2026-03-28 17:07:31.282633',2218,447,1148),('satish yadhav',5,'Best in market they kept there promise 100%\nI loved there working setup was awesome thank you team star pro event  for making my reception 200% effective and all people loved it and happy thank you once’s again','2026-03-28 17:07:31.285706',2219,447,1148),('Vaishali M',5,'We had the pleasure of working with Star pro events for my brother’s wedding, and they truly made the celebrations unforgettable! 🎉\n\nThe pyro and fog pot entry created a magical atmosphere and added so much grandeur to the occasion.\n\nThe DJ kept the energy high with the perfect mix of songs – everyone had a great time on the dance floor.\n\nThe instant photo booth was a huge hit with our guests. The props and setup were fun, and we now have so many beautiful memories captured instantly.\n\nProfessional, punctual, and very creative 👏. Thank you for making the event extra special – highly recommend their services for any celebration!','2026-03-28 17:07:31.288233',2220,447,1148),('Sufiyan Khan',5,'It\'s perfect decor to all functions and complete on time and finishing also this my experience','2026-03-28 17:07:38.869063',2221,448,1150),('Kalaiyalaya tv',5,'Events','2026-03-28 17:07:38.872443',2222,448,1150),('Harrish K',5,'Really loved the decorative plates for our event! The designs were beautiful and made the setup look extra special. The team was super easy to work with and made everything smooth and stress-free. Thanks for making our celebration memorable','2026-03-28 17:07:49.199671',2223,449,1155),('DvsTeja',5,'We opted for the 11 plate decoration service, and they did an excellent job! The decorations were beautifully done and delivered right on time. Fantastic service ✨️','2026-03-28 17:07:49.202645',2224,449,1155),('Aditya Gopalakrishnan',5,'I recently approached Lakshvan events for my family function in August, they did a very good job. They handled all the request and delivered on time. Varisa set was very innovative and beautiful, our friends and family liked it a lot. I recommend Lakshvan Events for all your function needs.','2026-03-28 17:07:49.206664',2225,449,1155),('prem kumar',5,'I’m very happy to recommend the wedding decorators who handled my marriage. They did an outstanding job and made our special day even more beautiful than we imagined.\n\nThe stage decoration, flowers, lighting, and overall setup were perfectly arranged with great attention to detail. Everything was neat, elegant, and completed on time. They were very professional, cooperative, and easy to work with throughout the entire process.\n\nIf anyone is looking for beautiful and stress-free wedding decorations, I strongly recommend them. You can confidently go ahead with their service.','2026-03-28 17:07:54.972347',2226,450,1160),('Vamsi Krishna',5,'Evergreen events & enterprises made our memories\" Evergreen \" on very short notice accepted our request for the birthday celebration. And creatively planned and designed according to the requirement the outcome was fabulous... Thanks a lot Evergreen events & enterprises team...','2026-03-28 17:07:54.974840',2227,450,1160),('Mukul Sreewastav',5,'Budget friendly, ontime delivery.\nExceptional service from start to finish at small venue by doing changes according to our budget & needs. The events team took my vision and elevated it beyond what I imagined. They were proactive, creative, and incredibly organized in time and explanation before, during and after. If you want a stress-free event that leaves your guests raving, this is the team to hire. 10/10!\n\nThank you for making our day.','2026-03-28 17:07:54.978686',2228,450,1160),('Ismail Ismail',5,'very beautiful event and good management and organised. thank you ever green','2026-03-28 17:07:54.982509',2229,450,1160),('siva sankar',5,'Absolutely stunning decoration! The attention to detail and creativity made the entire event look magical. Exceeded our expectations!','2026-03-28 17:07:54.985833',2230,450,1160),('reshmi k',5,'Excellent service! 👏The back-drop decor, food, photos, return gifts and other arrangements were great, budget friendly and spot-on. Your were flexiable and reachable at anytime. Your responses were quick and clear. Thanks, Sam and your team! 👍 Highly satisfied.','2026-03-28 17:08:00.758318',2231,451,1162),('Vivek Manoharan',5,'Great job Samuel and your team! 👏 You made sure the event was grandly completed at short notice. The guest conveyed that the backdrop decor, catering service and food taste were exceptional. Your services exceeded our expectations. Thank you and your team for the service.Keep up the good work. 🤝','2026-03-28 17:08:00.761766',2232,451,1162),('santhosh santy',5,'Thank you so much EVENT THEORY team. Special thanks to Mr.Samuel. Wonderful decoration you have done. We are very happy for your work. Good response. Thanks a lot for your beautiful decoration which makes our day much more special👍🏻😊','2026-03-28 17:08:00.765742',2233,451,1162),('Sharenya Asokan',5,'Heartfelt thanks to sam for making our event a memorable one. He is dedicated and sincere towards his work. Entire team is skilled and work gets done on time. The decoration was very good and at a very reasonable price. Keep it up event theory team 👍 👏','2026-03-28 17:08:00.768790',2234,451,1162),('Avanthika G',5,'A heartfelt tha