:08:18.864337',2242,453,1169),('Monisha John',4,'Good','2026-03-28 17:08:18.867020',2243,453,1169),('Arun G20',5,'We L&T realty engaged this  Zara event management Team, It was amazing and engaging as well !! Excellent!\n\nWe recommend for group events, family events and corporate events.\n\nAll the very best for your future growth!!','2026-03-28 17:08:23.479898',2244,454,1174),('U20-23 -Prasanna',5,'Zara Eventz made my wedding day absolutely magical! From coordinating vendors to setting up the most stunning decor, everything was handled flawlessly. Their team was super professional and made sure I didn’t have to worry about a thing. Highly recommend for any special occasion!\"','2026-03-28 17:08:23.481439',2245,454,1174),('Bad Komban',5,'\"Zara Eventz handled our annual corporate gala with absolute precision. From stage setup to coordinating speakers, every aspect was seamless. Our leadership team and employees were truly impressed with the elegant ambiance and smooth flow of the event.','2026-03-28 17:08:23.482895',2246,454,1174),('Naveen Kumar Jadav',5,'Dhanalakshmi College of Engineering - EEE 20 year reunion was organised. We had great time thanks and the event was engaging and well planned. thanks to Anurii','2026-03-28 17:08:23.484370',2247,454,1174),('Nagaraj Kamaraj',5,'\"I can’t thank Zara Eventz enough for organizing my engagement party. They were punctual, organized, and incredibly responsive throughout the planning process. Everything went smoothly, and our guests were impressed with the elegant setup.\"','2026-03-28 17:08:23.485764',2248,454,1174),('karthick Rajendran',5,'Good work and very impressive design done by MK event. Price is also too good. And jeep entry flower pot also very nice.','2026-03-28 17:08:26.452853',2249,455,1175),('DG imran',5,'Fabulous work done by mk event sarath...price is too worth for the decoration and jeep entry... very impressive and neat work','2026-03-28 17:08:26.456282',2250,455,1175),('k.annamalai Siva',5,'We booked for our manjal neerattuvilaa\n\nFully satisfied with the decorations\n\nThey provided output what we show in the photo','2026-03-28 17:08:26.460408',2251,455,1175),('Bharath Vijesh',5,'Very good experience with MK Event decorations. Nice decoration with affordable price','2026-03-28 17:08:26.464205',2252,455,1175),('rafi mohammed',5,'Smart and good decoration work, price also very affordable thank for your work','2026-03-28 17:08:26.468166',2253,455,1175),('Krishna prakash',4,'🎉 Namma Veetu Vishayam 🎉\nAll arrangements for my daughter\'s first birthday went beautifully! The decorations were widely appreciated—everyone said they looked absolutely stunning. The food was a hit too, especially the biriyani, which received lots of compliments. There was a slight hiccup with the food service, but overall, the celebration was joyful and memorable. Grateful to everyone who made it special! 💖','2026-03-28 17:08:33.647698',2254,456,1176),('Jaya sangamithrai',5,'Hi I am Shakthi Dharan\'s mom. We celebrated my son\'s first bday..The event management team done there job best..All the neighborhood told that the decoration, especially food and cake was very delicious..The dustbin cover is very useful kept my place very clean after the event...Thanks a lot Namma veetu Vishesham team ....','2026-03-28 17:08:33.651015',2255,456,1176),('Vajiravelu Velu',5,'I had the opportunity to experience the work of Namma Veetu Vishesham, and I must say they bring a refreshing approach to event management. Whether it\'s corporate events or personal celebrations, their innovative ideas, attention to detail, and seamless execution truly stand out. What impressed me most is their ability to deliver high-quality events tailored to different budgets without compromising on creativity or experience. I highly recommend them for anyone looking to plan a memorable and well-managed event','2026-03-28 17:08:33.654140',2256,456,1176),('nishanth r',5,'I recently hired Namma veetu vishaham for a special event, and I couldn’t be more impressed. From start to finish, their team was professional, detail-oriented, and incredibly creative. They took the time to understand my vision and brought it to life flawlessly. The event ran smoothly, looked stunning, and left a lasting impression on all our guests. Highly recommend for anyone looking to plan a stress-free and memorable event.','2026-03-28 17:08:33.657724',2257,456,1176),('Praveena Venkatesh',5,'Hi.. Mam.. I really enjoyed with my kid Birthday party event & house warming ceremonies.. With NVV Events. The best event planning company around! I was able to witness first hand their attention to details.\nThese Both events smoothly and professionally from beginning to end! NVV Events Proprietor kalai mam especially she was great at organizing and budget friendly.. In my events.. And answered all my questions before the day of.\nShe\'s was very personable and even made sure each Guest was enjoyed themselves.\nI will Definitely Recommend them to anyone in need of event planning.\nThankyou  Mam & NVV Events Team. 🤝','2026-03-28 17:08:33.661108',2258,456,1176),('Abyrami kannan',4,'Good work. On time hand over. Friendly discussion about the event. Overall excellent work','2026-03-28 17:08:47.001380',2259,458,1186),('Rajababu Krish',5,'Good decoration done for my function\nPrices are also affordable go ahead','2026-03-28 17:08:47.009632',2260,458,1186),('Pavi Tharan',5,'The decorations were completed on time, and everything turned out beautifully. The Sangeet decor was especially impressive and came out really well. All the arrangements, right from Sangeet till Muhurtham, were appreciated by both our families. Thank you so much for the wonderful work!','2026-03-28 17:08:58.548796',2261,459,1191),('Kicha Kicha2008',5,'Hello sir, I didn\'t expect you to translate it so beautifully, thank you very much','2026-03-28 17:08:58.551849',2262,459,1191),('Neerplaste',5,'One of the best and cheap best decor at Tindivanam and must use worth decoration and value for money','2026-03-28 17:08:58.555121',2263,459,1191),('Purushoth Purushoth',5,'06/03/2026 Decoration need clear completed complete that decoration everytime my family your decoration follows thank you sir','2026-03-28 17:08:58.558300',2264,459,1191),('Sanghavi SHRI',5,'We opt Dayyours for our daughter birthday celebration\nVery neat presentation and decoration\nSimple and affordable\nGood work must recommend 😄🙏👌','2026-03-28 17:08:58.561692',2265,459,1191),('Meena Natarajan',5,'We are extremely happy with the way our OH YES event was organized. The team was very professional, well-coordinated and attentive to every detail. From the initial discussion till the final execution, everything went smoothly because of their dedication and effort. Our guests also loved the arrangements.  From planning to execution, everything was handled very professionally.  The team was very supportive, responsive and made sure every small detail was taken care of. Especially Vihasini and Bharat have done a great job.they are pillars of the event.and our designer sheetal and dancers and stunt Roshini have done great job. Last but not least Saravanan sir who bring out our vision and dream into reality. The way he approached  and coordinated with us was very impressive ,thankyou for the blessed memories Anna❤️.Our event turned out exactly the way we imagined. Thank you for your hard work and dedication. Highly recommend them for any special occasion!” Thank you for making our celebration truly Special.','2026-03-28 17:09:05.033312',2266,460,1196),('Lakshmi Narasimhan',5,'We stumbled upon oh yes lead Shri Saravanan for waste management in our effort towards conducting our daughter marriage in an eco-friendly manner on  February 22, 2026. It turned out to be blessing, as with more interaction with him and his team, the positive approach in every single aspect was distinctly evident. The team members were a  bunch of proactive youngsters. We entrusted more responsibility with them for some of the event management. The  dynamic update of their work is really appreciated.\nTheir approach at each stage gave us immense confident that, we are trusting a team which focussed on their jobs. The outcome was clearly seen on the eve and during the event.\nDuring the two day marriage, the guests were very happy with the hospitality of the oh yes team.  It made us very comfortable. Also we could almost conduct the marriage in an eco friendly manner thanks to their support.\nI want to thank each and every member of the team for the wonderful work.\nBest wishes to the young team.','2026-03-28 17:09:05.037093',2267,460,1196),('Dakshina Siva',5,'From the very first meeting itself, there was an instant sense of trust and comfort that made us feel we were in the right hands. Something about the way your team listened, understood, and responded gave me and my parents complete confidence that you would create the wedding exactly the way we had imagined.\n\nYour enthusiasm, knowledge, and attention to detail were evident at every step of the planning process. You didn’t just suggest ideas — you truly understood our vision and transformed it into a design that perfectly reflected what our family had in mind. Seeing our dream wedding décor come to life was incredibly emotional and satisfying.\n\nThe level of professionalism your entire team displayed was outstanding — from planning and coordination to execution. Everything was seamless, well-organized, and beautifully managed, allowing us and our families to truly enjoy every moment without stress.\n\nEvery wedding couple and their families deserve a team like yours — one that can turn dreams into reality with such perfection, passion, and elegance. Thank you for making our wedding unforgettable.','2026-03-28 17:09:05.040864',2268,460,1196),('Sathyabama C',5,'Our wedding took place on August 25th at Ideal Beach Resort, and choosing Oh Yes Events turned out to be one of the best decisions we made!\n\nFrom the very first call with Saravanan and Ruthra, we felt an instant sense of confidence and clarity and that trust only grew stronger through the entire journey. The on-ground execution team, especially Bharath, Leeladharan, and Shyam Sundar, ensured that every ceremony Haldi, Mehendi, Sangeet, and the Wedding was flawlessly organized and filled with joy.\n\nWhat truly stood out was how Oh Yes created an entire event ecosystem from décor and logistics to hospitality and entertainment with every vendor suggested by them turning out to be top-notch. We realized during the execution that their choices brought results even beyond what we had imagined!\n\nEven with international guests and traditional rituals to manage, the team beautifully balanced everything, making our wedding both elegant and deeply personal.\n\nIf you’re planning your big day, go with Oh Yes Events’ suggestions even if you do your research, you’ll see that their experience and taste bring together the best that you might not even know existed until it all comes alive.\n\nTruly grateful and highly recommended for anyone looking for a stress-free, beautifully curated wedding experience! 💛✨','2026-03-28 17:09:05.044308',2269,460,1196),('Suresh Parthasarathy',5,'We engaged Oh Yes Events for my father’s 80th birthday celebration, and the experience was excellent from start to finish.\n\nA special mention to Ms. Chitra, who coordinated the event — she was extremely responsive, attentive to every detail, and ensured flawless execution on the day. Her calm approach and proactive follow-ups gave us complete confidence and peace of mind.\n\nEverything was well planned and beautifully executed. Kudos to Ms.Chitra and the Oh Yes Events team for a job very well done. Highly recommended.','2026-03-28 17:09:05.048122',2270,460,1196),('Nithya Senthil',5,'They did very good job for our son\'s birthday. Everything was as we expected. Thank you.\n\nWe opted decoration, popcorn, cotton candy, mehendi, face painting services from them. Everything was very good.','2026-03-28 17:09:12.737691',2271,461,1198),('Vijay Reddy',5,'Pasupathy sir decoration ideas are very innovative.  He understands the customer expectation very well and accurately in delivering his work. My family was happy with his work.','2026-03-28 17:09:12.741251',2272,461,1198),('Harish Kumar',5,'The decor was stunning and created the perfect atmosphere for the event. Everyone appreciated the setup. Great job by Mr. Pasupathy and his team for making it look so beautiful!”','2026-03-28 17:09:12.744846',2273,461,1198),('Thirumal Thiru',5,'The decoration team did an outstanding job for my daughter\'s 1st birthday celebration! Their professionalism, creativity, and attention to detail truly made the event special. The decorations were beautiful and exceeded our expectations. We highly recommend their services for anyone looking to make their party unforgettable!','2026-03-28 17:09:12.748835',2274,461,1198),('Mary Geetha',5,'Very Innovative and Creative decorations are done by SHREE DECORATIONS. I\'m viewing their Decorations for a very long time and now only had a perfect event( House Warming) to give them an opportunity..\nFully satisfied with their work.. Neatly done.. Reasonable charges.. They r so flexible to our taste and expectations..','2026-03-28 17:09:12.752890',2275,461,1198),('dedeepya ganta826',5,'Just got my nails done. Absolutely stunning ✨ She knows her stuff. Her work was meticulous and her advice was very helpful, the prices were reasonable as well . Definitely coming back here 😊','2026-03-28 17:09:19.952239',2276,462,1203),('Chandini suresh',5,'Sharmila mam came and she did an excellent job..completely satisfied of the service and design.. Thankyou Aadvi for this..','2026-03-28 17:09:19.956107',2277,462,1203),('KRITHIKA DURAI',5,'I have no idea or knowledge  about Mehandi &nail art here you can learn  more than the syllabus..\nmam actually explains  ever single single work in details...until we get to know the details an knowledge of the product an it is so easy to learn here','2026-03-28 17:09:19.959798',2278,462,1203),('Priya L',5,'Awesome mehendi work with so much of patience!!Have done beautiful mehendi at affordable price...they use only their organice henna cones for all their clients...best mehendi artist in Chennai.','2026-03-28 17:09:19.962806',2279,462,1203),('majidha saliha',5,'Unique artwork done here... here she use 100%organic henna cones that safe on skin....\nThank you Aadvi mehandi for making my wedding more beautiful with your artwork...','2026-03-28 17:09:19.966767',2280,462,1203),('Sunil Nayak',5,'Excellent work and colour. Thank you','2026-03-28 17:09:27.129110',2281,463,1207),('Pankaj Kumar',5,'I like all your mehndi art. I selected them for my sister\'s engagement. They are so responsible and make our events memorable. I have booked them again for my sister\'s wedding and I will book them for mine aswell Thank you so much...','2026-03-28 17:09:27.132123',2282,463,1207),('Suraj Chauhan',5,'Good service thanks bro...','2026-03-28 17:09:27.135046',2283,463,1207),('Jagdish shingh Nayak',5,'he was amazing. he came to my rescue last minute. And I was really impressed by her designs. Will definitely get in touch with her for all my future requirements.','2026-03-28 17:09:27.137776',2284,463,1207),('Aryan Nayak',5,'Good service thank you..','2026-03-28 17:09:27.140425',2285,463,1207),('Anand Vijai',5,'My wife had Mehandi today, they are quite faster & accurate in their designs. Excellent work from them','2026-03-28 17:09:35.720384',2286,464,1211),('anitha k',5,'Very good nice work','2026-03-28 17:09:35.723763',2287,464,1211),('Salome Ganesan',5,'It\'s very nice...And good bridle artist. quick fast designers.thanks to raj mehandi artist.','2026-03-28 17:09:35.726833',2288,464,1211),('Keerthana Baskar',5,'Very nice mehanthi art work done by ajay…','2026-03-28 17:09:35.729810',2289,464,1211),('Aarthi Dhanasekaran',5,'Awesome work very very good','2026-03-28 17:09:35.733911',2290,464,1211),('nikkeshh_',5,'Manoj Mehndi Artist Chennai is a highly respected name in the field of mehndi artistry, known for his exceptional creativity, precision, and dedication. Mehndi is an integral part of Indian culture, symbolizing joy, beauty, and new beginnings. Manoj understands the emotional value attached to this art form and treats every design as a masterpiece. His ability to blend tradition with modern aesthetics makes his work truly special. Over the years, he has gained immense popularity among brides and families who seek elegant and long-lasting mehndi designs for their important celebrations.','2026-03-28 17:09:39.277838',2291,465,1215),('Deepak Dr',5,'Manoj Mehndi Artist is truly amazing! His designs are beautiful, clean, and very detailed. He is professional, patient, and listens carefully to what you want. The mehndi color came out dark and long-lasting, and everyone loved the designs. He works quickly without compromising on quality. Highly recommended for weddings, festivals, and special occasions. Thank you, Manoj, for your excellent work!','2026-03-28 17:09:39.279815',2292,465,1215),('Rohit Soni',5,'Manoj\'s mehndi is truly beautiful! The intricate designs were exactly what I envisioned for my wedding. He was patient, skilled, and created stunning art. A wonderful experience in Tamil Nadu.','2026-03-28 17:09:39.281319',2293,465,1215),('Vishnu Patel',5,'Manoj\'s Mehndi is truly special! The designs were intricate, unique and lasted so long. Worth every penny for my bridal mehndi. He\'s a gifted artist in Tamil Nadu!','2026-03-28 17:09:39.282854',2294,465,1215),('Sunil Sungh',5,'Manoj created a beautiful, intricate design for my wedding. The color was rich and lasted long. Convenient home service in Tamil Nadu made it stress-free. Very pleased!','2026-03-28 17:09:39.284393',2295,465,1215),('kalaivani Palani',5,'I saw her contact from the website and  I have attended her Mehandi class (Basic & Advanced). Excellent Experience I gained. Her Teaching method is very friendly way. She trained so well and professionally. She is always motivating and Supporting Person.  I would recommend her for anyone who looking for Mehandi class. Thank You Anis for your great Support.','2026-03-28 17:09:46.325528',2296,466,1216),('chandini srinivasalu',5,'Anis mam,\nI had found Anis mam on Google just 3days before my engagement. Mam took up my order immediately without denying thanks a lot for that mam. And the work that mam had done was purely a magic. I had shared some theme for my engagement and mam exactly had replicated the same. Simply wonderful, worth for what you pay. Overall experience with Anis mam was great once again thank you so much for the mehandi work that you did mam.','2026-03-28 17:09:46.329021',2297,466,1216),('Jai Shree',5,'I booked mam for my engagement. She was very responsive also she replicated the design I gave her very well in a very short period of time. She was very friendly and patient throughout the process. I\'m very happy with her service.','2026-03-28 17:09:46.332912',2298,466,1216),('Suvarnamathy R',5,'She did Mehandi for my sisters wedding. The service was very professional and the same time very friendly. She listened to our requirement and delivered it perfectly. Would highly recommend her','2026-03-28 17:09:46.336135',2299,466,1216),('JESIMA YASMIN',5,'Professional Mehandi artist with knowledge on high level techniques and trendy designs to beautify your special occassion. Surely you will get fabulous work from her.\nUpcoming brides, please try her amazing art and get you hands fab on your special day... 😍','2026-03-28 17:09:46.339321',2300,466,1216),('Dhivya',1,'The Mehendi they use is not real Mehendi at all. It’s some chemical causing stains on hands and it became like a puss on my hands after few days causing allergic reactions. My hands were burning and itching after few days. The Mehendi is peeling like puss stickers after few days which is not real stains of Henna.','2026-03-28 17:09:54.366761',2301,467,1220),('Tarik Mohammad',5,'Nice mehandi artist very good design im very happy','2026-03-28 17:09:54.369965',2302,467,1220),('Vijay K',5,'This is excellent place and the artist was very excellent and expect in the Mehandi\nWe love a lot Thanks to him','2026-03-28 17:09:54.373061',2303,467,1220),('Babalu Nayak',5,'I book annad mehandi for my marriage. Me and my family are happy with annad\'s Mehandi Designs. I found him as a best mehndi artist of chennai.\nThank you, Anand ji🙏\nIf someone reading my review, I suggest you to Book him right Now to make your occasion special with his mehndi Designs\n2','2026-03-28 17:09:54.375582',2304,467,1220),('Pavithraa Sridharan',4,'Affordable and good stain too. Back side of hands they didn\'t do proper design to finish the work urgently that is the only drawback which I have faced otherwise it\'s fine to book them in affordable cost','2026-03-28 17:09:54.378496',2305,467,1220),('Satla Priyadharshini',5,'Hi this not only review but heartily words I recommend this mehendi artist -pavithra she is very good kind hearted person who never looks into the time for working or applying mehndi and  the client is very near or far she doesn\'t mind to visit the client without fail and iam of the person in her client list and iam very happy to see this kind of person is still on earth. Thank you Pavithra your designs was excellent and beautiful and iam veryy happy to recommend you to anyone.','2026-03-28 17:10:04.380782',2306,468,1224),('swetha sp',5,'Had a wonderful experience. She did an absolutely fabulous job. Her designs were beautiful and detailed . Color turned out rich and dark. Highly recommend her to anyone looking for a talented and dedicated mehendi artist!','2026-03-28 17:10:04.384657',2307,468,1224),('Supriyaa Hariharan',5,'Mrs.Pavithra was very sweet and humble. She was patient and design turned out so beautiful. Approved.','2026-03-28 17:10:04.388174',2308,468,1224),('Pavi Mani',5,'Verry verry beautiful ❤️ I like your mehendi....... So fantastic 😍','2026-03-28 17:10:04.391590',2309,468,1224),('Praveen N',5,'They have amazing designs.Designs are worth for the money we pay and giving a good friendly service.They are very flexible with timing..it\'s a pleasure to share this with you all','2026-03-28 17:10:04.394628',2310,468,1224),('Menaka Nagaraj',5,'Soundarya is an amazing mehandi artist.was such a pleasure of art she has done and she is a great communicator and a great women i have met and she gave me the henna of my wedding.highly appreciated her work and I will recommend her she is the best🥰♥️','2026-03-28 17:10:12.077976',2311,469,1228),('Hemavathi Selvaraj',5,'Absolutely loved the mehendi design! The detailing, neatness, and creativity were just perfect. Thank you for making the occasion extra special with your beautiful art.. Soundarya!!','2026-03-28 17:10:12.081250',2312,469,1228),('Logapriya M',5,'Nice work, She done a excellent job,perfect mehandi,Thank you for your service.','2026-03-28 17:10:12.084591',2313,469,1228),('V. Jayaprakash Jain',1,'he charge more  waste money and his work is very slow\ndont wast the money for this work\nvery high if you spoke with hour basis he work only one hand front and back with small bottom leg charges 2500','2026-03-28 17:10:12.087774',2314,469,1228),('suganya Siva',5,'Very good effort,nice henna,I like this henna,thank you for your service.','2026-03-28 17:10:12.090834',2315,469,1228),('krithika v',5,'I had a wonderful experience for my bridal mehndi. The artist was incredibly efficient, finishing much faster than anticipated without compromising on quality. The designs were intricate, and the final stain was deep and beautiful.','2026-03-28 17:10:15.166321',2316,470,1232),('vaishnavi R',5,'Choosing phoneix mehandi was the best decision. She made a unique design which perfectly came out very well and it’s very affordable also She was also very patient and friendly and professional throughout the entire process.','2026-03-28 17:10:15.170594',2317,470,1232),('Jaysri S',5,'I absolutely loved this makeup look! The blending was seamless, and the shades complemented my skin tone beautifully. The foundation gave me a flawless, natural finish without feeling heavy, and the eye makeup was detailed yet elegant. The lipstick tied the whole look together perfectly, adding just the right pop of color.\n\nThe overall finish was long-lasting, comfortable, and photographed really well. I felt confident and radiant the entire time. Definitely a makeup experience I’d recommend! 💄🌸','2026-03-28 17:10:15.173861',2318,470,1232),('Fathima',5,'Get the “ideal xerox stain of mehendi” design u wanted…. Especially at affordable COST…. Awesome work… Being a Mehendi lover have come across lottttt of artists but NONE LIKE U💕💕. 🥳 Extraordinary Archu.. U made my day❤️. Get ready to visit me regularly 😍..','2026-03-28 17:10:15.178100',2319,470,1232),('Srividhya Rajeshkumar',5,'I had the chance of having mehandi by Archana for a family function.  Though it was for a small family function, she took more patience and the output was very nice and it is a pure organic mehandi . Looking forward for more mehandi time with Archana and all the best wishes for Phoenix Mehandi Studio.','2026-03-28 17:10:15.180948',2320,470,1232),('Gayathri M',5,'I\'ve never seen such a perfectionist and detailed work... absolutely beautiful!\nThank you for being part of my special day and creating something so memorable.','2026-03-28 17:10:19.096917',2321,471,1233),('Muthulakshmi Murugan',5,'Absolutely loved the mehandi design! Very neat and beautiful work.The detailing was perfect and the stain came out really dark So happy with the mehandi. Clean, elegant and long-lasting.','2026-03-28 17:10:19.100147',2322,471,1233),('Logeshwari K',5,'Nice experience with Jareena henna girl....and I really loved her design\'s ✨','2026-03-28 17:10:19.103504',2323,471,1233),('Aparna Radhakrishnan',5,'I had her henna service for my sister in law\'s engagement, for my family and myself. Her henna designs were so amazing and she did her work with great love. And we all loved it very much. She\'s a passionate mehendi artist! I\'d recommend her service to anyone.','2026-03-28 17:10:19.106400',2324,471,1233),('Sangavi S',5,'Absolutely loved my bridal mehndi! The designs were stunning, intricate, and beautifully done. Every detail was perfect and the finishing was very clean. It added so much beauty to my Engagement look. Highly recommended!','2026-03-28 17:10:19.109956',2325,471,1233),('Poornima G K',5,'I actually booked her just before one day. But she came to my place and did an amazing job. Affordable price and quality output. She understood and applied the design as per my requirement. Very polite and friendly. 😊','2026-03-28 17:10:22.567984',2326,472,1234),('Nanmathi Veeramuthu',5,'I have availed the mehendi from Nasrin mam for my baby shower. The mehendi has come out as per my expectations. The artist was very punctual and professional throughout the time of putting mehendi. The quality of work is very nice and she was very fast in delivering the service. I will definitely be preferring her for future events in our family and her work will highly be recommended to my acquaintances. Thanks a lot for your efforts and time mam.\nThe cost of the service was very reasonable too.','2026-03-28 17:10:22.571340',2327,472,1234),('Jeni Dass',5,'Nasrin mehandhi art has done my bridal mehandhi so good actually I got my mehandi only day before my wedding time was very short but next day at my Muhurtham stain was awesome both on my legs and hands and designs were very clear stain also stayed for 1 week , especially mehandhi is organic I have sensitive skin but I did not get any rashes or allergy I booked my appointment only the day before at last minute but she did her work very well she is very friendly and punctual will book her again on my function days . Cost is also affordable , she is very talented and smart , my heart felt thanks to Afrin banu who has made my big day feel so much happy ❤️','2026-03-28 17:10:22.574961',2328,472,1234),('Priya N',5,'Such professional Mehndi work.\n🌸 “A perfect blend of skill and patience — your Mehndi art is clean,neat, elegant, and truly professional.”\nTrust worthy person 💯💗','2026-03-28 17:10:22.578236',2329,472,1234),('Jagdeeshwari JS',5,'All her designs are sooo clean and neat. Such a professional mehandi artist. The final output was amazing it turned out soo well and its more than my expectations ❤️🥰','2026-03-28 17:10:22.581293',2330,472,1234),('paventhan m',1,'Worst experience... Not at all recommended... Don\'t go... Doesn\'t know to put simple design also... Visit if you want to spoil your event mood and hands. Have booked for my brother engagement. I have added the reference design and what mehandi design he has put. Worst part is he justifies his work. Could have given zero stars ⭐ also but it\'s not available.','2026-03-28 17:10:28.716386',2331,473,1235),('M.S.MOHAMMED SHARUK',5,'Awesome mehendi art being done by shivam ji at an affordable price with lots of designs available. Do recommend him to others!','2026-03-28 17:10:28.720360',2332,473,1235),('sharmila devi',5,'Resonable price and nice designs. Best in chrompet pammal pallavaram','2026-03-28 17:10:28.724390',2333,473,1235),('Rajesh A',1,'Doesn\'t comes as promised and asks for extra money unnecessarily... neither me nor my frds will ever book him again','2026-03-28 17:10:28.728582',2334,473,1235),('Shani singh Rajpoot',5,'Natural mehandi very nice work','2026-03-28 17:10:28.732440',2335,473,1235),('Sweetie Swetha',5,'Jaffer Bro is One of The best mehandhi artist in chennai😍😍really i loved ur works🥰💯neat and perfection was really 👌 nice.','2026-03-28 17:10:39.063865',2336,474,1239),('Punima Kitchen',5,'Good work tnx for jaffar bro I\'m realy satisfied ❤️','2026-03-28 17:10:39.067149',2337,474,1239),('Fayaz Abdul',5,'Jaffar mehandi is one of the best Mehandi artist in my area tnx to @jaffar','2026-03-28 17:10:39.070342',2338,474,1239),('Zareen Creatives',5,'Very good mehendi artist at affordable price ranges, very friendly and professional😄','2026-03-28 17:10:39.073433',2339,474,1239),('Zahraz Creation',4,'Good work with neat finishing ❤️','2026-03-28 17:10:39.076588',2340,474,1239),('Subha V',5,'I had a wonderful experience with Asha sister. The mehandhi design was beautiful. She was professional, and I felt comfortable throughout the process. The stain came out rich and dark. Highly recommended for anyone looking for detailed and elegant mehandhi work.','2026-03-28 17:10:45.529102',2341,475,1243),('mithu prakash',5,'Had approached Asha for saree pre pleating and mehendi service.. she did a wonderful job on both. Saree prepleating was on dot and it literally took 2 mins to drape my saree during the event. When she had come for mehendi service she was so friendly and did a very neat job. Very much recommended for her service.','2026-03-28 17:10:45.532679',2342,475,1243),('Kaveri Ramachandran',5,'Good experience with Asha.... Mehandi designs and strains are very good.... Supportive with customers.... Pre pleating fixs me in exact position....\nThank you for your service....\nHereafter will book prepleating and mehandi with only Asha\'s.','2026-03-28 17:10:45.535470',2343,475,1243),('Vidya Arun Iyer',5,'I had an appointment with Asha Ramya a month back for a family function. She was prompt and patient and gave very good designs for both my hands and feet.\nI have allergic reactions with adulterated mehendi but Asha’s was great quality cos she makes it fresh without any additives.\nThe color was perfect. She gave intricate beautiful designs that lasted for over a week.\n\nWishing Asha all the best ! I will definitely use her services again.','2026-03-28 17:10:45.538831',2344,475,1243),('Vijay Ragavan',5,'Asha is so friendly to approach and did a great work.\nOver all happy with the service provided.\nAll the best for future works.','