n as per my suggestion. Really loved their service and I\'m completely satisfied with the quality of work.','2026-03-28 17:10:49.451330',2350,476,1247),('praveena giriprasad',5,'Very nice service, tanq so much fr such lovely designs 👍','2026-03-28 17:10:56.294750',2351,477,1248),('Nishi Sekar',5,'Very nice designs. I loved it. I wish to have u for further more functions.','2026-03-28 17:10:56.298254',2352,477,1248),('Kamalesh',5,'Recently, I got a \'Don\'t talk about it\'(IFYKYK)tattoo. It was really nice.','2026-03-28 17:10:56.301605',2353,477,1248),('Brammi Nivedhitha',5,'LOVED THE EXPERIENCE... The best artist I\'ve ever encountered.. even thinnest lines are easily drawn by her... ♥️♥️','2026-03-28 17:10:56.304084',2354,477,1248),('Vasu Bhavani',5,'Good work and design  worth of money\nSo sweet parson, ❤️❤️❤️❤️','2026-03-28 17:10:56.307287',2355,477,1248),('VENUPRASATH.M 21BCC069',5,'For my sister’s wedding we have booked sneha’s mehandi . Very creative and talented artist . For next baby shower we gonna book same artist with more innovative taught’s.','2026-03-28 17:11:09.064973',2356,479,1256),('Nakshatra .R',5,'I got my mehendi done from her and absolutely loved the designs!! She is very friendly and patient, and the detailing was beautiful','2026-03-28 17:11:09.069365',2357,479,1256),('Drishya Devakumar',5,'I think she’s got magic in her hands...Seriously, she made our day special...She was super friendly and I really appreciate her patience throughout...🌟❤️','2026-03-28 17:11:09.072592',2358,479,1256),('Sri Ramya',5,'Got mehandi from her and i showed a design and she did it exactly as in the pic, she is very friendly, very much satisfied with her work','2026-03-28 17:11:09.075289',2359,479,1256),('SOUNDARYA G',5,'Friendly mehandi artist. Fresh designs. Had really great experience on a big day.','2026-03-28 17:11:09.078559',2360,479,1256),('Simren Jayaraman',5,'Amazing service! Very beautiful designs, artist was very sweet and kind. She has a great story of s