mehandi designs Brindha recommended.','2026-03-28 17:11:22.829138',2366,481,1264),('Kee',5,'Had an amazing experience with Brindha- Mehendi artist! She is incredibly patient throughout the entire process and took great care in replicating the exact design I had in mind — down to the smallest details. Her dedication and steady hand truly impressed me.\n\nShe also provided helpful tips to ensure we get rich, long-lasting colour, and it made such a difference in the final outcome. Absolutely loved her professionalism, calm approach, and the beautiful result. Highly recommended! 🌿✨','2026-03-28 17:11:22.830764',2367,481,1264),('Annunc Alphonsa',5,'Loved the mehandi design she did. I had specific request and she was able to meet all my requests. Her own designs for others were also very beautiful. Would totally recommend her.','2026-03-28 17:11:22.832554',2368,481,1264),('Keerthu Vijay',5,'The mehndi design was absolutely beautiful and detailed—exactly what I wanted. The color turned out rich and dark, and it lasted for more than a week. The artist was professional, punctual, and made sure I was comfortable throughout. I highly recommend them for weddings.','2026-03-28 17:11:22.834043',2369,481,1264),('Subisha',5,'Brindha\'s mehendi skills were truly exceptional. As promised by her, the afternoon care balm helped darken the stain. I was very happy with my bridal mehendi.','2026-03-28 17:11:22.835711',2370,481,1264),('Bhuvana',5,'The mehendi design was absolutely beautiful and very neatly done. The artist was patient, professional, and paid great attention to detail. The stain color came out dark and long-lasting, and the overall experience was smooth and comfortable. Truly satisfied with the work—highly recommended','2026-03-28 17:11:25.883908',2371,482,1265),('geetha raj',5,'Your Mehadi models all most Fvt in my hands Murugan Vel symbol designs lovly happiest memories my life Deep Madam... Your website my  review 5 ⭐⭐⭐⭐⭐','2026-03-28 17:11:25.887323',2372,482,1265),('Sai Vaishnavi',5,'Your henna gave a prettiest stain dark, deep and full of warmth I couldn\'t stop admiring it😌','2026-03-28 17:11:25.890842',2373,482,1265),('SONALI R',5,'Mehendi was on point💯. Design was very unique and detailed 🫶. Thank you stain and shine for making mehendi as a beautiful memories.','2026-03-28 17:11:25.894183',2374,482,1265),('Dharani RT',5,'The stain that the mehandhi leaves is insane and also deepika who dress it also very kind and talented. I\'m going to book her for the next event also.','2026-03-28 17:11:25.897746',2375,482,1265),('Harini Prasanna',5,'I had the best mehandi experience with Ayeesha. She was present before time, quick n did her work to the best. Stop thinking n book this cutie for your big dayy!!!! cuz she’s gonna be our forever mehandi artist for all upcoming events 🫶🏻','2026-03-28 17:11:31.764410',2376,483,1266),('Mehaboob',5,'I had an absolutely amazing experience with Ayeesha for my Mehandi. The Traditional design was so neat and detailed. The service was very professional. Most importantly the stain color was very rich and last for 3 days. I highly recommend them to anyone looking for beautiful and high-quality mehandi.','2026-03-28 17:11:31.767930',2377,483,1266),('mariam taslima',5,'If you are in chennai I would definitely recommend her for attractive mehandi designs. She is extremely professional and punctual and has more patience too.Her home made organic cone is good and stain lasted long.Its not allergic and i recommended it to my friends.I had an amazing experience with you ayeesha, looking forward for your next work in my hands.','2026-03-28 17:11:31.771186',2378,483,1266),('Shafrin I',5,'This was my most favourite back hand design done by a super patient professional ayeesha , thank you so much for this wonderful work of you, i definitely recommend to all who is looking for super healthy organic mehndi and attractive designs for their hand suits for all occasions ...Once again thank you so much ayeesha ,im looking forward to have your work in my hand again ..!! 💗','2026-03-28 17:11:31.774633',2379,483,1266),('Asma Parveen.A',5,'I had a beautiful day with Ayesha sis, she is very kind and very patience artist, Am very happy for this beautiful deisgn whcih she made  for me i would  definitely suggest you people for who are searching for Professional mehandi artist\nEspecially the stain is amazing 🪄','2026-03-28 17:11:31.779265',2380,483,1266),('Mariyam',5,'Nice design\nThey provide beautifull floral bridal Not normal indian designs which is refreshing\nWe asked for siders very beautifuly done 😍 and very reasonable price','2026-03-28 17:11:35.985639',2381,484,1270),('Hussain PUBG TAMIL Hussain PUBG TAMIL',5,'Good quality henna and good service','2026-03-28 17:11:35.990243',2382,484,1270),('Musaddiqa Tahseen',5,'Nice design and perfect finishing','2026-03-28 17:11:35.997754',2383,484,1270),('Gayathri S',5,'I had my bridal Mehandi done by Akila from Mathi\'s Henna & Nail Art. She did a great job.\nI explained how I wanted the designs and she recreated them exactly how I wanted it.\nHad mehandi in both my hands and legs in just 4 hours - she was fast and accurate. And the price is very nominal, I heavily recommend Mathi\'s Henna & Nail Art 😁','2026-03-28 17:11:38.322048',2384,485,1271),('Saranya Subbiah',5,'My first proper mehendi experience and I chose the perfect one with my friend\'s referral. Everything was so perfect - the design,stain,her patience and professionalism. She managed it between the chaotic function environment. Lots of compliment to Mehendi and she is going to be the Go- To person for me from now on. Even my friends and relatives too. Thank you..','2026-03-28 17:11:38.325736',2385,485,1271),('Sasi',5,'I absolutely loved the mehendi and nail art! The designs were so neat, detailed, and elegant. The mehendi color came out beautifully, and the nail art added the perfect finishing touch😍. Truly impressed with her patience✨\nHighly recommended for anyone looking for stylish and classy work💖','2026-03-28 17:11:38.329521',2386,485,1271),('Swetha Thashini',5,'I had an amazing experience with Mathi mehendi artist for my bridal mehendi! Her work is absolutely beautiful and professional — she really brought my vision to life. The designs were intricate and stunning, and she was incredibly patient in accommodating all of my suggestions. The best part was that the price was very affordable, especially for the quality and attention to detail she provided. She also did the guest mehendi, and every single design was beautifully done. I received so many compliments from my guests! Highly recommend her for any event!','2026-03-28 17:11:38.334327',2387,485,1271),('Thanuja Chandramouli',5,'Mathi\'s henna ( Akila) has been my go to person for mehendi ! We got to know about her from instagram and booked her for my marriage in 2023. She is a thorough professional. The tariff is very nominal and she understands the wishes of the client and suggests designs that are wonderful. I loved the final look on my big day and even the guests loved the design. Following which I booked her again for my baby shower recently. She was very patient to adjust to my needs as I was not able to sit continuously. Can\'t wait to see the professional pictures. I\'d definitely recommend her for any occasion.\nNote : I recently got to know that she does nails as well and I\'m eager to try it out post pregnancy.','2026-03-28 17:11:38.337906',2388,485,1271),('Deepthi Balasubramanian',5,'Excellent work Jyothi. We had approached Jyothi couple of months back to do mehendi for an engagement in the family. She is so patient and dedicated to her art. She accepted to do it in such short notice and did a great job. We loved the end result and the mehendi lasted quite a number of days too. Thank you very much Jyothi. I know iam very late at posting the review. Keep up the great work. Thank you.','2026-03-28 17:11:47.316261',2389,486,1272),('Sahil Nair',5,'Excellent Experience. I am an animal lover and was looking for a cute, unique and a casual design pattern. The designer Jothi perfectly got the gist of it and drew these 2 cute patterns. I was also surprised to see that the designer makes her own mehendi which makes the product 100% organic. Will definitely visit again!!','2026-03-28 17:11:47.320082',2390,486,1272),('Picturesque Studio',5,'Recently i visited Tia mehendi art for my friend to put Mehandi for her shoots , i really happy with the output✨ the mehandi artist really did her job best first impressions is best..\n\nGuys you can book her for yours memorial day and she is using only organic cones for Mehendi so no more side effects.\n\nNambi vaanga Mehendi pottu sandhosama pongaa.😊','2026-03-28 17:11:47.324166',2391,486,1272),('Sivaranjani VV',5,'Very professional. She cares deeply about the outcome. Even when I insisted to go for a simple design because it was getting late in the night, she patiently completed the initial design I chose. I\'m very happy with how my mehendi turned out and definitely recommend her.','2026-03-28 17:11:47.328192',2392,486,1272),('Kumudha Reddy',5,'Excellent mehendi art done by Jyothi at tia mehendi......i love her intricate designs.....and she was very friendly.....she has amazing talent.....sure will visit again... overall it was great experience....... thank you so much Jyothi for beautiful design......my kids loved it','2026-03-28 17:11:47.332018',2393,486,1272),('Preethi Naidu',5,'Had booked Pavithra\'s Mehndi services for my engagement ceremony. The entire process was hassle free. Pavithra did a great job on both of my hands. She arrived promptly without any delay and was very quick with her work. She was very patient and made sure to explain the after care as well. Amazing service. Lovely person to work with. 😊 I 100% recommend MehndiByPavithra for anybody who is looking to get your hands and legs beautified. 💖','2026-03-28 17:11:50.593234',2394,487,1276),('Pavithra B',5,'Absolutely loved her work! She did a great job with my mehendi – the design was beautiful, neat, and detailed. It came out exactly how I wanted. Highly recommended!”','2026-03-28 17:11:50.596612',2395,487,1276),('Rekha P',5,'I had such a lovely experience with Pavithra. The designs were very clean and beautifully done, exactly the way I wanted. She was very professional, friendly and patient throughout the process, making me feel completely comfortable. I would definitely recommend her to anyone looking for a talented mehendi artist for bridal or any special occasion.','2026-03-28 17:11:50.599832',2396,487,1276),('Naga Rajan',5,'I had a wonderful experience with the mehendi service! The designs were absolutely beautiful, intricate, and exactly how I wanted them. The artist was very patient, professional, and worked with great attention to detail. The color turned out deep and rich. The overall experience was smooth, hygienic, and enjoyable — I’d definitely recommend their mehendi service to anyone looking for stunning and long-lasting designs! 🌿✨','2026-03-28 17:11:50.603019',2397,487,1276),('Cuteepie Doll',5,'I had a wonderful experience. The artist was very patient, creative, and quick. The mehndi design was stunning and the stain turned such a deep, beautiful colour. Truly impressed!','2026-03-28 17:11:50.606380',2398,487,1276),('Madhumitha B',5,'I\'ve booked Suganya mam for my baby shower function. I can say she\'s the best and very much professional in her work. Her experience speaks a lot in her work.\nI have suddenly wanted her to do guest mehandi also. She\'s done it with her utmost creativity.\nThank you so much mam! You\'ll be my first preference for upcoming happenings.','2026-03-28 17:11:54.240127',2399,488,1277),('Gayathri AK',5,'I loved the mehndi done by Suganya Ma\'am—it was very neat and professional. The stain came out beautifully bright, and the cost for the bridal mehndi was quite moderate and affordable. She replicated the exact design shown in the reference picture. Overall, I’m very happy with the service.','2026-03-28 17:11:54.243458',2400,488,1277),('kalpana subramani',5,'She came to the venue on time and completed the mehandi on time too.Totally loved the design and stain💯 All my family members,cousins and friends appreciated the design. Thanks to her for accommodating my special request and also for drawing the figures beautifully as requested. 100% satisfied👍🏼','2026-03-28 17:11:54.246754',2401,488,1277),('Shruthi Shreru',5,'I recently booked suganya mam for an engagement function.. She was very professional and gave clear instructions.. Very happy with her work..I would highly recommend her 🙂','2026-03-28 17:11:54.249690',2402,488,1277),('Lavanya Gummidipoondi Vijayakumar',5,'I booked suganya akka for my haldi guest mehandi and marriage bridal. She was very patient and professional. Everyone appreciated. Henna quality was so good and the henna stayed for long time. I would definitely book her in my upcoming events. Thank you so much.','2026-03-28 17:11:54.252675',2403,488,1277),('Keerthana S',5,'Such a kind hearted person and her works are mind-blowing.I booked with Mehendi for my baby shower function, and l am so happy with the experience ❤️ Everything was beautifully done,and  it truly made my special day even more memorable.  Highly recommend for anyone looking for quality and elegance on a budget.punctual, great designs and very affordable price . Thanks a lot 🥰','2026-03-28 17:11:58.199502',2404,489,1278),('Jebasta Rakesh',5,'I booked with Megandi for my baby shower function, and I’m so happy with the experience! ❤️ Everything was beautifully done, and it truly made my special day even more memorable. A big thank you to the sweet sister who handled everything with such care. I’m very much satisfied, and I must say it’s totally worth the money. Highly recommend for anyone looking for quality and elegance on a budget. 💯💐','2026-03-28 17:11:58.202632',2405,489,1278),('Indhuja Jawaharlal',5,'Superb with the work... 🥰 Really impressed with her work and kindness... Really lucky on the last minute to find her... 🤩','2026-03-28 17:11:58.205776',2406,489,1278),('Dr. Divya Balasubramanian',5,'She was just excellent and so pleasant. Very accommodating. Brought home made mehendi and rates are quite reasonable.\nDesigns were excellent and she really took care of the details while being fast . So happy to have found her!','2026-03-28 17:11:58.210164',2407,489,1278),('Varshinee Anandaraj',5,'We booked her for my baby shower event. She was very professional and quick in doing the work. The design was a super hit and we all enjoyed it. We would definitely be reaching out to her for our future requirements. Highly recommended!!!','2026-03-28 17:11:58.213312',2408,489,1278),('Vaishnavi Srinivasan',5,'Sameeen is a great artist. She’s creative and responsive to the needs of the clients. Her ability to customize designs on the fly is very impressive. Most importantly, she made us all comfortable right away and made it an enjoyable experience','2026-03-28 17:12:02.237900',2409,490,1279),('Rajeswari Gajjala',5,'Very friendly and affordable. I contacted her at my very last minute. Very responding. Quickresponse. Must suggested artist','2026-03-28 17:12:02.240614',2410,490,1279),('kaviya sekaran',5,'Her designs are elegant, unique, and perfectly done. The stain came out so beautifully. Will definitely book again for future functions','2026-03-28 17:12:02.243514',2411,490,1279),('Sana Mohammed',5,'I got my Mehendi done for Bakrid from Henna by Samreen, and I absolutely loved it! The design was beautiful, neat, and exactly what I wanted. I received so many compliments, and a few people even asked me where I got it done. Highly recommended for anyone looking for elegant and professional henna work!','2026-03-28 17:12:02.245919',2412,490,1279),('Mumtaj Riyas',5,'“Such a gorgeous mehndi design! The work is clean, creative, and perfectly applied.”😍🤍 satisfied ✅🤌','2026-03-28 17:12:02.249275',2413,490,1279),('Ramathilagam Chakaravarthi',5,'Felt sooo satisfied and happy about the outcome of! Booked Dhansika mehandi for both engagement and wedding! Mrs. Geetha was so friendly and comforting which most of the brides needs!!! Work is so professional and at reasonable price!!!','2026-03-28 17:12:10.466482',2414,491,1280),('joel ezekkiah',5,'Best place, artist was very polite and very talented. My wife really loved it here.','2026-03-28 17:12:10.469921',2415,491,1280),('Kripa unni',5,'I’m really satisfied with the Mehandi design. The detailing was beautiful, the design came out perfectly, and the service was smooth and professional. Truly a great experience','2026-03-28 17:12:10.473536',2416,491,1280),('Ashwathi Lakshminarayanan',5,'Geeta was very prompt, her designs were beautiful and she was very quick. She was able to exactly replicate the designs we chose and her work is extremely neat and skilled. Her charges are also very reasonable.','2026-03-28 17:12:10.476908',2417,491,1280),('Vembarasi Palrajkumar',5,'She has a very professional approach to her work. Her packages are reasonable and her work is amazing. She is good with her time management and has a very professional team of artists. All of our family members are happy...thank u....','2026-03-28 17:12:10.479844',2418,491,1280),('NAKUL Jaat',5,'Good','2026-03-28 17:12:17.800629',2419,492,1284),('Rohit Kumar',5,'Good','2026-03-28 17:12:17.804051',2420,492,1284),('Bhagban Singh',5,'Good','2026-03-28 17:12:17.807232',2421,492,1284),('Jagram Nishad',5,'Good','2026-03-28 17:12:17.810463',2422,492,1284),('Royal Nishad',5,'Good','2026-03-28 17:12:17.813866',2423,492,1284),('Janani Vivek',5,'Recently I got a chance to book Nethra and I feel that\'s the best decision I had made. She\'s such a dedicated artist and so much committed to her work. I really loved her patience and the way she approached the customer. She\'s so humble and friendly in nature. She made sure the customer is comfortable throughout the service. I really appreciate her time management. I loved the design and stain of the mehandi. Moreover the best part is it\'s affordable price.','2026-03-28 17:12:24.656209',2424,493,1288),('Rajendra',3,'Artist were professional, price too High. Still results are good. Can go if don\'t have better deal and option available.','2026-03-28 17:12:24.660389',2425,493,1288);
INSERT INTO `base_review` VALUES ('Nisha Senthil Babu',5,'If you\'re seeking a blend of artistry and passion, look no further than the talented hands of Nethra. I recently indulged in her mehendi magic, and oh, what an enchanting experience it was!\nBeing blessed with a darker complexion, I\'ve always fretted about how the mehendi stain would turn out. But behold, the results were beyond my wildest dreams! The rich hue, courtesy of her meticulously crafted paste, left me in awe.\nWhat truly sets Nethra apart is her unwavering dedication to perfection. Since our school days, I\'ve entrusted my hands solely to her artistic prowess, and each time, she exceeds all expectations. Her passion for her craft radiates through every stroke, leaving a trail of admiration in its wake.\nNot only does she possess a knack for intricate designs, but her warmth and friendliness elevate the entire experience. From start to finish, Nethra ensures her clients feel not just satisfied, but truly cherished.\nAnd let\'s talk about those aftercare tips – pure gold! Following her advice has worked wonders for maintaining the vibrancy of the stain, leaving my hands adorned with beauty for days on end.\nFor anyone in search of a mehendi maestro, look no further than Nethra. I wholeheartedly recommend paying a visit to her Instagram page and securing her services for your next occasion. Trust me, you won\'t be disappointed – you\'ll be spellbound.','2026-03-28 17:12:24.663916',2426,493,1288),('Sandhya Priyadarshini',5,'Recently booked Nethra and honestly I feel that\'s the best choice I made. Loved the stain. And have to appreciate Nethra for her patience throughout and how she pulled off the design I showed her.Overall, very satisfying experience 😊','2026-03-28 17:12:24.667486',2427,493,1288),('Shoba S R',5,'Nethra is an excellent professional mehandi artists. I told her the designs that I wanted and she patiently listened to me and gave me exactly what I wanted. The best part is the color of the mehandi as it gets darker on day 2 of application. I never expected the  depth of color on the upper portion and legs.\nShe charges reasonably and does her work  very efficiently.\nKudos to Nethra for her passion, dedication and hardwork 👏🏼👏🏼👏🏼','2026-03-28 17:12:24.670821',2428,493,1288),('Web Comic',5,'They have recreated the design very well and bhagya akka was very friendly 😊. She was patient and did the job very well. Me and family was very satisfied with her mehendi service','2026-03-28 17:12:31.829213',2429,494,1292),('KnJLo ozkiwi',5,'Wow! The talent of this beautiful woman. Thank you so much for your amazing artwork. Our designs look fantastic, and we enjoyed our time with you.','2026-03-28 17:12:31.832521',2430,494,1292),('Ashwini Parthiban',5,'Booked her at the last minute. One day before the wedding. Thanks to her. She stayed late nyt, patiently waited and finished d design I asked for. Very sweet person. I strongly recommend her.','2026-03-28 17:12:31.836196',2431,494,1292),('Smruti Srinivasan',5,'Let\'s just say Bhagyalakshmi was a godsend for us before our event of Ayushomam.\n\nWe had a few artists who bailed out on us last minute.. So we had to Google search and find someone near us in ECR near Neelankarai. Vicky Danu Mehendi Art was suggested. Next three days were packed muhurtham days and she was busy.. When we enquired at 8 in the night, she mentioned, that night was our only possibility to get it done.. We were two people who had hands front and back done. She came to our place around 9.30 pm, sat till 2 pm to help us with some amazing designs that we asked her for..\n\nSuch a down to earth woman and very professional.  Thanks for making our event memorable. 💚💚','2026-03-28 17:12:31.840640',2432,494,1292),('Skanda Kousalya Devathaa',5,'Bhagyalakshmi ma\'am was very professional, responsive on text, patient and friendly while doing the mehndi designs. She visited me in my house and made me sit comfortably before drawing on the designs, which was really kind of her. She is a pure artist at this, the designs turned out absolutely gorgeous. I\'d recommend her to anyone who wants to get their mehndi designs done. Thank you for the great experience ma\'am, it\'s beautiful.','2026-03-28 17:12:31.844400',2433,494,1292),('sulfiya banu',5,'You are the best mehendi artist I have ever seen. Your work always make others feel satisfied and happy🥰🥰fantastic work dear❣️❣️. keep going on! very talented henna artist...','2026-03-28 17:12:40.310080',2434,495,1296),('Dr. Ishrath Raihana',5,'She is a genuine artist with a lot of talent.... Makes everything with perfection....','2026-03-28 17:12:40.313131',2435,495,1296),('Baseer Baseer',5,'Good performance 👍','2026-03-28 17:12:40.316442',2436,495,1296),('Aishwarya Shetty',5,'It was such an amazing experience! The mehendi turned out to be absolutely beautiful, and the color was so rich and vibrant. They were extremely sweet, patient, and made me feel very comfortable throughout the process. I even customized my mehendi designs a little, and they were very open to my ideas the outcome was far better than I had expected. Thank you so much for your time, effort, and talent in making my big day even more special. Truly grateful!','2026-03-28 17:12:47.565718',2437,496,1300),('lakshmi priya',5,'Thanks Nila.. Loved your work❤️. Such a natural talent you are!\nListened to my needs patiently and you also provided inputs in improvising the design..punctual..\nI highly recommend you❣️','2026-03-28 17:12:47.568724',2438,496,1300),('archana swaminathan',5,'Extremely happy about how my design came out. Nilofar is extremely friendly as well as extremely professional. She says things clearly and also ensures that we are very comfortable. Her designs are so precise and thoughtful. I highly recommend her mehendi service. All the very best.','2026-03-28 17:12:47.571367',2439,496,1300),('Chithra Sankaran',5,'Awesome mehandi by Ayesha. Very patient and perfect mehandi. My go to person for mehandi from this. Thanks a lot Ayesha. You keep rocking','2026-03-28 17:12:47.574409',2440,496,1300),('Hemaprabha Krishnan',5,'Natural Healthy Homemade Organic Mehandi.. Creative designs..  Amazing Artist.. Value for money.. Wonderfully done by Aysha..','2026-03-28 17:12:47.577041',2441,496,1300),('Siva Ranjani',5,'I had experience with ilahi mehandi specialist! The design and finishing fabulous with friendly behaviour. Mam is very punctual and provided timely service. They used high- quality products. I loved the training and the great offers they had. I highly recommend institute.','2026-03-28 17:12:50.945370',2442,497,1301),('kalaiarasi kalai',5,'Hi...I have completed my advanced mehendi course here..Such a good place to learn and grow in mehendi industry..The tutor is very friendly and she gives you full knowledge about bridal mehendi..I would highly recommend this training place for future mehendi artist','2026-03-28 17:12:50.949214',2443,497,1301),('Rakesh Nissi',5,'I booked Ilahi Mehandi for my sister’s function and they did an amazing job! The designs were absolutely beautiful, intricate, and exactly what we wanted. They are truly the best mehandi artist in Chennai, especially around Pallikaranai. The cones they use are skin-friendly, and the colour came out rich and dark within hours. Professional, punctual, and very friendly — they made the whole experience memorable. Highly recommend them for bridal mehandi, engagement, and festive occasions in Chennai!','2026-03-28 17:12:50.952836',2444,497,1301),('John Wilson',5,'I\'ve recently booked Ilahi Mehandi Services for my cousin\'s wedding- Really a pleasant designs, wonderful talent, and very budget friendly. They even give training also, 2 of my friends are about to join there. Thank you Very much Nandini for the best and Beautiful Service.👏🏼🤍','2026-03-28 17:12:50.957763',2445,497,1301),('rekha arunachalam',5,'Booked Nandhini from Ilahi Mehandi for a special occasion, and she did an amazing job! The designs were neat, detailed, and exactly how I wanted. She is truly the best mehandi artist around Medavakkam, Pallikaranai, Velachery, and Kovilambakkam area. Highly recommend her for any function or bridal mehandi.','2026-03-28 17:12:50.961453',2446,497,1301),('Surubhi R',5,'Sherly akka was friendly & professional at the same time. Loved the Mehandi designs. I kept on changing the theme for mehandi but she was flexible and did it as I asked. Thank you Akka.','2026-03-28 17:12:55.739189',2447,498,1302),('Priya Dharshini',5,'Sherly mam  mehandi designs are stunning! 😍 The intricate details and patterns are amazing. She did an incredible job, loved it! 💖\"','2026-03-28 17:12:55.741935',2448,498,1302),('suganya s',5,'I had approached Sherley for my baby shower event and I really loved her work. She is truly an artist. She understood my requirement and gave a perfect output. I was looking for a simple and elegant mehandi design and Sherley made it exactly the way I wanted. She was extremely professional. She also ensured to give me some tips. The best part is she doesn\'t use some random mehandi product, instead she uses her own homemade mehandi cone which is totally safe even during pregnancy. Thank you Sherley for the lovely work ❤️','2026-03-28 17:12:55.745139',2449,498,1302),('Rajarajeshwari V',5,'I got my mehendi done by Sherly for my friend’s wedding, and I absolutely loved her work. The designs were so intricate and beautifully done, with perfect detailing. She was very patient and made sure the design matched exactly what I wanted. The stain came out really dark. Truly a wonderful experience – highly recommend her!','2026-03-28 17:12:55.748397',2450,498,1302),('Sai J',5,'Thanks u Sherly for making our day so special Loved how professional you were and really appreciated that u didn’t ask for any personal info super respectful. The mehndi was done right on time and the result was awesome. U brought ur own pillow, lime, sugar syrup, a cup, and even a cloth everything that needed u didn’t ask for anything from us. Despite having other commitments u changed ur schedule just to accommodate me.Can’t wait to work with you again.tbank u so much ma and the stain was awesome','2026-03-28 17:12:55.751831',2451,498,1302),('Billu Chacha',5,'Very nice work and very telent artist super mehandi artist','2026-03-28 17:13:03.844259',2452,499,1303),('Madhu mathi P',5,'Very satisfied with their work. We do mehandi to him for all my family functions. I recommend my frnds too. Very talented person and sincere with their work. Thankyou for the design. So many people like their work. All the best 👍','2026-03-28 17:13:03.847438',2453,499,1303),('Arun Kumar',5,'These are Rajasthani mehndi artists, they provide very good service and apply good designs, they also provide home service for wedding and engagement, so come to them and get good mehndi applied at very low cost.','2026-03-28 17:13:03.850681',2454,499,1303),('Abhishek Rr',5,'People here are very skilled in me mehandi art and they have the unique design in the city do try','2026-03-28 17:13:03.853896',2455,499,1303),('Yagnesh Mehandi Artist',5,'Nice work bro','2026-03-28 17:13:03.857206',2456,499,1303),('Krithiga G',5,'Ms. Yuvasree did a fantastic job with my baby shower mehendi! She was patient, quick, and customized the design exactly to my liking. The mehendi turned out beautifully and received lots of compliments from our guests. I’m very happy with the outcome and truly appreciated her skill and professionalism.','2026-03-28 17:13:06.799326',2457,500,1307),('Sangeetha SathishRaja',5,'Mam, I am fully satisfied with your dedicated work......especially mehandi was very nice......I am very much impressed with your excellent work at affordable price..... especially your time keep up is really ossom.....keep rock mam...','2026-03-28 17:13:06.802965',2458,500,1307),('Zakkiya gulam',5,'The designs were so neat, elegant and beautifully done. She was very patient and creative. Highly recommend her for anyone looking for professional and stunning mehndi work. ✨','2026-03-28 17:13:06.805828',2459,500,1307),('Viswalinga Surya S',5,'We had a wonderful experience with Ms. Yuva Sree! She\'s incredibly soft-spoken, patient, and cooperative, which made our entire experience so enjoyable. From the beginning, she listened carefully to what my wife wanted, making sure every detail was exactly as I had envisioned. Her designs were intricate and beautifully executed, with every line and pattern looking flawless. She also maintained a warm and calm atmosphere throughout, which made the whole session relaxing and memorable. We\'re so grateful for her amazing work and highly recommend her to anyone looking for a skilled and kind Mehandi artist!','2026-03-28 17:13:06.807765',2460,500,1307),('Beni Rajaht',5,'I\'m fully satisfied with your makeup work and mehandi design..... My daughter, sister and sister in law was fully satisfied with your mehandi work... dedicated person.... Thank you for full filling my daughter function 🙏','2026-03-28 17:13:06.810518',2461,500,1307),('Ancy Sherin',5,'Mehendi was so pretty😻\nThey did it with so much patience and their work is so amazing. I would totally recommend them ✨','2026-03-28 17:13:11.729103',2462,501,1308),('Shri P',5,'I had my second baby shower mehendi done with them and fully satisfied with every single detail she added. Special thanks to her patience in making small changes in all parts of mehandi compared to what i shared initially with her. She also came up with more better ideas which added charm to what it was already.\nTrust and go with the flow. She does everything pretty.','2026-03-28 17:13:11.732233',2463,501,1308),('Bhuvaneswari Baskaran',5,'Thank you so much Mam. From booking till the end of service the way you communicated and the care you showed was amazing.Your work was very good and it was done with so much detail and care.\nSpecial Thanks from my daughter for making the design she requested.','2026-03-28 17:13:11.735636',2464,501,1308),('Gomathi Kamalam',5,'We are happy and satisfied with your work mam😍.. Loved your patience and dedication  towards your work mam!🥰 We are very excited to book you for the upcoming functions.🥳. You made the engagement function more special with your beautiful work.. And the engagement tray decorations are as expected and customised by us💯.. I m very satisfied with your beautiful work..and it\'s worth for the money paid☺Lots of love to you mam😍❤❤❤','2026-03-28 17:13:11.739672',2465,501,1308),('Pravallika Dhileep',5,'My journey with Ms.Kanimozhi started when I got my Mehandi done by her for my engagement. Her work is absolutely beautiful, so intricate and clean. I was so impressed by her work, her dedication, and the passion. She is such a cool and inspiring person. You instantly feel comfortable around her.\nThat one experience was enough for me to decide that I wanted to learn Mehandi from her. Even though I’m from another city, I chose to stay in Chennai just to learn Mehandi from her. I love her teaching skill’s. She shares all her tips and tricks with so much love. I feel truly lucky to have found her! ❤️','2026-03-28 17:13:11.742479',2466,501,1308),('Raja Rajeswari K',5,'Really good and professional work done for my bridal and guest mehendi!\nAll the designs were very pretty and she did it with complete perfection!','2026-03-28 17:13:15.059960',2467,502,1309),('vishali gopinathan',5,'Hi all. I really had great work from akka. The mehndi looked so good. The stains remained for whole week. Got good pictures of them.','2026-03-28 17:13:15.063290',2468,502,1309),('abhinaya r',5,'Hi\n\nThanks a lot for your lovely service.\nShe\'s highly professional, easy to approach, punctual and very patient. Thanks again for making my day','2026-03-28 17:13:15.066486',2469,502,1309),('Nithish Kumar',5,'I did my babyshower design with her 🥰 she is expert in handling all the designs as per customer suggestion. Also the design was unique with the theme concept and no repeated designs. Thank you so much for your patience towards me bcoz I couldn\'t sit for long at one place even though she managed time n so friendly 🥳 I am fully satisfied and felt happy working with her. Strongly I recommend her 💐 Much impressed ✨','2026-03-28 17:13:15.069890',2470,502,1309),('Sangeetha Krishna moorthy',5,'Beautiful work at reasonable price. I was very much satisfied with her work. It was more that what I expected. Mehendi stain was very good.The hardwork you putup on this and the designs were really amazing and unique. keep going on !!! I hope you reach more heights. the future awaits a lot for you!! Keep rocking sis 💪🏻','2026-03-28 17:13:15.074393',2471,502,1309),('Madhubala R',5,'I had a very wonderful experience attending the Mehendi class at Maanya Meganthi Academy with Venni mam. She is very kind, friendly, and teaches with a lot of patience. Her teaching style is very clear, easy to understand, and she makes the class very jolly and comfortable.\n\nShe gives very good attention while teaching and makes sure we understand each step properly. I learned many beautiful designs and techniques and gained confidence in doing Mehendi.\n\nI am also sharing my Mehendi practice work and the final result after practice. I’m very happy to see my improvement.\n\nThank you so much, Venni mam, for your kindness, support, and wonderful teaching. I truly enjoyed learning with Venni mam.','2026-03-28 17:13:19.147947',2472,503,1310),('nandhu choo sweet',5,'I booked mehendi artist Veni, for my family function. Her work was neat and the designs looked beautiful and unique. She was very patient which is one of the important quality of a mehendi artist. You can blindly go ahead and book her for your functions.','2026-03-28 17:13:19.150151',2473,503,1310),('Rajendran Ramaswamy',5,'Mrs. Veni did an amazing job with my mehendi! The designs were elegant, intricate, and exactly what I had imagined. The color came out rich and dark, which lasted beautifully through all my events. She was extremely patient and took the time to understand my preferences, making the whole experience relaxing and joyful. Her professional attitude and attention to detail really set her apart. I would definitely recommend Mrs. Veni to anyone looking for a skilled and talented mehendi artist!\"','2026-03-28 17:13:19.152307',2474,503,1310),('Nakul Mahendran',5,'I loved the mehendi designs that she did for my daughter. She did the mehendi very fast and neatly. Highly recommend. Her homemade mehendi was high quality. Smell of the mehendi also too natural.','2026-03-28 17:13:19.154675',2475,503,1310),('Santhoshi Ramamurthy',5,'Excellent mehandi . Custom done for our requirements with reasonable price. I had my mehandi done for baby shower Veni is highly professional and did it on time. We had requested for 2 more people without prior notice but she happily accepted without hesitation. I highly recommend. At home service also available','2026-03-28 17:13:19.157943',2476,503,1310),('Thamizh',5,'She did an amazing job with my mehndi! The design came out perfect and the color was so dark. She’s super friendly and made me feel comfortable throughout❤️🫂','2026-03-28 17:13:26.409137',2477,504,1311),('Nithya sri G music',5,'\"Very talented and hardworking mehndi artist! Proud of my sister’s journey and the passion she puts into every design and every student. Wishing her more and more success.\" congrats sis🥳🥳✨️✨️✨️','2026-03-28 17:13:26.412275',2478,504,1311),('Latha Latha',5,'Hi all,\n\nFor my brother\'s wedding I was searching on online for mehandi services.\n\nI had got Lakshitha Mehndi Art at padiyanallur.\n\nWe had got awesome service and art from her.\nAffordable and small small work was very excellent.\n\nMe and my kutti daughter hands was turned into magic with her art.\n\nGreat work keep it up!!!\n\nRegards,\nLatha Senthil','2026-03-28 17:13:26.415488',2479,504,1311),('Sekar',4,'Thank you so much akka i like your design keep it up and growth your job I\'m satisfied your designed art Lovely sister 🤗🤝☺️💗','2026-03-28 17:13:26.418627',2480,504,1311),('Gbtb Y yb',5,'Thank you so much lakshitha sister 💕  amazing job  good designs keep it up .really satisfied with ur design and service 💕','2026-03-28 17:13:26.421615',2481,504,1311),('Nandhika',5,'I’m so happy with my mehendi! The design is neat, detailed, and beautifully balanced. You can really see the effort and skill in every pattern. The color developed amazingly well too. Thank you for making the experience so special — truly wonderful work!','2026-03-28 17:13:29.512061',2482,505,1315),('San Thanam',5,'Great experience. She did an amazing job for our family, so patient and friendly nature. Beautiful design outcomes. Highly Recommended!','2026-03-28 17:13:29.515450',2483,505,1315),('Soniya',5,'I’m so happy to share our amazing experience with the mehendi artist who made my sister’s engagement so special and memorable! 💚 From the very beginning, her work truly stood out. She was so calm, friendly, and professional. The bride’s mehendi came out absolutely stunning – every little detail was beautifully done, and the design looked perfect on her hands and feet. The stain turned out super dark and rich, just the way we had hoped! 🧡🖤 Not just the bride, even all the bridesmaids were extremely happy with their mehendi! Each one of us got different designs, and she did every single one with so much patience and care. Her speed, neatness, and creativity were really impressive. 👩‍🎨✨ She was on time, well-prepared, and made everyone feel comfortable. The entire session was filled with laughter, bonding, and beautiful mehendi moments. 🌸 We received so many compliments at the event – everyone kept asking about the artist! Thank you so much for adding beauty and joy to my sister’s engagement. You made the bride and all her bridesmaids feel truly special. 💖 If you\'re searching for a talented and professional mehendi artist, don’t think twice – she’s the best! Highly recommended! 🌟🙏','2026-03-28 17:13:29.520065',2484,505,1315),('Meenakshi Natarajan',5,'Highly recommended!\nAll the designs were so great and precise. It almost looked like it was a system generated image. It was that precise and beautiful. Both the hands looked even. We all liked it.\n\nShe patiently finished the mehandi for all, eventhough it was late. Thank you ka!','2026-03-28 17:13:29.530041',2485,505,1315),('Varuna Sunil kumar',5,'She did such a beautiful job with my mehndi! Very sweet and calm person, and her designs are neat and detailed. Super happy with how it turned out. Highly recommend her!','2026-03-28 17:13:29.541803',2486,505,1315),('D V',5,'I have learnt basic mehandhi from Sanskara Mehandhi art MRs. Aarthi. I should admit the fact that I didn\'t know anything about Mehandhi art when i started learning. Surprisingly at the end of the course I was able to do my own mehandhi design.\nShe was very patient while taking the class and she could even adjust her class timings for me despite her busy schedule. I would definitely recommend her for Learning mehandhi as I could see her passion in Mehandhi and it\'s intricacies.  Thanks Aarthi for your great help.','2026-03-28 17:13:35.778724',2487,506,1316),('Prabha Vathy',5,'It\'s was wounderful pleasure  to learn mehandi with Arthi (Sanskara Mehandi Art)  . She is a very good teacher . Her way of teaching is very clear and unique  . I am very much happy  with her while learning . If we have any doubt She will clear immediately .\n\nI am totally very very happy and successfully completed the course .','2026-03-28 17:13:35.781837',2488,506,1316),('Jayashree Venkatasubramanian',5,'Best service even for last minute booking. Thanks for your service Arthi.','2026-03-28 17:13:35.785279',2489,506,1316),('Ragul K',5,'I book sanskara mehendhi for my sister\'s wedding. I absolutely love this bridal. Ever since I discovered sanskara mehendhi, I had to have her as my artist! Her work is perfection, and she did not disappoint. Not only is her work beyond beautiful, her personality and professionalism is unmatched. sanskara aftercare instructions are also very easy to follow and doing so my color was so very dark! 100% recommend.','2026-03-28 17:13:35.789199',2490,506,1316),('Fathima Nisha',5,'When I was searching for Mehendi Classes in and around Pallikaranai, this one caught my attention. I was really curious as to how the classes would be. I was really touched by the way i was recieved. Arthi is so dedicated to her profession that she teaches only one person at a time. By that way, the learner gets the full attention of the teacher.She makes you learn and practice what you are taught. Even after the regular classes are over, Arthi will always be in touch with you, helping you in every step that you take to master the skill.\n\nAnother big thing that i feel makes her unique is the way that she looks at the art. She has really good principles such as using only natural mehendi and regular checks on the client before and after her bridal design is done. She not only does teaches you ways to make mehendi but also ways to keep your client comfortable during the time you need to design.','2026-03-28 17:13:35.792786',2491,506,1316),('Hema N',5,'I had an amazing experience with joy mam Her designs were so intricate and beautiful, and she made sure every detail was perfect. The mehendi color came out so rich and dark, and I got so many compliments! She was very professional, patient, and so easy to work with. I’m so happy I chose her and would highly recommend her to anyone looking for a talented mehendi artist.','2026-03-28 17:13:43.388968',2492,507,1317),('Aishwarya Muthukumar',5,'My daughter had very good experience with joy Mam for her puberty function the mehandi came  out so amazing that everyone was asking about the person ,especially my daughter wanted a very customised mehendi and Mam was sibling and polite with her and listened to her of each and every small custozation the final mehendi turned out very awesome thank you so much Mam for your work very appreciable👏🏻👏🏻👏🏻','2026-03-28 17:13:43.391925',2493,507,1317),('Smrithi Ganesh',5,'I was very happy with the service from Joyce! She was extremely patient and detail-oriented which was clearly seen in how well she executed the intricate henna designs that I chose. The quality of the henna used was also excellent as it gave a nice, dark shade after taking it off.\n\nOverall, a great experience with very reasonable prices and I can definitely recommend her services!','2026-03-28 17:13:43.394632',2494,507,1317),('Sarada Ganesh',5,'Had a wonderful mehendi experience for my engagement!! Ma\'am was soo patient and brought out the design so perfectly and her mehendi art work is truly outstanding!! Highly recommended and I would be booking ma\'am for mehendi for all my future functions!!','2026-03-28 17:13:43.397226',2495,507,1317),('Ranjitha Parivallal',5,'This was my first day stain..I loved it very much❤️😍Very experienced and professional mehandhi artist. She is very elegant, friendly and the mehandhi design was very super for my occasion. I Have booked her twice and grateful to have customized artist😍','2026-03-28 17:13:43.400271',2496,507,1317),('Faaiza Hameed',5,'I had my engagement mehendi done here and it was an amazing experience. The artist was very patient and detailed with the design. The mehendi color came out very dark and perfect. Thank you for making my special day even more beautiful!','2026-03-28 17:13:46.921807',2497,508,1321),('Srimathi',5,'I got my mehndi done by them for my wedding. The stain was beautiful, the design was amazing, and everything was absolutely perfect.','2026-03-28 17:13:46.923334',2498,508,1321),('rani murali',5,'Absolutely loved my mehendi experience! I was looking for a talented mehandi artist for a recent family function, and I\'m so glad I found Sivasankari Mehandi Artist & Saree Draping\n\nFrom the initial consultation to the final design, everything was perfect. They were incredibly  friendly and filled with positive energy, which made the whole process so enjoyable. I felt comfortable and relaxed, and they truly listened to my preferences.\n\nThe mehandi design was absolutely stunning! The intricate details and precision were remarkable. I received so many compliments on my bridal mehandi. The colorwas rich and dark, just as I wanted.\n\nIf you\'re looking for a professional mehandi artist who delivers beautiful mehandi, unique designs, and a wonderful experience, look no further! I highly recommend Sivasankari Mehandi Artist & Saree Draping for any occasion. They are truly the best! Their mehandi rates were also very reasonable for the quality of work.\n\nThe saree pre-pleating was flawless. They expertly pleated my Kanjivaram silk saree, creating a stunning and elegant look. The saree stayed in place throughout the entire event. They were also very knowledgeable about different draping styles and helped me choose the one that best suited my saree and body type.','2026-03-28 17:13:46.924827',2499,508,1321),('amutha. k',5,'She has done an amazing job, exactly the way I expected. Her designs were beautiful, neat, and so detailed. What truly stood out was her patience — she worked with utmost care from start to finish and made the whole experience so comfortable. I’m extremely happy with her work and would highly recommend her to anyone looking for a skilled and dedicated mehendi artist!','2026-03-28 17:13:46.926324',2500,508,1321),('shalini shalz',5,'I would like to start with the way she communicates and interacts. She sounded so good and explained me the rates for each designs, also recommend me that which would save the cost. Her hands definitely had a magic, she mentioned that it was purely her own practice those art were not taught from my any Mehandi classes. I could see her dedication when she was doing Mehandi, not distracted just doing her job, though I was so tired and wasn’t able to sit in a Same place I kept moving around, she just ensured that u was comfortable and fine to continue. I definitely will recommend everyone to get Mehandi from her. Also u wanna talk about the Mehandi she made on her own, it got super stained and I loved it. Best of luck Sivasankari akka you are doing a great job, 👏🏻 continue the same super work ✨','2026-03-28 17:13:46.927862',2501,508,1321),('Ashwitha S',5,'Got my hand mehendi done by a very talented artist at a budget-friendly price\nThe design was neat, detailed, and exactly how I wanted.\nVery patient, professional, and used good quality mehendi with nice dark stain.\nIf you are looking for a good mehendi artist at reasonable cost, highly recommended','2026-03-28 17:13:53.448622',2502,509,1322),('Bhanupriya Satishkumar',4,'I chose Raj mehendi in Instagram, called and booked appointment and made advance payment. but I was little worried how the outcome would be.I kept asking the mehendi artist person after finishing my one hand design. He guaranteed 100%.  The person came and did a very good job, the outcome was excellent. In my life time very first time the mehendi colour came out really dark was looking too good. I would highly recommend this person to my family and friends too for all family occasions. Thank you so much for the wonderful work bro.','2026-03-28 17:13:53.451865',2503,509,1322),('Pavi Nila',5,'Very professional and friendly artist work was very nice personally I loved it ...must try','2026-03-28 17:13:53.455239',2504,509,1322),('GAYATHRI N',5,'Raj Mehandi and tattoo studio best one, customised design and ideas for mehandhi and tattoos.','2026-03-28 17:13:53.458304',2505,509,1322),('Vaibhav Kabra',1,'On call, specified a price. On reaching the place, the called person wasn\'t available, and other person quoted 5x. Crazy.\nOriginally called person also now said \"go somewhere else or pay 5x.\nAvoid, if possible.','2026-03-28 17:13:53.461719',2506,509,1322),('Janani Ramaswamy',5,'I had booked Nive and team for both my engagement and wedding mehendi. Must say that it was an absolute pleasure getting my mehendi done by her. I can\'t even imagine someone doing these complicated designs on my hand with such finness and perfection. I was mind blown looking at the designs and the final outcome!\n\nWhile bridal mehendi could be mastered at this level, what amazed me further was the meticulous effort put in even for the guests\' mehendi. I had around 10 guest mehendi and every single woman left my place immensely happy with the final mehendi outcome!\n\nThank you Nive for the wonderful experience! I received a lot of compliments from all around just for the mehendi at my wedding! Will keep booking you for all my future events and will keep recommending you to all my relatives/friends! :)','2026-03-28 17:13:56.797503',2507,510,1326),('Keerthu BK',5,'Last Tuesday, I had the pleasure of having my engagement henna done by Nive and Grace. My henna was done by two stunning, creative and humble henna artists who went above and beyond to do my henna the way I wanted it. I was nervous to get my henna done four days before the event, but the henna stain on my hands and legs looked beautiful for the entire week. I\'m really thankful and grateful for coming in and outdoing themselves. Absolutely loved their work and I\'m excited to have them do my wedding henna. Love your work and you both! God bless!','2026-03-28 17:13:56.800808',2508,510,1326),('vaishnavi arasu',5,'Her mehendi designs were beautiful, detailed, and exactly what I wanted. She was professional, friendly, and the stain turned out rich and dark. Highly recommend her for any special occasion!','2026-03-28 17:13:56.804146',2509,510,1326),('Yamini Ayyanar',5,'I booked a mehandi artist from Lakshmi Henna Art, just before the event day. I asked for a little intricate work for me and 2 of my friends. The output was outstanding and was perfect. They also charge a very resonable amount. They charge as low as Rs 150 for one side, which was resonable. The cost might differ based on the design, but it is definitely worth the work. I highly recommend Lakshmi Henna Art, and I will definitely be booking for all my upcoming events.','2026-03-28 17:13:56.807480',2510,510,1326),('Jayanthi Mani',5,'We had the pleasure of having Nivedha from the Lakshmi Henna Art team for our family function, and she did a fantastic job! Design was beautifully done and exactly what we had hoped for. Her attention to detail, speed, and creativity truly stood out. Not just her work, but her calm nature made the whole experience even better. Thank you!','2026-03-28 17:13:56.811300',2511,510,1326),('samyuktha arunselvanayagam',5,'I had a wonderful experience with this mehndi artist. The design was very neat, detailed, and beautifully done. She was patient, professional, and made sure both hands were perfectly designed. I’m very happy with the result. Highly recommended for special occasions like baby showers and weddings!','2026-03-28 17:14:02.148939',2512,511,1327),('Keerthana Prakash',5,'I booked Raji for my baby shower mehandi at the last minute. I also shared few designs which I liked. She neatly did all those designs perfectly and the output was really good. She also suggested some designs. Everyone appreciated the mehendi. The stain achieved was also good. As she said the stain became darker after 1 full day. She was patient to do the design even though it was getting late.','2026-03-28 17:14:02.152050',2513,511,1327),('Vasumathi Velmurugan',5,'I had a very good experience with charming Mehandi. I had to call her at the last moment for my cousin’s wedding. She accepted and came after all her scheduled appointments were completed even though it was 9pm. She patiently did it for four of us. Though it was nearing midnight, she made sure we liked the designs . The cost was also very reasonable. I would definitely recommend this place for any occasion.','2026-03-28 17:14:02.155342',2514,511,1327),('KANI KANI',5,'Your mehandi application is amazing! The design is so neat and clean.\nThe peacock design you did is gorgeous! The colors are vibrant and the details are incredible.','2026-03-28 17:14:02.158531',2515,511,1327),('Sathiya priya',4,'Raji was an excellent mehendi artist and she is good in what she is doing.I had called her in a last minute yet she did well and made my day.. Thankyou so much Raji♥️','2026-03-28 17:14:02.161576',2516,511,1327),('Raju (R.) Sathish',5,'She did an amazing home service for my wife and daughter. She was punctual and very professional at her work. Would highly recommend her for Mehendi.','2026-03-28 17:14:09.324281',2517,512,1328),('Yamuna Selvarajan',5,'Sara is a great trainer who makes learning easy. She is kind, friendly, and always ready to help with any questions. Her work is very organized, and her teaching style is excellent. Iam happy to have her as my teacher!\"','2026-03-28 17:14:09.327598',2518,512,1328),('Hajira Nissa',5,'The class was helpful taking care individual attention. Mam taught all the designs step by step.. especially her patience with me🙏 I also taken mixology class for two days with ultimate cone fillings❤️','2026-03-28 17:14:09.330645',2519,512,1328),('nancy acs',5,'I learned Mehendi one month online class at Sara Institute. Even though I didn’t know anything at first, they taught me everything clearly from basic to advanced. Not only that, they explained even the smallest details very neatly, step by step.\n\nIt helped me take this up as my side income. They also taught me how to do marketing, how to talk to customers, and how to get leads. I gained a lot of experience from them.\n\nSo, thanks to Sara Institute!','2026-03-28 17:14:09.333843',2520,512,1328),('Rashmi Balakrishnan',5,'I requested Rajshree for mehandi for my girls party. She was amazing. She put designes which were so intricate and so fast and neatly. Me and my friends loved this experience. Thank you Rajshree for the wonderful evening','2026-03-28 17:14:09.337253',2521,512,1328),('Devipriya Chellapandian',5,'Makeover was really awesome. She is much dedicated to her work . I was completely satisfied with my makeover. Highly recommend for marriage and reception ceremony..','2026-03-28 17:14:15.725394',2522,513,1332),('Yamumohan Yamumohan',5,'My makeup Is very nice.i make proud my self because u done settle makeup done.very nice person.thank you ma.','2026-03-28 17:14:15.729376',2523,513,1332),('revathy selvaraj',5,'Uvisha makeovers providing best makeup and mehendi services with affordable price range.\nHighly recommended for all type of weddings and functions.','2026-03-28 17:14:15.733327',2524,513,1332),('Deepa Natarajan',5,'Good and kind person superb experience','2026-03-28 17:14:15.737212',2525,513,1332),('shwetha selvam',5,'Nice work done by her. Very kind and responsible. Charging reasonable price too.\nOverall good experience.','2026-03-28 17:14:15.741156',2526,513,1332),('jayashree Iyer',5,'I have been using Saranya’s mehandi service for almost 4th time now.. For all the occasions— she s the first person who comes to our mind for any mehandi service. More than an artist she has become one of the family member and whole heartedly enjoys all our functions.\nPrices are also very reasonable. Highly recommend her for any mehandi service.','2026-03-28 17:14:23.004301',2527,514,1336),('Sylvia Joachim',5,'Saranya was absolutely brilliant in her work. She was able to do whatever design was shown.','2026-03-28 17:14:23.006889',2528,514,1336),('Sai B',5,'On of the best mehandi artist in the town . She always very professional polite an best at work ! Would recommend to the bride to have a best experience','2026-03-28 17:14:23.010256',2529,514,1336),('Harsha Devi M',5,'I just love the work so muchh!! Its very professional i was so satisfied!!!!I recommend everyone to try this artist once!!!!','2026-03-28 17:14:23.013633',2530,514,1336),('Prathiksha Narayanan',5,'I am very happy with the designs and also the finishing was also very nice.','2026-03-28 17:14:23.016924',2531,514,1336),('S Roselin',5,'I loved her Mehendi art and work .She is a professional and have put the design as requested and the output had come out soo beautifully as shown in attached pictures .Please don\'t double think and you can book her .She will make your mehendi dream perfect .She put for myself and my daughter .Her rate is also cost effective. Thank you Shakthi :)','2026-03-28 17:14:26.054185',2532,515,1340),('Reshma MRavi',5,'I had my baby shower mehendi done recently with Shakthi. The mehendi came out even much more beautiful than I hoped for and all thanks to Shakthi and her immaculate work\n\nLove her punctual timing and clarity on her work. Def recommend for any of your special occasions..\n\nThank you so much Shakthi!!!!','2026-03-28 17:14:26.056068',2533,515,1340),('Rishita Garg',5,'I recently got henna prints done by Shakthi and I am completely thrilled with the results! The designs were exquisite and intricate, showcasing the artist\'s incredible skill and creativity. The henna used was of top quality, resulting in a rich, deep color that lasted beautifully. The application process was relaxing and enjoyable, with the artist being both professional and accommodating. I received numerous compliments on my henna prints and would definitely return for more in the future. Highly recommended for anyone looking for stunning henna art!\"','2026-03-28 17:14:26.057713',2534,515,1340),('Nikita N',5,'Thank you for beautiful designs at very affordable rates at the comfort of your home. Shakthi is very good and calm with lot patience with her unique ideas. The mehndi was chemical free that is important and the color is very good.\n\nMade my day with their beautiful,intricate work. I highly recommend them.','2026-03-28 17:14:26.059752',2535,515,1340),('Neena Yadav',5,'I had an amazing experience with Shakthi. She is professional and her designs are creative and fabulous. Very happy and satisfied Beautiful Designs Great service…','2026-03-28 17:14:26.061462',2536,515,1340),('Shreya khetrapal',5,'Nasim is a very skilled artist. Loved the work she did for my wedding. Very reliable and efficient.','2026-03-28 17:14:29.182965',2537,516,1341),('Shruthi S Pariyadath',5,'She is the best I’ve ever seen, design wise, communication wise, in everything. The stain is a must to be mentioned. It’s been more than 10 days, and I still have the stain. 10/10 recommendation !','2026-03-28 17:14:29.186317',2538,516,1341),('Arwa Makati',5,'I had a wonderful experience with Nasim as she did my henna and my family members as well. The stain was beautiful and very dark. She is extremely talented. Her work is super detailed and neat. I had a great time chatting with her while she did my henna. She was very easy to get in touch with and was very prompt in replying to my text. I highly recommend her.','2026-03-28 17:14:29.189967',2539,516,1341),('SRINITHIkaran srinithikaran',5,'Amazing work and she paitently heard the requirements and made sure its incorporated. loved the final design','2026-03-28 17:14:29.193097',2540,516,1341),('husena Jamnagar',5,'She is the best artist in the city, an extremely awesome experience with her. She is the most patient one I\'ve ever been through. She\'s enthusiastic about doing her work precisely. She just doesn\'t earn money but follows her passion and satisfaction towards her client. Her designs are intricated beautifully.','2026-03-28 17:14:29.196483',2541,516,1341),('divya manavalan',5,'Excellent mehendi service with beautiful, neat designs. She was extremely friendly and professional throughout. A wonderful experience — highly recommended.','2026-03-28 17:14:32.271620',2542,517,1342),('Rajalakshmi Sivaprakasam',5,'Sharanya and her team did a great job with the bridal mehendi! Very professional and fast with their work.The mehendi design had detailed intricate works.Received a lot of compliments for it.','2026-03-28 17:14:32.274718',2543,517,1342),('Sandhiya Srinivasan',5,'I am so glad I choose SV Mehendi and Makeup for my wedding in Chennai! The bridal makeup was absolutely flawless and lasted the entire day, even through all the happy tears. The HD makeup looked stunning in photos. The mehendi artist was incredibly talented; my bridal mehendi design was so intricate and the stain came out beautifully dark. They were professional, punctual, and made me feel so comfortable on my big day. Highly recommend for any bride','2026-03-28 17:14:32.278061',2544,517,1342),('Bhavna Ganesh',5,'Mehandhi design was intricate and beautiful. We have booked her for two occasions. She did a fantastic job. Really appreciative of her work. She is very friendly as well.','2026-03-28 17:14:32.281373',2545,517,1342),('humera faizl rehman',5,'Saranya Amazing job a real Artist sweet patient enthusiastic girl God Bless you You\'re working was applauded by whoever sees the design Now my colour has still gone darker keep rocking honey','2026-03-28 17:14:32.284808',2546,517,1342),('Sruti Ramesh',5,'Mala did an amazing job. She did all the intricate designs with such dedication and speed. Her quality of work is commendable. Would definitely recommend her for your mehandi services.','2026-03-28 17:14:39.241583',2547,518,1343),('Laki Angel',5,'Simply the most sweetest with such detailed designs. Akka was so damn sweet and she really knew what she wanted as for my henna design. Thanlyou so much for the wonderful art u made akka','2026-03-28 17:14:39.244961',2548,518,1343),('Ashok Anandaraj',5,'We availed Mehandi and Make-up services for my brother\'s wedding. Starting from noting down our requirements to final output Madam was very thorough in her work. Most of the guests appreciated my mom\'s makeup. She\'s always on time and the communication is crystal clear. Totally would recommend and book her services for future functions.','2026-03-28 17:14:39.248046',2549,518,1343),('Nithya Kaarthi',5,'I had a great experience! The designs were beautiful and detailed, and she was very professional and sweet. Highly recommend for any occasion!','2026-03-28 17:14:39.251628',2550,518,1343),('Priya Dhasarathan',5,'I loved the mehendi designs that she did for my mother, sister, daughter and for myself. She did the mehendi very fast and very patient in discussing the designs. Highly recommened.','2026-03-28 17:14:39.255963',2551,518,1343),('revathy prabakaran',5,'Absolutely loved my hairdo by Divya. The style was flawless, lasted all day and suited my face perfectly. She listened to what I wanted and added her creative touch. Super friendly and professional. Highly recommend! 💖💯”','2026-03-28 17:14:42.339965',2552,519,1347),('Samyuktha VR',5,'We booked them for mehendi event. It was extraordinary, excellent service and reasonable price. Quality and aroma of mehendi are beyond our expectations. The mehendi artists reported sharply on time and  customized the designs as per our wish. Moreover, the stains were too dark and remained more than a week. Will recommend Ms. Divya\'s team without any hesitation. Keep going !','2026-03-28 17:14:42.342898',2553,519,1347),('uthara ganesh',5,'I had booked them for saree draping and they did a fantastic job. Divya ma\'am was so helpful and very patient and did a really good job. I would recommend her in the future.','2026-03-28 17:14:42.346007',2554,519,1347),('Aishwarya gopal',5,'I booked Saras Bridal Meghandi for my wedding. She did the best. Design came out very well . She was very patient. We booked for bridal and Gust. She covered everything very patient. I loved her work. She is very experienced Meghandi Artist. The output came out very well. Thank you soo much.','2026-03-28 17:14:42.348703',2555,519,1347),('maneeshababa shaik',2,'Went to get cones for my self...they took 125- for 5 cones ...but the size and quantity is much difference than in the photo....very very thin....not satisfied...s mam stain also i didn\'t get proper....as u said. U sell chemical for cheap...now chemical cones also selling as natural cones in market with high prices ....sry i don\'t have those photos that i didn\'t get proper stain ...next time i definitely post that tq for ur kind rly','2026-03-28 17:14:42.352035',2556,519,1347),('Sandhiya Maha',5,'Hi..This is sandhiya from vanagaram, chennai.\nFirst of all thank you abi akka...from beginning till the end i enjoyed the class very well...❤️\nLiterally I had an doubt?how it is possible to learn an professional mehendi course within 10 days...but she proved it is possible...from first class till the end ...the way of teaching was very nice and i would able to understand clearly...she was an kind Hearted person....(Abi akka)❤️ In this 10 days ,the class which I was enjoyed is mixology...I loved it.... Because it gives me an satisfaction and relaxation..... She always clears my doubts..... beginning I don\'t have an knowledge of mehendi but now I can confidently say that I can even start the business.....i didn\'t say this for an name sake.....this words are from my heart....\nSeriously i enjoyed each and  every class...At the end thank you abi akka...❤️\nI loved this class.....','2026-03-28 17:14:45.364636',2557,520,1348),('Jaya Sethu',5,'Hello this is Archana.\nI really loved this class.\nI wanted to thank Abi akka for teaching me a lot of tricks and tips.She is very kind and patience.She corrected my mistakes and helped me to develop my skills😊I have learnt a lot from you and appreciate your help.I am excited to continue practicing and perfecting the art of mehndi.Thank you for being such a wonderful mentor akka.\n🔥❤️','2026-03-28 17:14:45.368214',2558,520,1348),('Preethi A',5,'Awesome work also budget friendly and worth for money❤ very neat mehandi. Attended her 3days offline class. Now I am so much confident in doing all mehandi design. Liked her teaching and she is very much calm.','2026-03-28 17:14:45.372180',2559,520,1348),('lavanya swaminathan',2,'I had opted for bridal henna service at last moment and was quite disappointed in the overall outlook of the design for the amount I have paid. None of the images represented here is similar to the work done. The work need more finesse and improvement on  symmetry and pattern work. There was no professional outlook and I was quite taken aback that i had to pay for the store bought cones apart from the service cost. It would have made more sense if I had to pay for organic cones. As a mehendi artist myself I am not satisfied with design work done for my big day!','2026-03-28 17:14:45.375925',2560,520,1348),('Varsha Ganesh',5,'It was a great experience and I learned a lot about designing patterns, earlier I was a slow processor, after joined with you I had become a fast processor..i think that is my success & I really enjoyed the 4 sessions.','2026-03-28 17:14:45.383920',2561,520,1348),('vaishu vai',5,'Very nice mehendi work, Had a wonderful experience with her, soo much satisfied with the design\'s, Thank u soo much akka\nfor making my hand looks soo beautiful.....\nI highly recommend , people who r searching for an excellent mehendi artists....','2026-03-28 17:14:52.947007',2562,521,1349),('abhi abhinaya',5,'I had an absolutely wonderful experience with Banu Priya mehendi artist on my wedding and reception ceremony.... thank you so much for making my hand look exquisite with unique and beautiful mehendi designs....I wholeheartedly recommend Banu Priya mehendi artist for her exceptional mehendi designs at an affordable price','2026-03-28 17:14:52.950504',2563,521,1349),('Vaishnavi Chandran',5,'Ameena did a great work for my baby shower function. Final design was beautiful and as expected. She was very patient and cooperative.\nMehendi stain was also good.','2026-03-28 17:14:57.192035',2564,522,1353),('cutiee baby',5,'I had an amazing experience with ameena. Their talent and creativity are truly exceptional. The designs were intricate, beautifully detailed, and exactly what I envisioned. They worked with such precision and patience, ensuring that every stroke was perfect.Not only is their artistry top-notch, but they were also professional, punctual, and very friendly. They made the whole experience enjoyable and comfortable. The henna stain turned out rich and long-lasting, which was a huge plus! If you’re looking for a skilled and reliable Mehndi artist, I highly recommend ameena. I’ll definitely be booking them again for future events........❤️❤️❤️❤️','2026-03-28 17:14:57.195613',2565,522,1353),('bhanu priya',5,'Ameena did a great work for my wedding. The amount of patience and dedication that was used to make the designs made it look more beautiful. It\'s totally worth  to hire Ameena in any event. Thanks for making my day.','2026-03-28 17:14:57.197888',2566,522,1353),('Revathi P',5,'The work was neat and perfect.\nThank you very much for your incredible work... the designs have come out with full details👌. My daughter is very much happy with your work❤️. Very neat and perfect 💯Thanks again for your timely help.🙏','2026-03-28 17:14:57.200274',2567,522,1353),('Sujatha Gunasekeran',5,'“I’m truly amazed by their beautiful work. Every detail reflects passion and perfection. Highly recommend!”','2026-03-28 17:14:57.202236',2568,522,1353),('anu govind',5,'Very artistic and professional. I loved your work. Guests who came for my wedding asked me about my mehendi. Thank you very much akka.','2026-03-28 17:15:07.878124',2569,523,1354),('Aneetha Angappan',5,'Ashi was very professional.  One of the best mehendi I have got so far. Very happy with output. Her Mehandi cone was home made and could feel a ocean difference from store bought. Has such a pleasant aroma too. She was on time, relatively quick and polite. Highly recommend.','2026-03-28 17:15:07.881733',2570,523,1354),('Jeevitha Ramesh kumar',5,'Ashi is one of the best mehandhi designer in chennai. I really loved the perfectness of her design. She can do the best design with affordable price. Everyone can choose her for your upcoming celebration.','2026-03-28 17:15:07.885088',2571,523,1354),('