530,1376),('Rathi MS',5,'Nakshatra Bridal offers exquisite mehendi designs and creative, elegant hairstyles. Their attention to detail and professionalism ensure that brides look stunning on their special day. Highly recommended for exceptional bridal services.','2026-03-28 17:15:42.781633',2606,530,1376),('Ankita Mishra',5,'It’s really beautiful and trendy Mehandi. I am Fully satisfied and Rohit bhaiya is amazing.','2026-03-28 17:15:52.436351',2607,532,1381),('asmita singh',5,'Very beautiful design, very professional, polite and extremely good at their work. Highly recommended for Mehndi.','2026-03-28 17:15:52.439683',2608,532,1381),('Ruchi Lathoria',5,'They are very punctual with their services and do home visits as per your availability even on a short notice. They did beautiful designs for me (attending a friend\'s engagement) and are very patient and understanding of your design expectations. Great service guys, thank you so much for the beautiful work ☺️\n\nP.S.: The attached pics are post keeping my mehendi intact one entire night ☺️','2026-03-28 17:15:52.443032',2609,532,1381),('Vijey Kumar Vijey Kumar',5,'They are very punctual with their service and do home visits as per your availability even  on a short notice they did beautiful designs for me attenting a friend s engagement and are very patient ant understanding of design','2026-03-28 17:15:52.446483',2610,532,1381),('Ankita Sharma',5,'My mehandi is so elegant\nBest experience of mehandi art studio','2026-03-28 17:15:52.449455',2611,532,1381),('Maharajee',5,'\"I had a wonderful experience! She did both nails and mehandi for my wedding..I was so overwhelmed by her work and dedication .. The artist really listened to my preferences and output was so good .I got so many compliments ..Highly recommend for anyone looking for professional mehandi and nail art ..','2026-03-28 17:16:00.592225',2612,533,1382),('Venkat Venky',5,'I booked raymehandhiart for my family event. It\'s been great  and professional work from her.\nMy family and relatives liked her work.\nHighly recommend for mehandi event\'s ❤️','2026-03-28 17:16:00.595728',2613,533,1382),('Nivedha Viswanathan',5,'Affordable for all occasions\nWhatever design we ask she is always ready to customize according to our wish. The cones are naturally made which gives perfect mature stains and last for more than 5 days. Designs are perfect without any break. Everyone Must book for their memorable day.','2026-03-28 17:16:00.599333',2614,533,1382),('CA BHARATHI',5,'Sowmi’s work is fantastic and there’s no regrets in choosing her..And the stain holds for more than a week…A perfect choice for any event..Thanks for your mehandhi sowmii..','2026-03-28 17:16:00.603393',2615,533,1382),('Aravind Kandasamy',5,'Excellent service and very much dedicated... She is flexible to make any design as per our wish and it comes out very nicely ...we received her service at our home & are really happy ... definitely recommended.','2026-03-28 17:16:00.607282',2616,533,1382),('visalatchi B A',5,'She’s super talented and so friendly! I showed her a reference photo, and she recreated it even better. Loved the neatness, the color, and the attention to detail. Will definitely book again for future occasions!','2026-03-28 17:16:09.815963',2617,534,1386),('Keerthana A',5,'Excellent work!! Perfect finishing!! And also customer friendly 😍','2026-03-28 17:16:09.819324',2618,534,1386),('Gayathrik Gayu',5,'Such ha excellent work. I loved it this Mehandi made my day so so special ❤️','2026-03-28 17:16:09.822618',2619,534,1386),('Pradeebha',5,'Designs are so detailed and beautiful... getting many compliments...','2026-03-28 17:16:09.825667',2620,534,1386),('Aarthi Ram',4,'Really Loved her work.She did an amazing job,whatever design we show she does that 100% as in pic.Such an amazing artist and even though it has bcme late at night she didn\'t loose her patience n did her work at the same pace when she started.Thank U👍😊','2026-03-28 17:16:09.828709',2621,534,1386),('Free Access',5,'I really loved the mehndi design. The details were very neat and creative. You are such a kind and smiling person, and it was very nice talking with you during the session. Thank you for your wonderful work.','2026-03-28 17:16:14.459747',2622,535,1390),('Sai Priya',5,'The mehandi was really good. She asked me to select any design of my choice and replicated the same. Was so happy with the outcome. Very intricate designs with absolute perfection. Worth the price and she gave her best. The stain was absolutely incredible the next day.','2026-03-28 17:16:18.002229',2623,536,1394),('SHRI KRITHIKA NARAYANAN',5,'Mehandi will come and go but henna stays for ever . Mehandi drew me in. Her  motivation tempts me to grew wider . And to learn with perfectness . I love her way of teaching and sincerity towards the work done . Thanks akka for helping me to bring my talents 💯🙌❤️. Her main motive to bring ideas and talents forward . Teacher plays vital role to bring out them .thanks one again hats off . Worth for money . Reasonabe cost of giving money .','2026-03-28 17:16:18.006509',2624,536,1394),('Rukmani R',5,'I Booked megandhi for my marriage it was really a wonderful work done by sindhu... strains were also very good and everyone liked it.','2026-03-28 17:16:18.010286',2625,536,1394),('strictly cyber boys',5,'Had a reception tomo.....well skilled and Intrested mehandi artist...simply in one word fantastic....u can go for it without any confusion...@bridal mehandi artist instagram page can scroll thru once...good work...totally satisfied 🙏👏👏','2026-03-28 17:16:18.014591',2626,536,1394),('nm volgs narmu',5,'the best','2026-03-28 17:16:18.019312',2627,536,1394),('Abirami Sekar',5,'Really good talented girl and well expert in customized design..I am satisfied with her work. Thank you for giving wonderful design','2026-03-28 17:16:26.557043',2628,537,1395),('Lakshmi Priya k',5,'Good experience.. affordable. She is very calm and talented person','2026-03-28 17:16:33.411185',2629,538,1399),('Muralidoss Murali',5,'Fantastic work done, she made a beautiful job👍','2026-03-28 17:16:33.413379',2630,538,1399),('Keerthana',5,'Uma the mehandi artist was put a beautiful mehandi on my hand...I really like her work..with affordable price.Thank you for this...','2026-03-28 17:16:33.415887',2631,538,1399),('Yogitha M',5,'Very good artist...so frndly....love her work...','2026-03-28 17:16:33.418097',2632,538,1399),('Deepi Deepz',5,'Amazing work @Uma\'s Mehandi','2026-03-28 17:16:33.420507',2633,538,1399),('yooghetha murthy',5,'Had a great last minute experience with the artist, Shiyamala, for my event’s mehendi after another artist cancelled on me the day before the event. Shiyamala, from Bridal Mehendi Studio, was thoroughly professional. She reassured me of her availability, showed up at my house the exact time that she said she would, was patient and friendly the entire time. She was a lifesaver. I would definitely recommend her! I am hiring her and her team for my wedding in the future.','2026-03-28 17:16:36.270472',2634,539,1403),('Miridini N',5,'The bridal mehendi from this studio was stunning! The artist carefully customized the designs to match  preferences and ensured neat, intricate patterns. The mehendi colour came out beautifully dark and lasted long. I really appreciate that they offer such professional work at a reasonable price. Highly recommended for brides!','2026-03-28 17:16:36.273847',2635,539,1403),('Chitra N',5,'I had my bridal mehendi done here and absolutely loved the experience! The design was intricate and beautifully detailed. The artist was very patient and professional, and the colour turned out rich and dark. The best part — all this at a very reasonable price! Highly recommend bridal mehendi studio for every bride-to-be.','2026-03-28 17:16:36.278111',2636,539,1403),('Nithya Venkatraman',5,'Shiyamala came over to do henna for my daughter and I. She was highly professional and quick to complete. She took on the design my daughter gave and did an amazing job and also suggested simple designs for me - outcome was beautiful!','2026-03-28 17:16:36.282521',2637,539,1403),('Anjana Krishnan',5,'“I absolutely loved the mehendi! The designs were so neat and detailed — every pattern was done with great precision. The price was also very reasonable for bridal work. Highly recommend her for anyone looking for beautiful and affordable bridal mehendi!” 💕','2026-03-28 17:16:36.285789',2638,539,1403),('Trishaa S',5,'I contacted many DJ providers and I found DJ Factory. They understood all my requirements and they executed really well. They understood the crowd and played the songs accordingly. We had a great time. Their sound quality is outstanding. Reasonable price. On time service. Thank you Harry and team DJ Factory.','2026-03-28 17:16:43.700965',2639,540,1404),('Sanjay Nagpal',5,'Dear Harry Edison\n\nWe would like to express our heartfelt appreciation to Harry and the entire team at DJ Factory for the outstanding work they did in organizing our son Samyukth’s wedding celebrations from February 18th to 20th.\nFrom the vibrant Mehndi and joyful Haldi to the energetic Sangeet, the beautiful wedding ceremony, and the grand reception — every event was planned meticulously and executed flawlessly. The décor was absolutely stunning, thoughtfully designed, and perfectly aligned with the spirit of each function.\nHarry’s exceptional coordination, attention to detail, and calm professionalism ensured that everything ran smoothly and on schedule. His dedication and hands-on approach allowed our family to truly enjoy every moment without any stress.\nThank you, Harry, for turning these special days into unforgettable memories for our family. Your commitment, creativity, and seamless execution made Samyukth’s wedding celebrations truly spectacular.\nWith sincere gratitude.\n\nSanjay Nagpal & Family','2026-03-28 17:16:43.702685',2640,540,1404),('Pranav Jadhav',5,'He was absolutely amazing at our friend’s wedding in Chennai! The song selection and playlists were perfect, and he kept the energy high the whole time. The dance floor was never empty, and everyone had a great time. Honestly, the music made the event even more special — highly recommend him for any celebration! 🎶🔥','2026-03-28 17:16:43.704091',2641,540,1404),('Varsha Prasad',5,'My wedding was at The Leela Palace, and we had asked Harry to handle the music for both the wedding and the reception.\n\nFor the wedding, we wanted a soft, traditional instrumental melody in the background using sitar, and for the reception, we wanted live music with a saxophone and violin. From the very beginning, Harry guided us on what would suit the setting best and helped us curate the right vibe. He understood our vision clearly and balanced both the wedding and reception music beautifully to create exactly the experience we had imagined.\n\nFor the wedding, we had two amazing live artists playing the saxophone and violin. They followed the playlist exactly as we wanted and the whole atmosphere felt magical. Towards the end, when we made a last-minute request to play “Night Changes” by One Direction (a song that is very special to us), they were extremely accommodating and played it without any hesitation. It made that moment even more emotional and memorable for us.\n\nHighly recommend Harry and his team if you’re looking for someone who is professional, detail-oriented, and genuinely invested in making your big day perfect.','2026-03-28 17:16:43.705335',2642,540,1404),('Adeline Koshy',5,'Amazing music. Was hired for a wedding and we had a blast. DJ Harry did a great job with the music.Everyone enjoyed it and danced their heart out. The fact that everyones\' requests were catered too was very much appreciated. Would surely recommend them.','2026-03-28 17:16:43.706930',2643,540,1404),('Raghothaman Balaji',5,'We chose Jagz as the DJ for our reception, and he absolutely brought the celebration to life. The vibe he created was energetic, classy, and perfectly suited for the occasion. Our guests were engaged, dancing, and genuinely enjoying every moment.\nHe was very easy to work with and paid close attention to what we wanted for our big evening. The music selection was spot on and flowed seamlessly, keeping the momentum strong throughout the event.\nEverything was handled with professionalism and care, and his pricing is fair for the quality and experience he delivers. We truly appreciate the effort he put into making our reception such a wonderful and unforgettable celebration.\nThank you, Jagz, for making our night so special. Highly recommended! ❤️','2026-03-28 17:16:50.858239',2644,541,1405),('Mythreyi Sudevan',5,'We worked with Jagz for our Sangeet and Wedding, and I couldn’t be happier with the experience. Our guests were thoroughly entertained and had an amazing time throughout both events.\nFrom the very beginning, Jagz was incredibly accommodating of all my requests and made sure the music reflected our crowd perfectly. He played a great mix of English, Hindi, Tamil, and Malayalam songs, which everyone truly enjoyed. His packages are reasonably priced and offer great value for money.\nThank you, Jagz, for all the support and effort you put into making our events so memorable. Highly recommend! ❤️','2026-03-28 17:16:50.860455',2645,541,1405),('GOWTHAM R',5,'We had a great experience with DJ Jagz at our reception. Excellent sound quality, smooth transitions, and well-planned music flow. Very professional and punctual. Would definitely recommend for weddings and events.','2026-03-28 17:16:50.862135',2646,541,1405),('Divya S',5,'We had an amazing experience with the DJ setup by DJ Pradeep and Jagadeshkumar for our son’s first birthday party. The music was perfectly curated to keep the atmosphere lively and enjoyable for both kids and adults. The sound system was excellent, and the lighting added a great vibe to the celebration. Pradeep and Jagadeshkumar were very professional, punctual, and easy to coordinate with. They understood our requirements well and ensured everything ran smoothly. Highly recommended for any special occasion!','2026-03-28 17:16:50.863492',2647,541,1405),('Priya Pri',5,'We had jagz as the DJ for our friends cocktail party and he was amazing! He was able to really engage the crowd with a mix of tamil, hindi and English songs and everyone enjoyed.We had a blast! Very friendly approach, Communicating with him before the event was extremely easy. Thank you jagz ☺️','2026-03-28 17:16:50.865400',2648,541,1405),('Malavika Stuckey',5,'DJ Rey did a great job for my cocktail party! He took into consideration my favorites that I sent him and that added a personal touch. Lights and equipment was really good too! 100% recommend! Very professional and great team.','2026-03-28 17:16:57.653919',2649,542,1408),('Priya Kannan',5,'The DJ event delivered an electrifying night filled with powerful beats and nonstop energy. From smooth transitions to perfectly timed drops, the DJ kept the crowd moving from start to finish The atmosphere was vibrant the sound was crisp  and the connection between the DJ and the audience made the night truly memorable.','2026-03-28 17:16:57.656828',2650,542,1408),('Arun kumar',5,'Hi 👋 Everyone I Booked My Brother Wedding Reception ✨✨ Rey Events did a great job! They arranged the DJ, dancers, and 360 selfie booth. My family really enjoyed it and danced a lot. Everything was well organized and fun. Highly recommend!🤝🤝👍👍🫰🫰😇😇Great Job 💫💫Thank You Brother 🤝🤝','2026-03-28 17:16:57.659488',2651,542,1408),('Joseph Antony charles',5,'At the recent event, DJ Ray Events truly set the stage on fire with an incredible mix of songs in multiple languages. The energy in the crowd was unmatched, and his music kept everyone on their feet till the very end. On top of that, the event decorations and the food menu were absolutely top notch, making the entire experience unforgettable','2026-03-28 17:16:57.662937',2652,542,1408),('EARNEST VIMAL',5,'I have referred Dj rey to my friend at chennai\nHe replied he was an outstanding performer\nHighly recommended dj in chennai.','2026-03-28 17:16:57.665481',2653,542,1408),('Karimallam Bharath',5,'Had a wonderful experience with violinist DJ.\nWe couldn’t have asked for a better DJ for our reception! Vinolist kept the energy high, Professional, easy to work with, and amazing music selection. Highly recommend!','2026-03-28 17:17:02.241006',2654,543,1411),('punimangadu bhanupriya',5,'Hello Deejo\nFirst of all thank u so much for ur timely presence and awesome, pleasant , vibely Violin DJ on our daughters puberty function … u have a great team actually .. they were very friendly n supportive till the end of the event … songs selections are very nice.. we enjoyed a lot and got many compliments from family n friends… we highly recommend u to all…\nThank u😊','2026-03-28 17:17:02.244060',2655,543,1411),('aakash R',5,'Great combination of violin + DJ. They know how to engage the crowd and elevate the vibe. Keep up the good work team.','2026-03-28 17:17:02.247087',2656,543,1411),('Nagarajan Desigan',5,'I cannot express enough gratitude for the exceptional music experience provided by MIC DJ at my daughter\'s wedding on April 3rd, 2024, held at GPL A/C Mahal on Redhills High Road, Laksmipuram, Chennai. MIC DJ showcased remarkable talent and enthusiasm, embodying the spirit of a young rising star in the industry.\n\nFrom the moment he arrived, promptly setting up his equipment at 6:30 PM, to the electrifying atmosphere he created in the Mandapam, his dedication was evident. Despite the request to lower the volume and dim the lights for the benefit of the elderly guests, MIC DJ skillfully balanced the ambiance while delivering an unforgettable musical journey.\n\nHis ability to entertain guests of all ages, with a diverse repertoire spanning multiple languages, was truly commendable. MIC DJ effortlessly guided the evening, ensuring everyone was immersed in the celebration, from the youngest to the eldest attendees.\n\nHis performance was nothing short of heroic, leaving an indelible mark on the reception. I am convinced that MIC DJ is destined for stardom in the years to come. As we reflect on this significant day in my daughter\'s life, it\'s clear that MIC DJ played an integral role in making it memorable.\n\nA heartfelt thank you to THE HEAVENLY KNOTS for connecting us with such a talented artist','2026-03-28 17:17:02.249699',2657,543,1411),('dhinesh subramaniam',5,'The DJ was so great and they customised everything to our needs and it blended with the party so well that it wasn\'t just a noise. Music and the songs along with the sound box was of great quality and perfect. Well organised and they catered everything based on our needs. Especially the ending for the dance was so great. Highly recommended and budget friendly.','2026-03-28 17:17:02.253577',2658,543,1411),('Ganesh M.v',5,'Dj bro u did great job. I never expected perfect timing punchivality .dj setup as timed 3 hours nice song collection keep it up bro. And the baloon blast , chenda melam, cold Pyro , photobooth everything was fabulous ur work very neat and clean as wat u committed. My family highly recommended. Hereafter for further events in my family side I\'ll not move to anyone. We were fixed u in my family members thanks a lot bro. Love u keep keep rocking. Thanks 🔥💓🫂','2026-03-28 17:17:04.965305',2659,544,1413),('Shaun Surrender',5,'We hired Dj spykie bro he did amazing work. He played Dj very well my family members enjoyed lot. Especially balloon blast Photo Booth and chendamela was very neat and clearly done. He made the day extraordinary\nNice collection of dj songs. Thanks for coming and did the awesome work wat we given to u.\nYou did proper timing and neat work done.\nThanks bro keep it up.','2026-03-28 17:17:04.968725',2660,544,1413),('Vijayalakshmi Muthu',5,'Hi spykie bro,\nYour team work really good and their execution were perfect. They made entire reception very lively and all my family members were happy. Thanks for the Chenda Mela, pyro , ballon blast and smoke effect were very neat and dj was really u made it bro.\nAll my cousin was appreciated for booked u. Thanks a lot u coming for the function\nHighly recommend.\nThanks bro','2026-03-28 17:17:04.971953',2661,544,1413),('Sabari Nathan',5,'I booked dj and more., for the event everything he done well. Dj spykie alice lokesh bro absolutely made our night wonderfull. I never expect were my family dance but everyone perform as wat they know. First of all he professionally played and main thing is wat he told on phone call he maintain that. Punctual time everything is ontime he setup sounds and dance floor, cold pyro. Very low price strongly recommended for everyone. Keep it up 👍 bro\nThanks sj spykie bro. ,💯','2026-03-28 17:17:04.975407',2662,544,1413),('Sri Ram',5,'Absolutely outstanding DJ service! From start to finish, the music selection, transitions, and crowd engagement were top-notch. Our guests didn’t leave the dance floor all night. Very professional, punctual, and easy to work with. Highly recommended for any event.','2026-03-28 17:17:04.980697',2663,544,1413),('A V',5,'The DJ did a great job and kept the atmosphere lively throughout the event. Music selection was good and everyone enjoyed the beats. Thank you for making our flat function memorable','2026-03-28 17:17:07.989232',2664,545,1414),('Saravanan Saravanan',5,'Really amazing experience in aDJ','2026-03-28 17:17:07.992703',2665,545,1414),('Nithya Durairaj',5,'Really super and rocked the function🥰🥰🥰 best choice for budget friendly DJ. Excellent service provided..','2026-03-28 17:17:07.996724',2666,545,1414),('Christina B',5,'Made my day fulfill by playing his dj, we had such a good entertainment . Affordable price too','2026-03-28 17:17:08.000595',2667,545,1414),('Beniston J',5,'Aadhavan was very professional. Overall good DJ for a family wedding event.','2026-03-28 17:17:08.004803',2668,545,1414),('Pooja',5,'Dj Dinesh and his team did an excellent job.\nPerfect mixing of songs, on-time counters… everything went perfectly. Thank you very much for making our event even more entertaining.','2026-03-28 17:17:14.378335',2669,546,1418),('Developer Team Sri Hema Infotech',5,'#Gowtham\n\nDJ Event Management: The entire process was smooth and well-organized. Dinesh managed every detail with precision, ensuring the event flowed seamlessly.\n\nDJ Services: The music selection was spot on, catering perfectly to the diverse tastes of our guests. The sound quality was excellent, and the energy was high throughout the night.','2026-03-28 17:17:14.381825',2670,546,1418),('Narasimman parthiban',5,'Dj was awesome . Boys were very polite and ans they made our day ❤️','2026-03-28 17:17:14.385796',2671,546,1418),('udhaya cr',5,'[DJD] exceeded our expectations by perfectly capturing the essence of our event. Their curated playlist kept the dance floor buzzing all night, with seamless transitions between tracks that effortlessly matched the crowd\'s energy. The lighting arrangements were equally impressive, enhancing every moment and creating just the right atmosphere throughout the evening.','2026-03-28 17:17:14.389074',2672,546,1418),('Madhan',5,'We had the pleasure of having [@djdchennai] as the DJ for our sister\'s wedding, and it was an unforgettable experience! From the moment the celebration began, [dj event management] set the perfect tone with a fantastic playlist that kept everyone on the dance floor all night long.','2026-03-28 17:17:14.392072',2673,546,1418),('Rahul Krish',5,'DJ Sunny Deepak was phenomenal for our Sangeet. Everyone from different parts of the world had a fantastic time! He reads the crowd well and gives them exactly what they want.\n\nBooking process was super easy and he was super helpful with organizing the licenses and MCs!\n\nThank you Sunny!','2026-03-28 17:17:19.127213',2674,547,1420),('Sankar Muthuswamy',5,'When I envisioned my baraat, I wanted something energetic, lively, and unforgettable. My goal was to make sure my friends and family danced and had a blast. During my search for DJs and vendors, I quickly realized that while there are many options out there, very few truly stand out for their professionalism and class. DJ Sunny Deepak, however, was exceptional.\n\nFrom the moment the baraat began, it was clear that his services were on another level. It wasn’t just the music—which was phenomenal and kept everyone dancing non-stop—it was the entire experience. The dhol players, their sharp uniforms, the beautifully decorated van, the lights, and even the car were all meticulously planned and executed. DJ Sunny Deepak gave us an unforgettable two-hour baraat filled with seamless mixes and smooth transitions that took the energy to another level.\n\nComing from a family that doesn’t typically dance, I was amazed to see everyone on their feet, enjoying themselves. It ended up being my favorite part of the wedding. I had the time of my life, and I know my guests did too.\n\nIf you\'re looking for a DJ or want to create an amazing baraat experience, I wholeheartedly recommend DJ Sunny Deepak. He turned our night into a memory that will last a lifetime.','2026-03-28 17:17:19.129847',2675,547,1420),('Khansa Kaleem',5,'Hands down one of the best DJs in the Chennai !\nFrom the moment the music started, the energy in the room was electric. Sunny knows exactly how to read the crowd and drop the perfect tracks at the perfect time. Whether it’s a wedding, corporate event, birthday party, or just a night to remember, he brings the vibe. His mixes are seamless, his energy is contagious, and his passion for music shows in every beat. If you’re looking for someone to turn your event into an unforgettable experience, THIS is your guy. Highly recommend without a second thought!','2026-03-28 17:17:19.133030',2676,547,1420),('A Kannan',5,'Hired Sunny for our trilingual wedding in Chennai and he crushed it. Read the room perfectly for 3 different languages (Tamil, Telugu, English) and everyone complimented him.','2026-03-28 17:17:19.135471',2677,547,1420),('Pankhuri Jain',5,'Sunny is awesome! He is a powerhouse of energy and his set reflects that!\nHe came to play for our wedding and was a friends recommendation! Boy are we glad to have chosen him for our big day!\nHe is absolutely professional! And soooooo darn good at what he does!\nWe had an awesome time with him!\nIf you are looking for someone who would make your party nights memorable.. Sunny is your man!','2026-03-28 17:17:19.138298',2678,547,1420),('srivin srivin',5,'Good DJs are skilled at mixing tracks, keeping the dance floor going, and creating a cohesive playlist. Some say they are professional, accommodating, and energetic.','2026-03-28 17:17:38.321076',2679,548,1422),('Sivakumar',5,'The dj spark event is they are providing high quality speakers and lights Dj spark entertainment is excellent','2026-03-28 17:17:38.324679',2680,548,1422),('Pravin Kumar',5,'Very good event organiser','2026-03-28 17:17:38.328652',2681,548,1422),('S. Rabishon',5,'Nice team to conduct a event','2026-03-28 17:17:38.332332',2682,548,1422),('Pravin',5,'Good team','2026-03-28 17:17:38.336394',2683,548,1422),('dwarakanath santhosh',5,'DJ with full vibe and crowd grabber. Not only professional but also very entertaining, a perfect combo for every occasion to cherish the moment with fun and joy\nMust go for his dj with full confidence','2026-03-28 17:17:43.871273',2684,549,1425),('Gajendhiran M',5,'Awesome DJ. Superb attitude. Wonderful collection of songs. Maddy has songs for all moods with foot tapping music and brought all of us to the dance floor. His beats and music console were out of the world, gave a big high to the entire party. His pauses and comments in between making us sing along the punch lines, brought in a fun factor to the event. Highly recommend DJ Maddy not only for his DJ work but also for his no frills attitude, extremely punctual nature and friendly demeanour with least demands and reasonable professional charges...He will make your DJ night a starry night to remember....','2026-03-28 17:17:43.874162',2685,549,1425),('Mohammed Thaiyub',5,'DJ Maddy WAS AN ABSOLUTE RIOT! Not only was he an incredible DJ, but he was also a fantastic person. He went above and beyond for our sangeet, coordinating seamlessly with our other vendors to ensure everything ran smoothly before the after-party. He perfectly captured the vibe we wanted, playing absolute bangers that had everyone on their feet. From start to finish, there was never a dull moment with him around. He was the absolute right vibe to end our greatest day. His energy and professionalism made our wedding unforgettable.','2026-03-28 17:17:43.876816',2686,549,1425),('kawin M.S',5,'DJ did not just perform music; He created an experience! His ability to read the crowd and read the mix track made the night unforgettable. It seemed that they really understand what we need every moment, keeping the energy elevated and the dance floor was packed. It was not just about beats - it was about emotions, vibes and pure connections through music. Really a DJ who knows how to bring people together like a big, happy rhythm -filled family. Can\'t wait to vibe again with them.','2026-03-28 17:17:43.879182',2687,549,1425),('Azarudheen Kadhar',5,'After thorough research, I choose DJ Maddy for office award function Their lighting was very sober and covered all the trees and plants around the lawn area. It was a night event, but the lighting made it look like a daytime event - the lighting was superb! And the Man made magic through the songs he judged crowd pulse and deliver the songs and they used the appropriate sound system for the same. All our guests loved this one man show. Overall it was a very pleasant DJ night. I’m so glad I chose them. Thank you so much DJ Maddy, I look forward to having you at our next event very soon!!','2026-03-28 17:17:43.881996',2688,549,1425),('Vidhya R',5,'DJS for you was the first name suggested by my family friend and he said dont look beyond him and thats what I did. The next day I  spoke with Dj Naz in less than 2mins I  knew I just found the right person. He and Dj Schabie just created a magic that would stay with us for a lifetime. Reshma maam who hekped with coordination was awesome. Looking for more events like this with ur team. Keep this vibe of yours going. U guys are the best and thank you.','2026-03-28 17:17:54.145689',2689,550,1428),('sakthi vel',5,'I recently worked with Djs For U for my event, and my experience was excellent. The team was professional, punctual, and handled everything smoothly. The sound quality, music selection, and overall coordination were all top-notch. They understood the vibe of the crowd and kept the energy high throughout the event.\n\nTheir setup, lighting, and hosting were also very impressive. Overall, I am very satisfied with their service and would definitely recommend Djs For U for any event.','2026-03-28 17:17:54.149446',2690,550,1428),('DHARANESHWARAN R',5,'Yesterday we had a corporate event at our office, and DJ Deepika totally rocked it!\nEveryone enjoyed a lot — even the usually serious employees turned into dancers .\nThe vibe was full of energy and happiness. For some time, all of us forgot our stress and just enjoyed the music.\nBig thanks to DJ Deepika for making our event so lively!','2026-03-28 17:17:54.153191',2691,550,1428),('Mano Venkatesh Rajaselvan',5,'We hired DJ Sowmya for our sangeet and haldi. She did a good job. We started late, so couldn’t have enough time for DJ night, but had fun in haldi :)','2026-03-28 17:17:54.157521',2692,550,1428),('Srinath Thiru',5,'I personally know the owners of this place , down to earth and very friendly.  Affordable pricing for any family or social gathering and events , they are amazing and brings in a different perspective to your event !\nNavz and Deepika mam are one of the best attractions you can add to your event, must book them if you are planning for a DJ in your event like wedding reception , society events, new clubs or any function you name it , they got it covered !\n\nMust book - recommended 👍🫰🏻','2026-03-28 17:17:54.161615',2693,550,1428),('Thulasi v',5,'With my cousin\'s reference I booked B3 DJ. They did 8 different services and my family as well as the guest no single compliment about any services. They did everything to the best and beyond expectations. Will strongly recommend them and they worth every penny.\n\nThe communication were also smooth from the time I booked.','2026-03-28 17:18:01.638138',2694,551,1431),('senthil buddy',5,'Thank you for making our event so lively! The DJ did an amazing job keeping the energy high throughout. The special entry was perfectly executed and made the moment truly memorable. Great work! 💯👏👏👏','2026-03-28 17:18:01.642400',2695,551,1431),('Prasad Jayakumar',5,'B3 DJ events truly bring the vibrant spirit of “Chanda Mella” to life, creating an energetic and joyful atmosphere where everyone feels connected through music. The DJ selection and mixing showcase exceptional talent, blending traditional vibes with modern beats skillfully, keeping the crowd engaged and moving non-stop. The music experience is both uplifting and memorable, making every event a special celebration worth returning for. B3 excels in turning any gathering into an electrifying fiesta with fantastic DJ sets and a lively “Chanda Mella” ambiance that resonates with the audience.','2026-03-28 17:18:01.646753',2696,551,1431),('keerthika shankar',5,'We booked the DJ package for our wedding reception, and the entire experience was excellent from start to finish. And we have planned the rose petal shower and the cold Pyro for my entry was stunning and executed perfectly.\nThank you Bala anna','2026-03-28 17:18:01.650832',2697,551,1431),('Ravi M',5,'Had my son\'s wedding at Ashoka hotel, chennai and fixed DJ bala.very cooperative person,best performance by him and his crew.had a gala time with his songs and dance,and all the guests','2026-03-28 17:18:01.654684',2698,551,1431),('Suresh Storm',5,'🎧BPM DJ was amazing,enjoyed a lot Great music, smooth transitions, and kept the crowd dancing all night. Hight recommended for any event!✨','2026-03-28 17:18:15.371910',2699,552,1435),('Arunvairavan',5,'I personally had a wonderful time with Boopap music. The songs was perfectly pitched for us to dance. Most importantly the DJ was a fun filled man and played the songs according to mood.I booked for my sister marriage\nNote : Budget friendly they have different packages that fulfilling our needs.\nGreat job guys keep rocking .','2026-03-28 17:18:15.375345',2700,552,1435),('Deepi Raj',5,'“Fantastic DJ! Very professional, easy to work with, and really knows how to read the crowd. Everyone had a great time!”','2026-03-28 17:18:15.378419',2701,552,1435),('Simbu Cool4499',5,'Best dj in Chennai .they made crowd stunt and played music well and best in price','2026-03-28 17:18:15.381807',2702,552,1435),('Madhan Raj',5,'Awesome dj and everyone would celebrate 🎉 and enjoy every single moment thanks for the Bpm dj','2026-03-28 17:18:15.385855',2703,552,1435),('S Sathya Bama 20e2166',5,'Happy to meet you, DJ Frizbee ❤️ Thank you so much for bringing the best vibes with your DJ set from the starting till the end of the event. You truly made my sister’s wedding reception grand with your full-on rocking DJ vibe 🔥🫂\n\nAlso, a big thanks for arranging the amazing dhol 🪘 it added so much energy to the celebration! 🔥 Overall, we had an incredible time and the DJ experience was simply the best. Really appreciate your effort in making the event so memorable.\nWe all truly felt we had the best DJ in Chennai.❤️\n\nWe will definitely contact you for our upcoming events☺️🫂','2026-03-28 17:18:29.983273',2704,553,1436),('Adhithya Giridhar CSK',5,'Hired dj frisbee for my sangeeth event in chennai at hotel park plaza. To be honest he did an awesome job. Kept the Entire crowd grooving till the end. His song mixes were apt and relevant to the crowd vibe. The 3d mirror dance floor and lighting which came as part of his package  too were top notch. Would recommend him without any hesitation . His courteous and calm attitude is something I really don’t find in mah dj’s these days.','2026-03-28 17:18:29.986778',2705,553,1436),('Prakash Prakash',5,'We were searching for DJ service near Gerugambakkam and Iyyapanthangal for my brother’s wedding reception. The event was held at Sri Krishnaveni Palace. While checking options nearby like Kovur, Mangadu and Vanagaram, we found DJ Frizbee on Google and decided to contact him.\n\nFrom the first call itself his explanation was very genuine. He patiently explained all the concepts and packages and gave many creative ideas for making the wedding reception grand. Finally we booked a high quality DJ setup with 3D dance floor, premium couple fog entry, balloon blast entry, imported smokeless cold pyros, Chendamelam team and dancers team.👌👌\n\nHonestly the entire setup looked amazing inside the wedding hall. The dance floor and lighting created a beautiful atmosphere and the couple entry with fog and pyros looked like a cinema scene. Many guests were asking who planned these ideas. DJ Frizbee helped us a lot with these unique concepts and handled everything very professionally. 🫶🏻🫶🏻\n\nThe DJ performance was also outstanding.🔥 His song collection is extraordinary,..  Tamil, Telugu, Hindi, Malayalam and even trending dance tracks. The way he mixed the songs and controlled the crowd energy was superb. Guests from all age groups enjoyed the music and the dance floor was active most of the time. 🔥\n\nAfter seeing the overall setup and performance, four of my relatives immediately booked him for their upcoming family functions. That itself shows how much people liked his work. I am really happy to introduce him to my family members.🫶🏻❤️\n\nCompared to many others we spoke with, his approach was very transparent and friendly. He is a very cool person and explains everything clearly without any confusion.👌👌\n\nIf anyone is searching for a DJ in Chennai or DJ service near Gerugambakkam, Iyyapanthangal, Kovur, Mangadu, Vanagaram or Kundrathur, I would definitely recommend DJ Frizbee. He really made our wedding reception at Sri Krishnaveni Palace look grand and memorable. 😍😍','2026-03-28 17:18:29.990049',2706,553,1436),('Sachin Antony',5,'I was searching for DJ service near me and found DJ Frizbee showing on top of the DJ list in Chennai. After reading many of his Google reviews, we understood why people call him the best DJ in Chennai. So we contacted him to check the packages. He immediately shared his package link and honestly the options were very attractive, affordable and had good variety also.\n\nWe booked the DJ + Dance Floor combo offer for my sister’s wedding. As promised, he gave us high-quality sound and lighting. The dance floor setup also looked fantastic.\n\nHis playlist was really unique and refreshing. I have seen many DJs in different events, but DJ Frizbee is truly unique and very professional. The way he mixes and transitions from one song to another clearly shows he is a highly skilled DJ.\n\nEveryone enjoyed his melody set, and after around 8:30 pm he started the dance set. He mixed everything from the latest trending songs to 90’s hits. All age groups enjoyed fully and danced non-stop. His couple fog entry concept also made the event look so grand. He really delivered premium service exactly as he promised.\n\nJust like how we booked him after reading Google reviews, I also wanted to share our experience here. Keep rocking, DJ Frizbee bro ✌✌ 100% you will be our DJ for all our upcoming family & friends events. Thanks for the amazing show 💐','2026-03-28 17:18:29.993394',2707,553,1436),('Dhanush G',5,'DJ Frizbee completely made our event unforgettable! The dance floor was packed all night, and the song choices were spot on. He knew exactly how to read the crowd and keep the vibe alive. If you want an amazing party atmosphere, he’s the DJ to book💯','2026-03-28 17:18:29.996817',2708,553,1436),('k.c haridoss',5,'My sister marriage reception  given order  LED SCREEN 10x8 and 6x8 very good service clear display good work…','2026-03-28 17:18:43.062715',2709,554,1439),('PRASANNA PRABHU P',5,'Semma super .. full support .all enjoyed lot . Good n neat clarity in LED audio and DJ','2026-03-28 17:18:43.064801',2710,554,1439),('Vijay 1077',5,'I booked Venture resort for my friend  birthday .\nI booked Anbu waves audio system, really had a blast using the speakers. Heavy bass speakers. Nice sound output, very clear  sound. Really good service.','2026-03-28 17:18:43.066950',2711,554,1439),('Ray Aaron',5,'I regarded to anbu waves for my son\'s birthday function for the purpose of DJ.he done his work enthusiastically and good services of his carrier.when his creative dj set up makes function happy and great full manner','2026-03-28 17:18:43.069750',2712,554,1439),('vijay wanted',5,'Good co workers for a marriage function\nWe invited for our sisters wedding reception at Bharani function hall (Vadapalani) they supported us well and make the function well and good thank you so team for your support....😍😍😍😍😍😍😍 children enjoyed a lot and lot for their stage set and lighting......💞💞💞💞💞💞💞','2026-03-28 17:18:43.072236',2713,554,1439),('Shavindar R',5,'3D events - Guys u were just awesome , on point co-ordination and everything was spot on…!!!\nmy baby bday event was loved by all ..!!!!','2026-03-28 17:18:46.049189',2714,555,1442),('Saravana Kumar',5,'3D events are the Top event organiser and they made our event unforgettable full of fun & we enjoyed it\n\n3D events are specially Top-notch service and attention\n\n3D  events Exceeded our expectations with their creativity and professionalism in dj AI photos & combo pack etc.....','2026-03-28 17:18:46.053088',2715,555,1442),('Marimuthu Subramani',5,'The reason im giving 5star is for a wonderful experience with 3d events. These guys were very professional and well organized and given very good clarity from my all ques. My daughter\'s wedding reception went in good vibe with these guys. Thanku.','2026-03-28 17:18:46.057273',2716,555,1442),('Prasannakumar Loganathan',5,'I have been working with 3D Events for over 12 years now, and every single time, they continue to exceed my expectations. This isn’t just a review—it\'s my heartfelt appreciation for the outstanding service they consistently deliver.\n\nFrom the very beginning, booking an event with 3D Events is always smooth and hassle-free. Their communication is clear, timely, and professional. I truly appreciate how they walked me through every detail, from sound systems to special entry setups, ensuring I felt confident and informed at every step.\n\nWhenever I requested videos or photos of past events, they promptly provided exactly what I needed, which helped me visualize the setup and make decisions easily. What impressed me the most is the way they sent timely reminders leading up to the event—this gave me so much peace of mind, knowing that everything was being taken care of without me having to follow up.\n\nOn the event day, their team arrived early and completed the setup an hour before the start time, with an impressive and elegant presentation. The quality of their equipment and service truly elevated the event to the next level. Every staff member was courteous, professional, and incredibly supportive throughout the entire event.\n\nAfter more than a decade of working with 3D Events, I can confidently say they not only maintain their high standards but continue to improve year after year. Thank you for always going above and beyond. Keep up the fantastic work—cheers!','2026-03-28 17:18:46.060798',2717,555,1442),('karthi keyan',5,'Had a great experience with 3D Events! They were super organized, easy to work with, and made everything stress-free. The setup looked amazing, and the whole event went off without a hitch. Got tons of compliments from guests. Highly recommend them!','2026-03-28 17:18:46.064390',2718,555,1442),('Shekar Chandrasekaran',5,'I had the pleasure of hiring DJ Guru for my daughter’s Sangeet and Bhaaraat/Evening Meeting Greet Ceremony, and I couldn’t be happier with his service. DJ Guru has a terrific “can do” attitude—he went above and beyond to help me secure all the necessary music licenses from Novex, PPL, IPRS, and RMPL, which made the whole process stress-free. He is incredibly proactive; whenever I had questions, I received a response within half an hour, and he always made himself available for a call whenever needed.\n\nDJ Guru is highly energetic and organized, ensuring every moment of the event was lively and seamless. His pricing is competitive, but what truly sets him apart is his tremendous work ethic and genuine passion for his craft. He takes his work seriously and delivers excellent results. On top of all this, he’s very personable and easy to work with.\n\nWith his great attitude and professionalism, I truly hope DJ Guru goes on to achieve even greater success. I highly recommend him for any event—he’s a true asset!','2026-03-28 17:18:51.128351',2719,556,1443),('Prakrith Arivagam',5,'We had a whole day anniversary event  for our library. DJ Box gave us excellent audio coverage with all the expected equipments. There were no glitches. Technicians were great. It was a smooth process right from the first call. It was great working with you. Thanks!!','2026-03-28 17:18:51.130164',2720,556,1443),('Divya Chandrasekaran',5,'Guru did an amazing job. He executed on exactly what I wanted to a tee, and played all the songs on my playlist. He had a great mix of Indian and English music to accommodate a more mixed crowed of nationalities. He also refused to take recommendations from others and played ONLY what the bride wanted.. which is AMAZING. He also had some great remixes of English songs. I would recommend him for your next function','2026-03-28 17:18:51.131893',2721,556,1443),('Sai Gautam',5,'DJ was so good and he plays what ever music we want in any language and especially the sound quality was so good. And need to mention this  DJ Guru was too good same as his music too','2026-03-28 17:18:51.133554',2722,556,1443),('Jayalakshmi Alltresbs',5,'Hi Guru and Baskar,\n\nWe are completely satisfied with your service in Event Management. Without any rush you people did an Excellent job behind all the time in the Event. Really appreciating your cost effective jobs behind the screens. The DJ was rocking. Your sound system is awesome.\n\nApart from all your coordination, yourself and Baskar are down to the earth, understood the need of the hour, and took care of even small small things which we really didn\'t expect. You did everything with a professional touch in a very friendly manner.\n\nA special thanks to Revathi, who has an Excellent timing sense, quickly reacted to all the needs without any hesitation or frustration and She handled last time rushes excellently. A good choice for MC.\n\nAfter nearly five years We are conducting this Annual Meet and you people rocked everything from the welcoming time to the close of the event in the Venue.\n\nThanks again for Everything.\n\nHere,\n\nAlltres Business Solutions Private Limited - Management Team.','2026-03-28 17:18:51.135149',2723,556,1443),('KTM Vicky',5,'We just had our wedding at April and we were on a tight budget and looked for months for a DJ, but then we finally found DJ Dinesh!\nHe was so easy going and very professional! When meeting with him we knew that he was prefect for our wedding and it was a relief to have someone with so much experience! Dinesh made the process so easy with planning ceremony.\nHe always answered my calls and emailed back right away!\nWe highly recommend DJ Dinesh as we had the wedding of our dreams and it was thanks to his expertise and ensuring he not only met our expectations, but did everything he could to exceed them!','2026-03-28 17:18:54.256000',2724,557,1445),('Nivetha Sivakumar',5,'We hired DJ Dinesh For a Destination Wedding. He is the best DJ i have ever seen. He made my whole family jump on the dance floor. His mixing skills & choice of songs along with marvelous miking are commendable. He managed my event so well and at reasonable costing.. A Big ThumbUp to DJ Dinesh once again.','2026-03-28 17:18:54.259529',2725,557,1445),('Ruthresh Gokul',5,'This is our 2nd experience with DJ Dinesh... They possess excellent Good quality equipment and the team is very friendly and expert.. We booked DJ Dinesh for college farewell to over 500 students at a time.. rhythm just takes u on the dance floor with every foot tapping songs and music. Really lived their performance, We look forward for more such memorable events Happy to share that we are very satisfied with the work and quality services of Dinesh.','2026-03-28 17:18:54.261151',2726,557,1445),('Abbas Abbas',5,'DJ Dinesh knows how to deliver good time. Great mixes accompanied by his engaging style,  it\'s a treat to watch him on stage. He is an amazing artist and a fine human being. Would love to see him perform again.','2026-03-28 17:18:54.262797',2727,557,1445),('Win fab Engg',5,'We booked him for Corporate Get-together it was memorable party event by the DJ Dinesh is Amazing knowledge of latest songs and the rhythm just takes u on the dance floor with every foot tapping songs and music. Really lived their performance. Thank u.','2026-03-28 17:18:54.264370',2728,557,1445),('Sri Akash Venugopal',5,'Best Dj.  They came timing and everything done properly..Thanks to dj mari','2026-03-28 17:19:01.909188',2729,558,1446),('Sultan Sabeel Ahamed',5,'A big thank-you to the DJ for delivering an unforgettable performance at yesterday’s event! Their ability to curate the perfect playlist and create an electric atmosphere was unmatched. Every beat, every transition, and every track kept the crowd engaged and the dance floor packed the entire day.  I’ve attended many events, but this DJ truly stood out as a highlight.\n\nHighly recommend!!','2026-03-28 17:19:01.912724',2730,558,1446),('UmaShankar Mv',5,'Fantastic DJ team, on time, flexible and friendly, good cooperation and coordination. DJ System, set-up are very good. Making the crowd engaged all time with music, tracks are very enjoyable.. memorable event','2026-03-28 17:19:01.916252',2731,558,1446),('Joey',5,'Wonderful experience with their team! Thanks Mari for the amazing output. You managed both the langauges songs very perfectly. Every guest of ours appreciated the DJ. I highly recommend you anyone looking for DJ services','2026-03-28 17:19:01.919749',2732,558,1446),('Kalyani Narayanan',5,'Excellent DJ service. The guests were very happy. Even those who don\'t dance have come on stage to dance... The DJ responded quickly to the request of the audience. Will definately recommend his service.','2026-03-28 17:19:01.922886',2733,558,1446),('Seril Kerson',5,'Team did an amazing job managing the photo booth throughout the event. Very friendly, patient, and professional with all the guests. He made everyone feel comfortable and ensured the photos came out perfect. Truly appreciate his dedication and smooth handling of the booth. Great service and great attitude!”','2026-03-28 17:19:08.635163',2734,559,1447),('Harshad .s',5,'The audio system was beautiful and very friendly to use, the dance floor was fantastic, and BTS was absolutely awesome!','2026-03-28 17:19:08.636928',2735,559,1447),('praveen kumar',5,'Very friendly and affordable. Played the list of songs suggested by us  and encouraged the participation of guests. Made the event more memorable for us.','2026-03-28 17:19:08.639395',2736,559,1447),('Ashok Kumar',5,'I recently had my wedding reception and chose Classic Events for the DJ and bride & groom entry. Mr. Srinivasan, the owner, handled everything in a friendly and professional way. The outcome was exactly how I imagined, and the whole event was amazing. They also offer many other services like Chenda Melam, instrumental shows, light shows, karaoke shows, and more. For anyone looking for budget-friendly and best service, I definitely recommend Classic Events.','2026-03-28 17:19:08.642252',2737,559,1447),('S Sanjay',5,'I\'m very impressed with their works. DJ  honey comb,Rose Flower shot and Fog machine it\'s a wonderful show. Me and seenu had a good brotherly vibe. I would like to recommend this \"Classic Events\" to my friends and family..\n\nThank You Bro😊','2026-03-28 17:19:08.644438',2738,559,1447),('Tamilselvi P',5,'3xDJ studio...5 stars not enough for their management skills.the decoration set and cake cutting event was really good.their time management and planning of the event was really appreciatable...especially the timing of songs played by DJ during the event was lit😍😍thankyou for making my Hrithvi\'s 1st birthday more memorable and loveable..thankyou😍😍😍','2026-03-28 17:19:23.911428',2739,560,1449),('Rubini Shankar',5,'Thank you so much for 3XDJSTUDIO Team ✨the best services offer a mix of creativity and professionalism, of beautiful, customized decoration and Good vibz DJ.Excellent photographer. Very professional and patient.  Enjoyed. best dj best event management company in Tambaram.','2026-03-28 17:19:23.915646',2740,560,1449),('Jessies Designer',5,'They did my daughters puberty function’s decoration. They were very friendly and did a good job. Within minutes they did the decorations and after the function they cleared everything neatly. Definitely will recommend them','2026-03-28 17:19:23.918839',2741,560,1449),('Bennett Davis J (Ben)',5,'We had our son’s first birthday organized by 3XDJ, and they did a wonderful job! The decor was beautiful and the photography captured every special moment perfectly. Truly made the day memorable. Highly recommend. Great Job. thank you 3XDJ team','2026-03-28 17:19:23.922521',2742,560,1449),('Charu V',5,'We booked 3XDJ for our Sister Engagement, and they were best ,professional, punctual, & flexible.I highly recommend them for any event if you want people to have an amazing time! Tq 3XDJ❤️','2026-03-28 17:19:23.926771',2743,560,1449),('Joshua m',5,'Our reception would not have been the same without you! The music was perfectly curated, the transitions were smooth, and you kept the energy high all night. You read the crowd brilliantly and made sure every moment from the entrance to the final dance felt magical. We received so many compliments about the music and overall vibe. Thank you for making our celebration unforgettable.','2026-03-28 17:19:33.048125',2744,561,1453),('Rajalakshmi Raji',5,'Thank you so much for the wonderful DJ music at our wedding. The song selection and sound quality were excellent. Thank you for adding so much joy to our big day.','2026-03-28 17:19:33.051442',2745,561,1453),('Swetha Sankaran',5,'Yesterday was my reception Dj Ram Bro was played a very well song and everyone\'s like it.  It was good actually and had a good vibe. Thanks Bro keep rocking as always 🥳','2026-03-28 17:19:33.055217',2746,561,1453),('Deepa Som',5,'We had the pleasure of having DJ Ram at our New Year\'s event, and they truly made the night super fun. He brought a fantastic vibe to the event and we couldn’t have asked for a better way to ring in the New Year. Highly recommend for any occasion!','2026-03-28 17:19:33.059624',2747,561,1453),('Prem Raj',5,'Recently, I had engaged R-Band DJ Events for my son’s 18th birthday event in one of the Farmhouses on the ECR side.\nThe team was before time and setting up the DJ space and testing them when we entered the venue. Mr. Ram from R-Band DJ Events was very sportive and energetic in action. He was getting to know the Audience expectations, before the play. Close to 4 hrs of non-stop musical extravaganza performed by Mr. Ram and his team was very well enjoyed by our family and friends, with the latest Pioneer Mixer, JBL Speakers, Honeycomb setup & the smoke effect.\nMany thanks to the team and specially Mr. Ram, who was engaging the audience and making sure that we thoroughly enjoyed.\nMusic comes with the passion, and it is being felt with Mr. Ram’s involvement with the music. Kudos to the R-Band’s Team!','2026-03-28 17:19:33.062948',2748,561,1453),('bharath kumar',5,'One of the best DJ\'s in town for any occasion at reasonable price. Highly recommend their caters as well. Prompt responses and all our requirements were met. Much satisfied.','2026-03-28 17:19:38.727190',2749,562,1454),('Prakash',5,'Best & affordable DJ services , they entertained the crowd very nicely and kept them moving in the dance floor.','2026-03-28 17:19:38.730892',2750,562,1454),('keerthana arunkumar',5,'Awesome dj provided, u wer really rockng😄😄 ur dj is the best in Tamil, was enjoying a lot couldn\'t forget those moments , thanks a lot dj','2026-03-28 17:19:38.734852',2751,562,1454),('Spartan Hari',5,'Best DJ service in chennai....One of the best DJ im the city. Highly recommended. Thanks again DJ marv','2026-03-28 17:19:38.738275',2752,562,1454),('Aravindhu Ramesh',5,'Good sound quality and performance, best services for the cost. Keep it up!','2026-03-28 17:19:38.741583',2753,562,1454),('Gowthaman R',5,'#Teens vision photography\n#DJ Prem thank you so much for your wonderful& great work in my wedding events...\nOnce again thank you so much for you & your entire team 😊\nHave a good years ahead...👍🏼','2026-03-28 17:19:52.074970',2754,563,1455),('Dj _praw',5,'amazng event','2026-03-28 17:19:52.077888',2755,563,1455),('RAGHUWAR UPADHAYAY',4,'🤔🤔🤔🤔🤔🤔🤔','2026-03-28 17:19:52.080268',2756,563,1455),('Yuvan Rj',5,'May May','2026-03-28 17:19:52.082986',2757,563,1455),('Kavitha',5,'We have booked BADBOY DJ for our family event.\nThey arrived early and was extremely organized.very friendly, easy to work with and good responsive to message. They kept dance the floor all night.They handled request smoothly and kept transition clean. Highly recommend for any event. Would book without any hesitation.... Enjoyed very lot....','2026-03-28 17:19:59.620972',2758,564,1459),('P Nivetha',5,'I reached out via Instagram to get a baby cart for my princess’s birthday, and the entire experience was flawless. From communication to delivery — everything was handled professionally and on time.\n\nThe cart itself was stunning — elegant, safe, and perfect for the special occasion. Couldn’t have asked for better quality or service.\n\nHuge thanks for making my little one’s day magical and unforgettable!\n— Bad Boy DJ 🎧','2026-03-28 17:19:59.624034',2759,564,1459),('preethi D',5,'The event was organized very well for my daughter\'s birthday; it was done in a professional manner. I am extremely satisfied and recommend choosing this event management team as a first choice. My best wishes to the team for good health and prosperity.','2026-03-28 17:19:59.627204',2760,564,1459),('Sidharth Gurusamy',5,'Best DJ I have ever admired, they are analysing situation and organising accordingly\n\nThey are best in market and affordable','2026-03-28 17:19:59.630608',2761,564,1459),('Ragul Ragul',5,'Good work 🔥🔥 best experience 🎉 keep rocking','2026-03-28 17:19:59.634196',2762,564,1459),('Akshaya Murugesan',5,'Had a great experience with him.Played all requested songs and made the crowd to dance well.. Really he was one the best DJ\'s out there','2026-03-28 17:20:15.111852',2763,565,1460),('Naga Ashwin',5,'It was awesome experience with you guys we loved your DJ keep rocking 🥳🥳','2026-03-28 17:20:15.114241',2764,565,1460),('Dj Remo',5,'I fully enjoyed the music during the Wedding occasion All our Friends and Relatives had good time and enjoyed with his Dj.\nAppreciated his work....Everyone Enjoyed...','2026-03-28 17:20:15.116792',2765,565,1460),('deepan salaignanadeepan',5,'Had a good dance music with him. Made the crowd to dance well. He made event awsome one. Value for money.','2026-03-28 17:20:15.118897',2766,565,1460),('Sriram Saravanan',5,'Had a great experience with him.Played all requested songs and made the crowd to dance well..','2026-03-28 17:20:15.120760',2767,565,1460),('Nirmal Raj',5,'VJ Recordz DJ is really awesome. Song collection and selection is too good. Song mixing is awesome. Very good response. Lights, smoke and laser lights effect is too good. I strongly preferred for VJ Recordz DJ Event.','2026-03-28 17:20:30.611479',2768,566,1464),('Gowtham S',4,'Such a amazing event...... Delivered by GOWTHAM..... Really enjoyed ❤️','2026-03-28 17:20:30.614319',2769,566,1464),('Sanket Joshi',5,'Best DJ in MM nagar , humble guy with knowledge of mixing songs , bass of songs & taste of fusion was great.💐😌','2026-03-28 17:20:30.617855',2770,566,1464),('Arun Hariharan',5,'Took DJ services from DJ Dre Gowtham, he really did it well in my wedding reception function, all were happy if his service, the latest song selection was surprising and overall a great experience with them','2026-03-28 17:20:30.621014',2771,566,1464),('Nitesh',5,'It was good dj , i loved the mixing of song and mashup of song , the main thing is sound ,speaker and mic all was so good , we have invited them for New year celebration, ended with good vibes and they were very kind to talk with us ,👏👏🙂🙂 i loved their way of work thank you so much for coming bro👏🙂','2026-03-28 17:20:30.623715',2772,566,1464),('Rpm Mani',5,'Sound quality and lighting work, very nice..','2026-03-28 17:20:39.833620',2773,567,1467),('Sun ShinyWork Constructions',5,'Excellent customer service, thanks a lot...','2026-03-28 17:20:39.837455',2774,567,1467),('dinesh kumar',5,'Best Quality..','2026-03-28 17:20:39.841650',2775,567,1467),('ashok suresh',5,'Supper','2026-03-28 17:20:39.845936',2776,567,1467),('Sabrish',5,'Had a really good experience with their wedding card printing service. They were very friendly and patient throughout, helping us choose the right design and making sure every small detail was perfect. The print quality and finishing were excellent, and the cards turned out exactly how we wanted. Everything was delivered on time, and the whole process felt smooth and stress-free. Definitely a place I’d recommend to anyone looking for beautiful wedding invitations made with care','2026-03-28 17:20:50.916155',2777,568,1469),('Dhakshinamoorthy Akash',5,'Beautiful collection of wedding cards with elegant and unique designs.\nExcellent quality printing and premium paper finish.\nStaff were friendly, patient, and very helpful in customization.\nTimely delivery with great attention to detail.\nReasonable pricing for such high-quality work.\nHighly recommended for anyone looking for perfect wedding invitations.','2026-03-28 17:20:50.920326',2778,568,1469),('Momodango',1,'This was honestly one of the worst experiences I’ve ever had at a printing shop. I went there just to print a very simple wedding card, nothing premium, nothing fancy. Yet they quoted ₹30 per card, which is absolutely ridiculous.\n\nWhen I checked with other shops, the same card was being printed for under ₹20. These people are clearly overcharging and looting customers without any shame. On top of that, they had the audacity to add ₹10–₹15 extra for absolutely no valid reason.\n\nThere is zero transparency in pricing, and they clearly take advantage of customers who don’t question them. Highly disappointed and would never recommend this place to anyone. Dont go to this place','2026-03-28 17:20:50.924410',2779,568,1469),('ani aadhiesh',5,'Where every invite begins with love and elegance\nTurning dreams into beautifully crafted designs\nEach card tells a story of togetherness\nBlending tradition with modern creativity\nMade with care, detail, and heartfelt perfection\nBecause first impressions deserve to be unforgettable','2026-03-28 17:20:50.928406',2780,568,1469),('Dila Diiva',1,'Very bad experience. The prices are unreasonably high compared to other shops, and the quality does not match the cost at all. I paid extra expecting good work, but the cards were damaged, misaligned, and handled carelessly.\n\nWhen I raised the issue, the staff showed no concern or apology. They clearly don’t care about customer satisfaction. This place is overpriced, careless, and not trustworthy. Strongly not recommended.','2026-03-28 17:20:50.932344',2781,568,1469),('Srinivasa Giridharan',5,'Very good service, we recently bought invitation for our function from sabari cards, they are very friendly had good options. Through proof reading was done and printed and delivered on time. Happy with the service. Keep up the good work.','2026-03-28 17:20:58.545343',2782,569,1473),('Srikanth Seshadri',5,'Excellent service. Quick to respond to corrections and delivery. Nominal price. Person is very polite. Highly recommend Sabari cards for all occasions.','2026-03-28 17:20:58.548263',2783,569,1473),('Anand Kumar',5,'An affordable quality card shop with good collection and service. Recently got my wedding cards from them and everything from cost, delivery and quality were impeccable. The shop has a good interiors with good collection where you can sit and choose your cards and gifts. You will get personalized service and suggestions.','2026-03-28 17:20:58.551597',2784,569,1473),('kannan R',5,'Fantastic shop. The owner has a great attitude and always keeps his commitments. The prices for cards and printing are lower than at other shops.','2026-03-28 17:20:58.554437',2785,569,1473),('Veeraraghavan Jagannathan',5,'Appreciate on the on time delivery\nMinimal corrections made our life easy\nHe is Approachable !!!\nGood job.thank u .','2026-03-28 17:20:58.557702',2786,569,1473),('Mathew Ambrose',5,'Hi everyone, this is Mathew Ambrose here. I would like to share my wonderful experience with Shub Cards for designing my wedding invitation. From the very beginning, their team was extremely professional, creative, and attentive to every detail.\nThey designed a truly elegant invitation using a blue velvet cloth pattern on the top, beautifully enhanced with a golden acrylic initial that gave it a royal and luxurious look. The quality of the materials, the craftsmanship, and the finishing were simply outstanding.\nWhat impressed me the most was their commitment to perfection and timely delivery. Every guest who received the invitation appreciated its unique design and premium look  even several VIP guests personally mentioned how impressive and classy it was.\nI genuinely appreciate the effort, creativity, and dedication that went into making our wedding invitation so special. My family and I are extremely happy with their service and would highly recommend Shub Cards to anyone looking for elegant, high-quality, and memorable wedding invitations.','2026-03-28 17:21:00.981561',2787,570,1477),('Raindropss Charity Foundation',5,'Our heartfelt thanks to Mr Dhilip Kumar, Shubh Cards for the extraordinary invitation design that truly elevated the expectations of the award ceremony, just like every year.\n\nWe are grateful for your continued support and for being a valued part of the event as our Official Invitation Partner. Your creativity and commitment add a special touch to the celebration.\n\nThank you for being a wonderful part of this journey. 🌸✨','2026-03-28 17:21:00.983728',2788,570,1477),('Beena Zahir',5,'Amazing Experience with Shubh Cards, Chennai.\n\nI had an excellent experience with Shubh Cards in Chennai for my event! Their wide range of designs, customization options, and professional approach truly stood out.\n\nThe team was incredibly helpful in understanding my requirements, ensuring the designs matched my vision perfectly. The quality of the cards was exceptional, and they delivered everything on time without any hassle. Whether it’s a wedding or any special occasion, Shubh Cards is the go-to place for beautiful, high-quality invitations. Highly recommended for anyone looking for unique and elegant card designs in Chennai.','2026-03-28 17:21:00.986490',2789,570,1477),('Studio 149 Swathi Purushothaman',5,'We worked with ShubCards for our hamper boxes, invite cards, photo sleeves, and price tags for Studio 149’s new store at Cenotaph Road, and the quality was simply impeccable. We received so many compliments on the boxes, they looked absolutely beautiful and premium. The team ensured constant coordination, understood the exact quality we needed, and delivered beyond expectations. Even now, people who receive our packaging, especially our price tags, tell us how classy and high-quality they look. Every detail speaks for itself. Thank you, ShubCards! We’ll definitely be sticking with you for all our future packaging requirements.','2026-03-28 17:21:00.988766',2790,570,1477),('JAGAN NATHAN',5,'I recently received my dear friend Mathew Ambrose’s wedding invitation, and I must say it was absolutely impressive and beautifully crafted. The design, quality, and finishing truly stood out  it reflected class and creativity in every detail.\nThe invitation was designed by Shub Cards, and after seeing their amazing work, I’m already planning to get my own wedding invitations done by them. Truly commendable craftsmanship and taste  highly recommended!','2026-03-28 17:21:00.991482',2791,570,1477),('raju ramamurthy',5,'Very satisfied, on time delivery. I’m really happy. Executives are very supportive and coordinated till the final draft approval','2026-03-28 17:21:07.751353',2792,571,1478),('Raghavendran M',5,'It was wonderful experience at Menaka cards Ambattur. The staffs were very polite, friendly and greatly helpful in best selection of cards. Process of checking the proof and timely delivery was perfect. The quality of the cards are really good and can’t be compared with the market where they offer low cost cards. Print quality was Cristal clear.\n\nThanks\nRaghav','2026-03-28 17:21:07.753673',2793,571,1478),('Priya Dharshini',5,'Professional service, timely delivery.\nFollowing their standard procedures very strictly\nVery clear communications by Staffs\n\n5/5\nRecomemded highly\n\nDont rish on last minute','2026-03-28 17:21:07.755446',2794,571,1478),('Nithyaa Anandan',5,'Excellent customer service.\n\nExplain the term and conditions clearly.\n\nDelivery within a week as they promised.\n\nStaffs approach towards customer is Nice.\n\nAll over my work done excellently\nAs I expected.\nThank you 😊\n\nNote:card range starts from Rs.9 and card collection are nice.','2026-03-28 17:21:07.756956',2795,571,1478),('Kiruba Selvam',5,'The patience maintained by the in charge Mr.Prasanna and the typist girl Ms.Barkavi was very good and awesome.  They made their best to fulfill the customer\'s service .','2026-03-28 17:21:07.758595',2796,571,1478),('M Legashri',5,'I’m extremely happy that I chose That1 Card to design my wedding caricature invitation. My sincere thanks to the entire team, especially Mr. Suresh Anna, who designed the invitation with great dedication and patience. The caricature turned out even better than I had hoped. Thank you, Mr. Suresh Anna and team—5 stars from me without a second thought! ⭐⭐⭐⭐⭐','2026-03-28 17:21:15.850470',2797,572,1482),('ruban s',5,'That1Card surpassed our expectations in designing our wedding cards, capturing our vision flawlessly. Their attention to detail and creative expertise were truly impressive. From the first consultation, they showed a deep understanding of our preferences and crafted personalized designs that reflected our love story.\n\nThe craftsmanship and quality were exceptional. The wedding cards were beautifully printed on high-quality materials, exuding an elegant and luxurious feel. They paid meticulous attention to every aspect, from the choice of fonts to the intricate patterns, resulting in breathtaking invitations.\n\nWe appreciate the professionalism and commitment to timelines. They delivered our order promptly, allowing us ample time to distribute the invitations. Their communication throughout the process was seamless, ensuring a stress-free experience.\n\nOur guests were captivated by the elegance and unique design of our wedding cards. That1Card truly made our invitations stand out and set the tone for our special day. We highly recommend That1Card to couples seeking exceptional wedding cards tailored to their vision.','2026-03-28 17:21:15.853690',2798,572,1482),('Balasubramanian K',5,'Card cost is moderate and the Printing design & the lay out is excellent. More so, their attitude towards the customer and fulfilling the expectation of the customer from their perspective is very good. I fully overwhelmed by their co operation.','2026-03-28 17:21:15.857501',2799,572,1482),('shahmala shabeshan',5,'I am from Malaysia and we communicated before my arrival in Chennai. The service was amazing, very accommodating and efficient. There were soo many choices to choose from. Highly recommend','2026-03-28 17:21:15.862440',2800,572,1482),('Sree Vidya',5,'Very friendly team! They help customizing exact designs according to how we want. Their quality, pricing and deliverables are ok point! Very happy to have got my invites done by them!\n\nHighly highly recommed!','2026-03-28 17:21:15.865732',2801,572,1482),('Rujutha',5,'Good customer support and varity of cards available in affordable price','2026-03-28 17:21:23.827177',2802,573,1486),('Madhavi Sugumar',5,'Madhuram cards managed by mrs.Parvati provides so personalised service, genuine, reliable, cost effective at whole sale rates, guiding with choices, very much timely and fast service delivered 500cards in two days at home at no extra cost, provides ample and latest choices, We are very happy and fully satisfied. We wish them very successful future with growing business. We surely recommend them as best choice. Thanks.','2026-03-28 17:21:23.830981',2803,573,1486),('jegapraveen prakash',5,'I went to this shop for printing invitations. They really did a great job. Must mention is DTP work, she is really doing excellent work. She spent enough time on designing by satisfying all our expectations.  I don\'t think in other shops they really spend enough time to accept all our requirements and improvisation by understanding what we are expecting as output but madhuram cards doing well in this aspect. Even the delivery also as expected  ery fast delivery. Much recommended shop. Please continue the good work madhuram cards.','2026-03-28 17:21:23.834483',2804,573,1486),('Suresh Sai',5,'My number','2026-03-28 17:21:23.838066',2805,573,1486),('Charu Kannan',4,'Lot\'s of models invitation available here with reasonable price.good quality of printing and also on time or before delivery.','2026-03-28 17:21:23.842695',2806,573,1486),('Karthikeyan Rajendran',5,'Lots of collection! Sales executives girls are excellent. They Went beyond their scope in getting ready my invitation. Thank you! The security person is very sincere on this work and not accepted the tips too!','2026-03-28 17:21:30.425477',2807,574,1490),('Arul Johnson',4,'I had a really good experience with Baakiyalakshmi. She showed me multiple template options and explained everything in a very polite and humble manner. She was patient throughout the process.\n\nSpecial mention to Sweatha, the editor — she did an excellent job. I shared one template idea from Pinterest, and she recreated it beautifully, even adding a few creative elements like unique icons and subtle design touches that made it look even better than the reference.\n\nI would definitely recommend them for birthday invitation cards. The cost is slightly on the higher side, but the quality of work and professionalism make it worth it. They also delivered the final design one day before the deadline, which I really appreciated.\n\nOverall, a smooth and satisfying experience.','2026-03-28 17:21:30.429172',2808,574,1490),('Dr Kiki',5,'We absolutely loved our wedding invitation cards! The design was elegant, detailed, and even more beautiful that truly reflected our vision. The quality was excellent, and the service was truly outstanding. The entire process was smooth and stress-free! The service was amazing, friendly and very professional. Couldn’t be happier with the final result. We are beyond happy with our wedding invitation cards! Highly recommended!','2026-03-28 17:21:30.433001',2809,574,1490),('RG Janani',5,'The invitation designs and collections at Menaka Cards are excellent. The quality of the cards here is very good. I was very satisfied. This is a great place to buy invitations for your wedding. I definitely recommend it!','2026-03-28 17:21:30.436535',2810,574,1490),('chaitanya prasad',5,'Wedding card design looks excellent. The layout, colors, and overall finishing are very elegant and perfectly match our expectations.\n\nWe truly appreciate the staff for their professional behavior, polite communication, and supportive attitude throughout the process. Their dedication and determination to complete the work at the earliest without compromising on quality is highly commendable.\n\nThank you to the entire team for delivering such beautiful cards with great commitment and efficiency.','2026-03-28 17:21:30.439866',2811,574,1490),('Prithivi Raj',5,'Excellent experience from start to finish! From selecting the card design to the proof section and final delivery, everything went smoothly and professionally. The team was very supportive, printing quality was great, and delivery was on time. Highly recommend for invitation printing!','2026-03-28 17:21:39.751446',2812,575,1494),('ArvINd',5,'I had a wonderful experience with Menaka Cards, Kodambakkam. The entire staff were very friendly and supportive, right from the proofing stage till the final delivery. They were patient, professional, and ensured everything was done exactly as expected.\n\nSpecial appreciation to the delivery staff as well — the person who dispatched the order received us warmly and made the final experience very pleasant. Overall, it was a smooth and satisfying experience.\n\nHighly recommended for anyone looking for quality work and excellent customer service!','2026-03-28 17:21:39.754891',2813,575,1494),('Niresh Magentharan',5,'Great service, I would like to sincerely thank the Menaka Card wedding card design team in Chennai India for their outstanding service. I am a customer from Malaysia, and despite the distance, the entire process was smooth and well-organized.','2026-03-28 17:21:39.758452',2814,575,1494),('Vijay James',5,'An exceptional experience from start to finish. The entire process of selecting and printing our marriage invitation was handled with utmost professionalism and refined taste. A special mention to Mari and Vinarasi for their impeccable service, thoughtful guidance, and attention to the finest details. Their expertise truly elevated the final outcome, resulting in invitations that were both elegant and timeless. Highly recommended for those who value quality, craftsmanship, and personalized service.','2026-03-28 17:21:39.761602',2815,575,1494),('Restaurant 272 Pizza Pizza',5,'I came all the way from Canada to do my wedding invitations and the process was seamless! I worked with esther and prakash did my proofing and editing. They both helped me and made my dream wedding invitation. They were both very patient as well. Thank you for that, definitely check out this place!','2026-03-28 17:21:39.764776',2816,575,1494),('Sweety Mano',5,'Excellent place to print your card….. They have lot of collections and try to bring out the cards that you want… most important it’s a budget friendly place to get your cards done. I had a best experience visiting this place.. thankyou bro…','2026-03-28 17:21:46.312148',2817,576,1498),('Selvam Mohanraj',5,'Small shop but has lots of collection as per customer expectation. He is very kind and knowledgeable person. Cards are available at a low price and the price was negotiable. I had done my brother\'s invitation card. He has done his job very perfect and professionally. Shop located in first floor near main road.','2026-03-28 17:21:46.315306',2818,576,1498),('Gopi Gurusami',5,'Mr Raghavan has done a fantastic job. Delivered the cards on time as committed.','2026-03-28 17:21:46.318739',2819,576,1498),('Thilsath ahmad S',5,'Shop has very good collections and provide the cards according to our requirement. Raghavan sir is so humble, very much responsive, Good in attentive to the customers.\nGiven so much importance to customers n giving more suggestions for the cards.\npatience in card corrections.\nBest shop ever in all aspects. Must visit.','2026-03-28 17:21:46.321996',2820,576,1498),('Divya Nagesh',5,'Requested for Telugu and English printing of my wedding card. Raghavan from Card creations did a fantastic job from content to printing, designs and handover. It was a seemless experience throughout. Thank you.','2026-03-28 17:21:46.325027',2821,576,1498),('N RAJESH',5,'“This place is a total gem! Super friendly team, solid quality products, and smooth service. No stress, no confusion — just good vibes and great deals. Definitely recommending to everyone!”','2026-03-28 17:21:51.947703',2822,577,1502),('Sugu Mar',5,'Really super New Good collection and speed delivery,good customer services','2026-03-28 17:21:51.951062',2823,577,1502),('Ravi Teja V S',5,'Very Good and Unique Collections according to their budget and On time Delivery...👏👏👏👏👏','2026-03-28 17:21:51.952714',2824,577,1502),('Senthil Kumar',5,'Perfect from start to finish! The team was so helpful in customizing our cards, and the final product was flawless. Fast delivery and great communication throughout. Highly recommend!','2026-03-28 17:21:51.954173',2825,577,1502),('sathish kumar',4,'The card quality, design options and service were top-notch..!! Delivery was super quick too..!!\nHighly recommend..!!','2026-03-28 17:21:51.955549',2826,577,1502),('Dhananjeyan B',5,'I recently purchased my wedding cards from Designo cards and was truly impressed with the quality, elegant designs, and timely delivery. They have a wide variety of options to suit every taste and budget. Excellent customer service and attention to detail made the whole experience stress-free. Highly recommended for anyone looking for the perfect wedding invitation!','2026-03-28 17:21:57.774162',2827,578,1506),('Ajith Kumar',5,'They have a very wide range of collections and all of them are very good. They listed to our requirements carefully and drafted the card as per our wish. And the card has come out very well. We are extremely satisfied with the output. The customer service was also very nice.','2026-03-28 17:21:57.777956',2828,578,1506),('Mahendran M',5,'Good service provided and lot of varities available to select...also good customer support','2026-03-28 17:21:57.781649',2829,578,1506),('L.s L.s',5,'The wedding cards are beautifully designed with an elegant and classy look. The quality of the paper is very good, and the printing is neat and clear. The color combination and font style are well chosen, which makes the card look attractive and pleasant. All the details are well arranged and easy to read. Overall, the wedding cards give a premium feel and leave a very good impression.','2026-03-28 17:21:57.784980',2830,578,1506),('Sheila Parmal pillai',5,'I am so happy with the service from this designo cards shop. My invitation cards were printed perfectly and delivered in a very short time. The quality, design, and professionalism were outstanding. Thank you for making my event more special. Highly recommended to anyone looking for fast and reliable service. I\'m from Malaydia and this shop is very reliable.','2026-03-28 17:21:57.788241',2831,578,1506),('Usha Vedavanam',5,'Anantmaya stores had a wide selection of unique wedding invitations and all other wedding related supplies. Myself and Sundari worked with Mr. Rajesh of Anantmaya to design custom thamboolam bags for the family wedding. He helped us design wonderful jute bags with kalamkari pattern,  and ensured the order was delivered on time to the US address.\nWe also ordered thengai koodu, kaash yatra set and custom screen printed curtain. They were awesome and we received a lot of complements at the wedding. We would recommend Anantmaya to anyone without reservation.','2026-03-28 17:22:01.120389',2832,579,1510),('Mukilan Hemanth Kumar',5,'The best in the business. Exceptional service and Impeccable quality! I had an issue with my planned invites last minute with a different vendor, and I found Anantmaya online. Anantmaya and Mr. Rajesh were extremely kind and helpful with taking up the job and getting it done in stellar time. The customisation and the quality was even better than I hoped for. Kudos to the entire team! 10/10 would recommend.','2026-03-28 17:22:01.123976',2833,579,1510),('Poovindran Pillai',5,'We couldn\'t be happier with the exceptional service and exquisite wedding invitation cards provided by this supplier. From start to finish, they displayed unwavering professionalism and dedication to making our special day even more memorable. The quality of the invitation cards exceeded our expectations, and their attention to detail was impeccable. Their customer service was outstanding, with prompt responses and a genuine willingness to accommodate our needs. We highly recommend this supplier to anyone in need of top-notch wedding stationery. Thank you for contributing to our perfect day!','2026-03-28 17:22:01.127598',2834,579,1510),('Hari prasad',5,'Beautiful collection of cards, amazing customer service. Happy with the way they handled the entire process. Always in touch to answer my queries and design updates. Had placed the order on a tight schedule. It was delivered before time. Thanks a lot for the support.','2026-03-28 17:22:01.130983',2835,579,1510),('Salomi Padmanaban',5,'I came to know Anantmaya through a cards printer from Mumbai.  The reference came to be a good choice for me, as it reduced my search for a good wedding card printer in Chennai.  The collections they have is remarkable and unique.  They offer variety with quality.\n\nThough I gave a very short time frame, they understood my urgency and necessity and delivered the cards 2 days before their promise.  I really appreciate the work and dedication. Thanks to Mr. Rajesh and his entire team.  Surely I will refer to my friends and relatives.   All the best Anantmaya.\n\nSALOMI P','2026-03-28 17:22:01.134014',2836,579,1510),('Gowri L',4,'Good service and correct time ku send pannitinga','2026-03-28 17:22:07.319250',2837,580,1511),('Rajesh B',5,'\"We had our baby’s ear piercing ceremony invitation cards printed here, and the experience was fantastic! The quality of the printing was excellent, and the designs were exactly as we envisioned. The team was professional, patient, and delivered on time. Highly recommend their services for anyone looking for beautifully crafted invitations. Thank you for making our special occasion even more memorable!\"','2026-03-28 17:22:07.322720',2838,580,1511),('Raj Mani',5,'Good Service 👍 on Time delivery. very good person 💯','2026-03-28 17:22:07.326376',2839,580,1511),('Ramesh Balasubramanium',5,'Very soft approach owner. Top notch quality affordable price ,committed delivery in time. People can get their greeting card done in 24 hrs that is the service Mr. Karthick does. Kudos to him','2026-03-28 17:22:07.329847',2840,580,1511),('sampath sathyanarayanan',5,'I am glad that we got reference to print wedding invite card at Aishwarya. Mr Karthikeyan was extremely responsive and the cost are very reasonable. I would recommend them for any printing needs.','2026-03-28 17:22:07.333446',2841,580,1511),('Radha Krishnan',5,'Good support for all the staffs. Very excellent service. For the past 12 years my whole family is printing hear only. Highly recommended to everyone.','2026-03-28 17:22:16.116100',2842,581,1515),('jaya shree',5,'Had a wonderful experience at Sriram Cards, west Tambaram. Customer service was excellent. Having more collections of cards for various occasions with affordable price.','2026-03-28 17:22:16.119922',2843,581,1515),('Surya Prakash',5,'Excellent place for wedding and function invitations. Wide variety of designs, clear printing and neat finishing. The staff patiently explained all the options and completed the work on time. Very satisfied with their service.','2026-03-28 17:22:16.123635',2844,581,1515),('Keerthana Sugumar',5,'Very good service and workers and employees are very kind and hardworker.\nEspecially thanks to Rangaraj and team.\nExcellent collections and affordable.','2026-03-28 17:22:16.127172',2845,581,1515),('Ramesh Babu N',5,'Friends card I have purchased. Excellent collection and designs in the shop. Also on time delivery and customer service too good.','2026-03-28 17:22:16.130577',2846,581,1515),('Sona E',1,'Edit to review:\n\nI later asked for 20 more cards and was told that 15 extra cards were already printed and available. I said I’d happily take those 15 easy, right?\n\nSince they were already printed and I had paid a lower per-piece price just a month ago, I naturally expected the same rate. Instead, I was told the price is now higher because the quantity is lower. I fully understand this logic for a new job. But in this case, I was basically adopting already-printed cards that were sitting there like, “Please take us.”\n\nStill, I paid. Because inner peace > price discussions.\n\nWhat I didn’t pay for, was the rude attitude.\n\nWhen I politely asked about the price difference, Mr. Vijay Jain replied in a rude and dismissive tone and dropped the iconic line:\n“We are not selling gold to keep increasing prices.”\n\nSir… agreed.\nBut I also wasn’t buying gold.\nJust wedding cards.\nWith emotional attachment.\n\nThey genuinely have beautiful cards and excellent work — unfortunately, the customer experience comes with a complimentary stress test.\n\nI truly had plans to come back for my other invitations and recommend them to my friends and family. After this visit, I will now only recommend them… to people I don’t like. (Just kidding. Mostly.)\n\nFrom the moment I walked into the store, the vibe was not “Welcome!”  it was more “Why are you back?” I honestly felt like I was asking for a favour, not placing a paid order.\n\nBy the end of the conversation, choosing another printer felt easier than choosing my wedding outfit.\n\nGreat cards. Tough conversations.','2026-03-28 17:22:22.543473',2847,582,1519),('Kailash Patel',5,'Love their collection and designing, very elegant and printing is very neat. The design collections are very unique and have a variety of options to choose from. It was a wonderful experience at the shop, everyone was very patient while guiding us through all the different collections of wedding invitations.','2026-03-28 17:22:22.545906',2848,582,1519),('Shobi',5,'They are amazing! They handled all of our wedding invites, gifts & gift bags, cake boxes and pallahram boxes. They made our logo beautifully and shipped to the UK. We were so impressed with how easy our communication was and how quickly our items arrived. They are brilliant. I’d recommend them to everyone!','2026-03-28 17:22:22.548189',2849,582,1519),('fasiha abdul',5,'Shankesvar Cards did an amazing job with our wedding invitations! The designs were elegant, the print quality was excellent, and the team was professional and responsive throughout the process. Everything was delivered on time, and our guests loved the invites. Highly recommended!','2026-03-28 17:22:22.550265',2850,582,1519),('Maitreyi Ramaswamy',5,'We had a wonderful time working with the team at Sankesvar Cards. They were very accommodating to all of our requests and patient with us as we went back and forth on our printing choices! They showed us many samples so we could get an idea and feel for the cards. Our cards turned out beautifully and we are extremely happy with the results. Highly recommend working with them!','2026-03-28 17:22:22.552058',2851,582,1519),('Mangalam Studio',5,'Sangeetha poorichand The overall approach was very professional and impressive. They were extremely patient with corrections and made all the necessary changes without hesitation. Even after multiple revisions, they ensured everything was done properly and delivered the final output perfectly. Throughout the entire process, they were supportive and attentive to details. My overall experience was truly very pleasant and satisfying. Thanks John sir.','2026-03-28 17:22:24.583675',2852,583,1520),('Lakshmi Priya',5,'We had an amazing experience working with Mr. John for my brother’s wedding invitation. From the very beginning.The design was elegant, well-organized, and every small detail was handled with great care. His patience with revisions and quick responses made the entire process smooth and stress-free.Thank you, Mr. John, for creating such a memorable and classy wedding invitation for our family. Highly recommended!','2026-03-28 17:22:24.587527',2853,583,1520),('Bhargavi Mohankumar',5,'Amazing experience with Lovely Cards! 😊 Ordered a custom invitation card for a family function and they nailed it. Design, print, everything was top-notch. Highly recommend for all your card needs! Special thanks to dinesh for his timely great customer service 👏','2026-03-28 17:22:24.591324',2854,583,1520),('ram kumar',4,'Recently ordered friends card here for my marriage. There was a lot of collections to choose from. Customer support for order, design and delivery, all were great here. Really satisfied with their service.\nBut cards rates were higher from what was mentioned on their website, hope it gets rectified soon.','2026-03-28 17:22:24.594742',2855,583,1520),('Elson Franklin',5,'Absolutely delighted with the service provided! They delivered on time, and their collection is vast and stunning. Customization options were fantastic, and the quality of printing was top-notch. The attention to detail and customer support were exceptional. Highly recommend for any occasion. Their designs are creative and elegant, making them perfect for weddings, birthdays, and more. Contact number given here is always either busy or not reachable. I hope this is fixed','2026-03-28 17:22:24.598076',2856,583,1520),('Sruthi Rajeev',5,'I got my brother\'s wedding invitation card from here. Their service is great, value for money. They wr patient enough to change the proofs multiple times in a day, trying different colour options. Thanks a lot. Everyone whoever received invitation card told us that that design is unique.','2026-03-28 17:22:31.272269',2857,584,1521),('Venkatesh Waran',5,'An excellent place for wedding cards! Wide variety of elegant designs and very good print quality. The team guided us nicely from selection to final delivery. We are very happy with the service. Thank you for making our wedding invitations special!','2026-03-28 17:22:31.275980',2858,584,1521),('logeswariy selvaraju',5,'I discovered Elroi Wedding Cards on Instagram and was instantly captivated by their beautiful designs. That’s when I reached out to Mr. Senthil (whom I fondly call anne). From the very beginning, he handled everything with such professionalism, care, and dedication—truly an excellent job from start to finish.\n\nAnne was incredibly helpful in guiding us through the process, from selecting cards that fit our budget to refining the designs just the way we envisioned. Though we’re from Malaysia, the distance was never an issue—he was always responsive and ensured we felt supported every step of the way.\n\nWe took almost two months to finalize the cards due to our many edits, but Anne was extremely patient and accommodating. He never made us feel rushed and gave genuine attention to every little detail. The final product was nothing short of amazing—excellent quality, beautifully packaged, and absolutely loved by everyone at home.\n\nWe’re so grateful to have chosen Elroi Wedding Cards for our big day. Thank you, Anne, for being such a key part of our wedding journey.\n\nLots of love from KL, Malaysia to Chennai, India. Highly recommended!','2026-03-28 17:22:31.279847',2859,584,1521),('Kartik sundar',5,'Wonderful place to have your wedding cards printed. The owner was very kind, courteous and gave lot of wonderful suggestions. The cards were very economical. I had my wedding and reception cards printed from here they surpassed my expectation. I would really recommend Elroi cards for others!','2026-03-28 17:22:31.283377',2860,584,1521),('Vignesh Givind',5,'Amazing collection of card design. We\'ve had the best experience with Elroi wedding cards.  Brother senthil was patient enough to listen to our requirements and suggest many options.\nBudget friendly!\nHighly recommend Elroi\'s service!','2026-03-28 17:22:31.286972',2861,584,1521),('Nancy Metilda',5,'🥰 Best experience with Krish Cards! I placed a last-minute order for customized wedding cards, and their delivery and output were amazing 🥰. They are budget-friendly too — they delivery cards start from 100 cards also. Thank you for the fast and wonderful 🤩 delivery sister!','2026-03-28 17:22:38.178339',2862,585,1525),('Yoaghesh B',5,'Thank you so much, Akka!\nYou truly helped us at the last moment, and we are extremely grateful for your support. The invitations were 100% perfect and matched our expectations beautifully. We couldn’t have asked for anything better 😃🩵','2026-03-28 17:22:38.181588',2863,585,1525),('Rohit Vijay',5,'I had a great experience with printing cards. They patiently made all the changes and requests in the proofreading process and delivered the cards on time. I am happy with their work and hope to do future projects with them.','2026-03-28 17:22:38.184676',2864,585,1525),('Prabha Karan',5,'Invitation card collection, beautiful and contomised card collection very nice, final finished superb, making so good thank you so much for all💐💐💐💐','2026-03-28 17:22:38.188027',2865,585,1525),('Pradeepa 3009',5,'First of all thank to KRISH CARDS AND PRINTERS. I have ordered logo Stickers 500pcs very affordable prices. One pcs just Rs.2 rupees and quality was of print outstanding. Best place to get customized stickers and all printed work. Worth for money. 💖','2026-03-28 17:22:38.192142',2866,585,1525),('Prakash Vijayan',5,'Thanks a lot for your service Ms. Bhuvaneshwari mam from Artist Maya cards, this is second time we are placing invitation printing with them and they are so supportive in listening all our queries, customisation requests, the wow factor never miss when you touch, feel the invitation cards, value for money and time we spend , wish to be a forever customer ❤️❤️❤️❤️🫶🏽🫶🏽🫶🏽🫶🏽 thanks again 🙏🏽','2026-03-28 17:22:44.471379',2867,586,1529),('Sreeni V',5,'The customer service was fantastic right through the process. Bhuvaneswari was very helpful and patient in getting the card design and content refined to our expectations - and  also arranging to courier the cards. Highly recommended.','2026-03-28 17:22:44.474421',2868,586,1529),('Chandra Sekaran',5,'From ordering till the delivery of the invitations , every activity went smoothly. The order was executed before time.It was a nice experience. Thanks to  Maya Wedding Cards people.','2026-03-28 17:22:44.477137',2869,586,1529),('maanasi rk',5,'This place is exactly what I was looking for.\nThey were truly helpful and patient with all the requests. They were timely in sending the changes and the final cards. All this was done without visiting them.\n\nI would recommend them highly for traditional cards.','2026-03-28 17:22:44.479786',2870,586,1529),('Ram Venkatesan',5,'I had a wonderful experience with Maya Traditional Cards! The craftsmanship and attention to detail in their cards are simply beautiful. I initially received a damaged product due to shipping, but the customer service I received from Bhuvaneswari was exceptional. She was kind, responsive, and immediately arranged for a free replacement (international shipping) without any hassle. It’s rare to find businesses that combine high-quality products with such genuine care for their customers. Highly recommend Maya Traditional Cards – both for their elegant designs and outstanding service!','2026-03-28 17:22:44.482348',2871,586,1529),('yasmine bowsiya',5,'I’m genuinely impressed with how the invitation turned out. The design, finishing, and overall quality exceeded my expectations. The detailing was sharp, the material feels premium, and the final output reflects real craftsmanship and professionalism.\n\nThank you for delivering not just a product, but an experience. I highly recommend Aarum Cards!','2026-03-28 17:22:56.928648',2872,587,1533),('Ramani Vaidyanathan',5,'Aarum Cards: Simply the Best of the Best\n\nAarum Cards didn’t just meet my expectations—they far exceeded them in every aspect, from the production quality and printing of the cards to the overall experience of working with Prasanth and his dedicated team. Unlike many companies focused solely on profit, Aarum Cards prioritizes delivering a truly high-quality customer experience.\n\nIt is a genuine blessing to have a company like Aarum Cards in India today—one that upholds superior work ethic and consistently provides exceptional service. Businesses across all sectors could learn a great deal from their commitment and professionalism.\n\nThank you, Aarum Cards, for setting such a remarkable standard!','2026-03-28 17:22:56.932302',2873,587,1533),('Durai Raj',5,'Aarum cards - Highly recommended for all kind of invitations. Variety of designs with budget friendly... They can deliver on time and they don\'t give false commitments. Personally I like them politeness and the way they treat the customers.','2026-03-28 17:22:56.935137',2874,587,1533),('Kav Vj',5,'We absolutely loved the end product of the wedding invitation. It exceeded our expectations! Prasanth was also very patient in our queries and was quick to answer and help us in any way that he could. He also provided suggestions on the content and design of the card which I appreciated. He was able to get the wedding cards ready within the short amount of time that I had requested as I was flying back to Singapore and needed it printed urgently. I would highly recommend Aarum cards. Both the quality of the cards and the service was top notch! Highly recommend to anyone that is looking to print any invitations to go for Aarum, even if you are based overseas!','2026-03-28 17:22:56.937602',2875,587,1533),('Janani Udhayakumar',5,'Aarum Cards comes highly recommended for all of your invitation needs. From choosing our wedding invitation from a variety of alternatives to finishing the proof and delivering the cards on schedule, Prashanth Anna was of great assistance to us. The cards he displayed were of excellent quality and were reasonably priced in relation to the market.','2026-03-28 17:22:56.939841',2876,587,1533),('Pranoy Mathews',5,'⭐️⭐️⭐️⭐️⭐️\n\nI had a wonderful experience with this wedding invitation store. The team was very professional, and I received my wedding cards well before the promised date, which was such a relief during the busy planning period. The quality of the cards exceeded my expectations, and everything was exactly as I had envisioned.\n\nA special thanks to the sales team – they were extremely helpful, patient, and made the whole process smooth and stress-free. Their guidance and attention to detail really stood out. They edited my card alot of times with patience.\n\nHighly recommend this store to anyone looking for beautiful invitations and excellent service!','2026-03-28 17:23:08.082208',2877,588,1537),('n ew',5,'Im extremely happy with invitation cards, the team was very professional, patient with my customization request . Overall Excellent service','2026-03-28 17:23:08.085942',2878,588,1537),('ALLI ELUMALAI',5,'Professional team and they have a very good collections of wedding invitations. Throughout the process, team was very supportive and delivered the invitation cards well before their commitment date.','2026-03-28 17:23:08.089668',2879,588,1537),('senthil kumar',5,'Walked into Menaka cards outlet @ Keelkattalai.. awesome response and customer service was par excellence.\n\nManimekalai- customer executive @Keelkattalai : Thanks for your support during choosing the card, and ur timely service/response starting from proof edit till card delivery 👍','2026-03-28 17:23:08.093108',2880,588,1537),('Ananthakrishnan C',4,'Usually I used to print all our functions invitations here only. The way of showing varieties of cards and advising during proof corrections by your staffs are appreciable.\nKeep it up 👍','2026-03-28 17:23:08.097431',2881,588,1537),('Senthilkumar R',5,'Jaishree Cards delivered an outstanding experience for my wedding invitations! The collection is vast with trendy designs, and provided expert guidance to customize exactly what I needed, including premium paper and quick printing. On-time delivery, affordable rates, and impeccable quality.Special thanks to Vimal Sir for his calm guidance throughout the entire process, making it stress-free.','2026-03-28 17:23:11.785358',2882,589,1541),('Murty Anantapalli SVS',5,'Extremely pleased with the quick and quality service. I just wanted 20 cards that too within a day but without compromise on quality as well as design. All requirements were perfectly met with great professionalism and best price. Thanks to Mr Vimal 🙌❤️','2026-03-28 17:23:11.788602',2883,589,1541),('Grelyne Esthetics',5,'This place is actually really good. Despite the appearance, they actually focus on what you exactly need and put effort into both designing and the quality of the prints. One thing that i like the most about them is their discipline in sticking to a deadline. I would say places like these need more promotion to stick out from the grand and cliché card shops that dont deliver good quality just because they got a popular name.','2026-03-28 17:23:11.792134',2884,589,1541),('Raja Rathinam',5,'I have placed an order(Netkundram) for invitations for an occasion in our family. The hospitality, detication and professional work of Mr.Vimal was very very pleased and I have become a regular customer to this concern. I assure you will get a quality and cost effective service from jaishree card\'s','2026-03-28 17:23:11.796087',2885,589,1541),('praveena ravikumar',5,'Thanks sir for really taking greats efforts for designing and printing the upanayanam Invitation. He has helped me to do in kannada language also with all his efforts..Price is nominal and quality is very good.','2026-03-28 17:23:11.799836',2886,589,1541),('Peakz',5,'I’m extremely happy with getting my wedding invites done from Shri Ranga Cards.\n\nFrom day one , Ravi sir had patiently helped with fully customising my cards exactly as discussed within a week. Thank you for being very accommodating and bringing out my vision to work. Truly appreciate your attentiveness to details and kind approach in delivering the best possible outcome.\n\nDiverse and unique designs at affordable range ,and best execution..I would highly recommend to get your invites  and printing done here without a doubt..Thanks again Ravi uncle for genuinely guiding us through everything , you’re doing an amazing job!!','2026-03-28 17:23:24.281461',2887,590,1545),('Madhav Haygreev',5,'We recently got our Wedding Invitation done from Shri Ranga Cards owned by Mr.Ravichandran. I must say that the output turned out to be stunning. They have a plethora of options to choose from with prices ranging from minimum budget cards to costly ones. Most of the cards we see at Shri Ranga Cards are really very unique & appealing. Mr.Ravichandran is very friendly & accomodative to all our requests to make customizations wherever possible. The overall service was top-notch & above all the quality of output was amazing. The card we chose was an extremely elegant yet rich & royal themed one we truly love how it has come out {pictures of the same have been attached}. I must admit that we could not find such interesting designs & prompt service even in some of the popular card-maker brands in Chennai. Last but not the least kudos to their commitment to timelines. Mr.Ravi promised to provide us the deliverables within a week & adhered to it perfectly. He was also very kind & helpful enough to come home & deliver the whole bunch of cards for us. Highly recommend getting your Invitation Cards for any occasion done from Shri Ranga Cards & Mr.Ravichandran.','2026-03-28 17:23:24.284394',2888,590,1545),('S GURUMURTHY',5,'Just a single visit to Sri Ranga Cards was enough for us to realize that it is the best place to get invitation cards. They offer an innumerable variety of beautiful designs to choose from.\n\nMr. Ravichandran patiently listened to our inputs, carefully understood our requirements, and handled everything with great professionalism. The final design was truly superb. He perfectly blended traditional elements with a touch of modernity, making the invitation unique and elegant.\n\nIt’s wonderful to see him maintaining the commitment and legacy of this third-generation family business.\n\nThank you so much, Mr. Ravichandran!','2026-03-28 17:23:24.287627',2889,590,1545),('Ramya Venkat',5,'We got the invitation printed for my son’s Upanayanam function from Shri Ranga Cards, Mylapore, and the experience was excellent. They were very patient in understanding our requirements, suggested traditional designs, and ensured the print quality was perfect. What really stood out was their fast turnaround time, despite a tight timeline, they delivered the cards promptly without compromising on quality. Highly reliable place for traditional function invitations. Would definitely recommend.','2026-03-28 17:23:24.290495',2890,590,1545),('Ganesh V K',3,'M/s Sri Ranga Cards is undoubtedly an amazing destination for print quality, guidance, emotional appeal, sharing of mutual views and adhering to timelines.  Their services are quite impeccable and matchless when compared to market peers.  Whatever we imagined and conceived in our mind turned out very well in black and white in Invitation form and whole credit should go truly to Mr. Ravichandran Sir for his punctuality, guidance  and adherence to timelines set.  The overall experience is very nice and excellent.  Thanks to Ranga Cards for their excellent service and customer orientation.','2026-03-28 17:23:24.293309',2891,590,1545),('Sumathi',5,'It\'s been a great experience printing my marriage invitation with Sripathi Cards right from choosing the invitation till getting the cards delivered on time. The owner patiently explained us the cards designs, asked for changes and checking it back with us after every proofreads etc. Such prompt reply from him and answered our queries as well very politely. We got the cards delivered on time and the price is also very reasonable with great quality print. Thank you.','2026-03-28 17:23:30.123886',2892,591,1549),('Krishnakumar Subbaiyan',5,'Excellent Service & Quality Printing!\n\nWe visited Sri Pathi Cards to get our wedding invitations printed. They completed the entire printing work within just two days with perfect finishing and careful packing. Their content write-up support, Tamil wording correction, and guidance in choosing the right font and colors were really superb.\n\nThe print quality was excellent, and the overall service was truly impressive.\nHighly satisfied with their work — definitely recommended!','2026-03-28 17:23:30.127075',2893,591,1549),('jency priya',5,'Thank you for your support on delivering and printing our invitations within a very limited timeframe. Your commitment, quick response, and attention to the entire process smooth. The final output was neat👌','2026-03-28 17:23:30.130222',2894,591,1549),('Gangadharan R',5,'The owner of Sripathi Cards is extremely responsive and proactive. He patiently accommodates multiple rounds of corrections and ensures every detail is addressed with care. His commitment to quality and timely delivery made the entire experience smooth and reliable.','2026-03-28 17:23:30.133367',2895,591,1549),('arunkumar gunasekaran',5,'Offering a variety of invitation collections at a reasonable cost. Delivering the card in a timely manner with good quality.','2026-03-28 17:23:30.136580',2896,591,1549),('Dhayanidhi Nirmaldevan',5,'This place is not easily identified, but they give excellent service and response. I used the wedding card printing service here and went with the wedding cards in hand. No one is ready to do only printing service, but Bharani cards accepted for printing and done a good job as expected. Thank you!!!','2026-03-28 17:23:39.415900',2897,592,1553),('Uma Rajaraman',5,'Good response from owner prompt in finishing work','2026-03-28 17:23:39.419247',2898,592,1553),('Andrews Jose',5,'Excludes service','2026-03-28 17:23:39.422660',2899,592,1553),('Rahul Kumar',5,'Very reliable','2026-03-28 17:23:39.425836',2900,592,1553),('RENNI I',5,'I would like to thank ‘Sri Krishna Prints’ for giving us the beautiful outcome. I was quite skeptical before giving the order because we got to know in manual cards we can only put traditional colors. But I wanted to go with royal purple color. The designer mam took care of everything and showed various samples of what we were looking for. Mam designs so well. She made sure that we like the alignment, font even the minute details of the print. Her suggestions are always great. I wanted to change a lot of stuffs but she patiently handled everything and most importantly she gave the prints on time. They just took 3 days to finish all the work. The colors of print are damn great as we gave two different types of card. They don’t confuse you with multiple options. They exactly find out what we want. They packed everything so well. Kudos to the entire team ❤️','2026-03-28 17:23:47.858604',2901,593,1557),('Vijaya Kumar',5,'I had given half saree function card for printing....There service and printing quality was SUPERB..','2026-03-28 17:23:47.861984',2902,593,1557),('Sneha Murali',5,'Recently placed our order for baby shower-3 layered invitation , card customisation was done according to our preference . Very neat work and delivered it on time. Thanks for the wonderful service. Highly recommend this place.','2026-03-28 17:23:47.865360',2903,593,1557),('Anandtha Kanna',5,'Surprised with your punctuality. On time invitation delivery for my baby birthday. En number of cards with multiple designs. Quality for price vise versa. Happy being one of your client. Thank you for making our moments beautiful.','2026-03-28 17:23:47.868931',2904,593,1557),('Dinesh kumar',5,'Great Quality & service .Thanks to them\n\nI have stated my new IT startup from here I ordered my first visiting card♥️ it was such an awesome and they just delivered before they promised date ✨\n\nspecial thanks to them','2026-03-28 17:23:47.873135',2905,593,1557),('Kishore Kumar',5,'Searched far and wide to print my sister\'s wedding card, been to many places but trust me this Shop understood what design I had in my mind and exactly replicated, I would have made numerous calls for correction but there was never a hesitation or frustration shown through call. The main concern was the time frame, I needed 800 cards with in a week and they delivered me with in 5-6 days and all the cards were complicated since it had lot of sticking and arranging works.\nPrinting was perfect and I was more than satisfied with them. Recommended for all kind of printings. Thank you KSK Printers and Wedding cards.','2026-03-28 17:24:05.817330',2906,594,1561),('Sai Ashwin',5,'The final product met my expectations and was high quality. The product was delivered on time. The staff was very friendly, and gave suggestions for a better final product.','2026-03-28 17:24:05.820183',2907,594,1561),('Ragland Lancer',5,'KSK printing has done a fantastic job of printing my wedding card. If you\'re looking for a quality screen printer then KSK is the place to go. Highly recommend it.','2026-03-28 17:24:05.822705',2908,594,1561),('Rajaraman Sekaran',5,'Good place to print your invitation and card,\nKSK press owner is the knowledgeable person to design your needs.\nHighly recommended .','2026-03-28 17:24:05.826631',2909,594,1561),('Maheswari Srinivasan',5,'Excellent coordination and very happy with the service. Highly recommend for everyone. Thank you sir 🙏🙏🙏','2026-03-28 17:24:05.829040',2910,594,1561),('Vasanthakumari Selvam',5,'Excellent service from Maruti Printers. Wedding card designs were beautiful, delivered on time, and the staff were very kind and supportive. Their response and coordination were truly impressive.','2026-03-28 17:24:11.722503',2911,595,1565),('Varadarajan Muthukumaran',4,'A customer-friendly shop as they design books and wedding cards as per your requirements. They finish and deliver the printed products on time. The best place to go for those living in and around Pammal neighbourhood.','2026-03-28 17:24:11.725351',2912,595,1565),('Ashwin R',1,'This was a total waste of time, money, and mental peace. Wedding printing is a once-in-a-lifetime requirement, and Maruti Printers clearly cannot be trusted with something so important. I strongly advise everyone to avoid Maruti Printers for wedding or any important printing work.','2026-03-28 17:24:11.728127',2913,595,1565),('GAANA BEATS',5,'Very good staffs and good work they done for my wedding invitation thank you all','2026-03-28 17:24:11.731636',2914,595,1565),('Thangamani R',5,'“Beautiful wedding card designs, on-time delivery, and very kind staff. The response from Maruti Printers was quick and professional. Completely satisfied!”','2026-03-28 17:24:11.735142',2915,595,1565),('Goutham Nathan',5,'One of the best invitation card shops! Elegant designs, premium paper quality, and neat finishing. They customized the card exactly as we wanted. Great customer service and timely delivery.','2026-03-28 17:24:18.841648',2916,596,1569),('Suresh krishnan',5,'Their designs were beautiful and exclusive and a very good customer service. Cards were also perfect . Their quality was amazing overall everything was good. Speedy and on time delivery.','2026-03-28 17:24:18.845370',2917,596,1569),('Nivedha C',5,'Excellent service and more new collections are available with very low price compared to other shops...','2026-03-28 17:24:18.849655',2918,596,1569),('jayanthi jayanthi',5,'Superb customer service, ontime response and affordable price too✨ thank you classy cards😊','2026-03-28 17:24:18.853569',2919,596,1569),('Aravindh Subramanian',5,'I have done for house warming, the cards was elegant with affordable price compare to other shops in Pattabirram.','2026-03-28 17:24:18.857398',2920,596,1569),('Cynthia N',5,'We absolutely loved the design and the work done on the wedding cards. We fell in love with this card as soon as we saw it, and the lettering inside. It was so elegant!\nWe found this store quite by chance, and are so glad we did. Mr Ramesh worked with us very closely for the editing work, and gave us new drafts to look at very promptly after we suggested changes. We were told by many relatives that the process of getting the wedding invites would be extremely hard, long and even painful, but everything happened so quickly and efficiently with Mr Ramesh.\nWe are very happy with his work.','2026-03-28 17:24:25.286634',2921,597,1573),('Seril Kerson',5,'The excellent work and quality: \"I got my invitation cards from them and they were brilliant! The work was superb. I\'m very happy with how they turned out! & their designs were fantastic, and the quality of work was really top-notch. The cost was also great value','2026-03-28 17:24:25.289204',2922,597,1573),('Anand V',5,'I had an excellent experience with RK Wedding Card. The collection of wedding cards is beautiful with many unique and elegant designs. The best part was that the owner personally attended to me and guided me throughout the selection and customization process. He was very polite, patient, and supportive, which made the whole experience smooth and stress-free.\nThe printing quality is superb, prices are reasonable, and delivery was on time. Highly recommended for wedding invitations!','2026-03-28 17:24:25.291431',2923,597,1573),('Monisha Moni',5,'We are so happy and grateful to R.K. Wedding Cards for creating such a beautiful invitation for our son’s first birthday! 💙\nA special thank you to Ramesh Sir, who treated our order with so much care and kindness. He made sure every detail was perfect and the design came out even better than we imagined.\nThank you once again for making our little one’s first birthday invitation so memorable! 🎉✨','2026-03-28 17:24:25.293809',2924,597,1573),('reema mary',5,'We recently worked with RK cards for our wedding invitations, and the entire experience was absolutely seamless. From the very beginning, they were attentive to our ideas and patient with our changes. The designs were elegant, customizable, and truly captured the essence of our celebration.\n\nThe quality of the cards exceeded our expectations—rich in detail, with beautiful finishing and premium materials. They managed to deliver everything on time, and their customer service was exceptional throughout the process.Thank you for seamless experience','2026-03-28 17:24:25.295896',2925,597,1573),('Udhaya Kumar',5,'Good printers, can do all types of printing and calendars with low cost and quick delivery. Recommended to all around perungalathur location.','2026-03-28 17:24:28.587693',2926,598,1577),('AYAAN AKBAR A',5,'I\'m regularly watching ur videos in YouTube u r doing good job... As a customer I\'m very satisfied... Last 10yrs u r doing great job and printing work 🙏🙏🙏💯','2026-03-28 17:24:28.589327',2927,598,1577),('Catering Balakrishnan Catering Balakrishnan',5,'Experience in printing 44 years. Timely Delivery low cost. Friendly approach. I appreciate. Good luck for ur future pandian & manoj','2026-03-28 17:24:28.590814',2928,598,1577),('Ralph Prince',5,'Fantastic work done by Manoj.. highly recommended.. price is also reasonable.','2026-03-28 17:24:28.592244',2929,598,1577),('Boopalan E',5,'On time delivery done... Really amazing for printing really so good... Best price worth','2026-03-28 17:24:28.593679',2930,598,1577),('Prem Kumar.V. CMA',5,'Am really appreciating their dedicated work and for the following...\n1.Good designing work...\n2. On time delivery...\n3. Very reasonable price in and around Poonamallee\n4. Quality cards\n5. More collections of cards with reasonable prices','2026-03-28 17:24:35.961921',2931,599,1578),('veera pandian',5,'\"I had a fantastic experience ordering my invitation cards from Suresh wedding cards. The variety of designs available made it easy to find something that suited my event perfectly. The cards were high quality and looked professional, with vibrant colors and elegant details. The customization process was simple, and I loved that I could personalize every detail to fit my needs. The customer service was exceptional, helping me with all my questions and making sure everything went smoothly. My order arrived quickly and well-packaged. I will definitely be ordering from them again in the future!\"','2026-03-28 17:24:35.965045',2932,599,1578),('Itzme Karthi',5,'Punctuality is perfect and workwise samrt amd neat..🙂thanks for your Help and Support..🙏','2026-03-28 17:24:35.967835',2933,599,1578),('Giridharan .v',5,'Cheap and best printing press in poonamalle, friendly customer service! More collections and quick delivery!','2026-03-28 17:24:35.970380',2934,599,1578),('GOPINATH K',5,'Best shop for Invitations card, Top quality at the same time with budget rate. We have purchased for my sister\'s engagement. Compared to parry\'s and other wedding card. Shop,this shop is best around Poonamallee.','2026-03-28 17:24:35.973405',2935,599,1578),('Harshitha Parandaman',5,'I had a wonderful experience at Nidi Cards. I wanted to print just a single wedding card for someone very special, but many well-known wedding card shops were not willing to help since it was only one card.\n\nHowever, when I visited Nidi Cards, they were extremely kind and supportive. They not only agreed to provide the card, but also patiently suggested many creative ideas on how to print it and guided me on the best ways to do it within my budget.\n\nWhat impressed me the most was how much they respected the emotional value behind my request. They truly prioritized customer needs and took the time to help me achieve exactly what I wanted.\n\nThey also have a fantastic collection of wedding cards, and everything is very affordable since they are wholesalers.\n\nI genuinely loved my experience here and highly recommend Nidi Cards to anyone looking for beautiful wedding cards at a great price with excellent customer service.','2026-03-28 17:24:43.431265',2936,600,1582),('Maha rajasekaran',5,'I requested each and every detailed to be perfect however it was more beautiful than what I expected! Thank you so much Nirmal bro and team for making our day more special by giving your best♥️','2026-03-28 17:24:43.434379',2937,600,1582),('magesh S',5,'They had a limited collection, but the quality was good and budget-friendly, with a variety of price ranges. We finally ended up purchasing our wedding invitations from here, definitely worth checking out!','2026-03-28 17:24:43.437470',2938,600,1582),('Udaya Elvis',5,'Iam very happy to give review to nidi card palace. Iam regular customer and they will provide lot of variety in low price. Thanks to nidi card palace','2026-03-28 17:24:43.439959',2939,600,1582),('Dharun Varun',5,'I really like your card design and everything looks good to me, i am completely satisfied with this House warming card, i am very Happy to visit your shop.... Thank you so much Nidi Card Place.... 🥰🥰🥰👍👍👍✨✨✨','2026-03-28 17:24:43.442626',2940,600,1582),('Sophie McConnell',5,'Very good service. Did prescription pad and it was delivered on time with good quality','2026-03-28 17:24:50.776824',2941,601,1586),('Nagendran V',5,'Quick service at best in market price','2026-03-28 17:24:50.779117',2942,601,1586),('Srilatha V',5,'I have contacted the shop to design and print first flight certificate for my son.. they have made excellent job that too in very short time i gave time limit only 2 hrs. Nice work keep it up','2026-03-28 17:24:50.781682',2943,601,1586),('Sushma M',5,'Printed my invitation at Ravimathi Printer. Excellent quality at an affordable price. Thank you so much, sir, for the wonderful service!','2026-03-28 17:24:50.784303',2944,601,1586),('Soundara Rajan B',5,'Excellent support and good service. Very prompt in support throughput the process.','2026-03-28 17:24:50.786444',2945,601,1586),('jothi lakshmi',4,'We print out wedding invitation here. Comparative to other printing house one of the best shop in saidapet. Must visit. They print out ceremony cards as our wishes. Many compliments received from our relatives and colleagues. Card was worth money and design. Affordable range cards are available here....','2026-03-28 17:25:02.535158',2946,602,1590),('jai krishna',5,'We good creativity thinker. And very good design and also properly well organized','2026-03-28 17:25:02.539591',2947,602,1590),('Suresh Sundar',5,'Excellent quality and timely delivery. The invitations came out beautifully. Highly recommended','2026-03-28 17:25:02.542961',2948,602,1590),('Harharmahadev Jai guruji',5,'Very good job, immediate response. Perfect for marriage invitations and other auspicious events.👍👍👍','2026-03-28 17:25:02.546067',2949,602,1590),('Prabha Ananthanarayanan',5,'Mr Prabhu was able to understand our requirements very well and was very patient and flexible to make all the changes needed. The cards reached us as promised . I would fully recommend them for all printing needs.','2026-03-28 17:25:02.549782',2950,602,1590),('Kannan Lankaraman',1,'Don\'t fall for the ratings. Highly unprofessional experience and very poor service.\nProof was shared, feedback was given, but not all corrections were incorporated. Despite responding within minutes, I was later informed that printing had already started.\nThe final output looked rushed, with poor font choices and unnecessary white space. The bride and groom names were not given proper emphasis.\nFor an event as important as a wedding, this level of carelessness is unacceptable. Please avoid this vendor as there are other better options available.','2026-03-28 17:25:11.080165',2951,603,1594),('gowtham krishnan',5,'I\'m thoroughly impressed with the card invitation printer! The print quality is stunning, and the colors are vibrant. I used it to print wedding invitations, and they turned out exactly as I envisioned. The printer is easy to use, and the setup was hassle-free. The customer support team is also very responsive and helpful. Highly recommend it for all your invitation printing needs!','2026-03-28 17:25:11.084463',2952,603,1594),('Divya 95',5,'A beautifully designed card elegant, graceful, and The colors, font, and layout are stunning a perfect Beautiful card!','2026-03-28 17:25:11.088353',2953,603,1594),('Revathi A',5,'Dream Day Cards did an amazing job! I’m extremely satisfied with their work and timely delivery. The invitation card turned out beautifully. Thank you, Dream Day Cards, for creating such a lovely design','2026-03-28 17:25:11.091809',2954,603,1594),('Durga',1,'Worst experience. I ordered 500 wedding cards but I received only 495 in that 495. 6 cards they don\'t give invitation covers. Also some printing mistake. That shop owner didn\'t give proper response. I really had a bad experience.','2026-03-28 17:25:11.095299',2955,603,1594),('Vimal Raj',5,'Nice collection','2026-03-28 17:25:18.829324',2956,604,1598),('Adesh Pandey',3,'Amazing collection of functions cards','2026-03-28 17:25:18.832764',2957,604,1598),('Praveen Kumar',5,'Very best','2026-03-28 17:25:18.836660',2958,604,1598),('Gopi nath',4,'Good','2026-03-28 17:25:18.839969',2959,604,1598),('Suresh Kanna',1,'Quick service','2026-03-28 17:25:18.843093',2960,604,1598),('Bhaskar MC',5,'In 2015 my good friend gave me one of the most unique and memorable wedding invites I ever had the pleasure of receiving, made by a designer based in Chennai. I held onto it with the hopes that one fine day, I would find the makers and visit their store.\n\n10 years later- I track down the business to a local shop, and take my fiancée to the Lotus Invitations storefront in T. Nagar, where we were immediately blown away by the vast collection of available card designs. The creativity and quality put into each and every design was impressive, and it didn\'t take long for us to find exactly what we were looking for.\n\nWe were greeted by the amazing Ms. Adhi Lakshmi, who has owned the business since 2009. She took care of us with her suggestions, recommendations, and patience: answering every question we threw at her. Nothing was off the table, every customisation was available and every option possible - from paper GSM thickness to bulk pricing to custom artwork - her response was always \"I can do that for you.\"\n\nAfter making a selection and receiving a quote, we commissioned Lotus for a small order, with half of the cards to be sent to Australia via Int\'l courier (at extra cost). The drafting process was quick and timely, and the turnaround between placing the final order and receiving the invites was mere weeks, with Int\'l shipping arriving in 4-5 days (DHL recommended). While it was a tad more expensive than other card designers, the per card cost can be made cheaper for larger orders, please ask the staff for how you can customise your order.\n\nReceiving our wedding cards has been nothing short of a dream come true, and we couldn\'t be happier with the results. Thank you Ms. Adhi Lakshmi and the graphics + printing team at Lotus for the care and incredible customer service - we will definitely be sending people your way!','2026-03-28 17:25:27.855991',2961,605,1602),('Madhumitha M',5,'Amazing experience! I’m truly grateful to the whole team. From start to finish, everyone was supportive, attentive, and genuinely committed to ensuring a smooth experience. A special appreciation and gratitude to Mrs. Adhilakshmi - who puts her whole heart into helping customers, listens patiently to our preferences, and guides us with thoughtful, professional suggestions that really make a difference. Her sincerity and commitment reflect the team’s overall excellence....\nThank you to each one of you for delivering such exceptional service and making the entire process feel effortless and pleasant.','2026-03-28 17:25:27.859827',2962,605,1602),('Archana Chinnappan',5,'I ordered my wedding invitations from Lotus and I couldn’t be more happy with the final product! From start to finish, their communication was great. They really helped me bring my vision to life! And I did this all over the phone as I am in the US, so it was good to know how trustworthy they were!','2026-03-28 17:25:27.863530',2963,605,1602),('bhavika agarwal',5,'Absolutely amazing experience!!! I had an urgent requirement and they handled it beautifully. The print quality was excellent and the team delivered everything much sooner than expected. I’m really grateful for their dedication and quick turnaround. I was coordinating with Adhi Lakshmi and she was beyond amazing, extremely supportive, prompt and professional throughout the process. Highly recommended!','2026-03-28 17:25:27.866850',2964,605,1602),('Revathy Baba',5,'Very much impressed with lotus exclusives particularly jhatin & team hats off . The wedding invites of both my sons was beyond expectations. Perfectly done on time with finesse. Trust me you’ll not get disappointed. We were extremely happy looking at the invite. Staff adi Lakshmi is very understanding and efficient.','2026-03-28 17:25:27.870835',2965,605,1602),('Yamuna Shanmugasundaram',5,'I got my housewarming invitation cards printed at Imperial Cards, Guduvanchery, and I am very impressed with their excellent service. The team was approachable and responsive, making content coordination and corrections easy. The print quality is outstanding, and my order was delivered on time. I appreciate their professionalism and attention to detail. Highly recommended to anyone in the area!','2026-03-28 17:25:44.170435',2966,606,1606),('Gokula krishnan Krishnan',5,'The service at the invitation card printing shop was outstanding. The team was professional, responsive, and ensured that the final design matched my expectations perfectly. The print quality and craftsmanship were excellent, and the invitations were delivered well within the promised timeline. I highly recommend this shop to anyone looking for high-quality, customized invitation cards and great customer service','2026-03-28 17:25:44.173300',2967,606,1606),('Sabarinathan Eaganathan',4,'Quality is super, Able to customize our need in ease. Even less number of counts they dedicatively printed provided in hand. Price also reasonable according to counts.','2026-03-28 17:25:44.176573',2968,606,1606),('DURGA PRASATH N',5,'I approached Imperial Cards and received excellent service. The team was friendly and patient, and they carefully handled all of our corrections. Highly appreciated—thank you!','2026-03-28 17:25:44.179227',2969,606,1606),('Vasanth Siva',5,'Delivery time and printing quality is very good. We are purchasing a card from showcarpet and printing only is here, so design a card and printing quality is also good.','2026-03-28 17:25:44.182150',2970,606,1606),('Ms',5,'Excellent customer service and very reasonable pricing. My order was delivered right on time, exactly as promised. This is a great place to buy invitation cards for all occasions. The quality, professionalism, and smooth experience make it highly recommended.','2026-03-28 17:25:51.297100',2971,607,1610),('Rio Madhan',5,'Its Great work , marvelous designs here, recently  I done my card here,  beautiful work  tq so much ✨','2026-03-28 17:25:51.299835',2972,607,1610),('RAVICHANDRAN N',5,'Great experience. Delivered well before committed  time. Nice courteous people. Have been printing invitations from them for more than 10 years. Would strongly recommend them. Ravi','2026-03-28 17:25:51.302990',2973,607,1610),('Arun Chellam',5,'Very good trending collection and model\'s. I have had very good service and reasonable price on delivery commitment...','2026-03-28 17:25:51.305793',2974,607,1610),('naveed ahmed',5,'Very good designs available here and invitations are timely delivered. Also shop incharge is very kind and cooperative','2026-03-28 17:25:51.308401',2975,607,1610),('Mangalam Narayanan',5,'In January we visited Menaka Cards Tambaram outlet for printing of traditional marriage invitation (மஞ்சள் பத்திரிகை) - for both bride side and groom side - and single card marriage invitation in english for the girl side.  All the three invitations came out very well and are appreciated by all.  Girl\'s parents were particular about the design and colour of the single card invitation for which they had sent a reference card too.  They were very happy and thoroughly satisfied with the printed card sent to them, which was more than their expectations.\n\nWe should thank the store in-charge Mr. Balaji and other staff, particularly Ms. Rani, who showed much patience and took care of our demands for all the three invitations.  Here  I should convey my whole hearted appreciation and thanks to the staff for delivering groom side traditional invitation one day before the due date.  Ms. Rani called us at about 9.30 pm in the night to discuss about the first proof.  Such was her dedication towards the work.  Thanks to her.','2026-03-28 17:25:58.920742',2976,608,1614),('Ajith Kannan',5,'I recently purchased marriage invitation cards from Menaka Card Tambaram, and I am extremely happy with their service. They have a wide range of collections and patiently showed multiple design options until we finalized the best one. The team is very polite and patient — they made more than 8 rounds of corrections exactly as per my request without any hesitation.\n\nThe print quality was excellent, they delivered the cards on time, and the pricing was very reasonable and affordable.\n\nHighly recommended for anyone looking for beautiful wedding invitations with great service and professionalism','2026-03-28 17:25:58.924955',2977,608,1614),('praveen kumar',5,'Mrs.Rani has taken good  care  and was responsible in handling us. And also our house warming invitation cards came out very well. Prompt delivery and good response..Highly recommended place for invitations cards and has good collections.','2026-03-28 17:25:58.929275',2978,608,1614),('Bhargavi Ram',5,'Wonderful experience. There was so many options and Balaji was easy to work with. They were careful about the drafts to make sure everything was perfect and it came out even better than expected. Easy to communicate and everyone was very nice','2026-03-28 17:25:58.932801',2979,608,1614),('sriraam durai',5,'Excellent service rendered by them. They modified the proof several times based on my request and never showed any frustration. They delivered the cards one day before the promised date. Must recommend meenaka cards for everyone','2026-03-28 17:25:58.936820',2980,608,1614),('Mohammed Shadab',1,'Completely uninterested towards certain customers. No flexibility and not open for discussion. Not rude, but just not interested in selling or providing service.','2026-03-28 17:26:13.360384',2981,609,1618),('subhesh adam',5,'Best Expereince for purchasing wedding cards! One stop destination, Affordable price and best service','2026-03-28 17:26:13.361978',2982,609,1618),('ariva vk',1,'They might be affordable or budget friendly but Don\'t visit and don\'t waste your time. We want to follow them often to get delivered properly.\n\nThey working for business minded not customer friendly!','2026-03-28 17:26:13.363401',2983,6