requests and changes, and their turnaround time was so quick. The final online invite they created was absolutely perfect and exactly what I envisioned. If you need an online invite creator, look no further. Great job, team!','2026-03-28 17:26:31.583914',2991,611,1623),('Shiva Ramaraju',5,'Excellent work... with less cost ... The displayed designs are very decent.','2026-03-28 17:26:31.587484',2992,611,1623),('Sanjay Kar',4,'Very quick response and more effective editing my rating 8.5','2026-03-28 17:26:31.591366',2993,611,1623),('madhu chandra uppuluri',5,'Service was very fast and as required. They were very nice and made corrections as required without any questions. Overall much recommended','2026-03-28 17:26:31.595180',2994,611,1623),('Soma Sekhar kaliya',5,'Fast and Perfect design what we need , keep it up 👍🏻','2026-03-28 17:26:31.599661',2995,611,1623),('mohanapriya sekar',5,'Thank you so so much! 💛\nWe walked in today around morning 11:30 a bit stressed saying “we need it today itself”… and you guys delivered brand new, absolutely stunning cards by 4 PM with the biggest smile! 😍\nThe cards have turned out even more beautiful than we imagined! ✨\nHuge respect to your team for such genuine, lightning-fast, and perfect service. From the bottom of our hearts  THANK YOU! 🫶\nFor every future function, your shop is definitely our first and only choice! 💯\nOnce again… THANK YOU SO MUCH! You made our day! 🥰🥳','2026-03-28 17:26:44.312454',2996,612,1624),('Hema Latha',5,'Customer service excellent hand everything greet . Delivery process done sharp printing quality too nice very efficient & supportive','2026-03-28 17:26:44.314204',2997,612,1624),('Jacob',5,'Beautifully designed wedding cards with excellent print quality.\nReally happy with the final output, nice finish and great overall experience!','2026-03-28 17:26:44.315721',2998,612,1624),('Siva Shankari',5,'The service level is excellent and I have continuously edited the invitation more than 8 times  They honoured the commitment of dates of delivery  trust and worthy','2026-03-28 17:26:44.317915',2999,612,1624),('Divyasre',5,'Excellent service.we asked to deliver within 5 days,but they delivered within 2 days itself, printing quality also good.very fast service.Thank you','2026-03-28 17:26:44.319385',3000,612,1624),('Vivasaya Pathai விவசாயம்',5,'Material Quality good\nStaff Nandhini\'s interaction and conversation was good. Thank you so much🙏🏻','2026-03-28 17:26:55.428014',3001,613,1628),('arun kumar',5,'I have ordered multiple poster requirements in KalyanG Designs. The staff name Nandhini co ordinated me towards the design and better suggestions towards the designes and ideas with affordable price and satisfied service. Thank you you KalyanG. I will recommend to anyone especially for new entrepreneur.','2026-03-28 17:26:55.431665',3002,613,1628),('Vignesh Murugaraj',5,'Good service, Customer treating very humble, Designer prabhu very talented person, Reception Nandhini very kind person totally I am satisfied.','2026-03-28 17:26:55.435422',3003,613,1628),('magesh kumar',5,'I ordered a banner from [Kalyan G design and prints], and I’m really happy with their work. The staff name shalini was friendly and helped with quick design corrections.','2026-03-28 17:26:55.440775',3004,613,1628),('Shobana janani',5,'Good work.....on time delivery... friendly staff...quick assistance....clear design ideas....','2026-03-28 17:26:55.444454',3005,613,1628),('Koushik Venkatesh Kannan',5,'Came here to shop for my mom & my aunt\'s jewellery for my wedding & the service by Sneha was wonderful. The jewels looked fantastic & they have an amazing collection in store.\n\nThe bride also shopped from here & her experience was the same.\n\nWould definitely recommend!','2026-03-28 17:27:06.692292',3006,614,1632),('Shruti Sridharan',4,'The collection at this store is quite unique. Malini was very helpful.\nThe only thing is that the majority of the pieces are heavy sets for bridal etc. I wish they had