6-03-28 17:27:09.589689',3013,615,1633),('Rocket',1,'This jewellery will have more hidden charges and product quality was very poor','2026-03-28 17:27:09.591691',3014,615,1633),('saranya soundar',1,'Worst Jewellery no proper response. The employees who is working are owner of this shop and too much costly compared to GRT','2026-03-28 17:27:09.593874',3015,615,1633),('Kaliyamoorthy G',5,'👏Huge collections of high quality. Current Designs including Antiques. Very Good Service by Staff. Prices are moderate. Best Wishes💐','2026-03-28 17:27:13.385444',3016,616,1634),('Sanjana',3,'The collections are little lesser on the shop comparatively. And also prices seem to be on the higher side.','2026-03-28 17:27:13.388794',3017,616,1634),('philomina cynthia',5,'Brides really who want to wear very unique collection without any second option come straight away to BBJ they are outstanding. Visit once so you can recommend this for the other brides as i am writing now. very adorable collections they have','2026-03-28 17:27:13.391988',3018,616,1634),('priyanka S',1,'I don’t recommend this artist for any outdoor services.. I don’t think that her makeup is worth  so much money and her attitude is very bad overall But she talks very sweet in which we all may think that these bad reviews are won’t even for her.... everyone in family and friends circle started scolding the bride for her worst makeup (especially eye and hair styling) which doesn’t even suit her at all....AND SHE IS DEMANDING FOR TRAVEL AND ACCOMMODATION AFTER WE PAID HER SO MUCH MONEY. That too a day before the wedding as though we don’t have any work other than paying her at that instant she messaged me about travel expenses and about the stay in spite of asking her multiple times if she needed any other assistance from our side. Overall we had a very bad experience  with her and worst makeup ever done.','2026-03-28 17:27:13.395529',3019,616,1634),('bhuvi Sridharan',1,'I booked a hair bun jewel with this jewellery store for my sister in law, worst customer service ever. The staff attitude (ROSHAN BANU) was too much to handle and the way she convey and speak to the customer was atrocious. I will not suggest this bridal jewellery to anyone. There are much better bridal jewellery on rent in the city where the customer service was very much appreciated.💥🔥🔥','2026-03-28 17:27:13.399420',3020,616,1634),('Pavithra Kannan',5,'I had an absolutely wonderful, satisfying, and truly memorable experience at the Bluestone Jewelry Ambattur store. From the very moment I entered the showroom, I was greeted with warmth, respect, and professionalism, which immediately made me feel comfortable and valued as a customer. The overall ambience, attention to detail, and customer-focused approach clearly reflect Bluestone’s commitment to excellence.\nI would like to give special and heartfelt appreciation to Mr.Lokesh , Mr.Ajay, and Mr. Shanthosh for their exceptional service and genuine dedication. They were extremely patient, attentive, and knowledgeable, taking the time to carefully understand my requirements and preferences. Every detail was explained clearly and transparently, which helped me make confident and informed decisions. Their friendly attitude, calm approach, and willingness to go the extra mile made the entire experience smooth, enjoyable, and completely stress-free.\nWhat truly stood out to me was the personal care and honest guidance they provided, without any pressure, making me feel respected and valued throughout the process. Because of their outstanding service and professionalism, I can confidently say that I have become a loyal and repeat customer of Bluestone. The team at the Ambattur store truly represents the brand’s core values of trust, quality, integrity, and customer satisfaction.\nI would highly recommend Bluestone Jewelry Ambattur to anyone looking not just for beautifully crafted jewellery, but also for an exceptional, reliable, and heartwarming customer experience. This store and its team have set a very high standard for customer service, and I truly look forward to visiting again in the future.','2026-03-28 17:27:18.188924',3021,617,1636),('Aswin T Dev',5,'The store and the ambience were good with good collections. Special care were taken by Ajay to make the selection process easy, quick and satisfying.','2026-03-28 17:27:18.192480',3022,617,1636),('Renuga subburaj',5,'Nice collection and ambiance Mr.Lokesh gave good service and he cleared all my doubts in products and he explained about the monthly scheme .. I will suggested my friends also I have good experience in Bluestone ambattur','2026-03-28 17:27:18.195643',3023,617,1636),('Reshma Begam',5,'I had an amazing experience shopping at BlueStone.The jewellery designs are beautiful and elegant, exactly as shown online and the quality exceeded my expectations. The customer service team was very helpful and Lokesh got patient in guiding me to the perfect piece, and my order was delivered on time with beautiful packaging. I’m extremely satisfied with my purchase and will definitely shop here again. Highly recommended for anyone looking for stylish, quality jewellery.','2026-03-28 17:27:18.198979',3024,617,1636),('M Madhuritha',5,'I had a wonderful and beautiful experience. They showed me a more option and helped me in choosing the perfect piece that fit in my budget. Thanks for the great service.','2026-03-28 17:27:18.202031',3025,617,1636),('Elakkiya S',5,'Recently I visited AR fashion jewel shop, it\'s really satisfied collections  and that kind of customer service was incredible andif not statisfied with the collections they will try to met customer\'s expectations 👍👑Thank you so much Mrs.Komal sharma❤😇','2026-03-28 17:27:21.652666',3026,618,1638),('sathish adlin',5,'Good collection and good quality very genuine rate I’m happy to purchase on this shop good respect to giving to customers. I suggest to my cousins and my friends','2026-03-28 17:27:21.656114',3027,618,1638),('Bhavani Chandran',5,'Nice collection 🤩..cheap and best collection for jewelery hire','2026-03-28 17:27:21.659655',3028,618,1638),('Sangee 0915',5,'Thanks to AR Fasion Jewellery.Good Bridal Collections. Affordable price and also Good Quality.','2026-03-28 17:27:21.663499',3029,618,1638),('Muna Sami',5,'Nice bridal collection 😁😄😃lowest price compare to other shop ☺️😊😊','2026-03-28 17:27:21.667899',3030,618,1638),('logithswetha3031 logithswetha3031',5,'Good collection …nice original gold looking…','2026-03-28 17:27:28.183061',3031,619,1639),('mala je',5,'Super super collections very good quality I am satisfied very nice','2026-03-28 17:27:28.184568',3032,619,1639),('vicky ranga',5,'Very neat and clean shop and lot of collection are there must visit 🙏','2026-03-28 17:27:28.186185',3033,619,1639),('Kokila Ko',4,'Very nice experience for purchasing','2026-03-28 17:27:28.187833',3034,619,1639),('aliyah kaur',5,'I recently purchased a chain set from visaga jewellery shop, and it was truly love at first sight! The entire collection is stunning, with each piece exuding elegance and charm.I\'m thrilled with my purchase and would highly recommend this shop to anyone seeking beautiful and quality jewelry.','2026-03-28 17:27:28.189531',3035,619,1639),('R D',5,'Highly recommend this shop for bridal rentals. The collections are stunning and very distinct compared to other stores in Anna Nagar. There is a required advance of $2,000, and while the pricing is premium, the \'wow factor\' of their pieces justifies the cost. Excellent choice for brides looking for something special','2026-03-28 17:27:32.422997',3036,620,1643),('sahithya s',1,'If you value your money, your sanity, or your special day, stay FAR away from this store. I rented jewellery for my event, and the piece literally fell apart right before I even got to wear it. Imagine standing there, all dressed up, and the jewellery you paid for snaps like a cheap toy. That’s exactly what happened.\n\nAnd the best part? They refused to reduce even a single rupee from the rental price for something that broke before it even touched my skin. Zero accountability. Zero professionalism. Just excuses and attitude.\n\nTheir customer service is a joke, and their quality is even worse. Don’t let them ruin your event the way they tried to ruin mine. There are plenty of other rental stores that actually respect their customer this one clearly doesn’t.\n\nWhile writing a review, I honestly have no idea how this store still keeps staff with such an attitude. I see a lot reviews mentioning the staff’s. The woman everyone keeps mentioning has absolutely zero idea how to treat customers or even respond properly. She takes no accountability for anything, and for every small thing she has to call someone else to come and handle it. I genuinely don’t understand how she’s still employed — her behaviour, lack of responsibility, and complete absence of basic customer-handling skills make the whole place look totally unprofessional.','2026-03-28 17:27:32.428365',3037,620,1643),('Ashikaa Arumugam',1,'The store has a nice collection of rental jewelry, but the staff’s attitude was very disappointing. The owner, one staff woman, and two boys were there, but none of them seemed interested in helping or showing matching pieces properly. The woman was on her phone most of the time and didn’t assist us at all. But when we finally decided to book, she suddenly came forward and started requesting us to confirm the booking. Clearly only interested when it came to money. It felt very unprofessional. A good collection or name/brand alone isn’t enough if the staff have no courtesy or interest in customers.','2026-03-28 17:27:32.430041',3038,620,1643),('Rizwana Begam',5,'We rented jewellery for my sister\'s engagement and to our suprise it is good in quality and the designs are Soo good and elegant that too in reasonable price. Don\'t hesitate to buy jewellery from them, they never disappoint with their quality and designs❤️.','2026-03-28 17:27:32.432299',3039,620,1643),('monica priya s',5,'Thank you so much to new ideas fashion jewellery. The jewels added more beauty and made my special day more beautiful. Good collections and great service. Thank you Preethi mam for coordinating and help me find the right fit.','2026-03-28 17:27:32.433902',3040,620,1643),('Kavitha Chandrasekhar',5,'If you are looking at hassle free jewellery shopping for any wedding festivities, Aishwaryam in Shanthi colony is a safe bet. The staff are really warm and friendly, which is a plus point.\n\nThey are quick in assessing the need and suggesting the right options. I really liked the approach of staff Aishwarya.','2026-03-28 17:27:43.393915',3041,621,1645),('Nivedha',5,'I had the most amazing experience with their bridal rental jewelry collection! Everything was so elegant and on-trend—exactly what I was looking for to complete my bridal look. The pieces were stunning and perfectly complemented my dress, adding just the right amount of sparkle and sophistication. The quality was fantastic, and the customer service was top-notch. They made the whole process easy and stress-free. Highly recommend for any bride looking for beautiful, affordable jewelry to rent for their special day','2026-03-28 17:27:43.398183',3042,621,1645),('Lakshmi Mukundan',5,'Very vide range of bridal collection with premium quality. Good assistance and pleased behaviour of staff .  Supportive and best suggestion and support by staffs','2026-03-28 17:27:43.401599',3043,621,1645),('deepikha ravi',5,'Lovely collections. I found my dream sets here and extremely friendly people to help you find the perfect match for your big day.','2026-03-28 17:27:43.404786',3044,621,1645),('Aakansha J',5,'really loved their collections with reasonable pricing and prompt helping with suggestion based on our preference','2026-03-28 17:27:43.408212',3045,621,1645),('vaishali Vaishu',5,'I\'m happy satisfied purchasing here\nWhen ever I\'m coming here making me wait and making me special and i purchase 1 product means the way he talks and makes me to buy more and more items\nRashi shop\nThis is not paid promotion\n100 percentage satisfied\nIf u come one time u keep on come to this shop\nIt\'s really worth of buying here','2026-03-28 17:27:46.469006',3046,622,1647),('PRIYANKA SINGHVI',5,'Happy purchasing here reasonable price\nI have placed order here on time delivered negotiations is here sweet people\'s\nNot like other shops','2026-03-28 17:27:46.472637',3047,622,1647),('VIRENDRA SINGHVI (Vinisha Singhvi)',5,'satisfied purchasing here\n100 percentage quality is to good\nprice is reasonable\ni like purchasing here\ni refered my friends and family they are also happy buying here','2026-03-28 17:27:46.476125',3048,622,1647),('Anisha jain',5,'Customised order undertaken here at best finishing I have given them really fabulous fully satisfied I saw the google reviews it’s really true','2026-03-28 17:27:46.479959',3049,622,1647),('Tamilselvik sigamani',5,'I have purchased dollor and coin\nRates are reasonable\nI saw the review and ratings it is true\nIt is small shop but giving best advice of buying gold and silver ornaments and for investment purchase also they are giving best advice you can buy here','2026-03-28 17:27:46.483014',3050,622,1647),('arulmani elango',5,'Very near Ashok Pillar. Wonderful SERVICE..Mr.Rahul.R is very patient ,with EXCELLENT composure.\nHe clarified our doubts and despite our persistent questions, was pleasant and courteous.\n\nThis even when we were just browsing and did not purchase anything !\n\nGreat Service.','2026-03-28 17:27:50.634372',3051,623,1648),('Ravikumar varadharajaperumal',5,'One of the finest place to have good collection. Customer engagement is too good..Mr. Rahul.R we met engaged us too good. One of the nicest person we have met in Tanishq. They will provide good collection. If we need any unique collection in online they will arrange to show us . Mr. Rahul R is specialist in that. O e of the best place to visit is Tanishq Ashok nagar. All the very best Mr. Rahul.R for your future . Thank you Tanishq for a wonderful experience.','2026-03-28 17:27:50.637873',3052,623,1648),('Dekshitha M N',5,'Dear Tanishq,\nI am joyful and grateful for the dedication in restoring my late mother in laws ear stud which we valued dearly… The craftsman in Tanishq Ashok pillar MR. Moovendhar took extra care in restoring the stud to its original beauty…we admire the workmanship of Mr.Moovendhar and we are happy to purchase our jewellery from Thanishq and we look forward to purchase more in near future. We attach the photo of the stud before and after restoration.','2026-03-28 17:27:50.641435',3053,623,1648),('Sathyaseelan',5,'I have met Janaki S, who gave me the right product for my relative. She was very calm and knowledgeable. Suggested the right product and made me understand why I should choose. Overall very satisfactory. Anyday I would recommend her. Well supported by Sumathi & Poornima. Wonderful experience at Ashoknagar.','2026-03-28 17:27:50.645676',3054,623,1648),('Sankaran Muthu',5,'We had a wonderful experience at the store yesterday. The ambiance was excellent — very clean, welcoming, and well-organized, which made us feel comfortable and relaxed throughout our visit.\n\nA special thanks to Mr. Prabhanjan for his outstanding service. He was very friendly, professional, and patient. He clearly explained all the details about the products and the old gold exchange process, which was very useful and transparent. His knowledge and communication helped us make the right decision.\n\nMy sister made a purchase, and we were very happy with the variety of designs and the overall buying experience. Thank you once again to the team and to Mr. Prabhanjan for making our visit so smooth and satisfying. Highly recommended!','2026-03-28 17:27:50.649696',3055,623,1648),('rohini monica',5,'Prefect store for purchasing accessories for any kinda occasions and for the weddings at very very affordable price with best quality. There huge collections available at the store. I would highly recommend this store.','2026-03-28 17:27:53.955781',3056,624,1650),('akshaya selvakumar',5,'I am extremely happy with my online purchase at \"Sparkle by Zing\". It was a beautiful jada billa that I had ordered. A 5 star rating for these 5 reasons.\n1. Timely delivery.\n2. Pocket friendly.\n3. Received Product exactly same as in the picture.\n4. Timely response from Gayathri ma\'am\n5. Good packaging.\nAnd brownie points for the Quality of the Jewellery :)','2026-03-28 17:27:53.958912',3057,624,1650),('tharani d',5,'Hi Gayathri akka...\nThanks for providing us the best quality products... I\'m really satisfied with the quality of that attigai... It\'s so beautiful.... And my MIL was so happy with that... 🤗😍','2026-03-28 17:27:53.962047',3058,624,1650),('Vignesh Sekar',4,'Very good collection of rental jewells and very friendly assisted person bhanu','2026-03-28 17:27:53.966141',3059,624,1650),('Sandhya Hari',1,'Worst service I have ever had.. booked 2set of jewels for wedding and reception .. it was too hectic for me to get ready in the reception as some of the jewels were missing as I found out at the last. These people are getting the payment and adhar card in the initial stage and delivering the jewellery before the day of wedding and not delivering the jewels which is choosed by us and few jewels are missing. I would not recommend this shop for any brides. Be careful when you choose this shop for wedding.','2026-03-28 17:27:53.969029',3060,624,1650),('RAVIKUMAR R V',1,'The jewellery collection is limited, and many expected designs were not available during my visit. Improvement in variety would be appreciated.','2026-03-28 17:27:56.736645',3061,625,1651),('THANISH PRIYAN A C',4,'I\'ve been purchasing from this jewellery shop since my childhood, and it has always been one of my trusted places. They offer good quality jewellery with a wide range of traditional and modern designs. One of the main reasons I’ve continued shopping here over the years is the friendly and polite staff who always made the experience pleasant.\n\nHowever, I’ve noticed that some of the newer staff members are a bit rude and less attentive compared to how it used to be. That said, most of the staff are still friendly, respectful, and helpful, and they take the time to assist you with patience.\n\nOverall, it’s still a good jewellery store with reliable service and quality products. I hope the management ensures that all staff maintain the same customer-friendly attitude that made this place special.','2026-03-28 17:27:56.740211',3062,625,1651),('Fashion gossip 360*Polka Dots',5,'Nice customer service with good professionallity','2026-03-28 17:27:56.743980',3063,625,1651),('Shanmuga Sundaram Balu',5,'Best Customer Service. We have been purchasing jewels with them for more than 30 years, no compromise on quality and reliability. Price always align with the market value. Resale value is much much better when compared to other jewellery stores. I would highly recommend.','2026-03-28 17:27:56.747229',3064,625,1651),('lakshmi venkat',5,'Nice super service I like very much sales executive also kind service','2026-03-28 17:27:56.750849',3065,625,1651),('Vinothkumar Kandasamy',4,'I had such a pleasant experience here!  The staff was so courteous and helpful. They have an impressive collection of bangles, necklaces, and makeup items.  While it might be a little pricey, the quality and selection are worth it! 💍','2026-03-28 17:28:00.488440',3066,626,1652),('suresh sundaram',4,'Beautiful collection of bangles with very good quality and unique designs. The shop is well maintained and the staff are courteous and helpful in showing different options. Prices are a bit on the higher side compared to other shops, but the quality and variety make it worth a visit. Overall, a good place if you’re looking for premium designs.','2026-03-28 17:28:00.492059',3067,626,1652),('renugadevi Bharath',5,'I visited Jazz after seeing their Instagram page. They have a huge collection of bridal sets, and the customer service is excellent. I visited Jazz three times, and on my third visit I booked my bridal rental sets for my reception and muhurtham. Special thanks to Faizel for showing me all the collections and helped me choose the best ones.','2026-03-28 17:28:00.495479',3068,626,1652),('Sruthi Mukunthan',5,'Thanks to Ali Khan - he helped with the bangles matching and very supportive','2026-03-28 17:28:00.499140',3069,626,1652),('radha Ram',5,'Good collection but too costly …they didn’t let to bargain … good experience with Shekar had a nice job for me','2026-03-28 17:28:00.502351',3070,626,1652),('Clatha Devaraj',5,'I’m very happy with this jewellery. The quality is premium, stones are well-set, and it looks classy when worn. Perfect for functions and special occasions.','2026-03-28 17:28:05.832351',3071,627,1654),('Usha shree Sri',5,'#Mahalakshmi fasion jewellery♥️ it\'s perfect match with saree colour for me 💙✨it\'s so beautiful & pretty\nfor my big day😊thnks to mahalakshmi fashion jewelry💐🥳','2026-03-28 17:28:05.835889',3072,627,1654),('Bhuvana Kamal',5,'I visited the shop to get jewelry for festival and marriage ceremony. The sales lady in the shop helped me and showed so many varieties. I got 2 sets which I liked very much. Got 2 more sets for my daughter also for her lehenga sets. Collections are very good.','2026-03-28 17:28:05.840022',3073,627,1654),('Neha Bhanu',5,'Fantastic jewellery shop! They have a really good collection with plenty of stylish and trendy pieces to choose from. The customer experience was great — the staff were friendly, patient, and very helpful. Prices are also quite affordable compared to many other places.\nIf you’re looking for fancy jewellery in Tambaram, this place is definitely a must-visit!','2026-03-28 17:28:05.843526',3074,627,1654),('Rajiv Arjunan',1,'The person quoted one price, but when you came to get the rental, he asked for more money. Such a dishonest fellow, this shop owner.','2026-03-28 17:28:05.847037',3075,627,1654),('Rekha T',5,'I got pearl and diamonds studs with pendant set customised, truly beyond expectations. The set is so lovely and the shine of diamonds speak for the quality. Although I felt it to be pricey but after looking at the piece it\'s worth every penny. Thankyou Gehna for an heirloom worthy GEHNA...','2026-03-28 17:28:08.777165',3076,628,1656),('Devaky Vijayan',5,'My experience from jewelry purchase till delivery has been really great. The designs are unique. Personally for me I prefer jewelry that can be worn everyday .\n\nAnd maximum patterns available on Gehna website are of the variety which can be worn everyday.\n\nWould recommend it to anyone looking for unique and everyday wear pieces.','2026-03-28 17:28:08.780755',3077,628,1656),('Sailaja Suman Malladi',5,'It’s a beautiful nose pin.The diamonds used are very bright and the make is to the perfection.Thank you so much for a prompt shipping too😊','2026-03-28 17:28:08.784502',3078,628,1656),('Hilary Barron',5,'I have been purchasing jewelry from Gehna for the last 10 years. I love the variety of stones and designs that they offer. This ring is my most recent purchase. It looks more amazing in person than in the photo. I have gotten many compliments. I love the unique design. It feels sturdy and solid on my finger. Communication was quick and easy. I had a specific time period that I needed it to arrive and it was ordered and shipped to the US on time. This is one of my favorite jewelry stores in Chennai.','2026-03-28 17:28:08.788155',3079,628,1656),('shweta yavagal',1,'I am very disappointed with my experience on the Gehna. Their buy-back or exchange policy is nonexistent. They are highly non-responsive in spite of regular follow-up. On top of that, the bracelet I received is not good at all. The craftsmanship is extremely poor, especially considering this is supposed to be a gold product. For a premium item, I expected quality, but what I got felt completely substandard.\n\nOverall, a very bad experience. I would not recommend buying from Gehna at all','2026-03-28 17:28:08.791652',3080,628,1656),('tamil selvi',1,'Very worst service they not consider the low budget people\'s, I bought one month before one kada for my son it was broken ,only one day use , they not take back for the  original value of the kada , they reducing the price all waste  etc ... The owner is not consider as a matter 😔 so I came back with the broken kada very bad quality money waste','2026-03-28 17:28:11.789054',3081,629,1657),('Shahe Gaddafi S',5,'Nice collection, reasonable wastage, can develop as big showroom','2026-03-28 17:28:11.793020',3082,629,1657),('sai ram',5,'Past 3 generation we are buying Gold on this shop. We have good relationship like an family members not treated as like an normal customers. Customers relationship was good. Highly recommended','2026-03-28 17:28:11.796331',3083,629,1657),('suresh babu k',5,'Customer delight.  Our family is in touch with them for their 3rd generation. Since their grand fathers time.  Very good people.','2026-03-28 17:28:11.799641',3084,629,1657),('Arunddati',5,'Personalised attention from the shop owner despite a good crowd is to really appreciate. Thanks for the wonderful customer service.','2026-03-28 17:28:11.802753',3085,629,1657),('Hanisha Muralikrishnan',2,'There were numerous collection in shop but the staff behaviour is unacceptable especially female staffs from second floor.If you ask about the product details they were not willing to explain about that. I\'m satisfied for purchases but staff as rude behavioural. Please improvise on this specific service to the customer.','2026-03-28 17:28:15.227768',3086,630,1658),('hacker kim',1,'Very worst pls don\'t order they show first quality item and when you order they give cheap third quality item and doesn\'t respond to messages or text totally different from website','2026-03-28 17:28:15.231111',3087,630,1658),('Milkahl Lokeshwaran',5,'Anita aunty would attend alone with ashiya and sugar akka were very sweet and recommend very good product and they treat us like family 😍😍🥳🥳 very sweet and well be waiting for the next time we come back but sure that still they\'ll treat us family our love everyone 🫶🫶','2026-03-28 17:28:15.234479',3088,630,1658),('jaya keerthanna',5,'Good collection and got all the accessories at one place .\nSuji gave us calm and great service.','2026-03-28 17:28:15.237926',3089,630,1658),('Gayathri Muruganathan',5,'Ashiya service was so good and friendly❤️\nAnitha sister service was very supportive and friendly😊❤️both of them had more patience','2026-03-28 17:28:15.240971',3090,630,1658),('Minnalkodi',5,'I recently rented a jwellery from Kamakhya. They have huge collections and they are unique, excellent and cleanly maintained. The Rental process was smooth. I am happy with the staff service & would definitely recommend','2026-03-28 17:28:18.583140',3091,631,1660),('dhivya priya Sukumar',5,'I chose Kamakhya jewellers for my baby shower.Quality of the the jewellery is very good.Staffs were very friendly & polite.They showed me wide variety of jewellery.Iam very much satisfied.','2026-03-28 17:28:18.586625',3092,631,1660),('sathish babu',5,'Very good collection of bridal jewelleries in Chennai, friendly staff with reasonable price!\n\nThis shop is in Tambaram - camp road junction and i suggest Kamakhya jewellers to my friends as it\'s difficult to find good collection in one place with reasonable price!','2026-03-28 17:28:18.589991',3093,631,1660),('Bharath',5,'Quality of Bridal Jewellery is excellent and price also affordable, new collections and good service.  The perfect place to buy Bridal Jewellery in our chennai.','2026-03-28 17:28:18.593223',3094,631,1660),('Dhana Lakshmi',5,'Last minute of my baby shower function , I got to find this shop and had satisfied my collection . Their service was extremely good and they shown many collections to try politely dealing with me. So I am able to choose good jewellery and the budget also affordable. Quality was so awesome.','2026-03-28 17:28:18.596366',3095,631,1660),('Reena Sundhari',5,'Very unique and beautiful bridal jewelry collection. The sets I chose were absolutely stunning and added a special charm to the occasion. I also truly appreciate that there was no pressure during the return process, which made the experience very comfortable and stress-free. Thank you for your excellent service and wonderful collection.','2026-03-28 17:28:31.014667',3096,633,1665),('shalini shalz',5,'Had a very great experience with Ariya’s bridal set. She showed me the sets that will go good with the trend and matches my saree. Moreover she had a a lot patience and polite. Rental rate was also affordable not too high not to less it was the correct price. She didn’t pressure much to return she was able to understand and accordingly I returned. Definitely would recommend everyone to try at least once.','2026-03-28 17:28:31.018366',3097,633,1665),('yazhini yazhu',5,'I recently rented jewels for my marriage and reception. The quality and look of the jewels was really awesome.\nMy MIL mistook my wedding rental jewels as gold jewellery.\nThey were so obsessed with the jewel and asked me to stay with all the jewels, saree and makeup for the whole day.\n\nThank you Ariyas for making my day😍😍','2026-03-28 17:28:31.022337',3098,633,1665),('Maha Lakshmi',5,'I highly recommend this place !!!! Enquired and visited several places for renting my wedding Jewellery. And, I am so glad I came across Ariyas Bridal Rental. Great quality and lots of variety to choose from and very very affordable price The client service is wonderful.. and sis you are very friendly sis and I give rate 💯 thankyou sis keep rocking','2026-03-28 17:28:31.026246',3099,633,1665),('Prashanthi Sridharan',5,'Variety of rental jewellery at affordable price. The designs are unique and the service by Shanmuga Priya should not be missed to mention. Very customer friendly and prompt delivery of the article.\nThanks alot for making my big day more special 🙂','2026-03-28 17:28:31.030516',3100,633,1665),('shan subramaniam',5,'Our 2nd time, following the last visit in Nov 2025. My wife and I, bought \"kolusu\" angklets , excellent service from Magalakshmi and the basement floor manager Sanjeevi, warm and welcoming. More than the product, the people behind are key assets and Maga is excellent at hospitality. We keep coming here.','2026-03-28 17:28:34.461733',3101,634,1667),('Syed Sameer ahmed',5,'Had a wonderful experience at Khazana Jewellery. The designs are elegant, quality is excellent, and the service was very professional. Special thanks to Sanjeevi for his patience, guidance, and friendly approach he made the entire purchase smooth and comfortable. Highly recommended for anyone looking for beautiful jewellery and great service.','2026-03-28 17:28:34.463876',3102,634,1667),('Uma Parvathy',5,'Customer service is good. Sales person Tamizh and cash team Karthick and Arivazhagan did great job at their work and coordinated with us. Goldsmith Mahalingam and Tamizhselvan did good job at melting the gold. Office Assistant Antony Karthi guided us through. Branch manager Neela and Vinoth also had been a great help in buying the gold. Overall customer service is good. Staffs are polite and respectful.','2026-03-28 17:28:34.465643',3103,634,1667),('Fathima Firoza',5,'The aura of the store was excellent, and the staff had definite aura points! Neela ma\'am helped us locate the perfect fit, and Ravi sir was her able assistant. They offered a choice of beverages of cold drinks and got, including badam milk. It was a good experience\nThank you, Khazana!','2026-03-28 17:28:34.467265',3104,634,1667),('Balachandar Seafarer',5,'Very good customer service and patience in showing all the designs with utmost care. Elakkiya, has provided the best service with a smiling face  and made us purchase more than we planned for. Keep up the good work.','2026-03-28 17:28:34.468742',3105,634,1667),('Harish Ps',5,'This is what experience should be like when you visit for purchasing something really for your special moments.\nThis store at Iyappanthangal is must for people minding choices of modern designs and value of their time.\nThanks to the whole team from the bottom of our heart.','2026-03-28 17:28:43.513674',3106,635,1668),('deepak ram',5,'Visited Bluestone Iyyappanthangal today and the service and the staff are too good and I suggest everyone to visit the store atleast once for their wide range of collections','2026-03-28 17:28:43.516916',3107,635,1668),('Dinesh Gogula',5,'Trust these guys to help you choose the right rings, especially if they are for a special occasion or even for regular use. These guys went the extra mile to deliver the product a few days in advance as against the date committed. I\'m sure going back again to buy more from them.\n\nThe hospitality of the staff is great.\n\nThank you','2026-03-28 17:28:43.519997',3108,635,1668),('Divya Sriman',4,'Had nice experience....staf are very cooperative and showed what all the design available...happy with the collection and looking fwd for more','2026-03-28 17:28:43.523355',3109,635,1668),('Nivedha Gurunathan',5,'Well coordinated with people and gave lot more options to choose the ornaments. Had a best experience.','2026-03-28 17:28:43.526684',3110,635,1668),('INDHU',5,'Rio Fashion Jewellery provided a great service for my marriage reception. I had visited lots of jewellery shops for my Lehanga.I am not satisfied with any of the shops and not found the perfect matching jewel set for my reception. I just visited Rio jewellery and got the perfect jewel for my Lehanga. They matched up Earring also which totally upscaled my attire. Thank you so much Rio Fashion Jewellry for the great service and support.','2026-03-28 17:28:50.670271',3111,636,1672),('Munish S',5,'GOOD COLLECTION FOR MODEL GIRLS & FORMAL GIRLS & FAMILY\' LADIES.. NICE SUPPORT SERVICE 🤝💐','2026-03-28 17:28:50.673403',3112,636,1672),('Reethika Chandran',5,'Had a great experience, the shopkeeper has shown a great interest overall , thank you','2026-03-28 17:28:50.675932',3113,636,1672),('RS COLLECTION 2019',5,'Nice collection.  Responsible person.\nBudget collection','2026-03-28 17:28:50.679247',3114,636,1672),('Hema Latha',5,'Service was good....u people have excellent nose pin collection especially','2026-03-28 17:28:50.682670',3115,636,1672),('Daksha Varsani',5,'I placed an urgent order for the father of the bride, my best friend whose daughter is getting married in Abu Dhabhi in 2 weeks. I was in Delhi when he called and sent me a photo of what he wanted a Sherwani brooch and necklace. We searched online and came across Ishhaara and contacted them urgently.  Dhara was on the other end and she was extremely patient and amazing, listened to us. It was such a smooth experience throughout my purchase which was via whats app. She shared the photos of the finished product and despatched the items via express shipping in 2 days. Really pleased with their services. Highly recommended to purchase from them online or via whats app.','2026-03-28 17:28:55.375329',3116,637,1676),('Mannat Shivnani',1,'I dont recommend this company. They are very unprofessional. I received a product which reacted very badly on my ear, when I complained, they asked me to send it back, the parcel was returned to me saying that the shop is closed and no one answered the call...\n\nI spent 300 (courier)on a product value of 799 and now when I call them, when finally the owner received my call after multiple attempts, BESHARAM LADY, says no one calls us for 800 rupees...\n... meaning they send bad products and there shouldn\'t be any complaints about it?\n\ninstead of offering to pick up the product themselves, she is arguing with me about how a parcel wasn\'t delivered when she works 24x7... and why did it come back...\n\nPlease explain me how a courier partner reaches u if u dont attend their call?\n\nVERY UNPROFESSIONAL AND NOT WORTH IT...\n\nIt was my 1st attempt with artificial jewelry anyways... ABSOLUTELY DO NOT RECOMMEND WORKING WITH ISHHARA.','2026-03-28 17:28:55.379287',3117,637,1676),('Disha',1,'Order number #11762 placed an order through the website on 2 March 2026 received it on 4 March 2026,\nI ordered Verdant Sparkle Handcuff × 1\nSilver\nI received a completely different product from what I ordered online they asked for proof for which I provided all the unboxing details and everything they asked for ,they won’t refund me and refuse to accept any type of resolution for this.\nMy biggest mistake was not checking their store reviews before buying .\nDon’t make the same mistake,don’t buy from the brand they post false images on the website and mislead customers with no return  policy . Where in even if the product is not the same quality but also looks different they still refuse to refund the customer.','2026-03-28 17:28:55.382739',3118,637,1676),('Sonu Arora',1,'A highly unpleasant and unprofessional experience!\nI placed an urgent order for a katar for my son’s wedding after being told on WhatsApp that it was ready to ship. I ordered through the website as expected, only to be questioned later on why I ordered online and told I should have paid directly by gpay to a number belonging to Dhara Chatbar\nI was then asked to pay ₹500 for express shipping, which suddenly became ₹590 because the website discount was withdrawn—after I had already placed the order. Instructions and charges kept changing, and the behavior was rude and unprofessional. Finally the order was cancelled and there was no refund!\nVery stressful experience. Would not recommend.','2026-03-28 17:28:55.385909',3119,637,1676),('Mouu',5,'Had a awesome experience buying a beautiful ring from Ishhaara, the quality is just mind blowing. The best part is it was delivered in 2 days. Thank you team Ishhara ❤️','2026-03-28 17:28:55.388995',3120,637,1676),('Nrc',1,'Guys, just be aware of what your spending for..\n1) only after renting I got to know that there is no cancellation even the next day..\n2) 1st of all they don\'t polish their jewelleries they just hand it over with so called cleaning (nothing was actually cleaned).. so this is what you wanna wear for any function?? For the sake of peace, I just skipped these and bought glass bangles 🤷 so if your renting, ask them in detail, rather jazz rentals does better quality rentals.\n3) customer service at the shop is not good.','2026-03-28 17:28:59.978736',3121,638,1678),('Gopi Krishnan',5,'Awesome collections at valuable price. The best shop in Chennai for rental and bridal jewellery and Kindly visit the shop','2026-03-28 17:28:59.981517',3122,638,1678),('Veena Venkataraman',1,'Terrible staff. Not at all interested to show collections. There were 2 male staff fully looking at their phone. Collections are good but staff has no sincerity. Very disappointed\nEdit - I visited the tnagar branch','2026-03-28 17:28:59.984035',3123,638,1678),('Aishu Sai',1,'I recently visited their branch in pondy bazaar . Idont understand why there is so much hype for this place . They do have good collection of jewelry but everything is very very expensive . One temple set with short/ long haram/ ear piece comes around 10-15K\nfor rental. ( Ps : please dont say it depends on the model/ your entry is not registered /\n)\n\nAnd there is a strict no photography policy . Then how people can decide how good they will look on their big day and we cannot bring everyone to the shop / video call . As if we are getting the product for free.\nIf it is a copywrite issue , then why\nThe products are promoted through celebrity , model and influencers .\n\nEdit : I mentioned antique temple jewelry and not silver. Also yes your price starts from 3K for only 1 haram / neck piece for rental .','2026-03-28 17:28:59.986644',3124,638,1678),('Ganapathyvinoth Vinoth',5,'Antique collections are awesome here. Brides pls do visit the store.','2026-03-28 17:28:59.989747',3125,638,1678),('Chocky',4,'Hey Fellas, it had been a wonderful experience having Jwellery in here So Pretty Collections in Valuable rates for rent.\nShop Owners are so Kind and Humble and so much Helpful in selecion.\nI recommend to have a look here for Amazing Collections.\nHappy shopping...','2026-03-28 17:29:04.902008',3126,639,1680),('Adithya Sundaram',5,'Good Service.\nValue for money. Would recommend to my friends aswell','2026-03-28 17:29:04.904663',3127,639,1680),('Sherlin Steephen',1,'Such a worst rental store have ever visited. Their products as well as customer service is not good.\nEdited:[4/29, 12:39 PM] Priyadharshini: This isn\'t fair pa\n[4/29, 12:39 PM] Priyadharshini: U know very well that I haven\'t used that Jewelry\n[4/29, 12:39 PM] Priyadharshini: Yesterday was closing time so came mrng to return the jewel\n[4/29, 12:39 PM] Priyadharshini: As I said bride wants to see the jewelry once\n[4/29, 12:40 PM] Priyadharshini: If U would have some courtesy atlest u wud have taken jewellery for atleast 75%\n[4/29, 12:42 PM] Priyadharshini: 50% is too much so rude and harsh , even we have informed our event date, to  your heart u knew that we haven\'t used your jewel\n[4/29, 1:32 PM] Krishya Bridal jewelry: Mam how do i for what purpose u took jewellery??? Do you think this is valid reason.\n[4/29, 1:33 PM] Priyadharshini: I was telling you repeatedly\n[4/29, 1:33 PM] Priyadharshini: Bride has to see her jewelry\n[4/29, 1:33 PM] Krishya Bridal jewelry: Atleast you have said this yesterday\n[4/29, 1:33 PM] Priyadharshini: Her wedding is in her natice\n[4/29, 1:33 PM] Priyadharshini: Pa u r about to close the store yesterday\n[4/29, 1:33 PM] Krishya Bridal jewelry: We pay charges even for 1 hour wedding shooy or other events\n[4/29, 1:34 PM] Krishya Bridal jewelry: You should have pinged yesterday\n[4/29, 1:34 PM] Priyadharshini: To your heart you know very well wat u r doing now isn\'t fair\n[4/29, 1:35 PM] Krishya Bridal jewelry: Mam we are doing business.. we can\'t down our standards for such reasons\n[4/29, 1:35 PM] Priyadharshini: This is not about standards\n[4/29, 1:35 PM] Priyadharshini: So locking such high amount is your business standard\n[4/29, 1:35 PM] Priyadharshini: I hope not ✌🏻\n[4/29, 1:36 PM] Krishya Bridal jewelry: Its not a High amount\n[4/29, 1:36 PM] Priyadharshini: I would have suggested your store for my friends really, but locking 1000 is still keeping me upset\n[4/29, 1:36 PM] Krishya Bridal jewelry: U took the jewellery and returned\n[4/29, 1:36 PM] Priyadharshini: Every penny matters for me, for me it is high amount 😊✌🏻\n[4/29, 1:37 PM] Krishya Bridal jewelry: Same for us\n[4/29, 1:37 PM] Priyadharshini: You are the one who said this\n[4/29, 1:37 PM] Priyadharshini: I am not justifying for any damaged product\n[4/29, 1:37 PM] Priyadharshini: We returned the jewelry as it is\n[4/29, 1:38 PM] Krishya Bridal jewelry: Mam do u think u can negotiate in big shops like this and givew excuses?\n[4/29, 1:38 PM] Priyadharshini: For the bride who is gonna get married, you gave your best nightmare\n[4/29, 1:38 PM] Priyadharshini: Thanks✌🏻\n[4/29, 1:39 PM] Priyadharshini: Comparing with other shops will reach us no where\n[4/29, 1:39 PM] Krishya Bridal jewelry: Your welcome mam\nThis was the chat which the owner spoke where we haven\'t asked for any zero charges. And the jewel was not taken to any of the functions we provided you the enough proof coming straight to your shop.','2026-03-28 17:29:04.907082',3128,639,1680),('Divya SukumarBabu',4,'Value fr the money i ll say ..\nRely superb collection\nVry unique pieces,fresh pieces too ..\nLoved their humble n kindness....the worker helped me a lot 2 choose the design.... Tey never tired of showing the pieces,definitely giv a try fr ever occasion 💯💯💯','2026-03-28 17:29:04.910412',3129,639,1680),('dinesh S',5,'Awesome collections and good hospitality..\nValue for money while comparing all other bridal collection in chennai.\nI am regular customer of krishya collection...\nWell cooperative executive.\n100Percent satisfied','2026-03-28 17:29:04.912906',3130,639,1680),('Sathish M',5,'Embarking on the journey to find the perfect bridal jewelry led me to the enchanting world of Haritha Bridal Jewelry, and my experience was nothing short of magical. From the moment I stepped into the store, I was greeted by a mesmerizing display of exquisite pieces that spoke volumes about craftsmanship and attention to detail.\n\nHaritha Bridal Jewelry boasts a diverse selection that caters to a myriad of tastes and preferences. Whether you\'re envisioning a modern, contemporary look or a more traditional and classic ensemble, Haritha has curated a collection that effortlessly blends elegance with individuality. Each piece tells a story of artistry, with intricate designs that capture the essence of a bride\'s unique style.\n\nWhat truly sets Haritha apart is the unparalleled customer service. The staff at Haritha is not only knowledgeable but also genuinely passionate about helping brides find the perfect jewelry to complement their special day. Their patience, expertise, and personalized approach create an atmosphere that goes beyond a typical shopping experience—it feels like you\'re being guided by friends who understand the significance of the occasion.\n\nThe store\'s ambiance is tastefully designed, creating an inviting space that allows brides to explore the treasures within. The well-lit displays, comfortable seating, and large mirrors add to the overall allure, making the process of selecting jewelry an enjoyable and memorable affair.\n\nHaritha Bridal Jewelry also excels in customization, ensuring that every bride can wear a piece that resonates with her unique vision. The process is seamless, and the end result is a bespoke creation that reflects the individuality of the wearer. The level of detail and craftsmanship in the customization process is truly commendable.\n\nDespite the luxurious feel of the jewelry, Haritha Bridal Jewelry understands the importance of catering to different budgets. The range of price points ensures that brides can find something exquisite within their financial parameters, without compromising on quality.\n\nIn conclusion, my experience at Haritha Bridal Jewelry was a delightful journey of discovery and refinement. If you\'re in search of bridal jewelry that seamlessly combines elegance, quality, and personalized service, Haritha is the ultimate destination. I left the store not just with stunning jewelry but with a sense of confidence, knowing that I had discovered the perfect pieces to adorn myself on my special day. Haritha Bridal Jewelry truly lives up to its promise of where elegance meets perfection.','2026-03-28 17:29:10.227855',3131,640,1682),('Benji benzy',5,'Come and see what you can get here at a low price and with good quality... Thank you haritha bridal jewellery 👍💯','2026-03-28 17:29:10.231229',3132,640,1682),('8227 V.kiruba Rani',5,'Wow wonderful collections in train to jewellery, very nice in your product I so happy... thank you Haritha bridal jewellery..... very very thank you so much\nMam.','2026-03-28 17:29:10.234655',3133,640,1682),('Dhanalakshmi Ethiraj',5,'So Nice cheap and best products\nI\'m really satisfied😊\nThanks to haritha bridal jewellery','2026-03-28 17:29:10.237721',3134,640,1682),('R PAVITHRA PAVITHRA',5,'Jewellery collection is very nice. I\'m so happy.😌','2026-03-28 17:29:10.240754',3135,640,1682),('Monisha. R',5,'I had a wonderful experience purchasing gold copy jewellery here. The service was extremely pleasant and made the entire shopping experience smooth and comfortable. The collection is truly awesome, with a wide variety of elegant and trendy designs to choose from, suitable for all occasions.\n\nA special mention to Thamarai Selvan, whose service was absolutely great. He was very patient, knowledgeable, and took the time to understand my preferences, guiding me with genuine suggestions. His professionalism and friendly approach really stood out and made the visit even more enjoyable.','2026-03-28 17:29:17.223488',3136,641,1684),('Priyavarshini',5,'Great service, highly recommended and truly appreciated. Best collections at affordable prices, and the customer service is excellent. Special thanks to Miss Meenakshi and Mr. Surya,your service was wonderful. Thank you so much for recommending and showing such beautiful jewellery pieces. Overall, I had a great experience. Thank you!','2026-03-28 17:29:17.227404',3137,641,1684),('Niveda',5,'The shop has a wonderful collection of bridal jewelry, perfect for a wedding day. They provide excellent customer service and a wide range of rental options. Kudos to the staff for helping us choose the right jewellery. A special thanks to Keerthana for assisting us throughout our shopping, and heartfelt gratitude to the owner for offering such beautiful jewellery at an affordable price.','2026-03-28 17:29:17.231143',3138,641,1684),('navya suja sri',5,'Great service , affordable rental Jewellery in town. Staffs are very kind and patient, top-notch service by thamarai selvan. My goto destination for all my rental jewellery needs.','2026-03-28 17:29:17.235108',3139,641,1684),('Saritha Rajendran',5,'Awesome collection with good quality and affordable price. Staffs are so friendly and polite. I strongly recommend this outlet.Thank you','2026-03-28 17:29:17.238840',3140,641,1684),('Swetha Swetha',5,'I had a wonderful experience with this jewellery rental shop. I had booked the jewellery in advance but unfortunately forgot to collect it on the day of my event. I realized it very late at night, around 1 AM, and immediately called the shop owner.\nTo my surprise, he answered the call and kindly informed me that he had already brought the jewellery home and asked me to come and collect it. Even though it was almost 2 AM, he patiently waited and handed over the jewellery to me.\nI truly appreciate his dedication, responsibility, and excellent customer service. Because of him, I was able to wear the jewellery for my event without any stress. Highly recommended for their professionalism and kindness! 👏🏻✨','2026-03-28 17:29:21.257483',3141,642,1686),('Gopika Krishnan',5,'Great experience renting out jewellery from Alankrita. Really good collection, and the owner and shop attenders were all really helpful and patient. The pieces were priced reasonably too!','2026-03-28 17:29:21.259952',3142,642,1686),('Jagadeesh P',5,'Great collections for bridal rentals. Couriered the jewellery in a nice box 3 days before the event and returned it back after a week. Charges were reasonable.','2026-03-28 17:29:21.262420',3143,642,1686),('Meghna Shashikant',5,'I personally love this store. They have amazing collections for both brides and bridesmaids. From minimal to heavy they have gorgeous designs with no compromise on quality. The quality of every single piece is top notch! They also help us decide which jewellery suits our tastes, requirements and outfits. The owners and staff are super patient and comfortable to be with. You can view a wide range of jewellery and select your favourite. Every piece is so beautifully chosen that you will definitely find your match for your dream day. Thank you Alankrita and team for helping me choose the perfect jewellery.','2026-03-28 17:29:21.265065',3144,642,1686),('Sufiya Afrin',5,'I m from Thanjavur..... I rented jewellery for my nikkah in alankrita....  I had hassle free experience... Received parcel on tym... Quality alsooo gudddd','2026-03-28 17:29:21.267452',3145,642,1686),('Nivedha Rajaram',5,'I had a wonderful experience with their rental bridal jewellery collection. The range was absolutely stunning  from classic temple pieces to elegant chokers and statement sets all well-maintained and perfect for a bridal look.\nWhat truly made the experience special was the staff. They were extremely patient, supportive, and genuinely invested in helping me choose the right jewellery. They took the time to understand my outfits, colours, and the overall look I was going for, and helped me mix and match pieces until everything felt just right. There was no rush, no pressure , only honest suggestions and reassurance, which really matters for a bride.\nThanks to their guidance, I felt confident and happy with my final choices. Highly recommend this place to any bride looking for beautiful rental jewellery and a stress-free, supportive experience. 💍✨','2026-03-28 17:29:26.049101',3146,643,1688),('Meenaloshini S',5,'Had a good experience and good collection of jewellery quality. Good ambiance staffs are very good and friendly to show the each jewellery with patience. Got a proper guidence based on the outfit ...\n\nThank you Ayra jewellery for making my day more special with your jewellers...','2026-03-28 17:29:26.052620',3147,643,1688),('Shalini',5,'This is Shalini. Im very much satisfied with the rental of my bridal jewels in Ayra Bridal Jewellery. They have wide range of collections and they provide them with affordable price. The Staffs are friendly and Polite.','2026-03-28 17:29:26.056104',3148,643,1688),('Mithun Mithun',5,'Staff were very polite, patient, and helpful in selection\nCustomization options available as per bridal outfits\nBeautiful and elegant bridal jewellery collection','2026-03-28 17:29:26.059425',3149,643,1688),('sumithra raju',5,'Loved their bridal jewellery and the friendly service.They understood exactly what I want, Made my shopping experience stress-free and memorable.Highly recommended!','2026-03-28 17:29:26.062888',3150,643,1688),('Aparna Rajhesh',5,'Prabhu Jewellers are one of the best rental jewellery shop. You go to the shop and they understand what type you want and they literally read your mind and give you jewellery the way you want. All staff are so supportive and reasonably priced too!','2026-03-28 17:29:31.239305',3151,644,1690),('sneha tharani',5,'Good Eve Sir/Mam!\nThe packing and the quality of the Product is so satisfying and neatly made. Thank you so much for the Best supply!','2026-03-28 17:29:31.242743',3152,644,1690),('Janc Ram',5,'I received good product and packing also very good. I like it....🥰','2026-03-28 17:29:31.246267',3153,644,1690),('Bhargavi S G',5,'Thank you so much for the jewellery❤️.  it was absolutely stunning and matched my saree perfectly! I truly appreciate the extra effort you took to replace the pearls with golden pearls in both the necklace and hipbelt. The jewels complemented my attire beautifully, and the additional loops on the hipbelt made it so much easier and quicker to wear.','2026-03-28 17:29:31.249607',3154,644,1690),('Vigneswararao Parvatheeswararo',5,'We ordered Andal kondai ,the quality is worth the price,no where we could get these kind of models with such a good quality in other places','2026-03-28 17:29:31.252737',3155,644,1690),('MEAT AND EAT KEBAB ISTAAN.',5,'Hi mam, I received the jewellery and it looks absolutely beautiful. The quality and finishing are even better than I expected Thank you for delivering such a lovely product ❤️','2026-03-28 17:29:34.294871',3156,645,1691),('niharika niha',5,'This was my first purchase from Iyla Bridal Jewellery, Loved the product ❤️\nIt was exactly as shown in the video and perfect in every way. And the little Ganesh idol was such a sweet and thoughtful surprise .Not everyone puts in that extra effort. Truly appreciate the gesture. Thank you so much ❤️❤️ Iyla','2026-03-28 17:29:34.298337',3157,645,1691),('Swetha Varadhan',5,'I recently booked this jewellery set for my reception and im extremely happy with it. The set is very new and fresh. The customer service was excellent and I\'m especially thankful to Manju for sharing such a unique ideas with me. If you\'re looking for something new, trendy, unique and affordable this is definitely the place to go. Highly recommended','2026-03-28 17:29:34.301949',3158,645,1691),('Dhana Lakshmi',5,'I picked up jewellery from this shop for my brother’s wedding, and it was such a lovely experience. The collection is gorgeous — so many elegant designs that it was hard to choose! The prices are very reasonable, and the quality is excellent. The staff were warm and patient, helping me find pieces that perfectly matched the wedding vibe. On the big day, the jewellery looked stunning and I received so many compliments from family and guests. I’m really happy with my purchase and will surely come back for future occasions.','2026-03-28 17:29:34.304956',3159,645,1691),('Renuka Subramaniyam',5,'Jewellery collections are nice and the quality is good. And staff Viji received us well and showed all the collections patiently. We will surely visit again.','2026-03-28 17:29:34.308766',3160,645,1691),('Rucha Sonare',5,'Exceptionally beautiful designs and Sudhir was very helpful in suggesting jewellery based on my request and preferences.','2026-03-28 17:29:38.689830',3161,646,1692),('Preethi Manoharan',5,'Beautiful collection of pearls in silver and gold. Peaceful ambience and customer service. Highly recommend','2026-03-28 17:29:38.691374',3162,646,1692),('Devi M',5,'Smooth shopping experience with Mr. Dinesh Kumar at the air port last minute shopping. Decent collections.','2026-03-28 17:29:38.693015',3163,646,1692),('Gopalakrishnan Karthikeyan',5,'Review for Krishnan Petals & Jewelers, Chennai\n\nI had a wonderful experience at **Krishnan Petals & Jewelers** in Chennai. The showroom had a great variety of gold and diamond collections, with beautiful craftsmanship and elegant designs to choose from.\n\nA special mention to **Mr. Dinesh Kumar**, the **Sales Manager**, who was extremely courteous and professional. He patiently explained the product details, helped us compare options, and ensured transparent pricing throughout. His guidance made the entire shopping experience smooth and satisfying.\n\nOverall, I’m very happy with the purchase and would highly recommend this store for anyone looking for trustworthy service and exquisite jewelr','2026-03-28 17:29:38.694495',3164,646,1692),('Priya Kannappa rajendran',5,'Loved the collections and hospitality very professional sales person … enjoyed my purchase','2026-03-28 17:29:38.696064',3165,646,1692),('Rajoo Rangarajan',5,'Karthik n Suganya are very polite and patientfully shows everything. Appreciate them. Responds instantly. Jewellery designs are unique and too good . Hospitality is outstanding. A must visit place for fashion jewellery.','2026-03-28 17:29:42.362589',3166,647,1694),('Harikrishnan Anandan',5,'A Truly Wonderful Jewellery Shopping Experience at Kushal\'s ✨🛍️\n💎💍 I had a fantastic time shopping at Kushal\'s Fashion Jewellery in Mogappair West, Chennai. ✨ The collection of fashion and imitation jewellery 👑💎🪅is absolutely stunning, and I was spoiled for choice with so many beautiful designs. The staff were incredibly courteous, and a special thank you to \"Mr. Karthikeyan\" for his expert guidance his product knowledge is truly amazing. I was so impressed that I ended up buying a ring and a bracelet in addition to the earrings I originally came for 💖 This is definitely the best place to find gorgeous accessories. 🌸👑💎🪅☀️💐','2026-03-28 17:29:42.366303',3167,647,1694),('Harini Vasudevan',5,'Really unique products paired with amazing customer service!\nI was attended by Ms Manjuparkavi (Mogappair branch) and she helped out very politely. Her suggestion and patience in trying out various jewellery combinations were heartwarming!\nThe store manager Ms Shehnaz also suggested really good combinations.\nHad a very great shopping experience!','2026-03-28 17:29:42.370187',3168,647,1694),('Mithra Bharath',5,'Had a great shopping experience at Kushal’s Fashion Jewellery, Mogappair West Road. The collection is beautiful with lots of elegant and trendy designs to choose from.\n\nSpecial mention to Manju, she was extremely helpful, patient, and wonderful in her service. She understood my requirement perfectly and made the whole experience smooth and pleasant.\n\nHighly recommend this store for both the collection and the amazing customer service!','2026-03-28 17:29:42.374456',3169,647,1694),('VimaThangam T',5,'I purchased a few products from Kushal Shop, and I had a very pleasant experience. The staff handled me very politely and patiently gave helpful suggestions based on my needs. The product quality was also very good. Overall, I’m happy with the purchase and service.','2026-03-28 17:29:42.378232',3170,647,1694),('Shruthi M',5,'I just received my order and I am absolutely in love with the jewelry. The Jhumkas and the neckpiece are even more beautiful in person, and the quality looks fantastic.\nThank you for the quick delivery and the lovely packaging.','2026-03-28 17:29:46.093161',3171,648,1696),('Patel Shalvi',5,'Thank you so much for the product. It\'s really very beautiful and the delivery is very quick. I\'m so happy. My best shopping experience ever🙏🤗. I love it.','2026-03-28 17:29:46.096757',3172,648,1696),('Surabhi Sridhar',5,'Namaste,\nJust received my temple jewellery from Zivara today, and I’m genuinely so impressed! The finishing is top-notch! The delivery was smooth, and everything arrived in perfect condition with no damages at all. Overall, I’m extremely happy with my purchase. If you’re looking for elegant, well-crafted temple jewellery, this is definitely worth checking out!','2026-03-28 17:29:46.100007',3173,648,1696),('Vinodha Arunachalam',5,'Very good place to get imitation and dance jewelery...had a great experience wid a last minute ordering and recieved d package as promised...thank you..ll come back for more..','2026-03-28 17:29:46.103279',3174,648,1696),('Jasmine A',5,'I hav recived the parcel Suchh a prettyy qualityyy🤗❤️\nThe maattal looks more prettier than in picturess Thnkk yuhh soo muchh ❤️ So satisfied 🫶🏻','2026-03-28 17:29:46.106364',3175,648,1696),('Vidhya N',5,'I rented my wedding jewellery from this shop, and I couldn’t have been happier with my choice. The collection was absolutely stunning, elegant, and perfect for a bride. The quality of the jewellery looked so premium and enhanced my entire bridal look beautifully.\nLalitha was extremely patient, friendly, and helped me choose pieces that suited my outfit perfectly. The service was smooth from selection to return.\nHighly recommended for brides who want luxurious-looking jewellery at a reasonable price. Thank you for making my wedding look even more special! ❤️','2026-03-28 17:29:51.829065',3176,649,1697),('Bharathi Sriram',5,'Really loved the jewelleries i rented from Vrishti, It was a very smooth process and honestly didnt have to worry even a bit for my jewellery as Lalitha akka helped ensure a smooth process for delivery and return.','2026-03-28 17:29:51.831277',3177,649,1697),('Aishwarya Ramakrishnan',5,'Very nice....I got perfect match for my dress...❤️❤️I love it','2026-03-28 17:29:51.833496',3178,649,1697),('Indumathy N',5,'I rented jewellery here.. It got delivered 3 days prior to the function date.. The look and feel was as same as shown in the pics... It was totally new and also you can get quick and polite response from her... The bridal sets are quite affordable as well. Overall a very fantastic experience.. I would highly recommend this to every girl...','2026-03-28 17:29:51.835789',3179,649,1697),('udhaya natrajan',5,'vrishti bridal jewelry has beautiful and elegant bridal and reception jewels for rent at affordable price. They deliver the jewels couple of days before the event and their booking and delivery process are so simple! Happy to shop with them!!','2026-03-28 17:29:51.838206',3180,649,1697),('Shamli Soundary',5,'I recently purchased artificial jewellery from Vizhiyaal and I’m really impressed! The pieces have a very neat finish, giving them a premium and elegant look that almost matches real jewellery. The design detailing is beautiful, and there are no rough edges or dull patches.\n\nWhat I like most is that it’s very cost-effective — perfect for those who want stylish accessories without spending too much. Overall, it’s a great blend of quality, craftsmanship, and affordability. I’d definitely recommend it for everyday wear or festive occasions.','2026-03-28 17:29:54.695652',3181,650,1698),('Sumithra Murugesan',5,'I have to definitely convey my thanks for the excellent jewellery you have sent me on my special day.\nMy first experience on purchasing the bridal jewellery online was so satisfying and trustworthy.\n\nThank you so much vizhiyaal bridal jewellery.\n\nCommunication and Service was so friendly.','2026-03-28 17:29:54.699156',3182,650,1698),('Nisha Sethu',5,'Vizhiyaal bridal jewellery shop has an absolutely beautiful collection suitable for all bridal functions. The designs are elegant, well-finished, and give a rich, premium look that perfectly suits weddings or any special occasions…….What really stands out is the variety available — from traditional bridal sets to trendy and modern designs — making it easy to find jewellery that matches different outfits and occasions. The quality is impressive, it truly enhances the overall bridal appearance….must visit for your special occasions..❤️','2026-03-28 17:29:54.702861',3183,650,1698),('Sankeerthana Danagari',5,'Im from Hyderabad, I saw their Instagram page and ordered a pair of beautiful jhumkas. The packaging was very good, I loved those jhumkas and would love to shop again ❤️🙏','2026-03-28 17:29:54.706169',3184,650,1698),('Loshana Velan',5,'Bought a neckset, and a jhumka. It looks stunning and exactly like the pictures. The finishing, shine, and quality are really good. Totally worth it!','2026-03-28 17:29:54.709509',3185,650,1698),('chithra r',5,'\"I would like to appreciate the effort and politeness of Saritha, Jaya, and Manager Logu. They came to my residence and spent time showing us a great variety of jewelry, particularly the antique designs we were looking for. Their kindness and patience made the process a very happy one. It’s rare to see this level of hospitality these days. Highly recommended!\"','2026-03-28 17:30:04.896375',3186,651,1699),('SANDEEP KURHADE',5,'Huge shopping format\nAll daily needs and fashion, jewellery under one roof','2026-03-28 17:30:04.899812',3187,651,1699),('Naresh Thalapaneni',5,'1st Floor Fabric was extremely beautiful.\n\nGuidence by Ms.Mahalakshmi was nice supporting','2026-03-28 17:30:04.903208',3188,651,1699),('Aruna Bhuvaneswari',5,'Collections were good. I was looking for gold plated antique silver jewellery. Ramakrishnan a staff in that counter helped me in selecting the jewellery. He was very friendly and polite, showed me all the best collections they had, all were unique ones. Overall good and awesome collections. Would give a five star to the staff Ramakrishnan and one more staff. *(I didn\'t ask his name)*😊 Good hospitality','2026-03-28 17:30:04.907613',3189,651,1699),('Santhi Suresh',5,'Mr Surender sales has given good service..He is very polite and untired ly shown all collection.fully satisfied..Excellent service by him','2026-03-28 17:30:04.910772',3190,651,1699),('Ajay Kanna',5,'Had a great experience at Shanthi Jewellery.\nThe collections are beautiful and well presented.\nSpecial thanks to Kavitha for her friendly and patient service.\nShe made the shopping experience smooth and pleasant.','2026-03-28 17:30:07.814303',3191,652,1703),('Narendar Rathod',1,'My wrong decision to start a gold chit in small jewellers led to a loss and mental agony..\n\nI make monthly 10k payment towards 11 month chit. They send an acknowledge aft 2 days with how much wgt of gold added.. Since golds are fluctuating a lot, I never bothered to do a calculation which ll have wgt like 3 decimal something.. 1 day I did and found huge difference and they considered next day rate instead of payment date. I mailed no response. Bt I kept paying towards the chit. 3 months gold wgt was differing.. And today I called them. Aft so many transfer of call they r saying yeah there is a difference. I can get that diff while I purchase physical gold. Bt how can I trust or leave them doing this know fraudulent activity. This is Shanti Jewelers, TN.. I said I’ll file a complaint if I don’t get a proof of my payment date, gold rate that day and wgt added..  I check live gold website. Is there any trustable website for this to b safer from my end.\n\nI hope this will an awareness post to many who don’t much bother about the milligram weightages difference which is a loss of thousands of amount now..','2026-03-28 17:30:07.817501',3192,652,1703),('Sudharson',5,'I visited this store for buy a silver gift. One of the employee in the name of Nandhini attended me with very polite attitude. Im happy with her customer service.','2026-03-28 17:30:07.820789',3193,652,1703),('Imran Ahmed',1,'Shanthi Jewellers is one of the most reputed jewellery showrooms in Pallavaram. However, it has come to notice that they are not accepting old gold for cash purchase and are offering only exchange-based options.\n\nThis practice is unfair to customers, as many rely on genuine jewellers for transparent and flexible transactions. A reputed establishment is expected to provide both cash-buying and exchange facilities, ensuring fairness and trust.\n\nI request the management to review this policy and make the process more customer-friendly, in line with industry standards.','2026-03-28 17:30:07.823936',3194,652,1703),('Sanchari Biswas',5,'Very good service and hospitable nature. They have good collections of every ornamament and section. I am completely happy with Hridhayam Santhosh service.','2026-03-28 17:30:07.827036',3195,652,1703),('Swarna Rekha',5,'Very good collections and worth for money. The way owner explained is very good. I bought impon thali chain which is very reasonable rate and quality is very good. Lots of latest trending collections.','2026-03-28 17:30:13.850430',3196,653,1705),('Rajesh Rajesh',5,'Collections are very nice and customer service is very good . Huge collections available at reasonable price','2026-03-28 17:30:13.852321',3197,653,1705),('DHARANIKUMAR M',1,'Very Disappointing Experience with Gold Kanchana Gold Covering\nI had a very bad experience with Gold Kanchana Gold Covering. The quality of the product was not as expected — it started fading and losing color within a short time. The finishing looked poor, and the design didn’t match the images shown. When I tried to contact their customer support, the response was unhelpful and slow. Totally disappointed with the service and product quality. Not worth the price.','2026-03-28 17:30:13.855606',3198,653,1705),('Amc India',5,'Awesome jewellery collection and affordable prices. Very well mannered and friendly customer service ♥️♥️','2026-03-28 17:30:13.858867',3199,653,1705),('Angel Angel',5,'Collections are super customer service is too good','2026-03-28 17:30:13.861478',3200,653,1705),('Vasanth Benjamin',4,'Went to GRT today and had an amazing experience the staff was very warm, polite and friendly as well. We bought a silver bar and the experience was good enough. The ladies in the Golusu section were really good and helped us in every ways possible. Would surely recommend GRT for everyone.','2026-03-28 17:30:16.090102',3201,654,1706),('hari prasad rao',5,'I had a very good experience at the stud counter in GRT Perambur. The staff were polite, patient, and explained the designs and pricing clearly. They helped us choose the perfect stud and provided excellent customer service throughout the purchase. The collection was showed,what I expected. Overall, it was a pleasant shopping experience. Thank you to the team!','2026-03-28 17:30:16.093451',3202,654,1706),('Mani Gandan',5,'Hi Team,\nI would like to express my sincere appreciation for the excellent service provided by your employees, Sharmila and Ganesh, at the GRT Tambaram showroom.\nThey did a wonderful job assisting me, showed great patience, and helped me choose from a very good collection. Their professionalism, friendly attitude, and the way they treated me made my shopping experience truly pleasant and memorable.\nI am extremely happy with their service and would like to thank them for their dedication and customer-focused approach.\n\nThanks and regards,\nManigandan Janarthanan','2026-03-28 17:30:16.096576',3203,654,1706),('Sathish S Sakthi',5,'I recently purchased silver items from GRT Jewellers, Perambur, and I had a very pleasant experience. The showroom was clean, well-organized, and had a good collection of silver articles ranging from pooja items to daily-use accessories.\n\nThe staff were polite, patient, and explained the pricing clearly, including weight and making charges. I especially liked the transparency in billing and the way they handled the packaging. The quality of the silver looks genuine and well-finished.','2026-03-28 17:30:16.099618',3204,654,1706),('Tana Thompson',5,'Nithya was very patient and helped us pick the best purchase... She was patient with for almost 3 hours and showed me various options until I was satisfied with my purchase.','2026-03-28 17:30:16.102701',3205,654,1706),('Ranjith Kumar Rajagopal',5,'Absolutely loved my experience at this jewellery shop! The collection is stunning, with intricate designs that truly stand out. Thei quality and craftsmanship are top-notch, and the staff made the entire experience so warm and welcoming. Every piece feels special and timeless. Highly recommended for anyone looking to add a touch of elegance!','2026-03-28 17:30:20.491284',3206,655,1707),('Vardhini',5,'Had rented jewels from sr fashions for my engagement. They have unique collections and every piece looks stunning. Very happy with their service and quality!','2026-03-28 17:30:20.494093',3207,655,1707),('Pugazh Sweety',5,'The shop owner handles customers wonderfully. Whatever we need, they explain everything patiently. The prices are very reasonable, and the collections are also excellent','2026-03-28 17:30:20.496970',3208,655,1707),('Agalya Babu',5,'The jewellery added so much elegance to my look. High-quality pieces, neatly packed, and delivered on time. Very satisfied with the service and pricing. Highly recommended for weddings and special occasions.','2026-03-28 17:30:20.499618',3209,655,1707),('Jenny Fer',5,'I recently rented jewellery for my brother wedding, and I was blown away by the quality and service! The jewelry was stunning, and they were so helpful in choosing the perfect pieces. The rental process was seamless, and the prices were very reasonable. I would highly recommend this shop to anyone looking for beautiful jewelry without the hefty price tag. Thank you for making my special day even more memorable.','2026-03-28 17:30:20.502270',3210,655,1707),('Jebasta koilpichai',5,'I had a great experience at GRT Jewellers. Neelambari provided excellent service and helped us choose the perfect design. Very satisfied with the purchase. Good quality of gifts you can buy here.','2026-03-28 17:30:23.778723',3211,656,1709),('David Josephravi',5,'I had a wonderful experience at GRT Jewellers – Poonamallee. I would especially like to appreciate Yoga Lakshmi (Emp ID: 24711) for her excellent support and customer service.\nShe was very patient, polite, and knowledgeable, and took the time to understand our requirements clearly. Her guidance made the entire purchase process smooth and comfortable, without any pressure. She explained all the details clearly and ensured we were fully satisfied before finalizing the purchase.\nThanks to her professionalism and warm approach, the overall experience was truly pleasant. Great service like this definitely builds trust and makes customers want to return. Highly recommend this store and the staff!','2026-03-28 17:30:23.782166',3212,656,1709),('Elavarasan Siva',5,'I recently purchased a jewel for my baby at GRT Jewellers, Poonamallee, and the experience was truly delightful. The collection was beautiful, with plenty of elegant designs perfect for little ones.\n\nA special mention to Mrs. Mano Ranjitham, who assisted us throughout the process with so much patience and care. She was very attentive, explained everything clearly, and helped us choose the right design without any pressure. Her guidance made the entire shopping experience smooth and memorable.\n\nOverall, I’m extremely happy with the service and the quality at GRT Poonamallee. It’s definitely a place I would recommend to family and friends for trustworthy and pleasant jewellery shopping.','2026-03-28 17:30:23.785477',3213,656,1709),('D. R. Ranjith',5,'I would like to express my appreciation for the excellent customer service provided by Ms. M. Santhiya at your Poonamallee Branch.\nDuring my recent visit, she was very polite, patient, and professional in handling our requirements. She clearly explained the product details and guided us appropriately, which helped us make a confident purchase decision. Her approach and attitude made the overall shopping experience smooth and pleasant.\nI would also like to mention that the purchase was made under the name Mr. Ranjith, and the product selected was Plattinam – Rinku model.\nSuch dedicated service truly reflects the values of your organisation. Kindly convey my appreciation to her.\nThank you\nRanjith Ramalingam','2026-03-28 17:30:23.788755',3214,656,1709),('Saravanan M S',5,'I had a truly wonderful experience at GRT Poonamallee. The customer service was outstanding, and I would like to express my sincere appreciation to Mr. Jagadheeswaran for his exceptional support. He patiently listened to my requirements, gave clear explanations, and put in his full efforts to help me select the right silver items. His dedication, product knowledge, and friendly approach made the entire shopping process comfortable and enjoyable. It is rare to find such committed service, and I am extremely satisfied with the way he handled everything. My heartfelt thanks to Mr. Jagadheeswaran and the GRT Poonamallee team for making my visit a delightful one.\n\nP.S:- Thanks a lot for wonderful tasty and aromic COFFEE. ☕👌','2026-03-28 17:30:23.793176',3215,656,1709),('Vivek Gupta',2,'I am from North India, and I was very disappointed with the behavior of the shop owner. From the beginning, his attitude towards me was not welcoming. I could clearly see the difference in the hospitality he showed to other customers compared to me.\n\nI purchased jewellery worth ₹1.8+ lakh, and when I asked for a discount, he gave only ₹1,000. Although I was in a hurry and proceeded with the purchase, I still felt uncomfortable with the way I was treated.\n\nAt the time of collection, he was again rude and even mentioned that they do not sell small items. I have never seen a shopkeeper treat customers based on their purchasing capacity. I had gone there to buy a special gift for my wife, but instead of feeling valued as a customer, I felt disrespected.\n\nHe did not even offer a complimentary gift — I had to ask for it myself.\n\nEvery customer deserves equal respect, whether they purchase something worth ₹1,000 or ₹1 lakh. Discrimination and biased behavior have no place in business. I hope the management reflects on this and treats all customers with fairness and dignity.','2026-03-28 17:30:32.446702',3216,658,1714),('Manoj',5,'Fantastic collection which impressed my daughters. We loved the cute designs and lavish jewellery. Under my observation, Tanishka Jewellery is the best jewellery shop in Ramapuram . It was a great experience to shop here and I would love to come back here with my wife for shopping.','2026-03-28 17:30:32.451295',3217,658,1714),('Nagarajan M',5,'Tanishka jewellery is the  best jewellery shop near me. The staff here helped me in finding the best necklace for my wife on our 25th marriage anniversary. The necklace was the reason behind the smile of my wife. Thank You so much to Tanishka jewellers for the great support.😇','2026-03-28 17:30:32.454599',3218,658,1714),('kishore kumar',5,'Excellent customer service and impressive designs which makes a killer combo when I am shopping for authentic Indian jewellery for my wedding. If you are looking for the best jewellery shop in Ramapuram look no further than Tanishka jewellers as they are the best in the business.','2026-03-28 17:30:32.457459',3219,658,1714),('Dhivya Advocate',5,'I liked the collection very much and it was an amazing experience to shop from the best jewellery shop near me. I strongly believe that Tanishka jewellers can showcase a strong competition to the likes of Tanishq and PCJ jewellers. Kudos to your entire team and I would recommend all my friends to visit here.','2026-03-28 17:30:32.460428',3220,658,1714),('Jayaraj K',5,'I really appreciate Praveena & Ashwin how patient and knowledgeable you were while helping me choose. You explained everything clearly and made the experience enjoyable. Your suggestions were thoughtful and matched exactly what I was looking for. Thank you for making my visit so pleasant.','2026-03-28 17:30:35.217179',3221,659,1715),('Vinodhini M',4,'I recently visited GRT Jewellers, Red Hills branch, and I had a very pleasant experience. The staff were extremely polite, patient, and helpful throughout the purchase process. They explained the designs, pricing details, and billing clearly, which made me feel comfortable and confident in my purchase.\n\nThe showroom was well-maintained, and there was a good variety of collections to choose from. I truly appreciate the customer service and support provided by the team.\n\nThank you for the wonderful service. I look forward to visiting again.','2026-03-28 17:30:35.219183',3222,659,1715),('Umesh Gangadharan',5,'I wanted to express my gratitude for the outstanding service I received at your gold shop. The staff Miss.Saranya(Ring section) were knowledgeable, friendly, and patient, helping me find the perfect piece. Their attention to detail and willingness to explain everything made the experience truly enjoyable. Please pass on my thanks to Miss.Saranya(Ring Section) involved. Looking forward to my next visit!\n\nBest regards,\nG. Umesh','2026-03-28 17:30:35.221266',3223,659,1715),('Sachin Vjs',5,'Had a wonderful experience purchasing gold from this shop. The designs are elegant, unique, and of excellent quality. Special thanks to Subhu Lakshmi, who explained every gold detail very clearly and patiently. She made the entire buying process smooth and easy to understand. Pricing was transparent with no hidden charges. Overall, a trustworthy and professional service—highly recommended ✨','2026-03-28 17:30:35.223582',3224,659,1715),('Jayashree',5,'We had a very good shopping experience at GRT Jewellers. Ms.Praveena was very polite and patient in showing many designs. Thank you for the good service.','2026-03-28 17:30:35.225933',3225,659,1715),('Chrissy Chrisel',5,'We had a very good experience purchasing gold jewellery at GRT Royapuram. Suriya and Sumathi assisted us during the purchase and showed a wide range of beautiful collections.\n\nThey were very patient and explained the details clearly, including the designs, weight, and pricing. They also helped us explore different options and made sure we were comfortable before finalizing our selection.\n\nTheir approach was polite and professional, and they gave us enough time to choose without any pressure. Because of their guidance, the whole buying process was smooth and pleasant.\n\nOverall, we are very happy with the service provided by Suriya and Sumathi and satisfied with our purchase at GRT Royapuram. We would recommend this store to others looking for a good gold jewellery collection and helpful customer service.','2026-03-28 17:30:39.238482',3226,660,1717),('Deepak kishore S',5,'We recently purchased gold jewellery from Suriya and Sumathi at GRT Royapuram, and the overall experience was excellent.\n\nBoth of them were very patient and professional throughout the purchase. They clearly explained the gold collections, designs, weight details, and pricing without any confusion. They also helped us compare multiple designs so we could choose the one that suited us best.\n\nThe collection available in the store was impressive, with a wide variety of traditional and modern designs. Suriya and Sumathi guided us through the options and ensured we were comfortable with our choice before finalizing the purchase.\n\nTheir customer service was polite, transparent, and not pushy, which made the buying experience smooth and trustworthy. Because of their assistance, we were able to confidently select the jewellery we wanted.\n\nOverall, we had a very satisfying purchase experience at GRT Royapuram, and we appreciate the support and service provided by Suriya and Sumathi. We would definitely recommend this store for anyone looking to buy quality gold jewellery with helpful staff.','2026-03-28 17:30:39.241722',3227,660,1717),('udaya shankar',5,'I had a wonderful experience shopping here, thanks to MS.Jamuna..She was incredibly professional. She helped me to get exactly what I was looking for and helped me find the perfect piece. She stayed smiling and showed me dozens of options without any rush or pressure. Her friendly attitude made the entire purchase process stress-free.\nI will definitely be coming back to her for my next purchase!\n\"Excellent customer service!\"\nHighly recommended!\"\nOnce again, Thank you so much Jamuna..','2026-03-28 17:30:39.244817',3228,660,1717),('Indian Kids',5,'We have visited the GRT Royapuram branch to purchase gold for my daughter. It was a nice experience and the staffs were very friendly and supportive. Especially, Mr\nPastin Rex and Mrs.Bhavani R guided us from start to finish until we complete the entire purchase. I would say this branch is extremely good than any other GRT Branch in Chennai. Thank you','2026-03-28 17:30:39.247779',3229,660,1717),('Chhai Charann',5,'I had a great experience at GRT Jewellers, Royapuram. The staff member Gayathri attended to me with a lot of patience and politeness, helping me choose the perfect jewelry with care. I really appreciate her customer service and professionalism. Thank you, GRT Royapuram, for such a pleasant shopping experience!','2026-03-28 17:30:39.250965',3230,660,1717),('Charisya Handoyo',5,'VERY GOOD STORE.... Found this beautiful set here, and the staff was very patient in helping me find this piece..\nDefinitely will come back..','2026-03-28 17:30:41.736907',3231,661,1719),('fayaz ahamed',5,'Such a lovely store! The staff made me feel very comfortable and helped me find the perfect piece. Beautiful designs, great quality, and amazing customer service. I’m very happy with my purchase and will definitely return.','2026-03-28 17:30:41.740250',3232,661,1719),('vaishnavi venkatraman',5,'We have an incredible experience at Gautham Jewlers every time we enter. From the moment you step into the store, it feels like a concierge rather than a sales experience. Not only is the collection expansive but the staff also are commited to finding you what you want at a price you are comfortable with. Strongly recommend going here!','2026-03-28 17:30:41.743502',3233,661,1719),('Yashwanth Nahar',5,'This is my third experience at the store. Ordered a Shiva idol in gold  for 16 grams , they took 20 days to deliver but after seeing the idol I guess it was worth it.','2026-03-28 17:30:41.746446',3234,661,1719),('antony raji',5,'Highly trustable store. Been buying from them for years and they\'ve been lucky for me as I have grown too.\nI am a satisfied customer.','2026-03-28 17:30:41.749329',3235,661,1719),('Dharani Hruday',5,'Product is more beautiful in person compare to the pictures and videos that are available online. I\'m really happy with the service, prompt response and also quick delivery.looking forward to shop more.','2026-03-28 17:30:46.794614',3236,662,1720),('Keerthana Palani',5,'I had seen their video\'s on insta page, And i decided to visit their shop for my engagement, seriously they surprised me with their collection\'s & i just loved it very much. The staff are very friendly and gud service to the customer. What I loved so much is a lot\'s of collection with affordable price with super quality.','2026-03-28 17:30:46.797200',3237,662,1720),('Priya Kalyan',5,'This is 3rd rental purchase had smooth dealing from the staff. No issues so far. Jewellery also good, same as we see in photos.','2026-03-28 17:30:46.801794',3238,662,1720),('keerthana Gopal',5,'Hi, I have purchased from little fingers for myself and my sister in law. They have very beautiful and unique collection for reasonable price. The staffs are very polite and responding promptly for any queries. Best customer service. Quality of the jewel is just awesome . They have jewels for rent and sale. Jewell has been sent to my location 10 days before wedding and It was really helpful.\n\nGo to shop for any bride to make your special occasion even more special.','2026-03-28 17:30:46.805898',3239,662,1720),('Asvin Kumar',5,'Amazing collections of new design jewellery. Reasonable rent with option to mix and match. Store keeper Jyothi had good vision on how to pick the right collections to match with the ceremony. Overall very good experience in choosing Little fingers for our bridal jewellery needs.','2026-03-28 17:30:46.810276',3240,662,1720),('Thakira Ismail',5,'Very good ...cloth quality is very good... affordable prices...we purchased tshirts and shirts','2026-03-28 17:30:48.137080',3241,663,1722),('Sharan P',5,'Our experience with Abharnam was fantastic! They helped us create a beautiful wedding set, and didn\'t even blink an eye at our rather customised request.\nWe stepped in with confused ideas for designs, and they helped us figure out what exactly we wanted.\nThey responds to queries around the clock , quickly and were very helpful.\nWe couldn\'t be happier with our experience with them','2026-03-28 17:30:48.139963',3242,663,1722),('Jothi Suresh',5,'\"Sheeba and Revathy, the owners of Abharnam, are passionate individuals dedicated to curating a diverse and stylish collection of artificial jewelry. Their commitment to quality, along with a keen eye for design, reflects in the shop\'s beautiful offerings!','2026-03-28 17:30:48.142721',3243,663,1722),('sri kumar ukkath',5,'Most modern fashionable designs at unbelievable rates and pleasing dealings made me and my family extremely happy. I was also surprised to note that a particular design of Kemp jewellery shown by my wife was delivered at our house within two days online. Anyone  who loves  to look for latest trends and   eye catching fashion jewellery designs( including rental ornaments) expecting decent dealings  should dial them at the earliest.','2026-03-28 17:30:48.145372',3244,663,1722),('Selvaraj Sharani',5,'Fabulous collections!! Cant miss to say how well they treat their customers and with so much of patience they understand the taste of the customer and provide the jewellery options! The collections are unique and gives a great look for any events!','2026-03-28 17:30:48.148252',3245,663,1722),('Kalai selvi Gopi',5,'One awesome place  with lot of collections. Very satisfying disign.The owner is very humble and very patient in listening to customer\'s expectations. The quality of jewellery is awesome. 10/10 in all aspects.','2026-03-28 17:30:52.590050',3246,664,1724),('yeruva chandupriya',5,'I had initially planned to just rent some jewellery from this shop, and honestly, I was a bit hesitant to even visit at first. But I’m so glad I did! The collection is absolutely stunning – so much so that when I went back to return the rental pieces, I ended up buying them instead! The designs are beautiful, the quality is excellent, and the overall experience was wonderful. Highly recommended for anyone looking for unique and elegant jewellery.','2026-03-28 17:30:52.593781',3247,664,1724),('Pragathi Murali',5,'Excellent collections ❤️\nJewel sets were good\nPurchased for the 1st time and whole heartedly thanking Hiranmayi bridal team ❤️','2026-03-28 17:30:52.597486',3248,664,1724),('Atchaiya boomi',5,'This shop in Perumbakkam is excellent! They offer a unique and beautiful collection of bridal jewellery. No matter what design we requested, they always had something new and impressive to show. Highly recommended!','2026-03-28 17:30:52.601302',3249,664,1724),('Jagath Chithira',5,'This shop is a Hidden Gem in Perumbakkam Area. One awesome place  with lot of collections. I just stopped to get an idea about Bridal jewellery. But I ended up Buying jewel for me and finished complete rental shopping for my sister\'s wedding. The owner is very humble and very patient in listening to customer\'s expectations. The quality of jewellery is awesome. 10/10 in all aspects.','2026-03-28 17:30:52.605587',3250,664,1724),('chess tamilan aachani chess academy',5,'Ashok jewellery sriperumbudur','2026-03-28 17:30:58.726625',3251,665,1726),('Waquas Azmi',4,'Jewellery shop.','2026-03-28 17:30:58.730273',3252,665,1726),('Deepishri Velan',5,'Had a wholesome experience at annai gold covering. Lots of options to choose from. Felt a lot comfortable and I took my time to choose the chains. Afte the insta hype I wanted to buy impon jewellery and I made the right choice visiting here. Aunty helped me patiently and I asked some maintainence tips as well.\nGood price good product, highly recommended','2026-03-28 17:31:03.046608',3253,666,1730),('Devika Ramachandran',5,'Excellent collection and excellent customer service. They have plenty of collections that too at an reasonable price. Best shop to purchase gold covering and other traditional ornaments','2026-03-28 17:31:03.050031',3254,666,1730),('Swarna Lakshmi',5,'Excellent collections of gold covering jewellery of all kinds in affordable price. Customer handling is really commendable. Nice I found a good shop for my purchase. Thank you','2026-03-28 17:31:03.053636',3255,666,1730),('arun priya',5,'I have purchased here some jewels last month. I had a wonderful experience. Very good quality with reasonable price. Satisfied with the purchase. Finally found the best shop for imitation jewels.','2026-03-28 17:31:03.057152',3256,666,1730),('Sreesha Shastri',5,'Had an awesome experience in shopping. The staffs were very friendly and helping to choose designs. They have largest collections of covering jewels at best and budget price. Overall the best to the satisfaction.','2026-03-28 17:31:03.060939',3257,666,1730),('Jaya shree',5,'I have been purchasing here for more than 3 years and have joined the chit scheme consecutively for 3 years. I have bought more than 10 sovereigns of gold at very good deals. The sales representative, Mrs. Dhanalakshmi, coordinated exceptionally well and provided excellent service throughout. The store offers the lowest VA (value addition) and has amazing new designs. I highly recommend this place to every family.','2026-03-28 17:31:05.615874',3258,667,1732),('Karuna Karan',5,'Excellent experience at Mahalakshmi Jewellers. Special thanks to Mrs.Sumathi  for her friendly approach and clear guidance throughout the purchase. She patiently explained the designs, purity details, and pricing, which made the selection process very comfortable.Overall, the service was smooth, trustworthy, and satisfying\nCollections can be included in jhumka section','2026-03-28 17:31:05.619363',3259,667,1732),('kiruba haran',5,'The overall experience was good. Only shop among the Big players still selling Silver ornaments on weight basis instead of piece rate. Transparent pricing and genuine customer service. The staffs in silver section, Mrs. Pooselvi and Mrs. Lakshmi were kind and professional in helping customers and were kind enough to provide information about all the articles on the shelves for sale. Great place to buy silver jewelry in gram based pricing. Good job and please spread the word.','2026-03-28 17:31:05.621898',3260,667,1732),('Suriya Siva',5,'I recently visited the showroom and was thoroughly impressed by the level of service. A huge thank you to the manager,  Mr. Ganesan, for running such a professional and welcoming establishment.\n​I was personally assisted by Sumathi and Poochelvi, who were such friendly as well as professional. both absolute delights to work with.\nBoth ensured that all my requirements were met with the utmost care and attention to detail.\n​Mr. Ganesan even checked in to ensure I was satisfied with my selection, which added a very nice personal touch to the visit. If you are looking for high-quality jewelry and a stress-free shopping experience, this is the place to go.','2026-03-28 17:31:05.624268',3261,667,1732),('priyana damodaran',5,'I visited the shop today,  we got the designs as we accepted and we love the designs. Sales person I didnt know her name but she patiently showed, for all our requirements as we requested the amount should not exceed to it. So she calculated each and every design before showing us. Thanks for your patience. And the floor manager Jothi Lakshmi mam, she is also very kind.\nI have noticed, I think he is the owner, was explaining patiently the customer needs or query.','2026-03-28 17:31:05.627265',3262,667,1732),('Raja Rangan',5,'Customer friendly shop,\nHuge collections of imitation jewellery available,\nDesigns are good quality similar to gold with low price,\nBest chidambaram covering shop in Thiruverkadu','2026-03-28 17:31:11.118981',3263,668,1734),('Sangeetha K',5,'Wonderful service\nWe are satisfied with products and designs\nSo many varieties of design are available\nRental jewels also so nice with valuable price\nKeep going on 😊','2026-03-28 17:31:11.121221',3264,668,1734),('Rangan C',5,'Excellent customer service provided\nVariety of collections and designs\nGood quality\nLow price\nBest gold covering shop in Chennai','2026-03-28 17:31:11.123698',3265,668,1734),('Naresh Kumar',5,'Variety and Beautifull collection of designs for both men and women, cutomers handling satisfied at it\'s best. Great place to shop.','2026-03-28 17:31:11.125985',3266,668,1734),('Vaishnavi g',5,'Products are good in quality\nVariety of designs are shown\nHope to be best in future sister👏✨🔥','2026-03-28 17:31:11.128413',3267,668,1734),('Stella Mary',4,'I am very impressed with the clever design by the jewellers','2026-03-28 17:31:14.450133',3268,669,1737),('Saranya Saranya',5,'I brought a gold chain over there that\'s my 1st experience, it is very gorgeous and now I\'m also interested to buy something in that jewellery shop 😍😍😍😍','2026-03-28 17:31:14.453919',3269,669,1737),('Arun kumar',5,'Good place to buy gold and silver very affordable price very trustful shop','2026-03-28 17:31:14.456988',3270,669,1737),('Subathra mangeshwarrao',5,'Best place for silver & gold shopping & staffs  are very kind to customers.','2026-03-28 17:31:14.460114',3271,669,1737),('Ganesh Mutha',5,'Good service and best in price','2026-03-28 17:31:14.464002',3272,669,1737),('Rashi R',5,'Jennifer was extremely friendly and showed us collections with patience. Highly recommend this store and service. Polite clean and lovely collections. Sneha also assisted us well.','2026-03-28 17:31:17.153415',3273,670,1738),('Umaiyal Devi prasad',5,'Good customer service. Product quality is very nice. Sneha mam provided a good staff service','2026-03-28 17:31:17.157913',3274,670,1738),('Praveen Galipelly',5,'Kusha\'s jewellery collections are pretty good and best in price.','2026-03-28 17:31:17.161612',3275,670,1738),('Nirmala Rajasekhar',5,'Friendly staff,  impressive collection. Have purchased sets with the help of Rani sales style associate. Would  highly recommend this store for everyone.','2026-03-28 17:31:17.165280',3276,670,1738),('Monbie27',5,'Shop is clean and bright. Sales person is doing their job great. Thank you.\nOne suggestion: you don’t have to stand next to the customer throughout their shopping..it’s bit uncomfortable. Thank you for your service','2026-03-28 17:31:17.169500',3277,670,1738),('shaja khan',5,'Owner is too friendly. He treats every customer is king. I am regular to his shop only for him. The shop managing director name is Hussain Mohamed. Please go and visit the shop and say hi to him.\nAnd say the code \"YoYo Squad\" and get 10% discount on all products.','2026-03-28 17:31:20.544499',3278,671,1739),('Fathima M',5,'Collections are awesome\nExclusive jewel collections. i am.very much satisfied for the cost of money i paid for the jewels','2026-03-28 17:31:20.547942',3279,671,1739),('November',5,'Value for money... Worth buying','2026-03-28 17:31:20.551120',3280,671,1739),('Sampath Zoom',5,'I had an amazing experience at Kamadhenu Jewellers! The staff were incredibly knowledgeable, patient, and helped me find the perfect piece of jewelry for a special occasion. Their collection is stunning, with a variety of unique and high-quality designs. The attention to detail and customer service really made me feel valued as a customer. I highly recommend Kamadhenu Jewellers for anyone looking for exquisite jewelry and a personalized shopping experience. I\'ll definitely be coming back!','2026-03-28 17:31:23.421180',3281,672,1740),('PHPA20009 SUMATHI',5,'The silver jewellery collection here is just stunning — elegant, detailed, and clearly crafted with care. From traditional to modern designs, there\'s something for every taste. The staff were friendly, patient, and knowledgeable, helping me choose the perfect pieces without any pressure. Prices were fair for the quality, and the packaging was beautiful too.','2026-03-28 17:31:23.424714',3282,672,1740),('Nithya',2,'I recently purchased silver jewellery worth over ₹15,000 from this shop and was quite disappointed with the payment experience.\n\nAt the time of billing, I informed them I would be paying a small portion of ₹4200+ through debit card and ₹10,600 through other means (chit savings) Before proceeding, I specifically asked whether their card machine accepted international debit cards, and they confirmed it did, but only after that, they added that they would charge an additional 3.5% on the card transaction.\nThis surcharge was applied even though:\n\nThe transaction was processed in Indian rupees, with no currency conversion involved.\n\nMy bank charges zero foreign conversion fees for INR payments, meaning the shop would receive the full amount requested.\n\nThe Merchant Discount Rate (MDR), the fee banks charge merchants for processing card payments, is meant to be absorbed by the merchant in India, not passed on to the customer, according to RBI guidelines.\n\nI found this unreasonable and refrained from using my international card altogether. In the end, I had to ask my father to pay the full amount using his locally issued Indian debit card to avoid the unnecessary surcharge.\n\nWhile I appreciate the craftsmanship of their jewellery, this practice of adding an undisclosed surcharge at the point of payment feels both unprofessional and against the spirit of fair trade. Customers should be informed of all additional charges upfront, especially when they are contrary to standard RBI norms.\n\nIt’s disappointing that a store selling high-value items chooses to burden customers with extra fees rather than price their goods accordingly or absorb the MDR as most reputable merchants do.\nTo make matters worse, they even forgot to give us the invoice with our purchase. We only realized after getting home and checking all the boxes, no bill at all. Now we have to make another trip back to the shop just to collect the invoice. Beautiful jewellery, but hidden fees and sloppy billing make for a frustrating experience.','2026-03-28 17:31:23.428274',3283,672,1740),('Dinesh Kanna',5,'Great collection with an Amazing service. Sales person Kousalya patiently showed us their jewels collection, went above and beyond to make sure we found the jewelry of our liking. Deepesh and Darshan make sure to provide exemplary service.','2026-03-28 17:31:23.431617',3284,672,1740),('Thanya Tamizh',5,'The way they treat the customers. I Know them since my childhood...Since me my mom and my family have great hope on them  for their collection ,purity and also customer satisfaction we are always satisfied with the shop.Once we approach them Mukesh uncle will be their to guide us and Makes the work complete. All Do visit The shop  for more collections in Silver and Gold.Visit Once and Then U will become their customers.','2026-03-28 17:31:23.434513',3285,672,1740),('Jeevan Suvishesh',5,'I had a wonderful experience at Thangamayil urapakkam. Special thanks to sumithra staff for their patience and professional work. They made me feel comfortable and gave excellent service. Truly satisfied!','2026-03-28 17:31:25.804246',3286,673,1741),('Parvatharajan Pakkiam',5,'It was my first purchase at Thangamayil Urapakkam, and honestly, it felt special.\n\nFrom the moment we walked in, there was a very positive and welcoming vibe in the store. The collections were beautiful and impressive good variety and elegant designs that really stood out.\n\nBut what touched me most was the customer service. Sowmiya patiently explained every detail about the products and gave genuine suggestions. It never felt like she was trying to sell — it felt like a family member guiding us sincerely to make the right choice. That comfort and trust made all the difference.\n\nOverall it was a heartfelt experience.\nThangamayil truly won my respect.','2026-03-28 17:31:25.808505',3287,673,1741),('Krashang Mudlyiar',5,'We had a wonderful experience at Tangamaiyil Jewellery. The employee who assisted us, Ms. Tirupurasundari, was extremely polite, patient, and knowledgeable. She guided us through every design with genuine suggestions and helped us make the right choice without any pressure. Her friendly nature and professionalism made our visit truly pleasant. Highly appreciate her service and the overall hospitality at Tangamaiyil Jewellery!','2026-03-28 17:31:25.812773',3288,673,1741),('Samyuktha A',5,'I had a wonderful experience at Thangamayil Jewellery. Sowmiya was extremely polite, patient, and knowledgeable. She explained every detail clearly and helped me choose the perfect design without any pressure.  customer-friendly approach and professionalism made the entire shopping experience smooth and comfortable. Truly appreciate the excellent service highly recommended!','2026-03-28 17:31:25.817274',3289,673,1741),('Sarah Christopher',5,'Over all good experience! I just wish the explanation for each product along with the hidden charges, { (i.e) wastage and other stuff } be more transparent and simple. Not everyone understands and calculate immediately when its quoted with percentage. It can be very confusing to young people who start investing in gold. I\'d like to appreciate Mr. Lokesh for his genuinely concerns and patience. He was very very patient and clearly answered to each and every question of mine. Much much appreciations to him🙌👏 Hoping to purchase again. To add, Digi Gold system is very easily done compared to other Gold shops, Kudos to that too.','2026-03-28 17:31:25.821238',3290,673,1741),('padma Priya',5,'I had an excellent experience at SR Jewellery, Vadapalani! The collection was beautiful, and the service was outstanding. A special mention to Manager Kannan, who went above and beyond to make my shopping experience smooth and memorable. His patience, professionalism, and friendly approach truly stand out , he ensured I got the best designs within my budget and made me feel completely comfortable throughout.\n\nAlso, a big thanks to Sales Assistant Baby for her kind and attentive service. She was very polite and helped me choose exactly what I wanted.\n\nOverall, SR Jewellery Vadapalani deserves full marks for their hospitality and quality. Highly recommended! 💎✨','2026-03-28 17:31:32.294619',3291,674,1743),('Dharshini',5,'Manjula ramu.R\n\n“Beautiful designs and excellent quality jewellery. Staff were very friendly and helpful.”\n“Good collection with reasonable prices. Very satisfied with the service.” “Elegant jewellery and trustworthy shop. Had a great shopping experience.”\nWide variety of designs and neat finishing. Highly recommended.”\n.“Nice ambience and quality products. Worth visiting again','2026-03-28 17:31:32.297938',3292,674,1743),('G.Deepika G.Deepika',4,'I had a wonderful experience at SR Jewellery, Vadapalani. Their collection is beautiful and the service was exceptional.\n\nA special thanks to Baby ma’am, who went above and beyond to make my shopping experience smooth and memorable. Her patience, professionalism, and friendly nature were truly impressive.\nHighly recommended!','2026-03-28 17:31:32.301058',3293,674,1743),('Praveena Praveena',5,'I had visited SR Jewellery Vadapalani branch their collections is really awesome & special thanks to baby mam as well as the Cashier Jhansi mam they patience and friendliness makes us to purchase here always.','2026-03-28 17:31:32.303983',3294,674,1743),('SANGEETHA M',5,'You people are amazing. You are providing very good service and you have very good designs of Hand chains I like it very very much. It was a good experience to deal with you.Dhivya sis was very nice approach our client.','2026-03-28 17:31:32.306829',3295,674,1743),('Français pour les enfants French for kids',5,'I had a wonderful experience purchasing beads from Eva. The beads were of excellent quality, beautifully crafted, and exactly as described. Eva was very friendly, helpful, and responded quickly to my questions. The packaging was okay but the delivery was prompt. I am very happy with my purchase and would definitely recommend Eva to anyone looking for beautiful beads and great service.','2026-03-28 17:31:40.415839',3296,675,1747),('Peter Arumugam',5,'Last week Naa Beads and charms order pannirundhe quality and quantity worth for money, and hair clips complementary ah kuduthurundhanga, I\'m so happy 🥰','2026-03-28 17:31:40.418206',3297,675,1747),('millo asha',4,'The products is of good quality and worth it but it\'s took more than 15 days to deliver in North East India.','2026-03-28 17:31:40.420439',3298,675,1747),('Preethi R',5,'I received parcel mam it\'s too good and I like free gifts also mam thank you so much','2026-03-28 17:31:40.422623',3299,675,1747),('Gomathi S',5,'Nice product and good quality with reasonable price of the product','2026-03-28 17:31:40.425337',3300,675,1747),('Franncis Xavier',5,'I’ve never personally visited this store, but I’m giving a full 5-star rating from my heart ❤️.\n\nThe reason is simple — the owner’s humanity. Seeing the showroom owner celebrate an employee’s Seemantham inside the store truly touched me. In today’s world, very few business owners treat their staff like family, but this gesture shows real respect, care, and culture.\n\nIt’s not just about selling products, it’s about valuing people. Celebrating such an important personal moment for an employee in the workplace speaks volumes about the owner’s character. It shows leadership with emotion, kindness, and responsibility.\n\nFrom the bottom of my heart, thank you for setting such a beautiful example. Businesses grow not only with profit, but with compassion like this. Hats off to the showroom owner and the entire team 👏. Keep inspiring others!','2026-03-28 17:31:45.036353',3301,676,1751),('Ambedkar p',5,'Truly appreciate the human values and care shown — arranging baby showers for staff reflects genuine love and respect on your video. Kudos to the owner and team!','2026-03-28 17:31:45.040012',3302,676,1751),('Abinaya Sridharan',5,'The collections are out of the world! And the service is amazing with patience they show every options…  we loved the service provided by Siraj sir! Thanks :)\nCan’t wait to come back for more.','2026-03-28 17:31:45.043315',3303,676,1751),('Vasanth S',3,'Luxe Velachery ornaments shop and cosmetics.\nPros-\nGood collections and neatly arranged.\nAmbience is also very good. Parking facility also there..\nCons-\nprice is very high comparing sowcarpet shops. When I asked the reason the said it\'s quality product and brought from Mumbai, sowcarpet shops also have the same quality.\nPrice is 40 to 50 percent higher than sowcarpet shops.','2026-03-28 17:31:45.046887',3304,676,1751),('Ahamed Haja',5,'Very nice collection and very reasonable price to buy the accessories and rental have more collection and all the sales present very kind and nice to customers❤️❤️','2026-03-28 17:31:45.050642',3305,676,1751),('Neha Kothari',5,'“An amazing collection at the store — trendy, elegant, and truly versatile! A must-visit for anyone who loves fashion. The designs cater beautifully to all age groups, from teenagers to elders. Every piece is simply stunning!”','2026-03-28 17:31:47.698354',3306,677,1753),('Shreya Shah',5,'I\'m a regular customer of Anmol, have shopped for my wedding, and my sister\'s wedding - and everytime I have received so many compliments for my jewellery.\n\nAnmol\'s collection is amazing _ great quality and craftsmanship. And their service is even better. I\'d strongly recommend Anmol if you are looking for good quality, affordable indian wear jewellery.','2026-03-28 17:31:47.701511',3307,677,1753),('Payal Jain',5,'I visited for the first  time but it felt like I am familiar to it .... make customer comfortable n with patience they treat us ... n v helping with all the matters ... Will surely refer for further shopping from here','2026-03-28 17:31:47.704917',3308,677,1753),('K',5,'Amazing jewellery collection they have.. And such a good customer service.. My any time go to place for Shopping.. They have such intricate designs and also customise accordingly..','2026-03-28 17:31:47.708279',3309,677,1753),('Ridhika Hirani',5,'A one stop place for all ethnic accessories. The collection here is amazing and the quality is worth the price. All their pieces are so elegant and class apart. And they are customer friendly too. Had an amazing experience shopping here ☺️','2026-03-28 17:31:47.711460',3310,677,1753),('Shalini Ganesan',5,'Collections are really unique and lovely. Particularly I love the earring collections..🧚‍♀️I gifted to one of my friend and she loved it.','2026-03-28 17:31:49.387722',3311,678,1754),('RAJASEKAR S',5,'Collection are superbeautiful.. Customer handling is also nice.. Especially bangles are extraordinary..','2026-03-28 17:31:49.390975',3312,678,1754),('Thaniya lakshmi',5,'Hello all, here all variety of jewels are available, so good to see and feels good to wear it, everywhere everyone asking about where we got this, the ornaments are that much amazing 💖','2026-03-28 17:31:49.394491',3313,678,1754),('Gopi Nath Manjunath gopi Nath',5,'The Gorgeous store has very nice collections with quality product at cheapest price...','2026-03-28 17:31:49.398412',3314,678,1754),('rajalakshmi gururaj',5,'Awesome beautiful collection.. Please visit the store..','2026-03-28 17:31:49.401734',3315,678,1754),('charu arvind',5,'Best place to buy your jewels here. Gold are good quality good pricing. Diamonds they sell are really lucky. You can trust in buying. Kairaasi. Billings are really faster than expected.','2026-03-28 17:31:53.196985',3316,679,1755),('Raju Nagarajan (RN-Vacations)',5,'Great selection. Wonderful craftsmanship. Bought silver jewelry for boys and they loved it','2026-03-28 17:31:53.199993',3317,679,1755),('Vaidhyanathan Natarajan',4,'Neighborhood jewellery shop.  Readymade jewellery are available.  You can order your own designs too.','2026-03-28 17:31:53.202427',3318,679,1755),('Vaishnavi S',5,'Very many designs.. very quick service and customer friendly','2026-03-28 17:31:53.205828',3319,679,1755),('priya balaji',5,'My favorite jewellery shop...They are provided awesome service....Thank you all','2026-03-28 17:31:53.208801',3320,679,1755),('Ramya Giri',5,'I recently rented bridal jewellery and had a wonderful experience! The collection was stunning, with elegant design that perfectly matched my outfit.\nSharmila akka was very helpful in suggesting designs that suited my style. Overall, great quality, excellent service, and totally worth it for any bride who wants a beautiful look without spending too much.','2026-03-28 17:31:58.237712',3321,680,1756),('Swathi Mohan',5,'Hi. This is Swathi. I recently rented jewelry for my Engagement and Wedding, I was blown away by the quality and variety of pieces you offer. The staff was knowledgeable and helpful in finding the perfect jewelry to match my outfit. The rental process was seamless and I received so many compliments on the jewelry and would highly recommend this shop to anyone looking for affordable and stylish jewelry options.','2026-03-28 17:31:58.240122',3322,680,1756),('kruthika kumar',5,'They have alot of collections and many variety\nIt was very good service\nThe rental set are at the best\nHad a great expriences and affordable also','2026-03-28 17:31:58.243307',3323,680,1756),('amudha varshini',5,'The store has great collections. Mrs. Sharmila and Ms. Divya helped me to choose the right bridal jewellery set :)','2026-03-28 17:31:58.246592',3324,680,1756),('Pooja Shree',5,'I am happy with customer service and deal. She is very polite and suggested so many jewellery to try. Brides and bridesmaid jewelry are available in wide range. Customer friendly. Have a great day ahead. Thank you sharmila 😊','2026-03-28 17:31:58.249351',3325,680,1756),('uki ugranth',1,'Worst experience buying gold at this shop.\nI have been purchasing gold through the Krishna Jewel Park application for the last one year and have accumulated almost 11 grams. Unfortunately, the customer support is extremely poor. Only one staff member handled my deal, and they clearly lacked proper knowledge.\nI even traveled all the way from Pondicherry, but it was a complete disappointment. They charged many extra fees and did not calculate GST or the current gold value correctly. Nothing was explained clearly or transparently.\nOverall, the experience was very frustrating and unprofessional. I will never visit or recommend this place again\'','2026-03-28 17:32:03.396836',3326,681,1758),('Bicky Thomas',1,'I given Pearl chain for converting to sliver thread, model what I expect they can’t make it. I told not to do anything return my jewel. He said it will come to shop in one or two days. They will call me said. I’m busy with work I forgotten it. I made call to shop, no one knowing the given material. I paid advance of Rs.2000/- bill I send no staff cannot know owner also avail e they said. Given on Nov 2024 I followed in 30 days. After I was traveling abroad I called shop on April no response. Same dialogue from shop staff owner is not available. 7 October 2025 I called him ask for jewel his father talked to me so rude stating jewel is not available. I never asked for money also, I asked only given jewel. Then I went to shop shown bill. He asked for original then only he will show it. I asked him to show the jewel then he shown me jewel and given original bills to Makesh son. He return my jewel and money. Mr.Mukesh speak polity to me. But his father not shown respect. Today I loss my respect with these guys. I paid I given product. They telling me after 8 months product will not be there. What is it. No proper response of the customer care staffs. Many will handle the phone.','2026-03-28 17:32:03.400366',3327,681,1758),('Venkata Krishnan',1,'⭐ 1 Star\n\nVery disappointed with my experience. I was initially given an estimate based on a different weight, but after requesting a lock change for the chain, the weight changed — and the shop didn’t account for this while billing. I was overcharged by ₹4,500 without proper explanation.\n\nI spent ₹4.35 lakhs and still wasn’t even offered a basic return gift, which is common practice in most jewellery stores. Poor customer service and lack of transparency. I will never visit this shop again and do not recommend it.','2026-03-28 17:32:03.404581',3328,681,1758),('Nandish',1,'Weight mismatch issue, half the weight only delivered\nI trusted you, but jewellery send me under weight product\nI ordered silver bracelet with the weight of 98grams at the time of order I made, I confirm that details in mentioned that website is it true, weight was 98 grams I asked through WhatsApp. Jewellery said that 98 grams of silver bracelet correct sir,\nSo I believed jewellery and I made a ordered though online at Saturday, and delivered at Monday I checked the weight that as 47.9 grams only instead of 98grams and I checked physical invoice mentioned 48.1 grams.\nDigital invoice mentioned correctly 98grams at the time of ordered I made.\nThen I made a phone call to jewellery, staff said owner is out of station, you call back tomorrow.\nFinally I want a solution\nDocuments are attached','2026-03-28 17:32:03.408785',3329,681,1758),('Rajan K',3,'only one contact number is provided and it is not reachable many times. Please share alternative number to reach out the shop.','2026-03-28 17:32:03.412150',3330,681,1758),('Dinesh Kumar',4,'Good','2026-03-28 17:32:05.611296',3331,682,1760),('Manivel Sutha',5,'Good welcome ring collection super','2026-03-28 17:32:10.357437',3332,683,1764),('Veni 403',1,'I purchase earring for my daughter.They r giving 18to 20 cat ,but charging 22cat rate .','2026-03-28 17:32:10.361060',3333,683,1764),('Sudhakar',5,'Very excellent designs and perfect quality super Store maintenance with A/C','2026-03-28 17:32:10.364430',3334,683,1764),('WMSE we make science easier',4,'Nice but there is no parking so you should park vehicles in road','2026-03-28 17:32:10.367895',3335,683,1764),('Vijay Raj K',5,'The one shop with best collections in ponneri.. price will be similar to other shops..','2026-03-28 17:32:10.371154',3336,683,1764),('Vijayalakshmi Ammu',5,'Very happy with my purchase.The design is elegant and the quality is superr. It adds a perfect touch to any traditional outfit. Truly worth the price! The chain