, with many compliments pouring in - people just couldn\'t stop raving about the beautiful jewelry!\n\nA huge thank you to Viha Bridals for curating such an exquisite collection. I highly recommend them for all your bridal and non-bridal jewelry needs - you won\'t be disappointed!','2026-03-28 17:33:05.543120',3383,694,1785),('Aadarsh Ravi',5,'Viha Bridal Jewelry is absolutely amazing! Their collection is stunning, with a perfect mix of traditional and modern designs. The shop has a warm and welcoming ambiance, and the staff is incredibly helpful and knowledgeable. Highly recommend for any bride-to-be!','2026-03-28 17:33:05.546059',3384,694,1785),('Vinisha',5,'I recently rented a jewelry set from Viha Bridal Jewelry for my sister’s engagement, and the necklace stood out with its unique design, catching everyone\'s attention. They offer a stunning collection of high-quality jewelry at affordable prices. I’m excited to shop for more pieces from their store for future occasions.','2026-03-28 17:33:05.548667',3385,694,1785),('Shanmathi Udayakumar',5,'I recently got to try the jewels from viva bridal jewellery for my engagement, the quality was very good and the collections are very nice. I would highly recommend it for all the bride to be to check the shops for some affordable but elegant jewellery. I loved the way they treated the customers','2026-03-28 17:33:05.551524',3386,694,1785),('Ravi Muthusamy',5,'Stunning bridal jewelry.  The collection is elegant, and the staff is super helpful. Highly recommend for unique designs','2026-03-28 17:33:05.554605',3387,694,1785),('Vaishali Manian',5,'Collections are wonderful! I shopped my engagement sets from here which turned out to be a Super Hit! Now I visited for my bridal set and was so happy to find the perfect match. I really loved the way Ponmaari Akka helped me find exactly what I wanted. She was so patient and kind to me. I appreciate her and the entire team for helping customers pick what\'s best for each individual! Kudos to the entire team for all your efforts and hard work ❤️ Thank you Team Anigalan!!','2026-03-28 17:33:13.469506',3388,695,1787),('Jana Priya',1,'I walked into this shop excited because they genuinely have a good jewellery collection. But the way I was treated by the staff was extremely disappointing. The attitude and lack of basic courtesy spoiled my mood and made the entire visit stressful. No matter how good the collection is, poor customer service can completely overshadow it. I left feeling upset rather than satisfied. I request you to change your staffs so that you can have a good name in the market rather than having only good collections.','2026-03-28 17:33:13.471387',3389,695,1787),('T V NARAYANAN',5,'Very nice and reliable place to buy fashion jewellery in the East Tambaram area.Good personalized services by the efficient staff lead by the team leader Smt.Sridevi .M R....The collections are wide ranging and the rates are moderate.We like this shop and once in a time visit will prevent us to visit T.Nagar and City side Shops.ANIGALAN IS the best choice in these days of highest Gold prices and safety of ornaments while travel too..\nT V.Narayanan & Mangala Narayanan','2026-03-28 17:33:13.473008',3390,695,1787),('AKSHAYA KM',1,'I visited this shop to buy rental jewellery for my sister’s baby shower. The customer service was very worst that she wasn’t even allowed to use the washroom. Even when they knew that she was pregnant. This kind of sales girl should not be appointed in shop, request you to change them and appoint kind people.','2026-03-28 17:33:13.474613',3391,695,1787),('KrishnaKumar Thiagarajan',5,'They have a huge collection of bridal rental and sale. Customer service is so good and they help you out in choosing the designs for the dresses.\n\nThey have all things like matte finish, antique finish gold jewels, hip belts and ornaments for hair styling. U will feel u had gone to sowcarpet.Best and reasonable pricing..\n\nHeard that they do deliver outside chennai via courier','2026-03-28 17:33:13.476218',3392,695,1787),('Sai teja Badri',5,'I had booked Narayana Bali pooja at Rameswaram through Harivara and the entire experience was truly exceptional. From the initial booking to the completion of the ritual, everything was handled in a very professional, transparent, and devotional manner.\n\nThey guided me clearly about the procedure, timings, and rituals, and ensured that the pooja was performed strictly according to Vedic traditions by knowledgeable and experienced priests. The arrangements were well organized, peaceful, and spiritually uplifting, which gave me great mental satisfaction.\n\nI am extremely grateful to Harivara Trust for their dedication, discipline, and genuine care towards devotees. I strongly recommend Harivara Trust to anyone looking for authentic and hassle-free Narayana Bali or other spiritual services at Rameswaram.\n\nTruly a 5-star, divine, and trustworthy experience. 🙏✨','2026-03-28 17:33:16.006937',3393,696,1789),('PPrashant Dagha',5,'We had ordered a Pooja (Sundarkand path and hawan) for 28th Feb. This was quite a good experience. Pandit Dharmendra Shukla ji were on time and he did the path and hawan so nicely and also explained the significance to all of us. We all have genuinely loved and looking for more poojas.','2026-03-28 17:33:16.011011',3394,696,1789),('Susmita Talluri',5,'I happened to book pooja from Harivara. My whole family is extremely happy with the way they conducted the ceremony. They talked to us very politely and it was such a divine experience. Kudos to the entire team!!','2026-03-28 17:33:16.015026',3395,696,1789),('ramya sathya',5,'We recently had the Sathyanarayana Puja performed at our home, and we are extremely pleased with the service provided by Pandit Gururajan. He conducted the entire puja with devotion, calmness, and clear explanation of every ritual. His chanting was very soothing, and the narration of the Satyanarayana Katha created a truly divine atmosphere in our home.\n\nHe was punctual, well-prepared, and ensured that all arrangements were taken care of smoothly. Our family felt very comfortable throughout the puja, and we truly appreciate his patience and the way he guided us during each step.\n\nHighly recommended for anyone looking for a knowledgeable and devoted priest for Sathyanarayana Puja or any other rituals.','2026-03-28 17:33:16.019244',3396,696,1789),('Balakrishnan Swaminathan',4,'My experience with Harihara for the Kashi Yatra was a memorable one.\nThe arrangements were excellent …starting from the taxi pick up and drops, hotel bookings and the ritual services and the tour guide services.\n\nOverall well managed tour and fully satisfied.\n\nWould highly  recommended to others to use their services.','2026-03-28 17:33:16.023202',3397,696,1789),('Suresh Kamatchi',5,'We are truly grateful to have had such a knowledgeable and dedicated Hindu wedding priest in Chennai for our Naidu wedding at M Convention, Chennai. The entire Vedic wedding ceremony was conducted with great devotion, clarity, and perfect timing.\n\nFrom Ganapathi Pooja to Mangalya Dharanam and Saptapadi, every ritual was explained beautifully and performed according to traditional Vedic procedures. His pronunciation of mantras, calm presence, and organized approach made the ceremony feel divine and meaningful for both families.\n\nMany guests appreciated how smoothly the wedding rituals were performed at M Convention, and how the priest guided us with patience throughout the ceremony. The coordination with the wedding team and maintaining muhurtham timing was excellent.\n\nIf anyone is looking for a professional Brahmin purohit in Chennai for a traditional Naidu wedding, purohith karthikeyan sastry is highly recommended. He truly made our day very special','2026-03-28 17:33:18.334771',3398,697,1790),('Vivek Pandey',5,'We are truly blessed to have Sastry ji as the purohith for our intercultural wedding. From the first discussion till the end of the wedding, he handled everything with such care, patience, and deep knowledge.\n\nWe had many doubts about rituals, meanings, and how to blend traditions from both cultures. He clearly explained each step in simple English, made both families comfortable, and ensured everyone felt included and respected.\n\nThe pooja was done in a very calm, powerful, and meaningful way. Not just chanting, but he made us understand the importance of every ritual, which made our wedding even more special and memorable.\n\nHis professionalism, warmth, and positive energy are truly extraordinary. We highly recommend him for intercultural, traditional, or modern weddings. A purohith who performs with both heart and wisdom.','2026-03-28 17:33:18.338225',3399,697,1790),('Premkumar',5,'We are filled with divine joy and heartfelt gratitude after the Ganapathi Homam performed by Purohith Karthikeya Sastry. The entire homam felt deeply sacred and spiritually uplifting. From the chanting of mantras to the final poornahuti, every moment radiated purity, devotion, and powerful positive vibrations.\n\nHis voice, clarity in mantras, and sincere bhakti created an atmosphere where we truly felt Lord Ganapathi\'s presence in our home. It was not just a pooja, but a blessed spiritual experience that brought immense peace, happiness, and confidence to our family.\n\nPurohith Karthikeya Sastry performs with complete dedication, patience, and divine grace. We felt extremely fortunate to have him conduct this homam for us. Our hearts are full, our minds are calm, and our home feels truly blessed. We strongly recommend him to anyone seeking a genuinely divine and fulfilling pooja experience.','2026-03-28 17:33:18.342609',3400,697,1790),('Dhiksha Kishore',5,'We invited Purohith Karthikeya Sastry for our housewarming pooja, and the experience was very peaceful and positive. He performed the rituals with sincerity, explained the steps clearly, and made sure everything was done properly according to tradition. His calm presence and dedication made the whole ceremony feel very divine and meaningful for our family. I would definitely recommend him to anyone looking for a knowledgeable and sincere priest for poojas and homams.','2026-03-28 17:33:18.346409',3401,697,1790),('Vissy vishal',5,'We are very happy and thankful to karthikeyan Sastry for making our wedding ceremony so special. He was kind, calm, and guided us through every step with care. The way he performed the rituals was very clear and peaceful.\n\nOur family and friends also felt very connected and happy. Thank you so much for your blessings and support on our big day!','2026-03-28 17:33:18.350729',3402,697,1790),('Ramesh hari',5,'Very good &Authontic Iyer in Chennai.Sins For 10 year He is local Hindu Preist . we invite him For Our every family function & occasions\nHighly Recommended\n🌟🌟🌟🌟🌟','2026-03-28 17:33:20.591203',3403,698,1791),('Dhinakaran Ramu',5,'The Iyer performed the housewarming ceremony extremely well. He explained all the homams clearly before each prayer, which helped us understand the significance of every ritual. He was very patient and pleasant throughout the ceremony. My entire family is very happy and satisfied with his service','2026-03-28 17:33:24.822649',3404,699,1795),('Balaji R',5,'Jayaprakash Prohithar, performed a house warming function for us very well. It was very divine. He had explained every single reason for chanting the mantras and it\'s benefits. He spreads lots of positivity while doing the pooja.','2026-03-28 17:33:24.826036',3405,699,1795),('Triviae Hotels',4,'Really nice that we got mr jayaprakash for my sister house warming Pooja ceremony he did with the passion and with the vibe of manths which he has chanting, we are happy with his service and budget friendly,\nThank you once again mr jayaprakash','2026-03-28 17:33:24.829367',3406,699,1795),('Valar Mathy',5,'It was our pleasure to have Jayaprakash sir for our house warming ceremony . He was so good and 