use..  he graciously accepted the request in a very short notice and supported us in the time of need.. He came on time and performed all the rites and rituals in a very traditional and formal way. His conduct and performance is very gracious. We would certainly recommend him for any event.','2026-03-28 17:33:38.249260',3414,701,1800),('moolam sreenivasulu rao',5,'We were searching for a Telugu purohitar to perform our new apartment Gruhapravesam. Finally, we got Vidyasagar sastry garu and performed puja and sathyanarayana vatram very well. All our family members, relatives & guests are very happy the way puja was performed by explaining all details clearly and patiently. He was very punchutal and also rang up 1 hour before puja to remind to be on time for puja. Totally we are very happy to have our gruhapravesam done by telugu purohitar in telugu. Once again thanks to Sastry garu.','2026-03-28 17:33:38.252032',3415,701,1800),('ram raghu',5,'We performed Rudrabhisheka and Satyanarayana swami vratam, guruvugaru Vidya Sagar garu performed both rituals with perfection and i am so happy the way Pooja is done. He comes from a very rich back ground of Vedic culture and mantra uccharana was very vibrant. Blessed feeling,,,','2026-03-28 17:33:38.254939',3416,701,1800),('Srikanth Pasumarthi Venkata',5,'I have known Vidya Sagar Shastri garu for a long time and he is my go to person for any  auspicious muhurtas. We are very happy to his expertise and always makes sure to explain all the aspects of the specific Subha Gadiya.','2026-03-28 17:33:38.257697',3417,701,1800),('Manchella Rao',5,'We found through G search and completed Puja at home. We are very Happy with the services provided and perfectly arranged Puja for us at home. It\'s a divine Day for us. Thanks to Shri Vidyasagar Garu.. we recommend the services for all types of Puja at Home','2026-03-28 17:33:38.260571',3418,701,1800),('Jayaraman Bala',5,'Very Good at their work. Timing as well.','2026-03-28 17:33:47.315227',3419,702,1801),('Shivaramakrishnan Kumar',5,'Very happy with the way they have performed the Pooja','2026-03-28 17:33:47.317423',3420,702,1801),('Jayaraman Kalyanasundaram',5,'Super 👌 👍 😍 🥰','2026-03-28 17:33:47.318823',3421,702,1801),('Srinivasan Jagannathan',5,'Divine experience','2026-03-28 17:33:47.320161',3422,702,1801),('Shanthi Jayaraman',5,'Super 💗👍👌👍💯','2026-03-28 17:33:47.321418',3423,702,1801),('Flora P',5,'I wanting to buy some good quality stones.\nI found this shop online. I was a very good surprise to talk with an Astrologer so easily. I could ask questions and understand why and how I should wear stones.\nThank you.','2026-03-28 17:34:02.522235',3424,703,1805),('Anandha Babu Ganapathy',5,'My brother bought a gem ring here long back and given good feedback.\nRecently, We went to buy a gem ring (Kanaga pushpa raagam).\nAfter going there, we really surprised about Raaj Shekar sir (owner of the Gem shop). He is a great astrologer too and well experienced.\nHis words about me and my past was 100% true. Feeling happy and positive after met him. Surely I would recommend to go here for buying gem and meet him for checking astrology.','2026-03-28 17:34:02.524087',3425,703,1805),('Xavier Livin',5,'Meeting with Raaj Shekar Sir in his T-nagar office was such a warming and strengthening experience. He gave reasons and thoughts to my tendencies and feelings that I had not previously characterised with regards to my way of life and personality. He also gave me cautioned on parts of myself to be aware of how to deal with the sensitivities and situations.\nHis reading and calculations in astrological sciences is astonishing from which revealed my personality and characteristics felt goosebumps.\nIt made me feel positive about myself and things which I need to concentrate. In fact I felt recharged after this conversation. I strongly recommend discussion with him in times of confusion.','2026-03-28 17:34:02.525735',3426,703,1805),('Natarajan S',5,'Raaj shekar sir has very good knowledge on both astrology and gemology. Though he is an expert in both fields he don\'t compel anyone to buy gems who are coming for astrology. I would strongly recommend him for those who want guidance on astrology and those who want to purchase any gems','2026-03-28 17:34:02.527117',3427,703,1805),('Kavita S',5,'Consulted Padmashri Gems and was impressed by their genuine, accurate and friendly advise. I strongly recommend them and their services. Am thankful for their advice to improve my life.','2026-03-28 17:34:02.528508',3428,703,1805),('silambarasan murugan',5,'Best Pooja pandit service unique veda mantras perfect pandit team thanks to Akash pandit🙏 one of the best Iyer team in vedaspandit 🕉️','2026-03-28 17:34:10.570065',3429,704,1809),('Subasri Pv',5,'Did my dad\'s final rights here,Akash vadiyar made sure that each and every process went smoothly he explained each and every steps and why they were doing so. The place is very clean and well maintained. Thank you so much to akash vadiyar for his time.','2026-03-28 17:34:10.572697',3430,704,1809),('M. Madhavan',5,'Fantastic pandit good service thank you akash vadhyar','2026-03-28 17:34:10.574794',3431,704,1809),('Sridharan Ramanujam',5,'Really it is appreciated that the two pooja pandit were well before time (before 4am .they came 3:45 am).they performed the all the pooja 5 types of poojas including gomatha pooja to our satification from 4 to 7 .one of the best pandits came one day before to ensure all the pooja items and arrangements are in line  with requirement so that we are ready with those items .it is really appreciated those pandits were so courteous and explained the details and significance of the poojas they performed. Thank you so much 🙏🙏','2026-03-28 17:34:10.576963',3432,704,1809),('Elumalai Selvi',5,'The way of approach is too good &we have fixed it one day before it was arranged very well & Pooja items were well planned and also on time we have done few house warming but this way highly satisfied.thank you for Vedas pandit .,,🙏🙏🙏 thanks to Akash vadhyar 🙏','2026-03-28 17:34:10.579678',3433,704,1809),('samrita shankar',1,'EDIT: after seeing this review he seems to have put some kind of bad omen on me as per his own words. Please see attached screenshot. Nothing scares me and I will not let such scammers take advantage of vulnerable people.\n\nHe is a con artist asking very inappropriate questions! Do not believe all the other reviews - they are all paid reviewers. If you don’t believe me, go read the other reviews, they are all from Delhi and not anywhere in Chennai. He is an absolute fraud.\n\nI went for a birth chart reading consultation but he refused to tell me anything about it. Even though I kept asking him questions about my birth chart all he said was someone is wishing ill will upon me. This proves that he doesn’t know anything about astrology. He charged me Rs. 23000 for a 30 day pooja that will supposedly remove all the dhrishti and if I didn’t do it it’ll affect my career very badly. Out of sheer fear I paid the money as I’m at a very critical juncture in my career.\n\nHe called me to the centre twice to ask only about my sex life - extremely inappropriate! At first I was going alone, but when I felt very uncomfortable with his questions, I took my mother. Only because I had already paid the money and I wanted to know if he was doing the pooja. He also tried taking another Rs. 25000 from us claiming my brother’s life is in danger and that if we do a pooja he will be cured of all his physical disabilities. But my brother has severe permanent disabilities that cannot be cured so he was trying to cheat us out of paying more money. We then ran out of there immediately once we realised he was after me by being interested in my sex life and my money.\n\nThe only questions he would ask are - if I have had boyfriends and if I had sexual relationships with them - why on earth does an astrologer need to know that? Horrendous experience.','2026-03-28 17:34:22.014020',3434,705,1813),('CHETAN FF',5,'I loved the way he make me understand and helped me alot in my critical condition','2026-03-28 17:34:22.018784',3435,705,1813),('Ramesh Verma',5,'. The accuracy of predictions at OM SRI SAI GURU ASTROLOGY CENTRE is unbelievable. I consulted them for career guidance and everything they mentioned has been turning out true. Very genuine and trustworthy astrologer In Chennal.','2026-03-28 17:34:22.022080',3436,705,1813),('Vinay Tiwari',5,'He is really very helpful I really felt so relexed after session','2026-03-28 17:34:22.025339',3437,705,1813),('Dore Mon',5,'Best om sri sai astroligy did I live him very professional too good environment','2026-03-28 17:34:22.028871',3438,705,1813),('Shanthi Sankaran',5,'Excellent. Very committed. Systematic.','2026-03-28 17:34:29.531999',3439,706,1817),('Parameswaran Nagarajan',5,'He has Avenger 150 street and Swift','2026-03-28 17:34:29.535160',3440,706,1817),('Sridhar R Capt',4,'Difficult to locate without Google location','2026-03-28 17:34:29.538320',3441,706,1817),('sethuraman jayalakshmi subramanian',5,'Hindu priest','2026-03-28 17:34:29.541533',3442,706,1817),('suresh rane',5,'Best Sastrigal in Madambakkam, Chennai.','2026-03-28 17:34:29.544648',3443,706,1817),('Sharmila sk',5,'Sarmaji performs the Hindu rituals and ceremonies with utmost care and love. He scrutinizes our horoscope and gives us a perfect report and guidance to glide our life journey with ease and poise👍','2026-03-28 17:34:41.165525',3444,707,1821),('Sundaramoorthy K',5,'Scientifically calculation , highly accuracy and just 500 Rupees only charging.','2026-03-28 17:34:41.168939',3445,707,1821),('Murali Krishna',4,'Nice person, he insists us to restrain buying exclusive for thithi Pooja and use provisions available at home.\nExplains everything while performing.','2026-03-28 17:34:41.172311',3446,707,1821),('VENKATRAJ T',5,'Good prohidar and nice person, a very famous person in this area for a decade','2026-03-28 17:34:41.175723',3447,707,1821),('Parthasarathy Polur',5,'His performance in pooja is very good and satisfied','2026-03-28 17:34:41.178786',3448,707,1821),('monisha nisha',5,'We recently performed a Ganapathi Omam at our home, and the Iyer’s service and overall experience were excellent. From the beginning, he guided us clearly on the preparations—such as the required items, the significance of each step, and the proper way to maintain the sanctity of the ritual','2026-03-28 17:34:50.643989',3449,708,1825),('Manibharathi R',4,'We did Ganapathi and Navagraha parihara homam at our home and we were satisfied with the pooja ..It was truly a divine experience. I would like to thank purohithar Mr.niranjan for making it a blessed one.','2026-03-28 17:34:50.647243',3450,708,1825),('Murugan Selvaraj',5,'Professional services... Punctual & courteous... Will recommend strongly to avail his services and get a satisfactory feel for the Pooja.','2026-03-28 17:34:50.650489',3451,708,1825),('Vinoth C',5,'We have recently booked for housewarming ceremony and they started the homam and Poojas in a well mannered way and we are happily satisfied with their service. Special credits to Niranjan Iyer for his explanation and service♥️','2026-03-28 17:34:50.653928',3452,708,1825),('Adhyanth collections',5,'Excellent service by the pandit ji.\nDidn\'t expected this much satisfaction by online services.\nLiterally a great job👍','2026-03-28 17:34:50.657358',3453,708,1825),('Bimal Chandra Samantray',3,'Its in a prime location which can give very good demand always. But parking area is very less. Most of vehicles are parking on the Main Road. If Owner of this convention centre can plan Multiple Parking (Racking system)  will be far better to park more than 50 cars easily inside specified parking area.  Hope it can be considered for public benefits as well as to get more business opportunity to the owner.','2026-03-28 17:34:58.210091',3454,709,1826),('Mohan',5,'Today My sister\'s marriage held here. What an excellent experience I had. Nice ambience and great service. All over The best hospitality.','2026-03-28 17:34:58.220668',3455,709,1826),('Venkat Narayanan',5,'We had our niece’s  marriage function at the hall on 26th and 27th.  The hall’s ambiance is very good and the rooms very well maintained.  Mr Karunanidhi and Mr Deverajan very cooperative and the service of the maintenance staff excellent.  👏👏','2026-03-28 17:34:58.227313',3456,709,1826),('samy vasan',5,'We have organized the wedding of our son on 31.10.2025 evening. Mandapam maintenance was good.Hospitality of the Manager and other staff members were very good.On the whole we had a nice experience in the Murugan Convention Centre.','2026-03-28 17:34:58.230191',3457,709,1826),('Aravindan T',5,'Murugan Mandapam is very famous in Velachery and it exists for more than 25 years. It’s so lucky for our family; as we had conducted many of our family functions here. People involved in the function are living healthy and are in great heights now. As we planned for a 2 days function, we gave an enquiry here again. During the enquiry, we understood the hall got renovated recently. In curiosity we went directly. It’s a complete changeover from before to now, hall looked beautiful and elegant. Guest rooms are spacious with a star category comfort. Parking space has improved.  Owner is a down to earth person who politely handled our queries. He gave us good offers and compliments as it’s was our auspicious function. With no second thought we immediately paid the advance and booked the hall. Very excited for our main day !!!!!','2026-03-28 17:34:58.232292',3458,709,1826),('vinutha',5,'The astrologer at Sri Veda Vyas Maharishi Vedic Astrology Centre here in Mylapore is very courteous and at the same time very precise in his prediction. His advice on how to overcome troubled phases has helped us and also not difficult to follow too. Finally, wish we could have met him earlier. Highly recommended and thank you.','2026-03-28 17:35:06.906795',3459,710,1830),('Thameem Ansari',5,'I had a wonderful experience with Sri Veda Vyas Maharishi Vedic Astrology Research Center. The astrologer was very knowledgeable, patient, and explained everything clearly with great accuracy. Their predictions and guidance were practical and insightful, helping me make better life decisions. I truly felt positive energy after the consultation. Highly recommend this place for anyone seeking genuine and traditional Vedic astrology advice.','2026-03-28 17:35:06.910185',3460,710,1830),('Vijay Kumar Gopu',5,'Venkata Sharma Sir\'s knowledge and understanding about astrology is very vast. He gave proper guidance for our issues.\n\nWe went for name change for my kids. After the name change, we have seen consistent and steady growth in them.\n\nWe have consulted for other requirements as well. Everytime we got right guidance and good results.\n\nI highly recommend this Vedic Astrology Research Centre.','2026-03-28 17:35:06.913865',3461,710,1830),('Krithika Babu',5,'The best person I have consulted . He gives us such a positive vibe. Even though our chart has some negative effects he puts out in a positive way which most of the astrologers lack.  Doesn\'t give us big list of temples to visit and pariharams. He has simple but effective solutions for all problems which gives us a big relief and hope. I would say that he is the best one to consult and return back home with happiness not fear.','2026-03-28 17:35:06.917775',3462,710,1830),('dharshana dhanapal',5,'Very prompt and accurate analysis. Grateful for his clear analysis of our marriage match  which led to us happily tying the knot. Anytime we need an astrological perspective for our problems we always reach out to him. Always reliable and provides perfect analysis.','2026-03-28 17:35:06.920957',3463,710,1830),('Deepikha Jerald',5,'Mr. Prasanna Iyer is an exceptional pandit with deep knowledge of Vedic rituals and traditions. He performs every ritual with great devotion, clarity, and precision, while patiently explaining the meaning and significance behind each step. His calm demeanor, positive energy, and professionalism made the entire experience peaceful and spiritually fulfilling. We truly felt blessed to have him conduct the rituals and would highly recommend him to anyone seeking an authentic and meaningful pooja experience','2026-03-28 17:35:44.282655',3464,711,1834),('Anandan Digitals',5,'Nameskaram.... Recently our house seemantham function.. Sharp time Arrived and   Good Viberation   My Family very Happy.. Thank you\nGood service  Mahesh Pandit','2026-03-28 17:35:44.286183',3465,711,1834),('jenny smith',5,'Brilliant. They are honest devotees.  They do what is requested and they go extra mile if needed. Thank you.','2026-03-28 17:35:44.289993',3466,711,1834),('VINOTHKUMAR MP',5,'The way of approach is too good & we have fixed it one day before it was arranged very well & the Pooja items were well planned and also on time. We are very grateful to have this wonderful experience. We have done few House warming but this was highly satisfied. Thank you Namma Pandit.','2026-03-28 17:35:44.293934',3467,711,1834),('selvam karthick',5,'We had a good experience... absolutely divine feel..he is very punctual.. thank u so much for ur service','2026-03-28 17:35:44.297820',3468,711,1834),('Raja T',5,'Nice pooja very good','2026-03-28 17:35:51.414228',3469,712,1838),('Murugan',4,'Very nice pooja','2026-03-28 17:35:51.416041',3470,712,1838),('Sathish Kumar',5,'Very good pandit','2026-03-28 17:35:51.417794',3471,712,1838),('Akshay Jack',4,'Nice pandit good wib','2026-03-28 17:35:51.419227',3472,712,1838),('Selvam Traders',5,'Best service pooja','2026-03-28 17:35:51.420693',3473,712,1838),('Preeti Pant',5,'Majestic! Absolutely perfect  holistic chant of vaidic mantra and prayer.   he is  very friendly with all the family members . Helping and arrangement taken care by him as old acquaintance and permanent pandit of our family.','2026-03-28 17:35:59.892405',3474,713,1842),('Nagarajan Thamizharasan',5,'AJ Gardens is the best venue for planning the events at both outdoor & Indoor. Grand outdoor garden and Elite Indoor venue made our event look outstanding. Best venue ever with friendly staffs and Reasonable price. Best part is outside vendors are allowed for decoration and catering ancillary services!!! Huge parking space available at venue.','2026-03-28 17:36:23.812593',3475,715,1850),('Thanush',5,'Nice place...well maintained...It\'s green around with grass and plants. Located in the outskirts of Chennai City.Ideal for reception and open air parties..Located in deserted place, access road to this location from main road is in horrible condition making it difficult to drive,Very spacious and well maintaining. Not easy to find. Need google map help.Nature surrounding open hall + indoor hall','2026-03-28 17:36:23.815338',3476,715,1850),('Dinesh Pandiyan',5,'Big parking and outdoor lawn also available 👌🏻\nPeaceful venue traffic free area because out of city 🌆','2026-03-28 17:36:23.818819',3477,715,1850),('M AJAY',5,'Nice and Amazing place to celebrate your big day. The car parking was really big, so all our guests were comfortable','2026-03-28 17:36:23.822148',3478,715,1850),('Saravanan Siddeswaran',2,'It was hard to reach the place, especially in the night time, no lamps whatsoever, and bumpy roads','2026-03-28 17:36:23.825059',3479,715,1850),('Manoj Dhanapal',5,'Mr.Bharathwaj performed the pooja very sincerely and with great devotion. He explained the rituals clearly and created a very peaceful and positive atmosphere. Highly satisfied.','2026-03-28 17:36:50.048218',3480,716,1854),('VGMT FAMILY',5,'Very good vibration good positive think','2026-03-28 17:36:50.051778',3481,716,1854),('VGM MOBILE',5,'Nice Pandit my family Pandit','2026-03-28 17:36:50.055143',3482,716,1854),('Suresh Suresh',5,'Best pooja','2026-03-28 17:36:50.058180',3483,716,1854),('socratese socratese',5,'Super o super','2026-03-28 17:36:50.061405',3484,716,1854),('Manoj dboss',5,'We have been incredibly blessed to have SRIRAM perform our Grahapravesam ceremonies and other poojas for our family. He has conducted ceremonies for us four times, and every single time he has been punctual, well-prepared, and extremely professional.\nPandit Sriram provides clear procedural guidance, explains the rituals in a way that is easy to understand, and ensures everything is done properly and peacefully. Beyond his knowledge and expertise, he builds a very warm and personal connection with the family. We truly feel comfortable and spiritually guided in his presence.\nHe is trustworthy, flexible, and always accommodating to our needs. We are very grateful for his support and highly recommend him to anyone looking for a knowledgeable and dependable pandit.\n🙏 Highly recommended!','2026-03-28 17:36:53.715852',3485,717,1858),('Subha K',5,'We recently invited Sri Sriram Sastrigal to our home to perform Sudharshana Homam, and it was an absolutely divine experience. He conducted the homam with authentic Vedic tradition, chanting every mantra with clarity and power, filling our home with positive and spiritual energy. He patiently explained each step in detail, ensured we clearly understood the significance of every ritual, and conducted the entire homam in a calm and unhurried manner. His punctuality, professionalism, and deep spiritual presence made the entire ceremony truly memorable and blessed. Highly recommended for any auspicious occasion.🙏✨','2026-03-28 17:36:53.719661',3486,717,1858),('sasi guru',5,'Sriram Iyer conducted our house warming ceremony in a very traditional and well-organized manner. He arrived on time, arranged everything properly, and performed the homam with great dedication. His chanting was clear and powerful, creating a very positive atmosphere at our home. We are completely satisfied and would definitely recommend his prohitham services to others.','2026-03-28 17:36:53.723951',3487,717,1858),('mani kandan',5,'We organized a Ganapathi Homam recently and the experience was truly divine. The priests were incredibly punctual and performed every ritual with deep devotion and clarity. The atmosphere in our home felt completely transformed calm, positive, and purified. If you are looking for a traditional and soul-stirring ceremony, I highly recommend their services','2026-03-28 17:36:53.728062',3488,717,1858),('vishal vimal',5,'Sriram Vathyar did a fantastic job conducting the engagement ceremony for one of our family members and made the whole event smooth and stress-free. We are really happy with the way he handled everything and the positive vibe he brought to the occasion. Highly recommended!','2026-03-28 17:36:53.731027',3489,717,1858),('shivakumar srinivasan',5,'We had a beautiful moment\nWe are completely 100% satisfied with the Decorations and other services rendered to us by Marriage Knot\nThanks to all of you staff members and others who made my wedding as memorable moments','2026-03-28 17:37:04.623062',3490,718,1859),('Judy Karol',5,'Very happy to share about marriage knot by Ms. Kaveya…. She was my wedding decor planner and she definitely nailed it. It was an outdoor Christian wedding. Marriage knot definitely delivered more than wat we expected. I would really suggest Marriage Knot. Thank you so much Ms. Kaveya for making each and every detail a memorable one✨','2026-03-28 17:37:04.625919',3491,718,1859),('Preethi Naidu',5,'Marriage knot did our reception decorations in ITC chola. They did an excellent job, great communication, our decorations looked grand and beautiful. Marriage knot has the best value for money and they do excellent job. Highly recommend','2026-03-28 17:37:04.628833',3492,718,1859),('Aniruddh Rangarajan',5,'We used Kavya and Marriage Knot\'s services for my brother\'s wedding and they did a great job. We discussed and agreed on a deco and it turned out beautifully. I was nervous if my ideas went across and of the how it would turn out, but Kavya managed to infuse her thoughts as well and do a very elegant job. Communication was initially a bit of an issue but that was overcome after spending some time together. We had very little time to plan and execute, but quite a feat to carry it out within a few days. Overall happy, and the final agreed price was competitive. Thank you to the team!','2026-03-28 17:37:04.631937',3493,718,1859),('Kannaki Sivakumar',5,'We approached Marriage Knot Event Planner for the Stage Decoration for our Son\'s Marriage Reception at Shelter Beach Resort.  Kavya and Karthik were very professional and they delivered a pleasant ambience on time.  We loved the Decor.  Great Experience.','2026-03-28 17:37:04.634581',3494,718,1859),('VPS Constructions',5,'We had an absolutely wonderful experience with Memories Planners for my daughter’s first birthday. From the initial discussion to the final execution, everything was handled with so much care and professionalism. The decoration was beautiful, creative, and perfectly matched the theme. Every little detail was thoughtfully done, and the setup truly made the day feel extra special.\nThe team was friendly, patient, and very supportive throughout the process. Thanks to them, we could relax and enjoy the celebration while they took care of everything seamlessly. It was a memorable first birthday for our daughter and for us as parents.\nHighly recommended for anyone looking for a reliable and talented event planning team in Chennai!','2026-03-28 17:37:16.428190',3495,719,1860),('roshine Manikandan',5,'We had a wonderful experience with our decor planner. They were extremely patient throughout the entire process and truly took the time to understand our vision. What I appreciated the most was how well they worked within our budget without compromising on quality or aesthetics.\nThe final outcome was absolutely beautiful and exceeded our expectations. Everything looked elegant and thoughtfully put together. I’m really happy with how it all turned out and would definitely recommend them to anyone looking for a reliable and creative wedding decor team.','2026-03-28 17:37:16.431151',3496,719,1860),('Ayshwarya Muthuraman',5,'I had planned a birthday party for my kid .They delivered exactly what i had envisioned !!! Their work was perfect and on point! Thank you for making it a memorable day! ❤️','2026-03-28 17:37:16.434266',3497,719,1860),('Nivetha Senthil',5,'I would like to extend my heartfelt appreciation for the incredible effort and creativity that went into my son\'s first birthday decoration. It was truly a remarkable display, showcasing both your talent and resourcefulness.\n\nNot only was the decoration beautifully executed, but it was also budget-friendly, which added an extra layer of admiration for your ingenuity. The fact that you were able to create such a stunning setup while being mindful of our financial constraints is truly commendable.','2026-03-28 17:37:16.437174',3498,719,1860),('Franklin Samuel',5,'Fantabulous work from Memories & Stories Planners team for my little one birthday. Such a beautiful and clean decoration, they made the birthday hall more elegant.\n\nThanks to Laksman for make the day more beautiful and colourful.','2026-03-28 17:37:16.440050',3499,719,1860),('Sathish Chandrasekar',5,'I want to express my heartfelt appreciation for the catering service provided for my son\'s first birthday party on September 29. The food was absolutely delicious and of exceptional quality, with an impressive presentation. The staff was not only professional and attentive but also handled everything with great humility. They even managed to accommodate additional guests without any extra charges, which was truly commendable. Overall, their service was outstanding. Thank you for making the event an unforgettable experience.','2026-03-28 17:37:25.012140',3500,720,1861),('Pradeesh Menon',5,'I love working with SA Events, Abi is responsive and always comes up with great ideas. I know I can count on them to deliver a wonderful experience every time. Abi and his team are remarkable to work with. They are fast with responses, have clean proposals that are easy to read, and are willing to work with budgets as best they can.\n\nOverall, I love that the SA Events team listens to what I need for any event and will put something together that fits. If it\'s not perfect, we pull it, and perfection happens.','2026-03-28 17:37:25.016985',3501,720,1861),('Srilekha S',5,'Your support and enthusiasm added to the event\'s success, and we deeply appreciate your contribution. It was a pleasure to see sa events there, and we hope you had a wonderful time.thanks for making it special.','2026-03-28 17:37:25.022465',3502,720,1861),('Blesssing John Peter G',5,'Designer has the Ability to understand the customer requirements.\n\n> Quality of the work would Grab the attention of peoples those who join hands with \"SA\".\n>Most beautiful thing is cost effective...\n\n* I thank \"SA Events\" for making my Daughter Birthday most memorable for Ever\"\n\n\"\" I Would recommend every to celebrate your Events with \"SA\" for best memories \"\"..','2026-03-28 17:37:25.027178',3503,720,1861),('Vinitha k',5,'Really the decor was awesome as shown in the reference picture. His approach was very polite and their work was very neat and good. We loved it 😍','2026-03-28 17:37:25.031499',3504,720,1861),('Deepti M',5,'We chose Atulya events to do the event management for our recent wedding in Bangalore. They did an absolutely fantastic job with the decor, guest management (logistics) and finding the best DJ and MC for our Sangeet! The entire team led by Mrs. Vidya were enthusiastic despite the lack of sleep from working day and night to get things done. Everything turned out better than what we wanted. A big big thank you to the entire team for making our wedding a memorable one ! ♥️','2026-03-28 17:37:31.813088',3505,721,1865),('Uro KS',5,'It is an absolute pleasure to write this review for Atulya - a family (not just a team) of committed professionals led by their founder manager, Vidhya. This is going to be a lengthy review so I beg the reader’s indulgence.\n\nOur daughter Shwetha’ wedding was slated for mid-Nov 2023 and we first contacted Vidhya in April 2023. Right from that first interaction (we live in Dubai so all our meetings were via Zoom) we felt very impressed - she had a very calm and reassuring demeanour, exuding an air of quiet confidence. Our going into every little granular detail during planning of the wedding was met with provision of rational solutions and alternatives without ever getting frustrated, regardless of our repetitive probing and questioning - and a trademark quiet and reassuring response from Vidhya as well as her team.\n\nWe had planned some outdoor events during the 3 days in Radisson Blu Temple Bay resort. As it was the monsoon season, Vidhya and her team offered a Plan B alternative for each event in case it rained.\n\nNeedless to say, come crunch time - their team worked with military precision and it was Plan B that had to be implemented as the weather forecast played soil-sport.\n\nWe were absolutely impressed with the decor options that they offered for each event - it was their simple but elegant choices which kind of attracted us towards Atulya in the first place. Their coordination with the bride’ color palette and suggestions eventually worked like magic and made each event absolutely wonderful and memorable.\n\nCome the day before D day, Vidhya was there with her team to welcome our families and from then on it was sheer magic - the way the team arranged / allocated rooms for guests helping them with all kind of requests; changing/turning around  the decorations for the next event in record time; arranging stuff so efficiently despite last minute change of plans/requests from us; being there in person in our sight all the time quietly reassuring us; sorting out a last minute mix-up by the DJ; helping with local tours for our international guests - the list is endless!\n\nThe highlight of the whole thing was the entire Atulya team in cahoots with us planning & executing a surprise flash mob dance - which the bride & groom had no clue about despite their being involved in several zoom calls with Atulya’ team!\n\nAll we can say is - Atulya = professional, punctual, quiet, confident, precise, affectionate and caring. Can’t get a better wedding planner/event manager. They took care of business so that we could just get on and enjoy the wedding celebrations unfettered!\n\nVidhya, Keshini, Aravind, Prabha, Varshita, Narasimhan et al have now become good friends and part of our families. Can’t thank them enough for a job done amazingly well! Love you guys! ❤️','2026-03-28 17:37:31.816669',3506,721,1865),('Anantha Venkatraman',5,'The team at Atulya is very enthusiastic, detail-oriented and professional. Right from the planning stage to execution, the team was on top of everything. Special thanks to the ceremonies and hospitality team on the day of the events. There were no gaps or pauses during the ceremonies while ensuring that each and every guest was taken care of. Several guests had special requirements in terms of diet and mobility. All these requests and their health were taken care of in a very personal way. The communication was excellent. All the guests thoroughly enjoyed themselves. Importantly, the families involved felt very supported by AWE. Every small request or unforeseen issue was taken care of immediately. I would highly recommend AWE for all future events. Kudos to the team for yet another phenomenal performance!','2026-03-28 17:37:31.820296',3507,721,1865),('Ramya Nagarajan',5,'Team Atulya did a fantastic job of coordinating and taking care of the wedding festivities for my brother’s wedding! Both families and attendees of the wedding were incredibly happy about their attention to detail and the care with which they went about things! Thank you so much for making it so memorable for all of us! :)','2026-03-28 17:37:31.824854',3508,721,1865),('Vasundhara Vedula',5,'Team Atulya assists wedding parties with the A to Z of a wedding. I had the pleasure of interacting with the team as a wedding guest. Every single team member is polite, efficient, thoughtful and truly caring. The wedding I attended had a sudden blessings from the rain Gods. But team Atulya was prepared with umbrellas and alternate indoor seating. Not only were they prepared, they executed everything within minutes seamlessly. So we just had to step off the lawn and into the auditorium mid-dinner. It takes exceptional skill and experience to handle an unforeseeable emergency so well. Atulya\'s wedding favours were also beautifully packaged and carefully curated. Some of their team members even helped with random requests from us! I don\'t think the wedding I attended could possibly have been managed better and I wish Atulya many more successful celebrations.','2026-03-28 17:37:31.827942',3509,721,1865),('Eddy Jones',5,'We engaged E4 Entertainment for catering for our daughter\'s wedding at OMR, Chennai. The food was delicious, well prepared, and beautifully presented. The menu had an excellent spread with a wide variety of dishes, thoughtfully planned to suit all age groups. Many of our guests personally complimented us on the taste and quality of the food.\nThey successfully prepared and served dinner for nearly 750+ guests, without compromising on quality. The welcome drink and desserts were especially enjoyable. The welcome girls and service staff were neatly dressed, courteous, and professional, adding to the overall elegance of the event.\n\nThank you, E4 Catering, for playing such an important role in making our wedding memorable.','2026-03-28 17:37:34.440203',3510,722,1867),('Ganesh Bushnam',5,'We thank the entire team so much for going beyond the ordinary for making our wedding event so special.\n\nFrom the moment we set a date, and contacted E4E to be our planner, we had a lot of specific choices and back and forth conversations wrt logistics, decor, food, etc, and E4E team especially Vandhana and Gowtham were very patient and the final output was beyond what we imagined.\n\nAll our guests and friends loved the food and the entire setup.\n\nHighly recommended!','2026-03-28 17:37:34.443104',3511,722,1867),('Iswarya Krish',5,'I just wanted to take a moment to express my sincere gratitude to “E4Entertainment” for the incredible work you did at our son’s first birthday party. The decorations were absolutely stunning and it truly brought joy in everyone. A warm and beautiful atmosphere was created. The photos and videos captured are also beyond amazing. Food was awesome. They are flexible to customisation and also their pastel backgrounds are bomb. The team was punctual, friendly and very professional. Highly recommended for anyone looking for top-notch birthday and wedding events. Thank you team for your hard work and dedication. You helped make our son\'s first birthday a truly unforgettable experience.','2026-03-28 17:37:34.446512',3512,722,1867),('dg mohan',5,'We came to know about E4Entertainment through Instagram and reached out to them to plan our daughter’s birthday. A big thanks to Mr. Gowtham for patiently answering all of our questions and explaining everything in detail.\n\nWe couldn’t be happier with our choice! The décor was elegant and classy, setting the perfect vibe for the celebration. The food was absolutely delicious—especially the mutton biryani, which everyone raved about. The cake was also fantastic, and the kids loved the activities like face painting, balloon sculpting and DJ.\n\nA special shout-out to Lavanya (Lavy), who made sure the entire space was used efficiently. She organized fun games that everyone, both kids and adults, really enjoyed. She also helped guests navigate the space, making sure they knew where everything was, from the food to the return gifts. Lavanya even took the extra step of adding thematic name boards, which was such a thoughtful touch.\n\nThank you, E4Entertainment, for making our day so special and memorable!','2026-03-28 17:37:34.449106',3513,722,1867),('shiny silvestra',5,'They bring your dream event to reality ❤️\n\nWe planned to have an engagement event but had zero idea on any thing. We simply went blank to e4 team.\n\nGowtham sir guided us from scratch and gave us  more ideas about the event. And then he planned our event so well. Like each and every single thing he noted and planned. From venue, decoration, food ,live counters ,garland, cake , mike arrangements everything he have done the best for us... Omg he did everything according to our taste.\n\nTeam really did whatever we asked, from cake decoration and garland. And garland was so good. And the stage decorations with the chair, we were really mesmerized.\n\nAnd moreover they also suprised and added a lot which we didn\'t Even ask them . They added sofas at the end in the hall and they added guest engaging games. It was a surprise for us.\n\nAnd i wanted to mention about the people who served food... Omg they were extremely sweet and smiling from start to end of the event. They served to each and every guest slowly with care. It actually felt like they worked as if it\'s their own families event. All the people who came from the e4 team where extremely sweet and they cared every guests and treated them so well. Our event was on 25th Jan until today people are calling us and they are praising every single thing. And mainly they are perfect in time, if you ask them to complete stage decoration by 4 . Then by 4 everything will be on place . You will never have any last minute delays from them!!\n\nTheir food omg , the taste of every single item was on top. Cake, live counters, every single food item was so good. I would really say this now. You guys have done engagement event for me , you should definitely come and do all our events in my family. I will book you guys only ❤️\n\nI really wanted to thank the team a lot. Thank you will be a small word . They have done a lot to us.\n\nEveryone who came to the event was speechless by their arrangements ❤️❤️\n\nSpecial mention for Gowtham sir , he was really so responsive and so kind to us. Sir without you our event would be nothing. They way you spoke and said yes for everything we asked, you gave a lot of confidence and you have executed it as well.\nYou made our dream into reality ❤️\nI feel extremely emotional when I talk about this, literally everyone thought that we wont do this great. You broke everything sir. You made everyone speechless ❤️❤️ .\n\nI\'m forever grateful for you and your team ❤️. Thank you for each and every thing you did for us in our event.\n\nWith Love ,\nShiny Abijo','2026-03-28 17:37:34.451944',3514,722,1867),('Hallina Stalin',5,'We would like to express our sincere gratitude to Magical Planners. They did an absolutely wonderful job for our daughter’s First Holy Communion. The work was neat, elegant, and visually appealing. They also customized everything perfectly according to our requirements. We are extremely happy with their service and would definitely recommend them. Fabulous work indeed!','2026-03-28 17:37:50.356186',3515,723,1868),('Ajita Chandrasekharan',5,'They did a amazing Sangeet event . As a team they deliver what they promise.','2026-03-28 17:37:50.359627',3516,723,1868),('Reena Thakur',5,'If you are looking for event planner go for Magical Planners. They are so full of creativity and respect your budget and provide best of their services. The personal touch they give to your events is something I have loved about them.\nThank you so much for making it so special event for us.','2026-03-28 17:37:50.362783',3517,723,1868),('Mahesh Babu Veeraraghava',5,'\"I recently hired Magical Planners to handle the decoration for my office event, and I couldn\'t be more pleased with the results! From the initial consultation to the final reveal, the team was professional, creative, and attentive to every detail. They listened to my vision and exceeded my expectations with their design ideas. The quality of their work was outstanding, and everything was delivered on time and within budget. I highly recommend Magical Planners for anyone looking to add a touch of elegance and style to their space or event. I will definitely be using them again in the future!\"','2026-03-28 17:37:50.366059',3518,723,1868),('Sharanya Ananth',5,'Creative and innovative decoration…','2026-03-28 17:37:50.369217',3519,723,1868),('Victoria Daniel',5,'Decoration was too good as we expected.... They prioritising clients requirements and full filling it..thank you','2026-03-28 17:37:57.512808',3520,724,1869),('Akila srinivasan',5,'Very nice we are so happy for the output many of them asked who did this please share the contact no differently we will refer thank you so much','2026-03-28 17:37:57.514813',3521,724,1869),('Ravichandran R',5,'I am doing business with balan, his attitude is very kind and sweet. He honour our words and gave a good suggestion to fulfill our satisfaction.To improve light session at corridor areas. Entire decoration was fully satisfied. Thanks Mr.Balan.','2026-03-28 17:37:57.516514',3522,724,1869),('Suresh Nannidhi',5,'Many thanks to them for understanding the needs of the customers and designing them in the best possible way, in accordance with their home ethics, and for conducting them in a dignified manner.','2026-03-28 17:37:57.518075',3523,724,1869),('rajagopal s',5,'They have done Very Nice decorations in a reasonable price for my Grandson\'s first birthday.It was as such shown in image. Everyone appreciated.','2026-03-28 17:37:57.519529',3524,724,1869),('Aishvariyaa Balasubramanian',5,'The set up done by Bala and his team was wonderful. I was very happy with the outcome. He simply did an amazing job. Thank you','2026-03-28 17:38:08.163392',3525,725,1870),('Varsha Jain',5,'The decorations for the birthday party were absolutely stunning and created a truly magical atmosphere.  Every detail was carefully considered, from the elegant table settings to the beautiful floral arrangements.  The color scheme was perfectly chosen and complemented the overall theme flawlessly.  The entire space was transformed into a festive wonderland, exceeding all expectations.  It was evident that a great deal of care and creativity went into making the birthday party a visual delight.','2026-03-28 17:38:08.167134',3526,725,1870),('Vignesh Baskaran',5,'The elegant decorations transformed the venue into a magical setting.  Soft lighting and flowing fabrics created a romantic ambiance.  Every detail, from the centerpieces to the draping, was thoughtfully chosen.  The overall effect was breathtaking and truly unforgettable. It perfectly complemented the joyous celebration.','2026-03-28 17:38:08.171130',3527,725,1870),('Jothi Priya',5,'We loved the flowers - they were perfect! And thanks so much for the arrangement and thanks for the extra hair flower accessories. Everything went perfectly - we were so pleased! Thanks for everything you did on time to make it so special for us...we will never forget you!','2026-03-28 17:38:08.174494',3528,725,1870),('Rohini Govindan',5,'Thanks to Mr.Bala and team. Kudos to your team the outcome was spellbound for our valaikappu. They worked from scratch and built the exact same backdrop as we imagined and discussed. Detailing to another level. Too satisfied with the outcome. Special mention to your patience wishing you more success and growth.','2026-03-28 17:38:08.177981',3529,725,1870),('Abimanyu A',5,'Makemywedding truly made our search for an affordable mandapam/hall so much easier. I contacted them online, and they immediately connected me with their manager, Mr. Anandh K. He patiently guided us through multiple options in our area. Even though the halls we initially looked for weren’t available, Anandh didn’t give up—within just a few hours, he found us a clean, well-maintained, and budget-friendly hall that fit all our requirements.\n\nHe also went the extra mile helping us get a good discount on the rent.\n\nReally thankful to the entire team for their quick coordination and support in helping us find the perfect hall for our function.','2026-03-28 17:38:16.466849',3530,726,1871),('Sabari Sree',5,'We connected with you at Tema Expo through my dad., Huge shoutout to Mr. Anandh for making everything super easy!!!!  From getting us the best price to cool complimentary addons 📸🙌... and helping us find the perfect photography team,\nthank you for all the support. Really appreciate it! 🤍👍','2026-03-28 17:38:16.469958',3531,726,1871),('Menaka Anandhan',5,'I have reached out to makemywedding through online, Anandh K from their team has connected with me and he helped me to find the marriage hall from my preferred location, I have searched all the Mandapam near my area. Due to peak muhurtham date, I couldn\'t find the decent and well maintained Mandapam...But Anandh K searched from his end and found the Mandapam within few hours of time....He also helped us to get the complimentary rooms  for stay...he was very attentive and polite to me and my family...\n\nI would suggest to go ahead with makemywedding......\n\nThanks Anandh and team for helping us to find the correct Mandapam for our Big day!','2026-03-28 17:38:16.473092',3532,726,1871),('Vignesh Subramani',5,'Makemywedding is the best place where we can find the affordable and reasonable Mandapam/hall for our functions. I have reached out through online, they have assigned me a professional manager from their team Anandh K. We spent time to explore the mandapam in our locality due to non availability, we couldn\'t get the right hall of choice, but Anandh was able to get us the well maintained and affordable hall within a few hours.\n\nHe also helped us get complementary rooms and discounts in rent.\n\nThanks team for your quick response and support in finding the right hall.','2026-03-28 17:38:16.476923',3533,726,1871),('Vikaash',5,'Make my wedding was very helpful , they connect to us so fast and prompt\nVinod helped to find a good beautician Sri . Iam very happy with make my wedding','2026-03-28 17:38:16.480249',3534,726,1871),('1063 Vijayasarathy. R',5,'Dj was good and smoke effects were really great. It was a wonderful experience and management was clean','2026-03-28 17:38:29.141169',3535,727,1875),('Jamal Haq',5,'Always I suggest VIP wedding Planner ... They are soo good... I didn\'t expect this much grand my son birthday is its due to VIP planner.','2026-03-28 17:38:29.144676',3536,727,1875),('Jenifer MariyaSelvam',5,'Wonderful team','2026-03-28 17:38:29.148335',3537,727,1875),('Sunu Johns',5,'Great experience with Kriyative Mindz. They looked after the decor , photography and food. Everything went easy for us. The budget part also Sowmya mam has worked out the best  for us making the best utilisation of budget and showing it us in real. We can fully trust Kriyative Mindz and they get the things done in the best manner. All the guests applauded the arrangements and we are totally happy.','2026-03-28 17:38:34.144168',3538,728,1879),('Indhuja V',5,'Thanks to Sowmya\'s team for helping us host an amazing birthday for both our daughters. The entire party was fun filled.The beautiful decor was appreciated by all the guests. Also she stayed throughout the party to ensure everything went well. Overall good experience working with Sowmya and team.','2026-03-28 17:38:34.148361',3539,728,1879),('Swetha Jeevanathan',5,'Kriyative Mindz Sowmya did a wonderful decor and planned everything with utmost details for my son first birthday. Initially I was confused in choosing the theme, but she helped me out with everything and gave me the confidence that the decor will turn out well. She was very professional and made sure everything goes smoothly. Thank you Sowmya for doing fabulous job and I would definitely recommend you to everyone.','2026-03-28 17:38:34.152876',3540,728,1879),('Akshaya Balasubramanian',5,'I’ve hired Kristive Mindz twice now for my son’s birthday parties, and she has done an incredible job both times! Her creativity, attention to detail, and professionalism are outstanding. Everything looked beautiful and perfectly matched the theme.\nShe’s so easy to work with and always makes the whole process stress-free. My son absolutely loved the decor, and our guests couldn’t stop complimenting it. I’d highly recommend her to anyone looking for stunning event decorations!','2026-03-28 17:38:34.158658',3541,728,1879),('Bhuvaneswari Srinivasan',5,'Wonderful experience with Kriyative Mindz.\n\nWe approached Sowmya for Decor just 2 weeks before the event. Based on my expectation and budget she suggested me ideas for the back drop. And to my surprise on the day of event, she made a lot of improvements herself and the outcome was so beautiful. The sofa in this image, all other props on the stage, was an add on she provided me on the day of event, which no event management team would do for a client.\n\nNo follow ups, no reminders, she took care of everything on time !!!! Her experience speaks in the output she provides. Highly recommend this team for all type of events.','2026-03-28 17:38:34.161422',3542,728,1879),('Shruthi Ramakrishnan',5,'We had a wonderful experience working with Purushotham from Vivaha Creations for my daughter’s 1st birthday décor. The setup was beautifully done with great attention to detail, and everything came together exactly as we had envisioned. The team was professional, responsive, and very easy to work with throughout the planning process.\n\nThe décor added so much charm to the celebration and received many compliments from our guests. Thank you, Vivaha Creations, for making our little one’s special day even more memorable. Highly recommend them for any event décor needs!','2026-03-28 17:38:39.629847',3543,729,1881),('Beatrice Ssowmiya',5,'The decor done by the team for our event was excellent. Budget friendly and impressive. Highly recommend them','2026-03-28 17:38:39.633141',3544,729,1881),('Rohan C Govind Nallagatla',5,'Mr Purushottaman and team deliver excellent results. Our event at Sai Villa was made all the more aesthetic with the tasteful decorations by Vivaha. 10/10 would recommend.','2026-03-28 17:38:39.636312',3545,729,1881),('Akshaya Sri S A',5,'We worked with Purushotham for our Haldi / Sangeeth event at Sai Villa 500. He was very patient and professional, understood our requirement, shared his valuable inputs and guided us along the way. The decoration was exactly what we had discussed, very pretty and executed very well. Very impressed and happy to have worked with him. Thanks a lot team','2026-03-28 17:38:39.639399',3546,729,1881),('S S',5,'Mr Purushoth and his team, im really so happy for what you have bought out in your decor. Jus the same of what i aksed for.. he s very receptive and open for discussion and comitted guy. thank you so much purushoth, beautifully done.','2026-03-28 17:38:39.642440',3547,729,1881),('Nandika Sampath',5,'As a sister, my brother’s wedding was an emotional and very special occasion for me. I had many responsibilities, but Nana Events handled everything so comfortably and professionally that I was able to truly enjoy each moment stress-free.\nThey didn’t just organize the wedding — they genuinely understood our emotions and family sentiments. Every ritual and detail was managed with care, patience, and respect. Their coordination, décor, timing, and guest arrangements were flawless.\nWhat impressed me the most was how confidently they handled unexpected situations. Their crowd management was excellent, and even last-minute challenges were managed calmly without any chaos.\nThey created beautiful memories that our family will cherish forever. I truly recommend Nana Events to anyone looking for a reliable, understanding, and highly professional event management team.\nThank you for making my brother’s wedding unforgettable!','2026-03-28 17:38:47.262083',3548,730,1882),('Koyyapu Durga Bhavani',1,'Our reception was handled perfectly by NANA Events. The decoration was stunning and matched our theme perfectly. The team was very organized and cooperative from start to end. Mehendi work was also included and was done very nicely. We received many compliments from guests.','2026-03-28 17:38:47.266031',3549,730,1882),('Jayasri reddy Jeeru',5,'We hired NANA Events for a corporate conference and they exceeded expectations. The seating, lighting, and arrangements were done very neatly. They followed all instructions and delivered on time. The team was professional and easy to communicate with. would definitely o them again.','2026-03-28 17:38:47.270065',3550,730,1882),('Vijaya Adari',5,'Our reception function was managed by NANA Events and I am happy. They made the stage very beautiful and arrange everything properly. Mehendi design was also very beautiful. My wife was very happy with the service. Thank you to the whole team.','2026-03-28 17:38:47.274354',3551,730,1882),('Madhuri chaganti',5,'lhad a wonderful experience with NANA Events for my brother\'s wedding. They handled everything - from décor to lighting - with perfection. The stage looked absolutely stunning and photo-worthy. They were always available for updates and ideas. Our family was very impressed.','2026-03-28 17:38:47.278141',3552,730,1882),('46 Madhu',5,'AR event management group is very  nice. It\'s trustable management team forever. Budget friendly always','2026-03-28 17:38:56.677003',3553,731,1886),('Dinesh Kumar',5,'AR event\'s around 4 years they are services for TATA international in Chennai division for all events. They will do whatever we want.\nBefore events they will complete the all work.\nprice negotiation\nConvenient timing\nColorful items\nGood thinking etc...','2026-03-28 17:38:56.680681',3554,731,1886),('Logesh',5,'A trustable event management service which you could rely on with your family functions and other events. I\'ve had a pretty good experience with them','2026-03-28 17:38:56.683792',3555,731,1886),('Saibavani V',5,'Nice organization with best affodabe price 👌  we can belive and give the money. It\'s very worth... excellent services with great team.......','2026-03-28 17:38:56.686921',3556,731,1886),('praveen kumar',5,'Excellent service 👌 with affordable price ..','2026-03-28 17:38:56.690054',3557,731,1886),('Marappan Manichandar',5,'An Unforgettable Experience!”\n\nWe recently hired J capital events for our event, and it was the best decision we made! From the initial planning to the final execution, everything was flawless. The team was incredibly professional, attentive to every detail, and made sure our vision came to life. The decorations, coordination, and overall management exceeded our expectations. Our guests were impressed, and we received so many compliments! Thank you for making our event stress-free and truly memorable. HIGHLY RECOMMENDED!\n\n— Manikandan','2026-03-28 17:39:02.300799',3558,732,1887),('sundar sundram',5,'\"A Well-Organized and Memorable Event!\"\nThe apartment opening event managed by J Capital Event and Management was truly outstanding. The planning, coordination, and execution were seamless. The venue was beautifully arranged, with every detail thoughtfully curated. The speeches, networking opportunities, and hospitality created a warm yet professional atmosphere. Kudos to the entire J Capital Event and Management team for delivering such a grand and well-executed event! Looking forward to attending more of their events in the future.','2026-03-28 17:39:02.302994',3559,732,1887),('Subash S,',5,'\"Excellent corporate event!\" The event organized by *J Capital Event and Management* was outstanding. The arrangements, venue, and food were top-notch. Everything was well-coordinated, and the event ran seamlessly. It provided a fantastic opportunity for team bonding and networking. I would definitely love to attend future events organized by them!','2026-03-28 17:39:02.305189',3560,732,1887),('Gowtham K',5,'I hired J Capital Events to throw my birthday bash, and it was one of the best parties ever! The crew was super friendly and took care of all the details without any stress. They came up with fun ideas that really set the vibe, and everyone had a great time. It felt more like hanging out with friends than a formal event. I’d happily work with them again for any party or celebration!','2026-03-28 17:39:02.307701',3561,732,1887),('sameer ahmed',5,'Exceptional service from start to finish! The Event team went above and beyond to make our event a resounding success. Their attention to detail, creativity, and professionalism were unmatched. Every aspect, from the venue setup to the seamless execution of the program, was handled with utmost precision.\n\nThe team was incredibly responsive to our needs and delivered exactly what we envisioned, creating a stress-free experience for us. Guests couldn’t stop raving about the atmosphere and flawless coordination. If you’re looking for a company that truly understands the art of event management, look no further. Highly recommended!”','2026-03-28 17:39:02.310263',3562,732,1887),('TJ Raahul',5,'Very good work, hard working. Everyone liked your house warming decoration and enquired about you. You work was great and commendable. Thanks for making our new home extra beautiful with your work\n\n🤝👍🏻','2026-03-28 17:39:11.872865',3563,733,1888),('Nishanthi Srinivasan',5,'I have chosen them for my daughter\'s birthday.Decorations was Awesome and unique 😍😍Everybody appreciated about it  particularly 🔥So Guys goahead and book bestival events for any kind of parties 🤟','2026-03-28 17:39:11.874696',3564,733,1888),('Krishnaharrishmitaa',4,'We want to extend a huge thank you to the decor team for bringing our vision to life for our son\'s first birthday party. Choosing a unique and culturally rich theme like \'Yaazh\' was very important to us, and the team executed it with absolute grace and creativity.\nThanks for bestival','2026-03-28 17:39:11.877221',3565,733,1888),('Balaji A',4,'Booked a Basic Home Decoration service for birthday event, very good and nice work. But package can include further more and add-on chosen little pricey. Websites like Balloon decor, Cherishx includes more at the same price.','2026-03-28 17:39:11.880015',3566,733,1888),('Manju Vinayagam',5,'We have celebrated my Son\'s First birthday and Back drop decoration done Bestival Events , I had given a theme, but they did very well decorations , It is awesome and Mr. Manikandan also a polite person and good way to talk to customers.\n\nPrices also reasonable , same theme checked with other two peoples both prices are very higher than his prices.\n\nThank you .Iam sharing the images for your reference.','2026-03-28 17:39:11.881871',3567,733,1888),('Mayuri Jain.',5,'Big and bash events is someone, whom you can trust blindly, one of the coolest event organisers that I\'ve ever come across, their presence of mind and calmness will blow your mind!! 💯😃','2026-03-28 17:39:19.019397',3568,734,1892),('SIVA SOORYA',5,'We just completed our 12th and we are looking for organizers for our farewell and we found big bash event one of the best and we really enjoyed there service','2026-03-28 17:39:19.023284',3569,734,1892),('Habibu Nisha',5,'Excellent work 👏 good job 👍','2026-03-28 17:39:19.027724',3570,734,1892),('sai venkat',5,'The management was so polite and Down to earth. They planned according to my thoughts. No compromises on their works. They are doing the best job,keep rock bro.!!!!!','2026-03-28 17:39:19.031722',3571,734,1892),('Jafar Ali',5,'Really Awesome work\'s...','2026-03-28 17:39:19.037160',3572,734,1892),('Mythili',5,'We had a clear vision in mind for our engagement décor, and this team brought it to life exactly as we imagined. They even added a few thoughtful elements that we hadn’t asked for, but they blended perfectly with the theme and elevated the entire setup. The team stayed in regular contact, kept us updated throughout, and the coordination was smooth from start to finish.\n\nThe décor was handed over on time and the quality of work was truly top-notch. Many of our guests specifically appreciated and praised the décor during the event. I would definitely recommend planning your décor well in advance and choosing this team — a solid 10/10. Kudos to the team! ✨','2026-03-28 17:39:27.222593',3573,735,1893),('Revathi Mathanraju',5,'Excellent service and end-to-end coordination for our housewarming function, arranged within a very short time. Shankar and his team managed everything perfectly. Thank you so much for the great support and dedication. Well done, and keep up the great work!','2026-03-28 17:39:27.225868',3574,735,1893),('Rukmani Mahendran',5,'Our son got married on 19th and 20th we had engaged SubhaMuhurtham as our decorator of the venue. Mr. Shankar and his team did a very good job of not only the decoration but a whole lot of other things like taking care of the guests and being there to help wherever needed. They especially took care of our guests at Sheraton . Thank you SubhaMuhurtham for being so nice and helpful specially to shankar such a thorough gentleman.Wish you all the very best.Thank you again','2026-03-28 17:39:27.229601',3575,735,1893),('Feel Goodnature',5,'A trust worthy and Dedication team. Mr.Shankar done a fabulous job on my Brother wedding he took care and make the wedding like his family wedding. We enjoyed the wedding and we Feel stress free because of Shankar and his team.\nI strongly recommend them if you want to enjoy your closest one wedding give your work to Subhamugurtham wedding planners you enjoy your time with closest one.\n🥰','2026-03-28 17:39:27.232966',3576,735,1893),('BINDU MADHAVA RAO',5,'They organised the wedding of our daughter. They were kind and cooperative throughout the entire process right from the start to finish. We would gladly recommend Shankar and his team for all wedding planning events. Thank you.','2026-03-28 17:39:27.236366',3577,735,1893),('vijay tiwari',5,'I review point for this Planer is below:\n1. Food is perfect there.\n2. Staff behavior very kind and friendly.\n3. Decorations is always seems unique.\n4. Sound and Dj systems excellent.\n5. Welcome celebrations is outstanding.\n6. Returns gifts is always perfect.','2026-03-28 17:39:30.845271',3578,736,1897),('prashanth S',5,'All the expectations from our side is fulfilled with full enjoyment .Really the V wedding Planner  team is a good one ,so cooperative ,punctual in each and every work they have done a good organize by Mr.vinayagam . Thanks a lot for making my son\'s wedding a memorable.one','2026-03-28 17:39:30.849245',3579,736,1897),('Padmanaban M',5,'The food was very good and the whole family was told to me super appreciation regarding your food items thank you','2026-03-28 17:39:30.853175',3580,736,1897),('Imran 1998',5,'My best friend marriage organized by v wedding planner wonderful moment best organized team.','2026-03-28 17:39:30.857157',3581,736,1897),('Vaideeshwaran Ranganathan',5,'Once will give quality come again.... Spread good name..... Keep it up.','2026-03-28 17:39:30.861066',3582,736,1897),('neha s',5,'We booked them for my uncle and aunt anniversary decor.. he did a fabulous work we all loved it. Especially they way he adjusted to the timings which most of the people doesn’t do ..thank you so much!','2026-03-28 17:39:46.247634',3583,737,1898),('Shruti R',5,'It was a great experience, the best decoration ever! They did their best, we were more satisfied than expected! The decor was perfectly arranged and done beautifully. Everything was perfect, thanks a lot to the team. Extremely happy and satisfied! ❤️','2026-03-28 17:39:46.257431',3584,737,1898),('Akshaya Nagappan',5,'No words to tell how happy we were ! These are the first people I talked to, and I got them fixed.\nWe called them for a bride to be shower.\nThey asked for 1.5 hours for decor and they were so punctual, they reached earlier also and they did not delay even by one minute for finishing the decors. We wanted it by 7 PM and they kept it ready exactly at 7 PM. It was more than what we expected.\n\nThe bride and our friends were all super happy to see how much beautiful and neat the decor turned out to be ! Outstanding, and hereafter we have decided to call them for all our events.\n\nClose your eyes and go for them ! Worth the price, and they just did an amazing job.\nThank you so much ❤️❤️❤️','2026-03-28 17:39:46.259223',3585,737,1898),('Madhumitha Kumar',5,'I chose Kadhir bro\'s event planner for my husband\'s 30th bday. I was Satisfied more than expected..they were pakka with the timings and decorations..😍😍 Being a chennai based planner they agreed to come to Pondy 😍 My husband was surprised seeing the decorations and it made my day💜','2026-03-28 17:39:46.260678',3586,737,1898),('Farrah Farrah',5,'Yh hi for  last few hours only I booked the event immediate response in wats app really am so much happy to groom to be surprise for my fiance on chennai airport for musical really he enjoyed more and service also awesome thank you so much the team to grow more,,, i like immediate response and complete work thank you bro and guitarist and singer perfect thank you guys','2026-03-28 17:39:46.262165',3587,737,1898),('venkatakrishnan sivam',5,'Best value for money packers and movers in and around Tambaram and vandalur region that I found after an extensive search. It\'s a young team with full of energy, very professional and so passionate about the work they do. Their service was beyond my expectation. Definitely recommend to anyone looking for packers and movers.','2026-03-28 17:39:51.180521',3588,738,1899),('Pablo Escobar',5,'Recently we\'ve planned to shift our house so contacted mr. Gopinath from Feliz packers and movers his response was damn quick and polite. Full of young team and energetic fellows. Thanks team  😅 will suggest to our friends and circle keep rocking.','2026-03-28 17:39:51.183981',3589,738,1899),('a sriram',5,'Best packers and movers around Tambaram.they r taking care all things as a gud manner especially punctuality and planning and execution is very well. During the shifting time i didn\'t faced even a little distraction. Thanks to Feliz gopi and team.\nBest wishes for ur future assignments 👏🍾','2026-03-28 17:39:51.187234',3590,738,1899),('2142 AARTHI D R',4,'I appreciate the team\'s dedication and adaptability. From decoration to photography to food preparation, the crew delivered a truly pleasing and spectacular result. Huge thanks to Gopi and team💟','2026-03-28 17:39:51.190281',3591,738,1899),('Gowtham Vijay',5,'Recently I had their service chennai to Bangalore, such a neat and clean service by them. The way they carried their work made me speechless. Very mature and marvelous service. Thank you from my bottom of my heart. Fully satisfied','2026-03-28 17:39:51.194004',3592,738,1899),('Sachin Jain',5,'A great and responsible anchor. Very co-operative and fun-loving person. Manages everything like a pro. Our venue and events were changed at the end moment because of covid situation but Ashwinji had handled and executed it smoothly for all of us.\n\nThank you for making our D-day a memorable one.','2026-03-28 17:39:55.677615',3593,739,1900),('Rakesh Kumar',5,'Mr.Ashwin , a very humble person to trust nd give the event a grand success. He s having almost all top facilities of sound ,lights ,decor ,best dj . We had a wonderful tamil nights, haldi and bollywood theme party with him . It was a great day nd memorable moments through out the lifetime.','2026-03-28 17:39:55.680788',3594,739,1900),('rithika kothari',5,'Can’t thank enough Hashvi events (Ashwin bhaiya) for making our event grand success !!! This was a last minute call made to Ashwin bhaiya and he delivered everything I wished for my sisters wedding 🥰 this is truly an appreciation post for the company’s great work, amazing decoration, best and latest designs, timely delivery even during the LOCKDOWN. Thankyou so much hashvi events for the perfect wedding decoration ☺️ I recommend them to everyone , don’t hesitate just get in contact with Ashwin bhaiya he will get everything sorted for you :)','2026-03-28 17:39:55.684962',3595,739,1900),('aashish srisrimal',5,'Was worried about my sister wedding in the lockdown time. That time I came to know about hashvi events(Ashwin Jain) that was the right decision made by me. The whole event looked so amazing. From the venue selection to the execution everything was like perfect. Decoration, event management, food just surprised me. From the stage decoration, Chavri decoration, full fledge menu nd many more. I from thereafter will always recommend hashvi events for any kind of function,event.','2026-03-28 17:39:55.689431',3596,739,1900),('Sanjay Kr',5,'Hi Ashwin\nI would like to thank you for all your support throughout the year. From Our first program at Hotel Turya to our last program at Hotel Pakwan , you were amazing well, from DECOR TO DJ everything was superb. Thanks once from entire TEAM','2026-03-28 17:39:55.693019',3597,739,1900),('kala kalyanram',5,'Had attended a wedding at Dakshin Chitra Museum Muttukadu Chennai recently. The decorations were excellent. The arrangements was fantastic.  Food was very good and I just saw the google review card alongwith the Bhakshanams. The murrukku and mysorepak was excellent.  Tasted very nice. The Adhirasam was nice but probably the jaggery was less and hence it made it a little hard...Overall very nice.','2026-03-28 17:39:58.625534',3598,740,1901),('radha kumar',5,'We had an absolutely wonderful experience with Prerana Events. From our very first meeting, Sudha and Anuradha was organized, attentive, and genuinely invested in making the event special and stress-free for us.\nEvery detail was handled with care — from décor and lighting to guest travel coordination and timing. They really listened to our preferences and turned our vision into something even more beautiful than we imagined. Mehndi and Haldi stage setup and overall ambiance received so many compliments from our guests!\nWhat stood out most was their calm professionalism on the big day. Everything flowed smoothly, and we were able to truly enjoy the celebration with our family and friends.\nIf you’re looking for a wedding planning team that is creative, reliable, and easy to work with, I highly recommend Prerana Events. They made our special day unforgettable.','2026-03-28 17:39:58.628767',3599,740,1901),('Nandha Kumar',5,'We are extremely grateful to Prerana Events for managing our daughter’s wedding so beautifully. From the Mehendi and Sangeet decorations to the stalls and entire program coordination, everything was done with great attention to detail and elegance.\n\nThe Haldi function decor was especially lovely, with perfectly coordinated themes that created a vibrant and joyful atmosphere. Sudha and Anuradha also supported us with all the logistics, transportation arrangements, and seer varisai setup, making sure everything ran smoothly.\n\nSince we are based in the USA, it was very important for us to have a team we could completely rely on — and Sudha and Anuradha exceeded our expectations. Even last-minute requests were handled promptly and efficiently. Whatever we needed, Sudha and Anuradha arranged without hesitation.\n\nSudha and Anuradha truly took care of every detail and made the entire experience stress-free for our family. Choosing Prerana Events was one of the best decisions we made for this wedding.\n\nWe highly recommend Prerana Events, Sudha, and Anuradha to anyone looking for a professional, dependable, and creative event management team!ent team!','2026-03-28 17:39:58.631893',3600,740,1901),('Shloka Narayanan',5,'Prerana Events helped organize and plan Bharath and my Tamil Iyer wedding in Chennai. Their contribution to our wedding was truly a blessing and we are grateful for their constant support, attention to detail and unending enthusiasm. It felt like we earned Sudha and Anu as our family members for a few months.\nThey provided support in arranging decorations, logistics and materials for rituals, accommodation, and liaising with the venue and vendors. Their work made our special day much less stressful, leaving all the family members and friends enough time to enjoy the wedding. Although we were quite particular about keeping things low-key and simple, they were patient in understanding what we wanted and gave us exactly that.\nA special mention for a few things: the hairpin with embellishments, the elakka malai for welcoming guests, sustainability in materials such as use of Banana leaf cases, brown paper bags, proper waste management and minimal use of plastic, and room kits were very thoughtful additions.\nWe wish them the best of luck in organizing many more events successfully and would definitely recommend them for your special events!','2026-03-28 17:39:58.635131',3601,740,1901),('Kavitha Sureshkumar',5,'We had taken services from Prerana events to support us during my daughter’s wedding.\nWe had 20 guests at home, and events like Nalungu, Mehendi etc spread over 4 days.\nThey supported us in every way possible, like catering, home decor, special decor for Mehendi, serial lights, tents, tables chairs, vehicle rentals and many more.\nThey were very responsive when we called them during the events and flexible to modifications in the list of services. They stood as a pillar of support while we could focus on the bigger event, which is the wedding/reception.\n\nThank you Sudha, Geethanjali and team for your excellent services.','2026-03-28 17:39:58.638449',3602,740,1901),('All in One Dream Place',5,'Awesome Decoration for My baby shower.... Really very dedicated person ✨ . Each and Everything kedu kedu romba satisfied ah perfect ah panni kuduthiga. Budget friendly. Thank you so much for make my day more special. Every one asked for your decoration 😍','2026-03-28 17:40:03.134611',3603,741,1902),('Kanchana Loganathan',5,'We got to know about wonder dreams event planner from one of my friend. We fixed them for my son\'s 1st birthday decoration.. They done an excellent job... My heartfelt thanks to your team... Keep doing the excellent job.','2026-03-28 17:40:03.138866',3604,741,1902),('Naseramuk Kumaresan',5,'I had a great experience with them.I did Birthday party for my son.they make the party more special and memorable one. Everyone is talking about the decoration designs and their work. I\'m very with their service.','2026-03-28 17:40:03.142458',3605,741,1902),('Hemasundar Jagadeesan',5,'Great work within your budget...you can ask for any type of decorations and he will do it as you wish.. Good team for your event preparations','2026-03-28 17:40:03.146239',3606,741,1902),('sweetha AG',5,'Recently, i booked this event management team for my niece first birthday.... They did an excellent job and charged very  very nominal. Also there listen carefully to the requirement.  I am extremely satisfied with their service.','2026-03-28 17:40:03.150335',3607,741,1902),('Revathi S',5,'OM SAKTHI CATERING & WEDDING PLANNER ⭐️⭐️⭐️⭐️⭐️⭐️⭐️⭐️\n\nWe are extremely happy with the catering service at our wedding. The food was delicious, the presentation was excellent, and the service was very professional. Our guests also appreciated the taste and quality of the dishes. The menus were also customized perfectly according to our preferences, which made everything even more special. Everything was well organized and served on time.\n\nWhat we truly appreciated the most was the way the team handled everything with so much care and responsibility. They managed the entire event just like it was their own sister’s wedding, paying attention to every small detail. The event planning and coordination were also done perfectly, which made the whole function smooth and stress-free for us.\n\nThank you for making our special day even more memorable!','2026-03-28 17:40:06.071516',3608,742,1903),('Abinayaa R',5,'We had a really great experience with Om Shakthi Catering for my brother’s wedding. The food was excellent, full of flavour, and perfectly prepared. We particularly loved their snacks, filter coffee, babycorn 65, spring roll, parotta, drumstick paya, etc. Their elaneer payasam and kasi halwa was an absolute favourite for all of us.\n\nTheir warm hospitality made the experience even better. They were professional, attentive, and handled everything so smoothly that we could just relax and enjoy. Our guests thoroughly enjoyed the food and appreciated the service. Huge thanks to Mr.Chandru for making this happen.\n\nWould happily book them again. Highly recommended.','2026-03-28 17:40:06.075209',3609,742,1903),('Immanuvel',5,'Om Sakthi Catering & Wedding Planner were fantastic. Food tasted fresh and authentic (that catering service tremendous ), planning was tight but flexible, and the team handled last-minute changes with a smile. Guests haven\'t stopped complimenting us - highly recommend them for weddings and big family events.','2026-03-28 17:40:06.079140',3610,742,1903),('Devarajan Saravanan',5,'Very very good service food is extraordinary no words to say  . Still my friends and relatives talking about the food . And Mr. CHANDRAN so nice person he take care all and the PRO mam and all other staffs are so nice thanks to all shakthi catering thank you very much.','2026-03-28 17:40:06.082684',3611,742,1903),('Srini Vasan',5,'We recently engaged Om Sakthi Wedding Catering for a family wedding, and we were thoroughly impressed by their exceptional service and professionalism. From start to finish, they managed every aspect of the event with remarkable efficiency and care, ensuring a seamless and memorable experience for all our guests.\n\nA heartfelt thanks to Mr. Hari Sir and his team for sincere efforts and meticulous coordination. His dedication truly stood out and contributed significantly to the success of the occasion.\n\nI wholeheartedly recommend Om Sakthi Catering for weddings and other special events. Their commitment to quality and client satisfaction is commendable.','2026-03-28 17:40:06.087015',3612,742,1903),('Sowmiya Anand',5,'I booked them for my daughter’s naming function. Their work was elegant we loved the look','2026-03-28 17:40:11.392958',3613,743,1904),('Ayyanar K',5,'My son Full wedding is handle by the team we r thappu,  catering taste is good my family is totally satisfied without their work , Especially Thanks to saran for his work','2026-03-28 17:40:11.396878',3614,743,1904),('BALA JAYACHANDRAN',5,'Awesome design for my daughter\'s 1st birthday , saran is very politely responded  to all my question , from catering to decoration completely allwork done neatly , I am happy with their work ,Thanks team Evento Planista !','2026-03-28 17:40:11.400503',3615,743,1904),('Vignesh Udhayan',5,'We are fully satisfied with this team. They made our occasion wonderful and excellent. Price packages are budget friendly. Event was Creative with fun. Thanks a lot guys.','2026-03-28 17:40:11.404115',3616,743,1904),('Ramya vino',5,'your Team really made our wedding most memorable, really our family members felt guest in our own wedding, thank you saran bro we always extend our support','2026-03-28 17:40:11.407868',3617,743,1904),('Avantika R',5,'⭐⭐⭐⭐⭐\n\nSeetharaman Event Planners made our event truly special! Their team was professional, well-organized, and handled everything seamlessly, from decorations to entertainment. The attention to detail and creativity they brought to the event were impressive. They were also very responsive and ensured everything went smoothly without any hassle.\n\nHighly recommend them for any occasion – they make events stress-free and memorable!','2026-03-28 17:40:21.394360',3618,744,1905),('Thangapandian C',5,'Best event planner in city. They take care of everything seamlessly, right from the decorations to catering. The highlight was definitely the food. Absolutely delicious and well presented.','2026-03-28 17:40:21.397117',3619,744,1905),('Subramanian Venkatraman',5,'Very good and nice activities in all aspects. No words to tell. Response is very good and prompt.\nAll marriage arrangements are very good and all bhakshanam are very tasty and good.','2026-03-28 17:40:21.399452',3620,744,1905),('Sowmya Rajagopalan',5,'Thanks for your supporting us on my seemandam and ayushomam function all foods, bakshanam and arrangement are perfect. Everyone loved the food.. and even during sudden rain your team managed and supported us❣️','2026-03-28 17:40:21.402125',3621,744,1905),('Geetha Srikanth',5,'Everything was consistently excellent, menus, food, presentation. The staff were gentle and good. I will definitely be calling Seetharaman Event Planners in future. Thank you Mr. Aravind and Mr. Amirthalingam','2026-03-28 17:40:21.404556',3622,744,1905),('Pandiselvi Ayas',5,'The dazzlers event - the brand that can orchestrate any event into a successful event. Mr. Mubarak work with full attention and to detail professionally. They organise impressive event so much details especially when it is Vegetarian catering services, they serve exceptional vegetarian food exceptionally and of course no words to express about the non vegetarian food as they are masters in that. Overall, they are one stop solutions for decorations, business events, wedding celebrations, corporate events, printing etc., Long way to go Mr. Mubarak and Mr. Malik and the entire team of Dazzlers.','2026-03-28 17:40:29.222347',3623,745,1909),('Auxilia Deepa',5,'Amazing ! Impressive arrangements & execution under the expected budget. The Dazzlers team surprised everyone with their awesome interior designing, good photo shoot, delicious food with buffet arrangements for my sister\'s house blessing ceremony. Great work by the event team.\n# Impressive #','2026-03-28 17:40:29.225962',3624,745,1909),('sharad nair',5,'Event was very well organized. All guests were happy with the food and stage decorations. Thanks to the entire Dazzlers team!!','2026-03-28 17:40:29.229883',3625,745,1909),('Manju Kumarasamy',5,'Dazzlers Event had done a wonderful job for my baby\'s first birthday. Mubarak was very diligent in following up and getting every detail down to the point, as requested. Would definitely recommend them for any events.','2026-03-28 17:40:29.232866',3626,745,1909),('Jasmine J Lydia',5,'Mubarak had done excellent art work with his team along with as we wished customized returned gifts for our reunion..Great job. Keepup. Feedback from nearly 100 ppl.','2026-03-28 17:40:29.236117',3627,745,1909),('Janarathinam',5,'Thank you, Cathy Event team, for your outstanding planning and flawless execution. You made the event truly memorable.\nAppreciation to the Cathy Event team for delivering exceptional coordination and a beautifully organized event. Truly impressive work.\nWishing cathy Event Team Most and More👏👏','2026-03-28 17:40:37.821958',3628,746,1910),('Arun Nassy',5,'Hi Cathy and Team,\n\nI’d like to take this moment to thank you and your team for making our white wedding beautifully decorated with all the requirements that we put in front of you.\nWe loved the output of how it all came together!🤩🤩\nAnd most importantly, Thank you for flexibility as per the clients requirement and budget and always being responsive and client oriented.\nYou guys did a great job and made our day special!👏🏽 👏🏽','2026-03-28 17:40:37.825131',3629,746,1910),('Madesh',5,'Our outdoor wedding decoration was absolutely beautiful! The lighting, floral setup and entrance décor created such a dreamy atmosphere. Even in the open space, the arrangements were neat and elegant. All our guests appreciated the look and feel. Thank you for making our special day so memorable','2026-03-28 17:40:37.828860',3630,746,1910),('Sriram N',5,'Ms Shalini from Cathy Event helped us for our son\'s wedding reception event at Blue House ECR Chennai this month. Being in USA and having not much support in Chennai, we were bit nervous before. But Ms Shalini helped us through the entire process very friendly. Over the weeks, we started trusting her fully and we used her suggested catering and photography vendors. The event was well decorated, well organized and we all enjoyed. My mom said, \'I have seen such a great looking event only in movies before\'. Another guest said, \'we enjoyed the kanum pongal (event was on kanum pongal day), every year kanum pongal in the future will remind us of this beautiful event\'. Thanks Ms Shalini and thanks Cathy Event.','2026-03-28 17:40:37.832994',3631,746,1910),('Avneesh Manian',5,'We had employed Cathy Decorators for our Sangeet, Reception and Haldi and they did not disappoint.\n\nThey\'d done a great job for all 3 events.\n\nThey\'re coordinator Dulasi was extremely patient, responsive and receptive to our needs and budget. And at no point did we ever feel pressured about anything.\n\nThe team gave us regular updates on a constant basis.\n\nThey stuck to our budget and charge much lesser than any other decorator our there for the very high quality work that they deliver.\n\nWe sincerely thank you for that.','2026-03-28 17:40:37.837169',3632,746,1910),('David David',5,'Thank you royal blooms for the wonderful decor... Very professional work... Awesome birthday theme creativity....thank you team❤️','2026-03-28 17:40:49.712297',3633,747,1912),('Nithesh kumar',5,'At their best, they showed more collections and did it for less money gd manner','2026-03-28 17:40:49.717102',3634,747,1912),('Rohit Jain',5,'I had an event planed from fly shots for my friends marriage . it was a small event but they did it in a massive way with a small budget. really like their work. vetri was very friendly throughout the process','2026-03-28 17:40:59.199069',3635,748,1916),('nandhinee geetha',5,'Awesome event management... Affordable price for perfect family event...... Good job keep it up 👍🎉🎉🎉','2026-03-28 17:40:59.201938',3636,748,1916),('Eva Computers',5,'Good and polite way of handling the event. Helped in celebrating my kids birthday.','2026-03-28 17:40:59.204377',3637,748,1916),('govindan ramasamy',5,'Excellent work..Response is very well..I Really appreciate your work','2026-03-28 17:40:59.207405',3638,748,1916),('sai Scott',5,'Best event organiser I ever saw 🔥🔥','2026-03-28 17:40:59.209916',3639,748,1916),('prakash d',5,'It was great work you did with their album edits and their own creativity on that perfection; thanks for the unexpected result.\n\nMy family totally admires your work. There are some pictures with a matte finish in the middle of the album that were super nice to see❤.','2026-03-28 17:41:11.344478',3640,749,1920),('kugan p',5,'Nice packing and delivery time also perfect response from their side is awesome','2026-03-28 17:41:11.347955',3641,749,1920),('Sneha A',5,'One of the most admired wedding planners in recent days. Loved their dedication towards their work.','2026-03-28 17:41:11.350483',3642,749,1920),('Rabin Son',5,'I really admire thier work and effort towards giving the best output to thier coustomers.','2026-03-28 17:41:11.353879',3643,749,1920),('Dheerga Dharshini',5,'Perfect plans with affordable cost👍','2026-03-28 17:41:11.357294',3644,749,1920),('hema latha',5,'Muruganantham instructor with substantial experience and expertise in playing and teaching the instrument. A good teacher is crucial for an effective learning process.more personalized attention and guidance from the instructor.','2026-03-28 17:41:20.817630',3645,750,1924),('Leela Barath',5,'They gave us a very good experience🥳\nWe enjoyed a lot 💙\nIt is very beautiful and clean❤❤','2026-03-28 17:41:20.821101',3646,750,1924),('Keerthi Overseas',5,'MPM group had performed in our family wedding on 25-04-2021. They were very prompt and efficient. Made the arrangements for the sound requirements by them selves and most importantly performed very well , which lifted up the mood by a notch. I will strongly recommend them.','2026-03-28 17:41:20.824807',3647,750,1924),('Venkatesan Punyakoti ADVOCATE',5,'Thanks for the support. Your performance for my daughter which was conduted on 1.6.2023 was very well appreciated by the guests who attended the marriage. Excellant keep it up.','2026-03-28 17:41:20.828518',3648,750,1924),('Logesh Murugan',5,'I would like to thank your team for the wonderful Nathaswara concert they performed at my daughter\'s wedding.','2026-03-28 17:41:20.832769',3649,750,1924),('Ajith K',5,'The performance on the Nadaswaram was truly extraordinary and left a lasting impression on everyone present. The depth of devotion and discipline reflected in every note was remarkable. The music flowed with such purity, strength, and grace that it created an atmosphere of divine energy throughout the space. Each raagam was presented with such precision and emotion that it felt as though the music was speaking directly to the soul. The powerful yet melodious tones of the Nadaswaram filled the surroundings with a sense of tradition, culture, and spirituality that only this instrument can bring','2026-03-28 17:41:25.292848',3650,751,1925),('Charuthathan T',5,'Dillibabu and team gave an unforgettable performance at our wedding. The Nadaswaram music was soulful, powerful, and added so much grandeur to the event. Many guests personally told us that the highlight of the day was their music. Hats off to Dillibabu and his wonderful team!','2026-03-28 17:41:25.296100',3651,751,1925),('Sanjutha T',5,'We had Dillibabu and his Nadaswaram team perform at our family function, and it was truly divine. The music set the perfect traditional atmosphere and all our guests kept praising their performance. Dillibabu is very talented and his passion for music shows in every note. Highly recommended!\"','2026-03-28 17:41:25.299343',3652,751,1925),('ajith kanagasundaram',5,'Dillibabu, your Nadaswaram playing is outstanding. Your talent and devotion shine through every note, making the performance unforgettable.”','2026-03-28 17:41:25.302647',3653,751,1925),('Ajith K',5,'“The energy and devotion in your playing elevate every event. You make the tradition of Nadaswaram come alive','2026-03-28 17:41:25.305995',3654,751,1925),('Cm Govardhan',5,'Dear [Mr.Karthik ], you were the heartbeat of our wedding! Your talent is absolutely breathtaking, and you brought so much joy to our celebration. We especially loved the way you played [ Movie Songs ]—it was a moment we will cherish forever. Thank you for being such a wonderful part of our wedding!\"😍👌','2026-03-28 17:41:29.799255',3655,752,1927),('Rayar Bojanalaya Caterers and Wedding Planner (Vijendiran Ragothaman)',5,'Sai nadha sangeet sutra orchestra provides soulful renditions of Nadaswaram music, reviving temple music traditions with passion and perfect pitch. About Mr karthick very professionalism, punctuality, and dedication to his profession.\nWe recommend them to all our events to our customers.','2026-03-28 17:41:29.802146',3656,752,1927),('Kavitha Sureshkumar',5,'We engaged their services for my daughter’s wedding on Dec 14th 2025. 1 lady played the saxophone, 2 male artists on Thavil and 1 male artist on the Nadaswaram.\nThey were very professional, right on time and played wonderfully.\nHats off to the team. Excellent.','2026-03-28 17:41:29.805286',3657,752,1927),('Pradeepa Vasudevan',5,'Excellent Nadaswaram performance! The music created a divine and traditional atmosphere. Beautifully played with great coordination and soulful rendering. Highly recommended.','2026-03-28 17:41:29.808600',3658,752,1927),('Charuthathan T',5,'We couldn’t have asked for a better Nadaswaram performance. Karthick and team are professional, punctual, and extremely talented. Every guest appreciated their music and told us how divine it felt. Totally worth the money — in fact, more than what we expected!\"','2026-03-28 17:41:29.811327',3659,752,1927),('Aishwarya S',5,'The nadaswaram team did an excellent job at our engagement ceremony. Their music added a perfect traditional touch to the event. Very professional and dedicated. Highly recommended!👍','2026-03-28 17:41:33.794284',3660,753,1928),('Dhivakar A',5,'It was great that we booked A.Nagarajan and team for our wedding ang they were simply amazing from start to end. And their play is very aesthetic and superb.','2026-03-28 17:41:33.799061',3661,753,1928),('Kowsi J',5,'Their team work is well neat ,disciplined,well coorporated,one of the best team....Highly recommendable for all your events...','2026-03-28 17:41:33.802718',3662,753,1928),('Arun V',5,'Nagarajan is a truly gifted nadaswaram artist whose music touches the soul. His mastery of the instrument, deep understanding of traditional ragas, and perfect rhythm create an unforgettable experience. Every performance is filled with devotion, emotion, and precision. A true gem in the world of Carnatic music','2026-03-28 17:41:33.806481',3663,753,1928),('N A G A S',5,'He so friendly and best music worth for money','2026-03-28 17:41:33.809691',3664,753,1928),('Srinivas . S',5,'The Nadaswaram band created a truly grand and joyful atmosphere with their vibrant performance. The powerful, melodious notes filled the venue with positive energy and traditional charm, instantly uplifting everyone’s spirits. Their seamless coordination and enthusiastic playing brought a celebratory feel that perfectly suited the occasion. The music was both majestic and heart-warming, making the event feel extra special and auspicious. A fantastic band that truly knows how to turn any celebration into a memorable festival of sound!','2026-03-28 17:41:53.484926',3665,754,1929),('Nanda kumar',5,'Good service, person also friendly & best budget service (Nadaswaram Team) Thank you so much.\n\n\"Traditional vibes-ku soul ah kodukkura Nadaswaram team ku oru big salute!\nEvery performance laum energy, discipline, and dedication theriyuthu.\nWeddings, functions, or cultural events – ivanga music vera level feel-a kudukkum.\nTamil culture-ku oru proud representation!\nNijamave oru \'aathma sangeetham\' experience!\"\n\nRating: ⭐⭐⭐⭐⭐ (5/5)','2026-03-28 17:41:53.486168',3666,754,1929),('Kalai Nesan',5,'Excellent Nadaswaram and Thavil katcheri. The music was vibrant and the artists were masters of their craft. Great acoustics and a wonderful cultural experience.','2026-03-28 17:41:53.488068',3667,754,1929),('Balamahendren R',5,'My sister marriage 27/08/25 in this team is very nice Nadhaswaram performance and sharp time to reached the team and great performance. so suggest the team in your family function','2026-03-28 17:41:53.489439',3668,754,1929),('ashwini Saravanan',5,'The Nadaswaram kacheri was an absolutely stunning experience! The musicians were incredibly skilled, and their performance of abhogi raga was breathtaking. The energy was infectious, and the traditional costumes added to the visual splendor. It was a truly magical evening, and I left feeling uplifted and inspired. I highly recommend this group','2026-03-28 17:41:53.490938',3669,754,1929),('Gokul Kamal',5,'Led by Nagash, this nadhaswaram group gives excellent classical music.  They played very well at my sister\'s wedding','2026-03-28 17:42:35.578790',3670,755,1931),('GOWTHAM',5,'Music artists with great experience.  Nadhaswaram was played beautifully at my son\'s wedding','2026-03-28 17:42:35.582377',3671,755,1931),('Prabhavathi Rajendran',5,'Best nadhaswaram Group Amazing - Thanks','2026-03-28 17:42:35.585884',3672,755,1931),('Isaiah Figo',5,'Best nathaswaram team in Chennai','2026-03-28 17:42:35.588987',3673,755,1931),('Santhosh bob',5,'Very nice asowm proformesce','2026-03-28 17:42:35.592323',3674,755,1931),('Callin Bernice Assunta',5,'The booking process was seamless, and the team was extremely helpful in choosing the perfect vehicle for our special day. The car was maintained, clean, and comfortable.\nOur driver was punctual, courteous, and ensured we arrived at our destination safely and on time. The overall experience was truly unforgettable, and I would highly recommend\nThank you for making our wedding day even more memorable!\"','2026-03-28 17:43:52.755731',3675,756,1935),('CALLIN BERNICE ASSUNTA P (RA2311013020017)',5,'VERY GOOD SERVICE. CARS ARE SO NEAT AND TIDY WITH GOOD FRAGRANCES .THEY ARE SUCH A GOOD COMPANY TO GET YOUR CARS FOR YOUR DAYS THEY ARE AO AFFORDABLE AND ALSO THEY ARE AO FRIENDLY THANK YOU OPULENCE ONCE AGAIN FOR YOUR CARS','2026-03-28 17:43:52.758368',3676,756,1935),('Emman Joshua',5,'Renting a luxury car is the perfect way to experience high-end performance, comfort, and style without the long-term commitment. Whether for a special occasion, a business trip, or just for the thrill of driving an elite vehicle, luxury car rentals offer an unforgettable experience.','2026-03-28 17:43:52.760312',3677,756,1935),('U Dhaamini',5,'The car was so clean and neat loge the experience highly recommend fantastic decoration it was so royal and rich highly recommend they are doing it in best prices do check them out','2026-03-28 17:43:52.761817',3678,756,1935),('Pricilla Joshua',5,'Rented the 🚗 🚘 for my brother\'s wedding last week..we r extremely satisfied by the service provided by opulenze & team... The car was well maintained neat & clean which is most important during this pandemic period..cost effective compare to others..The driver wore mask & he was a very polite & professional driver too... Good job guys...soooo ppl... whenever u wanted a rental cars for your special occasions, u can always close your eyes & Go for opulenze...','2026-03-28 17:43:52.763265',3679,756,1935),('Sreedhar CL',5,'Booking a car with Meenakshi Travels was seamless right up to the final payment. Selvam’s driving was highly professional, and the entire team was courteous and hospitable throughout the trip. The car was well maintained, adding to the comfort of our journey. Overall, my family and I had a wonderful vacation. A big thank you to the entire team for the great experience.','2026-03-28 17:43:58.310517',3680,757,1937),('AJ 2721',5,'I booked my 5 days trip from Chennai airport to Tirupati and traveling 3 different cities in TN. I booked through Sri Meenakshi Travels which was my best decision. We got a very well informed driver Govind who was aware of all the routes and all the best places to visit in Tirupati, Kanchipuram, Mahabalipuram and Chennai. Would definitely recommend to anyone who wants to travel to Chennai or any part of India to use Sri Meenakshi Travels.','2026-03-28 17:43:58.314310',3681,757,1937),('Santosh Polishetty',5,'Feeling happy to travel with Meenakashi travels...had a nice trip to Arunachalam ,kanchi,mahabalipuram...specially Arun driver ..he is very good knows telugu as well....overall Good experience 👍 👌 👏','2026-03-28 17:43:58.317798',3682,757,1937),('Vijay Gajendran',5,'We booked a HyCross rental cab for our office, and the service provided was exceptionally professional. The driver, Arun, was calm, courteous, and demonstrated a high level of professionalism throughout the journey. Overall, it was a reliable and cost-effective service.','2026-03-28 17:43:58.320535',3683,757,1937),('R.M.Dominic Savio',5,'Meenakshi Travels provided a good service to my family during Velankanni trip.\nDriver Mr. Siva very cooperative and skilled.\n\nIt\'s very trustworthy travel having good vehicles as per our requirement.\n\nI would like to wish them to be a successful winner of this race.\nRegards.','2026-03-28 17:43:58.323015',3684,757,1937),('Fredrick Subash J',5,'Booked a cab from them and I suggest them because\n\n1. Flexible rates as per my requirements\n2. The driver was very polite and handled situations properly\n3. Even though the timing i booked for got over, the driver waited with patience didn\'t nag and the service was excellent\n\nThank you guys all the best for your future endeavours.','2026-03-28 17:44:03.330378',3685,758,1938),('Abhi Shek',5,'We hired a BMW 5 Series from this luxury car rental service for our wedding, and the experience was absolutely outstanding. The car arrived perfectly on time, was spotlessly clean, and looked stunning — it added a truly royal touch to the occasion.\nThe chauffeur was extremely professional, well-dressed, polite, and drove very smoothly. The booking process was simple, and the team was responsive and cooperative throughout. They clearly understand the importance of weddings and handled everything with care and commitment.\nHighly recommended for anyone looking for premium, reliable, and classy wedding transportation.','2026-03-28 17:44:03.333604',3686,758,1938),('Jude Vincent',5,'Rented the vehicle from Sriram Cars, karthick organised very well with no followups. Driver was on time. Fantastic service and I would recommend Sriram car without thinking twice!','2026-03-28 17:44:03.337413',3687,758,1938),('Keerthi Ganesh',5,'I had a fantastic experience renting an Audi A6 for an event! Mr. Karthik handled the booking effortlessly, and the driver was prompt and polite. It was a smooth and hassle-free trip. I would recommend them for any luxury car rentals.','2026-03-28 17:44:03.340432',3688,758,1938),('Augustine Raj',5,'The bridal car service was outstanding. The decoration was elegant, the car was spotless, and the driver ensured a smooth and comfortable ride. We were very happy with the overall experience and would definitely recommend your service to others','2026-03-28 17:44:03.343844',3689,758,1938),('Raja Sekar',5,'Excellent service rendered by the Team. I have booked a Benz for Bridal, and for transportation Tempo travellers 2 nos, Crysta 5 nos and 2 Swift Dezires. Awesome service given by them. Punctuality is wonderful. All the drivers were kind enough to the guests and very flexible. Not even a single complaint raised by the Guests. All vehicles were neat and clean. Really amazing....','2026-03-28 17:44:08.869903',3690,759,1939),('Tharun K7',5,'Jai at APJ was incredibly easy to deal and conducted himself professionally.\n\nTheir network of drivers and vehicles are excellent and high quality.\n\nThe two drivers I dealt with; Mani and Sabari were both very professional and courteous.\n\nI rate APJ highly and will use them next time I\'m in Chennai.','2026-03-28 17:44:08.873783',3691,759,1939),('Monique Daswani',5,'⭐⭐⭐⭐⭐\nAPJ Cabs offers a truly premium travel experience! Their fleet of luxury cars is top-notch always spotless, comfortable, and perfect for VIP travel. The drivers are exceptionally well-mannered, professional, and fluent in English, making every journey smooth and pleasant. Their helicopter service is equally impressive. Highly recommended for anyone looking for world-class transportation with unmatched reliability and class!','2026-03-28 17:44:08.877946',3692,759,1939),('Krishnaraj T',4,'We booked cabs for clients for an international yoga conference held in Mamalla beach resort from APJ Cabs\nThe drivers were very professional and the cars we requested were in a very good condition and on time\nThey really made it seemless\nA big thanks and Wishing APJ cabs and Mr. Jai subash to continue this 5* service','2026-03-28 17:44:08.880706',3693,759,1939),('INBAKUMAR T',5,'With a great hesitation and doubtful mind, I had approached APJ Cabs for a bridal luxury car for my son\'s wedding. To my great surprise, they had kept up perfectly all the deals between us in this regard. Up keeping the time schedule, politeness of the driver and overall everything was so perfect and desirable. I also personally thank Mr.Jai, who had monitored everything in time and also Driver Mr.Palani who had raised himself to the occasion.I recommend APJ Cabs and wish APJ Cabs all the Best!','2026-03-28 17:44:08.883794',3694,759,1939),('Madhan raj V',5,'Had a great experience with NS Self Drive Cars. The people are very friendly, helpful, and honest. Everything was clear and hassle-free. I’ll definitely rent from them again.','2026-03-28 17:44:12.686120',3695,760,1940),('Priya Alphonse',1,'We booked Kia Carens which was promised as a \"luxury car\" with considerable boot space. What we received was a badly damaged and dented exterior and Stepney that was occupying 3/4th boot space. The person \"Sarfarez Basha\" sweet talked before booking and after booking was rude in his interaction. Would not recommend this service.','2026-03-28 17:44:12.687763',3696,760,1940),('Saravana Msd',5,'“I recently rented a 7-seater(Kia carens) from NS Cars for two days, and the experience was exceptional. The owner was incredibly friendly and supportive, always available 24/7 for any questions or concerns, which provided me with great peace of mind. The rental price was very budget-friendly, and I was pleasantly surprised that even their luxury cars are offered at such affordable rates. We will definitely be renting from NS Cars again. I highly recommend them to anyone looking for a reliable and cost-effective car rental service!”','2026-03-28 17:44:12.689127',3697,760,1940),('madhan v',5,'One of the best self-drive car rentals in Chennai. Friendly management.','2026-03-28 17:44:12.690834',3698,760,1940),('Madhan raj V',5,'Good service and kind-hearted staff. Totally trustworthy.','2026-03-28 17:44:12.692089',3699,760,1940),('Vimalraj Murugesan',5,'Very nice car and polite and helpful driver!! Very much appreciating for the friendly service','2026-03-28 17:44:25.126497',3700,761,1941),('revin cherian',5,'Excellent service. Rates are nominal, cars are good condition, dependable service and professional behavior from drivers. Overall it was a very smooth interaction throughout. Will definitely recommend to all.','2026-03-28 17:44:27.505021',3701,762,1945),('SathyaNG Work\'s',5,'Thank you, we had a nice long trip between Madurai to Rameswaram to Madurai, driver Vasudevan was a very good person. Nice driving and the way he handled is very polite. Appreciate your help. Thank you','2026-03-28 17:44:27.508288',3702,762,1945),('karthik B',5,'They take care of you as like their Family member, and u feel more secure and safe while travelling along. They are neat and clean on the Job start till end','2026-03-28 17:44:27.511735',3703,762,1945),('Kimberley Bericia',5,'Most Trustworthy, not to forget the exceptionally clean and well maintained cars with extremely polite and well mannered drivers. Keep up the good job. 👍','2026-03-28 17:44:27.515598',3704,762,1945),('ARUNACHALA ENTERPRISES GYPSUM SHOP',5,'Awesome response beginning to end from company side other then Drivers behaviour and attitude very well I never seen ever','2026-03-28 17:44:27.519523',3705,762,1945),('Chandra Kumar',5,'Very professional. Car was clean. I made a early bird booking and got good offer. They are comparatively cheaper than others in the market. The speciality is they have a blue colour BMW which was so cool with the other white cars.','2026-03-28 17:44:39.979294',3706,763,1949),('Keerthika K',5,'Best service on my wedding day 🚙-BMW\nMade my Spl day more beautiful 😇 Starting from query to decoration everything was perfect and in affordable charges. Thank you so much 🙏💐 Keep rocking & all the best 👍','2026-03-28 17:44:39.983041',3707,763,1949),('PARTHASARATHI L',5,'Very friendly service Good in keeping up with the timelines. Very professional driver with polite attitude Thank you so much team✨','2026-03-28 17:44:39.986128',3708,763,1949),('M C',5,'They gave a good discount for Early booking. They have nice BMW White with no dents or scratch.it looked like new. Thank you team.','2026-03-28 17:44:39.989837',3709,763,1949),('Benjamin V',5,'Thank you so much guys we really Enjoyed our wedding with your car, it’s make our wedding special and rich,thank you one second ❤️🕺💃','2026-03-28 17:44:39.993000',3710,763,1949),('Mokshita Ravi',5,'The booking process was seamless, and the team was extremely helpful in choosing the perfect vehicle for our special day. The car was maintained, clean, and comfortable.\nOur driver was punctual, courteous, and ensured we arrived at our destination safely and on time. The overall experience was truly unforgettable, and I would highly recommend\nThank you for making our wedding day even more memorable!\"','2026-03-28 17:44:41.164254',3711,764,1953),('Chennai Technologies',5,'Best luxury car rental . Best service.','2026-03-28 17:44:41.167713',3712,764,1953),('raja rani',5,'Excellent service rendered by the Team. I have booked a Jaguar for Wedding, and for transportation Crysta 5 nos Awesome service given by them. Punctuality is wonderful. All the drivers were kind enough to the guests and very flexible. Not even a single complaint raised by the Guests. All vehicles were neat and clean. Really amazing...','2026-03-28 17:44:45.797497',3713,765,1954),('Mokshita Ravi',5,'The booking process was seamless, and the team was extremely helpful in choosing the perfect vehicle for our special day. The car was maintained, clean, and comfortable.\nOur driver was punctual, courteous, and ensured we arrived at our destination safely and on time. The overall experience was truly unforgettable, and I would highly recommend\nThank you for making our wedding day even more memorable!\"','2026-03-28 17:44:45.800976',3714,765,1954),('Akib Hossain',5,'Lovely area','2026-03-28 17:44:45.804772',3715,765,1954),('Aravind Krishnan',4,'Rented out an Ertiga ZXI Hybrid for a group of 7. Was a great experience. The car was a latest model, very comfortable for all of us, and surprisingly a little bit fuel-efficient while maintaining 90kmph speed. Would highly recommend for short group trips!','2026-03-28 17:45:05.801926',3716,766,1958),('Karthik S',5,'Had a great experience using SKP Rental Cars for 2 days in Chennai. Rental price is reasonable compared to other options available. Would definitely go back to SKP for booking rental car in Chennai if required and suggest others to give this a try if they are in need of a car.','2026-03-28 17:45:05.805076',3717,766,1958),('nambi raj',5,'I had a very pleasant experience with SKP cars & travels. The car was clean and comfortable, and the staff were polite and helpful. The journey was on time and safe. Overall, a very reliable and professional service. Highly recommended!','2026-03-28 17:45:05.808291',3718,766,1958),('Nirmal G',5,'The car rented was a 7 seater, it was so nice and in condition as well. The dealer was polite and explained every details clearly before hand. Will definitely try next time as well','2026-03-28 17:45:05.812495',3719,766,1958),('செல்வா இளங்கோ',5,'Good experience we booked Ertiga car for tirupati ...best experience..friendly approach','2026-03-28 17:45:05.832949',3720,766,1958),('Ganapathy Travels & Car Rental',5,'Really good service 👍 good driver and car good condition net in clean service excellent','2026-03-28 17:45:20.388639',3721,767,1962),('Balarevathy Kanthakuru',5,'Had rented the taxi from nandini travels recently. The travel was very safe and smooth. Worth the money.','2026-03-28 17:45:20.391637',3722,767,1962),('Somasundaram S',5,'Good travels nice performance this travels good location Nanganallur\nSafety driving','2026-03-28 17:45:20.394835',3723,767,1962),('Lakshaman Lux',5,'Awesome.journey and timely pickup caring and humble driver feel like own vechile while traveling in Nandhini travells .. thank you ..','2026-03-28 17:45:20.397276',3724,767,1962),('purachithacan purachithacan',5,'Good service  nice performance all\' driver good amount is normal\nThank you Nandini Travels Ravi','2026-03-28 17:45:20.400213',3725,767,1962),('Sivakumar Natarajan',5,'Great car as promised. GLS showed up on time and the driver was professional. Decorations were as promised. Over all experience from quote till closing was smooth. Would highly recommend ABJ for any car rentals including high end luxury cars.','2026-03-28 17:45:28.092422',3726,768,1966),('Muhamad Hafiz',5,'I have used ABJ Luxury car rental services twice, and I must say their service has been excellent both times. As someone coming from Malaysia, comfort and quality service are very important to me and they truly delivered.\n\nFrom what I know, Mr. Vineth personally handled my arrangements. The car selection was clean, well-maintained, punctual, and everything was perfectly organized. The entire experience was smooth, comfortable, and professional.\n\nI highly recommend ABJ Luxury car rental to anyone looking for reliable and premium transport service. Definitely worth it, and I will continue using their service in the future.Suggested for all which going to india..which gonna try on new truly will be satisfied🤝🤝🤝','2026-03-28 17:45:28.094297',3727,768,1966),('Sourabh Chakraborty',5,'Wonderful and prompt Service.....clean car with good AC and very well behaved driver and owner. Charges also economical.\nWould love to get their service again.','2026-03-28 17:45:28.096109',3728,768,1966),('Jero Raj',5,'I rented a Toyota Crysta from ABJ Luxury Car Rental, and I must say it was an outstanding experience. The service was smooth from start to finish. Since my home is right on the main road, pickup and drop were absolutely hassle-free.\n\nThe driver was professional, punctual, and extremely courteous, making the journey very comfortable. The car was in excellent condition—clean, spacious, and perfect for long rides.\n\nABJ Luxury Car Rental truly lives up to its name. Their service, attention to detail, and customer care are top-notch. Honestly, it felt like the best car rental experience I’ve had so far, and I would highly recommend them to anyone looking for luxury and reliability at the same time.','2026-03-28 17:45:28.097904',3729,768,1966),('boons life',4,'Overall experience was great 4.5 star. Took urbania for 1 day family trip to velankanni. Decent driver and vechile was clean and well maintained. Just small thing was TV, if it was working and had some movies it would have been good. Seats were perfect for elders to relax and ride.','2026-03-28 17:45:28.099889',3730,768,1966),('Vignesh Dhanapal',5,'I’m from Bangalore and I took Tata Altroz rental for 3 days. I would say this is the 100% satisfied, best cleanliness/ hygienic, best condition cars you can ever get with proper reasonable prices. Here you can get Petrol, Diesel, 5 or 7 seater cars with good condition. Once you book the car slot timings, the staffs will completely do the water wash, interior clean with Car freshener. Even the security deposit will be instantly transferred to your bank account after you return the car. The best thing is they don’t have base version models, all they have is minimum Mid variant versions which is helpful for Apple Carplay/Andriod Auto. Highly recommend service in Chennai! This company will be my all time go for self drive bookings.','2026-03-28 17:45:33.607250',3731,769,1967),('Namdev Mane',5,'Very good service.pick up and drop provide.all staff with MSD cars are very cooperative and the guy name Sivaraman who provide pick up and drop is very cooperative and helping nature.\nOverall the service is very good 😊','2026-03-28 17:45:33.610867',3732,769,1967),('Adithya Shetty',5,'Car was in very good condition. We booked Espresso AT from Chennai to Pondy and back. Delivery was prompt and rules were mentioned clearly. Drive was smooth and absolutely no issues. All documents were provided','2026-03-28 17:45:33.614242',3733,769,1967),('Aravind Vaithiyanathan',1,'Not recommended. For minor side mirror cover damage they charge more. Apart from money, response is very poor.\n\n1. Not given clear instruction when can we expect the advance back.\n2. Concern not attending the call, which makes customer call multiple times for a proper response\n3. Then after 3 days follow up, finally takes the call and provided another person contact\n4. That person was rude and takes a session what is a response , how a good customer has to behave and informs to wait for 10-15 Days.\n5. Even after that duration, tried calling only one call once in a week (As per the good customer session taken by the person). He has not picked the call for next 3 weeks\n6. Finally after trying with other known sources tried contacting the old point of contact person.\n7. He quoted a amount which is not appropriate to the damage and not ready to negotiate as well. Informed this is the final amount and transferred on the next day. Almost a month later of the vehicle return.\n\nBefore taking sessions and expecting customer to be good. Please take sessions for what is customer service.\n\n1. Give clear deadline when the process will be completed. (Even if it is long)\n2. Picking the call and informing the status is response (Customer will understand and wait). Without picking the and without informing anything how do you expect client to wait on which hope and means\n3. What assurance you provide for the customer money. From customer you are getting documents like passport and getting sign in many papers including stamp paper.\n4. Try charging reasonable amount for the damage\n5. Keep the customer posted on the progress','2026-03-28 17:45:33.617768',3734,769,1967),('Vidathu Karupu',5,'I recently rented a Baleno 2023 petrol model from MSD Cars, Pallavaram for a one-day trip to Tirupati Temple, and I had a smooth and hassle-free experience.\n\nThe team provided the car early in the morning at 5 AM, which was very convenient. The car was in excellent condition, clean, and well-maintained, making the long drive comfortable and enjoyable. The refund process was quick and transparent, which I really appreciated.\n\nFor verification, they required my driving license and original passport, and the entire booking and handover process was smooth.\n\nOverall, I’m very satisfied with the service. MSD Cars is reliable, professional, and offers well-maintained vehicles at reasonable prices. I’d definitely recommend them to anyone looking for a car rental in Chennai or nearby areas.','2026-03-28 17:45:33.621218',3735,769,1967),('sravani asodi',5,'Recently we rented tata punch car from vjs cars its condition was good and good maintanence. We like staff behaviour also they are offering good conditioned cars in budget prices we enjoyed a lot in our trip because of self vehicle. THANK YOU  vjs cars for u r nice cars.','2026-03-28 17:45:40.961818',3736,770,1971),('Mutyala Phanikumar',4,'Excellent service! The car was clean, well-maintained, and the staff were very professional. Highly recommended.','2026-03-28 17:45:40.965884',3737,770,1971),('Nithish Kannan',5,'Took Tiago for one day trip and it was absolutely fine and in good condition.. I asked for swift but they told me to take Tiago instead coz it was came from service a day before .. and their suggestion helped me a lot and no regret for accepting Tiago.. Car was given with dust but it\'s okay 👍🏻\n\nAsk RC of the vehicle before taking..\n\nOverall smooth process...','2026-03-28 17:45:40.969470',3738,770,1971),('The_Black_Pearl Offical',5,'Seriously one of the best rental car service.... The staff are so kind and treating us superbly.... The car or really well maintained and at very reasonable price.... Worth for your money... I\'m really satisfied...... Thanks for vjs cars for the wonderful service..... Seriously your doing a great job','2026-03-28 17:45:40.974068',3739,770,1971),('Jayaram Kamineni',4,'Very satisfied with the service.\nThe car was neat and well maintained.','2026-03-28 17:45:40.977273',3740,770,1971),('Dhanachezhian',5,'Good communication and sharpness time','2026-03-28 17:45:52.756250',3741,771,1975),('Siva Ganesh',5,'I was very satisfied with the owner, Victor. He genuinely helped me like a brother and exceeded my expectations. I highly recommend his services to anyone looking for quality. I used a Maruthi Ertiga and shift,  Baleno from Winning Wheels, and all the cars were in good condition and offered at reasonable prices..','2026-03-28 17:46:05.611334',3742,772,1979),('Hariharan S',5,'Very well maintained car and in neat condition. Also the rental rates are affordable and flexible. They too have pickup and delivery options which is on time.\n\nThe overall experience is good.','2026-03-28 17:46:05.614871',3743,772,1979),('suceender kumar',5,'I recently had my first ride with Winniez Wheels, and it was truly exceptional. I chose this service based on glowing customer reviews, and I can confidently say they’ve earned every bit of praise. The owner was warm and welcoming, making the initial interaction enjoyable. The cab itself was spotless—in fact, it was a brand-new vehicle. What stood out even more was the driver, who didn’t feel like just a chauffeur but more like a trusted family member.\n\nThe punctual doorstep pickup made the journey seamless. I opted for the 10-hour package, as my family had several destinations to visit. The pricing was absolutely reasonable, offering great value for the service provided. After such a fantastic first experience, I\'ve decided that for any future cab requirements, Winniez Wheels will be my go-to choice.','2026-03-28 17:46:05.618583',3744,772,1979),('ATHITHULLA ATHITHULLA',5,'Having Very good condition vehicle.very low price for all types of vehicle.very good approach with customer. Very kindness also.i refered my frnds also.they also satisfied. Thank you very much sir.','2026-03-28 17:46:05.621824',3745,772,1979),('RAJESH KUMAR SB',5,'vehicle is superb taken Marazzo car for two days  and  Victor bro super person...\nAffordable price...','2026-03-28 17:46:05.625357',3746,772,1979),('Prathibha',5,'We wanted to go a Doctor\'s review at Agarwal\'s. Vasudevan sir driving was very good and safe, he knew the routes well.. we reached the hospital on time. Keep up the good work sir. Best wishes.','2026-03-28 17:46:10.684117',3747,773,1983),('Sumathi B',5,'Very good & safety service thanks for uk taxi network','2026-03-28 17:46:10.687278',3748,773,1983),('Vignesh Nagarajan',5,'We booked UK taxi for within city drop with luggage. Prompt response , timely pick up, route knowledgeable driver, clean vehicle and fair charges. I recommend this travels service.','2026-03-28 17:46:10.690530',3749,773,1983),('Bala Ganesh',5,'Good vehicle\n\nDrivers  all good\n\nVehicle is neat & clean','2026-03-28 17:46:10.693666',3750,773,1983),('Sandhiya Sandhiya',5,'Good safety car& taxis service','2026-03-28 17:46:10.696786',3751,773,1983),('Tamil Selvan',5,'Had a great experience with Star Yogesh Travels. The car was clean, the driver was professional, and the service was on time. Pricing was also reasonable. Highly recommended for anyone looking for comfortable and reliable travel.','2026-03-28 17:46:18.527977',3752,774,1987),('Grey Comb',5,'We booked Jaguar and Benz for our son’s wedding last week and the experience was truly grand! Both cars were elegant, well-maintained, and added a royal touch to the occasion. Excellent service, punctual and professional — made our special day even more memorable.top notch 👌','2026-03-28 17:46:18.531794',3753,774,1987),('Josephgeorge Mundakkatu',5,'It was an awesome fleet management by yogesh travels for my son\'s wedding including the wedding car. He even extended emergency requirement of cars which was incredible.great work by the team.','2026-03-28 17:46:18.536022',3754,774,1987),('Harry Vishal',5,'On 8th of june 2025 we had our wedding and we have booked star yogesh travels from Tambaram, we had a pleasant experience with the team from booking the vehicle to returning. The management is well planned and executed the service, once again thankyou so much for being part of our marriage','2026-03-28 17:46:18.539956',3755,774,1987),('Rajnikant R',5,'Hired Jaguar XF for wedding.  The quality of vehicle and overall experience was great.','2026-03-28 17:46:18.543408',3756,774,1987),('Sathesh Balu',5,'We rented Mahindra Marazzo for our Tirupathi pilgrimage trip. The vehicle was excellently maintained and in very good condition. Mr. Pradeep was very polite and service was overall good and timely service. I recommend renting cars from ST CARS','2026-03-28 17:46:28.407465',3757,775,1991),('OMR Pradeep Raj',5,'Best car rental service in chennai brand new vechicals only','2026-03-28 17:46:28.410798',3758,775,1991),('Kamal kannan',5,'This is really good am very happy to this service thank you','2026-03-28 17:46:28.413502',3759,775,1991),('Sudha S',5,'Good service.','2026-03-28 17:46:28.416067',3760,775,1991),('St Rentalcars',4,'Good','2026-03-28 17:46:28.418832',3761,775,1991),('Abdul ilah ali khan',5,'Mani from YTS was very cooperative, kind and friendly. Would definitely love to have him for my next event. Such a excellent driver and polite guy. Had fun with him. I would rate definitely more than 5 if there is an option. Please go for booking without any thoughts.','2026-03-28 17:46:33.856893',3762,776,1995),('Kumar Deep Das',5,'It was an amazing experience travelling with YourTaxiStand. Absolutely best cars and driver Boopathy was very polite and had taken care of us well. Will look forward to using the services again on our next visit to Chennai','2026-03-28 17:46:33.860441',3763,776,1995),('Sam Son',5,'I have a BMW and an Audi for my brother\'s wedding. Really, we had the best experience.\nThe cars were very nice and well maintained, the drivers were user-friendly, and moreover, they were sharp in timing.\nI think in Chennai, YOUR TAXI STAND is very cheap, and the best and owner were so friendly and understood our request and did it. Thanks!!!','2026-03-28 17:46:33.864160',3764,776,1995),('Palaniyappan Subbiah',5,'Booked for a 3 Days Outstation and 2 Days Chennai local package with Your Taxi Stand. And it was a wonderful experience through out the entire trip.Took Innova Crysta , it was clean and Comfort.  Want to mention our Driver Mr.Shankar who drove professionally and helped lot in the trip. Tariff was Reasonable as per Market. Thanks','2026-03-28 17:46:33.868223',3765,776,1995),('Shankar Sethu',5,'We have used the Jaguar for our daughter wedding with chauffeur Mr Pughal and he is very polite and kind enough also very professional with safe driving sense. No words about the Jaguar condition cleanliness and royal looks it added value memorable event to our daughter wedding function. Really a good service with grate price','2026-03-28 17:46:33.872431',3766,776,1995),('Lakshmi travels',5,'Good response 💯 trust driver 4days outstation trip I\'ll used good & brand new vehicle.keepit up bro nice service','2026-03-28 17:46:42.656649',3767,777,1996),('Anushu V',5,'Had a good and safe journey with the service.Keep doing !!! Thanks ❤️','2026-03-28 17:46:42.660415',3768,777,1996),('Capral Window Systems',5,'Good service and excellent customer support','2026-03-28 17:46:42.663747',3769,777,1996),('john antony prabhu nathan',5,'I have used the rental car service twice, car maintenance is excellent and drivers were co-operative during the travel time, there was no delay in the pick up point and very approachable and very good customer experience service. Thanks to the team for coordinating and executing the travel a very successful one!!!! You will be my first Choice for immediate response!!!! Have a successful year...','2026-03-28 17:46:42.667071',3770,777,1996),('Home Maker',5,'Went on an outstation trip for a few days. Proffessional and neat service. Good car and experienced driver. Transparent and neat billing. Thanks Mr.Mani. I wish you all the very best in your business.','2026-03-28 17:46:42.670389',3771,777,1996),('S ABDUL SHUKOOR',5,'\"I recently rented a Mahindra Thar RWD red from Colourful Cars and it was a blast! The car was barely driven (just 23,000 kms) and was super clean, thanks to the owner\'s meticulous maintenance. I drove it for two days and had an amazing experience. If you\'re curious about off-road adventures, rent this beast and you\'ll love it! 😊\n\nKudos to the owner - super kind, nice, and respectful to both staff and clients!\"\n\nI personally recommend','2026-03-28 17:46:47.450856',3772,778,1998),('Akash mali',5,'We needed an automatic car for 2 weeks and after searching various options, we decided to go with colourful self drive cars. They have a good variety of vehicles with decent price. Pick and drop off was quick and hassle-free. During pickup, vehicle was prooerly cleaned nd well maintained. Car didn’t had any issues in 2vweeks. Overall it was a pleasant experience','2026-03-28 17:46:47.454144',3773,778,1998),('Poshith SG',5,'This was my SECOND time with colourful cars and the experience was good. They really cooperative and very much approachable for any queries. Car condition was good and they promptly answer every call and clarified all our doubts during trip.Their customer service is truly impressive,and they make the whole process very easy and comfortable.\n\nAmazing experience with the owner. Me and my family are came from CHENNAI to visit SABARIMALAI and some of my friends rented a car from colourful cars and we meet with the owner he is an amazing guy and also helped us. I have no more words to say but I really recommend colourful cars','2026-03-28 17:46:47.457103',3774,778,1998),('Zion Evangelist',5,'Awesome experience with Colourfull Rental Car\nRecently rented a Hyundai Venue from them for a trip to Tada Waterfalls and it was a blast! 🚗 The car was in excellent condition  and well-maintained. The staff Mr.Jai amd team were super friendly and made the process hassle-free. Pricing was reasonable too! 👍 Highly recommend Colourfull Rental Car for your next trip!','2026-03-28 17:46:47.460798',3775,778,1998),('Sankara Narayanan',5,'Exceptional experience from start to finish. The check-in process was incredibly fast—I was in the car within 10 minutes of arriving. The vehicle Kia-Carens was spotless, smelled fresh, and had low mileage. Drop-off was just as easy with no hidden fees or surprise charges. friendly approach from the team. I’ll definitely be booking here again.\"','2026-03-28 17:46:47.463575',3776,778,1998),('Huzaifa Rupawala',5,'Excellent experience. Booked for 7 days. Jana Harsha was a very kind guy. Someone hit the car from the backside, and when I called to inform him, instead of getting hyper he calmly said. Don\'t worry about the car, are you okay? He is very kind and very flexible. Excellent car and service. Car was in very good condition and AC was too working very well.','2026-03-28 17:46:57.782132',3777,779,2002),('Uma Manikandan',5,'We rented a Nissan Magnite from Date A Car, and the experience was amazing! The car was super clean and ran really well. The team was very helpful, answering all our questions and adjusting everything to suit our convenience. Loved that they’re pet-friendly and have simple, practical rules. Totally satisfied and would definitely recommend them!','2026-03-28 17:46:57.785487',3778,779,2002),('Gurunathan Premkumar',5,'I had an exceptional experience with the rental car service! The Mahindra Marazzo provided was in top-notch condition, making my 500 km journey from Chennai to Tiruvannamalai smooth and comfortable. The staff, especially Janarthanan, was incredibly friendly and provided excellent customer service throughout. Janarthanan gave excellent support and adjustment, ensuring a seamless experience. I highly recommend this service for anyone looking for a reliable and pleasant car rental experience. Five stars all the way!','2026-03-28 17:46:57.788779',3779,779,2002),('Shanmuga Venkatesh',5,'Looking for Rental Cars in Chennai? Look no further, Hands down Jana is the person to call. I\'ve been using their service over 6 months, I\'ve used all rental car services from Chennai and no one matched the Price and Quality of Cars from Jana, every car is new Model and he is always on Time in delivering vechile, not once he failed.\n\nMore than anything other rental car providers in Chennai need to learn customer handling skills from him.','2026-03-28 17:46:57.793409',3780,779,2002),('Jeyanarayanan Bala',5,'The Best Rentals cars in Chennai ever, no one can match their professionalism and service commitment.\n\nAlways Responsive,\nOn Time,\nVery Flexible and Friendly service.\nAffordable one too.\nDay and Night available too.\nSame price all the days\n\nBlindly can go with them.','2026-03-28 17:46:57.796617',3781,779,2002),('Hema kumar',5,'Realy nice 👍 your approach with the customer in a positive way and your driver sorry we use to call as  a vehicle operator because he is the owner of the vehicle still he complete our journey, keep it up','2026-03-28 17:47:07.896485',3782,780,NULL),('Fransis Xavier Nolan',5,'Superb Service, Especially owner Mr.D.Suresh very responsive and respectful and Good Entrepreneur. Service Cost everything adorable. Greate work team keep it up.','2026-03-28 17:47:07.899303',3783,780,NULL),('Deepika Dilipkumar',5,'very good Service expecially Owner\nMr Suresh talking with Customer very kind and affordable price. Cars neet and clean thanks to LJS Car rental','2026-03-28 17:47:07.902367',3784,780,NULL),('hemavathy m',5,'Good service 👍 affordable price driver response very humble overall I had good marvellous service driver very polite and humble.','2026-03-28 17:47:07.904936',3785,780,NULL),('Ravi',5,'Very good service. Drivers are very professional and kind driving skill. Timily fast response...','2026-03-28 17:47:07.907871',3786,780,NULL),('smruti Ranade',5,'We found the car service details through Google and booked it for a 9-day Tamil Nadu temples tour from 24th Jan to 1st Feb. We were three ladies travelling together, including a senior citizen. The entire coordination was done over phone, and the owner, Mr. Manikanta Reddy, was very prompt in his responses, courteous, and professional.\nThe vehicle provided was in very good condition. Our driver, Mr. Balaji, who accompanied us for all 9 days, was an extremely skilled and safe driver. He was polite, helpful, punctual, and also very informative, which made the journey comfortable and enjoyable.\nOverall, we had a wonderful, hassle-free, and memorable trip. Highly recommended for safe and reliable travel, especially for family and ladies’ trips.','2026-03-28 17:47:10.853266',3787,781,2010),('Santhosh Neelamkavil',5,'We recently rented a car for our family trip from Chennai to Nagapattinam, and it was an excellent experience from start to finish. The car Innova Crysta (our family of 6) was in great condition, clean, well-maintained, and comfortable for a long journey. Our driver was punctual, friendly, and very professional, making the entire trip feel safe and stress-free. He knew the route well and even recommended some good restaurants along the way for lunch stops.\nThe drive was smooth, with no issues along the way, and we felt completely at ease traveling as a family. The rental process was a breeze, with the person I talked to delivering exactly what was promised.\nOverall, it was a pleasant, reliable, and worry-free journey. Highly recommend this service for anyone in Chennai planning a long trip.','2026-03-28 17:47:10.856996',3788,781,2010),('Saikat Mandal',5,'We went on a trip from Chennai to Pondi and then to Thanjavur and back. Mr. Mani was very polite and helpful in arranging things. The car was a new tempo traveller. Our driver Selva was very good. He took us to all the places and was polite. I would recommend BSR travels to anything visiting Chennai.','2026-03-28 17:47:10.861139',3789,781,2010),('Vikram Gunda',5,'Mani, the owner, was responsive and easy to deal with. He shared all the needed details on time, answered our questions, and was courteous throughout. Innova vehicle was well maintained and matched the pictures shared during booking.\nAlso want to highlight about the driver, Kamal - was polite and accommodating, especially with early morning pick-ups and drop-offs since we wanted to catch beach sunrises. He drove safely and responsibly throughout the trip. Overall it was a smooth and hassle-free experience. Would recommend them for anyone planning a trip in Tamil Nadu.','2026-03-28 17:47:10.865060',3790,781,2010),('Rahul Gupta',5,'Excellent service from BSR Travels for our 7-day outstation trip from Chennai to Trivandrum. The driver was polite and professional, and the entire journey was smooth and stress-free. Highly satisfied!','2026-03-28 17:47:10.868303',3791,781,2010),('nagarajan subramanian',5,'Nice coordination, polite,decent and patiently listening customer requirements.','2026-03-28 17:47:24.172839',3792,782,2011),('Senthil Venkatesan',5,'Vehicle neet   n driving friendly  is very good','2026-03-28 17:47:24.176864',3793,782,2011),('Saranya Ramakrishnan',5,'My request even though last minute and urgent was acknowledgely immediately by Vijay and cabs organized at reasonable rates. Soft spoken and prompt response every time I called. Both Yuvraj and Ramakrishnan were calm natured and good drivers. Cabs were well maintained too.','2026-03-28 17:47:24.181349',3794,782,2011),('Angshu Pal',5,'Very punctual, polite. Just rode his car twice in a week. First from Chengelpet to Mahabalipuram and then Chengelpet to Kancheepuram one week later. Car is in good condition, ac is good. Very moderate charge. Would love ride with him again.\nThank you for your service.','2026-03-28 17:47:24.184799',3795,782,2011),('Vasanth Vasanth',4,'thanks to Vijay sir. he made  immediately arranged the cab within 30min in peak time . thank you very much sir for your kind and imidiate response. right price and good service, good maintenance, worthy to booking in Lakshmi travels','2026-03-28 17:47:24.188167',3796,782,2011),('sudhakar pinninti',5,'I am completely satisfied with Lionea rental services, team is always reachable and responded without delay. I received the car at airport without any delay and follow ups. Car is also handed over at the Chennai airport at departures.  Security deposit was refunded in 2 days after car handover. I highly recommend Lionea for hassle free travel. Thank you once again and I would love to use your services in my next India trip.','2026-03-28 17:47:36.355826',3797,784,2019),('Malsa Deys',5,'I recently hired two cars from Lionea. Amazed by their professional approach and cooperative staff.  Ms. Catherine is very knowledgeable and prompt in handling the affairs.  Cars were is very good condition too. In summary, Lionea Cars are best in Business. Will not hesitate to avail their services in future.','2026-03-28 17:47:36.360069',3798,784,2019),('Kailash',5,'Took XUV500 manual variant for 2 days trip.\nWent to hills stations, the cars performance after running 1 Lakh+  kilometer was great, well maintained. The seats, interior cleanliness everything was good. Their communication and customer service is really good and appreciative.','2026-03-28 17:47:36.364213',3799,784,2019),('Apoorva Nijhara',5,'The experience was indeed very smooth, and the security deposit refund was processed in less than 24 hours. That\'s rare in the industry. The owner and the staff are very genuine and courteous. Thanks for being a part of the trip!','2026-03-28 17:47:36.367787',3800,784,2019),('Mitul Jain',5,'Had an amazing experience renting car from Lionea Cars. I recieved the car in just 2 hours after i made the booking. The car was well maintained and in almost new condition. Door step delivery and pickup was very smooth.I would definitely recommend them over online rental companies such as zoom cars.','2026-03-28 17:47:36.371168',3801,784,2019),('Visagan Mokshita',5,'Very good service very good👍 driver','2026-03-28 17:47:57.973210',3802,785,2021);
