ranged in a separate partitioned area\r\n* Dining capacity: 35 guests at a time\r\n* Fully centralised air-conditioned hall for complete comfort\r\n* Tariff: ₹35,000 + EB charges (₹24 per unit)',35000.00,2027,789,1,1,5.00),('big hall','Warm greetings from Lotus Banquet Hall, Virugambakkam! Thank you for considering our venue for your special occasion. We’re truly excited to walk with you in creating a celebration filled with joy, comfort, and beautiful memories.\r\n✨ Our Elegant Hall Arrangements\r\n✨ Tailored Just for You\r\nGrand Celebration Setup (Up to 500 Guests)\r\nDesigned for larger gatherings with smooth guest flow.\r\n* Hall 1 dedicated exclusively for the main event\r\n* Hall 2 reserved for dining\r\n* Dining capacity: 75 guests at a time\r\n* Dining hall comes with attached kitchen and washroom facilities\r\n* Both halls are fully centralised air-conditioned\r\n* Tariff: ₹60,000 + EB charges (₹24 per unit)',60000.00,2028,789,0,0,5.00),('nail art','',2000.00,2029,790,1,1,5.00),('plates','Biodegradable Food Containers - made from materials like sugarcane bagasse, corn-starch, and bamboo, our containers are:\r\n\r\n100% compostable\r\nMicrowave and freezer safe Leak-proof and durable\r\nIdeal for home use, takeaways, canteens, and eco-friendly even',NULL,2030,791,1,1,1.00),('custom notepads and dairy','wedding gifts,birthday gifts ,return gifts',NULL,2031,791,1,1,5.00),('seed pens and pencil','perfect for event gift purpose.',10.00,2032,791,1,1,1.00),('Wedding set dolls','45 dolls-Rs15000 sale',15000.00,2033,792,1,1,5.00),('kasi Yathirai set','',4000.00,2034,792,1,1,1.00),('Paruppu Thengai koodu','oonjal set also available-2200rs and gruhapravesam set,nalangu dolls vailable',0.00,2035,792,1,1,1.00),('makeup','',3000.00,2036,793,1,0,1.00);
